nswer\":\"The Samsung Galaxy M17 5G costs Rs 43,999 in Nepal.\"},{\"question\":\"When did the Samsung Galaxy M17 5G launch in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"It launched in Nepal on 5 November 2025.\"},{\"question\":\"Which processor does the Samsung Galaxy M17 5G use?\",\"answer\":\"It uses the Samsung Exynos 1330 (5nm).\"},{\"question\":\"What is the Samsung Galaxy M17 5G battery like?\",\"answer\":\"Li-Ion 5000 mAh, non-removable; 25W Fast Charging.\"}]','[{\"label\":\"GadgetByte Nepal \\u2013 Samsung Galaxy M17 5G\",\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/www.gadgetbytenepal.com\\/product\\/samsung-galaxy-m17\\/\",\"accessed\":\"2026-11-23\"}]',NULL,NULL,0,'2025-11-04 18:15:00','2025-11-04 18:15:00'),(177,1,2,'Samsung Galaxy A08 4G','samsung-galaxy-a08-4g',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,34499.00,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,'available',NULL,0,0,'<p>The Samsung Galaxy A08 4G costs <strong>Rs 34,499</strong> in Nepal for the 4GB/64GB model. The top 6GB/128GB version costs Rs 47,499. It competes in the crowded under-Rs 35,000 bracket, where battery life and a smooth screen matter more than benchmark scores.</p>\n<p>It has a 6.7-inch PLS LCD, HD+, 90Hz screen and runs on the MediaTek Helio G99 (6nm). Power comes from a 6000mAh battery with 25W wired charging. Expect it to last a full day for most people. On the back you get 50MP main + 2MP, and the selfie camera is 8MP. It is rated IP64 for dust and water, which helps in monsoon rain. Note that this is a 4G phone. That is fine on NTC and Ncell today, but it will not use 5G where it is available.</p>\n<p>Around the same budget, also look at the <a href=\"/products/samsung-galaxy-a08\">Samsung Galaxy A08</a> (Rs 34,499) and the <a href=\"/products/redmi-17-5g\">Redmi 17 5G</a> (Rs 33,999). You can <a href=\"/compare?category=mobile&g1=samsung-galaxy-a08-4g&g2=samsung-galaxy-a08\">compare the Samsung Galaxy A08 4G with the Samsung Galaxy A08</a> side by side.</p>\n<p>Prices are from <a href=\"https://www.gadgetbytenepal.com/samsung-mobiles-price-nepal/\" rel=\"nofollow