26999.00,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,'available',NULL,0,0,'<p>The Honor X6c costs <strong>Rs 26,999</strong> in Nepal for the 6GB/128GB model. The top 6GB/256GB version costs Rs 28,999. It competes in the crowded under-Rs 35,000 bracket, where battery life and a smooth screen matter more than benchmark scores.</p>\n<p>It has a 6.61-inch TFT LCD, 120Hz, 1010 nits screen and runs on the MediaTek Helio G81 Ultra (12nm). Power comes from a 5300 mAh battery with 35W wired charging. Expect it to last a full day for most people. On the back you get 50MP + QVGA depth, and the selfie camera is 5MP. It is rated IP64 for dust and water, which helps in monsoon rain. Note that this is a 4G phone. That is fine on NTC and Ncell today, but it will not use 5G where it is available. It ships with MagicOS 9 on Android 15.</p>\n<p>Around the same budget, also look at the <a href=\"/products/honor-x6c-4g\">Honor X6C 4G</a> (Rs 26,999) and the <a href=\"/products/redmi-15-4g\">Redmi 15 4G</a> (Rs 27,999). You can <a href=\"/compare?category=mobile&g1=honor-x6c&g2=honor-x6c-4g\">compare the Honor X6c with the Honor X6C 4G</a> side by side.</p>\n<p>Prices are from <a href=\"https://www.gadgetbytenepal.com/honor-mobiles-price-nepal\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" target=\"_blank\">GadgetByte Nepal – Honor mobile price list</a>, last updated 26 October 2026. Shop prices can change, so confirm with the seller before you pay.</p>','[{\"question\":\"What is the Honor X6c price in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"The Honor X6c starts at Rs 26,999 in Nepal. All variants: Rs 26,999 for 6GB\\/128GB; Rs 28,999 for 6GB\\/256GB.\"},{\"question\":\"Which processor does the Honor X6c use?\",\"answer\":\"It uses the MediaTek Helio G81 Ultra (12nm).\"},{\"question\":\"How big is the Honor X6c battery?\",\"answer\":\"It has a 5300 mAh battery with 35W wired charging.\"},{\"question\":\"Is the Honor X6c a 5G phone?\",\"answer\":\"No, it is a 4G phone.\"}]','[{\"label\":\"GadgetByte Nepal \\u2013 Honor mobile price list\",\"url\":\"h