hich processor does the Motorola Edge 70 Fusion use?\",\"answer\":\"It uses the Qualcomm Snapdragon 7s Gen 4 (4nm).\"},{\"question\":\"What is the Motorola Edge 70 Fusion battery like?\",\"answer\":\"Si\\/C Li-Ion 7000 mAh, non-removable; 68W Fast Charging.\"}]','[{\"label\":\"GadgetByte Nepal \\u2013 Motorola Edge 70 Fusion\",\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/www.gadgetbytenepal.com\\/product\\/motorola-edge-70-fusion\\/\",\"accessed\":\"2026-11-23\"}]',NULL,NULL,0,'2026-08-23 18:15:00','2026-08-23 18:15:00'),(253,47,2,'Motorola Moto G96 5G','moto-g96',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,44999.00,NULL,0,NULL,'2025-08-23','available',NULL,0,0,'<p>The Motorola Moto G96 5G costs <strong>Rs 44,999</strong> in Nepal for the 8GB/256GB model. It launched in Nepal on 23 August 2025. This is the sweet spot: enough for an AMOLED screen and fast charging without paying for flagship cameras.</p>\n<p>It has a 6.67 inches P-OLED, 144Hz, 1600 nits (HDR) screen and runs on the Qualcomm Snapdragon 7s Gen 2 (4 nm). Its Li-ion 5500 mAh, non-removable battery should last a full day for most people. Charging: 30W Fast Charging. Cameras: Primary: 50MP, f/1.9, PDAF, OIS, 1/1.56\" LYT-700C sensor + Ultrawide: 8MP, f/2.2, 1/4.0\" sensor. It is rated IP68 for dust and water. Software support: 1 Year (Android Updates); 3 years of Security patches.</p>\n<p>Around the same budget, also look at the <a href=\"/products/samsung-galaxy-a17-5g\">Samsung Galaxy A17 5G</a> (Rs 44,999) and the <a href=\"/products/realme-p3\">Realme P3</a> (Rs 44,999). You can <a href=\"/compare?category=mobile&g1=moto-g96&g2=samsung-galaxy-a17-5g\">compare the Motorola Moto G96 5G with the Samsung Galaxy A17 5G</a> side by side.</p>','[{\"question\":\"What is the Motorola Moto G96 5G price in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"The Motorola Moto G96 5G costs Rs 44,999 in Nepal.\"},{\"question\":\"When did the Motorola Moto G96 5G launch in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"It launched in Nepal on 23 August 2025.\"},{\"question\":\"Which processor does the Motorola Moto G96 5G use?\",\"answer\":\"It uses the Qualcomm Snapdragon 7s Gen 2 (4 nm).\"},{\"question\":\"What is the Motorola Moto G96 5G battery like?\",\"answer\":\"Li-ion 5500 mAh, non-removable; 30W Fast Charging.\"}]','[{\"label\":\"GadgetByte Nepal \\u2013 Motorola Moto G96 5G\",\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/www.gadgetbytenepal.com\\/product\\/motorola-g96-5g\\/\",\"accessed\":\"2026-11-23\"}]',NULL,NULL,0,'2025-08-22 18:15:00','2025-08-22 18:15:00'),(254,47,2,'Motorola Moto G57 Power','moto-g57-power',NULL,'gadgets/2026/moto-g57-power.webp',NULL,NULL,37499.00,NULL,0,NULL,'2026-05-10','available',NULL,0,0,'<p>The Motorola Moto G57 Power costs <strong>Rs 37,499</strong> in Nepal for the 8GB/128GB model. It launched in Nepal on 10 May 2026. This is the sweet spot: enough for an AMOLED screen and fast charging without paying for flagship cameras.</p>\n<p>It has a 6.72 inches IPS LCD, 120Hz, 1050 nits (HBM) screen and runs on the Qualcomm Snapdragon 6s Gen 4 (4nm). The Si-Ca 7000 mAh, non-removable battery is a real strength; most people will get a day and a half or more. Charging: 30W Fast Charging. Cameras: Primary: 50MP, f/1.8, PDAF 1/1.95” sensor + Ultrawide: 8MP, f/2.2, 120° FOV, 1/4.0\" sensor. It is rated IP64 for dust and water. Software support: 1 years of OS updates; 3 years of security updates.</p>\n<p>Around the same budget, also look at the <a href=\"/products/realme-c85-pro\">Realme C85 Pro</a> (Rs 36,999) and the <a href=\"/products/oppo-a6k-4g\">OPPO A6k 4G</a> (Rs 38,999). You can <a href=\"/compare?category=mobile&g1=moto-g57-power&g2=realme-c85-pro\">compare the Motorola Moto G57 Power with the Realme C85 Pro</a> side by side.</p>','[{\"question\":\"What is the Motorola Moto G57 Power price in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"The Motorola Moto G57 Power costs Rs 37,499 in Nepal.\"},{\"question\":\"When did the Motorola Moto G57 Power launch in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"It launched in Nepal on 10 May 2026.\"},{\"question\":\"Which processor does the Motorola Moto G57 Power use?\",\"answer\":\"It uses the Qualcomm Snapdragon 6s Gen 4 (4nm).\"},{\"question\":\"What is the Motorola Moto G57 Power battery like?\",\"answer\":\"Si-Ca 7000 mAh, non-removable; 30W Fast Charging.\"}]','[{\"label\":\"GadgetByte Nepal \\u2013 Motorola Moto G57 Power\",\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/www.gadgetbytenepal.com\\/product\\/motorola-moto-g57-power\\/\",\"accessed\":\"2026-11-23\"}]',NULL,NULL,0,'2026-05-09 18:15:00','2026-05-09 18:15:00'),(255,47,2,'Motorola Moto G64','moto-g64',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0.00,NULL,0,'Rs 29,999 last listed price in Nepal','2024-04-23','discontinued',NULL,0,0,'<p>The Motorola Moto G64 is no longer stocked in Nepal. Its last listed price was <strong>Rs 29,999</strong>. It launched in Nepal on 23 April 2024. We keep the full specs here for reference and for anyone checking a second-hand unit.</p>\n<p>It has a 6.5 inches IPS LCD, 120Hz, 560 nits (typ) screen and runs on the Mediatek Dimensity 7025 (6nm). Its Li-Ion 6000 mAh, non-removable battery should last a full day for most people. Charging: 30W Fast Charging. Cameras: Primary: 50MP, f/1.8, OIS, PDAF + Ultrawide: 8MP, f/2.2, 118° FOV. It is rated IP52 for dust and water. Software support: 1 years of OS updates; 3 years of security updates.</p>\n<p>Buying new instead? A current Motorola alternative is the <a href=\"/products/motorola-moto-g35-5g\">Motorola Moto G35 5G</a> (Rs 30,699).</p>','[{\"question\":\"Is the Motorola Moto G64 still available in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"No, it is no longer stocked. Its last listed price was Rs 29,999.\"},{\"question\":\"When did the Motorola Moto G64 launch in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"It launched in Nepal on 23 April 2024.\"},{\"question\":\"Which processor does the Motorola Moto G64 use?\",\"answer\":\"It uses the Mediatek Dimensity 7025 (6nm).\"},{\"question\":\"What is the Motorola Moto G64 battery like?\",\"answer\":\"Li-Ion 6000 mAh, non-removable; 30W Fast Charging.\"}]','[{\"label\":\"GadgetByte Nepal \\u2013 Motorola Moto G64\",\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/www.gadgetbytenepal.com\\/product\\/motorola-g64\\/\",\"accessed\":\"2026-11-23\"}]',NULL,NULL,0,'2024-04-22 18:15:00','2024-04-22 18:15:00'),(256,47,2,'Motorola Moto G06 Power','moto-g06-power',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,31999.00,NULL,0,NULL,'2026-05-06','available',NULL,0,0,'<p>The Motorola Moto G06 Power costs <strong>Rs 31,999</strong> in Nepal for the 4GB/64GB model. It launched in Nepal on 6 May 2026. It sits in the busiest part of the market, where battery life and a smooth screen matter more than benchmark scores.</p>\n<p>It has a 6.88 inches IPS LCD, 120Hz, 450 nits (typ), 600 nits (HBM) screen and runs on the Mediatek Helio G81 Ultra (12nm). The Li-Ion 7000 mAh, non-removable battery is a real strength; most people will get a day and a half or more. Charging: 18W charging. Cameras: Primary: 50 MP, f/1.8, PDAF. It is rated IP64 for dust and water. Software support: 2 years of security updates. It is a 4G phone, which works fine on NTC and Ncell today but will not use 5G.</p>\n<p>Around the same budget, also look at the <a href=\"/products/realme-p4-lite-4g\">Realme P4 Lite 4G</a> (Rs 31,999) and the <a href=\"/products/redmi-17-4g\">Redmi 17 4G</a> (Rs 32,499). You can <a href=\"/compare?category=mobile&g1=moto-g06-power&g2=realme-p4-lite-4g\">compare the Motorola Moto G06 Power with the Realme P4 Lite 4G</a> side by side.</p>','[{\"question\":\"What is the Motorola Moto G06 Power price in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"The Motorola Moto G06 Power costs Rs 31,999 in Nepal.\"},{\"question\":\"When did the Motorola Moto G06 Power launch in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"It launched in Nepal on 6 May 2026.\"},{\"question\":\"Which processor does the Motorola Moto G06 Power use?\",\"answer\":\"It uses the Mediatek Helio G81 Ultra (12nm).\"},{\"question\":\"What is the Motorola Moto G06 Power battery like?\",\"answer\":\"Li-Ion 7000 mAh, non-removable; 18W charging.\"}]','[{\"label\":\"GadgetByte Nepal \\u2013 Motorola Moto G06 Power\",\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/www.gadgetbytenepal.com\\/product\\/motorola-moto-g06-power\\/\",\"accessed\":\"2026-11-23\"}]',NULL,NULL,0,'2026-05-05 18:15:00','2026-05-05 18:15:00'),(257,36,2,'Nothing Phone 3a Lite','nothing-phone-3a-lite',NULL,'gadgets/2026/nothing-phone-3a-lite.webp',NULL,NULL,54999.00,NULL,0,NULL,'2025-11-14','available',NULL,0,0,'<p>The Nothing Phone 3a Lite costs <strong>Rs 54,999</strong> in Nepal for the 8/128GB model. It launched in Nepal on 14 November 2025. This is the sweet spot: enough for an AMOLED screen and fast charging without paying for flagship cameras.</p>\n<p>It has a 6.77 inches Super AMOLED, 120Hz, 800 nits (typ), 1300 nits (HBM), 3000 nits (HDR) screen and runs on the Mediatek Dimensity 7300 Pro (4nm). Its Li-Po 5000 mAh, non-removable battery should last a full day for most people. Charging: 33W Fast Charging, 5W Reverse Charging. Cameras: Primary: 50MP, f/1.9, 24 mm, PDAF, 1/1.57” sensor + Ultrawide: 8MP, f/2.2, 15 mm, 120° FOV, 1/4.0\" sensor + Macro: 2MP. It is rated IP54 for dust and water. Software support: 3 years of OS updates.</p>\n<p>Around the same budget, also look at the <a href=\"/products/honor-x9d\">Honor X9d</a> (Rs 54,999) and the <a href=\"/products/honor-600-lite\">Honor 600 Lite</a> (Rs 54,999). You can <a href=\"/compare?category=mobile&g1=nothing-phone-3a-lite&g2=honor-x9d\">compare the Nothing Phone 3a Lite with the Honor X9d</a> side by side.</p>','[{\"question\":\"What is the Nothing Phone 3a Lite price in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"The Nothing Phone 3a Lite costs Rs 54,999 in Nepal.\"},{\"question\":\"When did the Nothing Phone 3a Lite launch in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"It launched in Nepal on 14 November 2025.\"},{\"question\":\"Which processor does the Nothing Phone 3a Lite use?\",\"answer\":\"It uses the Mediatek Dimensity 7300 Pro (4nm).\"},{\"question\":\"What is the Nothing Phone 3a Lite battery like?\",\"answer\":\"Li-Po 5000 mAh, non-removable; 33W Fast Charging; 5W Reverse Charging.\"}]','[{\"label\":\"GadgetByte Nepal \\u2013 Nothing Phone 3a Lite\",\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/www.gadgetbytenepal.com\\/product\\/nothing-phone-3a-lite\\/\",\"accessed\":\"2026-11-23\"}]',NULL,NULL,0,'2025-11-13 18:15:00','2025-11-13 18:15:00'),(258,36,2,'Nothing Phone 4b','nothing-phone-4b',NULL,'gadgets/2026/nothing-phone-4b.webp',NULL,NULL,64999.00,NULL,0,NULL,'2026-07-17','available',NULL,0,0,'<p>The Nothing Phone 4b costs <strong>Rs 64,999</strong> in Nepal for the 8GB/128GB model. It launched in Nepal on 17 July 2026. At this price you should expect a bright AMOLED panel, a dependable main camera and long software support.</p>\n<p>It has a 6.77 inches AMOLED, 120Hz, 600 nits (typ), 1200 nits (HBM), 2000 nits (HDR) screen and runs on the Qualcomm Snapdragon 6 Gen 4 (4 nm). Its Li-Ion 5200 mAh, non-removable battery should last a full day for most people. Charging: 33W Fast Charging. Cameras: Primary: 50MP, f/1.8, OIS, PDAF, 1/2.76” sensor + Ultrawide: 8MP, f/2.2, 15 mm, 120° FOV, 1/4.0\" sensor. It is rated IP64 for dust and water. Software support: 3 years of OS updates.</p>\n<p>Around the same budget, also look at the <a href=\"/products/realme-16-5g\">Realme 16</a> (Rs 64,999) and the <a href=\"/products/xiaomi-15t\">Xiaomi 15T</a> (Rs 64,999). You can <a href=\"/compare?category=mobile&g1=nothing-phone-4b&g2=realme-16-5g\">compare the Nothing Phone 4b with the Realme 16</a> side by side.</p>','[{\"question\":\"What is the Nothing Phone 4b price in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"The Nothing Phone 4b costs Rs 64,999 in Nepal.\"},{\"question\":\"When did the Nothing Phone 4b launch in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"It launched in Nepal on 17 July 2026.\"},{\"question\":\"Which processor does the Nothing Phone 4b use?\",\"answer\":\"It uses the Qualcomm Snapdragon 6 Gen 4 (4 nm).\"},{\"question\":\"What is the Nothing Phone 4b battery like?\",\"answer\":\"Li-Ion 5200 mAh, non-removable; 33W Fast Charging.\"}]','[{\"label\":\"GadgetByte Nepal \\u2013 Nothing Phone 4b\",\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/www.gadgetbytenepal.com\\/product\\/nothing-phone-4b\\/\",\"accessed\":\"2026-11-23\"}]',NULL,NULL,0,'2026-07-16 18:15:00','2026-07-16 18:15:00'),(259,36,2,'Nothing Phone 4a Pro','nothing-phone-4a-pro',NULL,'gadgets/2026/nothing-phone-4a-pro.webp',NULL,NULL,109999.00,NULL,0,NULL,'2026-04-27','available',NULL,0,0,'<p>The Nothing Phone 4a Pro costs <strong>Rs 1,09,999</strong> in Nepal for the 12GB/256GB model. It launched in Nepal on 27 April 2026. That is flagship money, so the camera system, the chip and the build quality all need to justify it.</p>\n<p>It has a 6.83 inches AMOLED, 120Hz, 800 nits (typ), 1600 nits (HBM), 5000 nits (HDR) screen and runs on the Qualcomm Snapdragon 7 Gen 4 (4 nm). Its Li-Ion 5080 mAh, non-removable battery should last a full day for most people. Charging: 50W Fast Charging. Cameras: Primary: 50MP, f/1.9, OIS, PDAF, 1/1.57” sensor + Ultrawide: 8MP, f/2.2, 15 mm, 120° FOV, 1/4.0\" sensor + Telephoto: 50MP, f/2.9, 80 mm, 3.5x optical zoom, OIS, PDAF. It is rated IP65 for dust and water. Software support: 3 years of OS updates.</p>\n<p>Around the same budget, also look at the <a href=\"/products/nothing-phone-3\">Nothing Phone (3)</a> (Rs 1,09,999) and the <a href=\"/products/oppo-reno-16-5g\">OPPO Reno 16</a> (Rs 1,09,999). You can <a href=\"/compare?category=mobile&g1=nothing-phone-4a-pro&g2=nothing-phone-3\">compare the Nothing Phone 4a Pro with the Nothing Phone (3)</a> side by side.</p>','[{\"question\":\"What is the Nothing Phone 4a Pro price in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"The Nothing Phone 4a Pro costs Rs 1,09,999 in Nepal.\"},{\"question\":\"When did the Nothing Phone 4a Pro launch in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"It launched in Nepal on 27 April 2026.\"},{\"question\":\"Which processor does the Nothing Phone 4a Pro use?\",\"answer\":\"It uses the Qualcomm Snapdragon 7 Gen 4 (4 nm).\"},{\"question\":\"What is the Nothing Phone 4a Pro battery like?\",\"answer\":\"Li-Ion 5080 mAh, non-removable; 50W Fast Charging.\"}]','[{\"label\":\"GadgetByte Nepal \\u2013 Nothing Phone 4a Pro\",\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/www.gadgetbytenepal.com\\/product\\/nothing-phone-4a-pro\\/\",\"accessed\":\"2026-11-23\"}]',NULL,NULL,0,'2026-04-26 18:15:00','2026-04-26 18:15:00'),(260,9,3,'Dell Latitude 14 3450 2024 (Intel Core Ultra 5 135U)','dell-latitude-14-3450-2024',NULL,'gadgets/2026/dell-latitude-14-3450-2024.webp',NULL,NULL,0.00,NULL,0,'Rs 1,62,000 last listed price in Nepal','2025-01-01','discontinued',NULL,0,0,'<p>The Dell Latitude 14 3450 2024 (Intel Core Ultra 5 135U) is no longer stocked in Nepal. Its last listed price was <strong>Rs 1,62,000</strong>. It launched in Nepal in 2025. We keep the full specs here for reference and for anyone checking a second-hand unit.</p>\n<p>It runs on the Intel Core Ultra 5 135U (Intel 4), 12 cores / 14 threads. Screen: 14 inches, IPS LCD, FHD+ (1920 x 1080 pixels), 60Hz. 16GB of memory is the right amount for a laptop you plan to keep for several years. At 1.50 kg, it is fine for occasional carrying. Battery: Li-Ion 54 Wh; 65W adapter, Supports ExpressCharge.</p>\n<p>Buying new instead? A current Dell alternative is the <a href=\"/products/dell-14-plus-2-in-1-db04250-2025-intel-core-ultra-7-256v-16gb-1tb-14-fhd\">Dell 14 Plus 2-in-1 DB04250 2025 (Intel Core Ultra 7 256V)</a> (Rs 1,64,999).</p>','[{\"question\":\"Is the Dell Latitude 14 3450 2024 (Intel Core Ultra 5 135U) still available in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"No, it is no longer stocked. Its last listed price was Rs 1,62,000.\"},{\"question\":\"When did the Dell Latitude 14 3450 2024 (Intel Core Ultra 5 135U) launch in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"It launched in Nepal in 2025.\"},{\"question\":\"Which processor does the Dell Latitude 14 3450 2024 (Intel Core Ultra 5 135U) use?\",\"answer\":\"It uses the Intel Core Ultra 5 135U (Intel 4), 12 cores \\/ 14 threads.\"}]','[{\"label\":\"GadgetByte Nepal \\u2013 Dell Latitude 14 3450 2024 (Intel Core Ultra 5 135U)\",\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/www.gadgetbytenepal.com\\/product\\/dell-latitude-14-3450-2024-intel-core-ultra-5-135u16-gb-512gb-14-0-fhd\\/\",\"accessed\":\"2026-11-23\"}]',NULL,NULL,0,'2024-12-31 18:15:00','2024-12-31 18:15:00'),(261,9,3,'Dell Pro 14 PC14250 (Core 5 120U, 16GB/512GB)','dell-pro-14-pc14250-2025',NULL,'gadgets/2026/dell-pro-14-pc14250-2025.webp',NULL,NULL,127499.00,132499.00,0,NULL,'2025-01-01','available',NULL,0,0,'<p>The Dell Pro 14 is the business laptop we\'d hand to someone who needs a reliable machine for the next three years and doesn\'t want to think about it. ONIN Infosys sells the PC14250 for <strong>Rs 1,27,499</strong>, with a <strong>3-year warranty</strong>.</p>\n<p>It runs Intel\'s <strong>Core 5 120U</strong> (10 cores, up to 5.0GHz) with <strong>16GB of DDR5 in two 8GB modules</strong> (dual channel, and replaceable) and a 512GB NVMe SSD. The 14-inch FHD+ (1920 × 1200) anti-glare display is 300 nits, a good balance for office lighting. It has an FHD webcam and a backlit keyboard.</p>\n<p>The ports suit modern offices: a <strong>Thunderbolt 4</strong> port with charging, a 10Gbps USB-C with DisplayPort, two USB-A ports (one with PowerShare for charging your phone) and HDMI 2.1. ExpressCharge tops up the 45Wh battery quickly between meetings.</p>\n<p>Compared with the <a href=\"/products/lenovo-thinkpad-e14-gen-7-core-ultra-5-225u\">ThinkPad E14 Gen 7</a>, which also has a 3-year warranty, the Dell Pro 14 is about Rs 77,000 cheaper. The ThinkPad answers with a newer Core Ultra chip and Ethernet.</p>','[{\"question\":\"What is the Dell Pro 14 PC14250 price in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"ONIN Infosys sells the Dell Pro 14 PC14250 with Core 5 120U, 16GB DDR5 and 512GB SSD for Rs 1,27,499 with a 3-year warranty.\"},{\"question\":\"Does the Dell Pro 14 have Thunderbolt 4?\",\"answer\":\"Yes, one Thunderbolt 4 port with Power Delivery, plus a 10Gbps USB-C with DisplayPort.\"},{\"question\":\"Is the RAM upgradeable on the Dell Pro 14?\",\"answer\":\"Yes. It uses two 8GB DDR5 modules.\"}]','[{\"label\":\"ONIN Infosys \\u2013 Dell Pro 14 PC14250 (Core 5 120U, 16GB\\/512GB)\",\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/onin.com.np\\/product\\/dell-pro-14-pc14250-core5-120u-nepal\",\"accessed\":\"2026-11-23\"},{\"label\":\"GadgetByte Nepal \\u2013 Dell Pro 14 PC14250 2025 (Intel Core 5 120U)\",\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/www.gadgetbytenepal.com\\/product\\/dell-pro-14-2025-intel-core-5-120u\\/\",\"accessed\":\"2026-11-23\"}]',NULL,'https://onin.com.np/product/dell-pro-14-pc14250-core5-120u-nepal',0,'2024-12-31 18:15:00','2024-12-31 18:15:00'),(262,9,3,'Dell Vostro 15 3530 2023 (Intel Core i7-1355U)','dell-vostro-15-3530-2023',NULL,'gadgets/2026/dell-vostro-15-3530-2023.webp',NULL,NULL,0.00,NULL,0,'Rs 1,14,000 last listed price in Nepal','2023-01-01','discontinued',NULL,0,0,'<p>The Dell Vostro 15 3530 2023 (Intel Core i7-1355U) is no longer stocked in Nepal. Its last listed price was <strong>Rs 1,14,000</strong>. It launched in Nepal in 2023. We keep the full specs here for reference and for anyone checking a second-hand unit.</p>\n<p>It runs on the Intel Core i7-1355U (Intel 7), 10 cores / 12 threads. Screen: 15.6 inches, IPS LCD, Full HD (1920 x 1080 pixels), 120Hz. 8GB of RAM is fine for study and office work but tight for heavy multitasking; check whether it can be upgraded. At 1.63 kg, it is fine for occasional carrying. Battery: Li-Po 41 Wh; 65W adapter.</p>\n<p>Buying new instead? A current Dell alternative is the <a href=\"/products/dell-pro-14-plus-pc14250-2025-amd-ryzen-5-pro-230-16gb-512gb-14-fhd\">Dell Pro 14 Plus PC14250 2025 (AMD Ryzen 5 Pro 230)</a> (Rs 1,19,999).</p>','[{\"question\":\"Is the Dell Vostro 15 3530 2023 (Intel Core i7-1355U) still available in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"No, it is no longer stocked. Its last listed price was Rs 1,14,000.\"},{\"question\":\"When did the Dell Vostro 15 3530 2023 (Intel Core i7-1355U) launch in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"It launched in Nepal in 2023.\"},{\"question\":\"Which processor does the Dell Vostro 15 3530 2023 (Intel Core i7-1355U) use?\",\"answer\":\"It uses the Intel Core i7-1355U (Intel 7), 10 cores \\/ 12 threads.\"}]','[{\"label\":\"GadgetByte Nepal \\u2013 Dell Vostro 15 3530 2023 (Intel Core i7-1355U)\",\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/www.gadgetbytenepal.com\\/product\\/dell-vostro-3530-2023-i7-1355u\\/\",\"accessed\":\"2026-11-23\"}]',NULL,NULL,0,'2022-12-31 18:15:00','2022-12-31 18:15:00'),(263,9,3,'Dell 15 DC15250 2025','dell-15-dc15250-2025',NULL,'gadgets/2026/dell-15-dc15250-2025.webp',NULL,NULL,78999.00,NULL,0,NULL,'2026-01-01','available',NULL,0,0,'<p>The Dell 15 DC15250 2025 costs <strong>Rs 78,999</strong> in Nepal for the Intel Core 3 100U, 8GB/512GB model. The Intel i5-1334U, 8GB/512GB version costs Rs 1,08,205. It launched in Nepal in 2026. It is built for documents, browsing, online classes and video calls rather than editing or gaming.</p>\n<p>It runs on the Intel Core 3 100U (Intel 7), 6 cores / 8 threads (base configuration; see prices for other chips). Screen: 15.6 inches, IPS LCD, FHD (1920 x 1080 pixels), 120Hz. 8GB of RAM is fine for study and office work but tight for heavy multitasking; check whether it can be upgraded. At 1.90 kg, it is fine for occasional carrying. Battery: Li-Ion 41 Wh; 65W adapter.</p>\n<p>Around the same budget, also look at the <a href=\"/products/hp-notebook-15-fc0124nia-ryzen-3-7320u\">HP Notebook 15 FC0124NIA 2024 (Ryzen 3 7320U)</a> (Rs 78,999) and the <a href=\"/products/acer-aspire-lite-14-al14-32p-39zh-2024-intel-core-i3-n355\">Acer Aspire Lite 14 AL14-32p-39ZH 2024 (Intel Core i3-N355)</a> (Rs 78,999). You can <a href=\"/compare?category=laptop&g1=dell-15-dc15250-2025&g2=hp-notebook-15-fc0124nia-ryzen-3-7320u\">compare the Dell 15 DC15250 2025 with the HP Notebook 15 FC0124NIA 2024 (Ryzen 3 7320U)</a> side by side.</p>','[{\"question\":\"What is the Dell 15 DC15250 2025 price in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"The Dell 15 DC15250 2025 starts at Rs 78,999 in Nepal. All variants: Rs 78,999 for Intel Core 3 100U, 8GB\\/512GB; Rs 1,08,205 for Intel i5-1334U, 8GB\\/512GB.\"},{\"question\":\"When did the Dell 15 DC15250 2025 launch in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"It launched in Nepal in 2026.\"},{\"question\":\"Which processor does the Dell 15 DC15250 2025 use?\",\"answer\":\"It uses the Intel Core 3 100U (Intel 7), 6 cores \\/ 8 threads (base configuration; see prices for other chips).\"}]','[{\"label\":\"GadgetByte Nepal \\u2013 Dell 15 DC15250 2025 (Intel Core 3 100U)\",\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/www.gadgetbytenepal.com\\/product\\/dell-15-dc15250-2025-intel-core-3-100u\\/\",\"accessed\":\"2026-11-23\"},{\"label\":\"GadgetByte Nepal \\u2013 Dell 15 DC15250 2025 (Intel i5-1334U, 8GB, 512GB, 15.6\\\" FHD)\",\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/www.gadgetbytenepal.com\\/product\\/dell-15-dc15250-2025-intel-i5-1334u-8gb-512gb-156-fhd\\/\",\"accessed\":\"2026-11-23\"}]',NULL,NULL,0,'2025-12-31 18:15:00','2025-12-31 18:15:00'),(264,9,3,'Dell Latitude 14 3440 2022 (12th Gen i5-1235U)','dell-latitude-14-3440-2023',NULL,'gadgets/2026/dell-latitude-14-3440-2023.webp',NULL,NULL,0.00,NULL,0,'Rs 85,000 last listed price in Nepal','2022-01-01','discontinued',NULL,0,0,'<p>The Dell Latitude 14 3440 2022 (12th Gen i5-1235U) is no longer stocked in Nepal. Its last listed price was <strong>Rs 85,000</strong>. It was announced in 2022. We keep the full specs here for reference and for anyone checking a second-hand unit.</p>\n<p>It runs on the Intel Core i5-1235U, 10 cores / 12 threads. Screen: 14 inches, LCD, 16:9 aspect ratio, 60Hz, 250 nits (cd/m2). At 250 nits or less, the screen is dim for a bright room or outdoor use. 8GB of RAM is fine for study and office work but tight for heavy multitasking; check whether it can be upgraded. At 1.54kg, it is fine for occasional carrying. Battery: 3-cell 42Wh Li-ion.</p>\n<p>Buying new instead? A current Dell alternative is the <a href=\"/products/dell-pro-15-pv15255-2025\">Dell Pro 15 PV15255 2025 (AMD Ryzen 5 7520U)</a> (Rs 85,999).</p>','[{\"question\":\"Is the Dell Latitude 14 3440 2022 (12th Gen i5-1235U) still available in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"No, it is no longer stocked. Its last listed price was Rs 85,000.\"},{\"question\":\"Which processor does the Dell Latitude 14 3440 2022 (12th Gen i5-1235U) use?\",\"answer\":\"It uses the Intel Core i5-1235U, 10 cores \\/ 12 threads.\"}]','[{\"label\":\"GadgetByte Nepal \\u2013 Dell Latitude 14 3440 2022 (12th Gen i5-1235U)\",\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/www.gadgetbytenepal.com\\/product\\/dell-latitude-14-3440-2022-i5-1235u\\/\",\"accessed\":\"2026-11-23\"}]',NULL,NULL,0,'2021-12-31 18:15:00','2021-12-31 18:15:00'),(265,9,3,'Dell Pro 15 PV15255 (Ryzen 5 7520U, 8GB/512GB)','dell-pro-15-pv15255-2025',NULL,'gadgets/2026/dell-pro-15-pv15255-2025.webp',NULL,NULL,86499.00,NULL,0,NULL,'2026-01-01','available',NULL,0,0,'<p>The Dell Pro 15 is the most affordable Dell on ONIN Infosys\'s shelf at <strong>Rs 86,499</strong>. It has one feature that\'s unusual at this price: a <strong>120Hz</strong> 15.6-inch Full HD screen. Scrolling through long documents and web pages feels noticeably smoother than on the 60Hz panels most budget laptops use.</p>\n<p>Inside is AMD\'s 4-core <strong>Ryzen 5 7520U</strong> (8 threads, up to 4.3GHz) with Radeon 610M graphics, 8GB of LPDDR5-5500 (onboard) and a 512GB NVMe SSD. That\'s comfortable for study, office suites and video calls. The anti-glare IPS panel is 250 nits, so it\'s best used indoors.</p>\n<p>Ports are a mixed bag: a USB-A 5Gbps, a USB 2.0, a <strong>data-only</strong> USB-C, HDMI 1.4 and an SD card slot. The 41Wh battery is modest. The Carbon Black finish looks smarter than most budget plastic.</p>\n<p>The 8GB of soldered memory is the long-term limit. If you need more, the <a href=\"/products/hp-15-fc0043nq-2024\">HP 15 with 16GB</a> costs about Rs 13,500 more.</p>','[{\"question\":\"What is the Dell Pro 15 PV15255 price in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"ONIN Infosys sells the Dell Pro 15 PV15255 with Ryzen 5 7520U, 8GB LPDDR5 and 512GB SSD for Rs 86,499.\"},{\"question\":\"What refresh rate is the Dell Pro 15 display?\",\"answer\":\"120Hz on a 15.6-inch Full HD anti-glare IPS panel.\"},{\"question\":\"Can the Dell Pro 15 charge over USB-C?\",\"answer\":\"No. ONIN lists its USB-C port as data-only.\"}]','[{\"label\":\"ONIN Infosys \\u2013 Dell Pro 15 PV15255 (Ryzen 5 7520U, 8GB\\/512GB)\",\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/onin.com.np\\/product\\/dell-pro-15-pv15255-ryzen-5-price-nepal\",\"accessed\":\"2026-11-23\"},{\"label\":\"GadgetByte Nepal \\u2013 Dell Pro 15 PV15255 2025 (AMD Ryzen 5 7520U)\",\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/www.gadgetbytenepal.com\\/product\\/dell-pro-15-2025-pv15255-amd-ryzen-5-7520u\\/\",\"accessed\":\"2026-11-23\"}]',NULL,'https://onin.com.np/product/dell-pro-15-pv15255-ryzen-5-price-nepal',0,'2025-12-31 18:15:00','2025-12-31 18:15:00'),(266,9,3,'Dell Alienware 16X Aurora (2025)','dell-alienware-16x-aurora-2025',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,494499.00,NULL,0,NULL,'2025-01-01','available',NULL,0,0,'<p>The Dell Alienware 16X Aurora (2025) costs <strong>Rs 4,94,499</strong> in Nepal for the Core Ultra 9 275HX · RTX 5070, 16GB/2TB model. With a dedicated NVIDIA GPU, this is built for gaming and creative apps first.</p>\n<p>It runs on the Intel Core Ultra 9 275HX with NVIDIA GeForce RTX 5070 graphics. The screen is a 16-inch WQXGA IPS, 240Hz panel. 16GB of memory is the right amount for a laptop you plan to keep for four or five years. That GPU is comfortable with current games at high settings on the built-in screen.</p>\n<p>Around the same budget, also look at the <a href=\"/products/lenovo-legion-pro-5i-16iax10-2025-intel-core-ultra-9-275hx-rtx-5060\">Lenovo Legion Pro 5i 16IAX10 2025 (Intel Core Ultra 9 275HX)</a> (Rs 4,95,900) and the <a href=\"/products/asus-rog-strix-g18-g815jmr-2025-14th-gen-i9-14900hx-rtx-5060\">Asus ROG Strix G18 G815JMR 2025 (Intel Core i9-14900HX)</a> (Rs 4,88,900). You can <a href=\"/compare?category=laptop&g1=dell-alienware-16x-aurora-2025&g2=lenovo-legion-pro-5i-16iax10-2025-intel-core-ultra-9-275hx-rtx-5060\">compare the Dell Alienware 16X Aurora (2025) with the Lenovo Legion Pro 5i 16IAX10 2025 (Intel Core Ultra 9 275HX)</a> side by side.</p>\n<p>Prices are from <a href=\"https://www.gadgetbytenepal.com/dell-laptops-price-nepal\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" target=\"_blank\">GadgetByte Nepal – Dell laptop price list</a>, last updated 15 September 2026. Shop prices can change, so confirm with the seller before you pay.</p>','[{\"question\":\"What is the Dell Alienware 16X Aurora (2025) price in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"The Dell Alienware 16X Aurora (2025) costs Rs 4,94,499 in Nepal.\"},{\"question\":\"Which processor does the Dell Alienware 16X Aurora (2025) use?\",\"answer\":\"It uses the Intel Core Ultra 9 275HX.\"},{\"question\":\"Is the Dell Alienware 16X Aurora (2025) good for gaming?\",\"answer\":\"Yes. It has NVIDIA GeForce RTX 5070 graphics, so it is built for gaming as well as everyday work.\"}]','[{\"label\":\"GadgetByte Nepal \\u2013 Dell laptop price list\",\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/www.gadgetbytenepal.com\\/dell-laptops-price-nepal\",\"accessed\":\"2026-09-15\"}]',NULL,NULL,0,'2026-09-14 18:15:00','2026-09-14 18:15:00'),(267,8,3,'HP NoteBook 14-ep 2024 (Intel Core Ultra 5 125H)','hp-notebook-14-ep-2024',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,109999.00,NULL,0,NULL,'2026-01-01','available',NULL,0,0,'<p>The HP NoteBook 14-ep 2024 (Intel Core Ultra 5 125H) costs <strong>Rs 1,09,999</strong> in Nepal for the 8GB/512GB model. It launched in Nepal in 2026. That is mainstream money in Nepal: fine for office work, coding and study.</p>\n<p>It runs on the Intel Core Ultra 5 125H (Intel 4), 14 cores / 18 threads. Screen: 14 inches, IPS LCD, Full HD (1920 x 1080 pixels), 60Hz. 8GB of RAM is fine for study and office work but tight for heavy multitasking; check whether it can be upgraded. At 1.40 kg, it is easy to carry every day. Battery: Li-Ion 41 Wh; 65W adapter.</p>\n<p>Around the same budget, also look at the <a href=\"/products/acer-aspire-lite-16-al16-54p-586n-2024-intel-core-i5-1334u\">Acer Aspire Lite 16 AL16-54P-586N 2024 (Intel Core i5-1334U)</a> (Rs 1,09,999) and the <a href=\"/products/lenovo-yoga-slim-7-carbon-2022-i5-1240p-90hz\">Lenovo Yoga Slim 7 Carbon 13IAP7 2022 (Intel Core i5-1240P)</a> (Rs 1,10,000). You can <a href=\"/compare?category=laptop&g1=hp-notebook-14-ep-2024&g2=acer-aspire-lite-16-al16-54p-586n-2024-intel-core-i5-1334u\">compare the HP NoteBook 14-ep 2024 (Intel Core Ultra 5 125H) with the Acer Aspire Lite 16 AL16-54P-586N 2024 (Intel Core i5-1334U)</a> side by side.</p>','[{\"question\":\"What is the HP NoteBook 14-ep 2024 (Intel Core Ultra 5 125H) price in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"The HP NoteBook 14-ep 2024 (Intel Core Ultra 5 125H) costs Rs 1,09,999 in Nepal.\"},{\"question\":\"When did the HP NoteBook 14-ep 2024 (Intel Core Ultra 5 125H) launch in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"It launched in Nepal in 2026.\"},{\"question\":\"Which processor does the HP NoteBook 14-ep 2024 (Intel Core Ultra 5 125H) use?\",\"answer\":\"It uses the Intel Core Ultra 5 125H (Intel 4), 14 cores \\/ 18 threads.\"}]','[{\"label\":\"GadgetByte Nepal \\u2013 HP NoteBook 14-ep 2024 (Intel Core Ultra 5 125H)\",\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/www.gadgetbytenepal.com\\/product\\/hp-notebook-14-ep-2024-intel-core-ultra-5-125h\\/\",\"accessed\":\"2026-11-23\"}]',NULL,NULL,0,'2025-12-31 18:15:00','2025-12-31 18:15:00'),(268,8,3,'HP 15 (Ryzen 5 7520U, 8GB or 16GB)','hp-15-fc0043nq-2024',NULL,'gadgets/2026/hp-15-fc0043nq-2024.webp',NULL,NULL,89999.00,NULL,0,NULL,'2026-01-01','available',NULL,0,0,'<p>HP\'s basic 15-inch laptop is a familiar sight in Nepali offices and colleges, and ONIN Infosys stocks it with AMD\'s 4-core <strong>Ryzen 5 7520U</strong> in two memory sizes. The <strong>15-fc0196nia with 8GB costs Rs 89,999</strong>, and the <strong>15-fc0043nq with 16GB costs Rs 99,999</strong>. Both have a 512GB NVMe SSD and a 15.6-inch Full HD anti-glare screen.</p>\n<p>The memory is soldered to the board, so the choice you make at purchase is permanent. Our advice is simple: pay the extra Rs 10,000 for 16GB. It\'s the difference between a laptop that handles a browser full of tabs, Teams and Excel comfortably today and one that feels sluggish in a year or two.</p>\n<p>Both share HP\'s no-nonsense design: about 1.6 kg in silver, a full-size keyboard with number pad, Radeon integrated graphics, two USB-A ports, HDMI and a USB-C that\'s <strong>data-only</strong> (it can\'t charge the laptop or drive a monitor). The 41Wh battery covers a few hours of office work. HP lists the fc0196nia with a backlit keyboard.</p>\n<p>For a more powerful chip at a similar price, see the <a href=\"/products/hp-15-ryzen-7-7730u-8gb\">HP 15 with Ryzen 7 7730U</a>. For more memory and Ethernet, look at the <a href=\"/products/acer-aspire-lite-15-al15-42p-ryzen-5-7430u\">Acer Aspire Lite 15</a>.</p>','[{\"question\":\"What is the HP 15 Ryzen 5 7520U price in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"At ONIN Infosys, the HP 15-fc0196nia (8GB\\/512GB) costs Rs 89,999 and the HP 15-fc0043nq (16GB\\/512GB) costs Rs 99,999.\"},{\"question\":\"Can I upgrade the RAM on the HP 15 Ryzen 5?\",\"answer\":\"No. The LPDDR5 memory is onboard, so choose 8GB or 16GB at purchase.\"},{\"question\":\"Can the HP 15 charge via USB-C?\",\"answer\":\"No. Its USB-C port is for data only; it charges through HP\'s barrel connector.\"}]','[{\"label\":\"ONIN Infosys \\u2013 HP 15 (Ryzen 5 7520U, 8GB or 16GB)\",\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/onin.com.np\\/product\\/hp-laptop-15-fc0043nq-price-in-nepal-ryzen-5-7520u-16gb-ddr5-512gb\",\"accessed\":\"2026-11-23\"},{\"label\":\"ONIN Infosys \\u2013 HP 15 (Ryzen 5 7520U, 8GB or 16GB) (edition=15-fc0196nia, ram=8GB, storage=512GB)\",\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/onin.com.np\\/product\\/hp-15-ryzen-5-laptop-price-in-nepal\",\"accessed\":\"2026-11-23\"},{\"label\":\"GadgetByte Nepal \\u2013 HP 15-FC0043NQ 2024 (AMD Ryzen 5 7520U)\",\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/www.gadgetbytenepal.com\\/product\\/hp-15-fc0043nq-2024-amd-ryzen-5-7520u\\/\",\"accessed\":\"2026-11-23\"}]',NULL,'https://onin.com.np/product/hp-laptop-15-fc0043nq-price-in-nepal-ryzen-5-7520u-16gb-ddr5-512gb',0,'2025-12-31 18:15:00','2025-12-31 18:15:00'),(269,8,3,'HP 15-fc0124nia (2024)','hp-15-fc0124nia-2024',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,78999.00,NULL,0,NULL,'2024-01-01','available',NULL,0,0,'<p>The HP 15-fc0124nia (2024) costs <strong>Rs 78,999</strong> in Nepal for the AMD Ryzen 3 7320U, 8GB/512GB model. It is a basic machine for documents, browsing, online classes and video calls, not for editing or games.</p>\n<p>It runs on the AMD Ryzen 3 7320U. The screen is a 15.6-inch FHD panel. 8GB of RAM is enough for study and office work, but it will feel tight with many browser tabs open, so look for a model with a free slot or step up to 16GB if you can.</p>\n<p>Around the same budget, also look at the <a href=\"/products/hp-notebook-15-fc0124nia-ryzen-3-7320u\">HP Notebook 15 FC0124NIA 2024 (Ryzen 3 7320U)</a> (Rs 78,999) and the <a href=\"/products/dell-15-dc15250-2025\">Dell 15 DC15250 2025</a> (Rs 78,999). You can <a href=\"/compare?category=laptop&g1=hp-15-fc0124nia-2024&g2=hp-notebook-15-fc0124nia-ryzen-3-7320u\">compare the HP 15-fc0124nia (2024) with the HP Notebook 15 FC0124NIA 2024 (Ryzen 3 7320U)</a> side by side.</p>\n<p>Prices are from <a href=\"https://www.gadgetbytenepal.com/hp-laptops-price-nepal\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" target=\"_blank\">GadgetByte Nepal – HP laptop price list</a>, last updated 10 September 2026. Shop prices can change, so confirm with the seller before you pay.</p>','[{\"question\":\"What is the HP 15-fc0124nia (2024) price in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"The HP 15-fc0124nia (2024) costs Rs 78,999 in Nepal.\"},{\"question\":\"Which processor does the HP 15-fc0124nia (2024) use?\",\"answer\":\"It uses the AMD Ryzen 3 7320U.\"}]','[{\"label\":\"GadgetByte Nepal \\u2013 HP laptop price list\",\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/www.gadgetbytenepal.com\\/hp-laptops-price-nepal\",\"accessed\":\"2026-09-10\"}]',NULL,NULL,0,'2026-09-09 18:15:00','2026-09-09 18:15:00'),(270,8,3,'HP Pavilion x360 14 (2022)','hp-pavilion-x360-14-2022',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,95000.00,NULL,0,NULL,'2022-01-01','available',NULL,0,0,'<p>The HP Pavilion x360 14 (2022) cost