an <a href=\"/compare?category=laptop&g1=hp-probook-440-g11&g2=lenovo-ideapad-slim-5-14akp10-2025-amd-ryzen-ai-5-330\">compare the HP ProBook 440 G11 (Intel Core Ultra 5 125U) with the Lenovo IdeaPad Slim 5 14AKP10 2025 (AMD Ryzen AI 5 330)</a> side by side.</p>','[{\"question\":\"What is the HP ProBook 440 G11 (Intel Core Ultra 5 125U) price in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"The HP ProBook 440 G11 (Intel Core Ultra 5 125U) costs Rs 1,60,000 in Nepal.\"},{\"question\":\"When did the HP ProBook 440 G11 (Intel Core Ultra 5 125U) launch in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"It launched in Nepal on 1 March 2026.\"},{\"question\":\"Which processor does the HP ProBook 440 G11 (Intel Core Ultra 5 125U) use?\",\"answer\":\"It uses the Intel Core Ultra 5 125U (Intel 4), 12 cores \\/ 14 threads.\"}]','[{\"label\":\"GadgetByte Nepal \\u2013 HP ProBook 440 G11 (Intel Core Ultra 5 125U)\",\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/www.gadgetbytenepal.com\\/product\\/hp-probook-440-g11-intel-core-ultra-5-125u\\/\",\"accessed\":\"2026-11-23\"}]',NULL,NULL,0,'2026-02-28 18:15:00','2026-02-28 18:15:00'),(277,39,3,'Lenovo V14 G5 2025 (Intel Core 5 210H)','lenovo-v14-g5-2025',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0.00,NULL,0,'Rs 1,45,900 last listed price in Nepal','2025-01-01','discontinued',NULL,0,0,'<p>The Lenovo V14 G5 2025 (Intel Core 5 210H) is no longer stocked in Nepal. Its last listed price was <strong>Rs 1,45,900</strong>. It launched in Nepal in 2025. We keep the full specs here for reference and for anyone checking a second-hand unit.</p>\n<p>It runs on the Intel Core 5 210H (Intel 7), 8 cores / 12 threads. Screen: 14 inches, IPS, Full HD (1920 x 1080 pixels), 60Hz. 16GB of memory is the right amount for a laptop you plan to keep for several years. At 1.37 kg, it is easy to carry every day. Battery: Li-Ion 47 Wh; 65W adapter.</p>\n<p>Buying new instead? A current Lenovo alternative is the <a href=\"/products/lenovo-ideapad-5-2-in-1-14agp11-2026-ryzen-ai-5-430\">Lenovo IdeaPad 5 2-in-1 14AGP11 2026 (Ryzen AI 5 430)</a> (Rs 1,45,999).</p>','[{\"question\":\"Is the Lenovo V14 G5 2025 (Intel Core 5 210H) still available in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"No, it is no longer stocked. Its last listed price was Rs 1,45,900.\"},{\"question\":\"When did the Lenovo V14 G5 2025 (Intel Core 5 210H) launch in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"It launched in Nepal in 2025.\"},{\"question\":\"Which processor does the Lenovo V14 G5 2025 (Intel Core 5 210H) use?\",\"answer\":\"It uses the Intel Core 5 210H (Intel 7), 8 cores \\/ 12 threads.\"}]','[{\"label\":\"GadgetByte Nepal \\u2013 Lenovo V14 G5 2025 (Intel Core 5 210H)\",\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/www.gadgetbytenepal.com\\/product\\/lenovo-v14-g5-2024-core-5-210h\\/\",\"accessed\":\"2026-11-23\"}]',NULL,NULL,0,'2024-12-31 18:15:00','2024-12-31 18:15:00'),(278,39,3,'Lenovo IdeaPad 5 2-in-1 14IAL10 2025 (Intel Core Ultra 5 225U)','lenovo-ideapad-5-2-in-1-14ial10-2025',NULL,'gadgets/2026/lenovo-ideapad-5-2-in-1-14ial10-2025.webp',NULL,NULL,125999.00,NULL,0,NULL,'2026-01-01','available',NULL,0,0,'<p>The Lenovo IdeaPad 5 2-in-1 14IAL10 2025 (Intel Core Ultra 5 225U) costs <strong>Rs 1,25,999</strong> in Nepal for the 8GB/512GB model. It launched in Nepal in 2026. That is mainstream money in Nepal: fine for office work, coding and study.</p>\n<p>It runs on the Intel Core Ultra 5 225U (Intel 3), 12 cores / 14 threads. Screen: 14 inches, IPS LCD, WUXGA (1920 x 1200 pixels), 60Hz. 8GB of RAM is fine for study and office work but tight for heavy multitasking; check whether it can be upgraded. At 1.6 kg, it is fine for occasional carrying. Battery: Li-Ion 57 Wh; 65W adapter.</p>\n<p>Around the same budget, also look at the <a href=\"/products/acer-swift-neo-14-sfn14-54h-2025-intel-core-ultra-5-115u\">Acer Swift Neo 14 SFN14-54H 2025 (Intel Core Ultra 5 115U)</a> (Rs 1,26,999) and the <a href=\"/products/acer-aspire-14-ai-a14-52m-51s1-2025-intel-core-ultra-5-226v-16gb-512tb-14-wuxga-touch\">Acer Aspire 14 AI A14-52M-51S1 2025 (Intel Core Ultra 5 226V)</a> (Rs 1,24,999). You can <a href=\"/compare?category=laptop&g1=lenovo-ideapad-5-2-in-1-14ial10-2025&g2=acer-swift-neo-14-sfn14-54h-2025-intel-core-ultra-5-115u\">compare the Lenovo IdeaPad 5 2-in-1 14IAL10 2025 (Intel Core Ultra 5 225U) with the Acer Swift Neo 14 SFN14-54H 2025 (Intel Core Ultra 5 115U)</a> side by side.</p>','[{\"question\":\"What is the Lenovo IdeaPad 5 2-in-1 14IAL10 2025 (Intel Core Ultra 5 225U) price in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"The Lenovo IdeaPad 5 2-in-1 14IAL10 2025 (Intel Core Ultra 5 225U) costs Rs 1,25,999 in Nepal.\"},{\"question\":\"When did the Lenovo IdeaPad 5 2-in-1 14IAL10 2025 (Intel Core Ultra 5 225U) launch in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"It launched in Nepal in 2026.\"},{\"question\":\"Which processor does the Lenovo IdeaPad 5 2-in-1 14IAL10 2025 (Intel Core Ultra 5 225U) use?\",\"answer\":\"It uses the Intel Core Ultra 5 225U (Intel 3), 12 cores \\/ 14 threads.\"}]','[{\"label\":\"GadgetByte Nepal \\u2013 Lenovo IdeaPad 5 2-in-1 14IAL10 2025 (Intel Core Ultra 5 225U)\",\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/www.gadgetbytenepal.com\\/product\\/lenovo-ideapad-5-2-in-1-14ial10-2025-intel-core-ultra-5-225u-8gb-512gb-14-wuxga-ips-touch\\/\",\"accessed\":\"2026-11-23\"}]',NULL,NULL,0,'2025-12-31 18:15:00','2025-12-31 18:15:00'),(279,39,3,'Lenovo IdeaPad Slim 3 15AMN8 (Ryzen 5 40, 8GB/512GB)','lenovo-ideapad-slim-3-15amn8-2023',NULL,'gadgets/2026/lenovo-ideapad-slim-3-15amn8-2023.webp',NULL,NULL,87499.00,99999.00,0,NULL,'2024-01-01','available',NULL,0,0,'<p>The IdeaPad Slim 3 15AMN8 is the 15.6-inch laptop we\'d point a first-year college student or a small-office buyer to when the budget stops just under a lakh. ONIN Infosys sells it at <strong>Rs 87,499</strong> in Abyss Blue with Windows 11 Home already set up.</p>\n<p>It runs AMD\'s <strong>Ryzen 5 40</strong>, a 4-core, 8-thread processor that boosts to 4.3GHz with Radeon 610M graphics. That\'s enough headroom for assignments, Excel, browser-based software, Zoom and Netflix in the evening. You get a proper <strong>512GB PCIe 4.0 SSD</strong>, a 15.6-inch Full HD IPS anti-glare screen, Wi-Fi 6 and Bluetooth 5.2. The USB-C port supports charging and DisplayPort output, so one cable can power the laptop and run an external monitor.</p>\n<p>The weaknesses are the 8GB of soldered LPDDR5 memory and the non-backlit keyboard. Typing in a dark hostel room during a power cut takes some getting used to. The 720p webcam is ordinary but has a privacy shutter. If you need 16GB and a sharper 16:10 screen, the <a href=\"/products/lenovo-ideapad-slim-3-15arp10-2025\">Slim 3 15ARP10 with Ryzen 5 7535HS</a> is the step up.</p>','[{\"question\":\"What is the Lenovo IdeaPad Slim 3 15AMN8 price in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"Rs 87,499 at ONIN Infosys for the Ryzen 5 40, 8GB RAM and 512GB SSD version with a one-year warranty.\"},{\"question\":\"Can the IdeaPad Slim 3 15AMN8 charge over USB-C?\",\"answer\":\"Yes. Its USB-C 3.2 Gen 1 port supports USB Power Delivery (45\\u201365W) and DisplayPort 1.2 output.\"},{\"question\":\"Does it have a backlit keyboard?\",\"answer\":\"No. This configuration has a non-backlit English keyboard.\"}]','[{\"label\":\"ONIN Infosys \\u2013 Lenovo IdeaPad Slim 3 15AMN8 (Ryzen 5 40, 8GB\\/512GB)\",\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/onin.com.np\\/product\\/lenovo-ideapad-slim-3-15amn8-ryzen-5-price-nepal\",\"accessed\":\"2026-11-23\"},{\"label\":\"GadgetByte Nepal \\u2013 Lenovo IdeaPad Slim 3 15AMN8 2023 (Ryzen 3 7320U)\",\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/www.gadgetbytenepal.com\\/product\\/lenovo-ideapad-slim-3-2023-ryzen-3-7320u\\/\",\"accessed\":\"2026-11-23\"}]',NULL,'https://onin.com.np/product/lenovo-ideapad-slim-3-15amn8-ryzen-5-price-nepal',0,'2023-12-31 18:15:00','2023-12-31 18:15:00'),(280,39,3,'Lenovo V15 G4 IRU 2023 (Intel i3-1315U)','lenovo-v15-g4-iru-2023',NULL,'gadgets/2026/lenovo-v15-g4-iru-2023.webp',NULL,NULL,84000.00,NULL,0,NULL,'2025-01-01','available',NULL,0,0,'<p>The Lenovo V15 G4 IRU 2023 (Intel i3-1315U) costs <strong>Rs 84,000</strong> in Nepal for the 8+512 model. It launched in Nepal in 2025. That is mainstream money in Nepal: fine for office work, coding and study.</p>\n<p>It runs on the Intel Core i3-1315U (Intel 7), 6 cores / 8 threads. Screen: 15.6 inches, IPS LCD, Full HD (1920 x 1080 pixels), 60Hz. At 1.65 kg, it is fine for occasional carrying. Battery: Li-Ion 45 Wh; 65W adapter.</p>\n<p>Around the same budget, also look at the <a href=\"/products/asus-vivobook-15x-oled-x1503za-2022\">Asus Vivobook 15X OLED X1503ZA 2022 (Intel Core i3-1220P)</a> (Rs 83,900) and the <a href=\"/products/dell-pro-15-pv15255-2025\">Dell Pro 15 PV15255 2025 (AMD Ryzen 5 7520U)</a> (Rs 85,999). You can <a href=\"/compare?category=laptop&g1=lenovo-v15-g4-iru-2023&g2=asus-vivobook-15x-oled-x1503za-2022\">compare the Lenovo V15 G4 IRU 2023 (Intel i3-1315U) with the Asus Vivobook 15X OLED X1503ZA 2022 (Intel Core i3-1220P)</a> side by side.</p>','[{\"question\":\"What is the Lenovo V15 G4 IRU 2023 (Intel i3-1315U) price in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"The Lenovo V15 G4 IRU 2023 (Intel i3-1315U) costs Rs 84,000 in Nepal.\"},{\"question\":\"When did the Lenovo V15 G4 IRU 2023 (Intel i3-1315U) launch in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"It launched in Nepal in 2025.\"},{\"question\":\"Which processor does the Lenovo V15 G4 IRU 2023 (Intel i3-1315U) use?\",\"answer\":\"It uses the Intel Core i3-1315U (Intel 7), 6 cores \\/ 8 threads.\"}]','[{\"label\":\"GadgetByte Nepal \\u2013 Lenovo V15 G4 IRU 2023 (Intel i3-1315U)\",\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/www.gadgetbytenepal.com\\/product\\/lenovo-v15-g4-2023-intel-i3-1315u\\/\",\"accessed\":\"2026-11-23\"}]',NULL,NULL,0,'2024-12-31 18:15:00','2024-12-31 18:15:00'),(281,39,3,'Lenovo IdeaPad Slim 3 14AMN8 (Athlon Silver 7120U, 8GB/256GB)','lenovo-ideapad-slim-3-14amn8-2023',NULL,'gadgets/2026/lenovo-ideapad-slim-3-14amn8-2023.webp',NULL,NULL,66499.00,NULL,0,NULL,'2025-01-01','available',NULL,0,0,'<p>This is about as little as you can spend on a new Lenovo laptop in Nepal and still get an SSD, a Full HD screen and Wi-Fi 6. ONIN Infosys sells the IdeaPad Slim 3 14AMN8 for <strong>Rs 66,499</strong>. It\'s light at 1.37 kg and has a webcam privacy shutter, a USB-C port that charges and drives a monitor, and HDMI.</p>\n<p>Be realistic about the chip, though. The <strong>AMD Athlon Silver 7120U</strong> has just <strong>two cores and two threads</strong>. It is fine for one thing at a time: typing notes, a Zoom class, YouTube, Google Classroom, email. Open Chrome with fifteen tabs alongside Teams and it will slow down. The 8GB of LPDDR5 memory is soldered, so it can\'t be upgraded later. The 14-inch panel is a TN type, so colours shift if you look from an angle.</p>\n<p>Who should buy it? A school student who mainly writes assignments, a parent who needs something for banking and video calls, or a shop counter that runs one billing app. If your budget can reach about Rs 85,000, the 4-core <a href=\"/products/lenovo-ideapad-1-15amn7-2023-ryzen-5-7520u\">IdeaPad 1 with Ryzen 5 7520U</a> or the <a href=\"/products/lenovo-ideapad-slim-3-14iru8-core-i3-1315u\">IdeaPad Slim 3 with Core i3-1315U</a> will feel noticeably quicker and stay usable for longer.</p>','[{\"question\":\"What is the Lenovo IdeaPad Slim 3 14AMN8 price in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"ONIN Infosys sells the IdeaPad Slim 3 14AMN8 with AMD Athlon Silver 7120U, 8GB RAM and 256GB SSD for Rs 66,499 with a one-year warranty.\"},{\"question\":\"Is the Athlon Silver 7120U good for students?\",\"answer\":\"For notes, online classes and browsing, yes. It is a dual-core chip, so it struggles with heavy multitasking, video editing or programming tools.\"},{\"question\":\"Can I upgrade the RAM on the IdeaPad Slim 3 14AMN8?\",\"answer\":\"No. The 8GB LPDDR5 memory is soldered to the motherboard.\"}]','[{\"label\":\"ONIN Infosys \\u2013 Lenovo IdeaPad Slim 3 14AMN8 (Athlon Silver 7120U, 8GB\\/256GB)\",\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/onin.com.np\\/product\\/lenovo-ideapad-slim-3-14amn8-athlon-7120u-price-nepal\",\"accessed\":\"2026-11-23\"},{\"label\":\"GadgetByte Nepal \\u2013 Lenovo IdeaPad Slim 3 14AMN8 2023 (AMD Athlon 7120U)\",\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/www.gadgetbytenepal.com\\/product\\/lenovo-ideapad-slim-3-15amn8-2023-amd-athlon-7120u-8gb-256gb-156-fhd\\/\",\"accessed\":\"2026-11-23\"}]',NULL,'https://onin.com.np/product/lenovo-ideapad-slim-3-14amn8-athlon-7120u-price-nepal',0,'2024-12-31 18:15:00','2024-12-31 18:15:00'),(282,39,3,'Lenovo V15 G6 2025 (Intel N100)','lenovo-v15-g6-2025',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,62999.00,NULL,0,NULL,'2026-01-01','available',NULL,0,0,'<p>The Lenovo V15 G6 2025 (Intel N100) costs <strong>Rs 62,999</strong> in Nepal for the 8GB/256GB model. It launched in Nepal in 2026. It is built for documents, browsing, online classes and video calls rather than editing or gaming.</p>\n<p>It runs on the Intel N100 (Intel 7), 4 cores / 4 threads. Screen: 15.6 inches, IPS, Full HD (1920 x 1080 pixels), 60Hz. 8GB of RAM is fine for study and office work but tight for heavy multitasking; check whether it can be upgraded. At 1.51 kg, it is fine for occasional carrying. Battery: Li-Ion 38 Wh; 65W adapter.</p>\n<p>Around the same budget, also look at the <a href=\"/products/dell-wyse-5470-2022-celeron-n4100\">Dell Wyse 5470 2022 (Intel Celeron N4100)</a> (Rs 58,999) and the <a href=\"/products/lenovo-ideapad-slim-3-14amn8-2023\">Lenovo IdeaPad Slim 3 14AMN8 2023 (AMD Athlon 7120U)</a> (Rs 66,999). You can <a href=\"/compare?category=laptop&g1=lenovo-v15-g6-2025&g2=dell-wyse-5470-2022-celeron-n4100\">compare the Lenovo V15 G6 2025 (Intel N100) with the Dell Wyse 5470 2022 (Intel Celeron N4100)</a> side by side.</p>','[{\"question\":\"What is the Lenovo V15 G6 2025 (Intel N100) price in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"The Lenovo V15 G6 2025 (Intel N100) costs Rs 62,999 in Nepal.\"},{\"question\":\"When did the Lenovo V15 G6 2025 (Intel N100) launch in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"It launched in Nepal in 2026.\"},{\"question\":\"Which processor does the Lenovo V15 G6 2025 (Intel N100) use?\",\"answer\":\"It uses the Intel N100 (Intel 7), 4 cores \\/ 4 threads.\"}]','[{\"label\":\"GadgetByte Nepal \\u2013 Lenovo V15 G6 2025 (Intel N100)\",\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/www.gadgetbytenepal.com\\/product\\/lenovo-v15-g6-2025-intel-n100\\/\",\"accessed\":\"2026-11-23\"}]',NULL,NULL,0,'2025-12-31 18:15:00','2025-12-31 18:15:00'),(283,39,3,'Lenovo IdeaPad Slim 3 15ARP10 (Ryzen 5 7535HS, 16GB/512GB)','lenovo-ideapad-slim-3-15arp10-2025',NULL,'gadgets/2026/lenovo-ideapad-slim-3-15arp10-2025.webp',NULL,NULL,112499.00,117499.00,0,NULL,'2026-01-01','available',NULL,0,0,'<p>The 15ARP10 is the IdeaPad Slim 3 to buy if you want an everyday laptop that won\'t feel slow two years from now. ONIN Infosys has it at <strong>Rs 1,12,499</strong> in Luna Grey with a <strong>Ryzen 5 7535HS</strong>. That\'s a 6-core, 12-thread H-class chip boosting to 4.55GHz, with Radeon 660M graphics that can run esports titles and older games at modest settings.</p>\n<p>Memory is <strong>16GB DDR5-4800 in dual channel</strong>: 8GB on the board plus an 8GB SO-DIMM you can swap for a larger stick later. The 512GB PCIe 4.0 SSD sits in one of two M.2 slots, so adding a second drive is easy. That\'s unusual upgradeability for a slim laptop at this price.</p>\n<p>The 15.3-inch WUXGA (1920 × 1200) screen is anti-glare at 300 nits, and its 16:10 shape suits documents and coding. Battery is 50Wh with Rapid Charge Boost, which gives roughly two hours of use from a 15-minute charge, useful between power cuts. There\'s a numeric keypad, a Copilot key and a privacy shutter on the 720p webcam. It\'s a better all-rounder than the <a href=\"/products/lenovo-ideapad-slim-3-15amn8-2023\">Slim 3 15AMN8</a> for about Rs 25,000 more.</p>','[{\"question\":\"What is the Lenovo IdeaPad Slim 3 15ARP10 price in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"Rs 1,12,499 at ONIN Infosys for the Ryzen 5 7535HS, 16GB DDR5 and 512GB SSD model.\"},{\"question\":\"Is the RAM upgradeable on the IdeaPad Slim 3 15ARP10?\",\"answer\":\"Partly. 8GB is soldered and 8GB is in an SO-DIMM slot, so you can replace that module with a larger one.\"},{\"question\":\"Can it play games?\",\"answer\":\"Light games and esports titles at lower settings, using the integrated Radeon 660M. It is not a gaming laptop.\"}]','[{\"label\":\"ONIN Infosys \\u2013 Lenovo IdeaPad Slim 3 15ARP10 (Ryzen 5 7535HS, 16GB\\/512GB)\",\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/onin.com.np\\/product\\/lenovo-ideapad-slim-3-15arp10-ryzen-5-7535hs-price-nepal\",\"accessed\":\"2026-11-23\"},{\"label\":\"GadgetByte Nepal \\u2013 Lenovo IdeaPad Slim 3 15ARP10 2025 (Ryzen 7 170)\",\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/www.gadgetbytenepal.com\\/product\\/lenovo-ideapad-slim-3-15arp10-2025-ryzen-7-170\\/\",\"accessed\":\"2026-11-23\"}]',NULL,'https://onin.com.np/product/lenovo-ideapad-slim-3-15arp10-ryzen-5-7535hs-price-nepal',0,'2025-12-31 18:15:00','2025-12-31 18:15:00'),(284,39,3,'Lenovo IdeaPad Pro 5 16IAH10 2025 (Intel Core Ultra 9 285H)','lenovo-ideapad-pro-5-16iah10-2025',NULL,'gadgets/2026/lenovo-ideapad-pro-5-16iah10-2025.webp',NULL,NULL,289999.00,NULL,0,NULL,'2026-01-01','available',NULL,0,0,'<p>The Lenovo IdeaPad Pro 5 16IAH10 2025 (Intel Core Ultra 9 285H) costs <strong>Rs 2,89,999</strong> in Nepal for the 32GB/1TB model. It launched in Nepal in 2026. At this price you should get a premium build, a better screen and enough memory to last years.</p>\n<p>It runs on the Intel Core Ultra 9 285H (TSMC N3B), 16 cores / 16 threads. Screen: 16 inches, OLED, 2.8K (2880 x 1800 pixels), 120Hz. 32GB of memory gives plenty of headroom for editing and development. At 1.96 kg, it is fine for occasional carrying. Battery: Li-ion 84 Wh; 170W adapter.</p>\n<p>Around the same budget, also look at the <a href=\"/products/lenovo-thinkpad-l16-gen-2-2025-intel-core-ultra-7-255h\">Lenovo ThinkPad L16 Gen 2 2025 (Intel Core Ultra 7 255H)</a> (Rs 2,89,900) and the <a href=\"/products/lenovo-legion-5-15iax10-2025-intel-core-ultra-7-255hx-rtx-5060\">Lenovo Legion 5 15IAX10 2025</a> (Rs 2,84,999). You can <a href=\"/compare?category=laptop&g1=lenovo-ideapad-pro-5-16iah10-2025&g2=lenovo-thinkpad-l16-gen-2-2025-intel-core-ultra-7-255h\">compare the Lenovo IdeaPad Pro 5 16IAH10 2025 (Intel Core Ultra 9 285H) with the Lenovo ThinkPad L16 Gen 2 2025 (Intel Core Ultra 7 255H)</a> side by side.</p>','[{\"question\":\"What is the Lenovo IdeaPad Pro 5 16IAH10 2025 (Intel Core Ultra 9 285H) price in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"The Lenovo IdeaPad Pro 5 16IAH10 2025 (Intel Core Ultra 9 285H) costs Rs 2,89,999 in Nepal.\"},{\"question\":\"When did the Lenovo IdeaPad Pro 5 16IAH10 2025 (Intel Core Ultra 9 285H) launch in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"It launched in Nepal in 2026.\"},{\"question\":\"Which processor does the Lenovo IdeaPad Pro 5 16IAH10 2025 (Intel Core Ultra 9 285H) use?\",\"answer\":\"It uses the Intel Core Ultra 9 285H (TSMC N3B), 16 cores \\/ 16 threads.\"}]','[{\"label\":\"GadgetByte Nepal \\u2013 Lenovo IdeaPad Pro 5 16IAH10 2025 (Intel Core Ultra 9 285H)\",\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/www.gadgetbytenepal.com\\/product\\/lenovo-ideapad-pro-5-16iah10-2025-intel-core-ultra-9-285h-rtx-5050\\/\",\"accessed\":\"2026-11-23\"}]',NULL,NULL,0,'2025-12-31 18:15:00','2025-12-31 18:15:00'),(285,39,3,'Lenovo ThinkPad X13 Gen 6 2025 (Intel Core Ultra 7 255H)','lenovo-thinkpad-x13-gen-6-2025',NULL,'gadgets/2026/lenovo-thinkpad-x13-gen-6-2025.webp',NULL,NULL,324999.00,NULL,0,NULL,'2026-01-01','available',NULL,0,0,'<p>The Lenovo ThinkPad X13 Gen 6 2025 (Intel Core Ultra 7 255H) costs <strong>Rs 3,24,999</strong> in Nepal for the 32GB/512GB model. It launched in Nepal in 2026. This is high-end territory, aimed at heavy gaming, 3D work or video editing.</p>\n<p>It runs on the Intel Core Ultra 7 255H (TSMC N3B), 16 cores / 16 threads. Screen: 13.3 inches, IPS LCD, WUXGA (1900 x 1200 pixels), 60Hz. 32GB of memory gives plenty of headroom for editing and development. At 0.96 kg, it is easy to carry every day. Battery: Li-Ion 54.7 Wh; 65W adapter.</p>\n<p>Around the same budget, also look at the <a href=\"/products/asus-zenbook-s-14-oled-ux5406sa-2024\">Asus Zenbook S 14 OLED UX5406SA 2024 (Intel Cor