 a premium build, a better screen and enough memory to last years.</p>\n<p>It runs on the Intel Core Ultra 5 226V (TSMC N3B), 8 cores / 8 threads. Screen: 14 inches, OLED, WUXGA (1920 x 1200 pixels), 60Hz. 16GB of memory is the right amount for a laptop you plan to keep for several years. At 1.57 kg, it is fine for occasional carrying. Battery: Li-ion 70Wh; 65W adapter.</p>\n<p>Around the same budget, also look at the <a href=\"/products/asus-vivobook-s14-s5406sa-2025\">ASUS VivoBook S 14 S5406SA 2025 (Intel Core Ultra 7 258V)</a> (Rs 2,04,999) and the <a href=\"/products/asus-v16-2025-core-7-rtx-5050\">Asus Gaming V16 V3607VH 2025 (Core 7 240H)</a> (Rs 2,07,999). You can <a href=\"/compare?category=laptop&g1=asus-vivobook-14-flip-tp3407sa-2025&g2=asus-vivobook-s14-s5406sa-2025\">compare the Asus Vivobook 14 Flip TP3407SA 2025 (Intel Core Ultra 5 226V) with the ASUS VivoBook S 14 S5406SA 2025 (Intel Core Ultra 7 258V)</a> side by side.</p>','[{\"question\":\"What is the Asus Vivobook 14 Flip TP3407SA 2025 (Intel Core Ultra 5 226V) price in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"The Asus Vivobook 14 Flip TP3407SA 2025 (Intel Core Ultra 5 226V) costs Rs 2,04,900 in Nepal.\"},{\"question\":\"When did the Asus Vivobook 14 Flip TP3407SA 2025 (Intel Core Ultra 5 226V) launch in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"It launched in Nepal in 2026.\"},{\"question\":\"Which processor does the Asus Vivobook 14 Flip TP3407SA 2025 (Intel Core Ultra 5 226V) use?\",\"answer\":\"It uses the Intel Core Ultra 5 226V (TSMC N3B), 8 cores \\/ 8 threads.\"}]','[{\"label\":\"GadgetByte Nepal \\u2013 Asus Vivobook 14 Flip TP3407SA 2025 (Intel Core Ultra 5 226V)\",\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/www.gadgetbytenepal.com\\/product\\/asus-vivobook-14-flip-tp3407sa-2025-intel-core-ultra-5-226v\\/\",\"accessed\":\"2026-11-23\"}]',NULL,NULL,0,'2025-12-31 18:15:00','2025-12-31 18:15:00'),(293,40,3,'ASUS VivoBook 14 M1407KA 2025','asus-vivobook-14-m1407ka-2025',NULL,'gadgets/2026/asus-vivobook-14-m1407ka-2025.webp',NULL,NULL,145999.00,NULL,0,NULL,'2026-01-01','available',NULL,0,0,'<p>The ASUS VivoBook 14 M1407KA 2025 costs <strong>Rs 1,45,999</strong> in Nepal for the Ryzen AI 5 340, 16GB/512GB model. The Ryzen AI 5 330, 16GB/512GB version costs Rs 1,94,599. It launched in Nepal in 2026. That is mainstream money in Nepal: fine for office work, coding and study.</p>\n<p>It runs on the AMD Ryzen AI 5 340 (4nm), 6 cores / 12 threads (base configuration; see prices for other chips). Screen: 14 inches, IPS LCD, WUXGA (1920 x 1200 pixels), 60Hz. 16GB of memory is the right amount for a laptop you plan to keep for several years. At 1.46 kg, it is easy to carry every day. Battery: Li-Ion 42 Wh; 65W adapter.</p>\n<p>Around the same budget, also look at the <a href=\"/products/lenovo-ideapad-5-2-in-1-14agp11-2026-ryzen-ai-5-430\">Lenovo IdeaPad 5 2-in-1 14AGP11 2026 (Ryzen AI 5 430)</a> (Rs 1,45,999) and the <a href=\"/products/asus-vivobook-16-m1607ka-mb117w-2025-ryzen-ai-5-340-16gb-512gb-16-wuxga\">Asus Vivobook 16 M1607KA-MB117W 2025 (Ryzen AI 5 340)</a> (Rs 1,45,999). You can <a href=\"/compare?category=laptop&g1=asus-vivobook-14-m1407ka-2025&g2=lenovo-ideapad-5-2-in-1-14agp11-2026-ryzen-ai-5-430\">compare the ASUS VivoBook 14 M1407KA 2025 with the Lenovo IdeaPad 5 2-in-1 14AGP11 2026 (Ryzen AI 5 430)</a> side by side.</p>','[{\"question\":\"What is the ASUS VivoBook 14 M1407KA 2025 price in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"The ASUS VivoBook 14 M1407KA 2025 starts at Rs 1,45,999 in Nepal. All variants: Rs 1,45,999 for Ryzen AI 5 340, 16GB\\/512GB; Rs 1,94,599 for Ryzen AI 5 330, 16GB\\/512GB.\"},{\"question\":\"When did the ASUS VivoBook 14 M1407KA 2025 launch in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"It launched in Nepal in 2026.\"},{\"question\":\"Which processor does the ASUS VivoBook 14 M1407KA 2025 use?\",\"answer\":\"It uses the AMD Ryzen AI 5 340 (4nm), 6 cores \\/ 12 threads (base configuration; see prices for other chips).\"}]','[{\"label\":\"GadgetByte Nepal \\u2013 ASUS VivoBook 14 M1407KA 2025 (Ryzen AI 5 340)\",\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/www.gadgetbytenepal.com\\/product\\/asus-vivobook-14-m1407ka-2025-ryzen-ai-5-340\\/\",\"accessed\":\"2026-11-23\"},{\"label\":\"GadgetByte Nepal \\u2013 ASUS VivoBook 14 M1407KA 2025 (Ryzen AI 5 330, 16GB, 512GB, 14\\\" WUXGA)\",\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/www.gadgetbytenepal.com\\/product\\/asus-vivobook-14-m1407ka-2025-ryzen-ai-5-330\\/\",\"accessed\":\"2026-11-23\"}]',NULL,NULL,0,'2025-12-31 18:15:00','2025-12-31 18:15:00'),(294,40,3,'Asus Vivobook 14 X1405VA 2023 (Intel Core i7-13620H)','asus-vivobook-14-x1405va-2023',NULL,'gadgets/2026/asus-vivobook-14-x1405va-2023.webp',NULL,NULL,174900.00,NULL,0,NULL,'2024-01-01','available',NULL,0,0,'<p>The Asus Vivobook 14 X1405VA 2023 (Intel Core i7-13620H) costs <strong>Rs 1,74,900</strong> in Nepal for the 16GB/512GB model. It launched in Nepal in 2024. At this price you should get a premium build, a better screen and enough memory to last years.</p>\n<p>It runs on the Intel Core i7-13620H (Intel 7), 10 cores / 16 threads. Screen: 14 inches, IPS LCD, WUXGA (1920 x 1200 pixels), 60Hz. 16GB of memory is the right amount for a laptop you plan to keep for several years. At 1.60 kg, it is fine for occasional carrying. Battery: Li-Ion 42 Wh; 65W adapter.</p>\n<p>Around the same budget, also look at the <a href=\"/products/dell-inspiron-14-plus-7440-intel-core-ultra-9-185h\">Dell Inspiron 14 Plus 7440</a> (Rs 1,74,999) and the <a href=\"/products/lenovo-thinkpad-z13-gen-1-ryzen-7-pro-6850u\">Lenovo ThinkPad Z13 Gen 1 2022 (Ryzen 7 PRO 6850U)</a> (Rs 1,75,120). You can <a href=\"/compare?category=laptop&g1=asus-vivobook-14-x1405va-2023&g2=dell-inspiron-14-plus-7440-intel-core-ultra-9-185h\">compare the Asus Vivobook 14 X1405VA 2023 (Intel Core i7-13620H) with the Dell Inspiron 14 Plus 7440</a> side by side.</p>','[{\"question\":\"What is the Asus Vivobook 14 X1405VA 2023 (Intel Core i7-13620H) price in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"The Asus Vivobook 14 X1405VA 2023 (Intel Core i7-13620H) costs Rs 1,74,900 in Nepal.\"},{\"question\":\"When did the Asus Vivobook 14 X1405VA 2023 (Intel Core i7-13620H) launch in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"It launched in Nepal in 2024.\"},{\"question\":\"Which processor does the Asus Vivobook 14 X1405VA 2023 (Intel Core i7-13620H) use?\",\"answer\":\"It uses the Intel Core i7-13620H (Intel 7), 10 cores \\/ 16 threads.\"}]','[{\"label\":\"GadgetByte Nepal \\u2013 Asus Vivobook 14 X1405VA 2023 (Intel Core i7-13620H)\",\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/www.gadgetbytenepal.com\\/product\\/asus-vivobook-14-x1405va-2023-intel-core-i7-13620h\\/\",\"accessed\":\"2026-11-23\"}]',NULL,NULL,0,'2023-12-31 18:15:00','2023-12-31 18:15:00'),(295,40,3,'Asus Vivobook 14 X1407CA 2025 (Intel Core Ultra 5 225H)','asus-vivobook-14-x1407ca-2025',NULL,'gadgets/2026/asus-vivobook-14-x1407ca-2025.webp',NULL,NULL,170905.00,NULL,0,NULL,'2025-01-01','available',NULL,0,0,'<p>The Asus Vivobook 14 X1407CA 2025 (Intel Core Ultra 5 225H) costs <strong>Rs 1,70,905</strong> in Nepal for the 16GB/512GB model. It launched in Nepal in 2025. At this price you should get a premium build, a better screen and enough memory to last years.</p>\n<p>It runs on the Intel Core Ultra 5 225H (TSMC N3B), 14 cores / 14 threads. Screen: 14 inches, IPS LCD, WUXGA (1920 x 1200 pixels), 60Hz. 16GB of memory is the right amount for a laptop you plan to keep for several years. At 1.46 kg, it is easy to carry every day. Battery: Li-Ion 42 Wh; 65W adapter.</p>\n<p>Around the same budget, also look at the <a href=\"/products/acer-nitro-v-15-2025-intel-core-5-210h-rtx-4050\">Acer Nitro V 15 ANV15-52-5302 2025 (Intel Core 5 210H)</a> (Rs 1,70,000) and the <a href=\"/products/acer-nitro-lite-16-2025-13th-gen-i7-13620h-rtx-4050-16gb-512gb\">Acer Nitro Lite 16 ANL16-51 2025 (Intel Core i7-13620H)</a> (Rs 1,69,999). You can <a href=\"/compare?category=laptop&g1=asus-vivobook-14-x1407ca-2025&g2=acer-nitro-v-15-2025-intel-core-5-210h-rtx-4050\">compare the Asus Vivobook 14 X1407CA 2025 (Intel Core Ultra 5 225H) with the Acer Nitro V 15 ANV15-52-5302 2025 (Intel Core 5 210H)</a> side by side.</p>','[{\"question\":\"What is the Asus Vivobook 14 X1407CA 2025 (Intel Core Ultra 5 225H) price in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"The Asus Vivobook 14 X1407CA 2025 (Intel Core Ultra 5 225H) costs Rs 1,70,905 in Nepal.\"},{\"question\":\"When did the Asus Vivobook 14 X1407CA 2025 (Intel Core Ultra 5 225H) launch in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"It launched in Nepal in 2025.\"},{\"question\":\"Which processor does the Asus Vivobook 14 X1407CA 2025 (Intel Core Ultra 5 225H) use?\",\"answer\":\"It uses the Intel Core Ultra 5 225H (TSMC N3B), 14 cores \\/ 14 threads.\"}]','[{\"label\":\"GadgetByte Nepal \\u2013 Asus Vivobook 14 X1407CA 2025 (Intel Core Ultra 5 225H)\",\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/www.gadgetbytenepal.com\\/product\\/asus-vivobook-14-2025-intel-core-ultra-5-225h\\/\",\"accessed\":\"2026-11-23\"}]',NULL,NULL,0,'2024-12-31 18:15:00','2024-12-31 18:15:00'),(296,40,3,'Asus Vivobook S15 S5507QA','asus-vivobook-s15-s5507qa',NULL,'gadgets/2026/asus-vivobook-s15-s5507qa.webp',NULL,NULL,142800.00,NULL,0,NULL,'2024-01-01','available',NULL,0,0,'<p>The Asus Vivobook S15 S5507QA costs <strong>Rs 1,42,800</strong> in Nepal for the Snapdragon X Plus, 16GB/1TB model. That is mainstream laptop money in Nepal: fine for office work, coding and study, with some room for light photo editing.</p>\n<p>It runs on the Qualcomm Snapdragon X Plus. The screen is a 15.6-inch 3K OLED panel. 16GB of memory is the right amount for a laptop you plan to keep for four or five years.</p>\n<p>Around the same budget, also look at the <a href=\"/products/asus-vivobook-s15-oled-x-plus-16gb-1tb-15-6-3k-oled\">Asus Vivobook S15 S5507QA-MA004W (Snapdragon X Plus)</a> (Rs 1,42,800) and the <a href=\"/products/lenovo-v15-gen-4-ryzen-5-7520u\">Lenovo V15 Gen 4 AMN (AMD Ryzen 5 7520U)</a> (Rs 1,41,900). You can <a href=\"/compare?category=laptop&g1=asus-vivobook-s15-s5507qa&g2=asus-vivobook-s15-oled-x-plus-16gb-1tb-15-6-3k-oled\">compare the Asus Vivobook S15 S5507QA with the Asus Vivobook S15 S5507QA-MA004W (Snapdragon X Plus)</a> side by side.</p>\n<p>Prices are from <a href=\"https://www.gadgetbytenepal.com/asus-laptops-price-nepal\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" target=\"_blank\">GadgetByte Nepal – ASUS laptop price list</a>, last updated 14 September 2026. Shop prices can change, so confirm with the seller before you pay.</p>','[{\"question\":\"What is the Asus Vivobook S15 S5507QA price in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"The Asus Vivobook S15 S5507QA costs Rs 1,42,800 in Nepal.\"},{\"question\":\"Which processor does the Asus Vivobook S15 S5507QA use?\",\"answer\":\"It uses the Qualcomm Snapdragon X Plus.\"}]','[{\"label\":\"GadgetByte Nepal \\u2013 ASUS laptop price list\",\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/www.gadgetbytenepal.com\\/asus-laptops-price-nepal\",\"accessed\":\"2026-09-14\"}]',NULL,NULL,0,'2026-09-13 18:15:00','2026-09-13 18:15:00'),(297,40,3,'ASUS Vivobook Go 14 E1404FA (Ryzen 3 30 / Ryzen 5 40)','asus-vivobook-go-14-e1404fa-2025',NULL,'gadgets/2026/asus-vivobook-go-14-e1404fa-2025.webp',NULL,NULL,95499.00,NULL,0,NULL,'2023-01-01','available',NULL,0,0,'<p>The Vivobook Go 14 is ASUS\'s \"go anywhere\" budget laptop. At 1.38 kg with a 14-inch Full HD screen, it\'s light enough for daily commuting, and it has a <strong>backlit keyboard</strong>, which many laptops at this price skip. ONIN Infosys sells two versions with 8GB LPDDR5 and a 512GB SSD: <strong>Ryzen 3 30 at Rs 95,499</strong>, and <strong>Ryzen 5 40 at Rs 1,08,499</strong>.</p>\n<p>The two chips are closer than the names suggest. Both have 4 cores and 8 threads. The Ryzen 5 boosts slightly higher (4.3GHz against 4.1GHz). For typing, browsing and video calls you\'ll barely notice the difference. What you are partly paying for is the package: the Ryzen 3 listing carries a <strong>2-year warranty plus a year of ASUS Perfect Warranty</strong> (accidental damage), while the Ryzen 5 listing comes with a free bag, mouse and mousepad.</p>\n<p>Elsewhere they\'re the same: a 250-nit FHD anti-glare panel, Wi-Fi 6E, a 720p camera with privacy shutter, a 42Wh battery, and USB-C, USB-A, USB 2.0 and HDMI ports. Memory is soldered at 8GB.</p>\n<p>Honestly, if you want the most laptop for the money, the larger <a href=\"/products/asus-vivobook-15-e1504fa-ryzen-5-40\">Vivobook 15 E1504FA</a> has the same Ryzen 5 40 and costs less. The Go 14 wins on portability and that backlit keyboard.</p>','[{\"question\":\"What is the ASUS Vivobook Go 14 E1404FA price in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"At ONIN Infosys it costs Rs 95,499 with Ryzen 3 30 and Rs 1,08,499 with Ryzen 5 40, both with 8GB RAM and 512GB SSD.\"},{\"question\":\"Is the Ryzen 5 40 much faster than the Ryzen 3 30?\",\"answer\":\"Only slightly. Both are 4-core, 8-thread chips, with a 4.3GHz boost on the Ryzen 5 against 4.1GHz on the Ryzen 3.\"},{\"question\":\"Does the Vivobook Go 14 have a backlit keyboard?\",\"answer\":\"Yes, both versions have a backlit chiclet keyboard.\"}]','[{\"label\":\"ONIN Infosys \\u2013 ASUS Vivobook Go 14 E1404FA (Ryzen 3 30 \\/ Ryzen 5 40)\",\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/onin.com.np\\/product\\/asus-vivobook-go-e1404-ryzen-3-30-8gb-512gb-price-nepal\",\"accessed\":\"2026-11-23\"},{\"label\":\"ONIN Infosys \\u2013 ASUS Vivobook Go 14 E1404FA (Ryzen 3 30 \\/ Ryzen 5 40) (edition=Ryzen 5 40, ram=8GB, storage=512GB)\",\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/onin.com.np\\/product\\/asus-vivobook-go-14-ryzen-5-price-in-nepal\",\"accessed\":\"2026-11-23\"},{\"label\":\"GadgetByte Nepal \\u2013 Asus Vivobook Go 14 E1404FA 2023 (Ryzen 5 7520U)\",\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/www.gadgetbytenepal.com\\/product\\/asus-vivobook-go-14-2023-ryzen-5-7520u\\/\",\"accessed\":\"2026-11-23\"}]',NULL,'https://onin.com.np/product/asus-vivobook-go-e1404-ryzen-3-30-8gb-512gb-price-nepal',0,'2022-12-31 18:15:00','2022-12-31 18:15:00'),(298,40,3,'Asus Vivobook 15 X1504VAP 2024 (Intel Core 5 120U)','asus-vivobook-15-x1504vap-2024',NULL,'gadgets/2026/asus-vivobook-15-x1504vap-2024.webp',NULL,NULL,115900.00,NULL,0,NULL,'2024-01-01','available',NULL,0,0,'<p>The Asus Vivobook 15 X1504VAP 2024 (Intel Core 5 120U) costs <strong>Rs 1,15,900</strong> in Nepal for the 8GB/512GB model. It launched in Nepal in 2024. That is mainstream money in Nepal: fine for office work, coding and study.</p>\n<p>It runs on the Intel Core 5 120U (Intel 7), 10 cores / 12 threads. Screen: 15.6 inches, IPS LCD, Full HD (1920 x 1080 pixels), 60Hz. 8GB of RAM is fine for study and office work but tight for heavy multitasking; check whether it can be upgraded. At 1.70 kg, it is fine for occasional carrying. Battery: Li-Ion 42 Wh; 45W adapter.</p>\n<p>Around the same budget, also look at the <a href=\"/products/acer-aspire-go-14-g1471m55l0-2025-intel-core-ultra-5-115u\">Acer Aspire Go 14 AG14‑71M‑55L0 2025 (Intel Core Ultra 5 115U)</a> (Rs 1,15,999) and the <a href=\"/products/acer-spin-5-2023-i5-1335u\">Acer Spin 5 A5SP14-51MTN-58HT 2023 (13th Gen i5-1335U)</a> (Rs 1,15,000). You can <a href=\"/compare?category=laptop&g1=asus-vivobook-15-x1504vap-2024&g2=acer-aspire-go-14-g1471m55l0-2025-intel-core-ultra-5-115u\">compare the Asus Vivobook 15 X1504VAP 2024 (Intel Core 5 120U) with the Acer Aspire Go 14 AG14‑71M‑55L0 2025 (Intel Core Ultra 5 115U)</a> side by side.</p>','[{\"question\":\"What is the Asus Vivobook 15 X1504VAP 2024 (Intel Core 5 120U) price in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"The Asus Vivobook 15 X1504VAP 2024 (Intel Core 5 120U) costs Rs 1,15,900 in Nepal.\"},{\"question\":\"When did the Asus Vivobook 15 X1504VAP 2024 (Intel Core 5 120U) launch in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"It launched in Nepal in 2024.\"},{\"question\":\"Which processor does the Asus Vivobook 15 X1504VAP 2024 (Intel Core 5 120U) use?\",\"answer\":\"It uses the Intel Core 5 120U (Intel 7), 10 cores \\/ 12 threads.\"}]','[{\"label\":\"GadgetByte Nepal \\u2013 Asus Vivobook 15 X1504VAP 2024 (Intel Core 5 120U)\",\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/www.gadgetbytenepal.com\\/product\\/asus-vivobook-15-2024-intel-core-5-120u\\/\",\"accessed\":\"2026-11-23\"}]',NULL,NULL,0,'2023-12-31 18:15:00','2023-12-31 18:15:00'),(299,40,3,'ASUS Vivobook 14 X1404VAP (Core 5 120U, 8GB/256GB)','asus-vivobook-14-x1404vap-2025',NULL,'gadgets/2026/asus-vivobook-14-x1404vap-2025.webp',NULL,NULL,87000.00,NULL,0,NULL,'2024-01-01','available',NULL,0,0,'<p>The Vivobook 14 X1404VAP is a simple, light laptop with one unusually smart detail for its price: the 8GB of DDR4 sits in an <strong>SO-DIMM slot</strong>, so you can drop in a bigger stick later rather than buy a new laptop. ONIN Infosys sells it in Quiet Blue for <strong>Rs 87,000</strong>.</p>\n<p>It runs Intel\'s <strong>Core 5 120U</strong>, a 10-core, 12-thread chip that turbos to 5.0GHz. That\'s plenty for Office, Google Workspace, Zoom, Canva and a busy browser. The 14-inch Full HD panel is anti-glare and TÜV Rheinland certified, and at about 1.4 kg it\'s easy to carry to campus or a co-working space. ASUS quotes up to 8 hours of battery from the 42Wh cell. Expect less if you keep brightness high.</p>\n<p>There are two compromises. The 256GB SSD fills up quickly once you install a few apps and keep your photos locally. The screen is a basic 250-nit panel, fine indoors but dim next to a sunny window. Ports cover the essentials: two USB-A 3.2, a USB-C, a USB 2.0 and HDMI. The touchpad doubles as a NumberPad.</p>\n<p>If you\'d rather have 512GB of storage and a bigger screen for similar money, see the <a href=\"/products/asus-vivobook-15-e1504fa-ryzen-5-40\">Vivobook 15 E1504FA</a>.</p>','[{\"question\":\"What is the ASUS Vivobook 14 X1404VAP price in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"ONIN Infosys sells the Vivobook 14 X1404VAP with Core 5 120U, 8GB DDR4 and 256GB SSD for Rs 87,000 with a one-year warranty.\"},{\"question\":\"Can I upgrade the RAM on the Vivobook 14 X1404VAP?\",\"answer\":\"Yes. The memory is in an SO-DIMM slot, so it can be replaced with a larger module.\"},{\"question\":\"How long does the battery last?\",\"answer\":\"ASUS rates the 42Wh battery at up to about 8 hours of light use.\"}]','[{\"label\":\"ONIN Infosys \\u2013 ASUS Vivobook 14 X1404VAP (Core 5 120U, 8GB\\/256GB)\",\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/onin.com.np\\/product\\/asus-vivobook-14-x1404vap-core-5-120u-price-in-nepal\",\"accessed\":\"2026-11-23\"},{\"label\":\"GadgetByte Nepal \\u2013 Asus Vivobook 14 X1404VAP 2025 (Intel Core 5 120U)\",\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/www.gadgetbytenepal.com\\/product\\/asus-vivobook-14-x1404vap-2025-intel-core-5-120u-8gb-512gb-14-fhd-ips\\/\",\"accessed\":\"2026-11-23\"}]',NULL,'https://onin.com.np/product/asus-vivobook-14-x1404vap-core-5-120u-price-in-nepal',0,'2023-12-31 18:15:00','2023-12-31 18:15:00'),(300,40,3,'Asus Vivobook 14 X1405VAP 2024 (Intel Core 5 120U)','asus-vivobook-14-x1405vap-2024',NULL,'gadgets/2026/asus-vivobook-14-x1405vap-2024.webp',NULL,NULL,93000.00,NULL,0,NULL,'2024-01-01','available',NULL,0,0,'<p>The Asus Vivobook 14 X1405VAP 2024 (Intel Core 5 120U) costs <strong>Rs 93,000</strong> in Nepal for the 8GB/512GB model. It launched in Nepal in 2024. That is mainstream money in Nepal: fine for office work, coding and study.</p>\n<p>It runs on the Intel Core 5 120U (Intel 7), 10 cores / 12 threads. Screen: 14 inches, IPS LCD, WUXGA (1920 x 1200 pixels), 60Hz. 8GB of RAM is fine for study and office work but tight for heavy multitasking; check whether it can be upgraded. At 1.6 kg, it is fine for occasional carrying. Battery: Li-Ion 42 Wh; 45W adapter.</p>\n<p>Around the same budget, also look at the <a href=\"/products/msi-modern-14-2024-intel-core-7-150u\">MSI Modern 14 F1MG 2024</a> (Rs 93,000) and the <a href=\"/products/asus-vivobook-go-e1504-2025-ryzen-3-30\">Asus Vivobook Go E1504 2025 (Ryzen 3 30)</a> (Rs 93,900). You can <a href=\"/compare?category=laptop&g1=asus-vivobook-14-x1405vap-2024&g2=msi-modern-14-2024-intel-core-7-150u\">compare the Asus Vivobook 14 X1405VAP 2024 (Intel Core 5 120U) with the MSI Modern 14 F1MG 2024</a> side by side.</p>','[{\"question\":\"What is the Asus Vivobook 14 X1405VAP 2024 (Intel Core 5 120U) price in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"The Asus Vivobook 14 X1405VAP 2024 (Intel Core 5 120U) costs Rs 93,000 in Nepal.\"},{\"question\":\"When did the Asus Vivobook 14 X1405VAP 2024 (Intel Core 5 120U) launch in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"It launched in Nepal in 2024.\"},{\"question\":\"Which processor does the Asus Vivobook 14 X1405VAP 2024 (Intel Core 5 120U) use?\",\"answer\":\"It uses the Intel Core 5 120U (Intel 7), 10 cores \\/ 12 threads.\"}]','[{\"label\":\"GadgetByte Nepal \\u2013 Asus Vivobook 14 X1405VAP 2024 (Intel Core 5 120U)\",\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/www.gadgetbytenepal.com\\/product\\/asus-vivobook-14-2024-intel-core-5-120u\\/\",\"accessed\":\"2026-11-23\"}]',NULL,NULL,0,'2023-12-31 18:15:00','2023-12-31 18:15:00'),(301,40,3,'Asus Zenbook 14 OLED Q415','asus-zenbook-14-oled-q415',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,89999.00,NULL,0,NULL,'2024-01-01','available',NULL,0,0,'<p>The Asus Zenbook 14 OLED Q415 costs <strong>Rs 89,999</strong> in Nepal for the Intel Core Ultra 5 125H, 8GB/512GB model. That is mainstream laptop money in Nepal: fine for office work, coding and study, with some room for light photo editing.</p>\n<p>It runs on the Intel Core Ultra 5 125H. The screen is a 14-inch FHD OLED, 60Hz panel. 8GB of RAM is enough for study and office work, but it will feel tight with many browser tabs open, so look for a model with a free slot or step up to 16GB if you can.</p>\n<p>Around the same budget, also look at the <a href=\"/products/asus-zenbook-14-oled-q415-core-ultra-5-125h-8gb\">Asus Zenbook 14 OLED Q415 Core Ultra 5 125H, 8GB, 512GB, 14\" FHD, 60Hz OLED</a> (Rs 89,999) and the <a href=\"/products/hp-15-fc0043nq-2024\">HP 15-FC0043NQ 2024 (AMD Ryzen 5 7520U)</a> (Rs 90,999). You can <a href=\"/compare?category=laptop&g1=asus-zenbook-14-oled-q415&g2=asus-zenbook-14-oled-q415-core-ultra-5-125h-8gb\">compare the Asus Zenbook 14 OLED Q415 with the Asus Zenbook 14 OLED Q415 Core Ultra 5 125H, 8GB, 512GB, 14\" FHD, 60Hz OLED</a> side by side.</p>\n<p>Prices are from <a href=\"https://www.gadgetbytenepal.com/asus-laptops-price-nepal\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" target=\"_blank\">GadgetByte Nepal – ASUS laptop price list</a>, last updated 14 September 2026. Shop prices can change, so confirm with the seller before you pay.</p>','[{\"question\":\"What is the Asus Zenbook 14 OLED Q415 price in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"The Asus Zenbook 14 OLED Q415 costs Rs 89,999 in Nepal.\"},{\"question\":\"Which processor does the Asus Zenbook 14 OLED Q415 use?\",\"answer\":\"It uses the Intel Core Ultra 5 125H.\"}]','[{\"label\":\"GadgetByte Nepal \\u2013 ASUS laptop price list\",\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/www.gadgetbytenepal.com\\/asus-laptops-price-nepal\",\"accessed\":\"2026-09-14\"}]',NULL,NULL,0,'2026-09-13 18:15:00','2026-09-13 18:15:00'),(302,40,3,'Asus Vivobook 15X OLED X1503ZA 2022 (Intel Core i3-1220P)','asus-vivobook-15x-oled-x1503za-2022',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,83900.00,NULL,0,NULL,'2022-01-01','available',NULL,0,0,'<p>The Asus Vivobook 15X OLED X1503ZA 2022 (Intel Core i3-1220P) costs <strong>Rs 83,900</strong> in Nepal for the 8GB/256GB model. It launched in Nepal in 2022. That is mainstream money in Nepal: fine for office work, coding and study.</p>\n<p>It runs on the Intel Core i3-1220P (Intel 7), 10 cores / 12 threads. Screen: 15.6 inches, OLED, Full HD (1920 x 1080 pixels), 60Hz. 8GB of RAM is fine for study and office work but tight for heavy multitasking; check whether it can be upgraded. At 1.70 kg, it is fine for occasional carrying. Battery: Li-Ion 70 Wh; 90W Adapter.</p>\n<p>Around the same budget, also look at the <a href=\"/products/lenovo-v15-g4-iru-2023\">Lenovo V15 G4 IRU 2023 (Intel i3-1315U)</a> (Rs 84,000) and the <a href=\"/products/lenovo-ideapad-slim-3-15iru8-intel-core-i3-1315u\">Lenovo IdeaPad Slim 3 15IRU8 (Intel Core i3-1315U)</a> (Rs 81,999). You can <a href=\"/compare?category=laptop&g1=asus-vivobook-15x-oled-x1503za-2022&g2=lenovo-v15-g4-iru-2023\">compare the Asus Vivobook 15X OLED X1503ZA 2022 (Intel Core i3-1220P) with the Lenovo V15 G4 IRU 2023 (Intel i3-1315U)</a> side by side.</p>','[{\"question\":\"What is the Asus Vivobook 15X OLED X1503ZA 2022 (Intel Core i3-1220P) price in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"The Asus Vivobook 15X OLED X1503ZA 2022 (Intel Core i3-1220P) costs Rs 83,900 in Nepal.\"},{\"question\":\"When did the Asus Vivobook 15X OLED X1503ZA 2022 (Intel Core i3-1220P) launch in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"It launched in Nepal in 2022.\"},{\"question\":\"Which processor does the Asus Vivobook 15X OLED X1503ZA 2022 (Intel Core i3-1220P) use?\",\"answer\":\"It uses the Intel Core i3-1220P (Intel 7), 10 cores \\/ 12 threads.\"}]','[{\"label\":\"GadgetByte Nepal \\u2013 Asus Vivobook 15X OLED X1503ZA 2022 (Intel Core i3-1220P)\",\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/www.gadgetbytenepal.com\\/product\\/asus-vivobook-15x-oled-2022-i3-1220p\\/\",\"accessed\":\"2026-11-23\"}]',NULL,NULL,0,'2021-12-31 18:15:00','2021-12-31 18:15:00'),(303,40,3,'Asus Vivobook Go 15 E1504GA 2023 (Intel Core i3-N305)','asus-vivobook-go-15-e1504ga-2023',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,74999.00,NULL,0,NULL,'2026-01-01','available',NULL,0,0,'<p>The Asus Vivobook Go 15 E1504GA 2023 (Intel Core i3-N305) costs <strong>Rs 74,999</strong> in Nepal for the 8GB/256GB model. It launched in Nepal in 2026. It is built for documents, browsing, online classes and video calls rather than editing or gaming.</p>\n<p>It runs on the Intel Core i3-N305 (Intel 7), 8 cores / 8 threads. Screen: 15.6 inches, IPS LCD, Full HD (1920 x 1080), 60Hz. 8GB of RAM is fine for study and office work but tight for heavy multitasking; check whether it can be upgraded. At 1.63 kg, it is fine for occasional carrying. Battery: Li-Ion 42 Wh; 45W adapter.</p>\n<p>Around the same budget, also look at the <a href=\"/products/acer-aspire-go-15-ag15-21pt-2024-ryzen-5-7520u\">Acer Aspire Go 15 AG15-21PT 2024 (Ryzen 5 7520U)</a> (Rs 76,000) and the <a href=\"/products/acer-aspire-go-15-ag15-32p-39r2-2025-intel-core-3-n355-8gb-256gb-156-fhd\">Acer Aspire Go 15 AG15-32P-39R2 2025 (Intel Core 3 N355)</a> (Rs 72,990). You can <a href=\