5-ag15-32p-39r2-2025-intel-core-3-n355-8gb-256gb-156-fhd\">Acer Aspire Go 15 AG15-32P-39R2 2025 (Intel Core 3 N355)</a> (Rs 72,990) and the <a href=\"/products/asus-vivobook-go-15-e1504ga-2023\">Asus Vivobook Go 15 E1504GA 2023 (Intel Core i3-N305)</a> (Rs 74,999). You can <a href=\"/compare?category=laptop&g1=asus-vivobook-14-x1404va-2023&g2=acer-aspire-go-15-ag15-32p-39r2-2025-intel-core-3-n355-8gb-256gb-156-fhd\">compare the Asus Vivobook 14 X1404VA 2023 (Intel Core i3-1315U) with the Acer Aspire Go 15 AG15-32P-39R2 2025 (Intel Core 3 N355)</a> side by side.</p>','[{\"question\":\"What is the Asus Vivobook 14 X1404VA 2023 (Intel Core i3-1315U) price in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"The Asus Vivobook 14 X1404VA 2023 (Intel Core i3-1315U) costs Rs 70,999 in Nepal.\"},{\"question\":\"When did the Asus Vivobook 14 X1404VA 2023 (Intel Core i3-1315U) launch in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"It launched in Nepal in 2025.\"},{\"question\":\"Which processor does the Asus Vivobook 14 X1404VA 2023 (Intel Core i3-1315U) use?\",\"answer\":\"It uses the Intel Core i3-1315U (Intel 7), 6 cores \\/ 8 threads.\"}]','[{\"label\":\"GadgetByte Nepal \\u2013 Asus Vivobook 14 X1404VA 2023 (Intel Core i3-1315U)\",\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/www.gadgetbytenepal.com\\/product\\/asus-vivobook-14-x1404va-2023-intel-core-i3-1315u\\/\",\"accessed\":\"2026-11-23\"}]',NULL,NULL,0,'2024-12-31 18:15:00','2024-12-31 18:15:00'),(305,40,3,'Asus Zenbook S 14 OLED UX5406SA 2024 (Intel Core Ultra 7 256V)','asus-zenbook-s-14-oled-ux5406sa-2024',NULL,'gadgets/2026/asus-zenbook-s-14-oled-ux5406sa-2024.webp',NULL,NULL,325755.00,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,'available',NULL,0,0,'<p>The Asus Zenbook S 14 OLED UX5406SA 2024 (Intel Core Ultra 7 256V) costs <strong>Rs 3,25,755</strong> in Nepal for the 16GB/1TB model. This is high-end territory, aimed at heavy gaming, 3D work or video editing.</p>\n<p>It runs on the Intel Core Ultra 7 258V, 8 cores / 8 threads. Screen: 14 inches, OLED, 16:10 aspect ratio, 120Hz, 500 nits (HDR peak brightness). 16GB of memory is the right amount for a laptop you plan to keep for several years. At 1.20kg, it is easy to carry every day. Battery: 73 Wh; 65W AC Adapter (Type-C).</p>\n<p>Around the same budget, also look at the <a href=\"/products/lenovo-thinkpad-x13-gen-6-2025\">Lenovo ThinkPad X13 Gen 6 2025 (Intel Core Ultra 7 255H)</a> (Rs 3,24,999) and the <a href=\"/products/asus-rog-strix-g18-g815lm-2025-core-ultra-9-275hx-rtx-5060\">Asus ROG Strix G18 G815LM 2025 (Intel Core Ultra 9 275HX)</a> (Rs 3,29,999). You can <a href=\"/compare?category=laptop&g1=asus-zenbook-s-14-oled-ux5406sa-2024&g2=lenovo-thinkpad-x13-gen-6-2025\">compare the Asus Zenbook S 14 OLED UX5406SA 2024 (Intel Core Ultra 7 256V) with the Lenovo ThinkPad X13 Gen 6 2025 (Intel Core Ultra 7 255H)</a> side by side.</p>','[{\"question\":\"What is the Asus Zenbook S 14 OLED UX5406SA 2024 (Intel Core Ultra 7 256V) price in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"The Asus Zenbook S 14 OLED UX5406SA 2024 (Intel Core Ultra 7 256V) costs Rs 3,25,755 in Nepal.\"},{\"question\":\"Which processor does the Asus Zenbook S 14 OLED UX5406SA 2024 (Intel Core Ultra 7 256V) use?\",\"answer\":\"It uses the Intel Core Ultra 7 258V, 8 cores \\/ 8 threads.\"}]','[{\"label\":\"GadgetByte Nepal \\u2013 Asus Zenbook S 14 OLED UX5406SA 2024 (Intel Core Ultra 7 256V)\",\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/www.gadgetbytenepal.com\\/product\\/asus-zenbook-s-14-oled-2024-intel-core-ultra-7-256v\\/\",\"accessed\":\"2026-11-23\"}]',NULL,NULL,0,'2026-11-22 18:15:00','2026-11-22 18:15:00'),(306,40,3,'ASUS Zenbook 14 OLED UX3405CA (Core Ultra 7 255H)','asus-zenbook-14-oled-ux3405ca-2025',NULL,'gadgets/2026/asus-zenbook-14-oled-ux3405ca-2025.webp',NULL,NULL,275999.00,NULL,0,NULL,'2025-01-01','available',NULL,0,0,'<p>If someone asks us for a Windows alternative to the MacBook Air, the Zenbook 14 OLED UX3405CA is usually the answer. It weighs 1.28 kg, has a 75Wh battery and two <strong>Thunderbolt 4</strong> ports, and runs Intel\'s 16-core <strong>Core Ultra 7 255H</strong> with <strong>Arc 140T</strong> graphics. That\'s one of the fastest integrated GPUs you can get, with AV1 encode and decode for video work.</p>\n<p>ONIN Infosys lists two versions, and the pricing is a little odd. Read before you choose:</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>3K (2880 × 1800) 120Hz OLED touchscreen with a 1TB SSD: Rs 2,75,999.</strong> This is the one to buy. It has the sharper, smoother screen and twice the storage.</li>\n<li><strong>WUXGA (1920 × 1200) 60Hz OLED with a 512GB SSD: Rs 2,76,499.</strong> It costs slightly more for a lesser configuration. It only makes sense if the 3K model is out of stock.</li>\n</ul>\n<p>Both have 16GB of LPDDR5X, <strong>Wi-Fi 7</strong>, Bluetooth 5.4, an IR webcam with a privacy shutter, USB-A, HDMI 2.1, a backlit keyboard with a NumberPad touchpad, and 2 years of international warranty plus a year of ASUS Perfect Warranty. The OLED panels cover 100% DCI-P3 with True Black 500 HDR.</p>\n<p>For the same CPU with a plain IPS screen and a smaller budget, see the <a href=\"/products/asus-vivobook-s14-s3407ca-core-ultra-7-255h\">Vivobook S14 S3407CA</a>. For an AMD alternative with a touchscreen, see the <a href=\"/products/asus-zenbook-14-oled-um3406ga\">Zenbook 14 OLED UM3406GA</a>.</p>','[{\"question\":\"What is the ASUS Zenbook 14 OLED UX3405CA price in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"At ONIN Infosys, the Core Ultra 7 255H model costs Rs 2,75,999 with a 3K 120Hz OLED touchscreen and 1TB SSD, or Rs 2,76,499 with a WUXGA 60Hz OLED and 512GB SSD.\"},{\"question\":\"Which Zenbook 14 OLED UX3405CA version should I buy?\",\"answer\":\"The 3K 120Hz version with 1TB. It is the better configuration and, at ONIN\'s current prices, slightly cheaper.\"},{\"question\":\"Does the Zenbook 14 OLED UX3405CA have Wi-Fi 7?\",\"answer\":\"Yes. It supports Wi-Fi 7 (802.11be) and Bluetooth 5.4.\"}]','[{\"label\":\"ONIN Infosys \\u2013 ASUS Zenbook 14 OLED UX3405CA (Core Ultra 7 255H)\",\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/onin.com.np\\/product\\/asus-zenbook-14-oled-ux3405ca-ultra-7-255h-price-nepal\",\"accessed\":\"2026-11-23\"},{\"label\":\"ONIN Infosys \\u2013 ASUS Zenbook 14 OLED UX3405CA (Core Ultra 7 255H) (edition=FHD+ 60Hz OLED, ram=16GB, storage=512GB)\",\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/onin.com.np\\/product\\/asus-zenbook-14-oled-ux3405ca-core-ultra-7-255h-nepal\",\"accessed\":\"2026-11-23\"},{\"label\":\"GadgetByte Nepal \\u2013 Asus Zenbook 14 OLED UX3405CA 2025 (Intel Core Ultra 7 255H)\",\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/www.gadgetbytenepal.com\\/product\\/asus-zenbook-14-oled-intel-core-ultra-7-255h-16gb-1tb-14-inch-oled\\/\",\"accessed\":\"2026-11-23\"}]',NULL,'https://onin.com.np/product/asus-zenbook-14-oled-ux3405ca-ultra-7-255h-price-nepal',0,'2024-12-31 18:15:00','2024-12-31 18:15:00'),(307,40,3,'Asus Zenbook 14 OLED UM3406KA 2025 (Ryzen AI 5 340)','asus-zenbook-14-oled-um3406ka-2025',NULL,'gadgets/2026/asus-zenbook-14-oled-um3406ka-2025.webp',NULL,NULL,0.00,NULL,0,'Rs 2,18,900 last listed price in Nepal','2025-01-01','discontinued',NULL,0,0,'<p>The Asus Zenbook 14 OLED UM3406KA 2025 (Ryzen AI 5 340) is no longer stocked in Nepal. Its last listed price was <strong>Rs 2,18,900</strong>. It launched in Nepal in 2025. We keep the full specs here for reference and for anyone checking a second-hand unit.</p>\n<p>It runs on the AMD Ryzen AI 5 340 (4nm), 6 cores / 12 threads. Screen: 14 inches, OLED, 3K (2880 x 1800 pixels), 120Hz. 16GB of memory is the right amount for a laptop you plan to keep for several years. At 1.2 kg, it is easy to carry every day. Battery: Li-Ion 75 Wh; 65W adapter.</p>\n<p>Buying new instead? A current ASUS alternative is the <a href=\"/products/asus-vivobook-s15-2025-ryzen-ai-9-hx-370\">Asus Vivobook S 15 M5506WA 2025 (Ryzen AI 9 HX 370)</a> (Rs 2,19,999).</p>','[{\"question\":\"Is the Asus Zenbook 14 OLED UM3406KA 2025 (Ryzen AI 5 340) still available in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"No, it is no longer stocked. Its last listed price was Rs 2,18,900.\"},{\"question\":\"When did the Asus Zenbook 14 OLED UM3406KA 2025 (Ryzen AI 5 340) launch in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"It launched in Nepal in 2025.\"},{\"question\":\"Which processor does the Asus Zenbook 14 OLED UM3406KA 2025 (Ryzen AI 5 340) use?\",\"answer\":\"It uses the AMD Ryzen AI 5 340 (4nm), 6 cores \\/ 12 threads.\"}]','[{\"label\":\"GadgetByte Nepal \\u2013 Asus Zenbook 14 OLED UM3406KA 2025 (Ryzen AI 5 340)\",\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/www.gadgetbytenepal.com\\/product\\/asus-zenbook-14-oled-um3406ka-2025-ryzen-ai-5-340-16gb-512gb-14-3k-oled\\/\",\"accessed\":\"2026-11-23\"}]',NULL,NULL,0,'2024-12-31 18:15:00','2024-12-31 18:15:00'),(308,40,3,'Asus Zenbook S 16 UM5606GA 2026 (Ryzen 7 445)','asus-zenbook-s-16-um5606ga-2026',NULL,'gadgets/2026/asus-zenbook-s-16-um5606ga-2026.webp',NULL,NULL,275499.00,NULL,0,NULL,'2026-01-01','available',NULL,0,0,'<p>The Asus Zenbook S 16 UM5606GA 2026 (Ryzen 7 445) costs <strong>Rs 2,75,499</strong> in Nepal for the 16GB/1TB model. It launched in Nepal in 2026. At this price you should get a premium build, a better screen and enough memory to last years.</p>\n<p>It runs on the AMD Ryzen AI 7 445 (4nm), 6 cores / 12 threads. Screen: 16 inches, OLED, 3K (2880 x 1800 pixels), 120Hz. 16GB of memory is the right amount for a laptop you plan to keep for several years. At 1.5 kg, it is fine for occasional carrying. Battery: Li-Ion 83 Wh; 68W adapter.</p>\n<p>Around the same budget, also look at the <a href=\"/products/lenovo-thinkpad-x9-14-gen-1-2025-intel-core-ultra-7-258v\">Lenovo ThinkPad X9-14 Gen 1 2025 (Intel Core Ultra 7 258V)</a> (Rs 2,78,999) and the <a href=\"/products/dell-14-premium-2025-intel-core-ultra-7-255h\">Dell 14 Premium DA14250 2025 (Intel Core Ultra 7 255H)</a> (Rs 2,80,000). You can <a href=\"/compare?category=laptop&g1=asus-zenbook-s-16-um5606ga-2026&g2=lenovo-thinkpad-x9-14-gen-1-2025-intel-core-ultra-7-258v\">compare the Asus Zenbook S 16 UM5606GA 2026 (Ryzen 7 445) with the Lenovo ThinkPad X9-14 Gen 1 2025 (Intel Core Ultra 7 258V)</a> side by side.</p>','[{\"question\":\"What is the Asus Zenbook S 16 UM5606GA 2026 (Ryzen 7 445) price in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"The Asus Zenbook S 16 UM5606GA 2026 (Ryzen 7 445) costs Rs 2,75,499 in Nepal.\"},{\"question\":\"When did the Asus Zenbook S 16 UM5606GA 2026 (Ryzen 7 445) launch in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"It launched in Nepal in 2026.\"},{\"question\":\"Which processor does the Asus Zenbook S 16 UM5606GA 2026 (Ryzen 7 445) use?\",\"answer\":\"It uses the AMD Ryzen AI 7 445 (4nm), 6 cores \\/ 12 threads.\"}]','[{\"label\":\"GadgetByte Nepal \\u2013 Asus Zenbook S 16 UM5606GA 2026 (Ryzen 7 445)\",\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/www.gadgetbytenepal.com\\/product\\/asus-zenbook-s-16-um5606ga-2026-ryzen-7-445\\/\",\"accessed\":\"2026-11-23\"}]',NULL,NULL,0,'2025-12-31 18:15:00','2025-12-31 18:15:00'),(309,40,3,'Asus Zenbook 14 OLED UM3405GA 2026 (Ryzen AI 9 465)','asus-zenbook-14-oled-um3405ga-2026',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,239999.00,NULL,0,NULL,'2026-01-01','available',NULL,0,0,'<p>The Asus Zenbook 14 OLED UM3405GA 2026 (Ryzen AI 9 465) costs <strong>Rs 2,39,999</strong> in Nepal for the 16GB/512GB model. It launched in Nepal in 2026. At this price you should get a premium build, a better screen and enough memory to last years.</p>\n<p>It runs on the AMD Ryzen AI 9 465 (4nm), 10 cores / 20 threads. Screen: 14 inches, OLED, FHD+ (1920 x 1200 pixels), 60Hz. 16GB of memory is the right amount for a laptop you plan to keep for several years. At 1.20 kg, it is easy to carry every day. Battery: Li-Ion 75 Wh; 68W adapter.</p>\n<p>Around the same budget, also look at the <a href=\"/products/dell-xps-13-9350-2024-intel-core-ultra-7-256v-16gb-512gb-134-fhd\">Dell XPS 13 9350 2024</a> (Rs 2,39,999) and the <a href=\"/products/lenovo-thinkpad-e16-gen-3-2025-intel-core-ultra-7-256v\">Lenovo ThinkPad E16 Gen 3 2025 (Intel Core Ultra 7 256V)</a> (Rs 2,38,450). You can <a href=\"/compare?category=laptop&g1=asus-zenbook-14-oled-um3405ga-2026&g2=dell-xps-13-9350-2024-intel-core-ultra-7-256v-16gb-512gb-134-fhd\">compare the Asus Zenbook 14 OLED UM3405GA 2026 (Ryzen AI 9 465) with the Dell XPS 13 9350 2024</a> side by side.</p>','[{\"question\":\"What is the Asus Zenbook 14 OLED UM3405GA 2026 (Ryzen AI 9 465) price in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"The Asus Zenbook 14 OLED UM3405GA 2026 (Ryzen AI 9 465) costs Rs 2,39,999 in Nepal.\"},{\"question\":\"When did the Asus Zenbook 14 OLED UM3405GA 2026 (Ryzen AI 9 465) launch in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"It launched in Nepal in 2026.\"},{\"question\":\"Which processor does the Asus Zenbook 14 OLED UM3405GA 2026 (Ryzen AI 9 465) use?\",\"answer\":\"It uses the AMD Ryzen AI 9 465 (4nm), 10 cores \\/ 20 threads.\"}]','[{\"label\":\"GadgetByte Nepal \\u2013 Asus Zenbook 14 OLED UM3405GA 2026 (Ryzen AI 9 465)\",\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/www.gadgetbytenepal.com\\/product\\/asus-zenbook-14-oled-um3405ga-2026-ryzen-ai-9-465\\/\",\"accessed\":\"2026-11-23\"}]',NULL,NULL,0,'2025-12-31 18:15:00','2025-12-31 18:15:00'),(310,40,3,'Asus ProArt P16 H7606WX (2025)','asus-proart-p16-h7606wx-2025',NULL,'gadgets/2026/asus-proart-p16-h7606wx-2025.webp',NULL,NULL,831249.00,NULL,0,NULL,'2025-01-01','available',NULL,0,0,'<p>The Asus ProArt P16 H7606WX (2025) costs <strong>Rs 8,31,249</strong> in Nepal for the Ryzen AI 9 370 · RTX 5090, 64GB/2TB model. With a dedicated NVIDIA GPU, this is built for gaming and creative apps first.</p>\n<p>It runs on the AMD Ryzen AI 9 370 with NVIDIA GeForce RTX 5090 graphics. The screen is a 16-inch 4K OLED panel. 32GB or more of memory gives plenty of headroom for editing, virtual machines and big projects. That is as fast as laptop graphics get, with power to spare for high-refresh 1440p gaming and GPU rendering.</p>\n<p>Around the same budget, also look at the <a href=\"/products/apple-macbook-pro-16-inch-m5-max-2026\">Apple MacBook Pro 16-inch M5 Max (2026)</a> (Rs 8,33,000) and the <a href=\"/products/apple-macbook-pro-14-inch-m5-max-2026\">Apple MacBook Pro 14-inch M5 Max (2026)</a> (Rs 7,76,500). You can <a href=\"/compare?category=laptop&g1=asus-proart-p16-h7606wx-2025&g2=apple-macbook-pro-16-inch-m5-max-2026\">compare the Asus ProArt P16 H7606WX (2025) with the Apple MacBook Pro 16-inch M5 Max (2026)</a> side by side.</p>\n<p>Prices are from <a href=\"https://www.gadgetbytenepal.com/asus-laptops-price-nepal\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" target=\"_blank\">GadgetByte Nepal – ASUS laptop price list</a>, last updated 14 September 2026. Shop prices can change, so confirm with the seller before you pay.</p>','[{\"question\":\"What is the Asus ProArt P16 H7606WX (2025) price in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"The Asus ProArt P16 H7606WX (2025) costs Rs 8,31,249 in Nepal.\"},{\"question\":\"Which processor does the Asus ProArt P16 H7606WX (2025) use?\",\"answer\":\"It uses the AMD Ryzen AI 9 370.\"},{\"question\":\"Is the Asus ProArt P16 H7606WX (2025) good for gaming?\",\"answer\":\"Yes. It has NVIDIA GeForce RTX 5090 graphics, so it is built for gaming as well as everyday work.\"}]','[{\"label\":\"GadgetByte Nepal \\u2013 ASUS laptop price list\",\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/www.gadgetbytenepal.com\\/asus-laptops-price-nepal\",\"accessed\":\"2026-09-14\"}]',NULL,NULL,0,'2026-09-13 18:15:00','2026-09-13 18:15:00'),(311,40,3,'Asus TUF Gaming F16 FX608JMR (2025)','asus-tuf-gaming-f16-fx608jmr-2025',NULL,'gadgets/2026/asus-tuf-gaming-f16-fx608jmr-2025.webp',NULL,NULL,291649.00,NULL,0,NULL,'2025-01-01','available',NULL,0,0,'<p>The Asus TUF Gaming F16 FX608JMR (2025) costs <strong>Rs 2,91,649</strong> in Nepal for the Core i7-14650HX · RTX 5050, 16GB/512GB model. The top Core i7-14650HX · RTX 5060, 16GB/512GB version costs Rs 3,52,900. With a dedicated NVIDIA GPU, this is built for gaming and creative apps first.</p>\n<p>It runs on the Intel Core i7-14650HX with NVIDIA GeForce RTX 5050 or RTX 5060 (8GB) graphics. The screen is a 16-inch WUXGA, 165Hz panel. 16GB of memory is the right amount for a laptop you plan to keep for four or five years. That GPU handles esports titles and most current games at 1080p with medium settings.</p>\n<p>Around the sam