 1,83,999 in Nepal.\"},{\"question\":\"Which processor does the Asus TUF Gaming A16 FA607NUQ (2026) use?\",\"answer\":\"It uses the AMD Ryzen 7 170.\"},{\"question\":\"Is the Asus TUF Gaming A16 FA607NUQ (2026) good for gaming?\",\"answer\":\"Yes. It has NVIDIA GeForce RTX 4050 graphics, so it is built for gaming as well as everyday work.\"}]','[{\"label\":\"GadgetByte Nepal \\u2013 ASUS laptop price list\",\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/www.gadgetbytenepal.com\\/asus-laptops-price-nepal\",\"accessed\":\"2026-09-14\"}]',NULL,NULL,0,'2026-09-13 18:15:00','2026-09-13 18:15:00'),(314,40,3,'Asus TUF Gaming A15 FA506NCG 2024 (Ryzen 7 7445HS)','asus-tuf-gaming-a15-fa506ncg-2024',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,155999.00,NULL,0,NULL,'2026-02-10','available',NULL,0,0,'<p>The Asus TUF Gaming A15 FA506NCG 2024 (Ryzen 7 7445HS) costs <strong>Rs 1,55,999</strong> in Nepal for the 16GB/512GB model. It launched in Nepal on 10 February 2026. At this price you should get a premium build, a better screen and enough memory to last years.</p>\n<p>It runs on the AMD Ryzen 7 7445HS (4nm), 6 cores / 12 threads. Screen: 15.6 inches, IPS LCD, FHD (1920 x 1080 pixels), 144Hz. 16GB of memory is the right amount for a laptop you plan to keep for several years. At 2.3 kg, it is best kept on a desk. Battery: Li-Ion 48 Wh; 180W adapter.</p>\n<p>Around the same budget, also look at the <a href=\"/products/acer-aspire-7-a715-59g-76rm-2026-intel-core-7-240h-rtx-3050\">Acer Aspire 7 A715-59G-76RM 2026 (Intel Core 7 240H)</a> (Rs 1,54,999) and the <a href=\"/products/lenovo-ideapad-5-2-in-1-16ial10-2025-intel-core-ultra-7-255u-16gb-1tb-16-wuxga-ips-touch\">Lenovo IdeaPad 5 2-in-1 16IAL10 2025 (Intel Core Ultra 7 255U)</a> (Rs 1,54,999). You can <a href=\"/compare?category=laptop&g1=asus-tuf-gaming-a15-fa506ncg-2024&g2=acer-aspire-7-a715-59g-76rm-2026-intel-core-7-240h-rtx-3050\">compare the Asus TUF Gaming A15 FA506NCG 2024 (Ryzen 7 7445HS) with the Acer Aspire 7 A715-59G-76RM 2026 (Intel Core 7 240H)</a> side by side.</p>','[{\"question\":\"What is the Asus TUF Gaming A15 FA506NCG 2024 (Ryzen 7 7445HS) price in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"The Asus TUF Gaming A15 FA506NCG 2024 (Ryzen 7 7445HS) costs Rs 1,55,999 in Nepal.\"},{\"question\":\"When did the Asus TUF Gaming A15 FA506NCG 2024 (Ryzen 7 7445HS) launch in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"It launched in Nepal on 10 February 2026.\"},{\"question\":\"Which processor does the Asus TUF Gaming A15 FA506NCG 2024 (Ryzen 7 7445HS) use?\",\"answer\":\"It uses the AMD Ryzen 7 7445HS (4nm), 6 cores \\/ 12 threads.\"}]','[{\"label\":\"GadgetByte Nepal \\u2013 Asus TUF Gaming A15 FA506NCG 2024 (Ryzen 7 7445HS)\",\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/www.gadgetbytenepal.com\\/product\\/asus-tuf-gaming-a15-2024-ryzen-7-7445hs-rtx-3050\\/\",\"accessed\":\"2026-11-23\"}]',NULL,NULL,0,'2026-02-09 18:15:00','2026-02-09 18:15:00'),(315,40,3,'ASUS ROG Zephyrus Duo G16 GX651AX (Core Ultra 9 386H, RTX 5090)','asus-rog-zephyrus-duo-gx651ax-2026',NULL,'gadgets/2026/asus-rog-zephyrus-duo-gx651ax-2026.webp',NULL,NULL,1338900.00,NULL,0,NULL,'2026-01-01','available',NULL,0,0,'<p>The Zephyrus Duo is not a normal laptop, and it isn\'t priced like one. It has <strong>two 16-inch 3K OLED touchscreens</strong>. You can use them stacked, side by side, or with a detachable keyboard in front. ONIN Infosys sells the GX651AX for <strong>Rs 13,38,900</strong>, with an ROG backpack and mouse, 2 years of warranty and a year of ASUS Perfect Warranty.</p>\n<p>Who is this for? Video editors who want a timeline on one screen and a preview on the other, traders and analysts watching many charts, streamers running OBS and chat alongside a game, and developers who live in split windows. Both panels are 2880 × 1800 OLED at 120Hz with 100% DCI-P3, Pantone validation and stylus support.</p>\n<p>The hardware is flagship-level. It has Intel\'s <strong>Core Ultra 9 386H</strong> with a 50 TOPS NPU, an <strong>RTX 5090 Laptop GPU with 24GB</strong>, <strong>64GB of LPDDR5X-8533</strong> and a 1TB SSD. Connectivity includes two Thunderbolt 4 ports, HDMI 2.1, two USB-A, a UHS-II SD card reader, Wi-Fi 7 and Bluetooth 6.0. The 90Wh battery won\'t go far with two OLEDs and an RTX 5090. It weighs 2.82 kg.</p>\n<p>If you only need one great screen, the <a href=\"/products/asus-rog-strix-g18-scar-g835lx-2025-core-ultra-9-275hx-rtx-5090\">ROG Strix Scar 18</a> has the same RTX 5090 for well under half the price.</p>','[{\"question\":\"What is the ASUS ROG Zephyrus Duo GX651AX price in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"ONIN Infosys sells the ROG Zephyrus Duo G16 GX651AX with Core Ultra 9 386H, RTX 5090 24GB, 64GB RAM and 1TB SSD for Rs 13,38,900.\"},{\"question\":\"Does the Zephyrus Duo have two screens?\",\"answer\":\"Yes. It has two 16-inch 3K (2880 \\u00d7 1800) 120Hz OLED touchscreens with stylus support.\"},{\"question\":\"How much RAM does the Zephyrus Duo have?\",\"answer\":\"64GB of LPDDR5X-8533, soldered.\"}]','[{\"label\":\"ONIN Infosys \\u2013 ASUS ROG Zephyrus Duo G16 GX651AX (Core Ultra 9 386H, RTX 5090)\",\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/onin.com.np\\/product\\/asus-rog-zephyrus-duo-gx651ax-core-ultra-9-rtx-5090-price\",\"accessed\":\"2026-11-23\"},{\"label\":\"GadgetByte Nepal \\u2013 ASUS ROG Zephyrus Duo GX651AX 2026 (Intel Core Ultra 9 386H)\",\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/www.gadgetbytenepal.com\\/product\\/asus-rog-zephyrus-duo-gx651ax-2026-intel-core-ultra-9-386h-rtx-5090\\/\",\"accessed\":\"2026-11-23\"}]',NULL,'https://onin.com.np/product/asus-rog-zephyrus-duo-gx651ax-core-ultra-9-rtx-5090-price',0,'2025-12-31 18:15:00','2025-12-31 18:15:00'),(316,40,3,'Asus ROG Zephyrus G16 GU605CM 2025 (Intel Core Ultra 7 255H)','asus-rog-zephyrus-g16-gu605cm-2025',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,505900.00,NULL,0,NULL,'2025-01-01','available',NULL,0,0,'<p>The Asus ROG Zephyrus G16 GU605CM 2025 (Intel Core Ultra 7 255H) costs <strong>Rs 5,05,900</strong> in Nepal for the 16GB/1TB model. It launched in Nepal in 2025. This is high-end territory, aimed at heavy gaming, 3D work or video editing.</p>\n<p>It runs on the Intel Core Ultra 7 255H (TSMC N3B), 16 cores / 16 threads. Screen: 16 inches, OLED, 2.5K (2560 x 1600 pixels), 240Hz. 16GB of memory is the right amount for a laptop you plan to keep for several years. At 1.85 kg, it is fine for occasional carrying. Battery: Li-Ion 90 Wh; 200W adapter.</p>\n<p>Around the same budget, also look at the <a href=\"/products/lenovo-legion-pro-5i-16iax10-2025-intel-core-ultra-9-275hx-rtx-5060\">Lenovo Legion Pro 5i 16IAX10 2025 (Intel Core Ultra 9 275HX)</a> (Rs 4,95,900) and the <a href=\"/products/asus-rog-strix-g18-g815jmr-2025-14th-gen-i9-14900hx-rtx-5060\">Asus ROG Strix G18 G815JMR 2025 (Intel Core i9-14900HX)</a> (Rs 4,88,900). You can <a href=\"/compare?category=laptop&g1=asus-rog-zephyrus-g16-gu605cm-2025&g2=lenovo-legion-pro-5i-16iax10-2025-intel-core-ultra-9-275hx-rtx-5060\">compare the Asus ROG Zephyrus G16 GU605CM 2025 (Intel Core Ultra 7 255H) with the Lenovo Legion Pro 5i 16IAX10 2025 (Intel Core Ultra 9 275HX)</a> side by side.</p>','[{\"question\":\"What is the Asus ROG Zephyrus G16 GU605CM 2025 (Intel Core Ultra 7 255H) price in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"The Asus ROG Zephyrus G16 GU605CM 2025 (Intel Core Ultra 7 255H) costs Rs 5,05,900 in Nepal.\"},{\"question\":\"When did the Asus ROG Zephyrus G16 GU605CM 2025 (Intel Core Ultra 7 255H) launch in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"It launched in Nepal in 2025.\"},{\"question\":\"Which processor does the Asus ROG Zephyrus G16 GU605CM 2025 (Intel Core Ultra 7 255H) use?\",\"answer\":\"It uses the Intel Core Ultra 7 255H (TSMC N3B), 16 cores \\/ 16 threads.\"}]','[{\"label\":\"GadgetByte Nepal \\u2013 Asus ROG Zephyrus G16 GU605CM 2025 (Intel Core Ultra 7 255H)\",\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/www.gadgetbytenepal.com\\/product\\/asus-rog-zephyrus-g16-gu605cm-2025-intel-core-ultra-7-255h-rtx-5060\\/\",\"accessed\":\"2026-11-23\"}]',NULL,NULL,0,'2024-12-31 18:15:00','2024-12-31 18:15:00'),(317,40,3,'Asus ROG Strix Scar 18 G835 (2025-2026)','asus-rog-strix-scar-18-g835-2025-2026',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,592900