\\/1TB.\"},{\"question\":\"Which processor does the Asus ROG Strix Scar 18 G835 (2025-2026) use?\",\"answer\":\"It uses the Intel Core Ultra 9 275HX or 290HX Plus.\"},{\"question\":\"Is the Asus ROG Strix Scar 18 G835 (2025-2026) good for gaming?\",\"answer\":\"Yes. It has NVIDIA GeForce RTX 5070 Ti or RTX 5090 graphics, so it is built for gaming as well as everyday work.\"}]','[{\"label\":\"GadgetByte Nepal \\u2013 ASUS laptop price list\",\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/www.gadgetbytenepal.com\\/asus-laptops-price-nepal\",\"accessed\":\"2026-09-14\"}]',NULL,NULL,0,'2026-09-13 18:15:00','2026-09-13 18:15:00'),(318,40,3,'Asus ROG Strix G18 (2025)','asus-rog-strix-g18-2025',NULL,'gadgets/2026/asus-rog-strix-g18-2025.webp',NULL,NULL,537900.00,NULL,0,NULL,'2025-01-01','available',NULL,0,0,'<p>The Asus ROG Strix G18 (2025) costs <strong>Rs 5,37,900</strong> in Nepal for the Ryzen 9 8940HX · RTX 5070, 16GB/1TB model. The top Core i9-14900HX · RTX 5070, 32GB/2TB version costs Rs 5,95,900. With a dedicated NVIDIA GPU, this is built for gaming and creative apps first.</p>\n<p>It runs on the AMD Ryzen 9 8940HX or Intel Core i9-14900HX with NVIDIA GeForce RTX 5070 graphics. The screen is a 18-inch WQXGA, 240Hz panel. 32GB or more of memory gives plenty of headroom for editing, virtual machines and big projects. That GPU is comfortable with current games at high settings on the built-in screen.</p>\n<p>Around the same budget, also look at the <a href=\"/products/asus-rog-strix-g18-g814pp-2025-amd-ryzen-9-8940hx-rtx-5070\">Asus ROG Strix G18 G814PP 2025 (Ryzen 9 8940HX)</a> (Rs 5,37,900) and the <a href=\"/products/lenovo-legion-pro-5-16afr10-2025-ryzen-9-9955hx-rtx-5070\">Lenovo Legion Pro 5 16AFR10 2025 (Ryzen 9 9955HX)</a> (Rs 5,23,900). You can <a href=\"/compare?category=laptop&g1=asus-rog-strix-g18-2025&g2=asus-rog-strix-g18-g814pp-2025-amd-ryzen-9-8940hx-rtx-5070\">compare the Asus ROG Strix G18 (2025) with the Asus ROG Strix G18 G814PP 2025 (Ryzen 9 8940HX)</a> side by side.</p>\