Intel Core Ultra 9 275HX)</a> (Rs 6,10,000) and the <a href=\"/products/asus-rog-strix-g18-g815jpr-2025-14th-gen-i9-14900hx-rtx-5070\">Asus ROG Strix G18 G815JPR 2025 (Intel Core i9-14900HX)</a> (Rs 5,95,900). You can <a href=\"/compare?category=laptop&g1=msi-vector-16-hx-ai-2025&g2=msi-vector-16-hx-ai-a2xwjg-2025-intel-core-ultra-9-275hx-rtx-5090\">compare the MSI Vector 16 HX AI (2025) with the MSI Vector 16 HX AI A2XWJG 2025 (Intel Core Ultra 9 275HX)</a> side by side.</p>\n<p>Prices are from <a href=\"https://www.gadgetbytenepal.com/msi-laptops-price-nepal\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" target=\"_blank\">GadgetByte Nepal – MSI laptop price list</a>, last updated 21 September 2026. Shop prices can change, so confirm with the seller before you pay.</p>','[{\"question\":\"What is the MSI Vector 16 HX AI (2025) price in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"The MSI Vector 16 HX AI (2025) costs Rs 6,25,000 in Nepal.\"},{\"question\":\"Which processor does the MSI Vector 16 HX AI (2025) use?\",\"answer\":\"It uses the Intel Core Ultra 7 275HX.\"},{\"question\":\"Is the MSI Vector 16 HX AI (2025) good for gaming?\",\"answer\":\"Yes. It has NVIDIA GeForce RTX 5090 24GB, 175W graphics, so it is built for gaming as well as everyday work.\"}]','[{\"label\":\"GadgetByte Nepal \\u2013 MSI laptop price list\",\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/www.gadgetbytenepal.com\\/msi-laptops-price-nepal\",\"accessed\":\"2026-09-21\"}]',NULL,NULL,0,'2026-09-20 18:15:00','2026-09-20 18:15:00'),(321,2,31,'Apple iPad Air 11-inch (M4)','apple-ipad-air-11-m4-2026',NULL,'gadgets/2026/apple-ipad-air-11-m4-2026.webp',NULL,NULL,139999.00,NULL,0,NULL,'2026-04-10','available',NULL,0,0,'<p>The M4 iPad Air brings near-Pro power at an Air price. Apple\'s M4 chip has an 8-core CPU and a 9-core GPU with hardware ray tracing, and 12 GB of unified memory, 50% more than before, keeps several apps, Stage Manager and heavier creative work running smoothly.</p>\n<p>The 11-inch Liquid Retina display covers the P3 wide colour range at 500 nit