?\",\"answer\":\"Li-Po 7600 mAh, non-removable; 18W Charging.\"}]','[{\"label\":\"GadgetByte Nepal \\u2013 Redmi Pad 2 9.7\",\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/www.gadgetbytenepal.com\\/product\\/redmi-pad-2-97\\/\",\"accessed\":\"2026-11-23\"}]',NULL,NULL,0,'2026-05-25 18:15:00','2026-05-25 18:15:00'),(327,3,31,'Redmi Pad 2 11-inch','redmi-pad-2',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,29999.00,NULL,0,NULL,'2025-06-05','available',NULL,0,0,'<p>The Redmi Pad 2 11-inch costs <strong>Rs 29,999</strong> in Nepal for the 6GB/128GB model. The 8GB/256GB version costs Rs 34,999. It launched in Nepal on 5 June 2025. A tablet at this price is mainly for videos, reading, online classes and kids.</p>\n<p>It has a 11 inches IPS LCD, 90Hz, 500 nits (typ), 600 nits (HDR) screen and runs on the Mediatek Helio G100 Ultra (6nm). The Li-Po 9000 mAh, non-removable battery is a real strength; most people will get a day and a half or more. Charging: 18W Charging.</p>\n<p>Around the same budget, also look at the <a href=\"/products/honor-pad-x8b\">Honor Pad X8b</a> (Rs 29,999) and the <a href=\"/products/blackview-zeno-5\">Blackview Zeno 5</a> (Rs 29,999). You can <a href=\"/compare?category=tablet&g1=redmi-pad-2&g2=honor-pad-x8b\">compare the Redmi Pad 2 11-inch with the Honor Pad X8b</a> side by side.</p>','[{\"question\":\"What is the Redmi Pad 2 11-inch price in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"The Redmi Pad 2 11-inch starts at Rs 29,999 in Nepal. All variants: Rs 29,999 for 6GB\\/128GB; Rs 34,999 for 8GB\\/256GB.\"},{\"question\":\"When did the Redmi Pad 2 11-inch launch in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"It launched in Nepal on 5 June 2025.\"},{\"question\":\"Which processor does the Redmi Pad 2 11-inch use?\",\"answer\":\"It uses the Mediatek Helio G100 Ultra (6nm).\"},{\"question\":\"What is the Redmi Pad 2 11-inch battery like?\",\"answer\":\"Li-Po 9000 mAh, non-removable; 18W Charging.\"}]','[{\"label\":\"GadgetByte Nepal \\u2013 Redmi Pad 2 11-inch\",\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/www.gadgetbytenepal.com\\/product\\/redmi-pad-2\\/\",\"acc