 18:15:00','2021-08-10 18:15:00'),(395,2,4,'Apple AirPods Pro (1st generation)','apple-airpods-pro-1st-generation',NULL,'gadgets/2026/apple-airpods-pro-1st-generation.webp',NULL,NULL,0.00,NULL,0,'$249 US launch price','2019-10-30','discontinued',NULL,0,0,'<p>The Apple AirPods Pro (1st generation) launched on 30 October 2019 at $249 in the US. It is no longer sold new, so it has no current Nepal price. We keep its specs here for reference and for anyone weighing up a second-hand unit.</p>\n<p>It runs on the Apple H1. Battery: Up to 4.5 hours (24 hours with case). Notable: Active noise cancellation, Transparency mode, IPX4.</p>\n<p>Buying used? Check the battery and ask for the original charger. If you would rather buy new, the current equivalents are the <a href=\"/products/airpods-pro-3\">Apple AirPods Pro 3</a> (Rs 47,999) and the <a href=\"/products/airpods-5\">Apple AirPods 5</a> (Rs 31,000).</p>','[{\"question\":\"When was the Apple AirPods Pro (1st generation) released?\",\"answer\":\"It was released on 30 October 2019.\"},{\"question\":\"What was the Apple AirPods Pro (1st generation) launch price?\",\"answer\":\"It launched at $249 in the US. It is no longer sold new, so there is no current Nepal price.\"},{\"question\":\"Which processor does the Apple AirPods Pro (1st generation) use?\",\"answer\":\"It uses the Apple H1.\"}]','[]',NULL,NULL,0,'2019-10-29 18:15:00','2019-10-29 18:15:00'),(396,7,4,'Sony WF-1000XM4','sony-wf-1000xm4',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0.00,NULL,0,'$279.99 US launch price','2021-06-08','discontinued',NULL,0,0,'<p>The Sony WF-1000XM4 launched on 8 June 2021 at $279.99 in the US. It is no longer sold new, so it has no current Nepal price. We keep its specs here for reference and for anyone weighing up a second-hand unit.</p>\n<p>It runs on the Sony V1. Battery: Up to 8 hours with ANC (24 hours with case). Notable: Active noise cancellation, IPX4.</p>\n<p>Buying used? Check the battery and ask for the original charger. If you would rather buy new