 costs <strong>Rs 5,500</strong> in Nepal. It launched in Nepal on 23 July 2026. This is where noise cancellation, app support and better codecs start to appear.</p>\n<p>Noise cancellation: Yes (Up to 50dB). Drivers: 12.4 mm dynamic drivers. Battery: Music: 13.5 hours (buds) / 56 hours (case), With ANC off; 1 hour (buds) / 2 hours (case), Quick charge: 10 minutes = 10 hours playback. Connectivity: Bluetooth 6.1, multipoint, Codecs: AAC, SBC, LHDC 5.0. Water resistance: Earbuds: IP55 dust and splash resistance.</p>\n<p>Around the same budget, also look at the <a href=\"/products/anker-soundcore-r60i-nc\">Soundcore R60i NC</a> (Rs 5,499) and the <a href=\"/products/hifuture-flybuds-4\">HiFuture Flybuds 4</a> (Rs 5,624). You can <a href=\"/compare?category=earbuds&g1=realme-buds-t500-pro&g2=anker-soundcore-r60i-nc\">compare the Realme Buds T500 Pro with the Soundcore R60i NC</a> side by side.</p>','[{\"question\":\"What is the Realme Buds T500 Pro price in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"The Realme Buds T500 Pro costs Rs 5,500 in Nepal.\"},{\"question\":\"When did the Realme Buds T500 Pro launch in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"It launched in Nepal on 23 July 2026.\"},{\"question\":\"What is the Realme Buds T500 Pro battery like?\",\"answer\":\"Music: 13.5 hours (buds) \\/ 56 hours (case), With ANC off; 1 hour (buds) \\/ 2 hours (case), Quick charge: 10 minutes = 10 hours playback.\"}]','[{\"label\":\"GadgetByte Nepal \\u2013 Realme Buds T500 Pro\",\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/www.gadgetbytenepal.com\\/product\\/realme-buds-t500-pro\\/\",\"accessed\":\"2026-11-23\"}]',NULL,NULL,0,'2026-07-22 18:15:00','2026-07-22 18:15:00'),(700,39,3,'Lenovo IdeaPad 1 15IRU7 2025 (Intel Core i5-1335U)','lenovo-ideapad-1-15iru7-2025-intel-core-i5-1335u',NULL,'gadgets/2026/lenovo-ideapad-1-15iru7-2025-intel-core-i5-1335u.webp',NULL,NULL,101999.00,NULL,0,NULL,'2026-01-01','available',NULL,0,0,'<p>The Lenovo IdeaPad 1 15IRU7 2025 (Intel Core i5-1335U) costs <strong>Rs 1,01,999</strong> in Nepal for the 16GB/512GB 