ets/2026/dell-xps-13-2026-intel-core-ultra-5-320.webp',NULL,NULL,135999.00,155999.00,0,NULL,'2026-01-01','available',NULL,0,0,'<p>The XPS 13 has long been the Windows laptop people compare MacBooks against, and the 2026 DX13260 brings it to its lowest price yet in Nepal: <strong>Rs 1,35,999</strong> at ONIN Infosys, in a light Sky finish.</p>\n<p>It\'s still unmistakably an XPS. It weighs about <strong>1 kg</strong>, with near-borderless InfinityEdge bezels and a <strong>13.4-inch 2.5K (2560 × 1600) touchscreen</strong> that runs at up to <strong>120Hz</strong> and 500 nits. It looks crisp and bright next to the 250–300-nit panels common at this price. Wi-Fi 7 and Bluetooth 6.0 are included, and the 52Wh battery is a good size for the body.</p>\n<p>To reach this price, Dell uses Intel\'s 6-core <strong>Core 5 320</strong> (up to 4.6GHz) and <strong>8GB</strong> of fast LPDDR5x with a 512GB SSD. It\'s fine for writing, browsing, Office and streaming, but 8GB can\'t be upgraded and will limit heavier multitasking. Ports are minimal, just two USB-C, so keep a small hub in your bag.</p>\n<p>The obvious rival is the <a href=\"/products/macbook-neo\">MacBook Neo</a> at almost the same price. Choose the XPS if you need Windows or want the 120Hz touchscreen.</p>','[{\"question\":\"What is the Dell XPS 13 (2026) price in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"ONIN Infosys sells the Dell XPS 13 DX13260 with Core 5 320, 8GB RAM and 512GB SSD for Rs 1,35,999.\"},{\"question\":\"What display does the 2026 XPS 13 have?\",\"answer\":\"A 13.4-inch 2.5K (2560 \\u00d7 1600) touchscreen at 30\\u2013120Hz and 500 nits.\"},{\"question\":\"How many ports does the XPS 13 have?\",\"answer\":\"Two USB-C ports. You will likely want a hub for USB-A and HDMI.\"}]','[{\"label\":\"ONIN Infosys \\u2013 Dell XPS 13 DX13260 (2026, Core 5 320)\",\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/onin.com.np\\/product\\/dell-xps-13-dx13260-core-5-320-price-in-nepal\",\"accessed\":\"2026-11-23\"},{\"label\":\"GadgetByte Nepal \\u2013 Dell XPS 13 