 40 mm dynamic drivers.</p>\n<p>Around the same budget, also look at the <a href=\"/products/jbl-tune-680nc\">JBL Tune 680NC</a> (Rs 15,000) and the <a href=\"/products/cmf-headphone-pro\">CMF Headphone Pro</a> (Rs 13,999). You can <a href=\"/compare?category=headphones&g1=sony-wh-g300-inzone-h3&g2=jbl-tune-680nc\">compare the Sony WH-G300 INZONE H3 with the JBL Tune 680NC</a> side by side.</p>','[{\"question\":\"What is the Sony WH-G300 INZONE H3 price in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"The Sony WH-G300 INZONE H3 costs Rs 16,200 in Nepal.\"},{\"question\":\"When did the Sony WH-G300 INZONE H3 launch in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"It launched in Nepal in 2022.\"}]','[{\"label\":\"GadgetByte Nepal \\u2013 Sony WH-G300 INZONE H3\",\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/www.gadgetbytenepal.com\\/product\\/sony-wh-g300-inzone-h3\\/\",\"accessed\":\"2026-11-23\"}]',NULL,NULL,0,'2021-12-31 18:15:00','2021-12-31 18:15:00'),(724,2,3,'Apple MacBook Pro 14-inch M5 (2025)','apple-macbook-pro-14-inch-m5',NULL,'gadgets/2026/apple-macbook-pro-14-inch-m5.webp',NULL,NULL,376500.00,NULL,0,NULL,'2025-12-03','available',NULL,0,0,'<p>The Apple MacBook Pro 14-inch M5 (2025) costs <strong>Rs 3,76,500</strong> in Nepal for the 16GB/1TB model. The 32GB/1TB version costs Rs 4,56,000. It launched in Nepal on 3 December 2025. This is high-end territory, aimed at heavy gaming, 3D work or video editing.</p>\n<p>It runs on the Apple M5 (3nm). Screen: 14.2 inches, IPS LCD, 3K (3024 x 1964 pixels), 120Hz. 32GB of memory gives plenty of headroom for editing and development. At 1.55 kg, it is fine for occasional carrying. Battery: Li-Po 72.4 Wh; 70W adapter.</p>\n<p>Around the same budget, also look at the <a href=\"/products/macbook-pro-14-m5\">Apple MacBook Pro 14 (M5)</a> (Rs 3,76,500) and the <a href=\"/products/lenovo-yoga-9-14ill10-2025-core-ultra-7-258v\">Lenovo Yoga 9 Gen 5 14ILL10 2025 (Intel Core Ultra 7 258V)</a> (Rs 3,69,999). You can <a href=\"/compare?category=laptop&g1=apple-macbook-pro-14-inch-m5&g2=macbook-pro-14-m5\">compare the Apple MacBook Pro 14-inch M5 (2025) with the Apple MacBook Pro 14 (M5)</a> side by side.</p>','[{\"question\":\"What is the Apple MacBook Pro 14-inch M5 (2025) price in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"The Apple MacBook Pro 14-inch M5 (2025) starts at Rs 3,76,500 in Nepal. All variants: Rs 3,76,500 for 16GB\\/1TB; Rs 4,15,000 for 24GB\\/1TB; Rs 4,56,000 for 32GB\\/1TB.\"},{\"question\":\"When did the Apple MacBook Pro 14-inch M5 (2025) launch in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"It launched in Nepal on 3 December 2025.\"},{\"question\":\"Which processor does the Apple MacBook Pro 14-inch M5 (2025) use?\",\"answer\":\"It uses the Apple M5 (3nm).\"}]','[{\"label\":\"GadgetByte Nepal \\u2013 Apple MacBook Pro 14-inch M5 (2025)\",\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/www.gadgetbytenepal.com\\/product\\/apple-macbook-pro-14-inch-m5\\/\",\"accessed\":\"2026-11-23\"}]',NULL,NULL,0,'2025-12-02 18:15:00','2025-12-02 18:15:00'),(725,2,3,'Apple MacBook Pro 14-inch M5 Pro (2026)','apple-macbook-pro-14-inch-m5-pro-2026',NULL,'gadgets/2026/apple-macbook-pro-14-inch-m5-pro-2026.webp',NULL,NULL,474500.00,NULL,0,NULL,'2026-01-01','available',NULL,0,0,'<p>The Apple MacBook Pro 14-inch M5 Pro (2026) costs <strong>Rs 4,74,500</strong> in Nepal for the 24GB - 1TB - 15-core - 16-core model. The 24GB - 2TB - 18-core - 20-core version costs Rs 6,06,500. It launched in Nepal in 2026. This is high-end territory, aimed at heavy gaming, 3D work or video editing.</p>\n<p>It runs on the Apple M5 Pro (3nm), 18 cores / 20 threads. Screen: 14.2 inches, IPS LCD, 3K (3024 x 1964 pixels), 120Hz. At 1.6 kg, it is fine for occasional carrying. Battery: Li-Po 72.4 Wh; 96W adapter.</p>\n<p>Around the same budget, also look at the <a href=\"/products/macbook-pro-14-m5-pro\">Apple MacBook Pro 14 (M5 Pro)</a> (Rs 4,74,500) and the <a href=\"/products/lenovo-legion-5a-g11-15agp11-2026-amd-ryzen-ai-9-465-rtx-5060\">Lenovo Legion 5a G11 15AGP11 2026 (AMD Ryzen AI 9 465)</a> (Rs 4,76,900). You can <a href=\"/compare?category=laptop&g1