n-pro-7i-16iax10h-2025-intel-core-ultra-9-275hx-rtx-5090\">Lenovo Legion Pro 7i 16IAX10H 2025</a> (Rs 7,73,900). You can <a href=\"/compare?category=laptop&g1=apple-macbook-pro-14-inch-m5-max-2026&g2=lenovo-legion-pro-7i-2025\">compare the Apple MacBook Pro 14-inch M5 Max (2026) with the Lenovo Legion Pro 7i (2025)</a> side by side.</p>','[{\"question\":\"What is the Apple MacBook Pro 14-inch M5 Max (2026) price in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"The Apple MacBook Pro 14-inch M5 Max (2026) costs Rs 7,76,500 in Nepal.\"},{\"question\":\"When did the Apple MacBook Pro 14-inch M5 Max (2026) launch in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"It launched in Nepal in 2026.\"},{\"question\":\"Which processor does the Apple MacBook Pro 14-inch M5 Max (2026) use?\",\"answer\":\"It uses the Apple M5 Max (3nm).\"}]','[{\"label\":\"GadgetByte Nepal \\u2013 Apple MacBook Pro 14-inch M5 Max (2026)\",\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/www.gadgetbytenepal.com\\/product\\/apple-macbook-pro-14-inch-m5-max-2026\\/\",\"accessed\":\"2026-11-23\"}]',NULL,NULL,0,'2025-12-31 18:15:00','2025-12-31 18:15:00'),(729,1,5,'Samsung Galaxy Watch Ultra','samsung-galaxy-watch-ultra',NULL,'gadgets/2026/samsung-galaxy-watch-ultra.webp',NULL,NULL,115000.00,NULL,0,NULL,'2025-07-25','available',NULL,0,0,'<p>The Samsung Galaxy Watch Ultra costs <strong>Rs 1,15,000</strong> in Nepal for the 47mm model. It launched in Nepal on 25 July 2025. This is a premium watch, so expect accurate GPS, better health sensors and a tougher build.</p>\n<p>It has a 1.5 inches, Super AMOLED display. Battery: Up to 48 hours (normal usage), Up to 100 hours (low power mode); Li-Ion 590 mAh. Connectivity: Bluetooth 5.3, GPS: Yes, with A-GPS (L1+L5), BDS, Galileo, Glonass, NFC. Water resistance: IP68 dust and water resistance, 10 ATM water resistance, MIL-STD 810H certified. It has a speaker and microphone for calls from the wrist.</p>\n<p>Around the same budget, also look at the <a href=\"/products/samsung-galaxy-watch-ultra-2\">Samsung Galaxy Watch Ultra 2</a> (Rs 1,23,499) and the <a href=\"/products/samsung-galaxy-watch8-classic\">Samsung Galaxy Watch 8 Classic</a> (Rs 82,999). You can <a href=\"/compare?category=smartwatch&g1=samsung-galaxy-watch-ultra&g2=samsung-galaxy-watch-ultra-2\">compare the Samsung Galaxy Watch Ultra with the Samsung Galaxy Watch Ultra 2</a> side by side.</p>','[{\"question\":\"What is the Samsung Galaxy Watch Ultra price in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"The Samsung Galaxy Watch Ultra costs Rs 1,15,000 in Nepal.\"},{\"question\":\"When did the Samsung Galaxy Watch Ultra launch in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"It launched in Nepal on 25 July 2025.\"},{\"question\":\"What is the Samsung Galaxy Watch Ultra battery like?\",\"answer\":\"Up to 48 hours (normal usage), Up to 100 hours (low power mode); Li-Ion 590 mAh.\"}]','[{\"label\":\"GadgetByte Nepal \\u2013 Samsung Galaxy Watch Ultra\",\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/www.gadgetbytenepal.com\\/product\\/samsung-galaxy-watch-ultra\\/\",\"accessed\":\"2026-11-23\"}]',NULL,NULL,0,'2025-07-24 18:15:00','2025-07-24 18:15:00'),(730,39,3,'Lenovo LOQ 15 15IRX10 2025 (Intel Core i7-13650HX)','lenovo-loq-15-15irx10-intel-i7-13650hx-rtx-5050',NULL,'gadgets/2026/lenovo-loq-15-15irx10-intel-i7-13650hx-rtx-5050.webp',NULL,NULL,331900.00,NULL,0,NULL,'2025-01-01','available',NULL,0,0,'<p>The Lenovo LOQ 15 15IRX10 2025 (Intel Core i7-13650HX) costs <strong>Rs 3,31,900</strong> in Nepal for the 16GB/512GB model. It launched in Nepal in 2025. This is high-end territory, aimed at heavy gaming, 3D work or video editing.</p>\n<p>It runs on the Intel Core i7-13650HX (Intel 7), 14 cores / 20 threads. Screen: 15.6 inches, IPS LCD, Full HD (1920 x 1080 pixels), 144Hz. 16GB of memory is the right amount for a laptop you plan to keep for several years. At 2.4 kg, it is best kept on a desk. Battery: Li-Ion 60 Wh; 245W adapter.</p>\n<p>Around the same budget, also look at the <a href=\"/products/asus-rog-strix-g18-g815lm-2025-core-ultra-9-275hx-rtx-5060\">Asus ROG Strix G18 G815LM 2025 (Intel Core Ultra 9 275HX)</a> (Rs 3,29,999) and the <a href=\"/products/asus-zenbook-s-14-oled-ux5406sa-2024\">Asus Zenbook S 14 OLED UX5406SA 2024 (Intel Core Ultra 7 256V)</a> (Rs 3,25,755). You can <a href=\"/compare?category=laptop&g1=lenovo-loq-15-15irx10-intel-i7-13650hx-rtx-5050&g2=asus-rog-strix-g18-g815lm-2025-core-ultra-9-275hx-rtx-5060\">compare the Lenovo LOQ 15 15IRX10 2025 (Intel Core i7-13650HX) with the Asus ROG Strix G18 G815LM 2025 (Intel Core Ultra 9 275HX)</a> side by side.</p>','[{\"question\":\"What is the Lenovo LOQ 15 15IRX10 2025 (Intel Core i7-13650HX) price in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"The Lenovo LOQ 15 15IRX10 2025 (Intel Core i7-13650HX) costs Rs 3,31,900 in Nepal.\"},{\"question\":\"When did the Lenovo LOQ 15 15IRX10 2025 (Intel Core i7-13650HX) launch in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"It launched in Nepal in 2025.\"},{\"question\":\"Which processor does the Lenovo LOQ 15 15IRX10 2025 (Intel Core i7-13650HX) use?\",\"answer\":\"It uses the Intel Core i7-13650HX (Intel 7), 14 cores \\/ 20 threads.\"}]','[{\"label\":\"GadgetByte Nepal \\u2013 Lenovo LOQ 15 15IRX10 2025 (Intel Core i7-13650HX)\",\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/www.gadgetbytenepal.com\\/product\\/lenovo-loq-15-15irx10-intel-i7-13650hx-rtx-5050\\/\",\"accessed\":\"2026-11-23\"}]',NULL,NULL,0,'2024-12-31 18:15:00','2024-12-31 18:15:00'),(731,39,3,'Lenovo LOQ 15IRX9 (Core i7-13650HX, RTX 4050)','lenovo-loq-15-intel-i7-13650hx-rtx-4050',NULL,'gadgets/2026/lenovo-loq-15-intel-i7-13650hx-rtx-4050.webp',NULL,NULL,201999.00,NULL,0,NULL,'2025-01-01','available',NULL,0,0,'<p>This LOQ is built around a CPU that feels almost too strong for a budget gaming laptop. The <strong>Core i7-13650HX</strong> has <strong>14 cores and 20 threads</strong> and boosts to 4.9GHz. If you game and also render in Blender, compile code or export long videos, it chews through those jobs. ONIN Infosys currently asks <strong>Rs 2,01,999</strong> with a bag, gaming mouse and mousepad.</p>\n<p>Graphics come from an <strong>RTX 4050 6GB at 105W</strong>, with Advanced Optimus to switch between the GPU and the integrated chip and save battery on the move. In practice, it handles 1080p high settings in most games with DLSS 3 frame generation, and very high frame rates in esports titles. The 15.6-inch IPS panel is 144Hz with 100% sRGB.</p>\n<p>The 60Wh battery supports Super Rapid Charge Pro, which reaches 80% in about 30 minutes. The keyboard has 1.5mm travel, white backlighting, anti-ghosting and a set of swappable keycaps. You get 16GB of DDR5-5600 on SO-DIMM and a 512GB PCIe 4.0 SSD.</p>\n<p>Should you pick this or the newer <a href=\"/products/lenovo-loq-15-2025\">LOQ 15 with RTX 5050</a>? The RTX 5050 has more VRAM (8GB) for new games. This i7 model wins on CPU-heavy work.</p>','[{\"question\":\"What is the Lenovo LOQ 15IRX9 i7 RTX 4050 price in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"ONIN Infosys sells it for Rs 2,01,999 with Core i7-13650HX, RTX 4050 6GB, 16GB DDR5 and 512GB SSD, plus a bag, gaming mouse and mousepad.\"},{\"question\":\"How fast does the LOQ 15IRX9 charge?\",\"answer\":\"Super Rapid Charge Pro reaches about 40% in 10 minutes, 80% in 30 minutes and 100% in an hour.\"},{\"question\":\"Is the RTX 4050 good for 1080p gaming?\",\"answer\":\"Yes. At 105W it runs most games at 1080p high settings, especially with DLSS enabled.\"}]','[{\"label\":\"ONIN Infosys \\u2013 Lenovo LOQ 15IRX9 (Core i7-13650HX, RTX 4050)\",\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/onin.com.np\\/product\\/lenovo-loq-15irx9-i7-13650hx-rtx-4050-price-nepal\",\"accessed\":\"2026-11-23\"},{\"label\":\"GadgetByte Nepal \\u2013 Lenovo LOQ 15 15IRX9 2024 (Intel Core i7-13650HX)\",\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/www.gadgetbytenepal.com\\/product\\/lenovo-loq-15-intel-i7-13650hx-rtx-4050\\/\",\"accessed\":\"2026-11-23\"},{\"label\":\"GadgetByte Nepal \\u2013 Lenovo LOQ 15 15IRX9 (Intel i7-13650HX, RTX 3050, 16GB, 512GB, 15.6\\\" FHD 144Hz)\",\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/www.gadgetbytenepal.com\\/product\\/lenovo-loq-15-intel-i7-13650hx-rtx-3050-2\\/\",\"accessed\":\"2026-11-23\"},{\"label\":\"GadgetByte Nepal \\u2013 Lenovo LOQ 15 15IRX9 2024 (Intel Core i5-13450HX, RTX 4050, 16GB, 512GB, 15.6\\\" FHD 144Hz)\",\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/www.gadgetbytenepal.com\\/product\\/lenovo-loq-15-2024-intel-core-i5-13450hx-rtx-4050\\/\",\"accessed\":\"2026-11-23\"},{\"label\":\"GadgetByte Nepal \\u2013 Lenovo LOQ 15 15IRX9 2024 (Intel Core i5-13450HX, RTX 3050, 16GB, 512GB, 15.6\\\" FHD 144Hz)\",\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/www.gadgetbytenepal.com\\/product\\/lenovo-loq-15-intel-i5-13450hx\\/\",\"accessed\":\"2026-11-23\"}]',NULL,'https://onin.com.np/product/lenovo-loq-15irx9-i7-13650hx-rtx-4050-price-nepal',0,'2024-12-31 18:15:00','2024-12-31 18:15:00'),(732,39,3,'Lenovo LOQ 15IAX9 2024 (Intel i5-12450HX)','lenovo-loq-2024-i5-12450hx-rtx-2050',NULL,'gadgets/2026/lenovo-loq-2024-i5-12450hx-rtx-2050.webp',NULL,NULL,181900.00,NULL,0,NULL,'2023-01-01','available',NULL,0,0,'<p>The Lenovo LOQ 15IAX9 2024 (Intel i5-12450HX) costs <strong>Rs 1,81,900</strong> in Nepal for the 16GB/512GB model. It was announced in 2023. At this price you should get a premium build, a better screen and enough memory to last years.</p>\n<p>It runs on the Intel Core i5-12450HX, 8 cores / 12 threads with NVIDIA GeForce RTX 2050 (4GB GDDR6 VRAM, 65W TGP) graphics. Screen: 15.6 inches, IPS LCD, 16:9 aspect ratio, 144Hz, 300 nits (cd/m2). 16GB of memory is the right amount for a laptop you plan to keep for several years. At 2.38 kg, it is best kept on a desk. Battery: 60 Wh; 135W Slim Tip (3-pin), Supports Rapid Charge Pro.</p>\n<p>Around the same budget, also look at the <a href=\"/products/acer-nitro-v-15-anv15-52-57dy-2025-intel-core-5-210h-rtx-5050\">Acer Nitro V 15 ANV15-52-57DY 2025 (Intel Core 5 210H)</a> (Rs 1,82,400) and the <a href=\"/products/msi-summit-e13-ai-evo-a1mtg-2025-intel-core-ultra-7-155h\">MSI Summit E13 AI Evo A1MTG 2025 (Intel Core Ultra 7 155H)</a> (Rs 1,79,999). You can <a href=\"/compare?category=laptop&g1=lenovo-loq-2024-i5-12450hx-rtx-2050&g2=acer-nitro-v-15-anv15-52-57dy-2025-intel-core-5-210h-rtx-5050\">compare the Lenovo LOQ 15IAX9 2024 (Intel i5-12450HX) with the Acer Nitro V 15 ANV15-52-57DY 2025 (Intel Core 5 210H)</a> side by side.</p>','[{\"question\":\"What is the Lenovo LOQ 15IAX9 2024 (Intel i5-12450HX) price in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"The Lenovo LOQ 15IAX9 2024 (Intel i5-12450HX) costs Rs 1,81,900 in Nepal.\"},{\"question\":\"Which processor does the Lenovo LOQ 15IAX9 2024 (Intel i5-12450HX) use?\",\"answer\":\"It uses the Intel Core i5-12450HX, 8 cores \\/ 12 threads.\"}]','[{\"label\":\"GadgetByte Nepal \\u2013 Lenovo LOQ 15IAX9 2024 (Intel i5-12450HX)\",\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/www.gadgetbytenepal.com\\/product\\/lenovo-loq-2024-i5-12450hx-rtx-2050\\/\",\"accessed\":\"2026-11-23\"}]',NULL,NULL,0,'2022-12-31 18:15:00','2022-12-31 18:15:00'),(733,39,3,'Lenovo LOQ 15 Essential Gen 9 15IAX9E 2024','lenovo-loq-15-essential-gen9-intel-i7-12650hx-rtx-4050',NULL,'gadgets/2026/lenovo-loq-15-essential-gen9-intel-i7-12650hx-rtx-4050.webp',NULL,NULL,229900.00,NULL,0,NULL,'2025-01-01','available',NULL,0,0,'<p>The Lenovo LOQ 15 Essential Gen 9 15IAX9E 2024 costs <strong>Rs 2,29,900</strong> in Nepal for the Intel Core i5-12450HX, RTX 3050 65W, 16GB/512GB model. The Intel Core i7-12650HX, RTX 4050 65W, 16GB/512GB version costs Rs 2,61,900. It launched in Nepal in 2025. At this price you should get a premium build, a better screen and enough memory to last years.</p>\n<p>It runs on the Intel Core i7-12650HX (Intel7), 14 cores / 20 threads (base configuration; see prices for other chips). Screen: 15.6 inches, IPS LCD, Full HD (1920 x 1080 pixels), 144Hz. 16GB of memory is the right amount for a laptop you plan to keep for several years. At 1.77 kg, it is fine for occasional carrying. Battery: Li-Ion 57 Wh; 135W adapter.</p>\n<p>Around the same budget, also look at the <a href=\"/products/acer-nitro-v-16s-ai-anv16s-41-2025-ryzen-7-260\">Acer Nitro V 16S AI ANV16S-41 2025 (Ryzen 7 260)</a> (Rs 2,28,999) and the <a href=\"/products/acer-nitro-v-16-ai\">Acer Nitro V 16 AI</a> (Rs 2,30,999). You can <a href=\"/compare?category=laptop&g1=lenovo-loq-15-essential-gen9-intel-i7-12650hx-rtx-4050&g2=acer-nitro-v-16s-ai-anv16s-41-2025-ryzen-7-260\">compare the Lenovo LOQ 15 Essential Gen 9 15IAX9E 2024 with the Acer Nitro V 16S AI ANV16S-41 2025 (Ryzen 7 260)</a> side by side.</p>','[{\"question\":\"What is the Lenovo LOQ 15 Essential Gen 9 15IAX9E 2024 price in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"The Lenovo LOQ 15 Essential Gen 9 15IAX9E 2024 starts at Rs 2,29,900 in Nepal. All variants: Rs 2,29,900 for Intel Core i5-12450HX, RTX 3050 65W, 16GB\\/512GB; Rs 2,35,900 for Intel Core i5-12450HX, RTX 4050 65W, 16GB\\/512GB; Rs 2,61,900 for Intel Core i7-12650HX, RTX 4050 65W, 16GB\\/512GB.\"},{\"question\":\"When did the Lenovo LOQ 15 Essential Gen 9 15IAX9E 2024 launch in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"It launched in Nepal in 2025.\"},{\"question\":\"Which processor does the Lenovo LOQ 15 Essential Gen 9 15IAX9E 2024 use?\",\"answer\":\"It uses the Intel Core i7-12650HX (Intel7), 14 cores \\/ 20 threads (base configuration; see prices for other chips).\"}]','[{\"label\":\"GadgetByte Nepal \\u2013 Lenovo LOQ 15 Essential Gen 9 15IAX9E 2024 (Intel Core i7-12650HX)\",\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/www.gadgetbytenepal.com\\/product\\/lenovo-loq-15-essential-gen9-intel-i7-12650hx-rtx-4050\\/\",\"accessed\":\"2026-11-23\"},{\"label\":\"GadgetByte Nepal \\u2013 Lenovo LOQ 15 Essential Gen 9 15IAX9E 2024 (Intel Core i5-12450HX, RTX 4050 65W, 16GB , 51\",\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/www.gadgetbytenepal.com\\/product\\/lenovo-loq-15-essential-gen9-intel-i5-12450hx-rtx-4050\\/\",\"accessed\":\"2026-11-23\"},{\"label\":\"GadgetByte Nepal \\u2013 Lenovo LOQ 15 Essential Gen 9 15IAX9E 2024 (Intel Core i5-12450HX, RTX 3050 65W, 16GB, 512\",\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/www.gadgetbytenepal.com\\/product\\/lenovo-loq-15-essential-gen9-intel-i5-12450hx-rtx-3050\\/\",\"accessed\":\"2026-11-23\"}]',NULL,NULL,0,'2024-12-31 18:15:00','2024-12-31 18:15:00'),(734,39,3,'Lenovo Legion Pro 5 Gen 10 (Ryzen 9 9955HX, RTX 5070, OLED)','lenovo-legion-pro-5-16afr10-2025-ryzen-9-9955hx-rtx-5070',NULL,'gadgets/2026/lenovo-legion-pro-5-16afr10-2025-ryzen-9-9955hx-rtx-5070.webp',NULL,NULL,457999.00,NULL,0,NULL,'2026-01-01','available',NULL,0,0,'<p>If we had to pick one Legion from ONIN Infosys\'s shelf for someone who games seriously <em>and</em> does heavy creative work, it would be this one. The Legion Pro 5 Gen 10 pairs a <strong>16-core, 32-thread Ryzen 9 9955HX</strong> (up to 5.4GHz, 64MB L3 cache) with an <strong>RTX 5070 8GB at 115W</strong>, and costs <strong>Rs 4,57,999</strong> with a 2-year warranty.</p>\n<p>That CPU is essentially desktop-class. Blender renders, Unreal Engine builds, 4K exports and code compiles finish dramatically faster than on 8-core laptop chips. The RTX 5070 runs current games at the OLED\'s native 2560 × 1600 with high settings, using DLSS 4 in the heaviest titles.</p>\n<p>The <strong>16-inch OLED</strong> reaches 1100 nits peak HDR, carries True Black 1000 certification and covers 100% DCI-P3 at 165Hz. Memory is <strong>32GB DDR5</strong> in dual channel. The 512GB SSD is this machine\'s one weak spot, so budget for a 2TB second drive. Lenovo\'s Coldfront cooling keeps it fairly composed under load, and it weighs about 2.3 kg.</p>\n<p>Next to the <a href=\"/products/lenovo-legion-pro-5i-16iax10-2025-intel-core-ultra-9-275hx-rtx-5060\">Legion Pro 5i with RTX 5060</a>, which costs about Rs 25,000 less, this is the better gaming machine thanks to the RTX 5070.</p>','[{\"question\":\"What is the Lenovo Legion Pro 5 Gen 10 Ryzen 9 price in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"ONIN Infosys sells the Legion Pro 5 Gen 10 with Ryzen 9 9955HX, RTX 5070 8GB, 32GB DDR5 and 512GB SSD for Rs 4,57,999 with a 2-year warranty.\"},{\"question\":\"How many cores does the Ryzen 9 9955HX have?\",\"answer\":\"16 cores and 32 threads, boosting up to 5.4GHz, with 64MB of L3 cache.\"},{\"question\":\"Is 512GB storage enough on the Legion Pro 5?\",\"answer\":\"Not for a big game library. Plan to add a second SSD.\"}]','[{\"label\":\"ONIN Infosys \\u2013 Lenovo Legion Pro 5 Gen 10 (Ryzen 9 9955HX, RTX 5070, OLED)\",\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/onin.com.np\\/product\\/lenovo-legion-pro-5-ryzen-9-rtx-5070-price-nepal\",\"accessed\":\"2026-11-23\"},{\"label\":\"GadgetByte Nepal \\u2013 Lenovo Legion Pro 5 16AFR10 2025 (Ryzen 9 9955HX)\",\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/www.gadgetbytenepal.com\\/product\\/lenovo-legion-pro-5-16afr10-2025-ryzen-9-9955hx-rtx-5070\\/\",\"accessed\":\"2026-11-23\"}]',NULL,'https://onin.com.np/product/lenovo-legion-pro-5-ryzen-9-rtx-5070-price-nepal',0,'2025-12-31 18:15:00','2025-12-31 18:15:00'),(735,39,3,'Lenovo Legion Pro 5i 16IAX10 (Core Ultra 9 275HX, RTX 5060, OLED)','lenovo-legion-pro-5i-16iax10-2025-intel-core-ultra-9-275hx-rtx-5060',NULL,'gadgets/2026/lenovo-legion-pro-5i-16iax10-2025-intel-core-ultra-9-275hx-rtx-5060.webp',NULL,NULL,432999.00,NULL,0,NULL,'2025-01-01','available',NULL,0,0,'<p>The \"Pro\" in Legion Pro 5i means a cooler-running chassis, a better screen and more premium finishing than the regular Legion 5. ONIN Infosys\'s configuration is all about the display: a <strong>16-inch WQXGA OLED</strong> at 165Hz with <strong>DisplayHDR True Black 1000</strong>, Dolby Vision and 100% DCI-P3. It costs <strong>Rs 4,32,999</strong> with a <strong>2-year warranty</strong> and lifetime software support from the store.</p>\n<p>Under the hood is the 24-core <strong>Core Ultra 9 275HX</strong>, <strong>32GB DDR5-5600</strong> (2 × 16GB), a 1TB PCIe 4.0 SSD and an <strong>RTX 5060 8GB at 115W</strong>. For gaming, the RTX 5060 is the limiting part at native 2560 × 1600, so expect to use DLSS in demanding titles. For creators, this is a superb machine. The OLED is colour-accurate enough for photo and video grading, and the CPU flies through exports.</p>\n<p>You also get Thunderbolt 4, HDMI 2.1, Wi-Fi 7, a 5MP webcam and an 80Wh battery, and it weighs around 2.43 kg.</p>\n<p>Value check: the <a href=\"/products/lenovo-legion-5-16iax10-ultra-9-275hx-rtx-5060\">Legion 5 16IAX10</a> has the same CPU, GPU and memory with a 240Hz IPS screen for about a lakh less. For the same money as this Pro 5i, the <a href=\"/products/lenovo-legion-pro-5-16afr10-2025-ryzen-9-9955hx-rtx-5070\">Legion Pro 5 with RTX 5070</a> gives you a faster GPU.</p>','[{\"question\":\"What is the Lenovo Legion Pro 5i price in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"ONIN Infosys sells the Legion Pro 5i with Core Ultra 9 275HX, RTX 5060 8GB, 32GB DDR5, 1TB SSD and a 16-inch OLED for Rs 4,32,999 with a 2-year warranty.\"},{\"question\":\"Is the Legion Pro 5i OLED good for video editing?\",\"answer\":\"Yes. The 16-inch OLED covers 100% DCI-P3, supports Dolby Vision and is True Black 1000 certified, which suits colour work.\"},{\"question\":\"Does the Legion Pro 5i have Thunderbolt?\",\"answer\":\"Yes, one Thunderbolt 4 \\/ USB4 port with DisplayPort 2.1.\"}]','[{\"label\":\"ONIN Infosys \\u2013 Lenovo Legion Pro 5i 16IAX10 (Core Ultra 9 275HX, RTX 5060, OLED)\",\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/onin.com.np\\/product\\/lenovo-legion-pro-5i-ultra-9-price-nepal\",\"accessed\":\"2026-11-23\"},{\"label\":\"GadgetByte Nepal \\u2013 Lenovo Legion Pro 5i 16IAX10 2025 (Intel Core Ultra 9 275HX)\",\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/www.gadgetbytenepal.com\\/product\\/lenovo-legion-pro-5i-16iax10-2025-intel-core-ultra-9-275hx-rtx-5060\\/\",\"accessed\":\"2026-11-23\"}]',NULL,'https://onin.com.np/product/lenovo-legion-pro-5i-ultra-9-price-nepal',0,'2024-12-31 18:15:00','2024-12-31 18:15:00'),(736,40,3,'Asus Zenbook S 16 OLED UM5606WA 2024 (Ryzen AI 9 365)','asus-zenbook-s-16-oled-um5606wa-2024-ryzen-ai-9-365-24gb-1tb-16-3k-120hz',NULL,'gadgets/2026/asus-zenbook-s-16-oled-um5606wa-2024-ryzen-ai-9-365-24gb-1tb-16-3k-120hz.webp',NULL,NULL,0.00,NULL,0,'Rs 2,54,999 last listed price in Nepal','2024-01-01','discontinued',NULL,0,0,'<p>The Asus Zenbook S 16 OLED UM5606WA 2024 (Ryzen AI 9 365) is no longer stocked in Nepal. Its last listed price was <strong>Rs 2,54,999</strong>. It launched in Nepal in 2024. We keep the full specs here for reference and for anyone checking a second-hand unit.</p>\n<p>It runs on the AMD Ryzen AI 9 365 (4nm), 10 cores / 20 threads. Screen: 16 inches, OLED, 3K (2880 x 1800 pixels), 120Hz. 16GB of memory is the right amount for a laptop you plan to keep for several years. At 1.5 kg, it is fine for occasional carrying. Battery: Li-Ion 78 Wh; 65W adapter.</p>\n<p>Buying new instead? A current ASUS alternative is the <a href=\"/products/asus-zenbook-14-oled-um3406ga\">ASUS Zenbook 14 OLED (UM3406GA)</a> (Rs 2,54,999).</p>','[{\"question\":\"Is the Asus Zenbook S 16 OLED UM5606WA 2024 (Ryzen AI 9 365) still available in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"No, it is no longer stocked. Its last listed price was Rs 2,54,999.\"},{\"question\":\"When did the Asus Zenbook S 16 OLED UM5606WA 2024 (Ryzen AI 9 365) launch in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"It launched in Nepal in 2024.\"},{\"question\":\"Which processor does the Asus Zenbook S 16 OLED UM5606WA 2024 (Ryzen AI 9 365) use?\",\"answer\":\"It uses the AMD Ryzen AI 9 365 (4nm), 10 cores \\/ 20 threads.\"}]','[{\"label\":\"GadgetByte Nepal \\u2013 Asus Zenbook S 16 OLED UM5606WA 2024 (Ryzen AI 9 365)\",\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/www.gadgetbytenepal.com\\/product\\/asus-zenbook-s-16-oled-um5606wa-2024-ryzen-ai-9-365-24gb-1tb-16-3k-120hz\\/\",\"accessed\":\"2026-11-23\"}]',NULL,NULL,0,'2023-12-31 18:15:00','2023-12-31 18:15:00'),(737,61,37,'Soundcore H30i','soundcore-h30i',NULL,'gadgets/2026/soundcore-h30i.webp',NULL,NULL,0.00,NULL,0,'Rs 3,999 last listed price in Nepal','2024-01-01','discontinued',NULL,0,0,'<p>The Soundcore H30i is no longer stocked in Nepal. Its last listed price was <strong>Rs 3,999</strong>. It launched in Nepal in 2024. We keep the full specs here for reference and for anyone checking a second-hand unit.</p>\n<p>Drivers: 40 mm dynamic drivers. Battery: Music: 70 hours; Quick charge: 5 minutes = 4 hours playback. Connectivity: Bluetooth 5.3, multipoint, Codecs: SBC, AAC.<