etByte Nepal \\u2013 boAt Rockerz 650 Pro\",\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/www.gadgetbytenepal.com\\/product\\/boat-rockerz-650-pro\\/\",\"accessed\":\"2026-11-23\"}]',NULL,NULL,0,'2026-09-16 18:15:00','2026-09-16 18:15:00'),(763,8,3,'HP Envy x360 ES0013DX 2024 (Intel Core 5 120U)','hp-envy-x360-2024-intel-core-5-120u',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,105000.00,NULL,0,NULL,'2025-01-01','available',NULL,0,0,'<p>The HP Envy x360 ES0013DX 2024 (Intel Core 5 120U) costs <strong>Rs 1,05,000</strong> in Nepal for the 8GB/512GB model. It launched in Nepal in 2025. That is mainstream money in Nepal: fine for office work, coding and study.</p>\n<p>It runs on the Intel Core 5 120U (Intel 7), 10 cores / 12 threads. Screen: 14 inches, IPS LCD, Full HD (1920 x 1080 pixels), 60Hz. 8GB of RAM is fine for study and office work but tight for heavy multitasking; check whether it can be upgraded. At 1.32 kg, it is easy to carry every day. Battery: Li-Ion 43 Wh; 65W adapter.</p>\n<p>Around the same budget, also look at the <a href=\"/products/msi-modern-15-2023-i5-1335u\">MSI Modern 15 B13M 2023</a> (Rs 1,05,000) and the <a href=\"/products/acer-travelmate-p2-14-2024-tmp214-intel-core-5-120u\">Acer TravelMate P2 14 TMP214 2024 (Intel Core 5 120U)</a> (Rs 1,07,000). You can <a href=\"/compare?category=laptop&g1=hp-envy-x360-2024-intel-core-5-120u&g2=msi-modern-15-2023-i5-1335u\">compare the HP Envy x360 ES0013DX 2024 (Intel Core 5 120U) with the MSI Modern 15 B13M 2023</a> side by side.</p>','[{\"question\":\"What is the HP Envy x360 ES0013DX 2024 (Intel Core 5 120U) price in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"The HP Envy x360 ES0013DX 2024 (Intel Core 5 120U) costs Rs 1,05,000 in Nepal.\"},{\"question\":\"When did the HP Envy x360 ES0013DX 2024 (Intel Core 5 120U) launch in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"It launched in Nepal in 2025.\"},{\"question\":\"Which processor does the HP Envy x360 ES0013DX 2024 (Intel Core 5 120U) use?\",\"answer\":\"It uses the Intel Core 5 120U (Intel 7), 10 cores \\/ 12 threads.\"}]','[{\"label\":\"G