18:15:00','2025-12-31 18:15:00'),(786,38,5,'Honor Watch X5 Play','honor-watch-x5-play',NULL,'gadgets/2026/honor-watch-x5-play.webp',NULL,NULL,7999.00,NULL,0,NULL,'2026-10-07','available',NULL,0,0,'<p>The Honor Watch X5 Play costs <strong>Rs 7,999</strong> in Nepal. It launched in Nepal on 7 October 2026. At this price it is mainly a fitness tracker with notifications and long battery life.</p>\n<p>It has a 2.01 inches, TFT LCD display. Battery: Up to 18 days (typical usage); Li-Po 450 mAh. Connectivity: Bluetooth 6.0, LE. Water resistance: IP68 dust and water resistance. It has a speaker and microphone for calls from the wrist.</p>\n<p>Around the same budget, also look at the <a href=\"/products/galaxy-fit-3\">Samsung Galaxy Fit 3</a> (Rs 7,999) and the <a href=\"/products/huawei-band-10\">Huawei Band 10</a> (Rs 7,990). You can <a href=\"/compare?category=smartwatch&g1=honor-watch-x5-play&g2=galaxy-fit-3\">compare the Honor Watch X5 Play with the Samsung Galaxy Fit 3</a> side by side.</p>','[{\"question\":\"What is the Honor Watch X5 Play price in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"The Honor Watch X5 Play costs Rs 7,999 in Nepal.\"},{\"question\":\"When did the Honor Watch X5 Play launch in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"It launched in Nepal on 7 October 2026.\"},{\"question\":\"What is the Honor Watch X5 Play battery like?\",\"answer\":\"Up to 18 days (typical usage); Li-Po 450 mAh.\"}]','[{\"label\":\"GadgetByte Nepal \\u2013 Honor Watch X5 Play\",\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/www.gadgetbytenepal.com\\/product\\/honor-watch-x5-play\\/\",\"accessed\":\"2026-11-23\"}]',NULL,NULL,0,'2026-10-06 18:15:00','2026-10-06 18:15:00'),(787,39,3,'Lenovo IdeaPad 1 14AMN7 2023 (Ryzen 5 7520U)','lenovo-ideapad-1-2023-ryzen-5',NULL,'gadgets/2026/lenovo-ideapad-1-2023-ryzen-5.webp',NULL,NULL,0.00,NULL,0,'Rs 98,999 last listed price in Nepal','2025-01-01','discontinued',NULL,0,0,'<p>The Lenovo IdeaPad 1 14AMN7 2023 (Ryzen 5 7520U) is no longer stocked in Nepal. Its last listed price was <strong>Rs 98,999</strong