-15-2023-intel-core-i5-13420h-rtx-3050-8gb-512gb-156-fhd-144hz',NULL,'gadgets/2026/hp-victus-15-2023-intel-core-i5-13420h-rtx-3050-8gb-512gb-156-fhd-144hz.webp',NULL,NULL,146499.00,NULL,0,NULL,'2025-01-01','available',NULL,0,0,'<p>The Victus 15 is HP\'s entry ticket to gaming, and its understated design is a big part of the appeal. It looks like a normal laptop in a classroom or office, then runs Valorant, CS2 and Fortnite at high frame rates in the evening. ONIN Infosys sells this configuration for <strong>Rs 1,46,499</strong>.</p>\n<p>It has an 8-core <strong>Core i5-13420H</strong> (up to 4.6GHz), an <strong>RTX 3050 6GB</strong>, <strong>16GB of DDR4-3200</strong> and a 512GB PCIe Gen 4 SSD. The 15.6-inch FHD IPS panel runs at <strong>144Hz</strong> at 300 nits, though its 62.5% sRGB coverage means colours are a little muted. Ports include USB-C, two USB-A, HDMI and a full-size SD card reader. The battery is 52.5Wh, and it weighs about 2.3 kg.</p>\n<p>It\'s priced close to the <a href=\"/products/lenovo-loq-15-15ahp9-2024-ryzen-7-7445hs\">Lenovo LOQ 15AHP9</a>, which has a 100% sRGB screen and a 95W RTX 3050. That\'s the stronger gaming machine. Buy the Victus if you prefer its quieter look, or if the extra Rs 21,000 for the <a href=\"/products/hp-victus-15-i5-13420h-rtx-4050\">RTX 4050 Victus</a> is out of reach.</p>','[{\"question\":\"What is the HP Victus 15 RTX 3050 price in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"ONIN Infosys sells the HP Victus 15 (2023) with Core i5-13420H, RTX 3050 6GB, 16GB RAM and 512GB SSD for Rs 1,46,499.\"},{\"question\":\"What refresh rate is the Victus 15 screen?\",\"answer\":\"144Hz on a 15.6-inch Full HD IPS panel.\"},{\"question\":\"Does the HP Victus 15 have an SD card reader?\",\"answer\":\"Yes, a multi-format SD card reader.\"}]','[{\"label\":\"ONIN Infosys \\u2013 HP Victus 15 (Core i5-13420H, RTX 3050 6GB)\",\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/onin.com.np\\/product\\/hp-victus-15-i5-13th-gen-rtx-3050-6gb-price-nepal\",\"accessed\":\"2026-11-23\"},{\"label\":\"GadgetByte Nepal \\u2013 HP Victus 15 FA1093DX 2023 (Intel Core i5-13420H)\",\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/www.gadgetbytenepal.com\\/product\\/hp-victus-15-2023-intel-core-i5-13420h-rtx-3050-8gb-512gb-156-fhd-144hz\\/\",\"accessed\":\"2026-11-23\"}]',NULL,'https://onin.com.np/product/hp-victus-15-i5-13th-gen-rtx-3050-6gb-price-nepal',0,'2024-12-31 18:15:00','2024-12-31 18:15:00'),(812,40,3,'Asus Zenbook 14 OLED UM3406HA 2024 (Ryzen 7 8840HS)','asus-zenbook-14-2024-oled-ryzen-7-8840hs',NULL,'gadgets/2026/asus-zenbook-14-2024-oled-ryzen-7-8840hs.webp',NULL,NULL,0.00,NULL,0,'Rs 1,74,999 last listed price in Nepal','2025-05-25','discontinued',NULL,0,0,'<p>The Asus Zenbook 14 OLED UM3406HA 2024 (Ryzen 7 8840HS) is no longer stocked in Nepal. Its last listed price was <strong>Rs 1,74,999</strong>. It launched in Nepal on 25 May 2025. We keep the full specs here for reference and for anyone checking a second-hand unit.</p>\n<p>It runs on the AMD Ryzen 7 8840HS (4nm), 8 cores / 16 threads. Screen: 14 inches, OLED, WUXGA (1920 x 1200 pixels), 120Hz. 16GB of memory is the right amount for a laptop you plan to keep for several years. At 1.2 kg, it is easy to carry every day. Battery: Li-Ion 75 Wh; 65W adapter.</p>\n<p>Buying new instead? A current ASUS alternative is the <a href=\"/products/asus-vivobook-14-x1405va-2023\">Asus Vivobook 14 X1405VA 2023 (Intel Core i7-13620H)</a> (Rs 1,74,900).</p>','[{\"question\":\"Is the Asus Zenbook 14 OLED UM3406HA 2024 (Ryzen 7 8840HS) still available in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"No, it is no longer stocked. Its last listed price was Rs 1,74,999.\"},{\"question\":\"When did the Asus Zenbook 14 OLED UM3406HA 2024 (Ryzen 7 8840HS) launch in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"It launched in Nepal on 25 May 2025.\"},{\"question\":\"Which processor does the Asus Zenbook 14 OLED UM3406HA 2024 (Ryzen 7 8840HS) use?\",\"answer\":\"It uses the AMD Ryzen 7 8840HS (4nm), 8 cores \\/ 16 threads.\"}]','[{\"label\":\"GadgetByte Nepal \\u2013 Asus Zenbook 14 OLED UM3406HA 2024 (Ryzen 7 8840HS)\",\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/www.gadgetbytenepal.com\\/product\\/asus-zenbook-14-2024-oled-ryzen-7-8840hs\\/\",\"accessed\":\"2026-11-23\"}]',NULL,NULL,0,'2025-05-24 18:15:00','2025-05-24 18:15:00'),(813,40,3,'Asus Vivobook Go E1504 2025 (Ryzen 3 30)','asus-vivobook-go-e1504-2025-ryzen-3-30',NULL,'gadgets/2026/asus-vivobook-go-e1504-2025-ryzen-3-30.webp',NULL,NULL,93900.00,NULL,0,NULL,'2026-01-01','available',NULL,0,0,'<p>The Asus Vivobook Go E1504 2025 (Ryzen 3 30) costs <strong>Rs 93,900</strong> in Nepal for the 8GB/512GB model. It launched in Nepal in 2026. That is mainstream money in Nepal: fine for office work, coding and study.</p>\n<p>It runs on the AMD Ryzen 3 30 (6nm), 4 cores / 8 threads. Screen: 15.6 inches, IPS LCD, Full HD (1920 x 1080 pixels), 60Hz. 8GB of RAM is fine for study and office work but tight for heavy multitasking; check whether it can be upgraded. At 1.63 kg, it is fine for occasional carrying. Battery: Li-Ion 42 Wh; 45W adapter.</p>\n<p>Around the same budget, also look at the <a href=\"/products/asus-vivobook-14-x1405vap-2024\">Asus Vivobook 14 X1405VAP 2024 (Intel Core 5 120U)</a> (Rs 93,000) and the <a href=\"/products/msi-modern-14-2024-intel-core-7-150u\">MSI Modern 14 F1MG 2024</a> (Rs 93,000). You can <a href=\"/compare?category=laptop&g1=asus-vivobook-go-e1504-2025-ryzen-3-30&g2=asus-vivobook-14-x1405vap-2024\">compare the Asus Vivobook Go E1504 2025 (Ryzen 3 30) with the Asus Vivobook 14 X1405VAP 2024 (Intel Core 5 120U)</a> side by side.</p>','[{\"question\":\"What is the Asus Vivobook Go E1504 2025 (Ryzen 3 30) price in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"The Asus Vivobook Go E1504 2025 (Ryzen 3 30) costs Rs 93,900 in Nepal.\"},{\"question\":\"When did the Asus Vivobook Go E1504 2025 (Ryzen 3 30) launch in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"It launched in Nepal in 2026.\"},{\"question\":\"Which processor does the Asus Vivobook Go E1504 2025 (Ryzen 3 30) use?\",\"answer\":\"It uses the AMD Ryzen 3 30 (6nm), 4 cores \\/ 8 threads.\"}]','[