\\/\\/www.gadgetbytenepal.com\\/product\\/asus-vivobook-s-16-oled-m5606ka-2025-ryzen-ai-5-340-16gb-512gb-16-3k-oled\\/\",\"accessed\":\"2026-11-23\"}]',NULL,NULL,0,'2024-12-31 18:15:00','2024-12-31 18:15:00'),(815,38,5,'Honor Watch X5i','honor-watch-x5i',NULL,'gadgets/2026/honor-watch-x5i.webp',NULL,NULL,8999.00,NULL,0,NULL,'2026-08-25','available',NULL,0,0,'<p>The Honor Watch X5i costs <strong>Rs 8,999</strong> in Nepal for the Defult model. It launched in Nepal on 25 August 2026. At this price it is mainly a fitness tracker with notifications and long battery life.</p>\n<p>It has a 1.97 inches, AMOLED display. Battery: Up to 21 days (typical usage) / Up to 6 days (AOD); Li-Po 420 mAh. Connectivity: Bluetooth 5.4. Water resistance: 1 ATM water resistant. It has a speaker and microphone for calls from the wrist.</p>\n<p>Around the same budget, also look at the <a href=\"/products/huawei-band-11\">Huawei Band 11</a> (Rs 9,990) and the <a href=\"/products/honor-watch-x5-play\">Honor Watch X5 Play</a> (Rs 7,999). You can <a href=\"/compare?category=smartwatch&g1=honor-watch-x5i&g2=huawei-band-11\">compare the Honor Watch X5i with the Huawei Band 11</a> side by side.</p>','[{\"question\":\"What is the Honor Watch X5i price in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"The Honor Watch X5i costs Rs 8,999 in Nepal.\"},{\"question\":\"When did the Honor Watch X5i launch in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"It launched in Nepal on 25 August 2026.\"},{\"question\":\"What is the Honor Watch X5i battery like?\",\"answer\":\"Up to 21 days (typical usage) \\/ Up to 6 days (AOD); Li-Po 420 mAh.\"}]','[{\"label\":\"GadgetByte Nepal \\u2013 Honor Watch X5i\",\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/www.gadgetbytenepal.com\\/product\\/honor-watch-x5i\\/\",\"accessed\":\"2026-11-23\"}]',NULL,NULL,0,'2026-08-24 18:15:00','2026-08-24 18:15:00'),(816,43,5,'Huawei Watch Fit 5 Pro','huawei-watch-fit-5-pro',NULL,'gadgets/2026/huawei-watch-fit-5-pro.webp',NULL,NULL,43990.00,NULL,0,NULL,'2026-08-16','available',NULL,0,0,'<p>The Huawei Watch Fit 5 Pro costs <strong>Rs 43,990</strong> in Nepal. It launched in Nepal on 16 August 2026. This is a premium watch, so expect accurate GPS, better health sensors and a tougher build.</p>\n<p>It has a 1.92 inches, AMOLED display. Battery: Up to 7 days (normal usage), Up to 10 days (low power mode); Li-Ion 471 mAh. Connectivity: Bluetooth 6.0, LE, GPS: Yes, with A-GPS (L1+L5), BDS (B1I+B1C+B2a), Galileo (E1+E5a), Glonass, NavIC, QZSS (L1+L5), NFC. Water resistance: 5 ATM water resistance, IP6X dust resistance. It has a speaker and microphone for calls from the wrist.</p>\n<p>Around the same budget, also look at the <a href=\"/products/huawei-watch-gt-7\">Huawei Watch GT 7</a> (Rs 44,990) and the <a href=\"/products/samsung-galaxy-watch-6\">Samsung Galaxy Watch 6</a> (Rs 44,999). You can <a href=\"/compare?category=smartwatch&g1=huawei-watch-fit-5-pro&g2=huawei-watch-gt-7\">compare the Huawei Watch Fit 5 Pro with the Huawei Watch GT 7</a> side by side.</p>','[{\"question\":\"What is the Huawei Watch Fit 5 Pro price in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"The Huawei Watch Fit 5 Pro costs Rs 43,990 in Nepal.\"},{\"question\":\"When did the Huawei Watch Fit 5 Pro launch in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"It launched in Nepal on 16 August 2026.\"},{\"question\":\"What is the Huawei Watch Fit 5 Pro battery like?\",\"answer\":\"Up to 7 days (normal usage), Up to 10 days (low power mode); Li-Ion 471 mAh.\"}]','[{\"label\":\"GadgetByte Nepal \\u2013 Huawei Watch Fit 5 Pro\",\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/www.gadgetbytenepal.com\\/product\\/huawei-watch-fit-5-pro\\/\",\"accessed\":\"2026-11-23\"}]',NULL,NULL,0,'2026-08-15 18:15:00','2026-08-15 18:15:00'),(817,43,5,'Huawei Watch Fit 4 Pro','huawei-watch-fit-4-pro',NULL,'gadgets/2026/huawei-watch-fit-4-pro.webp',NULL,NULL,38990.00,NULL,0,NULL,'2025-06-06','available',NULL,0,0,'<p>The Huawei Watch Fit 4 Pro costs <strong>Rs 38,990</strong> in Nepal. It launched in Nepal on 6 June 2025. This is a premium watch, so expect accurate GPS, better health sensors and a tougher build.</p>\n<p>It has a 1.82 inches, AMOLED display. Battery: Up to 7 days (normal usage), Up to 10 days (low power mode); Li-Ion 400 mAh. Connectivity: Bluetooth 5.2, GPS: Yes, with A-GPS (L1+L5), BDS (L1+L5), Galileo (L1+L5), Glonass, QZSS (L1+L5), NFC. Water resistance: IP6X dust resistance, 5 ATM water resistance, EN13319 dive compliance. It has a speaker and microphone for calls from the wrist.</p>\n<p>Around the same budget, also look at the <a href=\"/products/xiaomi-watch-s5\">Xiaomi Watch S5</a> (Rs 39,999) and the <a href=\"/products/amazfit-cheetah\">Amazfit Cheetah</a> (Rs 36,999). You can <a href=\"/compare?category=smartwatch&g1=huawei-watch-fit-4-pro&g2=xiaomi-watch-s5\">compare the Huawei Watch Fit 4 Pro with the Xiaomi Watch S5</a> side by side.</p>','[{\"question\":\"What is the Huawei Watch Fit 4 Pro price in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"The Huawei Watch Fit 4 Pro costs Rs 38,990 in Nepal.\"},{\"question\":\"When did the Huawei Watch Fit 4 Pro launch in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"It launched in Nepal on 6 June 2025.\"},{\"question\":\"What is the Huawei Watch Fit 4 Pro battery like?\",\"answer\":\"Up to 7 days (normal usage), Up to 10 days (low power mode); Li-Ion 400 mAh.\"}]','[{\"label\":\"GadgetByte Nepal \\u2013 Huawei Watch Fit 4 Pro\",\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/www.gadgetbytenepal.com\\/product\\/huawei-watch-fit-4-pro\\/\",\"accessed\":\"2026-11-23\"}]',NULL,NULL,0,'2025-06-05 18:15:00','2025-06-05 18:15:00'),(818,43,5,'Huawei Band 11 Pro','huawei-band-11-pro',NULL,'gadgets/2026/huawei-band-11-pro.webp',NULL,NULL,14990.00,NULL,0,NULL,'2026-04-15','available',NULL,0,0,'<p>The Huawei Band 11 Pro costs <strong>Rs 14,990</strong> in Nepal. It launched in Nepal on 15 April 2026. It sits in the mid-range, where AMOLED screens and built-in GPS become common.</p>\n<p>It has a 1.62 inches, AMOLED display. Battery: Up to 8 days (normal usage), Up to 14 days (low power mode). Connectivity: Bluetooth 6.0, GPS: Yes, with GNSS tracking. Water resistance: 5 ATM wat