 is the Huawei Band 11 price in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"The Huawei Band 11 starts at Rs 9,990 in Nepal. All variants: Rs 9,990 for Durable Polymer; Rs 11,990 for Aluminium Alloy.\"},{\"question\":\"When did the Huawei Band 11 launch in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"It launched in Nepal on 15 April 2026.\"},{\"question\":\"What is the Huawei Band 11 battery like?\",\"answer\":\"Up to 8 days (normal usage), Up to 14 days (low power mode).\"}]','[{\"label\":\"GadgetByte Nepal \\u2013 Huawei Band 11\",\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/www.gadgetbytenepal.com\\/product\\/huawei-band-11\\/\",\"accessed\":\"2026-11-23\"}]',NULL,NULL,0,'2026-04-14 18:15:00','2026-04-14 18:15:00'),(820,41,3,'Acer Nitro V 15 ANV15-52-57DY 2025 (Intel Core 5 210H)','acer-nitro-v-15-anv15-52-57dy-2025-intel-core-5-210h-rtx-5050',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,182400.00,NULL,0,NULL,'2026-01-01','available',NULL,0,0,'<p>The Acer Nitro V 15 ANV15-52-57DY 2025 (Intel Core 5 210H) costs <strong>Rs 1,82,400</strong> in Nepal for the 16GB/512GB model. It launched in Nepal in 2026. At this price you should get a premium build, a better screen and enough memory to last years.</p>\n<p>It runs on the Intel Core 5 210H (Intel 7), 8 cores / 12 threads. Screen: 15.6 inches, IPS LCD, FHD (1920 x 1080 pixels), 165Hz. 16GB of memory is the right amount for a laptop you plan to keep for several years. At 2.1 kg, it is best kept on a desk. Battery: Li-Ion 57.5 Wh; 135W adapter.</p>\n<p>Around the same budget, also look at the <a href=\"/products/lenovo-loq-2024-i5-12450hx-rtx-2050\">Lenovo LOQ 15IAX9 2024 (Intel i5-12450HX)</a> (Rs 1,81,900) and the <a href=\"/products/asus-tuf-gaming-a16-fa607nuq-rl063ws-2026-ryzen-7-170-rtx-4050\">Asus TUF Gaming A16 FA607NUQ-RL063WS 2026 (Ryzen 7 170)</a> (Rs 1,83,999). You can <a href=\"/compare?category=laptop&g1=acer-nitro-v-15-anv15-52-57dy-2025-intel-core-5-210h-rtx-5050&g2=lenovo-loq-2024-i5-12450hx-rtx-2050\">compare the Acer Nitro V 15 ANV15-52-57DY 2025 (Intel Core 5 210H) with the Lenovo LOQ 15IAX9 