o 2 with the CMF Watch Pro 2</a> side by side.</p>','[{\"question\":\"What is the MWC Callisto Watch Pro 2 price in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"The MWC Callisto Watch Pro 2 costs Rs 11,999 in Nepal.\"}]','[{\"label\":\"GadgetByte Nepal \\u2013 MWC Callisto Watch Pro 2\",\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/www.gadgetbytenepal.com\\/product\\/mwc-callisto-watch-pro-2\\/\",\"accessed\":\"2026-11-23\"}]',NULL,NULL,0,'2026-01-31 18:15:00','2026-01-31 18:15:00'),(823,64,5,'MWC Aether One Watch Pro','mwc-aether-one-watch-pro',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,6999.00,NULL,0,NULL,'2026-02-24','available',NULL,0,0,'<p>The MWC Aether One Watch Pro costs <strong>Rs 6,999</strong> in Nepal. It was announced on 24 February 2026. At this price it is mainly a fitness tracker with notifications and long battery life.</p>\n<p>It has a 1.43 inches, AMOLED display. Connectivity: GPS: Yes, with GPS. Water resistance: 5 ATM water resistance. It has a speaker and microphone for calls from the wrist.</p>\n<p>Around the same budget, also look at the <a href=\"/products/ultima-watch-navigator\">Ultima Watch Navigator</a> (Rs 6,999) and the <a href=\"/products/boat-enigma-radiant\">boAt Enigma Radiant</a> (Rs 6,799). You can <a href=\"/compare?category=smartwatch&g1=mwc-aether-one-watch-pro&g2=ultima-watch-navigator\">compare the MWC Aether One Watch Pro with the Ultima Watch Navigator</a> side by side.</p>','[{\"question\":\"What is the MWC Aether One Watch Pro price in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"The MWC Aether One Watch Pro costs Rs 6,999 in Nepal.\"}]','[{\"label\":\"GadgetByte Nepal \\u2013 MWC Aether One Watch Pro\",\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/www.gadgetbytenepal.com\\/product\\/mwc-aether-one-watch-pro\\/\",\"accessed\":\"2026-11-23\"}]',NULL,NULL,0,'2026-02-23 18:15:00','2026-02-23 18:15:00'),(824,9,3,'Dell Wyse 5470 2022 (Intel Celeron N4100)','dell-wyse-5470-2022-celeron-n4100',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,58999.00,NULL,0,NULL,'2023-01-01','available',NULL,0,0,'<p>The Dell Wyse 5470 2022 (Intel Celeron N4100) costs <strong>Rs 58,999</strong> in Nepal for the 8GB/256GB model. It launched in Nepal in 2023. It is built for documents, browsing, online classes and video calls rather than editing or gaming.</p>\n<p>It runs on the Intel Celeron N4100 (14nm), 4 cores / 4 threads. Screen: 14 inches, IPS LCD, FHD (1920 x 1080 pixels), 60Hz. 8GB of RAM is fine for study and office work but tight for heavy multitasking; check whether it can be upgraded. At 1.79 kg, it is fine for occasional carrying. Battery: Li-Ion 42 Wh; 65W adapter.</p>\n<p>Around the same budget, also look at the <a href=\"/products/hp-notebook-14-em0002wm-2023-amd-athlon-silver-7120u\">HP Notebook 14-em0002wm 2023 (AMD Athlon Silver 7120U)</a> (Rs 54,999) and the <a href=\"/products/lenovo-ideapad-slim-3-15ian8-2023-intel-n100\">Lenovo IdeaPad Slim 3 15IAN8 2023</a> (Rs 54,999). You can <a href=\"/compare?category=laptop&g1=dell-wyse-5470-2022-celeron-n4100&g2=hp-notebook-14-em0002wm-2023-amd-athlon-silver-7120u\">compare the Dell Wyse 5470 2022 (Intel Celeron N4100) with the HP Notebook 14-em0002wm 2023 (AMD Athlon Silver 7120U)</a> side by side.</p>','[{\"question\":\"What is the Dell Wyse 5470 2022 (Intel Celeron N4100) price in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"The Dell Wyse 5470 2022 (Intel Celeron N4100) costs Rs 58,999 in Nepal.\"},{\"question\":\"When did the Dell Wyse 5470 2022 (Intel Celeron N4100) launch in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"It launched in Nepal in 2023.\"},{\"question\":\"Which processor does the Dell Wyse 5470 2022 (Intel Celeron N4100) use?\",\"answer\":\"It uses the Intel Celeron N4100 (14nm), 4 cores \\/ 4 threads.\"}]','[{\"label\":\"GadgetByte Nepal \\u2013 Dell Wyse 5470 2022 (Intel Celeron N4100)\",\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/www.gadgetbytenepal.com\\/product\\/dell-wyse-5470-2022-celeron-n4100\\/\",\"accessed\":\"2026-11-23\"}]',NULL,NULL,0,'2022-12-31 18:15:00','2022-12-31 18:15:00'),(825,40,3,'ASUS TUF Gaming A16 FA607NUQ (Ryzen 7 170, RTX 4050)','asus-tuf-gaming-a16-fa607nuq-rl063ws-2026-ryzen-7-170-rtx-4050',NULL,'gadgets/2026/asus-tuf-gaming-a16-fa607nuq-rl063ws-2026-ryzen-7-170-rtx-4050.webp',NULL,NULL,194499.00,NULL,0,NULL,'2026-01-01','available',NULL,0,0,'<p>The TUF A16 is a 16-inch gaming laptop that\'s easy to live with. It has a taller 16:10 screen for work, a USB4 port and lots of upgrade room. ONIN Infosys sells the FA607NUQ for <strong>Rs 1,94,499</strong>.</p>\n<p>The <strong>Ryzen 7 170</strong> is a proper 8-core, 16-thread chip (up to 4.75GHz), so streaming, recording gameplay and video exports don\'t stall. ONIN lists the <strong>RTX 4050 6GB</strong> at up to 140W, a generous power budget for this GPU, which helps it sustain frame rates in long sessions. Expect 1080p high settings in most games with DLSS.</p>\n<p>The upgrade story is excellent. There are <strong>two SO-DIMM slots</strong> (16GB DDR5 now, up to 64GB) and <strong>two M.2 slots</strong>, so adding a second SSD for your game library is easy. Ports include USB4 with DisplayPort and charging, a 10Gbps USB-C, two USB-A and HDMI 2.1. The keyboard has RGB lighting and a Copilot key. The 56Wh battery is average, and the webcam is only 720p.</p>\n<p>If you want the newer RTX 50-series for similar money, the <a href=\"/products/asus-tuf-f16-fx608-i5-14450hx-rtx-5050\">TUF F16 with RTX 5050</a> has 8GB of VRAM and a 1080p webcam.</p>','[{\"question\":\"What is the ASUS TUF A16 FA607NUQ price in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"ONIN Infosys sells the TUF A16 FA607NUQ with Ryzen 7 170, RTX 4050 6GB, 16GB DDR5 and 512GB SSD for Rs 1,94,499.\"},{\"question\":\"How much can the TUF A16 be upgraded?\",\"answer\":\"It has two SO-DIMM slots (up to 64GB DDR5) and two M.2 PCIe slots for storage.\"},{\"question\":\"Does the TUF A16 have USB4?\",\"answer\":\"Yes, one USB4 Type-C port with DisplayPort and power delivery support.\"}]','[{\"label\":\"ONIN Infosys \\u2013 ASUS TUF Gaming A16 FA607NUQ (Ryzen 7 170, RTX 4050)\",\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/onin.com.np\\/product\\/asus-tuf-gaming-a16-fa607nuq-ryzen-7-rtx-4050-price-nepal\",\"accessed\":\"2026-11-23\"},{\"label\":\"GadgetByte Nepal \\u2013 Asus TUF Gaming A16 FA607NUQ-RL063WS 2026 (Ryzen 7 170)\",\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/www.gadgetbytenepal.com\\/product\\/asus-tuf-gaming-a16-fa607nuq-rl063ws-2026-ryzen-7-170-rtx-4050\\/\",\"accessed\":\"2026-11-23\"}]',NULL,'https://onin.com.np/product/asus-tuf-gaming-a16-fa607nuq-ryzen-7-rtx-4050-price-nepal',0,'2025-12-31 18:15:00','2025-12-31 18:15:00'),(826,61,37,'Soundcore Q20i','soundcore-q20i',NULL,'gadgets/2026/soundcore-q20i.webp',NULL,NULL,9199.00,NULL,0,NULL,'2023-01-01','available',NULL,0,0,'<p>The Soundcore Q20i costs <strong>Rs 9,199</strong> in Nepal. It launched in Nepal in 2023. At this price, expect comfortable everyday listening rather than audiophile detail.</p>\n<p>Drivers: 40 mm dynamic drivers. Battery: Music: 40 hours, With ANC on, 60 hours, With ANC off; 2 hours, Quick charge: 5 minutes = 4 hours playback. Connectivity: Bluetooth 5.3, multipoint, Codecs: SBC, AAC.</p>\n<p>Around the same budget, also look at the <a href=\"/products/jbl-tune-530c\">JBL Tune 530C</a> (Rs 9,499) and the <a href=\"/products/jbl-tune-530bt\">JBL Tune 530BT</a> (Rs 9,500). You can <a href=\"/compare?category=headphones&g1=soundcore-q20i&g2=jbl-tune-530c\">compare the Soundcore Q20i with the JBL Tune 530C</a> side by side.</p>','[{\"question\":\"What is the Soundcore Q20i price in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"The Soundcore Q20i costs Rs 9,199 in Nepal.\"},{\"question\":\"When did the Soundcore Q20i launch in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"It launched in Nepal in 2023.\"},{\"question\":\"What is the Soundcore Q20i battery like?\",\"answer\":\"Music: 40 hours, With ANC on, 60 hours, With ANC off; 2 hours, Quick charge: 5 minutes = 4 hours playback.\"}]','[{\"label\":\"GadgetByte Nepal \\u2013 Soundcore Q20i\",\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/www.gadgetbytenepal.com\\/product\\/soundcore-q20i\\/\",\"accessed\":\"2026-11-23\"}]',NULL,NULL,0,'2022-12-31 18:15:00','2022-12-31 18:15:00'),(827,61,37,'Soundcore Q11i','soundcore-q11i',NULL,'gadgets/20