3 (13th Gen i5-13420H) use?\",\"answer\":\"It uses the Intel Core i5-13420H, 8 cores \\/ 12 threads.\"}]','[{\"label\":\"GadgetByte Nepal \\u2013 HP Victus 15 2023 (13th Gen i5-13420H)\",\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/www.gadgetbytenepal.com\\/product\\/hp-victus-15-2023-13th-gen-i5-13420h-rtx-4050\\/\",\"accessed\":\"2026-11-23\"}]',NULL,NULL,0,'2021-12-31 18:15:00','2021-12-31 18:15:00'),(848,39,3,'Lenovo IdeaPad Slim 3 15AHP10 2025 (Ryzen 7 8840HS)','lenovo-ideapad-slim-3-15ahp10-2025-ryzen-7-8840hs-16gb-512gb-153-wuxga',NULL,'gadgets/2026/lenovo-ideapad-slim-3-15ahp10-2025-ryzen-7-8840hs-16gb-512gb-153-wuxga.webp',NULL,NULL,131999.00,NULL,0,NULL,'2026-01-01','available',NULL,0,0,'<p>The Lenovo IdeaPad Slim 3 15AHP10 2025 (Ryzen 7 8840HS) costs <strong>Rs 1,31,999</strong> in Nepal for the 16GB/512GB model. It launched in Nepal in 2026. That is mainstream money in Nepal: fine for office work, coding and study.</p>\n<p>It runs on the AMD Ryzen 7 8840HS (4nm), 8 cores / 16 threads. Screen: 15.3 inches, IPS LCD, WUXGA (1900 x 1200 pixels), 60Hz. 16GB of memory is the right amount for a laptop you plan to keep for several years. At 1.59 kg, it is fine for occasional carrying. Battery: Li-Ion 50 Wh; 65W adapter.</p>\n<p>Around the same budget, also look at the <a href=\"/products/dell-inspiron-14-5441-2024-snapdragon-x-plus-x1p-42-100\">Dell Inspiron 14 5441 2024 (Snapdragon X Plus X1P-42-100)</a> (Rs 1,31,999) and the <a href=\"/products/acer-swift-lite-14-sfl14-41m-r4qm-2025-amd-ryzen-7-260\">Acer Swift Lite 14 SFL14-41M-R4QM 2025 (Ryzen 7 260)</a> (Rs 1,32,999). You can <a href=\"/compare?category=laptop&g1=lenovo-ideapad-slim-3-15ahp10-2025-ryzen-7-8840hs-16gb-512gb-153-wuxga&g2=dell-inspiron-14-5441-2024-snapdragon-x-plus-x1p-42-100\">compare the Lenovo IdeaPad Slim 3 15AHP10 2025 (Ryzen 7 8840HS) with the Dell Inspiron 14 5441 2024 (Snapdragon X Plus X1P-42-100)</a> side by side.</p>','[{\"question\":\"What is the Lenovo IdeaPad Slim 3 15AHP10 2025 (Ryzen 7 8840HS) price in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"The Lenovo IdeaPad Slim 3 15AHP10 2025 (Ryzen 7 8840HS) costs Rs 1,31,999 in Nepal.\"},{\"question\":\"When did the Lenovo IdeaPad Slim 3 15AHP10 2025 (Ryzen 7 8840HS) launch in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"It launched in Nepal in 2026.\"},{\"question\":\"Which processor does the Lenovo IdeaPad Slim 3 15AHP10 2025 (Ryzen 7 8840HS) use?\",\"answer\":\"It uses the AMD Ryzen 7 8840HS (4nm), 8 cores \\/ 16 threads.\"}]','[{\"label\":\"GadgetByte Nepal \\u2013 Lenovo IdeaPad Slim 3 15AHP10 2025 (Ryzen 7 8840HS)\",\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/www.gadgetbytenepal.com\\/product\\/lenovo-ideapad-slim-3-15ahp10-2025-ryzen-7-8840hs-16gb-512gb-153-wuxga\\/\",\"accessed\":\"2026-11-23\"}]',NULL,NULL,0,'2025-12-31 18:15:00','2025-12-31 18:15:00'),(849,9,3,'Dell 16 DC16255 2025 (Ryzen 7 250)','dell-16-dc16255-2025-ryzen-7-250-16gb-1tb-16-fhd',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,134999.00,NULL,0,NULL,'2025-01-01','available',NULL,0,0,'<p>The Dell 16 DC16255 2025 (Ryzen 7 250) costs <strong>Rs 1,34,999</strong> in Nepal for the 16GB/512GB model. It launched in Nepal in 2025. That is mainstream money in Nepal: fine for office work, coding and study.</p>\n<p>It runs on the AMD Ryzen 7 250 (4nm), 8 cores / 16 threads. Screen: 16 inches, IPS LCD, FHD+ (1920 x 1200 pixels), 60Hz. 16GB of memory is the right amount for a laptop you plan to keep for several years. At 1.98 kg, it is fine for occasional carrying. Battery: Li-Ion 54 Wh; 65W adapter, Supports ExpressCharge.</p>\n<p>Around the same budget, also look at the <a href=\"/products/macbook-neo\">Apple MacBook Neo</a> (Rs 1,34,999) and the <a href=\"/products/dell-xps-13-2026\">Dell XPS 13 (2026)</a> (Rs 1,34,999). You can <a href=\"/compare?category=laptop&g1=dell-16-dc16255-2025-ryzen-7-250-16gb-1tb-16-fhd&g2=macbook-neo\">compare the Dell 16 DC16255 2025 (Ryzen 7 250) with the Apple MacBook Neo</a> side by side.</p>','[{\"question\":\"What is the Dell 16 DC16255 2025 (Ryzen 7 250) price in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"The Dell 16 DC16255 2025 (Ryzen 7 250) costs Rs 1,34,999 in Nepal.\"},{\"question\":\"When did the Dell 16 DC16255 2025 (Ryzen 7 250) launch in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"It launched in Nepal in 2025.\"},{\"question\":\"Which processor does the Dell 16 DC16255 2025 (Ryzen 7 250) use?\",\"answer\":\"It uses the AMD Ryzen 7 250 (4nm), 8 cores \\/ 16 threads.\"}]','[{\"label\":\"GadgetByte Nepal \\u2013 Dell 16 DC16255 2025 (Ryzen 7 250)\",\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/www.gadgetbytenepal.com\\/product\\/dell-16-dc16255-2025-ryzen-7-250-16gb-1tb-16-fhd\\/\",\"accessed\":\"2026-11-23\"}]',NULL,NULL,0,'2024-12-31 18:15:00','2024-12-31 18:15:00'),(850,41,3,'Acer Aspire 14 AI (Core Ultra 5 226V, 16GB/1TB, Touch)','acer-aspire-14-ai-a14-52m-51s1-2025-intel-core-ultra-5-226v-16gb-512tb-14-wuxga-touch',NULL,'gadgets/2026/acer-aspire-14-ai-a14-52m-51s1-2025-intel-core-ultra-5-226v-16gb-512tb-14-wuxga-touch.webp',NULL,NULL,126499.00,NULL,0,NULL,'2025-01-01','available',NULL,0,0,'<p>The Aspire 14 AI is one of the most affordable <strong>Lunar Lake</strong> laptops in Nepal, and Lunar Lake is all about <strong>battery life</strong>. Intel\'s <strong>Core Ultra 5 226V</strong> has 8 cores, a 40 TOPS NPU (so it\'s a Copilot+ PC), and Arc 130V graphics, with 16GB of very fast LPDDR5X-8533 built into the chip package. ONIN Infosys sells the A14-52MT-59DP in Steel Grey for <strong>Rs 1,26,499</strong>, with a <strong>1TB</strong> SSD.</p>\n<p>Combined with a <strong>65Wh battery</strong>, that efficiency translates into long unplugged days of office work, browsing and video. The 14-inch WUXGA IPS screen is a <strong>touchscreen</strong> with a matte ComfyView finish, a rare combination that reduces reflections while still letting you tap and scroll. There are two <strong>USB4</strong> ports for fast storage and docking, plus two USB-A and HDMI. It weighs about 1.4 kg.</p>\n<p>The memory can\'t be upgraded, but 16GB at this speed is comfortable for its intended use. For much more power in the same chassis, the <a href=\"/products/acer-aspire-14-ai-a14-52mt-94h5-2025-intel-core-ultra-9-288v-32gb-1tb-14-wuxga-touch\">Aspire 14 AI with Core Ultra 9 288V and 32GB</a> costs about Rs 60,000 more.</p>','[{\"question\":\"What is the Acer Aspire 14 AI Core Ultra 5 226V price in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"ONIN Infosys sells the Aspire 14 AI A14-52MT-59DP with Core Ultra 5 226V, 16GB LPDDR5X and 1TB SSD for Rs 1,26,499.\"},{\"question\":\"Is the Acer Aspire 14 AI a Copilot+ PC?\",\"answer\":\"Yes. The Core Ultra 5 226V\'s NPU delivers up to 40 TOPS, which meets the Copilot+ requirement.\"},{\"question\":\"Is the Aspire 14 AI a touchscreen?\",\"answer\":\"Yes, it has a 14-inch WUXGA IPS touchscreen with a matte finish.\"}]','[{\"label\":\"ONIN Infosys \\u2013 Acer Aspire 14 AI (Core Ultra 5 226V, 16GB\\/1TB, Touch)\",\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/onin.com.np\\/product\\/acer-aspire-14-ai-a14-52mt-59dp-price-nepal\",\"accessed\":\"2026-11-23\"},{\"label\":\"GadgetByte Nepal \\u2013 Acer Aspire 14 AI A14-52M-51S1 2025 (Intel Core Ultra 5 226V)\",\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/www.gadgetbytenepal.com\\/product\\/acer-aspire-14-ai-a14-52m-51s1-2025-intel-core-ultra-5-226v-16gb-512tb-14-wuxga-touch\\/\",\"accessed\":\"2026-11-23\"}]',NULL,'https://onin.com.np/product/acer-aspire-14-ai-a14-52mt-59dp-price-nepal',0,'2024-12-31 18:15:00','2024-12-31 18:15:00'),(851,2,4,'AirPods 4','airpods-4',NULL,'gadgets/2026/airpods-4.webp',NULL,NULL,24999.00,NULL,0,NULL,'2024-11-06','available',NULL,0,0,'<p>The AirPods 4 costs <strong>Rs 24,999</strong> in Nepal. The with ANC version costs Rs 34,999. It launched in Nepal on 6 November 2024. At this price you are paying for strong noise cancellation, better tuning and premium features.</p>\n<p>Drivers: Custom high-excursion Apple driver. Battery: Music: 5 hours (buds) / 30 hours (case), With ANC off; Quick charge: 5 minutes = 1 hour playback. Connectivity: Bluetooth 5.3, Codecs: AAC, SBC. Water resistance: Earbuds: IP54 dust and splash resistance, Case: IP54 dust and splash resistance.</p>\n<p>Around the same budget, also look at the <a href=\"/products/samsung-galaxy-buds4\">Samsung Galaxy Buds 4</a> (Rs 26,099) and the <a href=\"/products/jbl-soundgear-clips\">JBL Soundgear Clips</a> (Rs 23,000). You can <a href=\"/compare?category=earbuds&g1=airpods-4&g2=samsung-galaxy-buds4\">compare the AirPods 4 with the Samsung Galaxy Buds 4</a> side by side.</p>','[{\"question\":\"What is the AirPods 4 price in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"The AirPods 4 starts at Rs 24,999 in Nepal. All variants: Rs 24,999 for ; Rs 34,999 for with ANC.\"},{\"question\":\"When did the AirPods 4 launch in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"It launched in Nepal on 6 November 2024.\"},{\"question\":\"What is the AirPods 4 battery like?\",\"answer\":\"Music: 5 hours (buds) \\/ 30 hours (case), With ANC off; Quick charge: 5 minutes = 1 hour playback.\"}]','[{\"label\":\"GadgetByte Nepal \\u2013 AirPods 4\",\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/www.gadgetbytenepal.com\\/product\\/airpods-4\\/\",\"accessed\":\"2026-11-23\"}]',NULL,NULL,0,'2024-11-05 18:15:00','2024-11-05 18:15:00'),(852,40,3,'Asus TUF Gaming F16 FX607VB-RL015W 2024 (Intel Core 5 210H)','asus-tuf-gaming-f16-2024-core-5-rtx-3050-4gb',NULL,'gadgets/2026/asus-tuf-gaming-f16-2024-core-5-rtx-3050-4gb.webp',NULL,NULL,165600.00,NULL,0,NULL,'2024-01-01','available',NULL,0,0,'<p>The Asus TUF Gaming F16 FX607VB-RL015W 2024 (Intel Core 5 210H) costs <strong>Rs 1,65,600</strong> in Nepal for the 8GB/512GB model. It launched in Nepal in 2024. At this price you should get a premium build, a better screen and enough memory to last years.</p>\n<p>It runs on the Intel Core 5 210H (Intel 7), 8 cores / 12 threads. Screen: 16 inches, IPS LCD, FHD+ (1920 x 1200 pixels), 144Hz. 8GB of RAM is fine for study and office work but tight for heavy multitasking; check whether it can be upgraded. At 2.2 kg, it is best kept on a desk. Battery: Li-Ion 56 Wh; 150W adapter.</p>\n<p>Around the same budget, also look at the <a href=\"/products/lenovo-loq-15-15ahp9-2024-ryzen-7-7445hs\">Lenovo LOQ 15 15AHP9 2024</a> (Rs 1,65,499) and the <a href=\"/products/lenovo-loq-15-intel-i7-13650hx-rtx-4050\">Lenovo LOQ 15 15IRX9 2024</a> (Rs 1,65,999). You can <a href=\"/compare?category=laptop&g1=asus-tuf-gaming-f16-2024-core-5-rtx-3050-4gb&g2=lenovo-loq-15-15ahp9-2024-ryzen-7-7445hs\">compare the Asus TUF Gaming F16 FX607VB-RL015W 2024 (Intel Core 5 210H) with the Lenovo LOQ 15 15AHP9 2024</a> side by side.</p>','[{\"question\":\"What is the Asus TUF Gaming F16 FX607VB-RL015W 2024 (Intel Core 5 210H) price in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"The Asus TUF Gaming F16 FX607VB-RL015W 2024 (Intel Core 5 210H) costs Rs 1,65,600 in Nepal.\"},{\"question\":\"When did the Asus TUF Gaming F16 FX607VB-RL015W 2024 (Intel Core 5 210H) launch in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"It launched in Nepal in 2024.\"},{\"question\":\"Which processor does the Asus TUF Gaming F16 FX607VB-RL015W 2024 (Intel Core 5 210H) use?\",\"answer\":\"It uses the Intel Core 5 210H (Intel 7), 8 cores \\/ 12 threads.\"}]','[{\"label\":\"GadgetByte Nepal \\u2013 Asus TUF Gaming F16 FX607VB-RL015W 2024 (Intel Core 5 210H)\",\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/www.gadgetbytenepal.com\\/product\\/asus-tuf-gaming-f16-2024-core-5-rtx-3050-4gb\\/\",\"accessed\":\"2026-11-23\"}]',NULL,NULL,0,'2023-12-31 18:15:00','2023-12-31 18:15:00'),(853,39,3,'Lenovo IdeaPad Slim 3 15IRH10R 2025','lenovo-ideapad-slim-3-15irh10r-2025-intel-core-5-210h',NULL,'gadgets/2026/lenovo-ideapad-slim-3-15irh10r-2025-intel-core-5-210h.webp',NULL,NULL,123999.00,NULL,0,NULL,'2026-01-01','available',NULL,0,0,'<p>The Lenovo IdeaPad Slim 3 15IRH10R 2025 costs <strong>Rs 1,23,999</strong> in Nepal for the Intel Core 5 210H, 16GB/512GB model. The Intel Core Ultra 7 240H, 16GB/512GB version costs Rs 1,37,999. It launched in Nepal in 2026. That is mainstream money in Nepal: fine for office work, coding and study.</p>\n<p>It runs on the Intel Core 5 210H (Intel 7), 8 cores / 12 threads (base configuration; see prices for other chips). Screen: 15.3 inches, IPS LCD, WUXGA (1900 x 1200 pixels), 60Hz. 16GB of memory is the right amount for a laptop you plan to keep for several years. At 1.63 kg, it is fine for occasional carrying. Battery: Li-Ion 60 Wh; 65W adapter.</p>\n<p>Around the same budget, also look at the <a href=\"/products/acer-aspire-lite-16-a16-52p-intel-core-i5-1334u\">Acer Aspire Lite 16 AL16-52P 2024 (Intel Core i5-1334U)</a> (Rs 1,23,500) and the <a href=\"/products/acer-aspire-14-ai-a14-52m-51s1-2025-intel-core-ultra-5-226v-16gb-512tb-14-wuxga-touch\">Acer Aspire 14 AI A14-52M-51S1 2025 (Intel Core Ultra 5 226V)</a> (Rs 1,24,999). You can <a href=\"/compare?category=laptop&g1=lenovo-ideapad-slim-3-15irh10r-2025-intel-core-5-210h&g2=acer-aspire-lite-16-a16-52p-intel-core-i5-1334u\">compare the Lenovo IdeaPad Slim 3 15IRH10R 2025 with the Acer Aspire Lite 16 AL16-52P 2024 (Intel Core i5-1334U)</a> side by side.</p>','[{\"question\":\"What is the Lenovo IdeaPad Slim 3 15IRH10R 2025 price in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"The Lenovo IdeaPad Slim 3 15IRH10R 2025 starts at Rs 1,23,999 in Nepal. All variants: Rs 1,23,999 for Intel Core 5 210H, 16GB\\/512GB; Rs 1,37,999 for Intel Core Ultra 7 240H, 16GB\\/512GB.\"},{\"question\":\"When did the Lenovo IdeaPad Slim 3 15IRH10R 2025 launch in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"It launched in Nepal in 2026.\"},{\"question\":\"Which processor does the Lenovo IdeaPad Slim 3 15IRH10R 2025 use?\",\"answer\":\"It uses the Intel Core 5 210H (Intel 7), 8 cores \\/ 12 threads (base configuration; see prices for other chips).\"}]','[{\"label\":\"GadgetByte Nepal \\u2013 Lenovo IdeaPad Slim 3 15IRH10R 2025 (Intel Core 5 210H)\",\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/www.gadgetbytenepal.com\\/product\\/lenovo-ideapad-slim-3-15irh10r-2025-intel-core-5-210h\\/\",\"accessed\":\"2026-11-23\"},{\"label\":\"GadgetByte Nepal \\u2013 Lenovo IdeaPad Slim 3 15IRH10R 2025 (Intel Core Ultra 7 240H, 16GB, 512GB, 15.3\\\" WUXGA)\",\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/www.gadgetbytenepal.com\\/product\\/lenovo-ideapad-slim-3-15irh10r-2025-intel-core-ultra-7-240h-16gb-512gb-153-wuxga\\/\",\"accessed\":\"2026-11-23\"}]',NULL,NULL,0,'2025-12-31 18:15:00','2025-12-31 18:15:00'),(854,41,3,'Acer Aspire Lite 14 AL14-32P (Core i3 N355, 8GB/512GB)','acer-aspire-lite-14-al14-32p-39zh-2024-intel-core-i3-n355',NULL,'gadgets/2026/acer-aspire-lite-14-al14-32p-39zh-2024-intel-core-i3-n355.webp',NULL,NULL,79499.00,NULL,0,NULL,'2025-01-01','available',NULL,0,0,'<p>The Aspire Lite 14 AL14-32P is a light, quiet laptop for study and office work, and ONIN Infosys\'s listing has a useful extra: a <strong>2-year official warranty</strong> at <strong>Rs 79,499</strong>. For a first laptop that a student will rely on through most of a degree, two years of cover is worth a lot.</p>\n<p>The <strong>Intel Core i3 N355</strong> has 8 cores (up to 3.9GHz). That\'s plenty for Office, web apps, Zoom and streaming, though not for heavy creative software. You get 8GB of LPDDR5, soldered, and a <strong>512GB</strong> SSD. The 14-inch screen is a 16:10 <strong>WUXGA</strong> IPS panel with a matte ComfyView finish, which handles bright rooms better than glossy budget screens.</p>\n<p>It weighs about 1.35 kg and has a USB-C port, three USB-A ports, HDMI and a microSD slot. The cheaper <a href=\"/products/acer-aspire-lite-14-al14-45p-ryzen-3-5400u\">AL14-45P with Ryzen 3</a> has a bigger 58Wh battery. This N355 model trades that for a newer, more efficient chip and the longer warranty.</p>','[{\"question\":\"What is the Acer Aspire Lite 14 Core i3 N355 price in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"ONIN Infosys sells the Aspire Lite 14 AL14-32P with Core i3 N355, 8GB RAM and 512GB SSD for Rs 79,499 with a 2-year warranty.\"},{\"question\":\"How many cores does the Core i3 N355 have?\",\"answer\":\"8 cores and 8 threads, boosting to 3.9GHz.\"},{\"question\":\"Is the RAM upgradeable?\",\"answer\":\"No. The 8GB LPDDR5 is on board.\"}]','[{\"label\":\"ONIN Infosys \\u2013 Acer Aspire Lite 14 AL14-32P (Core i3 N355, 8GB\\/512GB)\",\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/onin.com.np\\/product\\/acer-aspire-lite-14-al14-32p-30j8-price-nepal\",\"accessed\":\"2026-11-23\"},{\"label\":\"GadgetByte Nepal \\u2013 Acer Aspire Lite 14 AL14-32p-39ZH 2024 (Intel Core i3-N355)\",\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/www.gadgetbytenepal.com\\/product\\/acer-aspire-lite-14-al14-32p-39zh-2024-intel-core-i3-n355\\/\",\"accessed\":\"2026-11-23\"}]',NULL,'https://onin.com.np/product/acer-aspire-lite-14-al14-32p-30j8-price-nepal',0,'2024-12-31 18:15:00','2024-12-31 18:15:00'),(855,41,3,'Acer Aspire Go 14 AG14‑71M‑55L0 2025 (Intel Core Ultra 5 115U)','acer-aspire-go-14-g1471m55l0-2025-intel-core-ultra-5-115u',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,115999.00,NULL,0,NULL,'2026-01-01','available',NULL,0,0,'<p>The Acer Aspire Go 14 AG14‑71M‑55L0 2025 (Intel Core Ultra 5 115U) costs <strong>Rs 1,15,999</strong> in Nepal for the 16GB/512GB model. It launched in Nepal in 2026. That is mainstream money in Nepal: fine for office work, coding and study.</p>\n<p>It runs on the Intel Core Ultra 5 115U (Intel 4), 8 cores / 10 threads. Screen: 14 inches, IPS LCD, WUXGA (1920 x 1200 pixels), 60Hz. 16GB of memory is the right amount for a laptop you plan to keep for several years. At 1.5 kg, it is fine for occasional carrying. Battery: Li-Ion 55 Wh; 65W adapter.</p>\n<p>Around the same budget, also look at the <a href=\"/products/asus-vivobook-15-x1504vap-2024\">Asus Vivobook 15 X1504VAP 2024 (Intel Core 5 120U)</a> (Rs 1,15,900) and the <a href=\"/products/acer-spin-5-2023-i5-1335u\">Acer Spin 5 A5SP14-51MTN-58HT 2023 (13th Gen i5-1335U)</a> (Rs 1,15,000). You can <a href=\"/compare?category=laptop&g1=acer-aspire-go-14-g1471m55l0-2025-intel-core-ultra-5-115u&g2=asus-vivobook-15-x1504vap-2024\">compare the Acer Aspire Go 14 AG14‑71M‑55L0 2025 (Intel Core Ultra 5 115U) with the Asus Vivobook 15 X1504VAP 2024 (Intel Core 5 120U)</a> side by side.</p>','[{\"question\":\"What is the Acer Aspire Go 14 AG14\\u201171M\\u201155L0 2025 (Intel Core Ultra 5 115U) price in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"The Acer Aspire Go 14 AG14\\u201171M\\u201155L0 2025 (Intel Core Ultra 5 115U) costs Rs 1,15,999 in Nepal.\"},{\"question\":\"When did the Acer Aspire Go 14 AG14\\u201171M\\u201155L0 2025 (Intel Core Ultra 5 115U) launch in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"It launched in Nepal in 2026.\"},{\"question\":\"Which processor does the Acer Aspire Go 14 AG14\\u201171M\\u201155L0 2025 (Intel Core Ultra 5 115U) use?\",\"answer\":\"It uses the Intel Core Ultra 5 115U (Intel 4), 8 cores \\/ 10 threads.\"}]','[{\"label\":\"GadgetByte Nepal \\u2013 Acer Aspire Go 14 AG14\\u201171M\\u201155L0 2025 (Intel Core Ultra 5 115U)\",\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/www.gadgetbytenepal.com\\/product\\/acer-aspire-go-14-g1471m55l0-2025-intel-core-ultra-5-115u\\/\",\"accessed\":\"2026-11-23\"}]',NULL,NULL,0,'2025-12-31 18:15:00','2025-12-31 18:15:00'),(856,8,3,'HP OmniBook 5 Flip 14 (Core 7 150U, 16GB/512GB)','hp-omnibook-5-flip-14-fp0023-2025-intel-core-7-150u-16gb-512gb-14-2k-ips-touch',NULL,'gadgets/2026/hp-omnibook-5-flip-14-fp0023-2025-intel-core-7-150u-16gb-512gb-14-2k-ips-touch.webp',NULL,NULL,153999.00,NULL,0,NULL,'2025-01-01','available',NULL,0,0,'<p>The OmniBook 5 Flip is a convertible that gets the practical things right. It has a big <strong>68Wh battery</strong>, a <strong>5MP IR camera</strong> that makes you look sharp on calls and logs you in with your face, and a 360-degree hinge for tablet and tent modes. ONIN Infosys sells it for <strong>Rs 1,53,999</strong>, with lifetime software support and free servicing from the store.</p>\n<p>It runs Intel\'s <strong>Core 7 150U</strong> (10 cores, up to 5.4GHz), which is quick for office, study and creative-lite work, with 16GB of LPDDR5 and an upgradeable 512GB Gen 4 SSD. The 14-inch 1920 × 1200 IPS touchscreen is 300 nits, fine indoors and good for pen notes.</p>\n<p>Ports cover everything most people need: two 10Gbps USB-C ports with charging and DisplayPort, two USB-A ports and HDMI 2.1.</p>\n<p>Against the <a href=\"/products/hp-omnibook-x-flip-14-core-ultra-5-226v\">OmniBook X Flip</a>, which costs about the same, the 5 Flip has the bigger battery and the better camera. The X Flip has the more modern Lunar Lake chip with an NPU, Thunderbolt 4 and a brighter glass-covered screen. For video calls and battery life, we\'d lean towards the 5 Flip.</p>','[{\"question\":\"What is the HP OmniBook 5 Flip 14 price in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"ONIN Infosys sells the HP OmniBook 5 Flip 14 with Core 7 150U, 16GB RAM and 512GB SSD for Rs 1,53,999.\"},{\"question\":\"What camera does the OmniBook 5 Flip have?\",\"answer\":\"An HP 5MP IR camera with Windows Hello face login.\"},{\"question\":\"How big is the battery?\",\"answer\":\"68Wh, 4-cell.\"}]','[{\"label\":\"ONIN Infosys \\u2013 HP OmniBook 5 Flip 14 (Core 7 150U, 16GB\\/512GB)\",\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/onin.com.np\\/product\\/hp-omnibook-5-flip-14fp0023dx-price-nepal\",\"accessed\":\"2026-11-23\"},{\"label\":\"GadgetByte Nepal \\u2013 HP OmniBook 5 Flip 14-fp0023 2025 (Intel Core 7 150U)\",\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/www.gadgetbytenepal.com\\/product\\/hp-omnibook-5-flip-14-fp0023-2025-intel-core-7-150u-16gb-512gb-14-2k-ips-touch\\/\",\"accessed\":\"2026-11-23\"}]',NULL,'https://onin.com.np/product/hp-omnibook-5-flip-14fp0023dx-price-nepal',0,'2024-12-31 18:15:00','2024-12-31 18:15:00'),(857,39,3,'Lenovo IdeaPad 5 2-in-1 14AGP11 2026 (Ryzen AI 5 430)','lenovo-ideapad-5-2-in-1-14agp11-2026-ryzen-ai-5-430',NULL,'gadgets/2026/lenovo-ideapad-5-2-in-1-14agp11-2026-ryzen-ai-5-430.webp',NULL,NULL,145999.00,NULL,0,NULL,'2026-01-01','available',NULL,0,0,'<p>The Lenovo IdeaPad 5 2-in-1 14AGP11 2026 (Ryzen AI 5 430) costs <strong>Rs 1,45,999</strong> in Nepal for the 16GB/512GB model. It launched in Nepal in 2026. That is mainstream money in Nepal: fine for office work, coding and study.</p>\n<p>It runs on the AMD Ryzen AI 5 430 (4nm), 4 cores / 8 threads. Screen: 14 inches, IPS LCD, WUXGA (1920 x 1200 pixels), 60Hz. 16GB of memory is the right amount for a laptop you plan to keep for several years. At 1.54 kg, it is fine for occasional carrying. Battery: Li-Ion 60 Wh; 65W adapter.</p>\n<p>Around the same budget, also look at the <a href=\"/products/asus-vivobook-14-m1407ka-2025\">ASUS VivoBook 14 M1407KA 2025</a> (Rs 1,45,999) and the <a href=\"/products/asus-vivobook-16-m1607ka-mb117w-2025-ryzen-ai-5-340-16gb-512gb-16-wuxga\">Asus Vivobook 16 M1607KA-MB117W 2025 (Ryzen AI 5 340)</a> (Rs 1,45,999). You can <a href=\"/compare?category=laptop&g1=lenovo-ideapad-5-2-in-1-14agp11-2026-ryzen-ai-5-430&g2=asus-vivobook-14-m1407ka-2025\">compare the Lenovo IdeaPad 5 2-in-1 14AGP11 2026 (Ryzen AI 5 430) with the ASUS VivoBook 14 M1407KA 2025</a> side by side.</p>','[{\"question\":\"What is the Lenovo IdeaPad 5 2-in-1 14AGP11 2026 (Ryzen AI 5 430) price in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"The Lenovo IdeaPad 5 2-in-1 14AGP11 2026 (Ryzen AI 5 430) costs Rs 1,45,999 in Nepal.\"},{\"question\":\"When did the Lenovo IdeaPad 5 2-in-1 14AGP11 2026 (Ryzen AI 5 430) launch in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"It launched in Nepal in 2026.\"},{\"question\":\"Which processor does the Lenovo IdeaPad 5 2-in-1 14AGP11 2026 (Ryzen AI 5 430) use?\",\"answer\":\"It uses the AMD Ryzen AI 5 430 (4nm), 4 cores \\/ 8 threads.\"}]','[{\"label\":\"GadgetByte Nepal \\u2013 Lenovo IdeaPad 5 2-in-1 14AGP11 2026 (Ryzen AI 5 430)\",\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/www.gadgetbytenepal.com\\/product\\/lenovo-ideapad-5-2-in-1-14agp11-2026-ryzen-ai-5-430\\/\",\"accessed\":\"2026-11-23\"}]',NULL,NULL,0,'2025-12-31 18:15:00','2025-12-31 18:15:00'),(858,61,4,'Soundcore Liberty 5 Pro Max','soundcore-liberty-5-pro-max',NULL,'gadgets/2026/soundcore-liberty-5-pro-max.webp',NULL,NULL,39999.00,NULL,0,NULL,'2026-11-01','available',NULL,0,0,'<p>The Soundcore Liberty 5 Pro Max costs <strong>Rs 39,999</strong> in Nepal. It launched in Nepal on 1 November 2026. At this price you are paying for strong noise cancellation, better tuning and premium features.</p>\n<p>Drivers: 9.2 mm wool-paper diaphragm drivers. Battery: Music: 6.5 hours (buds) / 28 hours (case), With ANC on; 3 hours, Quick charge: 5 minutes = 4 hours playback. Connectivity: Bluetooth 6.1, multipoint, Codecs: AAC, SBC, LDAC. Water resistance: Earbuds: IP55 dust and splash resistance.</p>\n<p>Around the same budget, also look at the <a href=\"/products/samsung-galaxy-buds4-pro\">Samsung Galaxy Buds 4 Pro</a> (Rs 35,799) and the <a href=\"/products/soundcore-liberty-5-pro\">Soundcore Liberty 5 Pro</a> (Rs 34,999). You can <a href=\"/compare?category=earbuds&g1=soundcore-liberty-5-pro-max&g2=samsung-galaxy-buds4-pro\">compare the Soundcore Liberty 5 Pro Max with the Samsung Galaxy Buds 4 Pro</a> side by side.</p>','[{\"question\":\"What is the Soundcore Liberty 5 Pro Max price in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"The Soundcore Liberty 5 Pro Max costs Rs 39,999 in Nepal.\"},{\"question\":\"When did the Soundcore Liberty 5 Pro Max launch in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"It launched in Nepal on 1 November 2026.\"},{\"question\":\"What is the Soundcore Liberty 5 Pro Max battery like?\",\"answer\":\"Music: 6.5 hours (buds) \\/ 28 hours (case), With ANC on; 3 hours, Quick charge: 5 minutes = 4 hours playback.\"}]','[{\"label\":\"GadgetByte Nepal \\u2013 Soundcore Liberty 5 Pro Max\",\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/www.gadgetbytenepal.com\\/product\\/soundcore-liberty-5-pro-max\\/\",\"accessed\":\"2026-11-23\"}]',NULL,NULL,0,'2026-10-31 18:15:00','2026-10-31 18:15:00'),(859,65,5,'Ultima Watch Navigator','ultima-watch-navigator',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,6999.00,NULL,0,NULL,'2025-05-23','available',NULL,0,0,'<p>The Ultima Watch Navigator costs <strong>Rs 6,999</strong> in Nepal. It was announced on 23 May 2025. At this price it is mainly a fitness tracker with notifications and long battery life.</p>\n<p>It has a 47 mm: 1.43 inches, AMOLED display. Connectivity: GPS: Yes, with GPS. Water resistance: 3 ATM water resistance. It has a speaker and microphone for calls from the wrist.</p>\n<p>Around the same budget, also look at the <a href=\"/products/mwc-aether-one-watch-pro\">MWC Aether One Watch Pro</a> (Rs 6,999) and the <a href=\"/products/boat-enigma-radiant\">boAt Enigma Radiant</a> (Rs 6,799). You can <a href=\"/compare?category=smartwatch&g1=ultima-watch-navigator&g2=mwc-aether-one-watch-pro\">compare the Ultima Watch Navigator with the MWC Aether One Watch Pro</a> side by side.</p>','[{\"question\":\"What is the Ultima Watch Navigator price in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"The Ultima Watch Navigator costs Rs 6,999 in Nepal.\"}]','[{\"label\":\"GadgetByte Nepal \\u2013 Ultima Watch Navigator\",\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/www.gadgetbytenepal.com\\/product\\/ultima-watch-navigator\\/\",\"accessed\":\"2026-11-23\"}]',NULL,NULL,0,'2025-05-22 18:15:00','2025-05-22 18:15:00'),(860,65,5,'Ultima Watch Active','ultima-watch-active',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,4299.00,NULL,0,NULL,'2024-01-01','available',NULL,0,0,'<p>The Ultima Watch Active costs <strong>Rs 4,299</strong> in Nepal. It was announced in 2024. At this price it is mainly a fitness tracker with notifications and long battery life.</p>\n<p>It has a 1.43 inches display. Connectivity: Bluetooth v5.3. Water resistance: IP68. It has a speaker and microphone for calls from the wrist.</p>\n<p>Around the same budget, also look at the <a href=\"/products/redmi-watch-5-active\">Redmi Watch 5 Active</a> (Rs 4,499) and the <a href=\"/products/ultima-watch-circle-2-0\">Ultima Watch Circle 2.0</a> (Rs 3,699). You can <a href=\"/compare?category=smartwatch&g1=ultima-watch-active&g2=redmi-watch-5-active\">compare the Ultima Watch Active with the Redmi Watch 5 Active</a> side by side.</p>','[{\"question\":\"What is the Ultima Watch Active price in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"The Ultima Watch Active costs Rs 4,299 in Nepal.\"}]','[{\"label\":\"GadgetByte Nepal \\u2013 Ultima Watch Active\",\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/www.gadgetbytenepal.com\\/product\\/ultima-watch-active\\/\",\"accessed\":\"2026-11-23\"}]',NULL,NULL,0,'2023-12-31 18:15:00','2023-12-31 18:15:00'),(861,39,3,'Lenovo IdeaPad Slim 3 15IRU8 (Intel Core i3-1315U)','lenovo-ideapad-slim-3-15iru8-intel-core-i3-1315u',NULL,'gadgets/2026/lenovo-ideapad-slim-3-15iru8-intel-core-i3-1315u.webp',NULL,NULL,81999.00,NULL,0,NULL,'2026-01-01','available',NULL,0,0,'<p>The Lenovo IdeaPad Slim 3 15IRU8 (Intel Core i3-1315U) costs <strong>Rs 81,999</strong> in Nepal for the 8GB/256GB model. It launched in Nepal in 2026. That is mainstream money in Nepal: fine for office work, coding and study.</p>\n<p>It runs on the Intel Core i3-1315U (Intel 7), 6 cores / 8 threads. Screen: 15.6 inches, IPS LCD, Full HD (1920 x 1080 pixels), 60Hz. 8GB of RAM is fine for study and office work but tight for heavy multitasking; check whether it can be upgraded. At 1.62 kg, it is fine for occasional carrying. Battery: Li-Ion 47 Wh; 65W adapter.</p>\n<p>Around the same budget, also look at the <a href=\"/products/lenovo-ideapad-1-15amn7-2023-ryzen-5-7520u\">Lenovo IdeaPad 1 15AMN7 2023 (Ryzen 5 7520U)</a> (Rs 80,999) and the <a href=\"/products/asus-vivobook-15x-oled-x1503za-2022\">Asus Vivobook 15X OLED X1503ZA 2022 (Intel Core i3-1220P)</a> (Rs 83,900). You can <a href=\"/compare?category=laptop&g1=lenovo-ideapad-slim-3-15iru8-intel-core-i3-1315u&g2=lenovo-ideapad-1-15amn7-2023-ryzen-5-7520u\">compare the Lenovo IdeaPad Slim 3 15IRU8 (Intel Core i3-1315U) with the Lenovo IdeaPad 1 15AMN7 2023 (Ryzen 5 7520U)</a> side by side.</p>','[{\"question\":\"What is the Lenovo IdeaPad Slim 3 15IRU8 (Intel Core i3-1315U) price in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"The Lenovo IdeaPad Slim 3 15IRU8 (Intel Core i3-1315U) costs Rs 81,999 in Nepal.\"},{\"question\":\"When did the Lenovo IdeaPad Slim 3 15IRU8 (Intel Core i3-1315U) launch in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"It launched in Nepal in 2026.\"},{\"question\":\"Which processor does the Lenovo IdeaPad Slim 3 15IRU8 (Intel Core i3-1315U) use?\",\"answer\":\"It uses the Intel Core i3-1315U (Intel 7), 6 cores \\/ 8 threads.\"}]','[{\"label\":\"GadgetByte Nepal \\u2013 Lenovo IdeaPad Slim 3 15IRU8 (Intel Core i3-1315U)\",\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/www.gadgetbytenepal.com\\/product\\/lenovo-ideapad-slim-3-15iru8-intel-core-i3-1315u\\/\",\"accessed\":\"2026-11-23\"}]',NULL,NULL,0,'2025-12-31 18:15:00','2025-12-31 18:15:00'),(862,41,3,'Acer Aspire 14 AI A14-52MT-94H5 (Core Ultra 9 288V, 32GB/1TB)','acer-aspire-14-ai-a14-52mt-94h5-2025-intel-core-ultra-9-288v-32gb-1tb-14-wuxga-touch',NULL,'gadgets/2026/acer-aspire-14-ai-a14-52mt-94h5-2025-intel-core-ultra-9-288v-32gb-1tb-14-wuxga-touch.webp',NULL,NULL,186499.00,NULL,0,NULL,'2026-01-01','available',NULL,0,0,'<p>It looks like an ordinary 14-inch Aspire, but inside is the top Lunar Lake chip. The <strong>Core Ultra 9 288V</strong> boosts higher than any other chip in the range, has a <strong>48 TOPS NPU</strong> and the strongest <strong>Arc 140V</strong> graphics, and comes with a generous <strong>32GB</strong> of LPDDR5X. ONIN Infosys sells the A14-52MT-94H5 for <strong>Rs 1,86,499</strong> with a 1TB SSD.</p>\n<p>That makes it a sleeper. Arc 140V handles light video editing, Lightroom and even modern games at modest settings far better than you\'d expect from an \"Aspire\". The 32GB of memory keeps virtual machines, large datasets and heavy browser work comfortable for years. Battery life stays excellent thanks to the efficient Lunar Lake design and a 65Wh battery.</p>\n<p>The design is shared with the cheaper <a href=\"/products/acer-aspire-14-ai-a14-52m-51s1-2025-intel-core-ultra-5-226v-16gb-512tb-14-wuxga-touch\">Core Ultra 5 Aspire 14 AI</a>: a 14-inch WUXGA matte touchscreen, two USB4 ports, two USB-A, HDMI and about 1.4 kg. The screen is the one part that doesn\'t feel premium at this price. If you want this much power with an OLED, look at the <a href=\"/products/asus-zenbook-14-oled-ux3405ca-2025\">Zenbook 14 OLED</a>.</p>','[{\"question\":\"What is the Acer Aspire 14 AI Ultra 9 288V price in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"ONIN Infosys sells the Aspire 14 AI A14-52MT-94H5 with Core Ultra 9 288V, 32GB LPDDR5X and 1TB SSD for Rs 1,86,499.\"},{\"question\":\"How much RAM does the Aspire 14 AI Ultra 9 have?\",\"answer\":\"32GB of LPDDR5X, integrated into the processor package and not upgradeable.\"},{\"question\":\"What graphics does the Core Ultra 9 288V have?\",\"answer\":\"Intel Arc 140V integrated graphics.\"}]','[{\"label\":\"ONIN Infosys \\u2013 Acer Aspire 14 AI A14-52MT-94H5 (Core Ultra 9 288V, 32GB\\/1TB)\",\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/onin.com.np\\/product\\/acer-aspire-14-ai-a14-52mt-94h5-price-nepal\",\"accessed\":\"2026-11-23\"},{\"label\":\"GadgetByte Nepal \\u2013 Acer Aspire 14 AI A14-52MT-94H5 2025 (Intel Core Ultra 9 288V)\",\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/www.gadgetbytenepal.com\\/product\\/acer-aspire-14-ai-a14-52mt-94h5-2025-intel-core-ultra-9-288v-32gb-1tb-14-wuxga-touch\\/\",\"accessed\":\"2026-11-23\"}]',NULL,'https://onin.com.np/product/acer-aspire-14-ai-a14-52mt-94h5-price-nepal',0,'2025-12-31 18:15:00','2025-12-31 18:15:00'),(863,39,3,'Lenovo LOQ 15 Essential 15ARP11 2026 (Ryzen 7 170)','lenovo-loq-15-essential-15arp11-2026-ryzen-7-170-rtx-5050',NULL,'gadgets/2026/lenovo-loq-15-essential-15arp11-2026-ryzen-7-170-rtx-5050.webp',NULL,NULL,209999.00,NULL,0,NULL,'2026-01-01','available',NULL,0,0,'<p>The Lenovo LOQ 15 Essential 15ARP11 2026 (Ryzen 7 170) costs <strong>Rs 2,09,999</strong> in Nepal for the 16GB/512GB model. It launched in Nepal in 2026. At this price you should get a premium build, a better screen and enough memory to last years.</p>\n<p>It runs on the AMD Ryzen 7 170 (6nm), 8 cores / 16 threads. Screen: 15.6 inches, IPS LCD, FHD (1920 x 1080 pixels), 144Hz. 16GB of memory is the right amount for a laptop you plan to keep for several years. At 2.3 kg, it is best kept on a desk. Battery: Li-Ion 60 Wh; 135W adapter.</p>\n<p>Around the same budget, also look at the <a href=\"/products/dell-pro-13-pb13255-2025-ryzen-ai-7-pro-350\">Dell Pro 13 PB13255 2025 (Ryzen AI 7 Pro 350)</a> (Rs 2,09,999) and the <a href=\"/products/lenovo-thinkpad-z16-2022-ryzen-7-pro-6850h-rx6500m\">Lenovo ThinkPad Z16 Gen 1 2022 (Ryzen 7 PRO 6850H)</a> (Rs 2,10,000). You can <a href=\"/compare?c