54,999</strong>, which includes a 2-year warranty, a year of ASUS Perfect Warranty, and a bag, mouse and mousepad.</p>\n<p>The appeal is <strong>battery life</strong> and the <strong>screen</strong>. Qualcomm\'s 12-core Arm chip sips power, and with a 70Wh battery a full working day away from the charger is realistic. The 15.6-inch <strong>3K (2880 × 1620) OLED</strong> runs at 120Hz, covers 100% DCI-P3 and is DisplayHDR True Black 600 certified. It\'s gorgeous for movies and photo work.</p>\n<p>Before buying, understand the Arm trade-off. Office, Chrome, Edge, Spotify, Zoom, Teams, Photoshop and Lightroom all run natively and fast, and most other apps work through Windows\' Prism emulation. Some things don\'t: many online games with anti-cheat, certain VPN clients, older printer and scanner drivers, and niche engineering software. Check your must-have apps first.</p>\n<p>Ports are generous: two USB4 40Gbps, two USB-A, HDMI 2.1 and a microSD reader. The backlit keyboard has a number pad and a Copilot key, and the laptop weighs 1.43 kg. For a similar OLED on Intel or AMD, look at the <a href=\"/products/asus-zenbook-14-oled-um3406ga\">Zenbook 14 OLED</a>.</p>','[{\"question\":\"What is the ASUS Vivobook S15 OLED Snapdragon X Elite price in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"ONIN Infosys sells the Vivobook S15 OLED (S5507QA) with Snapdragon X Elite, 16GB RAM and 1TB SSD for Rs 1,54,999.\"},{\"question\":\"Can the Snapdragon Vivobook S15 run all Windows apps?\",\"answer\":\"Most apps run natively or through emulation, but some games with anti-cheat, older drivers and specialised software may not. Check the apps you rely on before buying.\"},{\"question\":\"What display does the Vivobook S15 OLED have?\",\"answer\":\"A 15.6-inch 3K (2880 \\u00d7 1620) OLED at 120Hz with 100% DCI-P3 and DisplayHDR True Black 600.\"}]','[{\"label\":\"ONIN Infosys \\u2013 ASUS Vivobook S15 OLED S5507QA (Snapdragon X Elite, 16GB\\/1TB)\",\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/onin.com.np\\/product\\/asus-vivobook-s15-s5507qa-price-nepal\",\"accessed\":\"2026-11-23\"},{\"label\":\"GadgetByte Nepal \\u2013 Asus Vivobook S15 S5507QA 2024 (X Elite X1E 78 100)\",\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/www.gadgetbytenepal.com\\/product\\/asus-vivobook-s15-2024-x-elite-x1e-78-100\\/\",\"accessed\":\"2026-11-23\"}]',NULL,'https://onin.com.np/product/asus-vivobook-s15-s5507qa-price-nepal',0,'2025-12-31 18:15:00','2025-12-31 18:15:00'),(941,40,3,'Asus TUF Gaming A15 FA506NFR 2023 (Ryzen 7 7435HS)','asus-tuf-gaming-a15-ryzen-7-7435hs-rtx-2050',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0.00,NULL,0,'Rs 1,49,900 last listed price in Nepal','2024-01-01','discontinued',NULL,0,0,'<p>The Asus TUF Gaming A15 FA506NFR 2023 (Ryzen 7 7435HS) is no longer stocked in Nepal. Its last listed price was <strong>Rs 1,49,900</strong>. It launched in Nepal in 2024. We keep the full specs here for reference and for anyone checking a second-hand unit.</p>\n<p>It runs on the AMD Ryzen 7 7435HS (6nm), 8 cores / 16 threads. Screen: 15.6 inches, IPS LCD, FHD (1920 x 1080 pixels), 144Hz. 8GB of RAM is fine for study and office work but tight for heavy multitasking; check whether it can be upgraded. At 2.3 kg, it is best kept on a desk. Battery: Li-Ion 48 Wh; 150W adapter.</p>\n<p>Buying new instead? A current ASUS alternative is the <a href=\"/products/asus-vivobook-s14-m3407ha-2025\">Asus Vivobook S14 M3407HA 2025</a> (Rs 1,52,999).</p>','[{\"question\":\"Is the Asus TUF Gaming A15 FA506NFR 2023 (Ryzen 7 7435HS) still available in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"No, it is no longer stocked. Its last listed price was Rs 1,49,900.\"},{\"question\":\"When did the Asus TUF Gaming A15 FA506NFR 2023 (Ryzen 7 7435HS) launch in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"It launched in Nepal in 2024.\"},{\"question\":\"Which processor does the Asus TUF Gaming A15 FA506NFR 2023 (Ryzen 7 7435HS) use?\",\"answer\":\"It uses the AMD Ryzen 7 7435HS (6nm), 8 cores \\/ 16 threads.\"}]','[{\"label\":\"GadgetByte Nepal \\u2013 Asus TUF Gaming A15 FA506NFR 2023 (Ryzen 7 7435HS)\",\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/www.gadgetbytenepal.com\\/product\\/asus-tuf-gaming-a15-ryzen-7-7435hs-rtx-2050\\/\",\"accessed\":\"2026-11-23\"}]',NULL,NULL,0,'2023-12-31 18:15:00','2023-12-31 18:15:00'),(942,8,3,'HP OmniBook 5 16–AG1175 2025 (Ryzen AI 7 350)','hp-omnibook-5-16-ag1175-2025-ryzen-ai-7-35016gb-512gb-16-ips-touch',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0.00,NULL,0,'Rs 1,36,999 last listed price in Nepal','2025-01-01','discontinued',NULL,0,0,'<p>The HP OmniBook 5 16–AG1175 2025 (Ryzen AI 7 350) is no longer stocked in Nepal. Its last listed price was <strong>Rs 1,36,999</strong>. It launched in Nepal in 2025. We keep the full specs here for reference and for anyone checking a second-hand unit.</p>\n<p>It runs on the AMD Ryzen Al 7 350 (4nm), 8 cores / 16 threads. Screen: 16 inches, IPS LCD, 2K (1920 x 1200 pixels), 60Hz. 16GB of memory is the right amount for a laptop you plan to keep for several years. At 1.80 kg, it is fine for occasional carrying. Battery: Li-Ion 59 Wh; 65W adapter.</p>\n<p>Buying new instead? A current HP alternative is the <a href=\"/products/hp-omnibook-x-flip-14-14-fk0033-2025-ryzen-ai-7-350-24gb-1tb-2k-ips-touch\">HP OmniBook X Flip 14 14-FK0033 2025 (Ryzen AI 7 350)</a> (Rs 1,39,999).</p>','[{\"question\":\"Is the HP OmniBook 5 16\\u2013AG1175 2025 (Ryzen AI 7 350) still available in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"No, it is no longer stocked. Its last listed price was Rs 1,36,999.\"},{\"question\":\"When did the HP OmniBook 5 16\\u2013AG1175 2025 (Ryzen AI 7 350) launch in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"It launched in Nepal in 2025.\"},{\"question\":\"Which processor does the HP OmniBook 5 16\\u2013AG1175 2025 (Ryzen AI 7 350) use?\",\"answer\":\"It uses the AMD Ryzen Al 7 350 (4nm), 8 cores \\/ 16 threads.\"}]','[{\"label\":\"GadgetByte Nepal \\u2013 HP OmniBook 5 16\\u2013AG1175 2025 (Ryzen AI 7 350)\",\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/www.gadgetbytenepal.com\\/product\\/hp-omnibook-5-16-ag1175-2025-ryzen-ai-7-35016gb-512gb-16-ips-touch\\/\",\"accessed\":\"2026-11-23\"}]',NULL,NULL,0,'2024-12-31 18:15:00','2024-12-31 18:15:00'),(943,10,4,'JBL Sense Lite','jbl-sense-lite',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,18000.00,NULL,0,NULL,'2026-01-28','available',NULL,0,0,'<p>The JBL Sense Lite costs <strong>Rs 18,000</strong> in Nepal. It launched in Nepal on 28 January 2026. At this price you are paying for strong noise cancellation, better tuning and premium features.</p>\n<p>Drivers: 18 x 11 mm drivers. Battery: Music: 8 hours (buds) / 32 hours (case); Quick charge: 10 minutes = 3 hours playback. Connectivity: Bluetooth 5.4, multipoint, Codecs: AAC, SBC. Water resistance: Earbuds: IP54 dust and splash resistance, Case: No.</p>\n<p>Around the same budget, also look at the <a href=\"/products/huawei-freebuds-7i\">Huawei FreeBuds 7i</a> (Rs 17,990) and the <a href=\"/products/soundcore-liberty-5\">Soundcore Liberty 5</a> (Rs 17,499). You can <a href=\"/compare?category=earbuds&g1=jbl-sense-lite&g2=huawei-freebuds-7i\">compare the JBL Sense Lite with the Huawei FreeBuds 7i</a> side by side.</p>','[{\"question\":\"What is the JBL Sense Lite price in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"The JBL Sense Lite costs Rs 18,000 in Nepal.\"},{\"question\":\"When did the JBL Sense Lite launch in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"It launched in Nepal on 28 January 2026.\"},{\"question\":\"What is the JBL Sense Lite battery like?\",\"answer\":\"Music: 8 hours (buds) \\/ 32 hours (case); Quick charge: 10 minutes = 3 hours playback.\"}]','[{\"label\":\"GadgetByte Nepal \\u2013 JBL Sense Lite\",\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/www.gadgetbytenepal.com\\/product\\/jbl-sense-lite\\/\",\"accessed\":\"2026-11-23\"}]',NULL,NULL,0,'2026-01-27 18:15:00','2026-01-27 18:15:00'),(944,4,4,'OnePlus Nord Buds 3 Pro','oneplus-nord-buds-3-pro',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0.00,NULL,0,'Rs 5,999 last listed price in Nepal','2024-10-07','discontinued',NULL,0,0,'<p>The OnePlus Nord Buds 3 Pro is no longer stocked in Nepal. Its last listed price was <strong>Rs 5,999</strong>. It launched in Nepal on 7 October 2024. We keep the full specs here for reference and for anyone checking a second-hand unit.</p>\n<p>Noise cancellation: Yes (Up to 49dB). Drivers: 12.4 mm dynamic drivers. Battery: Music: 12 hours (buds) / 44 hours (case), With ANC off, 50% volume, AAC; 1 hours (buds) / 1.33 hours (case), Quick charge: 10 minutes = 4 hours playback. Connectivity: Bluetooth 5.4, multipoint, Codecs: AAC, SBC. Water resistance: Earbuds: IP55 dust and splash resistance.</p>\n<p>Buying new instead? A current OnePlus alternative is the <a href=\"/products/oneplus-nord-buds-4\">OnePlus Nord Buds 4</a> (Rs 4,999).</p>','[{\"question\":\"Is the OnePlus Nord Buds 3 Pro still available in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"No, it is no longer stocked. Its last listed price was Rs 5,999.\"},{\"question\":\"When did the OnePlus Nord Buds 3 Pro launch in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"It launched in Nepal on 7 October 2024.\"},{\"question\":\"What is the OnePlus Nord Buds 3 Pro battery like?\",\"answer\":\"Music: 12 hours (buds) \\/ 44 hours (case), With ANC off, 50% volume, AAC; 1 hours (buds) \\/ 1.33 hours (case), Quick charge: 10 minutes = 4 hours playback.\"}]','[{\"label\":\"GadgetByte Nepal \\u2013 OnePlus Nord Buds 3 Pro\",\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/www.gadgetbytenepal.com\\/product\\/oneplus-nord-buds-3-pro\\/\",\"accessed\":\"2026-11-23\"}]',NULL,NULL,0,'2024-10-06 18:15:00','2024-10-06 18:15:00'),(945,41,3,'Acer Swift Edge 14 AI SFE14-51T-960E 2025 (Intel Core Ultra 9 288V)','acer-swift-edge-14-ai-sfe14-51t-960e-2025-intel-core-ultra-9-288v',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,360000.00,NULL,0,NULL,'2026-01-01','available',NULL,0,0,'<p>The Acer Swift Edge 14 AI SFE14-51T-960E 2025 (Intel Core Ultra 9 288V) costs <strong>Rs 3,60,000</strong> in Nepal for the 32GB/1TB model. It launched in Nepal in 2026. This is high-end territory, aimed at heavy gaming, 3D work or video editing.</p>\n<p>It runs on the Intel Core Ultra 9 288V (TSMC N3B), 8 cores / 8 threads. Screen: 14 inches, OLED, WQXGA+ (2880 x 1800 pixels), 120Hz. 32GB of memory gives plenty of headroom for editing and development. At 0.99 kg, it is easy to carry every day. Battery: Li-Ion 65 Wh; 100W adapter.</p>\n<p>Around the same budget, also look at the <a href=\"/products/lenovo-yoga-9-14ill10-2025-core-ultra-7-258v\">Lenovo Yoga 9 Gen 5 14ILL10 2025 (Intel Core Ultra 7 258V)</a> (Rs 3,69,999) and the <a href=\"/products/lenovo-legion-7i-16iax10-2025-intel-core-ultra-9-275hx-rtx-5060\">Lenovo Legion 7i 16IAX10 2025 (Intel Core Ultra 9 275HX)</a> (Rs 3,49,999). You can <a href=\"/compare?category=laptop&g1=acer-swift-edge-14-ai-sfe14-51t-960e-2025-intel-core-ultra-9-288v&g2=lenovo-yoga-9-14ill10-2025-core-ultra-7-258v\">compare the Acer Swift Edge 14 AI SFE14-51T-960E 2025 (Intel Core Ultra 9 288V) with the Lenovo Yoga 9 Gen 5 14ILL10 2025 (Intel Core Ultra 7 258V)</a> side by side.</p>','[{\"question\":\"What is the Acer Swift Edge 14 AI SFE14-51T-960E 2025 (Intel Core Ultra 9 288V) price in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"The Acer Swift Edge 14 AI SFE14-51T-960E 2025 (Intel Core Ultra 9 288V) costs Rs 3,60,000 in Nepal.\"},{\"question\":\"When did the Acer Swift Edge 14 AI SFE14-51T-960E 2025 (Intel Core Ultra 9 288V) launch in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"It launched in Nepal in 2026.\"},{\"question\":\"Which processor does the Acer Swift Edge 14 AI SFE14-51T-960E 2025 (Intel Core Ultra 9 288V) use?\",\"answer\":\"It uses the Intel Core Ultra 9 288V (TSMC N3B), 8 cores \\/ 8 threads.\"}]','[{\"label\":\"GadgetByte Nepal \\u2013 Acer Swift Edge 14 AI SFE14-51T-960E 2025 (Intel Core Ultra 9 288V)\",\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/www.gadgetbytenepal.com\\/product\\/acer-swift-edge-14-ai-sfe14-51t-960e-2025-intel-core-ultra-9-288v\\/\",\"accessed\":\"2026-11-23\"}]',NULL,NULL,0,'2025-12-31 18:15:00','2025-12-31 18:15:00');
INSERT INTO `gadgets` VALUES (946,3,2,'Redmi 15 4G','redmi-15-4g',NULL,'gadgets/2026/redmi-15-4g.webp',NULL,NULL,27999.00,NULL,0,NULL,'2025-09-01','available',NULL,0,0,'<p>The Redmi 15 4G costs <strong>Rs 27,999</strong> in Nepal for the 6GB/128GB model. The 8GB/256GB version costs Rs 29,999. It launched in Nepal on 1 September 2025. It sits in the busiest part of the market, where battery life and a smooth screen matter more than benchmark scores.</p>\n<p>It has a 6.9 inches IPS LCD, 144Hz, 700 nits (typ) screen and runs on the Qualcomm Snapdragon 685 (6nm). The Si-Ca 7000 mAh, non-removable battery is a real strength; most people will get a day and a half or more. Charging: 33W Fast Charging. Cameras: Primary: 50MP, f/1.8, PDAF + Auxiliary lens. It is rated IP64 for dust and water. Software support: 2 years of OS udpates; 6 years of security updates. It is a 4G phone, which works fine on NTC and Ncell today but will not use 5G.</p>\n<p>Around the same budget, also look at the <a href=\"/products/oppo-a6x\">OPPO A6x</a> (Rs 27,999) and the <a href=\"/products/realme-c100i\">Realme C100i</a> (Rs 28,999). You can <a href=\"/compare?category=mobile&g1=redmi-15-4g&g2=oppo-a6x\">compare the Redmi 15 4G with the OPPO A6x</a> side by side.</p>','[{\"question\":\"What is the Redmi 15 4G price in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"The Redmi 15 4G starts at Rs 27,999 in Nepal. All variants: Rs 27,999 for 6GB\\/128GB; Rs 29,999 for 8GB\\/256GB.\"},{\"question\":\"When did the Redmi 15 4G launch in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"It launched in Nepal on 1 September 2025.\"},{\"question\":\"Which processor does the Redmi 15 4G use?\",\"answer\":\"It uses the Qualcomm Snapdragon 685 (6nm).\"},{\"question\":\"What is the Redmi 15 4G battery like?\",\"answer\":\"Si-Ca 7000 mAh, non-removable; 33W Fast Charging.\"}]','[{\"label\":\"GadgetByte Nepal \\u2013 Redmi 15 4G\",\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/www.gadgetbytenepal.com\\/product\\/redmi-15-4g\\/\",\"accessed\":\"2026-11-23\"}]',NULL,NULL,0,'2025-08-31 18:15:00','2025-08-31 18:15:00'),(947,70,2,'Infinix GT 30 Pro','infinixgt-30-pro',NULL,'gadgets/2026/infinixgt-30-pro.webp',NULL,NULL,65999.00,NULL,0,NULL,'2025-06-24','available',NULL,0,0,'<p>The Infinix GT 30 Pro costs <strong>Rs 65,999</strong> in Nepal for the 8GB/256GB model. The 12GB/256GB version costs Rs 69,999. It launched in Nepal on 24 June 2025. At this price you should expect a bright AMOLED panel, a dependable main camera and long software support.</p>\n<p>It has a 6.78 Inches AMOLED, 144Hz, 700 nits (typ), 1600 nits (HBM), 4500 nits (HDR) screen and runs on the Mediatek Dimensity 8350 Ultimate (4nm). The 45W Fast Charging battery may need a top-up on heavy days. Charging: 30W Wireless Charging, 4.5W Reverse Wireless Charging. Cameras: Primary: 108MP, f/1.9, PDAF, 1/1.33” ISOCELL sensor + Ultrawide: 8MP, f/2.2, 111° FOV, 1/4.0\" sensor. It is rated IP64 for dust and water. Software support: 2 years of OS udpates; 3 years of security updates.</p>\n<p>Around the same budget, also look at the <a href=\"/products/tecno-camon-slim\">Tecno Camon Slim</a> (Rs 65,999) and the <a href=\"/products/realme-p3-ultra\">Realme P3 Ultra</a> (Rs 65,999). You can <a href=\"/compare?category=mobile&g1=infinixgt-30-pro&g2=tecno-camon-slim\">compare the Infinix GT 30 Pro with the Tecno Camon Slim</a> side by side.</p>','[{\"question\":\"What is the Infinix GT 30 Pro price in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"The Infinix GT 30 Pro starts at Rs 65,999 in Nepal. All variants: Rs 65,999 for 8GB\\/256GB; Rs 69,999 for 12GB\\/256GB.\"},{\"question\":\"When did the Infinix GT 30 Pro launch in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"It launched in Nepal on 24 June 2025.\"},{\"question\":\"Which processor does the Infinix GT 30 Pro use?\",\"answer\":\"It uses the Mediatek Dimensity 8350 Ultimate (4nm).\"},{\"question\":\"What is the Infinix GT 30 Pro battery like?\",\"answer\":\"45W Fast Charging; 30W Wireless Charging, 4.5W Reverse Wireless Charging.\"}]','[{\"label\":\"GadgetByte Nepal \\u2013 Infinix GT 30 Pro\",\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/www.gadgetbytenepal.com\\/product\\/infinixgt-30-pro\\/\",\"accessed\":\"2026-11-23\"}]',NULL,NULL,0,'2025-06-23 18:15:00','2025-06-23 18:15:00'),(948,38,2,'Honor X7e Plus','honor-x7e-plus',NULL,'gadgets/2026/honor-x7e-plus.webp',NULL,NULL,44999.00,NULL,1,NULL,'2026-07-28','upcoming',NULL,0,0,'<p>The Honor X7e Plus has not launched in Nepal yet. GadgetByte lists an expected price of <strong>Rs 44,999</strong>, so treat it as an estimate until the official launch.</p>\n<p>It has a 6.87 inches TFT LCD, 120Hz, 1020 nits (peak), 860 nits (HBM) screen and runs on the Qualcomm Snapdragon 685 (6nm). The Si/C Li-Po 8100 mAh, non-removable battery is a real strength; most people will get a day and a half or more. Charging: 45W HONOR SuperCharge, 7.5W Reverse Charging. Cameras: Primary: 108MP f/1.8, AF + Auxiliary lens. It is rated IP68 / IP69K for dust and water. It is a 4G phone, which works fine on NTC and Ncell today but will not use 5G.</p>','[{\"question\":\"When will the Honor X7e Plus launch in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"It has not launched in Nepal yet. The expected price is around Rs 44,999.\"},{\"question\":\"Which processor does the Honor X7e Plus use?\",\"answer\":\"It uses the Qualcomm Snapdragon 685 (6nm).\"},{\"question\":\"What is the Honor X7e Plus battery like?\",\"answer\":\"Si\\/C Li-Po 8100 mAh, non-removable; 45W HONOR SuperCharge; 7.5W Reverse Charging.\"}]','[{\"label\":\"GadgetByte Nepal \\u2013 Honor X7e Plus\",\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/www.gadgetbytenepal.com\\/product\\/honor-x7e-plus\\/\",\"accessed\":\"2026-11-23\"}]',NULL,NULL,0,'2026-07-27 18:15:00','2026-07-27 18:15:00'),(949,49,2,'Blackview Wave 7C','blackview-wave-7c',NULL,'gadgets/2026/blackview-wave-7c.webp',NULL,NULL,16999.00,NULL,0,NULL,'2026-07-19','available',NULL,0,0,'<p>The Blackview Wave 7C costs <strong>Rs 16,999</strong> in Nepal for the 4GB/64GB model. The 4GB/128GB version costs Rs 18,999. It launched in Nepal on 19 July 2026. At this price the job is simple: calls,