unit.</p>\n<p>It has a 6.1 inches Super Retina XDR OLED, 60Hz, 800 nits (HBM), 1200 nits (HDR) screen and runs on the Apple A18 (3 nm). The Li-Ion 4005 mAh, non-removable battery may need a top-up on heavy days. Charging: Wired, 50% in 30 min, 7.5W Wireless Charging. Cameras: 48MP, f/1.6, 26 mm, OIS, PDAF, 1/2.55” CMOS sensor. It is rated IP68 for dust and water. Software support: At least 5 years.</p>\n<p>Buying new instead? A current Apple alternative is the <a href=\"/products/apple-iphone-15\">iPhone 15</a> (Rs 1,27,499).</p>','[{\"question\":\"Is the iPhone 16e still available in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"No, it is no longer stocked. Its last listed price was Rs 1,05,999.\"},{\"question\":\"When did the iPhone 16e launch in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"It launched in Nepal on 21 February 2025.\"},{\"question\":\"Which processor does the iPhone 16e use?\",\"answer\":\"It uses the Apple A18 (3 nm).\"},{\"question\":\"What is the iPhone 16e battery like?\",\"answer\":\"Li-Ion 4005 mAh, non-removable; Wired, 50% in 30 min; 7.5W Wireless Charging.\"}]','[{\"label\":\"GadgetByte Nepal \\u2013 iPhone 16e\",\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/www.gadgetbytenepal.com\\/product\\/iphone-16e\\/\",\"accessed\":\"2026-11-23\"}]',NULL,NULL,0,'2025-02-20 18:15:00','2025-02-20 18:15:00'),(951,47,2,'Motorola Moto G05','moto-g05',NULL,'gadgets/2026/moto-g05.webp',NULL,NULL,0.00,NULL,0,'Rs 14,499 last listed price in Nepal','2025-04-17','discontinued',NULL,0,0,'<p>The Motorola Moto G05 is no longer stocked in Nepal. Its last listed price was <strong>Rs 14,499</strong>. It launched in Nepal on 17 April 2025. We keep the full specs here for reference and for anyone checking a second-hand unit.</p>\n<p>It has a 6.67 inches IPS LCD, 90Hz screen and runs on the Mediatek Helio G81 Extreme (12 nm). Its Li-ion 5200 mAh battery should last a full day for most people. Charging: 18W charging. Cameras: Primary: 50 MP, f/1.8, PDAF. It is a 4G phone, which works fine on NTC and Ncell today but will not use 5G.</p>\n<p