lme Note 80</a> (Rs 21,999). You can <a href=\"/compare?category=mobile&g1=blackview-fort-1&g2=tecno-spark-go-3\">compare the Blackview Fort 1 with the Tecno Spark Go 3</a> side by side.</p>','[{\"question\":\"What is the Blackview Fort 1 price in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"The Blackview Fort 1 costs Rs 21,999 in Nepal.\"},{\"question\":\"When did the Blackview Fort 1 launch in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"It launched in Nepal on 27 July 2026.\"},{\"question\":\"Which processor does the Blackview Fort 1 use?\",\"answer\":\"It uses the Unisoc T615 (12nm).\"},{\"question\":\"What is the Blackview Fort 1 battery like?\",\"answer\":\"Li-Po 10000 mAh, non-removable; 18W charging.\"}]','[{\"label\":\"GadgetByte Nepal \\u2013 Blackview Fort 1\",\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/www.gadgetbytenepal.com\\/product\\/blackview-fort-1\\/\",\"accessed\":\"2026-11-23\"}]',NULL,NULL,0,'2026-07-26 18:15:00','2026-07-26 18:15:00'),(1070,49,2,'Blackview Wave 2C','blackview-wave-2c',NULL,'gadgets/2026/blackview-wave-2c.webp',NULL,NULL,10999.00,NULL,0,NULL,'2026-06-08','available',NULL,0,0,'<p>The Blackview Wave 2C costs <strong>Rs 10,999</strong> in Nepal for the 3GB/32GB model. It was announced on 8 June 2026. At this price the job is simple: calls, messaging, social apps and a battery that lasts the day.</p>\n<p>It has a 5 inches TFT LCD, 60Hz, 350 nits (typ), 400 nits (peak) screen and runs on the Unisoc SC9863A1 (28nm). The Li-Po 3000 mAh, non-removable battery may need a top-up on heavy days. Charging: 5W charging. Cameras: Primary: 2MP, f/2.4. It is a 4G phone, which works fine on NTC and Ncell today but will not use 5G.</p>\n<p>Around the same budget, also look at the <a href=\"/products/tecno-spark-go-2\">Tecno Spark Go 2</a> (Rs 11,499) and the <a href=\"/products/blackview-wave-10c\">Blackview Wave 10C</a> (Rs 14,499). You can <a href=\"/compare?category=mobile&g1=blackview-wave-2c&g2=tecno-spark-go-2\">compare the Blackview Wave 2C with the Tecno Spark Go 2</a> side by side.</p>','[{\"question\":\"What is the Blackview Wave 2C price in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"The Blackview Wave 2C costs Rs 10,999 in Nepal.\"},{\"question\":\"Which processor does the Blackview Wave 2C use?\",\"answer\":\"It uses the Unisoc SC9863A1 (28nm).\"},{\"question\":\"What is the Blackview Wave 2C battery like?\",\"answer\":\"Li-Po 3000 mAh, non-removable; 5W charging.\"}]','[{\"label\":\"GadgetByte Nepal \\u2013 Blackview Wave 2C\",\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/www.gadgetbytenepal.com\\/product\\/blackview-wave-2c\\/\",\"accessed\":\"2026-11-23\"}]',NULL,NULL,0,'2026-06-07 18:15:00','2026-06-07 18:15:00'),(1071,9,3,'Dell 15 DC15255 2025 (Ryzen 7 7730U)','dell-15-dc15255-2025-ryzen-7-7730u',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0.00,NULL,0,'Rs 1,09,999 last listed price in Nepal','2025-01-01','discontinued',NULL,0,0,'<p>The Dell 15 DC15255 2025 (Ryzen 7 7730U) is no longer stocked in Nepal. Its last listed price was <strong>Rs 1,09,999</strong>. It launched in Nepal in 2025. We keep the full specs here for reference and for anyone checking a second-hand unit.</p>\n<p>It runs on the AMD Ryzen 7 7730U (7nm), 8 cores / 16 threads. Screen: 15.6 inches, IPS LCD, FHD (1920 x 1080 pixels), 120Hz. 16GB of memory is the right amount for a laptop you plan to keep for several years. At 1.63 kg, it is fine for occasional carrying. Battery: Li-Ion 41 Wh; 65W adapter.</p>\n<p>Buying new instead? A current Dell alternative is the <a href=\"/products/dell-pro-14-plus-pc14250-2025-amd-ryzen-5-pro-230-16gb-512gb-14-fhd\">Dell Pro 14 Plus PC14250 2025 (AMD Ryzen 5 Pro 230)</a> (Rs 1,19,999).</p>','[{\"question\":\"Is the Dell 15 DC15255 2025 (Ryzen 7 7730U) still available in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"No, it is no longer stocked. Its last listed price was Rs 1,09,999.\"},{\"question\":\"When did the Dell 15 DC15255 2025 (Ryzen 7 7730U) launch in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"It launched in Nepal in 2025.\"},{\"question\":\"Which processor does the Dell 15 DC15255 2025 (Ryzen 7 7730U) use?\",\"answer\":\"It uses the AMD Ryzen 7 7730U (7nm), 8 cores \\/ 16 threads.\"}]','[{\"label\":\"GadgetByte Nepal \\u2013 Dell 15 DC15255 2025 (Ryzen 7 7730U)\",\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/www.gadgetbytenepal.com\\/product\\/dell-15-dc15255-2025-ryzen-7-7730u\\/\",\"accessed\":\"2026-11-23\"}]',NULL,NULL,0,'2024-12-31 18:15:00','2024-12-31 18:15:00'),(1072,40,3,'Asus Vivobook 14 Flip TP3407 2025 (Intel Core Ultra 7 256V)','asus-vivobook-14-2025-intel-core-ultra-7-256v',NULL,'gadgets/2026/asus-vivobook-14-2025-intel-core-ultra-7-256v.webp',NULL,NULL,187000.00,NULL,0,NULL,'2026-01-01','available',NULL,0,0,'<p>The Asus Vivobook 14 Flip TP3407 2025 (Intel Core Ultra 7 256V) costs <strong>Rs 1,87,000</strong> in Nepal for the 16GB/1TB model. It launched in Nepal in 2026. At this price you should get a premium build, a better screen and enough memory to last years.</p>\n<p>It runs on the Intel Core Ultra 7 256V (TSMC N3B), 8 cores / 8 threads. Screen: 14 inches, OLED, WUXGA (1920 x 1200 pixels), 60Hz. 16GB of memory is the right amount for a laptop you plan to keep for several years. At 1.57 kg, it is fine for occasional carrying. Battery: Li-ion 75Wh; 65W adapter.</p>\n<p>Around the same budget, also look at the <a href=\"/products/hp-elitebook-ultra-g1q-b16xzua-2025-snapdragon-x-elite-x1e-78-100\">HP EliteBook Ultra G1Q B16XZUA 2025 (Snapdragon X Elite X1E-78-100)</a> (Rs 1,88,100) and the <a href=\"/products/asus-vivobook-s15-2024-x-elite-x1e-78-100\">Asus Vivobook S15 S5507QA 2024 (X Elite X1E 78 100)</a> (Rs 1,88,900). You can <a href=\"/compare?category=laptop&g1=asus-vivobook-14-2025-intel-core-ultra-7-256v&g2=hp-elitebook-ultra-g1q-b16xzua-2025-snapdragon-x-elite-x1e-78-100\">compare the Asus Vivobook 14 Flip TP3407 2025 (Intel Core Ultra 7 256V) with the HP EliteBook Ultra G1Q B16XZUA 2025 (Snapdragon X Elite X1E-78-100)</a> side by side.</p>','[{\"question\":\"What is the Asus Vivobook 14 Flip TP3407 2025 (Intel Core Ultra 7 256V) price in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"The Asus Vivobook 14 Flip TP3407 2025 (Intel Core Ultra 7 256V) costs Rs 1,87,000 in Nepal.\"},{\"question\":\"When did the Asus Vivobook 14 Flip TP3407 2025 (Intel Core Ultra 7 256V) launch in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"It launched in Nepal in 2026.\"},{\"question\":\"Which processor does the Asus Vivobook 14 Flip TP3407 2025 (Intel Core Ultra 7 256V) use?\",\"answer\":\"It uses the Intel Core Ultra 7 256V (TSMC N3B), 8 cores \\/ 8 threads.\"}]','[{\"label\":\"GadgetByte Nepal \\u2013 Asus Vivobook 14 Flip TP3407 2025 (Intel Core Ultra 7 256V)\",\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/www.gadgetbytenepal.com\\/product\\/asus-vivobook-14-2025-intel-core-ultra-7-256v\\/\",\"accessed\":\"2026-11-23\"}]',NULL,NULL,0,'2025-12-31 18:15:00','2025-12-31 18:15:00'),(1073,40,3,'ASUS ROG Strix G16 G614FM (Ryzen 9 9955HX, RTX 5060)','asus-rog-strix-g16-g614fm-2025-ryzen-9-9955hx-rtx-5060',NULL,'gadgets/2026/asus-rog-strix-g16-g614fm-2025-ryzen-9-9955hx-rtx-5060.webp',NULL,NULL,388000.00,NULL,0,NULL,'2025-08-24','available',NULL,0,0,'<p>The Strix G16 G614FM is a CPU-first gaming laptop. AMD\'s <strong>Ryzen 9 9955HX</strong> has 16 cores, 32 threads and a 5.4GHz boost, about as much processing power as fits in a laptop. That suits gamers who also stream with CPU encoding, run game servers, render in Blender or compile large projects. ONIN Infosys sells it in Eclipse Gray for <strong>Rs 3,88,000</strong> with a 2-year international warranty and a year of Perfect Warranty.</p>\n<p>The GPU is an <strong>RTX 5060 8GB</strong> at 115W with ROG Boost. It\'s good at 1080p and 1600p with DLSS, but it\'s the limiting part at the screen\'s native resolution in demanding games. Speaking of the screen: a <strong>16-inch 2.5K 240Hz</strong> ROG Nebula panel with 100% DCI-P3, 3ms response and Dolby Vision. There\'s a <strong>MUX switch</strong>, two <strong>USB4 40Gbps</strong> ports, HDMI 2.1, Ethernet and a 90Wh battery, and it weighs 2.5 kg.</p>\n<p>If gaming frame rates matter more than core count, the <a href=\"/products/asus-rog-strix-g16-g614pp-ryzen-9-8940hx-rtx-5070\">Strix G16 G614PP with RTX 5070</a> costs about Rs 65,000 more and is the faster gaming machine. The <a href=\"/products/asus-rog-strix-g18-g815jpr-2025-14th-gen-i9-14900hx-rtx-5070\">Strix G18 G815JPR</a> gives you an RTX 5070 and a bigger screen for less.</p>','[{\"question\":\"What is the ASUS ROG Strix G16 G614FM price in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"ONIN Infosys sells the ROG Strix G16 G614FM with Ryzen 9 9955HX, RTX 5060 8GB, 16GB DDR5 and 1TB SSD for Rs 3,88,000.\"},{\"question\":\"How many cores does the Ryzen 9 9955HX have?\",\"answer\":\"16 cores and 32 threads, boosting to 5.4GHz.\"},{\"question\":\"Does the Strix G16 G614FM have USB4?\",\"answer\":\"Yes, two USB4 Type-C ports at 40Gbps.\"}]','[{\"label\":\"ONIN Infosys \\u2013 ASUS ROG Strix G16 G614FM (Ryzen 9 9955HX, RTX 5060)\",\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/onin.com.np\\/product\\/asus-rog-strix-g16-ryzen-9-9955hx-rtx-5060-price-nepal\",\"accessed\":\"2026-11-23\"},{\"label\":\"GadgetByte Nepal \\u2013 Asus ROG Strix G16 G614FM 2025 (Ryzen 9 9955HX)\",\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/www.gadgetbytenepal.com\\/product\\/asus-rog-strix-g16-g614fm-2025-ryzen-9-9955hx-rtx-5060\\/\",\"accessed\":\"2026-11-23\"}]',NULL,'https://onin.com.np/product/asus-rog-strix-g16-ryzen-9-9955hx-rtx-5060-price-nepal',0,'2025-08-23 18:15:00','2025-08-23 18:15:00'),(1074,6,4,'Realme Buds T100','realme-buds-t100',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,2499.00,NULL,0,NULL,'2023-12-17','available',NULL,0,0,'<p>The Realme Buds T100 costs <strong>Rs 2,499</strong> in Nepal. It launched in Nepal on 17 December 2023. At this price, expect decent everyday sound for calls, videos and the commute.</p>\n<p>Drivers: 10 mm dynamic bass drivers. Battery: Music: 6 hours (buds) / 28 hours (case). Connectivity: Bluetooth 5.3, multipoint, Codecs: AAC, SBC. Water resistance: Earbuds: IPX5 splash resistance.</p>\n<p>Around the same budget, also look at the <a href=\"/products/boat-airdopes-131-gen-2\">boAt Airdopes 131 Gen 2</a> (Rs 2,499) and the <a href=\"/products/redmi-buds-6-play\">Redmi Buds 6 Play</a> (Rs 2,499). You can <a href=\"/compare?category=earbuds&g1=realme-buds-t100&g2=boat-airdopes-131-gen-2\">compare the Realme Buds T100 with the boAt Airdopes 131 Gen 2</a> side by side.</p>','[{\"question\":\"What is the Realme Buds T100 price in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"The Realme Buds T100 costs Rs 2,499 in Nepal.\"},{\"question\":\"When did the Realme Buds T100 launch in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"It launched in Nepal on 17 December 2023.\"},{\"question\":\"What is the Realme Buds T100 battery like?\",\"answer\":\"Music: 6 hours (buds) \\/ 28 hours (case).\"}]','[{\"label\":\"GadgetByte Nepal \\u2013 Realme Buds T100\",\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/www.gadgetbytenepal.com\\/product\\/realme-buds-t100\\/\",\"accessed\":\"2026-11-23\"}]',NULL,NULL,0,'2023-12-16 18:15:00','2023-12-16 18:15:00'),(1075,6,4,'Realme Buds T200','realme-buds-t200',NULL,'gadgets/2026/realme-buds-t200.webp',NULL,NULL,4499.00,NULL,0,NULL,'2026-07-24','available',NULL,0,0,'<p>The Realme Buds T200 costs <strong>Rs 4,499</strong> in Nepal. It launched in Nepal on 24 July 2026. At this price, expect decent everyday sound for calls, videos and the commute.</p>\n<p>Noise cancellation: 32 dB. Drivers: 12.4 mm dynamic drivers. Battery: Quick charge: 10 minutes = 5 hours playback. Connectivity: Bluetooth 5.3, multipoint, Codecs: AAC, SBC, LDAC. Water resistance: Earbuds: IP55.</p>\n<p>Around the same budget, also look at the <a href=\"/products/boat-airdopes-loop\">boAt Airdopes Loop</a> (Rs 4,499) and the <a href=\"/products/redmi-buds-8-active\">Redmi Buds 8 Active</a> (Rs 4,499). You can <a href=\"/compare?category=earbuds&g1=realme-buds-t200&g2=boat-airdopes-loop\">compare the Realme Buds T200 with the boAt Airdopes Loop</a> side by side.</p>','[{\"question\":\"What is the Realme Buds T200 price in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"The Realme Buds T200 costs Rs 4,499 in Nepal.\"},{\"question\":\"When did the Realme Buds T200 launch in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"It launched in Nepal on 24 July 2026.\"},{\"q