re 7 240H)\",\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/www.gadgetbytenepal.com\\/product\\/acer-nitro-v15-anv15-52-7287-2025-intel-core-7-240h-rtx-4050\\/\",\"accessed\":\"2026-11-23\"}]',NULL,NULL,0,'2025-12-31 18:15:00','2025-12-31 18:15:00'),(1080,76,4,'Kick Phantom Buds X2','kick-phantom-buds-x2',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,2026.00,NULL,0,NULL,'2025-10-31','available',NULL,0,0,'<p>The Kick Phantom Buds X2 costs <strong>Rs 2,026</strong> in Nepal. It launched in Nepal on 31 October 2025. At this price, expect decent everyday sound for calls, videos and the commute.</p>\n<p>Noise cancellation: Yes (Up to 35dB). Drivers: 12.4 mm dynamic bass drivers. Battery: Music: 8 hours (buds) / 100 hours (case); Quick charge: 10 minutes = 1.66 hours playback. Connectivity: Bluetooth 5.4, Codecs: AAC, SBC. Water resistance: Earbuds: IPX5 water resistance.</p>\n<p>Around the same budget, also look at the <a href=\"/products/redmi-buds-5a\">Redmi Buds 5A</a> (Rs 1,999) and the <a href=\"/products/kick-phantom-buds-x-elite\">Kick Phantom Buds X Elite</a> (Rs 1,999). You can <a href=\"/compare?category=earbuds&g1=kick-phantom-buds-x2&g2=redmi-buds-5a\">compare the Kick Phantom Buds X2 with the Redmi Buds 5A</a> side by side.</p>','[{\"question\":\"What is the Kick Phantom Buds X2 price in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"The Kick Phantom Buds X2 costs Rs 2,026 in Nepal.\"},{\"question\":\"When did the Kick Phantom Buds X2 launch in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"It launched in Nepal on 31 October 2025.\"},{\"question\":\"What is the Kick Phantom Buds X2 battery like?\",\"answer\":\"Music: 8 hours (buds) \\/ 100 hours (case); Quick charge: 10 minutes = 1.66 hours playback.\"}]','[{\"label\":\"GadgetByte Nepal \\u2013 Kick Phantom Buds X2\",\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/www.gadgetbytenepal.com\\/product\\/kick-phantom-buds-x2\\/\",\"accessed\":\"2026-11-23\"}]',NULL,NULL,0,'2025-10-30 18:15:00','2025-10-30 18:15:00'),(1081,76,4,'Kick Phantom Buds X2 Neo','kick-phantom-buds-x2-neo',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,1499.00,NULL,0,NULL,'2025-10-31','avai