edmi-pad-2-9-7\">Redmi Pad 2 9.7</a> (Rs 25,999).</p>','[{\"question\":\"Is the Redmi Pad SE 8.7 still available in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"No, it is no longer stocked. Its last listed price was Rs 19,999.\"},{\"question\":\"When did the Redmi Pad SE 8.7 launch in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"It launched in Nepal on 5 October 2024.\"},{\"question\":\"Which processor does the Redmi Pad SE 8.7 use?\",\"answer\":\"It uses the Mediatek Helio G85 (12nm).\"},{\"question\":\"What is the Redmi Pad SE 8.7 battery like?\",\"answer\":\"Li-Po 6650 mAh, non-removable; 18W Charging.\"}]','[{\"label\":\"GadgetByte Nepal \\u2013 Redmi Pad SE 8.7\",\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/www.gadgetbytenepal.com\\/product\\/redmi-pad-se-8-7\\/\",\"accessed\":\"2026-11-23\"}]',NULL,NULL,0,'2024-10-04 18:15:00','2024-10-04 18:15:00'),(1083,41,3,'Acer Nitro 16S AI AN16S-61 (Ryzen AI 7 350, RTX 5070 Ti)','acer-nitro-16s-ai-an16s-61-2025-amd-ryzen-ai-7-350-rtx-5070ti-16gb-1tb-16-wqxga-180hz',NULL,'gadgets/2026/acer-nitro-16s-ai-an16s-61-2025-amd-ryzen-ai-7-350-rtx-5070ti-16gb-1tb-16-wqxga-180hz.webp',NULL,NULL,297499.00,NULL,0,NULL,'2025-01-01','available',NULL,0,0,'<p>This might be the best-value high-end GPU on ONIN Infosys\'s shelf. The Nitro 16S AI puts an <strong>RTX 5070 Ti with 12GB of GDDR7</strong>, a GPU usually found in laptops costing five or six lakh, into a slim Nitro chassis for <strong>Rs 2,97,499</strong>.</p>\n<p>The 12GB of VRAM matters. It lets you use high-resolution textures in new games without stutter, and it gives room for local AI image generation and heavier 3D scenes. ONIN lists a 110W TGP, lower than flagship laptops push the same chip, but still very fast at the <strong>16-inch WQXGA (2560 × 1600) 180Hz</strong> screen\'s native resolution with DLSS 4.</p>\n<p>The CPU is AMD\'s <strong>Ryzen AI 7 350</strong> (8 cores, 16 threads, 50 TOPS NPU). It\'s efficient, which helps the <strong>76Wh battery</strong> last longer when you\'re not gaming. You get a <strong>1TB</strong> SSD and 16GB of DDR5. Ports include two 10Gbps USB-A, a 10Gbps USB-C, a USB 2.0, HDMI and Ethernet. It weighs about 2.2 kg (4.81 lb).</p>\n<p>For more CPU power and an OLED screen at the same price, the <a href=\"/products/acer-predator-helios-neo-16s-ai-phn16s7191aw-2025-intel-core-ultra-9-275hx-rtx-5060\">Predator Helios Neo 16S AI</a> is the alternative, but its RTX 5060 is a clear step down for gaming.</p>','[{\"question\":\"What is the Acer Nitro 16S AI RTX 5070 Ti price in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"ONIN Infosys sells the Nitro 16S AI AN16S-61-R10J with Ryzen AI 7 350, RTX 5070 Ti 12GB, 16GB DDR5 and 1TB SSD for Rs 2,97,499.\"},{\"question\":\"How much VRAM does the RTX 5070 Ti laptop GPU have?\",\"answer\":\"12GB of GDDR7.\"},{\"question\":\"What is the display on the Nitro 16S AI?\",\"answer\":\"A 16-inch WQXGA (2560 \\u00d7 1600) IPS panel at 180Hz with a matte finish.\"}]','[{\"label\":\"ONIN Infosys \\u2013 Acer Nitro 16S AI AN16S-61 (Ryzen AI 7 350, RTX 5070 Ti)\",\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/onin.com.np\\/product\\/acer-nitro-16-ai-an16s-61-r10j-rtx-5070-ti-price-nepal\",\"accessed\":\"2026-11-23\"},{\"label\":\"GadgetByte Nepal \\u2013 Acer Nitro 16S AI AN16S-61 2025 (Ryzen AI 7 350)\",\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/www.gadgetbytenepal.com\\/product\\/acer-nitro-16s-ai-an16s-61-2025-amd-ryzen-ai-7-350-rtx-5070ti-16gb-1tb-16-wqxga-180hz\\/\",\"accessed\":\"2026-11-23\"}]',NULL,'https://onin.com.np/product/acer-nitro-16-ai-an16s-61-r10j-rtx-5070-ti-price-nepal',0,'2024-12-31 18:15:00','2024-12-31 18:15:00'),(1084,41,3,'Acer Predator Helios 16 AI PH16-73-95Q8 2025 (Intel Core Ultra 9 275HX)','acer-predator-helios-16-ai-ph16-73-95q8-2025-intel-core-ultra-9-275hx-rtx-5090',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0.00,NULL,0,'Rs 6,99,999 last listed price in Nepal','2025-01-01','discontinued',NULL,0,0,'<p>The Acer Predator Helios 16 AI PH16-73-95Q8 2025 (Intel Core Ultra 9 275HX) is no longer stocked in Nepal. Its last listed price was <strong>Rs 6,99,999</strong>. It was announced in 2025. We keep the full sp