,999. It launched in Nepal on 29 October 2025. A tablet at this price is mainly for videos, reading, online classes and kids.</p>\n<p>It has a 8.7 inches TFT LCD, 90Hz screen and runs on the Mediatek Helio G99 (6nm). Its Li-Po 5100 mAh, non-removable battery should last a full day for most people. Charging: 15W Charging. Software support: 7 years of OS updates; 7 years of security updates.</p>\n<p>Around the same budget, also look at the <a href=\"/products/honor-pad-x7\">Honor Pad X7</a> (Rs 21,999) and the <a href=\"/products/blackview-tab-80\">Blackview Tab 80</a> (Rs 22,000). You can <a href=\"/compare?category=tablet&g1=samsung-galaxy-tab-a11&g2=honor-pad-x7\">compare the Samsung Galaxy Tab A11 with the Honor Pad X7</a> side by side.</p>','[{\"question\":\"What is the Samsung Galaxy Tab A11 price in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"The Samsung Galaxy Tab A11 starts at Rs 21,999 in Nepal. All variants: Rs 21,999 for WiFi; Rs 36,999 for 5G+WiFi.\"},{\"question\":\"When did the Samsung Galaxy Tab A11 launch in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"It launched in Nepal on 29 October 2025.\"},{\"question\":\"Which processor does the Samsung Galaxy Tab A11 use?\",\"answer\":\"It uses the Mediatek Helio G99 (6nm).\"},{\"question\":\"What is the Samsung Galaxy Tab A11 battery like?\",\"answer\":\"Li-Po 5100 mAh, non-removable; 15W Charging.\"}]','[{\"label\":\"GadgetByte Nepal \\u2013 Samsung Galaxy Tab A11\",\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/www.gadgetbytenepal.com\\/product\\/samsung-galaxy-tab-a11\\/\",\"accessed\":\"2026-11-23\"}]',NULL,NULL,0,'2025-10-28 18:15:00','2025-10-28 18:15:00'),(1126,1,31,'Samsung Galaxy Tab A11+','samsung-galaxy-tab-a11-plus',NULL,'gadgets/2026/samsung-galaxy-tab-a11-plus.webp',NULL,NULL,41999.00,NULL,0,NULL,'2025-11-30','available',NULL,0,0,'<p>The Samsung Galaxy Tab A11+ costs <strong>Rs 41,999</strong> in Nepal for the 6GB - 128GB - Wi-Fi Only model. The 8GB - 256GB - Wi-Fi & 5G version costs Rs 53,999. It launched in Nepal on 30 November 2025. At this price it can double as a note-taking and light work device.</p>\n<p>It has a 11 inches TFT LCD, 90Hz screen and runs on the Mediatek Dimensity 7300 (4nm). The Li-Po 7040 mAh, non-removable battery is a real strength; most people will get a day and a half or more. Charging: 25W Fast Charging. Software support: 7 years of OS updates; 7 years of security updates.</p>\n<p>Around the same budget, also look at the <a href=\"/products/oneplus-pad-go\">OnePlus Pad Go</a> (Rs 39,999) and the <a href=\"/products/blackview-link-8-wifi\">Blackview Link 8 WiFi</a> (Rs 39,999). You can <a href=\"/compare?category=tablet&g1=samsung-galaxy-tab-a11-plus&g2=oneplus-pad-go\">compare the Samsung Galaxy Tab A11+ with the OnePlus Pad Go</a> side by side.</p>','[{\"question\":\"What is the Samsung Galaxy Tab A11+ price in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"The Samsung Galaxy Tab A11+ starts at Rs 41,999 in Nepal. All variants: Rs 41,999 for 6GB - 128GB - Wi-Fi Only; Rs 53,999 for 8GB - 256GB - Wi-Fi & 5G.\"},{\"question\":\"When did the Samsung Galaxy Tab A11+ launch in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"It launched in Nepal on 30 November 2025.\"},{\"question\":\"Which processor does the Samsung Galaxy Tab A11+ use?\",\"answer\":\"It uses the Mediatek Dimensity 7300 (4nm).\"},{\"question\":\"What is the Samsung Galaxy Tab A11+ battery like?\",\"answer\":\"Li-Po 7040 mAh, non-removable; 25W Fast Charging.\"}]','[{\"label\":\"GadgetByte Nepal \\u2013 Samsung Galaxy Tab A11+\",\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/www.gadgetbytenepal.com\\/product\\/samsung-galaxy-tab-a11-plus\\/\",\"accessed\":\"2026-11-23\"}]',NULL,NULL,0,'2025-11-29 18:15:00','2025-11-29 18:15:00'),(1127,9,3,'Dell Inspiron 13 5330 2024 (Intel Core Ultra 7 155H)','dell-inspiron-5330-intel-core-ultra-7-155h',NULL,'gadgets/2026/dell-inspiron-5330-intel-core-ultra-7-155h.webp',NULL,NULL,0.00,NULL,0,'Rs 1,70,000 last listed price in Nepal','2025-01-01','discontinued',NULL,0,0,'<p>The Dell Inspiron 13 5330 2024 (Intel Core Ultra 7 155H) is no longer stocked in Nepal. Its last listed pric