eaPad Slim 5 Gen 10 16IRH10R 2024 (Intel Core 7 240H) still available in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"No, it is no longer stocked. Its last listed price was Rs 1,51,900.\"},{\"question\":\"When did the Lenovo IdeaPad Slim 5 Gen 10 16IRH10R 2024 (Intel Core 7 240H) launch in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"It launched in Nepal in 2025.\"},{\"question\":\"Which processor does the Lenovo IdeaPad Slim 5 Gen 10 16IRH10R 2024 (Intel Core 7 240H) use?\",\"answer\":\"It uses the Intel Core 7 240H (Intel 7), 10 cores \\/ 16 threads.\"}]','[{\"label\":\"GadgetByte Nepal \\u2013 Lenovo IdeaPad Slim 5 Gen 10 16IRH10R 2024 (Intel Core 7 240H)\",\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/www.gadgetbytenepal.com\\/product\\/lenovo-ideapad-slim-5-gen-10-16irh10r-2024-intel-core-7-240h-16gb-512gb\\/\",\"accessed\":\"2026-11-23\"}]',NULL,NULL,0,'2024-12-31 18:15:00','2024-12-31 18:15:00'),(1211,36,2,'Nothing Phone 2a Plus','nothing-phone-2a-plus',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0.00,NULL,0,'Rs 49,999 last listed price in Nepal','2025-02-20','discontinued',NULL,0,0,'<p>The Nothing Phone 2a Plus is no longer stocked in Nepal. Its last listed price was <strong>Rs 49,999</strong>. It launched in Nepal on 20 February 2025. We keep the full specs here for reference and for anyone checking a second-hand unit.</p>\n<p>It has a 6.7 inches AMOLED, 120Hz, 700 nits (typ), 1100 nits (HBM), 1300 nits (HDR) screen and runs on the Mediatek Dimensity 7350 Pro (4nm). Its Li-Po 5000 mAh, non-removable battery should last a full day for most people. Charging: 50W Fast Charging. Cameras: Primary: 50MP, f/1.9, OIS, PDAF, 1/1.57” S5KGN9 sensor + Ultrawide: 50MP, f/2.2, 114° FOV, 1/2.76\" S5KJN1 sensor. It is rated IP54 for dust and water. Software support: 3 years of OS updates; 4 years of security updates.</p>\n<p>Buying new instead? A current Nothing alternative is the <a href=\"/products/nothing-phone-3a-lite\">Nothing Phone 3a Lite</a> (Rs 54,999).</p>','[{\"question\":\"Is the Nothing Phone 2a Plus still available in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"No, it is no longer stocked. Its last listed price was Rs 49,999.\"},{\"question\":\"When did the Nothing Phone 2a Plus launch in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"It launched in Nepal on 20 February 2025.\"},{\"question\":\"Which processor does the Nothing Phone 2a Plus use?\",\"answer\":\"It uses the Mediatek Dimensity 7350 Pro (4nm).\"},{\"question\":\"What is the Nothing Phone 2a Plus battery like?\",\"answer\":\"Li-Po 5000 mAh, non-removable; 50W Fast Charging.\"}]','[{\"label\":\"GadgetByte Nepal \\u2013 Nothing Phone 2a Plus\",\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/www.gadgetbytenepal.com\\/product\\/nothing-phone-2a-plus\\/\",\"accessed\":\"2026-11-23\"}]',NULL,NULL,0,'2025-02-19 18:15:00','2025-02-19 18:15:00'),(1212,6,2,'Realme 14T 5G','realme-14t-5g',NULL,'gadgets/2026/realme-14t-5g.webp',NULL,NULL,0.00,NULL,0,'Rs 36,999 last listed price in Nepal','2025-04-25','discontinued',NULL,0,0,'<p>The Realme 14T 5G is no longer stocked in Nepal. Its last listed price was <strong>Rs 36,999</strong>. It was announced on 25 April 2025. We keep the full specs here for reference and for anyone checking a second-hand unit.</p>\n<p>It has a 6.67 inches AMOLED, 120Hz, 2000 nits (HDR) screen and runs on the MediaTek Dimensity 6300 (6nm). Its Li-Po 6000 mAh, non-removable battery should last a full day for most people. Charging: 45W Fast Charging. Cameras: Primary: 50MP, f/1.8, 27 mm, OIS, PDAF, 1/2.88” PureCel sensor + Depth: 2MP, f/2.4, 1/5\" sensor. It is rated IP68 / IP69 for dust and water. Software support: 3 years of OS updates; 4 years of security updates.</p>\n<p>Buying new instead? A current Realme alternative is the <a href=\"/products/realme-c85-pro\">Realme C85 Pro</a> (Rs 36,999).</p>','[{\"question\":\"Is the Realme 14T 5G still available in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"No, it is no longer stocked. Its last listed price was Rs 36,999.\"},{\"question\":\"Which processor does the Realme 14T 5G use?\",\"answer\":\"It uses the MediaTek Dimensity 6300 (6nm).\"},{\"question\":\"What is the Realme 14T 5G battery