5hs.webp',NULL,NULL,0.00,NULL,0,'Rs 1,72,900 last listed price in Nepal','2024-01-01','discontinued',NULL,0,0,'<p>The Lenovo ThinkBook 14 G7 ARP 2024 (Ryzen 5 7535HS) is no longer stocked in Nepal. Its last listed price was <strong>Rs 1,72,900</strong>. It launched in Nepal in 2024. We keep the full specs here for reference and for anyone checking a second-hand unit.</p>\n<p>It runs on the AMD Ryzen 5 7535HS (6nm), 6 cores / 12 threads. Screen: 14 inches, IPS LCD, WUXGA (1920 x 1200 pixels), 60Hz. 16GB of memory is the right amount for a laptop you plan to keep for several years. At 1.36 kg, it is easy to carry every day. Battery: Li-Ion 60 Wh; 65W adapter.</p>\n<p>Buying new instead? A current Lenovo alternative is the <a href=\"/products/lenovo-thinkpad-z13-gen-1-ryzen-7-pro-6850u\">Lenovo ThinkPad Z13 Gen 1 2022 (Ryzen 7 PRO 6850U)</a> (Rs 1,75,120).</p>','[{\"question\":\"Is the Lenovo ThinkBook 14 G7 ARP 2024 (Ryzen 5 7535HS) still available in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"No, it is no longer stocked. Its last listed price was Rs 1,72,900.\"},{\"question\":\"When did the Lenovo ThinkBook 14 G7 ARP 2024 (Ryzen 5 7535HS) launch in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"It launched in Nepal in 2024.\"},{\"question\":\"Which processor does the Lenovo ThinkBook 14 G7 ARP 2024 (Ryzen 5 7535HS) use?\",\"answer\":\"It uses the AMD Ryzen 5 7535HS (6nm), 6 cores \\/ 12 threads.\"}]','[{\"label\":\"GadgetByte Nepal \\u2013 Lenovo ThinkBook 14 G7 ARP 2024 (Ryzen 5 7535HS)\",\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/www.gadgetbytenepal.com\\/product\\/lenovo-thinkbook-14-g7-2024-ryzen-5-7535hs\\/\",\"accessed\":\"2026-11-23\"}]',NULL,NULL,0,'2023-12-31 18:15:00','2023-12-31 18:15:00'),(1245,39,3,'Lenovo ThinkPad L16 Gen 2 (Core Ultra 7 255H, 16GB/512GB)','lenovo-thinkpad-l16-gen-2-2025-intel-core-ultra-7-255h',NULL,'gadgets/2026/lenovo-thinkpad-l16-gen-2-2025-intel-core-ultra-7-255h.webp',NULL,NULL,266499.00,NULL,0,NULL,'2026-01-01','available',NULL,0,0,'<p>The ThinkPad L16 Gen 2 is for people who spend the whole day inside spreadsheets, ERPs and dashboards and want a bigger canvas without losing the ThinkPad keyboard. It costs <strong>Rs 2,66,499</strong> at ONIN Infosys, ships with <strong>Windows 11 Pro</strong>, and has a <strong>3-year official warranty</strong>.</p>\n<p>This model moves to the H-series <strong>Core Ultra 7 255H</strong>: 16 cores, 22 threads and up to 5.1GHz. It\'s a big jump over the U-series chips in the 14-inch ThinkPads when you\'re crunching data or compiling code. Its <strong>Intel Arc 140T</strong> graphics are strong for an integrated GPU and drive high-resolution external monitors smoothly. You get 16GB of DDR5-5600 (expandable to 64GB) and a 512GB PCIe 4.0 SSD.</p>\n<p>The 16-inch WUXGA panel is 400 nits and anti-glare, and the full-size keyboard has a number pad, which accountants will appreciate. Connectivity matches the L14: two Thunderbolt 4 ports, three USB-A, HDMI 2.1 and Ethernet. At 1.79 kg it\'s portable for its size, and the 57Wh battery is reasonable. If you mostly work in one place and want something more compact, the <a href=\"/products/lenovo-thinkpad-l14-gen-6-2025-intel-core-ultra-7-255u\">L14 Gen 6</a> is about Rs 60,000 cheaper.</p>','[{\"question\":\"What is the Lenovo ThinkPad L16 Gen 2 price in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"ONIN Infosys sells the ThinkPad L16 Gen 2 with Core Ultra 7 255H, 16GB DDR5 and 512GB SSD for Rs 2,66,499, with Windows 11 Pro and a 3-year warranty.\"},{\"question\":\"Does the ThinkPad L16 Gen 2 have a number pad?\",\"answer\":\"Yes. The 16-inch body fits a full keyboard with a numeric keypad.\"},{\"question\":\"What graphics does the ThinkPad L16 Gen 2 use?\",\"answer\":\"Integrated Intel Arc 140T graphics, which are part of the Core Ultra 7 255H.\"}]','[{\"label\":\"ONIN Infosys \\u2013 Lenovo ThinkPad L16 Gen 2 (Core Ultra 7 255H, 16GB\\/512GB)\",\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/onin.com.np\\/product\\/lenovo-thinkpad-l16-gen-2-core-ultra-7-price-nepal\",\"accessed\":\"2026-11-23\"},{\"label\":\"GadgetByte Nepal \\u201