/\",\"accessed\":\"2026-11-23\"}]',NULL,NULL,0,'2024-12-31 18:15:00','2024-12-31 18:15:00'),(1248,9,3,'Dell Inspiron 14 7420 2022 (Intel Core i7-1255U)','dell-inspiron-14-7420-i7-1255u',NULL,'gadgets/2026/dell-inspiron-14-7420-i7-1255u.webp',NULL,NULL,0.00,NULL,0,'Rs 1,50,000 last listed price in Nepal','2022-01-01','discontinued',NULL,0,0,'<p>The Dell Inspiron 14 7420 2022 (Intel Core i7-1255U) is no longer stocked in Nepal. Its last listed price was <strong>Rs 1,50,000</strong>. It launched in Nepal in 2022. We keep the full specs here for reference and for anyone checking a second-hand unit.</p>\n<p>It runs on the Intel Core i7-1255U (Intel 7), 10 cores / 12 threads. Screen: 14 inches, IPS LCD, FHD+ (1920 x 1200 pixels), 60Hz. 16GB of memory is the right amount for a laptop you plan to keep for several years. At 1.57 kg, it is fine for occasional carrying. Battery: Li-Po 54 Wh; 65W adapter, Supports ExpressCharge.</p>\n<p>Buying new instead? A current Dell alternative is the <a href=\"/products/dell-14-plus-2-in-1-db04250-2025-intel-core-ultra-7-256v-16gb-1tb-14-fhd\">Dell 14 Plus 2-in-1 DB04250 2025 (Intel Core Ultra 7 256V)</a> (Rs 1,64,999).</p>','[{\"question\":\"Is the Dell Inspiron 14 7420 2022 (Intel Core i7-1255U) still available in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"No, it is no longer stocked. Its last listed price was Rs 1,50,000.\"},{\"question\":\"When did the Dell Inspiron 14 7420 2022 (Intel Core i7-1255U) launch in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"It launched in Nepal in 2022.\"},{\"question\":\"Which processor does the Dell Inspiron 14 7420 2022 (Intel Core i7-1255U) use?\",\"answer\":\"It uses the Intel Core i7-1255U (Intel 7), 10 cores \\/ 12 threads.\"}]','[{\"label\":\"GadgetByte Nepal \\u2013 Dell Inspiron 14 7420 2022 (Intel Core i7-1255U)\",\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/www.gadgetbytenepal.com\\/product\\/dell-inspiron-14-7420-i7-1255u\\/\",\"accessed\":\"2026-11-23\"}]',NULL,NULL,0,'2021-12-31 18:15:00','2021-12-31 18:15:00'),(1249,9,3,'Dell Inspiron 14 2-in-1 7440 (Core 5 120U, 16GB/1TB)','dell-inspiron-14-x360-intel-core-5-120u',NULL,'gadgets/2026/dell-inspiron-14-x360-intel-core-5-120u.webp',NULL,NULL,131500.00,143999.00,0,NULL,'2024-01-01','available',NULL,0,0,'<p>The Inspiron 14 2-in-1 7440 folds back into a tablet, comes in a soft <strong>Ice Blue</strong>, and has a <strong>1TB</strong> SSD, which is rare at this price. ONIN Infosys has it at <strong>Rs 1,31,500</strong>.</p>\n<p>It runs Intel\'s <strong>Core 5 120U</strong> (10 cores, 12 threads, up to 5.0GHz) with 16GB of DDR5. That\'s a good combination for students and home users who take notes by hand, watch a lot of video, and want plenty of room for photos and downloads. The 14-inch FHD+ (1920 × 1200) touchscreen is anti-glare at 300 nits, so it holds up better under room lights than glossy convertibles.</p>\n<p>The battery is a healthy 54Wh. Ports include two 10Gbps USB ports, two 5Gbps USB ports, HDMI and a microSD slot. At 1.71 kg it\'s heavier than the 1.5 kg convertibles, which you\'ll notice in tablet mode. Note that the 1TB drive is a QLC type, so large sustained file copies slow down a little.</p>\n<p>For a faster AMD chip with Copilot+ AI features in a similar body, see the <a href=\"/products/dell-14-plus-2-in-1-db04255-2025-ryzen-ai-7-350-16gb-1tb-14-fhd\">Dell 14 Plus 2-in-1</a>.</p>','[{\"question\":\"What is the Dell Inspiron 14 2-in-1 7440 price in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"ONIN Infosys sells the Dell Inspiron 14 2-in-1 7440 with Core 5 120U, 16GB RAM and 1TB SSD for Rs 1,31,500.\"},{\"question\":\"Is the Dell Inspiron 14 7440 a touchscreen?\",\"answer\":\"Yes. It is a 2-in-1 with a 14-inch FHD+ anti-glare touchscreen.\"},{\"question\":\"How heavy is it?\",\"answer\":\"About 1.71 kg.\"}]','[{\"label\":\"ONIN Infosys \\u2013 Dell Inspiron 14 2-in-1 7440 (Core 5 120U, 16GB\\/1TB)\",\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/onin.com.np\\/product\\/dell-inspiron-14-2in1-7440-price-in-nepal\",\"accessed\":\"2026-11-23\"},{\"label\":\"GadgetByte Nepal \\u2013 Dell Inspiron 14 x360 (Intel Core 5 120U)\",\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/www.gadgetbytenepal.com\\/product\\/dell-inspiron-14-x360-intel-core-5-120u\\/\",\"accessed\":\"2026-11-23\"}]',NULL,'https://onin.com.np/product/dell-inspiron-14-2in1-7440-price-in-nepal',0,'2023-12-31 18:15:00','2023-12-31 18:15:00'),(1250,9,3,'Dell 14 Plus 2-in-1 DB04255 (Ryzen AI 7 350, 16GB/1TB)','dell-14-plus-2-in-1-db04255-2025-ryzen-ai-7-350-16gb-1tb-14-fhd',NULL,'gadgets/2026/dell-14-plus-2-in-1-db04255-2025-ryzen-ai-7-350-16gb-1tb-14-fhd.webp',NULL,NULL,178499.00,NULL,0,NULL,'2026-01-01','available',NULL,0,0,'<p>The Dell 14 Plus 2-in-1 is a convertible with a properly fast processor. AMD\'s <strong>Ryzen AI 7 350</strong> has 8 cores, an NPU for Copilot+ features and <strong>Radeon 860M</strong> graphics, among the better integrated GPUs for photo editing and light gaming. ONIN Infosys sells it in Midnight Blue for <strong>Rs 1,78,499</strong>.</p>\n<p>It comes with 16GB of LPDDR5X-7500 and a <strong>1TB</strong> SSD, so storage isn\'t a worry. The 14-inch 16:10 touchscreen (1920 × 1200, 300 nits) uses Dell\'s ComfortView low-blue-light tech, and the 360-degree hinge lets you use it as a tablet for notes or reading. A fingerprint reader and backlit keyboard round out the daily-use details.</p>\n<p>The <strong>64Wh battery</strong> is generous for a 1.59 kg convertible, and both USB-C ports (10Gbps) support charging and DisplayPort. There\'s also a USB-A and HDMI.</p>\n<p>It costs more than the Intel-based <a href=\"/products/dell-inspiron-14-x360-intel-core-5-120u\">Inspiron 14 2-in-1 7440</a>. That extra buys a considerably faster CPU and GPU, Copilot+ AI features and a bigger battery, all worth it if you\'ll keep the laptop for years.</p>','[{\"question\":\"What is the Dell 14 Plus 2-in-1 price in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"ONIN Infosys sells the Dell 14 Plus 2-in-1 DB04255 with Ryzen AI 7 350, 16GB LPDDR5X and 1TB SSD for Rs 1,78,499.\"},{\"question\":\"Is the Dell 14 Plus 2-in-1 a Copilot+ PC?\",\"answer\":\"Yes. The Ryzen AI 7 350\'s NPU supports Windows Copilot+ features.\"},{\"question\":\"Does it have a fingerprint reader?\",\"answer\":\"Yes. ONIN lists a fingerprint reader and backlit keyboard.\"}]','[{\"label\":\"ONIN Infosys \\u2013 Dell 14 Plus 2-in-1 DB04255 (Ryzen AI 7 350, 16GB\\/1TB)\",\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/onin.com.np\\/product\\/dell-14-plus-2in1-amd-ryzen-ai7-350-copilot-pc-price\",\"accessed\":\"2026-11-23\"},{\"label\":\"GadgetByte Nepal \\u2013 Dell 14 Plus 2-in-1 DB04255 2025 (Ryzen AI 7 350)\",\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/www.gadgetbytenepal.com\\/product\\/dell-14-plus-2-in-1-db04255-2025-ryzen-ai-7-350-16gb-1tb-14-fhd-\\/\",\"accessed\":\"2026-11-23\"}]',NULL,'https://onin.com.np/product/dell-14-plus-2in1-amd-ryzen-ai7-350-copilot-pc-price',0,'2025-12-31 18:15:00','2025-12-31 18:15:00'),(1251,9,3,'Dell 14 Plus 2-in-1 DB04250 2025 (Intel Core Ultra 7 256V)','dell-14-plus-2-in-1-db04250-2025-intel-core-ultra-7-256v-16gb-1tb-14-fhd',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,164999.00,NULL,0,NULL,'2026-01-01','available',NULL,0,0,'<p>The Dell 14 Plus 2-in-1 DB04250 2025 (Intel Core Ultra 7 256V) costs <strong>Rs 1,64,999</strong> in Nepal for the 16GB/1TB model. It launched in Nepal in 2026. At this price you should get a premium build, a better screen and enough memory to last years.</p>\n<p>It runs on the Intel Core Ultra 7 256V (TSMC N3B), 8 cores / 8 threads. Screen: 14 inches, IPS LCD, WUXGA (1920 x 1200 pixels), 60Hz. 16GB of memory is the right amount for a laptop you plan to keep for several years. At 1.61 kg, it is fine for occasional carrying. Battery: Li-Ion 64 Wh; 65W adapter, Supports ExpressCharge.</p>\n<p>Around the same budget, also look at the <a href=\"/products/lenovo-yoga-slim-7i-aura-edition\">Lenovo Yoga Slim 7i Aura Edition</a> (Rs 1,64,999) and the <a href=\"/products/lenovo-yoga-slim-7i-aura-edition-14ill10-2025-intel-core-ultra-5-226v\">Lenovo Yoga Slim 7i Aura Edition 14ILL10 2025 (Intel Core Ultra 5 226V)</a> (Rs 1,64,999). You can <a href=\"/compare?categor