2026 (AMD Ryzen AI 7 445)</a> side by side.</p>','[{\"question\":\"What is the Dell Pro 14 Plus PB14250 2025 price in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"The Dell Pro 14 Plus PB14250 2025 starts at Rs 1,88,999 in Nepal. All variants: Rs 1,88,999 for Intel Core Ultra 5 235U, 16GB\\/512GB; Rs 2,39,999 for Intel Core Ultra 7 255U, 16GB\\/512GB.\"},{\"question\":\"When did the Dell Pro 14 Plus PB14250 2025 launch in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"It launched in Nepal in 2026.\"},{\"question\":\"Which processor does the Dell Pro 14 Plus PB14250 2025 use?\",\"answer\":\"It uses the Intel Core Ultra 5 235U (Intel 3), 12 cores \\/ 14 threads (base configuration; see prices for other chips).\"}]','[{\"label\":\"GadgetByte Nepal \\u2013 Dell Pro 14 Plus PB14250 2025 (Intel Core Ultra 5 235U)\",\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/www.gadgetbytenepal.com\\/product\\/dell-pro-14-plus-pb14250-2025-intel-core-ultra-5-235u-16gb-512gb-14-fhd\\/\",\"accessed\":\"2026-11-23\"},{\"label\":\"GadgetByte Nepal \\u2013 Dell Pro 14 Plus PB14250 2025 (Intel Core Ultra 7 255U, 16GB, 512GB, 14\\u2033 FHD+)\",\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/www.gadgetbytenepal.com\\/product\\/dell-pro-14-plus-pb14250-2025-intel-core-ultra-7-255u-16gb-512gb-14-fhd\\/\",\"accessed\":\"2026-11-23\"}]',NULL,NULL,0,'2025-12-31 18:15:00','2025-12-31 18:15:00'),(1462,2,3,'Apple MacBook Pro 14-inch M3 (2023)','apple-macbook-pro-14-inch-m3',NULL,'gadgets/2026/apple-macbook-pro-14-inch-m3.webp',NULL,NULL,0.00,NULL,0,'Rs 1,98,000 last listed price in Nepal','2023-01-01','discontinued',NULL,0,0,'<p>The Apple MacBook Pro 14-inch M3 (2023) is no longer stocked in Nepal. Its last listed price was <strong>Rs 1,98,000</strong>. It launched in Nepal in 2023. We keep the full specs here for reference and for anyone checking a second-hand unit.</p>\n<p>It runs on the Apple M3 (3nm). Screen: 14.2 inches, IPS LCD, 3K (3024 x 1964 pixels), 120Hz. 16GB of memory is the right amount for a laptop you plan to keep for several years. At 1.55 kg, it is fine for occasional carrying. Battery: Li-Po 70 Wh; 70W adapter.</p>\n<p>Buying new instead? A current Apple alternative is the <a href=\"/products/macbook-air-m5-13\">Apple MacBook Air 13 (M5)</a> (Rs 2,34,900).</p>','[{\"question\":\"Is the Apple MacBook Pro 14-inch M3 (2023) still available in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"No, it is no longer stocked. Its last listed price was Rs 1,98,000.\"},{\"question\":\"When did the Apple MacBook Pro 14-inch M3 (2023) launch in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"It launched in Nepal in 2023.\"},{\"question\":\"Which processor does the Apple MacBook Pro 14-inch M3 (2023) use?\",\"answer\":\"It uses the Apple M3 (3nm).\"}]','[{\"label\":\"GadgetByte Nepal \\u2013 Apple MacBook Pro 14-inch M3 (2023)\",\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/www.gadgetbytenepal.com\\/product\\/apple-macbook-pro-14-inch-m3\\/\",\"accessed\":\"2026-11-23\"}]',NULL,NULL,0,'2022-12-31 18:15:00','2022-12-31 18:15:00'),(1463,41,3,'Acer Aspire 3 A325-42 (Ryzen 7 7730U, 16GB/512GB)','acer-aspire-3-2023-ryzen-7-7730u',NULL,'gadgets/2026/acer-aspire-3-2023-ryzen-7-7730u.webp',NULL,NULL,107000.00,NULL,0,NULL,'2023-01-01','available',NULL,0,0,'<p>The Aspire 3 A325-42 is a plain-looking laptop with a strong processor inside. Its <strong>Ryzen 7 7730U</strong> has 8 cores and 16 threads with a 4.5GHz boost. That\'s real multitasking muscle for coding, large spreadsheets, research software or the odd video export, at a price where most laptops have 4-core chips. The price at ONIN Infosys is <strong>Rs 1,07,000</strong>.</p>\n<p>Memory is <strong>16GB of dual-channel DDR4</strong>, expandable to 32GB, which also helps the integrated Radeon graphics. The 512GB PCIe SSD can be upgraded to 1TB. The 15.6-inch Full HD IPS ComfyView display is easy on the eyes for long sessions, though like most at this price it\'s not colour-rich. You get three USB-A ports, USB-C and HDMI, with a 55Wh battery.</p>\n<p>At 1.79 kg it\'s comfortable to move around the house or office. Compare it with the <a href=\"/products/acer-aspire-go-15-ag15-42p-ryzen-7-7730u\">Aspire Go 15 AG15-42P</a>, which has the same chip and adds Ethernet and a USB-C port with charging, and with the cheaper <a href=\"/products/lenovo-v15-g4-ryzen-7-7730u-16gb\">Lenovo V15 G4</a>.</p>','[{\"question\":\"What is the Acer Aspire 3 A325-42 Ryzen 7 price in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"ONIN Infosys sells the Aspire 3 A325-42 with Ryzen 7 7730U, 16GB RAM and 512GB SSD for Rs 1,07,000.\"},{\"question\":\"How many cores does the Ryzen 7 7730U have?\",\"answer\":\"8 cores and 16 threads with a 4.5GHz boost.\"},{\"question\":\"Is the Aspire 3 upgradeable?\",\"answer\":\"Yes. RAM can go up to 32GB, and the SSD can be upgraded.\"}]','[{\"label\":\"ONIN Infosys \\u2013 Acer Aspire 3 A325-42 (Ryzen 7 7730U, 16GB\\/512GB)\",\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/onin.com.np\\/product\\/acer-aspire-3-a325-42-ryzen-7-7730u-price-in-nepal\",\"accessed\":\"2026-11-23\"},{\"label\":\"GadgetByte Nepal \\u2013 Acer Aspire 3 A325-42 2023 (Ryzen 7 7730U)\",\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/www.gadgetbytenepal.com\\/product\\/acer-aspire-3-2023-ryzen-7-7730u\\/\",\"accessed\":\"2026-11-23\"}]',NULL,'https://onin.com.np/product/acer-aspire-3-a325-42-ryzen-7-7730u-price-in-nepal',0,'2022-12-31 18:15:00','2022-12-31 18:15:00'),(1464,41,3,'Acer Aspire 3 A315-24P-R2AD 2023 (Ryzen 5 7520U)','acer-aspire-3-2023-ryzen-7520u',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0.00,NULL,0,'Rs 71,000 last listed price in Nepal','2023-01-03','discontinued',NULL,0,0,'<p>The Acer Aspire 3 A315-24P-R2AD 2023 (Ryzen 5 7520U) is no longer stocked in Nepal. Its last listed price was <strong>Rs 71,000</strong>. It was announced on 3 January 2023. We keep the full specs here for reference and for anyone checking a second-hand unit.</p>\n<p>It runs on the AMD Ryzen 5 7520U, 4 cores / 8 threads. Screen: 15.6 inches, TFT LCD, 16:9 aspect ratio, 60Hz. 16GB of memory is the right amount for a laptop you plan to keep for several years. At 1.78 kg, it is fine for occasional carrying. Battery: 3-cell 40 Wh Li-ion; 45W AC Adapter.</p>\n<p>Buying new instead? A current Acer alternative is the <a href=\"/products/acer-aspire-go-15-ag15-32p-39r2-2025-intel-core-3-n355-8gb-256gb-156-fhd\">Acer Aspire Go 15 AG15-32P-39R2 2025 (Intel Core 3 N355)</a> (Rs 72,990).</p>','[{\"question\":\"Is the Acer Aspire 3 A315-24P-R2AD 2023 (Ryzen 5 7520U) still available in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"No, it is no longer stocked. Its last listed price was Rs 71,000.\"},{\"question\":\"Which processor does the Acer Aspire 3 A315-24P-R2AD 2023 (Ryzen 5 7520U) use?\",\"answer\":\"It uses the AMD Ryzen 5 7520U, 4 cores \\/ 8 threads.\"}]','[{\"label\":\"GadgetByte Nepal \\u2013 Acer Aspire 3 A315-24P-R2AD 2023 (Ryzen 5 7520U)\",\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/www.gadgetbytenepal.com\\/product\\/acer-aspire-3-2023-ryzen-7520u\\/\",\"accessed\":\"2026-11-23\"}]',NULL,NULL,0,'2023-01-02 18:15:00','2023-01-02 18:15:00'),(1465,41,3,'Acer Aspire 7 A715-76G-50FE 2022 (12th Gen i5-12450H)','acer-aspire-7-2022-12th-gen-i5-1250h-rtx-2050-16gb-512gb-15-6-fhd-144hz',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0.00,NULL,0,'Rs 78,999 last listed price in Nepal','2022-01-01','discontinued',NULL,0,0,'<p>The Acer Aspire 7 A715-76G-50FE 2022 (12th Gen i5-12450H) is no longer stocked in Nepal. Its last listed price was <strong>Rs 78,999</strong>. It was announced in 2022. We keep the full specs here for reference and for anyone checking a second-hand unit.</p>\n<p>It runs on the Intel Core i5-12450H, 8 cores / 12 threads with NVIDIA GeForce RTX 2050 graphics. Screen: 15.6 inches, IPS LCD, 16:9 aspect ratio, 144Hz. 16GB of memory is the right amount for a laptop you plan to keep for several years. At 2.1 kg, it is best kept on a desk. Battery: 3-cell 50 Wh Li-ion; 135W AC Adapter.</p>\n<p>Buying new instead? A current Acer alternative is the <a href=\"/products/acer-aspire-lite-14-al14-32p-39zh-2024-intel-core-i3-n355\">Acer Aspire Lite 14 AL14-32p-39ZH 2024 (Intel Core i3-N355)</a> (Rs 78,999).</p>','[{\"question\":\"Is the Acer Aspire 7 A715-76G-50FE 2022 (12th Gen i5-12450H) still available in Nepa