 mAh, non-removable; 45W Fast Charging; 5W reverse wireless charging, 15W wireless charging.\"}]','[{\"label\":\"GadgetByte Nepal \\u2013 Nothing Phone 2\",\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/www.gadgetbytenepal.com\\/product\\/nothing-phone-2\\/\",\"accessed\":\"2026-11-23\"}]',NULL,NULL,0,'2023-07-10 18:15:00','2023-07-10 18:15:00'),(1552,70,2,'Infinix Smart 9','infinix-smart-9',NULL,'gadgets/2026/infinix-smart-9.webp',NULL,NULL,0.00,NULL,0,'Rs 11,999 last listed price in Nepal','2024-09-27','discontinued',NULL,0,0,'<p>The Infinix Smart 9 is no longer stocked in Nepal. Its last listed price was <strong>Rs 11,999</strong>. It launched in Nepal on 27 September 2024. We keep the full specs here for reference and for anyone checking a second-hand unit.</p>\n<p>It has a 6.7 inches IPS LCD, 120Hz, 500 nits (typ) screen and runs on the Mediatek Helio G81 (12nm). Its Li-Ion 5000 mAh, non-removable battery should last a full day for most people. Charging: 10W Charging. Cameras: 13MP, f/1.9, 27 mm, 1/3.07” sensor. It is rated IP54 for dust and water. It is a 4G phone, which works fine on NTC and Ncell today but will not use 5G.</p>\n<p>Buying new instead? A current Infinix alternative is the <a href=\"/products/infinix-smart-10\">Infinix Smart 10</a> (Rs 14,999).</p>','[{\"question\":\"Is the Infinix Smart 9 still available in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"No, it is no longer stocked. Its last listed price was Rs 11,999.\"},{\"question\":\"When did the Infinix Smart 9 launch in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"It launched in Nepal on 27 September 2024.\"},{\"question\":\"Which processor does the Infinix Smart 9 use?\",\"answer\":\"It uses the Mediatek Helio G81 (12nm).\"},{\"question\":\"What is the Infinix Smart 9 battery like?\",\"answer\":\"Li-Ion 5000 mAh, non-removable; 10W Charging.\"}]','[{\"label\":\"GadgetByte Nepal \\u2013 Infinix Smart 9\",\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/www.gadgetbytenepal.com\\/product\\/infinix-smart-9\\/\",\"accessed\":\"2026-11-23\"}]',NULL,NULL,0,'2024-09-26 18:15:00','2024-09-26 18:15:00'),(1553,40,3,'Asus ROG Strix G16 G614PM 2025 (Ryzen 9 8940HX)','asus-rog-strix-g16-g614pm-2025-ryzen-9-8940hx-rtx-5060',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,419899.00,NULL,0,NULL,'2026-01-01','available',NULL,0,0,'<p>The Asus ROG Strix G16 G614PM 2025 (Ryzen 9 8940HX) costs <strong>Rs 4,19,899</strong> in Nepal for the 16GB/1TB model. It launched in Nepal in 2026. This is high-end territory, aimed at heavy gaming, 3D work or video editing.</p>\n<p>It runs on the AMD Ryzen 9 8940HX (5nm), 16 cores / 32 threads. Screen: 16 inches, IPS LCD, WQXGA (2560 x 1600 pixels), 240Hz. 16GB of memory is the right amount for a laptop you plan to keep for several years. At 2.5 kg, it is best kept on a desk. Battery: Li-Ion 90 Wh; 280W adapter.</p>\n<p>Around the same budget, also look at the <a href=\"/products/asus-rog-strix-g16-g614fm-2025-ryzen-9-9955hx-rtx-5060\">Asus ROG Strix G16 G614FM 2025 (Ryzen 9 9955HX)</a> (Rs 4,18,900) and the <a href=\"/products/asus-rog-strix-g18-g814fp-2025-ryzen-9-9955hx-rtx-5070\">Asus ROG Strix G18 G814FP 2025 (Ryzen 9 9955HX)</a> (Rs 3,99,999). You can <a href=\"/compare?category=laptop&g1=asus-rog-strix-g16-g614pm-2025-ryzen-9-8940hx-rtx-5060&g2=asus-rog-strix-g16-g614fm-2025-ryzen-9-9955hx-rtx-5060\">compare the Asus ROG Strix G16 G614PM 2025 (Ryzen 9 8940HX) with the Asus ROG Strix G16 G614FM 2025 (Ryzen 9 9955HX)</a> side by side.</p>','[{\"question\":\"What is the Asus ROG Strix G16 G614PM 2025 (Ryzen 9 8940HX) price in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"The Asus ROG Strix G16 G614PM 2025 (Ryzen 9 8940HX) costs Rs 4,19,899 in Nepal.\"},{\"question\":\"When did the Asus ROG Strix G16 G614PM 2025 (Ryzen 9 8940HX) launch in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"It launched in Nepal in 2026.\"},{\"question\":\"Which processor does the Asus ROG Strix G16 G614PM 2025 (Ryzen 9 8940HX) use?\",\"answer\":\"It uses the AMD Ryzen 9 8940HX (5nm), 16 cores \\/ 32 threads.\"}]','[{\"label\":\"GadgetByte Nepal \\u2013 Asus ROG Strix G16 G614PM 2025 (Ryzen 9 8940HX)\",\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/www.gadgetbytenepal.com\\/product\\/asus-rog-strix-g16-g614pm-2025-ryzen-9-8940hx-rtx-5060\\/\",\"accessed\":\"2026-11-23\"}]',NULL,NULL,0,'2025-12-31 18:15:00','2025-12-31 18:15:00'),(1554,40,3,'ASUS ROG Strix Scar 16 G635LW (Core Ultra 9 275HX, RTX 5080)','asus-rog-strix-scar-16-2025-intel-core-ultra-9-275hx-rtx-5080',NULL,'gadgets/2026/asus-rog-strix-scar-16-2025-intel-core-ultra-9-275hx-rtx-5080.webp',NULL,NULL,601499.00,NULL,0,NULL,'2025-01-01','available',NULL,0,0,'<p>The Strix Scar is ROG\'s no-compromise gaming line, and the 2025 Scar 16 G635LW is one of the fastest 16-inch laptops you can buy in Nepal. ONIN Infosys sells it for <strong>Rs 6,01,499</strong>, which includes an ROG backpack, 2 years of international warranty and a year of Perfect Warranty.</p>\n<p>The <strong>RTX 5080 16GB</strong> runs at the full <strong>175W</strong> (150W plus 25W Dynamic Boost). Paired with Intel\'s 24-core <strong>Core Ultra 9 275HX</strong>, it maxes out current games at 2560 × 1600 with path tracing and DLSS 4. The 16GB of VRAM also makes it a capable machine for local AI and heavy 3D work. There\'s <strong>32GB DDR5</strong> and <strong>2TB</strong> of storage in RAID 0.</p>\n<p>The display is a <strong>Mini LED</strong> ROG Nebula HDR panel at 240Hz with 100% DCI-P3 and Dolby Vision. Mini LED delivers far higher brightness for HDR than a normal IPS panel. Connectivity is cutting-edge, with <strong>two Thunderbolt 5</strong> ports (120Gbps), three USB-A, HDMI 2.1 and <strong>2.5Gb Ethernet</strong>. It weighs 2.8 kg.</p>\n<p>Its direct rival on ONIN\'s shelf is the <a href=\"/products/lenovo-legion-pro-7i-2025\">Lenovo Legion Pro 7i with RTX 5080</a>, which has an OLED instead of Mini LED. The Scar costs less and gives you 2TB instead of 1TB.</p>','[{\"question\":\"What is the ASUS ROG Strix Scar 16 RTX 5080 price in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"ONIN Infosys sells the ROG Strix Scar 16 G635LW with Core Ultra 9 275HX, RTX 5080 16GB, 32GB DDR5 and 2TB SSD for Rs 6,01,499, including an ROG backpack.\"},{\"question\":\"What type of display does the Scar 16 use?\",\"answer\":\"A 16-inch 2.5K Mini LED ROG Nebula HDR panel at 240Hz with 100% DCI-P3.\"},{\"question\":\"Does the Scar 16 have Thunderbolt 5?\",\"answer\":\"Yes. It has two Thunderbolt 5 ports at up to 120Gbps.\"}]','[{\"label\":\"ONIN Infosys \\u2013 ASUS ROG Strix Scar 16 G635LW (Core Ultra 9 275HX, RTX 5080)\",\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/onin.com.np\\/product\\/asus-rog-strix-scar-16-g635lx-rtx-5080-ultra9-240hz-nepal\",\"accessed\":\"2026-11-23\"},{\"label\":\"GadgetByte Nepal \\u2013 Asus ROG Strix SCAR 16 G635LW 2025 (Intel Core Ultra 9 275HX)\",\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/www.gadgetbytenepal.com\\/product\\/asus-rog-strix-scar-16-2025-intel-core-ultra-9-275hx-rtx-5080\\/\",\"accessed\":\"2026-11-23\"}]',NULL,'https://onin.com.np/product/asus-rog-strix-scar-16-g635lx-rtx-5080-ultra9-240hz-nepal',0,'2024-12-31 18:15:00','2024-12-31 18:15:00'),(1555,40,3,'ASUS ROG Strix G18 G815JPR (Core i9-14900HX, RTX 5070, 2TB)','asus-rog-strix-g18-g815jpr-2025-14th-gen-i9-14900hx-rtx-5070',NULL,'gadgets/2026/asus-rog-strix-g18-g815jpr-2025-14th-gen-i9-14900hx-rtx-5070.webp',NULL,NULL,378999.00,NULL,0,NULL,'2025-01-01','available',NULL,0,0,'<p>An 18-inch gaming laptop is really a portable desktop. You won\'t carry it to class, but you can move it between rooms, take it home for Dashain, or set it up at a LAN event. The ROG Strix G18 G815JPR is one of the best-value ways to get that experience in Nepal. The price at ONIN Infosys is <strong>Rs 3,78,999</strong> with 2 years of warranty, a year of ASUS Perfect Warranty, lifetime free servicing and an ROG mouse.</p>\n<p>The <strong>18-inch ROG Nebula display</strong> is the star: 2560 × 1600 at <strong>240Hz</strong>, 100% DCI-P3, 3ms response time, Pantone validated and Dolby Vision capable. Behind it is an <strong>RTX 5070 8GB</strong> (115W with ROG Boost) and a <strong>Core i9-14900HX</strong> with 24 cores and a 5.8GHz boost. Storage is a generous <strong>2TB</strong> PCIe 4.0 SSD. Memory is 16GB DDR5 across two slots and expands to 64GB.</p>\n<p>Connectivity is complete: Thunderbolt 4, a 10Gbps USB-C, three 10Gbps USB-A ports, HDMI 2.1, Wi-Fi 7 and an IR webcam. The 90Wh battery helps, but at <strong>3.2 kg</strong> plus a hefty charger, this lives on a desk.</p>\n<p>Oddly, ONIN prices it well below the <a href=\"/products/asus-rog-strix-g18-g815jmr-2025-14th-gen-i9-14900hx-rtx-5060\">Strix G18 G815JMR</a>, which has a slower RTX 5060 but 32GB of RAM. For gaming, this RTX 5070 model is clearly the better buy. Add a second 16GB stick and you\'ve matched the JMR\'s memory for far less.</p>','[{\"question\":\"What is the ASUS ROG Strix G18 G815JPR price in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"ONIN Infosys sells the ROG Strix G18 G815JPR with Core i9-14900HX, RTX 5070 8GB, 16GB DDR5 and 2TB SSD for Rs 3,78,999.\"},{\"question\":\"What is the display on the ROG Strix G18?\",\"answer\":\"An 18-inch ROG Nebula IPS panel at 2560 \\u00d7 1600, 240Hz, 100% DCI-P3, with G-SYNC and Dolby Vision.\"},{\"question\":\"How heavy is the ROG Strix G18?\",\"answer\":\"About 3.2 kg.\"}]','[{\"label\":\"ONIN Infosys \\u2013 ASUS ROG Strix G18 G815JPR (Core i9-14900HX, RTX 5070, 2TB)\",\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/onin.com.np\\/product\\/rog-strix-g18-2025-g815jpr-i9-rtx5070-nepal\",\"accessed\":\"2026-11-23\"},{\"label\":\"GadgetByte Nepal \\u2013 Asus ROG Strix G18 G815JPR 2025 (Intel Core i9-14900HX)\",\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/www.gadgetbytenepal.com\\/product\\/asus-rog-strix-g18-g815jpr-2025-14th-gen-i9-14900hx-rtx-5070\\/\",\"accessed\":\"2026-11-23\"}]',NULL,'https://onin.com.np/product/rog-strix-g18-2025-g815jpr-i9-rtx5070-nepal',0,'2024-12-31 18:15:00','2024-12-31 18:15:00'),(1556,40,3,'ASUS ROG Strix G18 G815JMR (Core i9-14900HX, RTX 5060, 32GB/2TB)','asus-rog-strix-g18-g815jmr-2025-14th-gen-i9-14900hx-rtx-5060',NULL,'gadgets/2026/asus-rog-strix-g18-g815jmr-2025-14th-gen-i9-14900hx-rtx-5060.webp',NULL,NULL,449999.00,NULL,0,NULL,'2025-01-01','available',NULL,0,0,'<p>The Strix G18 G815JMR is configured for people who never want to think about memory or storage. It comes with <strong>32GB DDR5</strong> and a <strong>2TB</strong> SSD, plus a 24-core <strong>Core i9-14900HX</strong> and Volt Green accents on the chassis. ONIN Infosys currently asks <strong>Rs 4,49,999</strong> with 2 years of international warranty and a year of Perfect Warranty.</p>\n<p>You get the same superb <strong>18-inch 2.5K 240Hz</strong> ROG Nebula panel as the rest of the G18 range (100% DCI-P3, Pantone validated, Dolby Vision), along with a per-key RGB keyboard, Thunderbolt 4, Wi-Fi 7, an IR webcam and a 90Wh battery. It weighs 3.2 kg.</p>\n<p>Here\'s the honest catch: the GPU is an <strong>RTX 5060 8GB</strong>. At native 2560 × 1600 in demanding games it needs DLSS, and ONIN sells the <a href=\"/products/asus-rog-strix-g18-g815jpr-2025-14th-gen-i9-14900hx-rtx-5070\">G815JPR with a faster RTX 5070</a> for about Rs 71,000 <em>less</em>. Unless the extra 16GB of RAM matters for your work (VMs, huge After Effects projects) and you can\'t add it yourself, the JPR is the smarter purchase.</p>','[{\"question\":\"What is the ASUS ROG Strix G18 G815JMR price in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"ONIN Infosys sells the ROG Strix G18 G815JMR with Core i9-14900HX, RTX 5060 8GB, 32GB DDR5 and 2TB SSD for Rs 4,49,999.\"},{\"question\":\"Should I buy the G815JMR or the G815JPR?\",\"answer\":\"For gaming, the G815JPR. It has a faster RTX 5070 and costs less at ONIN. The JMR\'s advantage is 32GB of RAM out of the box.\"},{\"question\":\"What warranty does it come with?\",\"answer\":\"2 years of international warranty plus 1 year of ASUS Perfect Warranty.\"}]','[{\"label\":\"ONIN Infosys \\u2013 ASUS ROG Strix G18 G815JMR (Core i9-14900HX, RTX 5060, 32GB\\/2TB)\",\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/onin.com.np\\/product\\/asus-rog-strix-g18-g815jmr-price-nepal\",\"accessed\":\"2026-11-23\"},{\"label\":\"GadgetByte Nepal \\u2013 Asus ROG Strix G18 G815JMR 2025 (Intel Core i9-14900HX)\",\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/www.gadgetbytenepal.com\\/product\\/asus-rog-strix-g18-g815jmr-2025-14th-gen-i9-14900hx-rtx-5060\\/\",\"accessed\":\"2026-11-23\"}]',NULL,'https://onin.com.np/product/asus-rog-strix-g18-g815jmr-price-nepal',0,'2024-12-31 18:15:00','2024-12-31 18:15:00'),(1557,40,3,'Asus ROG Strix G18 G814PP 2025 (Ryzen 9 8940HX)','asus-rog-strix-g18-g814pp-2025-amd-ryzen-9-8940hx-rtx-5070',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,537900.00,NULL,0,NULL,'2026-01-01','available',NULL,0,0,'<p>The Asus ROG Strix G18 G814PP 2025 (Ryzen 9 8940HX) costs <strong>Rs 5,37,900</strong> in Nepal for the 16GB/1TB model. It launched in Nepal in 2026. This is high-end territory, aimed at heavy gaming, 3D work or video editing.</p>\n<p>It runs on the AMD Ryzen 9 8940HX (5nm), 16 cores / 32 threads. Screen: 18 inches, IPS LCD, WQXGA (2560 x 1600 pixels), 240Hz. 16GB of memory is the right amount for a laptop you plan to keep for several years. At 3 kg, it is best kept on a desk. Battery: Li-Ion 90 Wh; 280W adapter.</p>\n<p>Around the same budget, also look at the <a href=\"/products/lenovo-legion-pro-5-16afr10-2025-ryzen-9-9955hx-rtx-5070\">Lenovo Legion Pro 5 16AFR10 2025 (Ryzen 9 9955HX)</a> (Rs 5,23,900) and the <a href=\"/products/asus-rog-zephyrus-g16-gu605cm-2025\">Asus ROG Zephyrus G16 GU605CM 2025 (Intel Core Ultra 7 255H)</a> (Rs 5,05,900). You can <a href=\"/compare?category=laptop&g1=asus-rog-strix-g18-g814pp-2025-amd-ryzen-9-8940hx-rtx-5070&g2=lenovo-legion-pro-5-16afr10-2025-ryzen-9-9955hx-rtx-5070\">compare the Asus ROG Strix G18 G814PP 2025 (Ryzen 9 8940HX) with the Lenovo Legion Pro 5 16AFR10 2025 (Ryzen 9 9955HX)</a> side by side.</p>','[{\"question\":\"What is the Asus ROG Strix G18 G814PP 2025 (Ryzen 9 8940HX) price in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"The Asus ROG Strix G18 G814PP 2025 (Ryzen 9 8940HX) costs Rs 5,37,900 in Nepal.\"},{\"question\":\"When did the Asus ROG Strix G18 G814PP 2025 (Ryzen 9 8940HX) launch in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"It launched in Nepal in 2026.\"},{\"question\":\"Which processor does the Asus ROG Strix G18 G814PP 2025 (Ryzen 9 8940HX) use?\",\"answer\":\"It uses the AMD Ryzen 9 8940HX (5nm), 16 cores \\/ 32 threads.\"}]','[{\"label\":\"GadgetByte Nepal \\u2013 Asus ROG Strix G18 G814PP 2025 (Ryzen 9 8940HX)\",\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/www.gadgetbytenepal.com\\/product\\/asus-rog-strix-g18-g814pp-2025-amd-ryzen-9-8940hx-rtx-5070\\/\",\"accessed\":\"2026-11-23\"}]',NULL,NULL,0,'2025-12-31 18:15:00','2025-12-31 18:15:00'),(1558,40,3,'Asus ROG Flow X13 GV301QE 2021 (Ryzen 9 5900HS)','asus-rog-flow-x13-2021-ryzen-9-5900hs-rtx-3050-ti',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0.00,NULL,0,'Rs 2,38,000 last listed price in Nepal','2021-01-01','discontinued',NULL,0,0,'<p>The Asus ROG Flow X13 GV301QE 2021 (Ryzen 9 5900HS) is no longer stocked in Nepal. Its last listed price was <strong>Rs 2,38,000</strong>. It launched in Nepal in 2021. We keep the full specs here for reference and for anyone checking a second-hand unit.</p>\n<p>It runs on the AMD Ryzen 9 5900HS (7nm), 8 cores / 16 threads. Screen: 13.4 inches, IPS LCD, WQUXGA (3840 x 2400 pixels), 60Hz. 16GB of memory is the right amount for a laptop you plan to keep for several years. At 1.3 kg, it is easy to carry every day. Battery: Li-Ion 62 Wh; 100W adapter.</p>\n<p>Buying new instead? A current ASUS alternative is the <a href=\"/products/asus-vivobook-s14-m3407ga-2026\">Asus Vivobook S14 M3407GA 2026 (Ryzen 7 445)</a> (Rs 2,36,900).</p>','[{\"question\":\"Is the Asus ROG Flow X13 GV301QE 2021 (Ryzen 9 5900HS) still available in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"No, it is no longer stocked. Its last listed price was Rs 2,38,000.\"},{\"question\":\"When did the Asus ROG Flow X13 GV301QE 2021 (Ryzen 9 5900HS) launch in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"It launched in Nepal in 2021.\"},{\"question\":\"Which processor does the Asus ROG Flow X13 GV301QE 2021 (Ryzen 9 5900HS) use?\",\"answer\":\"It uses the AMD Ryzen 9 5900HS (7nm), 8 cores \\/ 16 threads.\"}]','[{\"label\":\"GadgetByte Nepal \\u2013 Asus ROG Flow X13 GV301QE 2021 (Ryzen 9 5900HS)\",\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/www.gadgetbytenepal.com\\/product\\/asus-rog-flow-x13-2021-ryzen-9-5900hs-rtx-3050-ti\\/\",\"accessed\":\"2026-11-23\"}]',NULL,NULL,0,'2020-12-31 18:15:00','2020-12-31 18:15:00'),(1559,40,3,'Asus ProArt PX13 OLED HN7306WU-LX014W 2024 (Ryzen AI 9 HX 370)','asus-proart-px13-oled-ryzen-ai-9-hx-370',NULL,'gadgets/2026/asus-proart-px13-oled-ryzen-ai-9-hx-370.webp',NULL,NULL,0.00,NULL,0,'Rs 3,18,999 last listed price in Nepal','2024-01-01','discontinued',NULL,0,0,'<p>The Asus ProArt PX13 OLED HN7306WU-LX014W 2024 (Ryzen AI 9 HX 370) is no longer stocked in Nepal. Its last listed price was <strong>Rs 3,18,999</strong>. It launched in Nepal in 2024. We keep the full specs here for reference and for anyone checking a second-hand unit.</p>\n<p>It runs on the AMD Ryzen AI 9 HX 370 (4nm), 12 cores / 24 threads. Screen: 13.3 inches, OLED, 3K (2880 x 1800 pixels), 60Hz. At 1.38 kg, it is easy to carry every day. Battery: Li-Ion 73 Wh; 200W adapter.</p>\n<p>Buying new instead? A current ASUS alternative is the <a href=\"/products/asus-zenbook-s-14-oled-ux5406sa-2024\">Asus Zenbook S 14 OLED UX5406SA 2024 (Intel Core Ultra 7 256V)</a> (Rs 3,25,755).</p>','[{\"question\":\"Is the Asus ProArt PX13 OLED HN7306WU-LX014W 2024 (Ryzen AI 9 HX 370) still available in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"No, it is no longer stocked. Its last listed price was Rs 3,18,999.\"},{\"question\":\"When did the Asus ProArt PX13 OLED HN7306WU-LX014W 2024 (Ryzen AI 9 HX 370) launch in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"It launched in Nepal in 2024.\"},{\"question\":\"Which processor does the Asus ProArt PX13 OLED HN7306WU-LX014W 2024 (Ryzen AI 9 HX 370) use?\",\"answer\":\"It uses the AMD Ryzen AI 9 HX 370 (4nm), 12 cores \\/ 24 threads.\"}]','[{\"label\":\"GadgetByte Nepal \\u2013 Asus ProArt PX13 OLED HN7306WU-LX014W 2024 (Ryzen AI 9 HX 370)\",\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/www.gadgetbytenepal.com\\/product\\/asus-proart-px13-oled-ryzen-ai-9-hx-370\\/\",\"accessed\":\"2026-11-23\"}]',NULL,NULL,0,