','available',NULL,0,0,'<p>Pick up the Zenbook S13 and the first thing you notice is that it barely weighs anything: <strong>1.0 kg</strong>, with a body that\'s thinner than most phones are tall. For people who carry their laptop all day, such as consultants, journalists and students walking between campus buildings, that changes how the day feels. The price at ONIN Infosys is <strong>Rs 1,91,000</strong> with a 2-year global warranty and a bag, mouse and mousepad.</p>\n<p>The screen is a <strong>13.3-inch 3K (2880 × 1800) OLED</strong>, Pantone-validated with 100% DCI-P3 and 550-nit HDR peaks, so text is crisp and photos look accurate. A <strong>Core i7-1355U</strong> (10 cores, up to 5.0GHz) with 16GB LPDDR5 and a <strong>1TB</strong> PCIe 4.0 SSD keeps office and browser work fast. A 63Wh battery is big for such a small laptop.</p>\n<p>Despite the thinness you still get <strong>two Thunderbolt 4</strong> ports, a full-size USB-A and HDMI 2.1, so no dongles needed for a projector. The trade-offs: memory is fixed at 16GB, the panel is 60Hz, and Iris Xe graphics are only for light creative work.</p>\n<p>The newer <a href=\"/products/asus-zenbook-s13-oled-ux5304ma-core-ultra-7-155u\">Zenbook S13 with Core Ultra 7 155U</a> adds an NPU and slightly better graphics for about Rs 9,000 more.</p>','[{\"question\":\"What is the ASUS Zenbook S13 OLED UX5304VA price in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"ONIN Infosys sells the Zenbook S13 OLED with Core i7-1355U, 16GB RAM and 1TB SSD for Rs 1,91,000 with a 2-year warranty.\"},{\"question\":\"How heavy is the Zenbook S13 OLED?\",\"answer\":\"About 1.0 kg.\"},{\"question\":\"Does the Zenbook S13 have Thunderbolt?\",\"answer\":\"Yes. It has two Thunderbolt 4 ports, one USB-A 3.2 Gen 2 port and HDMI 2.1.\"}]','[{\"label\":\"ONIN Infosys \\u2013 ASUS Zenbook S13 OLED UX5304VA (Core i7-1355U, 16GB\\/1TB)\",\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/onin.com.np\\/product\\/asus-zenbook-s-13-price-in-nepal\",\"accessed\":\"2026-11-23\"},{\"label\":\"GadgetByte Nepal \\u2013 Asus Zenbook S 13 OLED UX5304VA 2023 (13th Gen i7-1355U)\",\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/www.gadgetbytenepal.com\\/product\\/asus-zenbook-s-13-oled-2023-i7-1355u\\/\",\"accessed\":\"2026-11-23\"}]',NULL,'https://onin.com.np/product/asus-zenbook-s-13-price-in-nepal',0,'2022-12-31 18:15:00','2022-12-31 18:15:00'),(2057,40,3,'Asus Zenbook S 13 OLED UX5304MA 2024 (Core Ultra 7 155H)','asus-zenbook-s-13-oled-core-ultra-7-155h',NULL,'gadgets/2026/asus-zenbook-s-13-oled-core-ultra-7-155h.webp',NULL,NULL,0.00,NULL,0,'Rs 2,02,490 last listed price in Nepal','2024-01-01','discontinued',NULL,0,0,'<p>The Asus Zenbook S 13 OLED UX5304MA 2024 (Core Ultra 7 155H) is no longer stocked in Nepal. Its last listed price was <strong>Rs 2,02,490</strong>. It was announced in 2024. We keep the full specs here for reference and for anyone checking a second-hand unit.</p>\n<p>It runs on the Intel Core Ultra 7 155H, 16 cores / 22 threads. Screen: 13.3 inches, OLED, 3K (2, 120Hz, 600 nits (cd/m2). 16GB of memory is the right amount for a laptop you plan to keep for several years. At 1 kg, it is easy to carry every day. Battery: 63 Wh Li-ion; 65W AC Adapter.</p>\n<p>Buying new instead? A current ASUS alternative is the <a href=\"/products/asus-vivobook-14-flip-tp3407sa-2025\">Asus Vivobook 14 Flip TP3407SA 2025 (Intel Core Ultra 5 226V)</a> (Rs 2,04,900).</p>','[{\"question\":\"Is the Asus Zenbook S 13 OLED UX5304MA 2024 (Core Ultra 7 155H) still available in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"No, it is no longer stocked. Its last listed price was Rs 2,02,490.\"},{\"question\":\"Which processor does the Asus Zenbook S 13 OLED UX5304MA 2024 (Core Ultra 7 155H) use?\",\"answer\":\"It uses the Intel Core Ultra 7 155H, 16 cores \\/ 22 threads.\"}]','[{\"label\":\"GadgetByte Nepal \\u2013 Asus Zenbook S 13 OLED UX5304MA 2024 (Core Ultra 7 155H)\",\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/www.gadgetbytenepal.com\\/product\\/asus-zenbook-s-13-oled-core-ultra-7-155h\\/\",\"accessed\":\"2026-11-23\"}]',NULL,NULL,0,'2023-12-31 18:15:00