GNV) + 50MP 2.5x retractable portrait lens + 13MP ultra wide, with a 32MP selfie camera. Battery: 5160mAh, 45W charging. Notable: First phone with a retractable portrait lens.</p>\n\n<p>Buying used? Check battery health, make sure the phone is registered on NTA\'s MDMS system (<a href=\"/guides/how-to-check-phone-is-official-in-nepal\">how to check</a>), and compare the asking price with a new mid-range phone. If you would rather buy new, the current equivalents are the <a href=\"/products/tecno-camon-slim\">Tecno Camon Slim</a> (Rs 65,999) and the <a href=\"/products/tecno-pova-curve-2\">Tecno Pova Curve 2</a> (Rs 52,999).</p>','[{\"question\":\"When was the Tecno Phantom X2 Pro released?\",\"answer\":\"It launched on 7 December 2022.\"},{\"question\":\"What was the Tecno Phantom X2 Pro launch price?\",\"answer\":\"It launched at \\u20b949,999 in India (12GB\\/256GB). It has been replaced by newer models, so there is no current official Nepal price.\"},{\"question\":\"Which processor does the Tecno Phantom X2 Pro use?\",\"answer\":\"It uses the MediaTek Dimensity 9000 (4nm).\"}]','[]',NULL,NULL,0,'2022-12-06 18:15:00','2022-12-06 18:15:00'),(2445,47,2,'Motorola Edge 50 Ultra','motorola-edge-50-ultra',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0.00,NULL,0,'€999 Europe launch price (12GB/512GB)','2024-04-16','discontinued',NULL,0,0,'<p>The Motorola Edge 50 Ultra launched on 16 April 2024 at €999 in Europe (12GB/512GB). It has since been replaced by newer models, so we list its launch price rather than a current Nepal price. We keep its specs here for reference and for anyone weighing up a second-hand unit.</p>\n<p>It has a 6.7-inch curved pOLED, 1.5K, 144Hz screen and the Snapdragon 8s Gen 3 (4nm). Cameras: 50MP main + 50MP ultra wide + 64MP 3x periscope, with a 50MP selfie camera. Battery: 4500mAh, 125W wired, 50W wireless charging. Notable: Real wood back option, IP68.</p>\n\n<p>Buying used? Check battery health, make sure the phone is registered on NTA\'s MDMS system (<a href=\"/guides/how-to-check-phone-is-official-in-nepal\">how to check</a>), and compare the asking price with a new mid-range phone. If you would rather buy new, the current equivalents are the <a href=\"/products/moto-g96\">Moto G96</a> and the <a href=\"/products/motorola-edge-70-fusion\">Motorola Edge 70 Fusion</a> (Rs 79,999).</p>','[{\"question\":\"When was the Motorola Edge 50 Ultra released?\",\"answer\":\"It launched on 16 April 2024.\"},{\"question\":\"What was the Motorola Edge 50 Ultra launch price?\",\"answer\":\"It launched at \\u20ac999 in Europe (12GB\\/512GB). It has been replaced by newer models, so there is no current official Nepal price.\"},{\"question\":\"Which processor does the Motorola Edge 50 Ultra use?\",\"answer\":\"It uses the Snapdragon 8s Gen 3 (4nm).\"}]','[]',NULL,NULL,0,'2024-04-15 18:15:00','2024-04-15 18:15:00'),(2446,2,39,'Apple Mac mini (M4, 16GB/512GB)','apple-mac-mini-m4-16gb-512gb',NULL,'gadgets/2026/apple-mac-mini-m4-16gb-512gb.webp',NULL,NULL,179999.00,182499.00,0,NULL,NULL,'available',NULL,0,0,'<p>The Mac mini is the cheapest way to get a fast Mac onto a desk, as long as you already own a monitor, keyboard and mouse. This M4 model with <strong>16GB of unified memory and a 512GB SSD</strong> costs <strong>Rs 1,79,999</strong> at ONIN Infosys, and it is roughly the size of a wireless router. It weighs 0.67 kg.</p>\n<p>The M4 has a 10-core CPU and 10-core GPU. That\'s enough for a small design studio, a coding setup, a home office or a family computer that will stay quick for years. It runs almost silently. During Nepal\'s dusty months, the small fan pulling a fraction of the air of a tower PC is a quiet advantage too.</p>\n<p>The ports are the best part. On the front are two USB-C ports and a headphone jack, so you\'re not reaching behind the box for a pen drive. On the back are three Thunderbolt 4 ports, HDMI and Gigabit Ethernet. It can drive multiple displays, and a 4K panel like the <a href=\"/products/benq-ma270u-27-4k-mac-monitor\">BenQ MA270U</a> pairs nicely with macOS scaling.</p>\n<p>Remember to budget for what\'s not in the box, and plan for a UPS. A small one like the 600VA Dahua offline unit keeps it running through a short power cut.</p>','[{\"question\":\"What is the Mac mini M4 price in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"ONIN Infosys sells the Mac mini M4 with 16GB unified memory and 512GB SSD for Rs 1,79,999, with a one-year international warranty.\"},{\"question\":\"Does the Mac mini come with a keyboard and monitor?\",\"answer\":\"No. You need your own display, keyboard and mouse. It connects over HDMI or Thunderbolt\\/USB-C.\"},{\"question\":\"What ports does the Mac mini M4 have?\",\"answer\":\"Two USB-C ports and a 3.5 mm jack on the front; three Thunderbolt 4 ports, HDMI and Gigabit Ethernet on the back.\"}]','[{\"label\":\"ONIN Infosys \\u2013 Apple Mac mini (M4, 16GB\\/512GB)\",\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/onin.com.np\\/product\\/mac-mini-m4-16gb-512gb-price-in-nepal\",\"accessed\":\"2026-11-23\"}]',NULL,'https://onin.com.np/product/mac-mini-m4-16gb-512gb-price-in-nepal',0,'2026-11-22 18:15:00','2026-11-22 18:15:00'),(2447,2,39,'Apple Mac mini (M6, 2026)','apple-mac-mini-m6-2026',NULL,'gadgets/2026/apple-mac-mini-m6-2026.webp',NULL,NULL,180000.00,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,'available',NULL,0,0,'<p>The 2026 Mac mini keeps the same palm-sized 5 × 5-inch body and moves to Apple\'s <strong>M6</strong> chip: a 12-core CPU, a 12-core GPU and dual 16-core Neural Engines for on-device Apple Intelligence. ONIN Infosys lists it from <strong>Rs 1,80,000</strong> with 16GB of unified memory, in 256GB (MHQK4LL/A) and 512GB (MHQL4LL/A) storage versions.</p>\n<p>Compared with the <a href=\"/products/apple-mac-mini-m4-16gb-512gb\">M4 Mac mini</a>, you get two more CPU cores, two more GPU cores, <strong>Wi-Fi 7 and Bluetooth 6</strong>, and a faster <strong>2.5Gb Ethernet</strong> port as standard. It drives up to three external displays from three Thunderbolt 4 ports and HDMI, and keeps the two front USB-C ports and headphone jack.</p>\n<p>Which one should you buy? If the M4 model is still on the shelf with 512GB for about the same money, it is the better deal for storage-hungry users. Choose the M6 if you want the newest chip for longer software support, faster AI features, or Wi-Fi 7 for a newer router. Either way, add a monitor, keyboard, mouse and a small UPS to your budget.</p>','[{\"question\":\"What is the Mac mini M6 price in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"ONIN Infosys lists the 2026 Mac mini with the M6 chip and 16GB memory from Rs 1,80,000. The 512GB model costs more than the 256GB one.\"},{\"question\":\"What is new in the Mac mini M6?\",\"answer\":\"A 12-core CPU and 12-core GPU, dual 16-core Neural Engines, Wi-Fi 7, Bluetooth 6 and 2.5Gb Ethernet, in the same compact body.\"},{\"question\":\"How many monitors can the Mac mini M6 run?\",\"answer\":\"Up to three external displays.\"}]','[{\"label\":\"ONIN Infosys \\u2013 Apple Mac mini (M6, 2026)\",\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/onin.com.np\\/product\\/mac-mini-m6-price-in-nepal\",\"accessed\":\"2026-11-23\"}]',NULL,'https://onin.com.np/product/mac-mini-m6-price-in-nepal',0,'2026-11-22 18:15:00','2026-11-22 18:15:00'),(2448,2,39,'Apple Mac Studio (M4 Max, 36GB/512GB)','apple-mac-studio-m4-max-36gb-512gb',NULL,'gadgets/2026/apple-mac-studio-m4-max-36gb-512gb.webp',NULL,NULL,434999.00,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,'available',NULL,0,0,'<p>The Mac Studio is what you buy when a Mac mini is not enough but you don\'t want a screen attached to your computer. ONIN Infosys has the <strong>M4 Max</strong> version with a 14-core CPU, a 32-core GPU with hardware ray tracing, <strong>36GB of unified memory</strong> and a 512GB SSD for <strong>Rs 4,34,999</strong>.</p>\n<p>The number that matters most for creative studios is the <strong>410GB/s memory bandwidth</strong>. It\'s why 8K timelines, large After Effects comps and big Blender scenes stay fluid on this machine. The fan is large and slow-spinning, so it stays quiet even during long exports.</p>\n<p>Connectivity is built for a busy desk. There are Thunderbolt 5 ports, HDMI 2.1, <strong>10Gb Ethernet</strong> for fast NAS transfers, two USB-A ports for older peripherals, and an SDXC slot on the front for camera cards. It weighs 2.74 kg and sits comfortably under a monitor.</p>\n<p>The one weak spot is storage. 512GB is tight for video work, so plan on a fast external drive. A Thunderbolt or USB 3.2 portable SSD works well for active projects. If your projects are lighter, an <a href=\"/products/apple-mac-mini-m4-16gb-512gb\">M4 Mac mini</a> costs less than half as much.</p>','[{\"question\":\"What is the Mac Studio M4 Max price in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"Rs 4,34,999 at ONIN Infosys for the 14-core CPU, 32-core GPU, 36GB unified memory and 512GB SSD model.\"},{\"question\":\"Who should buy the Mac Studio instead of a Mac mini?\",\"answer\":\"Video editors, motion designers, 3D artists and music producers who need the M4 Max GPU, high memory bandwidth and 10Gb Ethernet.\"},{\"question\":\"Does the Mac Studio include a monitor?\",\"answer\":\"No. It is a desktop unit only. Pair it with your own display, keyboard and mouse.\"}]','[{\"label\":\"ONIN Infosys \\u2013 Apple Mac Studio (M4 Max, 36GB\\/512GB)\",\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/onin.com.np\\/product\\/apple-mac-studio-m4-max-price-nepal\",\"accessed\":\"2026-11-23\"}]',NULL,'https://onin.com.np/product/apple-mac-studio-m4-max-price-nepal',0,'2026-11-22 18:15:00','2026-11-22 18:15:00'),(2449,2,39,'Apple Mac Studio (M5 Max, 36GB/512GB)','apple-mac-studio-m5-max-36gb-512gb',NULL,'gadgets/2026/apple-mac-studio-m5-max-36gb-512gb.webp',NULL,NULL,515000.00,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,'available',NULL,0,0,'<p>The newest Mac Studio swaps in Apple\'s <strong>M5 Max</strong>, and the headline is the CPU: <strong>18 cores</strong> (6 super cores and 12 performance cores), up from 14 on the M4 Max. ONIN Infosys has the 32-core GPU, <strong>36GB</strong>, 512GB model (MHL64LL/A) at <strong>Rs 5,15,000</strong>.</p>\n<p>Memory bandwidth climbs to 460GB/s, and there are now four Thunderbolt 5 ports alongside HDMI 2.1, 10Gb Ethernet, two USB-C and two USB-A ports, and an SD card slot. Wi-Fi 7 and Bluetooth 6 replace the older wireless chips. If your work is CPU-bound, such as code compilation, large audio sessions, photogrammetry or batch RAW exports, the extra cores make a real difference to how long you wait.</p>\n<p>If your bottleneck is GPU rendering, the <a href=\"/products/apple-mac-studio-m4-max-36gb-512gb\">M4 Max Mac Studio</a> has the same 32-core GPU count and costs about Rs 80,000 less. That saving buys a lot of fast external storage, which you\'ll want anyway, because the 36GB memory cannot be upgraded later and 512GB is small for this class of machine.</p>','[{\"question\":\"What is the Mac Studio M5 Max price in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"ONIN Infosys lists the Mac Studio M5 Max (MHL64LL\\/A) with an 18-core CPU, 32-core GPU, 36GB memory and 512GB SSD at Rs 5,15,000.\"},{\"question\":\"Is the M5 Max Mac Studio worth it over the M4 Max?\",\"answer\":\"For CPU-heavy work, yes. It has 18 cores against 14, plus more memory bandwidth and Wi-Fi 7. For GPU-bound work the gap is smaller, because both have a 32-core GPU.\"},{\"question\":\"Can I upgrade the memory later?\",\"answer\":\"No. Unified memory is part of the chip, so choose the configuration you need at purchase.\"}]','[{\"label\":\"ONIN Infosys \\u2013 Apple Mac Studio (M5 Max, 36GB\\/512GB)\",\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/onin.com.np\\/product\\/mac-studio-m5-max-price-in-nepal\",\"accessed\":\"2026-11-23\"}]',NULL,'https://onin.com.np/product/mac-studio-m5-max-price-in-nepal',0,'2026-11-22 18:15:00','2026-11-22 18:15:00'),(2450,40,39,'ASUS V400 AiO V440VAK (Core 5 210H, 16GB/512GB)','asus-v400-aio-v440vak-core-5-210h',NULL,'gadgets/2026/asus-v400-aio-v440vak-core-5-210h.webp',NULL,NULL,167999.00,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,'available',NULL,0,0,'<p>The ASUS V400 is the all-in-one for people who want the desk to look clean. It comes in white, has slim NanoEdge bezels (93% screen-to-body) and a <strong>pop-up privacy webcam</strong> that physically retracts when you\'re not on a call. ONIN Infosys sells it at <strong>Rs 1,67,999</strong>, and it carries a <strong>3-year warranty</strong>, the longest of any all-in-one we list.</p>\n<p>It runs an Intel <strong>Core 5 210H</strong> (8 cores, 12 threads, up to 4.8GHz) with 16GB of DDR5 in two SO-DIMM slots, so it\'s <strong>upgradeable to 32GB</strong>, unlike many AIOs. The 512GB PCIe 4.0 SSD is quick. The 23.8-inch Full HD anti-glare panel covers 100% sRGB, so photos look true to life, and the 1080p camera has an IR sensor for Windows Hello.</p>\n<p>Connectivity is generous: Wi-Fi 6E and Bluetooth 5.4, Gigabit Ethernet, four USB 3.2 ports (one Type-C), a USB 2.0 port, HDMI out to add a second monitor, and HDMI in to use the screen for another device. The built-in speakers are tuned with Dolby Atmos.</p>\n<p>It costs more than Lenovo\'s <a href=\"/products/lenovo-ideacentre-aio-24irh9-i5-13420h\">IdeaCentre AIO</a>. What you\'re paying for is the newer CPU, upgradeable memory, the privacy camera and that 3-year cover, which makes sense for a reception desk or a home office that has to last.</p>','[{\"question\":\"What is the ASUS V400 AiO V440VAK price in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"ONIN Infosys sells the ASUS V400 V440VAK (Core 5 210H, 16GB DDR5, 512GB SSD, 23.8-inch FHD) for Rs 1,67,999 with a 3-year warranty.\"},{\"question\":\"Can I upgrade the RAM on the ASUS V400 all-in-one?\",\"answer\":\"Yes. It uses two DDR5 SO-DIMM slots and supports up to 32GB.\"},{\"question\":\"Does it have a privacy webcam?\",\"answer\":\"Yes. The 1080p IR webcam retracts into the frame when not in use and supports Windows Hello.\"}]','[{\"label\":\"ONIN Infosys \\u2013 ASUS V400 AiO V440VAK (Core 5 210H, 16GB\\/512GB)\",\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/onin.com.np\\/product\\/asus-v400-aio-v440vak-price-nepal-onin-infosys\",\"accessed\":\"2026-11-23\"}]',NULL,'https://onin.com.np/product/asus-v400-aio-v440vak-price-nepal-onin-infosys',0,'2026-11-22 18:15:00','2026-11-22 18:15:00'),(2451,39,39,'Lenovo ThinkCentre Neo 50a 24 Gen 5 All-in-One (Core i5-13420H)','lenovo-thinkcentre-neo-50a-24-gen-5-i5-13420h',NULL,'gadgets/2026/lenovo-thinkcentre-neo-50a-24-gen-5-i5-13420h.webp',NULL,NULL,128499.00,134499.00,0,NULL,NULL,'available',NULL,0,0,'<p>Walk into a bank branch, a clinic reception or a school office in Kathmandu and you\'ll often find a ThinkCentre. The Neo 50a Gen 5 is the current all-in-one version. Everything lives behind a 23.8-inch screen, so there\'s no tower on the floor collecting dust and no cables for staff to trip over. ONIN Infosys has it at <strong>Rs 1,28,499</strong>.</p>\n<p>Inside is an Intel <strong>Core i5-13420H</strong> (8 cores, 12 threads, up to 4.6GHz) with <strong>16GB of DDR5-5200</strong> and a 512GB Gen 4 SSD. That\'s plenty for accounting software, billing systems, Office, browser-based ERPs and video calls running at the same time. The Full HD IPS panel refreshes at 100Hz, covers 99% sRGB and is anti-glare, low-blue-light and flicker-free, which matters when someone stares at it for eight hours.</p>\n<p>The 5MP camera and 3W × 2 Harman speakers handle meetings without a separate webcam. The port selection is properly office-friendly: Ethernet, 10Gbps USB-A and USB-C, two USB 2.0 ports for a barcode scanner or printer, and <strong>HDMI-in</strong>, so the screen can double as a monitor for a laptop. A wireless keyboard is included.</p>\n<p>For home use with a slightly warmer design, compare it with the <a href=\"/products/lenovo-ideacentre-aio-24irh9-i5-13420h\">IdeaCentre AIO 24IRH9</a>, which has the same chip.</p>','[{\"question\":\"What is the Lenovo ThinkCentre Neo 50a Gen 5 price in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"ONIN Infosys sells the ThinkCentre Neo 50a 24 Gen 5 with Core i5-13420H, 16GB DDR5 and 512GB SSD for Rs 1,28,499 with a one-year warranty.\"},{\"question\":\"Can the ThinkCentre Neo 50a be used as a monitor?\",\"answer\":\"Yes. It has an HDMI-in port, so you can connect a laptop or another device and use the 23.8-inch screen as a display.\"},{\"question\":\"Does it come with a keyboard and mouse?\",\"answer\":\"ONIN lists a wireless Lenovo keyboard in the box. Confirm the mouse with the store when ordering.\"}]','[{\"label\":\"ONIN Infosys \\u2013 Lenovo ThinkCentre Neo 50a 24 Gen 5 All-in-One (Core i5-13420H)\",\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/onin.com.np\\/product\\/lenovo-thinkcentre-neo-50a-24-gen-5-price-nepal\",\"accessed\":\"2026-11-23\"}]',NULL,'https://onin.com.np/product/lenovo-thinkcentre-neo-50a-24-gen-5-price-nepal',0,'2026-11-22 18:15:00','2026-11-22 18:15:00'),(2452,39,39,'Lenovo IdeaCentre AIO 24IRH9 (Core i5-13420H, 16GB/512GB)','lenovo-ideacentre-aio-24irh9-i5-13420h',NULL,'gadgets/2026/lenovo-ideacentre-aio-24irh9-i5-13420h.webp',NULL,NULL,131499.00,149999.00,0,NULL,NULL,'available',NULL,0,0,'<p>A family computer should be easy: plug in one cable, switch it on, and it just works for homework, video calls, YouTube and the household accounts. That\'s the job the IdeaCentre AIO 24IRH9 is built for, and at <strong>Rs 1,31,499</strong> from ONIN Infosys it arrives with a <strong>wireless keyboard and mouse</strong> in the box.</p>\n<p>The specification is solid for the money: a 13th-gen <strong>Core i5-13420H</strong> (8 cores, up to 4.6GHz), <strong>16GB DDR5-5200</strong> and a 512GB PCIe 4.0 SSD, so it boots in seconds and doesn\'t choke when the kids open thirty tabs. The 23.8-inch IPS screen is anti-glare, covers 99% of sRGB and runs at 100Hz, which makes scrolling and light games feel smoother than a typical 60Hz office monitor.</p>\n<p>The 5MP <strong>IR camera</strong> supports Windows Hello face login, so nobody has to remember a password. Wi-Fi 6 and Bluetooth 5.1 cover wireless, and Ethernet is there if your ISP router is nearby. An HDMI-in port lets you plug in a laptop or set-top box and use it as a second screen.</p>\n<p>The graphics are Intel UHD, so it\'s not a gaming PC. For serious games, look at a gaming laptop like the <a href=\"/products/lenovo-loq-15-15ahp9-2024-ryzen-7-7445hs\">LOQ 15</a> instead. For an office counter, the <a href=\"/products/lenovo-thinkcentre-neo-50a-24-gen-5-i5-13420h\">ThinkCentre Neo 50a</a> is the more business-minded twin.</p>','[{\"question\":\"What is the Lenovo IdeaCentre AIO 24IRH9 price in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"Rs 1,31,499 at ONIN Infosys for the Core i5-13420H, 16GB DDR5 and 512GB SSD model with a 23.8-inch FHD screen.\"},{\"question\":\"Does the IdeaCentre AIO 24IRH9 support face login?\",\"answer\":\"Yes. The 5MP IR camera supports Windows Hello facial recognition.\"},{\"question\":\"Can I play games on it?\",\"answer\":\"Light and older games, yes. It uses integrated Intel UHD graphics, so modern AAA games are not a good fit.\"}]','[{\"label\":\"ONIN Infosys \\u2013 Lenovo IdeaCentre AIO 24IRH9 (Core i5-13420H, 16GB\\/512GB)\",\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/onin.com.np\\/product\\/lenovo-ideacentre-aio-24irh9-i5-13420h-price-nepal\",\"accessed\":\"2026-11-23\"}]',NULL,'https://onin.com.np/product/lenovo-ideacentre-aio-24irh9-i5-13420h-price-nepal',0,'2026-11-22 18:15:00','2026-11-22 18:15:00'),(2453,40,3,'ASUS Vivobook 15 E1504FA (Ryzen 5 40, 8GB/512GB)','asus-vivobook-15-e1504fa-ryzen-5-40',NULL,'gadgets/2026/asus-vivobook-15-e1504fa-ryzen-5-40.webp',NULL,NULL,89000.00,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,'available',NULL,0,0,'<p>At <strong>Rs 89,000</strong> from ONIN Infosys, the Vivobook 15 E1504FA is one of the cheapest ways to get a 15.6-inch screen, a 512GB SSD and a 4-core Ryzen in one laptop. That makes it an easy recommendation for students and home users who want a big display without stretching past a lakh.</p>\n<p>The <strong>AMD Ryzen 5 40</strong> (4 cores, 8 threads, up to 4.3GHz) with Radeon graphics handles assignments, browser work, video calls and streaming smoothly. Memory is 8GB of LPDDR5-5500 soldered to the board, so it can\'t be upgraded. Buy it knowing that 8GB is what it will always have. The 512GB PCIe 3.0 SSD is comfortable for everyday files.</p>\n<p>You get Wi-Fi 6E and Bluetooth 5.3 (newer than most laptops at this price), a 720p webcam with a privacy shutter, and USB-C, USB-A, USB 2.0 and HDMI ports. The 15.6-inch FHD panel is anti-glare and TÜV-certified but only 250 nits, so it\'s fine indoors. One thing to check: ONIN\'s key specs mention this unit ships <strong>without an operating system</strong>, so ask about Windows activation when you order.</p>\n<p>If you need more memory for multitasking, the <a href=\"/products/lenovo-ideapad-slim-3-15arp10-2025\">Lenovo IdeaPad Slim 3 15ARP10</a> comes with 16GB.</p>','[{\"question\":\"What is the ASUS Vivobook 15 E1504FA price in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"Rs 89,000 at ONIN Infosys for the Ryzen 5 40, 8GB LPDDR5 and 512GB SSD model.\"},{\"question\":\"Does the Vivobook 15 E1504FA come with Windows?\",\"answer\":\"ONIN\'s listing describes this unit as shipping without an OS, so confirm Windows installation with the store before buying.\"},{\"question\":\"Can the RAM be upgraded?\",\"answer\":\"No. The 8GB LPDDR5 memory is onboard and not upgradeable.\"}]','[{\"label\":\"ONIN Infosys \\u2013 ASUS Vivobook 15 E1504FA (Ryzen 5 40, 8GB\\/512GB)\",\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/onin.com.np\\/product\\/asus-vivobook-15-e1504fa-ryzen-5-price-nepal\",\"accessed\":\"2026-11-23\"}]',NULL,'https://onin.com.np/product/asus-vivobook-15-e1504fa-ryzen-5-price-nepal',0,'2026-11-22 18:15:00','2026-11-22 18:15:00'),(2454,40,3,'ASUS Vivobook 14 M1407KA (Ryzen AI 5 330, 16GB/512GB)','asus-vivobook-14-m1407ka-ryzen-ai-5-330',NULL,'gadgets/2026/asus-vivobook-14-m1407ka-ryzen-ai-5-330.webp',NULL,NULL,138999.00,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,'available',NULL,0,0,'<p>The Vivobook 14 M1407KA is one of the most affordable <strong>Copilot+ PCs</strong> in Nepal. Its <strong>Ryzen AI 5 330</strong> includes an AMD XDNA NPU rated at <strong>50 TOPS</strong>, enough for Windows\' on-device AI features like Recall, Live Captions with translation and Cocreator. ONIN Infosys lists it at <strong>Rs 1,38,999</strong> with a 2-year warranty.</p>\n<p>The CPU is a 4-core, 8-thread chip that boosts to 4.5GHz. It\'s efficient rather than fast, so this suits office, study and creative-lite work rather than heavy rendering. There\'s 16GB of DDR5 onboard plus a free SO-DIMM slot, for <strong>up to 32GB</strong> later, and a 512GB PCIe 4.0 SSD.</p>\n<p>The rest is well chosen. The 14-inch WUXGA (1920 × 1200) panel is a taller 16:10 shape at 300 nits. The FHD webcam has <strong>IR face login</strong> and a privacy shutter. Two USB-C ports support charging and display output, and HDMI 2.1 drives a 4K monitor properly. At 1.46 kg it\'s easy to carry. The 42Wh battery is the weak point, so carry the charger on long days.</p>\n<p>Need more CPU muscle rather than AI features? The <a href=\"/products/asus-vivobook-s14-s3407ca-core-ultra-7-255h\">Vivobook S14 with Core Ultra 7 255H</a> has a much bigger battery and a faster processor.</p>','[{\"question\":\"What is the ASUS Vivobook 14 M1407KA price in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"ONIN Infosys sells the Vivobook 14 M1407KA with Ryzen AI 5 330, 16GB DDR5 and 512GB SSD for Rs 1,38,999 with a 2-year warranty.\"},{\"question\":\"Is the Vivobook 14 M1407KA a Copilot+ PC?\",\"answer\":\"Its Ryzen AI 5 330 has a 50 TOPS NPU, which meets Microsoft\'s Copilot+ PC requirement for on-device AI features.\"},{\"question\":\"How much RAM can it take?\",\"answer\":\"Up to 32GB: 16GB onboard plus one SO-DIMM slot.\"}]','[{\"label\":\"ONIN Infosys \\u2013 ASUS Vivobook 14 M1407KA (Ryzen AI 5 330, 16GB\\/512GB)\",\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/onin.com.np\\/product\\/asus-vivobook-14-m1407ka-ryzen-ai-5-330-price-nepal\",\"accessed\":\"2026-11-23\"}]',NULL,'https://onin.com.np/product/asus-vivobook-14-m1407ka-ryzen-ai-5-330-price-nepal',0,'2026-11-22 18:15:00','2026-11-22 18:15:00'),(2455,40,3,'ASUS TUF Gaming A15 FA506NC (Ryzen 7 7445HS, RTX 3050 4GB)','asus-tuf-a15-fa506nc-ryzen-7-7445hs-rtx-3050',NULL,'gadgets/2026/asus-tuf-a15-fa506nc-ryzen-7-7445hs-rtx-3050.webp',NULL,NULL,153499.00,157499.00,0,NULL,NULL,'available',NULL,0,0,'<p>At <strong>Rs 1,53,499</strong>, the TUF A15 is the cheapest dedicated-GPU gaming laptop on ONIN Infosys\'s shelf. ONIN also includes a bag, a mouse, a mousepad and lifetime service support. For a student who mostly plays Valorant, PUBG PC, CS2, Dota 2 or Minecraft, that\'s a lot of laptop for the money.</p>\n<p>Inside is a 6-core <strong>Ryzen 7 7445HS</strong> (12 threads, up to 4.5GHz), <strong>16GB DDR5</strong> (expandable to 32GB) and a 512GB PCIe 4.0 SSD. The GPU is an <strong>RTX 3050 with 4GB</strong> of VRAM at up to 75W with Dynamic Boost. It\'s fine for esports titles at high frame rates, but 4GB of VRAM is tight for new AAA games, which you\'ll play at low to medium settings.</p>\n<p>The screen is where the savings show. It runs at 144Hz with Adaptive-Sync, which is great for shooters, but it only covers about 62% of sRGB, so colours look washed out next to the LOQ\'s 100% sRGB panel. That matters if you also edit photos. You do get an RGB-backlit keyboard, Ethernet, HDMI 2.1, a 10Gbps USB-C with DisplayPort, and three USB-A ports. The 48Wh battery is small.</p>\n<p>For roughly Rs 11,000 more, the <a href=\"/products/lenovo-loq-15-15ahp9-2024-ryzen-7-7445hs\">Lenovo LOQ 15AHP9</a> has the same CPU with an RTX 3050 <em>6GB</em> at 95W and a far better screen. We\'d stretch for it if you can.</p>','[{\"question\":\"What is the ASUS TUF A15 FA506NC price in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"ONIN Infosys sells the TUF A15 with Ryzen 7 7445HS, RTX 3050 4GB, 16GB DDR5 and 512GB SSD for Rs 1,53,499, with a bag, mouse and mousepad.\"},{\"question\":\"Is the RTX 3050 4GB good for gaming?\",\"answer\":\"For esports titles like Valorant, CS2 and Dota 2, yes. For new AAA games, expect low to medium settings because of the 4GB of VRAM.\"},{\"question\":\"How good is the TUF A15 display for photo editing?\",\"answer\":\"Not great. The 144Hz panel covers about 62.5% sRGB, so colours are muted.\"}]','[{\"label\":\"ONIN Infosys \\u2013 ASUS TUF Gaming A15 FA506NC (Ryzen 7 7445HS, RTX 3050 4GB)\",\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/onin.com.np\\/product\\/asus-tuf-a-15-ryzen-7-price-in-nepal\",\"accessed\":\"2026-11-23\"}]',NULL,'https://onin.com.np/product/asus-tuf-a-15-ryzen-7-price-in-nepal',0,'2026-11-22 18:15:00','2026-11-22 18:15:00'),(2456,40,3,'ASUS Zenbook S13 OLED UX5304MA (Core Ultra 7 155U, 16GB/1TB)','asus-zenbook-s13-oled-ux5304ma-core-ultra-7-155u',NULL,'gadgets/2026/asus-zenbook-s13-oled-ux5304ma-core-ultra-7-155u.webp',NULL,NULL,200000.00,208500.00,0,NULL,NULL,'available',NULL,0,0,'<p>The 2024 Zenbook S13 keeps everything that made the original a favourite, including the 1 kg body, a stunning 3K OLED and two Thunderbolt ports, and moves to Intel\'s <strong>Core Ultra 7 155U</strong>. ONIN Infosys currently asks <strong>Rs 2,00,000</strong> with 16GB LPDDR5X, a <strong>1TB</strong> SSD, a 2-year global warranty and a bag, mouse and mousepad.</p>\n<p>The new chip brings 12 cores and an <strong>Intel AI Boost NPU</strong>, which handles background blur, eye contact and noise cancellation on calls without draining the battery. Day-to-day speed is similar to the i7-1355U model. The real gains are efficiency and readiness for newer AI features in Windows.</p>\n<p>The 13.3-inch OLED runs at 2880 × 1800 with <strong>DisplayHDR True Black 600</strong> and 100% DCI-P3, and is Pantone validated. It\'s one of the nicest small screens on any Windows laptop. The 63Wh battery, two Thunderbolt 4 ports, USB-A and HDMI 2.1 are all unchanged.</p>\n<p>Which one to buy? If the price gap with the <a href=\"/products/asus-zenbook-s-13-oled-2023-i7-1355u\">i7-1355U Zenbook S13</a> stays around Rs 9,000, take this newer model for the NPU and longer software runway. If you want a bigger screen, faster graphics and Wi-Fi 7, step up to the <a href=\"/products/asus-zenbook-14-oled-ux3405ca-2025\">Zenbook 14 OLED</a>.</p>','[{\"question\":\"What is the ASUS Zenbook S13 OLED 2024 price in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"ONIN Infosys sells the Zenbook S13 OLED UX5304MA with Core Ultra 7 155U, 16GB RAM and 1TB SSD for Rs 2,00,000.\"},{\"question\":\"What is the difference between the 2023 and 2024 Zenbook S13?\",\"answer\":\"The 2024 model (UX5304MA) uses a Core Ultra 7 155U with an AI NPU instead of a 13th-gen Core i7-1355U, and its OLED reaches 600 nits HDR peak instead of 550.\"},{\"question\":\"Is the RAM upgradeable on the Zenbook S13?\",\"answer\":\"No. The 16GB LPDDR5X memory is soldered.\"}]','[{\"label\":\"ONIN Infosys \\u2013 ASUS Zenbook S13 OLED UX5304MA (Core Ultra 7 155U, 16GB\\/1TB)\",\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/onin.com.np\\/product\\/asus-zenbook-s-13-2024-price-in-nepal\",\"accessed\":\"2026-11-23\"}]',NULL,'https://onin.com.np/product/asus-zenbook-s-13-2024-price-in-nepal',0,'2026-11-22 18:15:00','2026-11-22 18:15:00'),(2457,40,3,'ASUS TUF Gaming F16 FX608 (Core i5-14450HX, RTX 5050)','asus-tuf-f16-fx608-i5-14450hx-rtx-5050',NULL,'gadgets/2026/asus-tuf-f16-fx608-i5-14450hx-rtx-5050.webp',NULL,NULL,202999.00,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,'available',NULL,0,0,'<p>This TUF F16 is an affordable RTX 50-series laptop that gets the fundamentals right. The <strong>RTX 5050 8GB</strong> runs at <strong>115W</strong> (100W plus 15W Dynamic Boost) with a <strong>MUX switch</strong>, which routes frames straight from the GPU to the screen for a few extra percent of performance. ONIN Infosys sells it for <strong>Rs 2,02,999</strong>.</p>\n<p>The <strong>Core i5-14450HX</strong> (10 cores, 16 threads, up to 4.8GHz) is a sensible match for the GPU at 1080p and 1200p. The 16-inch WUXGA (1920 × 1200) screen runs at 144Hz and covers <strong>100% sRGB</strong>, a big step up from the washed-out panels on older budget TUFs. Memory is 16GB DDR5-5600 on SO-DIMM, with a 512GB PCIe 4.0 SSD.</p>\n<p>Practical touches make it easy to recommend. There\'s a <strong>70Wh battery</strong>, a <strong>1080p webcam</strong>, Wi-Fi 6E with Bluetooth 5.4, Ethernet, three 10Gbps USB-A ports and a USB-C with DisplayPort and charging. It weighs 2.2 kg, lighter than most 16-inch gaming laptops.</p>\n<p>Spending Rs 40,000 more gets you the <a href=\"/products/asus-tuf-f16-fx608jhr-i7-14650hx-rtx-5050\">TUF F16 FX608JHR</a>, which adds an i7, a 165Hz screen, Thunderbolt 4 and a 90Wh battery with the same GPU. For pure gaming value, this i5 model is the smarter buy.</p>','[{\"question\":\"What is the ASUS TUF F16 FX608 RTX 5050 price in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"ONIN Infosys sells the TUF F16 FX608 with Core i5-14450HX, RTX 5050 8GB, 16GB DDR5 and 512GB SSD for Rs 2,02,999.\"},{\"question\":\"Does the TUF F16 FX608 have a MUX switch?\",\"answer\":\"Yes. It has a MUX switch plus NVIDIA Advanced Optimus.\"},{\"question\":\"What is the screen like?\",\"answer\":\"16-inch 1920 \\u00d7 1200 IPS at 144Hz, 300 nits and 100% sRGB.\"}]','[{\"label\":\"ONIN Infosys \\u2013 ASUS TUF Gaming F16 FX608 (Core i5-14450HX, RTX 5050)\",\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/onin.com.np\\/product\\/asus-tuf-f16-fx608-core-i5-rtx-5050-price-in-nepal\",\"accessed\":\"2026-11-23\"}]',NULL,'https://onin.com.np/product/asus-tuf-f16-fx608-core-i5-rtx-5050-price-in-nepal',0,'2026-11-22 18:15:00','2026-11-22 18:15:00'),(2458,40,3,'ASUS Vivobook S14 S3407CA (Core Ultra 7 255H, 16GB/1TB)','asus-vivobook-s14-s3407ca-core-ultra-7-255h',NULL,'gadgets/2026/asus-vivobook-s14-s3407ca-core-ultra-7-255h.webp',NULL,NULL,239999.00,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,'available',NULL,0,0,'<p>The Vivobook S14 S3407CA is for buyers who want a fast H-series processor in a slim, sensible 14-inch laptop, without paying the OLED premium of the Zenbooks. It\'s on ONIN Infosys\'s shelf at <strong>Rs 2,39,999</strong> with a 2-year international warranty <em>and</em> a year of ASUS Perfect Warranty, which covers accidental damage.</p>\n<p>The <strong>Core Ultra 7 255H</strong> has 16 cores, boosts to 5.1GHz and includes an NPU. It handles code, data analysis, light video editing and dozens of browser tabs with ease. You get 16GB of LPDDR5 and a <strong>1TB</strong> PCIe 4.0 SSD, so storage won\'t be an early worry. The headline for everyday life is the <strong>70Wh battery</strong>, a lot for a 14-inch laptop.</p>\n<p>The 14-inch WUXGA IPS display is anti-glare and TÜV-certified, though at 300 nits and 45% NTSC it\'s built for comfort rather than colour work. The FHD webcam supports IR face login and has a privacy shutter. Ports include two USB-C with charging and display output, two USB-A and HDMI.</p>\n<p>The <a href=\"/products/asus-zenbook-14-oled-ux3405ca-2025\">Zenbook 14 OLED</a> uses the same chip with a 3K 120Hz OLED and Thunderbolt 4 for about Rs 36,000 more. If you don\'t need those, the S14 is the smarter spend.</p>','[{\"question\":\"What is the ASUS Vivobook S14 S3407CA price in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"ONIN Infosys sells the Vivobook S14 S3407CA with Core Ultra 7 255H, 16GB RAM and 1TB SSD for Rs 2,39,999 with a 2-year international warranty and 1 year of ASUS Perfect Warranty.\"},{\"question\":\"What does ASUS Perfect Warranty cover?\",\"answer\":\"It is ASUS\'s accidental damage protection programme, covering one incident such as a drop or liquid spill during the cover period.\"},{\"question\":\"Does the Vivobook S14 support Windows Hello?\",\"answer\":\"Yes. The FHD webcam includes an IR sensor for face login.\"}]','[{\"label\":\"ONIN Infosys \\u2013 ASUS Vivobook S14 S3407CA (Core Ultra 7 255H, 16GB\\/1TB)\",\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/onin.com.np\\/product\\/asus-vivobook-s14-s3407ca-intel-core-ultra-7-price-nepal\",\"accessed\":\"2026-11-23\"}]',NULL,'https://onin.com.np/product/asus-vivobook-s14-s3407ca-intel-core-ultra-7-price-nepal',0,'2026-11-22 18:15:00','2026-11-22 18:15:00'),(2459,40,3,'ASUS TUF Gaming F16 FX608JHR (Core i7-14650HX, RTX 5050)','asus-tuf-f16-fx608jhr-i7-14650hx-rtx-5050',NULL,'gadgets/2026/asus-tuf-f16-fx608jhr-i7-14650hx-rtx-5050.webp',NULL,NULL,242499.00,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,'available',NULL,0,0,'<p>The FX608JHR is the \"everything sensible\" version of the TUF F16. It keeps the same <strong>RTX 5050 8GB at 115W</strong> as the cheaper i5 model and upgrades almost everything around it. ONIN Infosys has it at <strong>Rs 2,42,499</strong> with <strong>2 years of international warranty plus a year of ASUS Perfect Warranty</strong>.</p>\n<p>The CPU becomes a <strong>Core i7-14650HX</strong> with 16 cores, 24 threads and a 5.2GHz boost, which makes a real difference if you stream, edit or compile. The 16-inch WUXGA panel steps up to <strong>165Hz</strong> with G-SYNC, 100% sRGB and 75% Adobe RGB. The battery grows to <strong>90Wh</strong>, the largest allowed on flights, and a <strong>Thunderbolt 4</strong> port joins the 10Gbps USB-C, three USB-A ports, HDMI 2.1 and Ethernet.</p>\n<p>One detail to confirm: ONIN\'s product title says 512GB SSD while its spec table says 1TB, so ask which you\'re getting.</p>\n<p>Is it worth Rs 40,000 over the <a href=\"/products/asus-tuf-f16-fx608-i5-14450hx-rtx-5050\">TUF F16 FX608 i5</a>? For gaming alone, no. The GPU is identical. For a laptop that also has to survive heavy work, long trips and three years of use, the bigger battery, faster CPU and extra warranty make a strong case. For more GPU, look at the <a href=\"/products/asus-tuf-a16-fa608umi-ryzen-7-260-rtx-5060\">TUF A16 with RTX 5060</a>.</p>','[{\"question\":\"What is the ASUS TUF F16 FX608JHR price in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"ONIN Infosys sells the TUF F16 FX608JHR with Core i7-14650HX, RTX 5050 8GB and 16GB DDR5 for Rs 2,42,499 with 2 years international and 1 year Perfect warranty.\"},{\"question\":\"How big is the TUF F16 FX608JHR battery?\",\"answer\":\"90Wh, the largest battery size you can normally carry on a flight.\"},{\"question\":\"Does it have Thunderbolt 4?\",\"answer\":\"Yes, one Thunderbolt 4 port with DisplayPort and G-SYNC support.\"}]','[{\"label\":\"ONIN Infosys \\u2013 ASUS TUF Gaming F16 FX608JHR (Core i7-14650HX, RTX 5050)\",\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/onin.com.np\\/product\\/asus-tuf-gaming-f16-2025-fx608jhr-price-nepal\",\"accessed\":\"2026-11-23\"}]',NULL,'https://onin.com.np/product/asus-tuf-gaming-f16-2025-fx608jhr-price-nepal',0,'2026-11-22 18:15:00','2026-11-22 18:15:00'),(2460,40,3,'ASUS TUF Gaming A16 FA608UMI (Ryzen 7 260, RTX 5060)','asus-tuf-a16-fa608umi-ryzen-7-260-rtx-5060',NULL,'gadgets/2026/asus-tuf-a16-fa608umi-ryzen-7-260-rtx-5060.webp',NULL,NULL,242999.00,269999.00,0,NULL,NULL,'available',NULL,0,0,'<p>For gamers who want the most frames per rupee from ASUS, this is the TUF to look at. The FA608UMI pairs an <strong>RTX 5060 8GB</strong> (up to 115W with Dynamic Boost) with AMD\'s 8-core <strong>Ryzen 7 260</strong> (16 threads, up to 5.1GHz). ONIN Infosys lists it at <strong>Rs 2,42,999</strong>, the same money as the RTX 5050 <a href=\"/products/asus-tuf-f16-fx608jhr-i7-14650hx-rtx-5050\">TUF F16 FX608JHR</a>.</p>\n<p>That\'s the key comparison. The RTX 5060 is clearly faster than the RTX 5050 in new AAA games, so if gaming is the priority, this A16 wins. The F16 answers with a bigger battery, a 165Hz screen and Thunderbolt 4.</p>\n<p>The 16-inch WUXGA panel runs at 144Hz with a 3ms response time, 100% sRGB and G-SYNC, and there\'s a <strong>MUX switch</strong> with Advanced Optimus. You also get a 70Wh battery, a 1080p webcam, Wi-Fi 6E, Bluetooth 5.4, an RGB keyboard with a number pad and Copilot key, Ethernet, HDMI 2.1 and 10Gbps USB ports. Memory is 16GB DDR5-5600 on SO-DIMM with a 512GB SSD. Add a second drive early. It weighs 2.2 kg.</p>','[{\"question\":\"What is the ASUS TUF A16 FA608UMI price in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"ONIN Infosys sells the TUF A16 FA608UMI-NB73 with Ryzen 7 260, RTX 5060 8GB, 16GB DDR5 and 512GB SSD for Rs 2,42,999.\"},{\"question\":\"Is the RTX 5060 better than the RTX 5050 for gaming?\",\"answer\":\"Yes. The RTX 5060 has more CUDA cores and is noticeably faster in demanding games at 1080p and 1200p.\"},{\"question\":\"Does the TUF A16 FA608UMI have a MUX switch?\",\"answer\":\"Yes, with NVIDIA Advanced Optimus.\"}]','[{\"label\":\"ONIN Infosys \\u2013 ASUS TUF Gaming A16 FA608UMI (Ryzen 7 260, RTX 5060)\",\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/onin.com.np\\/product\\/asus-tuf-gaming-a16-fa608umi-nb73-price-in-nepal\",\"accessed\":\"2026-11-23\"}]',NULL,'https://onin.com.np/product/asus-tuf-gaming-a16-fa608umi-nb73-price-in-nepal',0,'2026-11-22 18:15:00','2026-11-22 18:15:00'),(2461,40,3,'ASUS TUF Gaming F16 FX607 (Core i7-14650HX, RTX 5060, 2.5K)','asus-tuf-f16-fx607-i7-14650hx-rtx-5060',NULL,'gadgets/2026/asus-tuf-f16-fx607-i7-14650hx-rtx-5060.webp',NULL,NULL,272499.00,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,'available',NULL,0,0,'<p>The top TUF on ONIN Infosys\'s shelf is also the most complete. The 2025 TUF F16 FX607 combines a <strong>2.5K (2560 × 1600) 165Hz</strong> display, an <strong>RTX 5060 8GB at 115W</strong>, a 16-core <strong>Core i7-14650HX</strong> and a <strong>1TB SSD</strong>. It costs <strong>Rs 2,72,499</strong>, and you can ignore the \"116GB RAM\" typo in ONIN\'s product title: it\'s 16GB of DDR5-5600 on SO-DIMM.</p>\n<p>The higher-resolution screen is the reason to choose it. At 400 nits and 100% sRGB, text is sharper for coding and documents, and games look crisper when you use DLSS to render below native resolution. The RTX 5060 drives it well in most titles at high settings.</p>\n<p>It also has a <strong>90Wh battery</strong>, Thunderbolt 4, three 10Gbps USB-A ports, a 10Gbps USB-C, Ethernet, an RGB keyboard and an <strong>IR webcam</strong> for Windows Hello. That\'s unusually complete for a TUF.</p>\n<p>Compared with the <a href=\"/products/asus-tuf-a16-fa608umi-ryzen-7-260-rtx-5060\">TUF A16 FA608UMI</a>, which has the same GPU and a 1200p screen for about Rs 30,000 less, this F16 is the better all-rounder. If you only want to play esports titles, the A16 is the smarter buy.</p>','[{\"question\":\"What is the ASUS TUF F16 FX607 RTX 5060 price in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"ONIN Infosys sells the 2025 TUF F16 FX607 with Core i7-14650HX, RTX 5060 8GB, 16GB DDR5 and 1TB SSD for Rs 2,72,499.\"},{\"question\":\"What resolution is the TUF F16 FX607 display?\",\"answer\":\"16-inch 2.5K (2560 \\u00d7 1600) at 165Hz, 400 nits and 100% sRGB.\"},{\"question\":\"Does it support face login?\",\"answer\":\"Yes. The 1080p webcam has an IR sensor for Windows Hello.\"}]','[{\"label\":\"ONIN Infosys \\u2013 ASUS TUF Gaming F16 FX607 (Core i7-14650HX, RTX 5060, 2.5K)\",\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/onin.com.np\\/product\\/asus-tuf-f16-2025-i7-14650hx-rtx-5060-price-nepal\",\"accessed\":\"2026-11-23\"}]',NULL,'https://onin.com.np/product/asus-tuf-f16-2025-i7-14650hx-rtx-5060-price-nepal',0,'2026-11-22 18:15:00','2026-11-22 18:15:00'),(2462,40,3,'ASUS ROG Strix G16 G614PP (Ryzen 9 8940HX, RTX 5070)','asus-rog-strix-g16-g614pp-ryzen-9-8940hx-rtx-5070',NULL,'gadgets/2026/asus-rog-strix-g16-g614pp-ryzen-9-8940hx-rtx-5070.webp',NULL,NULL,453499.00,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,'available',NULL,0,0,'<p>The Strix G16 G614PP is a 16-inch, 2.5 kg ROG with an <strong>RTX 5070</strong>, which is easier to carry than the 18-inch G18s. It\'s on ONIN Infosys\'s shelf at <strong>Rs 4,53,499</strong> with 2 years of official warranty and a year of ASUS Perfect Warranty.</p>\n<p>The <strong>Ryzen 9 8940HX</strong> has 16 cores and 32 threads with a 5.3GHz boost and 64MB of cache. That\'s a lot of headroom for streaming and creative work. The <strong>RTX 5070 8GB</strong> runs at 115W with ROG Boost and a MUX switch, and handles the <strong>16-inch 2.5K 240Hz</strong> Nebula panel well in most games at high settings. Tri-fan cooling keeps it composed, the keyboard has per-key RGB with a NumberPad touchpad and Copilot key, and there are two <strong>USB4</strong> ports, HDMI 2.1 and Ethernet.</p>\n<p>The value question is hard to ignore: the 18-inch <a href=\"/products/asus-rog-strix-g18-g815jpr-2025-14th-gen-i9-14900hx-rtx-5070\">Strix G18 G815JPR</a> has the same RTX 5070, a bigger screen and a 2TB SSD for about Rs 75,000 less. Buy the G16 if portability matters. It\'s 0.7 kg lighter, and a 16-inch laptop fits a normal backpack.</p>','[{\"question\":\"What is the ASUS ROG Strix G16 G614PP price in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"ONIN Infosys sells the ROG Strix G16 G614PP with Ryzen 9 8940HX, RTX 5070 8GB, 16GB DDR5 and 1TB SSD for Rs 4,53,499.\"},{\"question\":\"Is the ROG Strix G16 G614PP good for streaming?\",\"answer\":\"Yes. The 16-core Ryzen 9 8940HX has plenty of headroom for gaming and encoding at the same time.\"},{\"question\":\"How heavy is it?\",\"answer\":\"About 2.5 kg.\"}]','[{\"label\":\"ONIN Infosys \\u2013 ASUS ROG Strix G16 G614PP (Ryzen 9 8940HX, RTX 5070)\",\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/onin.com.np\\/product\\/asus-rog-strix-g16-g614pp-rtx-5070-price-nepal\",\"accessed\":\"2026-11-23\"}]',NULL,'https://onin.com.np/product/asus-rog-strix-g16-g614pp-rtx-5070-price-nepal',0,'2026-11-22 18:15:00','2026-11-22 18:15:00'),(2463,39,3,'Lenovo IdeaPad Slim 3 14IRU8 (Core i3-1315U, 8GB/512GB)','lenovo-ideapad-slim-3-14iru8-core-i3-1315u',NULL,'gadgets/2026/lenovo-ideapad-slim-3-14iru8-core-i3-1315u.webp',NULL,NULL,74999.00,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,'available',NULL,0,0,'<p>For under Rs 75,000, the IdeaPad Slim 3 14IRU8 gets the basics right: a 13th-gen Intel chip, a <strong>512GB</strong> SSD rather than the 256GB you see on many laptops at this price, and a 1.37 kg body that fits easily in a college bag. ONIN Infosys has it in Arctic Grey for <strong>Rs 74,999</strong> with genuine Windows 11 Home pre-activated.</p>\n<p>The <strong>Core i3-1315U</strong> has six cores (two performance and four efficiency) and boosts to 4.5GHz, so it handles Office, browser research, Zoom and streaming without feeling sluggish. The 8GB LPDDR5 memory is soldered. That\'s enough for study and office work today, but keep it in mind if you expect to run heavier software later. The 47Wh battery gets most students through the morning\'s classes. The privacy shutter on the webcam is a small thing you\'ll appreciate.</p>\n<p>Compared with the cheaper <a href=\"/products/lenovo-ideapad-slim-3-14amn8-2023\">Athlon-powered Slim 3</a>, this is a big step up in everyday speed. If you want a bigger screen and a number pad for accounting work, the <a href=\"/products/lenovo-ideapad-slim-3-15amn8-2023\">15.6-inch Slim 3 15AMN8</a> costs about Rs 12,000 more.</p>','[{\"question\":\"What is the Lenovo IdeaPad Slim 3 14IRU8 price in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"Rs 74,999 at ONIN Infosys for the Core i3-1315U, 8GB RAM and 512GB SSD model, with Windows 11 Home and a one-year warranty.\"},{\"question\":\"Is the Core i3-1315U good enough for college?\",\"answer\":\"Yes, for documents, research, online classes and light multitasking. For engineering software or video editing, choose a Core i5 or Ryzen 5 H-series laptop.\"},{\"question\":\"How heavy is the IdeaPad Slim 3 14IRU8?\",\"answer\":\"About 1.37 kg.\"}]','[{\"label\":\"ONIN Infosys \\u2013 Lenovo IdeaPad Slim 3 14IRU8 (Core i3-1315U, 8GB\\/512GB)\",\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/onin.com.np\\/product\\/lenovo-ideapad-slim-3-14iru8-core-i3-1315u-price-nepal\",\"accessed\":\"2026-11-23\"}]',NULL,'https://onin.com.np/product/lenovo-ideapad-slim-3-14iru8-core-i3-1315u-price-nepal',0,'2026-11-22 18:15:00','2026-11-22 18:15:00'),(2464,39,3,'Lenovo V14 G4 (Ryzen 5 7520U, 16GB/512GB)','lenovo-v14-g4-ryzen-5-7520u-16gb',NULL,'gadgets/2026/lenovo-v14-g4-ryzen-5-7520u-16gb.webp',NULL,NULL,103499.00,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,'available',NULL,0,0,'<p>Lenovo\'s V-series is the laptop companies buy in bulk: plain grey, sturdy enough, and specced for work rather than show. The V14 G4 at <strong>Rs 1,03,499</strong> from ONIN Infosys stands out because it comes with <strong>16GB of DDR5</strong>. That\'s double what most laptops at this price ship with, and it\'s the spec that decides whether a work laptop still feels fine in its third year.</p>\n<p>The <strong>Ryzen 5 7520U</strong> (4 cores, 8 threads, up to 4.3GHz) is not a powerhouse, but with 16GB behind it, Teams, Outlook, a CRM in the browser and a couple of spreadsheets can stay open together. The 14-inch Full HD IPS display is anti-glare and TÜV-certified for low blue light. There\'s a <strong>wired Ethernet port</strong>, which IT teams love, plus full-function USB-C, two USB-A ports and HDMI.</p>\n<p>The keyboard isn\'t backlit and the 45Wh battery is average, so this is best for desk-and-meeting-room work rather than all-day travel. ONIN adds a bag, mouse and mousepad. If you need a faster CPU in the same family, the <a href=\"/products/lenovo-v14-g5-irl-core-i7-13620h\">V14 G5 with Core i7-13620H</a> costs about Rs 34,000 more.</p>','[{\"question\":\"What is the Lenovo V14 G4 Ryzen 5 price in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"ONIN Infosys sells the Lenovo V14 G4 with Ryzen 5 7520U, 16GB DDR5 and 512GB SSD for Rs 1,03,499.\"},{\"question\":\"Does the Lenovo V14 G4 have an Ethernet port?\",\"answer\":\"Yes. It has an RJ45 Ethernet port along with USB-C, two USB-A ports and HDMI.\"},{\"question\":\"Is the keyboard backlit?\",\"answer\":\"No, this V14 G4 configuration has a non-backlit English keyboard.\"}]','[{\"label\":\"ONIN Infosys \\u2013 Lenovo V14 G4 (Ryzen 5 7520U, 16GB\\/512GB)\",\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/onin.com.np\\/product\\/lenovo-v-14-g4-2023-ryzen-5-price-in-nepal\",\"accessed\":\"2026-11-23\"}]',NULL,'https://onin.com.np/product/lenovo-v-14-g4-2023-ryzen-5-price-in-nepal',0,'2026-11-22 18:15:00','2026-11-22 18:15:00'),(2465,39,3,'Lenovo V15 G4 (Ryzen 7 7730U, 16GB/512GB)','lenovo-v15-g4-ryzen-7-7730u-16gb',NULL,'gadgets/2026/lenovo-v15-g4-ryzen-7-7730u-16gb.webp',NULL,NULL,103999.00,107999.00,0,NULL,NULL,'available',NULL,0,0,'<p>An <strong>8-core, 16-thread</strong> processor for about a lakh is still rare in Nepal, and that\'s the reason to look at the V15 G4. Its <strong>Ryzen 7 7730U</strong> boosts to 4.5GHz with 16MB of cache. If your work involves compiling code, running VMs, editing large spreadsheets or exporting the odd video, it will finish noticeably sooner than the 4-core chips around this price. ONIN Infosys sells it for <strong>Rs 1,03,999</strong>.</p>\n<p>The memory setup is practical: 16GB DDR4-3200 split between soldered memory and an <strong>SO-DIMM slot</strong>, so you can upgrade later. There\'s also a bay for a 2.5-inch drive alongside the 512GB NVMe SSD, which is handy for a cheap terabyte of extra storage. The 15.6-inch FHD IPS screen is anti-glare, and the keyboard includes a number pad. You also get Ethernet and HDMI.</p>\n<p>The battery is the catch. At 38Wh, it\'s small. Rapid Charge gets it to 80% in about an hour, but plan on staying near a socket. At 1.65 kg it\'s a laptop for a desk, not a commute. If battery life matters more than core count, compare it with the <a href=\"/products/lenovo-v14-g4-ryzen-5-7520u-16gb\">V14 G4</a>.</p>','[{\"question\":\"What is the Lenovo V15 G4 Ryzen 7 price in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"ONIN Infosys sells the Lenovo V15 G4 with Ryzen 7 7730U, 16GB RAM and 512GB SSD for Rs 1,03,999, with a bag, mouse and mousepad.\"},{\"question\":\"Can I upgrade the RAM and storage on the V15 G4?\",\"answer\":\"Yes. One memory module sits in an SO-DIMM slot, and there is room for a 2.5-inch drive alongside the M.2 SSD.\"},{\"question\":\"How good is the battery?\",\"answer\":\"Modest. It is a 38Wh battery with Rapid Charge (about 80% in one hour), so it suits desk use best.\"}]','[{\"label\":\"ONIN Infosys \\u2013 Lenovo V15 G4 (Ryzen 7 7730U, 16GB\\/512GB)\",\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/onin.com.np\\/product\\/lenovo-v15-g4-ryzen-7-7730u-16gb-512gb-price-nepal\",\"accessed\":\"2026-11-23\"}]',NULL,'https://onin.com.np/product/lenovo-v15-g4-ryzen-7-7730u-16gb-512gb-price-nepal',0,'2026-11-22 18:15:00','2026-11-22 18:15:00'),(2466,39,3,'Lenovo V14 G5 IRL (Core i7-13620H, 16GB/512GB)','lenovo-v14-g5-irl-core-i7-13620h',NULL,'gadgets/2026/lenovo-v14-g5-irl-core-i7-13620h.webp',NULL,NULL,137999.00,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,'available',NULL,0,0,'<p>Most 14-inch laptops use low-power U-series chips. The V14 G5 IRL fits a <strong>Core i7-13620H</strong> instead: 10 cores (6 performance and 4 efficiency), 16 threads and a 4.9GHz boost. For developers, data analysts and engineering students who need real CPU speed but don\'t want a heavy gaming laptop, that\'s the appeal. ONIN Infosys sells it in Iron Grey at <strong>Rs 1,37,999</strong>.</p>\n<p>It comes with 16GB of DDR5-5200 and a 512GB PCIe 4.0 SSD, and weighs about 1.37–1.4 kg. Ports are business-practical: USB-C with charging and DisplayPort, USB 3.2 and USB 2.0, HDMI 1.4b and <strong>Ethernet</strong>. Wi-Fi 6 and Bluetooth 5.2 cover wireless, and the 720p webcam has a privacy shutter.</p>\n<p>Lenovo saved money on the screen. It\'s a 14-inch FHD IPS panel at 300 nits with 45% NTSC colour, fine for code and documents but dull for photo editing. The 47Wh battery won\'t last as long as a U-series laptop\'s when you push the CPU. If colour accuracy matters to you, look at the <a href=\"/products/lenovo-ideapad-slim-5-14agp11-ryzen-ai-5-430\">IdeaPad Slim 5 14AGP11</a> with its brighter glossy touchscreen.</p>','[{\"question\":\"What is the Lenovo V14 G5 IRL i7 price in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"ONIN Infosys lists the Lenovo V14 G5 IRL with Core i7-13620H, 16GB RAM and 512GB SSD at Rs 1,37,999.\"},{\"question\":\"Is the Core i7-13620H good for programming?\",\"answer\":\"Yes. Its 10 cores and 16 threads handle compilers, Docker, Android emulators and data work much better than U-series chips.\"},{\"question\":\"Does the V14 G5 have an Ethernet port?\",\"answer\":\"Yes, it includes an RJ45 Ethernet port.\"}]','[{\"label\":\"ONIN Infosys \\u2013 Lenovo V14 G5 IRL (Core i7-13620H, 16GB\\/512GB)\",\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/onin.com.np\\/product\\/lenovo-v14-g5-irl-i7-13th-gen-price-nepal\",\"accessed\":\"2026-11-23\"}]',NULL,'https://onin.com.np/product/lenovo-v14-g5-irl-i7-13th-gen-price-nepal',0,'2026-11-22 18:15:00','2026-11-22 18:15:00'),(2467,39,3,'Lenovo IdeaPad Slim 5 14AGP11 (Ryzen AI 5 430) with Pen','lenovo-ideapad-slim-5-14agp11-ryzen-ai-5-430',NULL,'gadgets/2026/lenovo-ideapad-slim-5-14agp11-ryzen-ai-5-430.webp',NULL,NULL,148999.00,160000.00,0,NULL,NULL,'available',NULL,0,0,'<p>Here\'s a laptop that tries to be a little of everything without costing two lakh. The IdeaPad Slim 5 14AGP11 has a <strong>14-inch WUXGA touchscreen</strong> under glass, ships with a <strong>Lenovo Pen Gen 2</strong> in the box, and runs AMD\'s newer <strong>Ryzen AI 5 430</strong> with an NPU for Copilot+ style features. ONIN Infosys has it in Luna Grey for <strong>Rs 1,48,999</strong>.</p>\n<p>Students who annotate PDFs, sketch diagrams or sign documents will get real use from the pen and touch screen. The display is brighter than usual at 400 nits, though it\'s glossy, so watch for reflections near windows. Memory is 2 × 8GB DDR5-5600 on <strong>SO-DIMM sticks</strong>, so you can upgrade it later. The Radeon 840M graphics are among the better integrated GPUs for light creative work.</p>\n<p>The 60Wh battery is larger than in most laptops at this price, charging is over USB-C, and the port selection is generous: two USB-C (10Gbps, with charging and DisplayPort 1.4), two USB-A, HDMI 2.1 and a microSD reader. The FHD webcam has an IR sensor for face login. At 1.54 kg it\'s a touch heavier than ultraportables. If you don\'t need touch or a pen, the <a href=\"/products/lenovo-ideapad-slim-3-15arp10-2025\">IdeaPad Slim 3 15ARP10</a> saves around Rs 36,000.</p>','[{\"question\":\"What is the Lenovo IdeaPad Slim 5 14AGP11 price in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"ONIN Infosys sells the IdeaPad Slim 5 14AGP11 with Ryzen AI 5 430, 16GB RAM, 512GB SSD and Lenovo Pen Gen 2 for Rs 1,48,999.\"},{\"question\":\"Does the IdeaPad Slim 5 14AGP11 come with a stylus?\",\"answer\":\"Yes. ONIN lists the official Lenovo Pen Gen 2 inside the retail box.\"},{\"question\":\"Is the RAM upgradeable?\",\"answer\":\"Yes. It uses two 8GB DDR5-5600 SO-DIMM modules.\"}]','[{\"label\":\"ONIN Infosys \\u2013 Lenovo IdeaPad Slim 5 14AGP11 (Ryzen AI 5 430) with Pen\",\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/onin.com.np\\/product\\/lenovo-ideapad-slim-5-ryzen-ai-5-430-price-nepal\",\"accessed\":\"2026-11-23\"}]',NULL,'https://onin.com.np/product/lenovo-ideapad-slim-5-ryzen-ai-5-430-price-nepal',0,'2026-11-22 18:15:00','2026-11-22 18:15:00'),(2468,39,3,'Lenovo LOQ 15IRX9 (Core i5-13450HX, RTX 3050, 24GB)','lenovo-loq-15irx9-i5-13450hx-rtx-3050-24gb',NULL,'gadgets/2026/lenovo-loq-15irx9-i5-13450hx-rtx-3050-24gb.webp',NULL,NULL,174999.00,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,'available',NULL,0,0,'<p>The unusual thing about this LOQ is the memory: <strong>24GB of DDR5</strong> (2 × 12GB) instead of the usual 16GB. For gamers who also stream, keep Discord and a browser open while playing, or edit their own clips, that extra headroom is genuinely useful. ONIN Infosys sells this configuration at <strong>Rs 1,74,999</strong> with a laptop bag, mouse and mousepad included.</p>\n<p>The <strong>Core i5-13450HX</strong> is a 10-core, 16-thread HX chip, desktop-class silicon in a laptop that boosts to 4.6GHz. It pairs with an <strong>RTX 3050 6GB</strong> and a 15.6-inch FHD IPS screen at 144Hz with G-SYNC and 100% sRGB. That covers competitive shooters at high refresh rates, and story games at medium settings with DLSS.</p>\n<p>The battery is 60Wh with Super Rapid Charge Pro, the keyboard has white backlighting and 100% anti-ghosting, and the ports are mostly at the rear: two USB-A, Ethernet, HDMI 2.1 and power. The right side has a USB-A and a USB-C with 140W charging and DisplayPort. One note: the 512GB SSD is a QLC drive, which is slower on big sustained writes. Many buyers add a second SSD for their game library. If you\'d rather have a stronger GPU than more RAM, look at the <a href=\"/products/lenovo-loq-15-intel-i7-13650hx-rtx-4050\">LOQ 15IRX9 with i7 and RTX 4050</a>.</p>','[{\"question\":\"What is the Lenovo LOQ 15IRX9 i5-13450HX price in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"ONIN Infosys sells the LOQ 15IRX9 with Core i5-13450HX, RTX 3050 6GB, 24GB DDR5 and 512GB SSD for Rs 1,74,999.\"},{\"question\":\"Why does this LOQ have 24GB RAM?\",\"answer\":\"This configuration ships with two 12GB DDR5 sticks (24GB, dual channel), which is more than the usual 16GB and helps with streaming and multitasking.\"},{\"question\":\"Does it include accessories?\",\"answer\":\"ONIN lists a free laptop bag, mouse and mousepad with this model.\"}]','[{\"label\":\"ONIN Infosys \\u2013 Lenovo LOQ 15IRX9 (Core i5-13450HX, RTX 3050, 24GB)\",\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/onin.com.np\\/product\\/lenovo-loq-15irx9-i5-13450hx-price-nepal\",\"accessed\":\"2026-11-23\"}]',NULL,'https://onin.com.np/product/lenovo-loq-15irx9-i5-13450hx-price-nepal',0,'2026-11-22 18:15:00','2026-11-22 18:15:00'),(2469,39,3,'Lenovo LOQ 15 AX9E (Core i5-12450HX, RTX 3050 6GB)','lenovo-loq-15ax9e-i5-12450hx-rtx-3050',NULL,'gadgets/2026/lenovo-loq-15ax9e-i5-12450hx-rtx-3050.webp',NULL,NULL,182499.00,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,'available',NULL,0,0,'<p>The LOQ 15 AX9E is the \"Essential\" version of Lenovo\'s budget gaming laptop. What makes ONIN Infosys\'s listing worth a look is the <strong>2-year official Lenovo Nepal warranty</strong>, double the usual cover on a gaming laptop. It\'s priced at <strong>Rs 1,82,499</strong> in Luna Grey.</p>\n<p>Inside is the <strong>Core i5-12450HX</strong> (8 cores, 12 threads, up to 4.4GHz) with an <strong>RTX 3050 6GB</strong> running at <strong>65W TGP</strong>. That\'s lower than the 95W in the <a href=\"/products/lenovo-loq-15-15ahp9-2024-ryzen-7-7445hs\">LOQ 15AHP9</a>, so expect fewer frames in demanding games. It\'s still comfortable for esports titles at high refresh rates, and for older or lighter AAA games at medium settings. Memory is 2 × 8GB DDR5-4800 in dual channel, with a 512GB PCIe 4.0 SSD.</p>\n<p>The display is the same good LOQ panel: 15.6-inch FHD IPS, 144Hz, 100% sRGB, G-SYNC. The keyboard has white backlighting, and there\'s a card reader that the other LOQs lack. The USB-C port is data-only, so you can\'t charge from it. The battery is 57Wh.</p>\n<p>Honestly, the cheaper AHP9 is the faster laptop. Choose the AX9E if the longer warranty and dual-channel memory out of the box matter more to you than raw GPU power.</p>','[{\"question\":\"What is the Lenovo LOQ 15 AX9E price in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"ONIN Infosys sells the LOQ 15 AX9E (2025) with Core i5-12450HX, RTX 3050 6GB, 16GB DDR5 and 512GB SSD for Rs 1,82,499, with a 2-year warranty.\"},{\"question\":\"What is the GPU power of the LOQ 15 AX9E?\",\"answer\":\"The RTX 3050 6GB runs at 65W TGP.\"},{\"question\":\"Can the LOQ 15 AX9E charge over USB-C?\",\"answer\":\"No. Its USB-C port is for data only; it charges through the barrel power connector.\"}]','[{\"label\":\"ONIN Infosys \\u2013 Lenovo LOQ 15 AX9E (Core i5-12450HX, RTX 3050 6GB)\",\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/onin.com.np\\/product\\/lenovo-loq-15-ax9e-2025-price-in-nepal\",\"accessed\":\"2026-11-23\"}]',NULL,'https://onin.com.np/product/lenovo-loq-15-ax9e-2025-price-in-nepal',0,'2026-11-22 18:15:00','2026-11-22 18:15:00'),(2470,39,3,'Lenovo ThinkPad E14 Gen 7 (Core Ultra 5 225U, 16GB/512GB)','lenovo-thinkpad-e14-gen-7-core-ultra-5-225u',NULL,'gadgets/2026/lenovo-thinkpad-e14-gen-7-core-ultra-5-225u.webp',NULL,NULL,204999.00,209499.00,0,NULL,NULL,'available',NULL,0,0,'<p>People buy ThinkPads for the keyboard, the durability and the warranty, and the E14 Gen 7 delivers all three. ONIN Infosys has it at <strong>Rs 2,04,999</strong> with a <strong>3-year official hardware warranty</strong> in Nepal. For a company laptop that has to last until the next budget cycle, that matters more than raw specs.</p>\n<p>The <strong>Core Ultra 5 225U</strong> is a 12-core efficiency-focused chip (2 performance, 8 efficiency and 2 low-power cores) that boosts to 4.8GHz. It\'s built for long battery life and cool running during a day of email, documents, Teams and browser apps. It comes with 16GB of DDR5 on an <strong>SO-DIMM</strong> slot and a 512GB PCIe 4.0 SSD. The chassis is MIL-STD-810H tested, and the backlit keyboard has the deep, precise feel that makes ThinkPad owners loyal.</p>\n<p>The port selection is the best in this price range: <strong>Thunderbolt 4</strong>, so one cable can run a dock and two monitors, plus HDMI 2.1, USB-A at 5 and 10Gbps, and Ethernet. The 14-inch WUXGA panel is a sensible 16:10 anti-glare IPS. The webcam is only 720p, though it has a privacy shutter. If you want a newer CPU and more ports for a bit more money, compare it with the <a href=\"/products/lenovo-thinkpad-l14-gen-6-2025-intel-core-ultra-7-255u\">ThinkPad L14 Gen 6</a>.</p>','[{\"question\":\"What is the Lenovo ThinkPad E14 Gen 7 price in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"ONIN Infosys sells the ThinkPad E14 Gen 7 with Core Ultra 5 225U, 16GB DDR5 and 512GB SSD for Rs 2,04,999 with a 3-year official warranty.\"},{\"question\":\"Does the ThinkPad E14 Gen 7 have Thunderbolt?\",\"answer\":\"Yes. One USB-C port supports Thunderbolt 4 \\/ USB4 at 40Gbps with charging and DisplayPort 2.1.\"},{\"question\":\"Is the ThinkPad E14 Gen 7 durable?\",\"answer\":\"It is MIL-STD-810H tested, Lenovo\'s standard set of durability tests for ThinkPads.\"}]','[{\"label\":\"ONIN Infosys \\u2013 Lenovo ThinkPad E14 Gen 7 (Core Ultra 5 225U, 16GB\\/512GB)\",\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/onin.com.np\\/product\\/lenovo-thinkpad-e14-gen7-intel-core-ultra-5-225u-price-nepal\",\"accessed\":\"2026-11-23\"}]',NULL,'https://onin.com.np/product/lenovo-thinkpad-e14-gen7-intel-core-ultra-5-225u-price-nepal',0,'2026-11-22 18:15:00','2026-11-22 18:15:00'),(2471,39,3,'Lenovo LOQ 15AHP10 (Ryzen 7 250, RTX 5050 / RTX 5060)','lenovo-loq-15ahp10-ryzen-7-250',NULL,'gadgets/2026/lenovo-loq-15ahp10-ryzen-7-250.webp',NULL,NULL,217499.00,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,'available',NULL,0,0,'<p>The LOQ 15AHP10 is the LOQ we\'d recommend to most serious gamers on a two-lakh budget. It pairs AMD\'s 8-core <strong>Ryzen 7 250</strong> (16 threads, up to 5.1GHz) with an RTX 50-series GPU. ONIN Infosys stocks it two ways: with an <strong>RTX 5050 for Rs 2,17,499</strong> (2-year warranty), and as the \"LOQ 15 AI\" with an <strong>RTX 5060 for Rs 2,39,999</strong>.</p>\n<h3>RTX 5050 or RTX 5060?</h3>\n<p>Both have 8GB of GDDR7. The RTX 5060 has more CUDA cores (3,328) and runs at 115W against the 5050\'s 100W, and it\'s the faster card by a clear margin in new AAA games at 1080p high and ultra settings. If you mostly play esports titles, the RTX 5050 is plenty and the Rs 22,500 saving can go towards a second SSD. If you want the laptop to keep up with big releases for the next few years, buy the 5060.</p>\n<p>Both versions share the 15.6-inch FHD IPS panel (144Hz, 100% sRGB, G-SYNC), 16GB DDR5-5600, a 512GB PCIe 4.0 SSD, a 60Wh battery and a white-backlit keyboard. They also share the <strong>5MP webcam</strong> with an e-shutter, a clear upgrade on the 720p cameras most gaming laptops still use. Ports include three USB-A, USB-C with 100W charging and DisplayPort 1.4, HDMI 2.1 and Ethernet. It weighs about 2.3–2.4 kg.</p>\n<p>Compared with the <a href=\"/products/lenovo-loq-15-2025\">LOQ 15 with Ryzen 5 220</a>, you get two extra CPU cores, which helps if you stream or record gameplay.</p>','[{\"question\":\"What is the Lenovo LOQ 15AHP10 price in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"At ONIN Infosys the Ryzen 7 250 model costs Rs 2,17,499 with an RTX 5050 8GB and Rs 2,39,999 with an RTX 5060 8GB, both with 16GB DDR5 and 512GB SSD.\"},{\"question\":\"Is the RTX 5060 worth the extra over the RTX 5050?\",\"answer\":\"For new AAA games at high settings, yes. It has more CUDA cores and a 115W power limit. For esports titles, the RTX 5050 is enough.\"},{\"question\":\"What webcam does the LOQ 15AHP10 have?\",\"answer\":\"A 5MP webcam with an electronic privacy shutter.\"}]','[{\"label\":\"ONIN Infosys \\u2013 Lenovo LOQ 15AHP10 (Ryzen 7 250, RTX 5050 \\/ RTX 5060)\",\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/onin.com.np\\/product\\/lenovo-loq-gaming-laptop-2025-ryzen7-250-rtx5050-nepal\",\"accessed\":\"2026-11-23\"},{\"label\":\"ONIN Infosys \\u2013 Lenovo LOQ 15AHP10 (Ryzen 7 250, RTX 5050 \\/ RTX 5060) (edition=RTX 5060 8GB, ram=16GB, storage=512GB)\",\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/onin.com.np\\/product\\/lenovo-loq-15-ai-ryzen-7-250-rtx-5060-price-nepal\",\"accessed\":\"2026-11-23\"}]',NULL,'https://onin.com.np/product/lenovo-loq-gaming-laptop-2025-ryzen7-250-rtx5050-nepal',0,'2026-11-22 18:15:00','2026-11-22 18:15:00'),(2472,39,3,'Lenovo LOQ 15IRX10 (Core i7-14700HX, RTX 5050, 1TB)','lenovo-loq-15irx10-i7-14700hx-rtx-5050',NULL,'gadgets/2026/lenovo-loq-15irx10-i7-14700hx-rtx-5050.webp',NULL,NULL,234999.00,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,'available',NULL,0,0,'<p>Two things set this LOQ apart from its siblings: a <strong>20-core Core i7-14700HX</strong> and a <strong>1TB SSD</strong> as standard. It\'s on ONIN Infosys\'s shelf at <strong>Rs 2,34,999</strong>.</p>\n<p>The i7-14700HX (8 performance and 12 efficiency cores, 28 threads, up to 5.5GHz) is one of the fastest mobile CPUs you can buy at this price. That makes this a sensible pick for gamers who also do heavy work, such as 3D rendering, code compilation, virtual machines or streaming with x264 encoding. The <strong>RTX 5050 8GB</strong> runs at 100W, enough for 1080p high settings in most new games with DLSS 4.</p>\n<p>Doubling storage to 1TB means a handful of 100GB games fit without juggling installs. The rest is familiar LOQ: a 15.6-inch FHD IPS panel at 144Hz with 100% sRGB and G-SYNC, a white-backlit keyboard, a 5MP webcam with e-shutter, a 60Wh battery, and rear-mounted USB, HDMI 2.1 and Ethernet.</p>\n<p>If your use is mostly gaming, the GPU matters more than the CPU. The <a href=\"/products/lenovo-loq-15ahp10-ryzen-7-250\">LOQ 15AHP10 with RTX 5060</a> costs about Rs 5,000 more and will produce higher frame rates.</p>','[{\"question\":\"What is the Lenovo LOQ 15IRX10 i7-14700HX price in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"ONIN Infosys sells the LOQ 15IRX10 with Core i7-14700HX, RTX 5050 8GB, 16GB DDR5 and 1TB SSD for Rs 2,34,999.\"},{\"question\":\"How many cores does the Core i7-14700HX have?\",\"answer\":\"20 cores (8 performance and 12 efficiency) with 28 threads and up to 5.5GHz boost.\"},{\"question\":\"Does the LOQ 15IRX10 come with a 1TB SSD?\",\"answer\":\"Yes, this configuration has a 1TB PCIe 4.0 NVMe SSD.\"}]','[{\"label\":\"ONIN Infosys \\u2013 Lenovo LOQ 15IRX10 (Core i7-14700HX, RTX 5050, 1TB)\",\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/onin.com.np\\/product\\/lenovo loq 15irx10 i7 14700hx rtx 5050 price in nepal\",\"accessed\":\"2026-11-23\"}]',NULL,'https://onin.com.np/product/lenovo loq 15irx10 i7 14700hx rtx 5050 price in nepal',0,'2026-11-22 18:15:00','2026-11-22 18:15:00'),(2473,39,3,'Lenovo Legion 5 15IRX10 (Core i7-13650HX, RTX 5050, OLED)','lenovo-legion-5-15irx10-i7-13650hx-rtx-5050',NULL,'gadgets/2026/lenovo-legion-5-15irx10-i7-13650hx-rtx-5050.webp',NULL,NULL,236499.00,238499.00,0,NULL,NULL,'available',NULL,0,0,'<p>This is the cheapest way into a Legion, and the reason to choose it over a LOQ at a similar price is the screen. The Legion 5 15IRX10 has a <strong>15.3-inch 2.5K (2560 × 1600) OLED</strong> panel at 165Hz with 100% DCI-P3, DisplayHDR True Black 600 and Dolby Vision. Dark game scenes and movies look a generation ahead of any IPS gaming laptop. ONIN Infosys sells it for <strong>Rs 2,36,499</strong>.</p>\n<p>It\'s also built more like a premium laptop. At <strong>1.9 kg</strong> it\'s noticeably lighter than the 2.4 kg LOQs, and it has an <strong>80Wh battery</strong>, Wi-Fi 7, a 24-zone RGB keyboard and a 5MP webcam. Inside are a 14-core <strong>Core i7-13650HX</strong>, an <strong>RTX 5050 8GB at 115W</strong>, 16GB DDR5 and a <strong>1TB</strong> SSD.</p>\n<p>A trade-off to know about: at 2.5K, the RTX 5050 won\'t run demanding new games at native resolution with high settings. You\'ll lean on DLSS or play at 1080p-equivalent scaling, which still looks sharp on a 15.3-inch OLED. If you\'re a student who games, edits photos and wants something you can actually carry to class, this is a lovely all-rounder. If frame rates are all you care about, the <a href=\"/products/lenovo-loq-15ahp10-ryzen-7-250\">LOQ with RTX 5060</a> is faster for similar money.</p>','[{\"question\":\"What is the Lenovo Legion 5 15IRX10 price in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"ONIN Infosys sells the Legion 5 15IRX10 with Core i7-13650HX, RTX 5050 8GB, 16GB DDR5 and 1TB SSD for Rs 2,36,499.\"},{\"question\":\"What display does the Legion 5 15IRX10 have?\",\"answer\":\"A 15.3-inch WQXGA (2560 \\u00d7 1600) OLED panel at 165Hz with 100% DCI-P3, Dolby Vision and DisplayHDR True Black 600 (500 nits typical, 1000 nits peak).\"},{\"question\":\"How heavy is the Legion 5 15IRX10?\",\"answer\":\"About 1.9 kg, much lighter than most gaming laptops at this price.\"}]','[{\"label\":\"ONIN Infosys \\u2013 Lenovo Legion 5 15IRX10 (Core i7-13650HX, RTX 5050, OLED)\",\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/onin.com.np\\/product\\/enovo-legion-5-15irx10-i7-13650hx-rtx-5050-price-nepal\",\"accessed\":\"2026-11-23\"}]',NULL,'https://onin.com.np/product/enovo-legion-5-15irx10-i7-13650hx-rtx-5050-price-nepal',0,'2026-11-22 18:15:00','2026-11-22 18:15:00'),(2474,39,3,'Lenovo Legion 5 16IAX10 (Core Ultra 9 275HX, RTX 5060, 32GB)','lenovo-legion-5-16iax10-ultra-9-275hx-rtx-5060',NULL,'gadgets/2026/lenovo-legion-5-16iax10-ultra-9-275hx-rtx-5060.webp',NULL,NULL,327499.00,334499.00,0,NULL,NULL,'available',NULL,0,0,'<p>This Legion 5 is for players who care about high refresh rates. Its <strong>16-inch WQXGA IPS panel runs at 240Hz</strong>, is bright at 500 nits, covers 100% DCI-P3 and is DisplayHDR 400 certified. Competitive shooters feel noticeably smoother than on a 144Hz or 165Hz screen. ONIN Infosys sells it in Storm Grey for <strong>Rs 3,27,499</strong>.</p>\n<p>The CPU is Intel\'s <strong>Core Ultra 9 275HX</strong> with 24 cores and a 5.4GHz boost, the same flagship chip found in laptops costing twice as much. It comes with <strong>32GB of DDR5-5600</strong> (2 × 16GB) and a <strong>1TB</strong> SSD, so this configuration won\'t need upgrades for years. The <strong>RTX 5060 8GB</strong> runs at 105W. It\'s strong at 1080p and capable at 1600p with DLSS 4, although the 24-core CPU is clearly the star here.</p>\n<p>Other highlights include Wi-Fi 7, a Thunderbolt 4 port, HDMI 2.1, a 24-zone RGB keyboard, a 5MP webcam and an 80Wh battery. It weighs about 2.45 kg.</p>\n<p>Gaming is the priority, but you also stream, edit or run engineering software? This is a balanced pick. If you\'d trade the 240Hz IPS for a gorgeous OLED, the <a href=\"/products/lenovo-legion-pro-5i-16iax10-2025-intel-core-ultra-9-275hx-rtx-5060\">Legion Pro 5i</a> has the same CPU and GPU with an OLED panel.</p>','[{\"question\":\"What is the Lenovo Legion 5 16IAX10 price in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"ONIN Infosys sells the Legion 5 16IAX10 with Core Ultra 9 275HX, RTX 5060 8GB, 32GB DDR5 and 1TB SSD for Rs 3,27,499.\"},{\"question\":\"What refresh rate is the Legion 5 16IAX10 display?\",\"answer\":\"240Hz on a 16-inch 2560 \\u00d7 1600 IPS panel with 500 nits, 100% DCI-P3 and G-SYNC.\"},{\"question\":\"Does it have Thunderbolt?\",\"answer\":\"Yes, one USB-C port supports Thunderbolt 4 \\/ USB4 at 40Gbps.\"}]','[{\"label\":\"ONIN Infosys \\u2013 Lenovo Legion 5 16IAX10 (Core Ultra 9 275HX, RTX 5060, 32GB)\",\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/onin.com.np\\/product\\/lenovo-legion-5i-2026-intel-core-ultra-9-rtx-5060-price-nepal\",\"accessed\":\"2026-11-23\"}]',NULL,'https://onin.com.np/product/lenovo-legion-5i-2026-intel-core-ultra-9-rtx-5060-price-nepal',0,'2026-11-22 18:15:00','2026-11-22 18:15:00'),(2475,39,3,'Lenovo Legion 5 (Core i9-14900HX, RTX 5070, OLED)','lenovo-legion-5-i9-14900hx-rtx-5070-oled',NULL,'gadgets/2026/lenovo-legion-5-i9-14900hx-rtx-5070-oled.webp',NULL,NULL,339499.00,349499.00,0,NULL,NULL,'available',NULL,0,0,'<p>This Legion 5 combines the brightest panel tech Lenovo puts in its mid-range gaming laptops with a GPU that can actually drive it. A <strong>2.5K (2560 × 1600) OLED</strong> at 165Hz with 1000-nit HDR peaks, 100% DCI-P3 and Dolby Vision sits on top of an <strong>RTX 5070 8GB at 115W</strong>. ONIN Infosys sells it in Eclipse Black for <strong>Rs 3,39,499</strong>.</p>\n<p>The RTX 5070 is a meaningful step up from the RTX 5060. It handles new AAA games at the panel\'s native resolution with high settings and DLSS 4, and it has the tensor muscle for local AI image tools. The <strong>Core i9-14900HX</strong> (24 cores, 32 threads, up to 5.8GHz) is overkill for games alone, but it\'s excellent for streaming, video exports and compiling code.</p>\n<p>You get a 1TB SSD and 16GB of DDR5-5600. We\'d add a second 16GB stick for 32GB if you multitask heavily. Wi-Fi 7, a 24-zone RGB keyboard, HDMI 2.1 and two 10Gbps USB-C ports round it out, and ONIN adds lifetime free servicing on top of the 1-year warranty.</p>\n<p>Comparing options? The <a href=\"/products/lenovo-legion-5-16iax10-ultra-9-275hx-rtx-5060\">Legion 5 16IAX10</a> has a 240Hz IPS screen and 32GB of RAM but a weaker GPU. The <a href=\"/products/lenovo-legion-pro-5-16afr10-2025-ryzen-9-9955hx-rtx-5070\">Legion Pro 5 with Ryzen 9 9955HX</a> has the same RTX 5070 with a 16-inch OLED and 32GB.</p>','[{\"question\":\"What is the price of the Lenovo Legion 5 i9-14900HX RTX 5070 in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"ONIN Infosys lists it at Rs 3,39,499 with 16GB DDR5, a 1TB SSD and a 2.5K OLED 165Hz display.\"},{\"question\":\"What is the GPU power of the RTX 5070 in this Legion 5?\",\"answer\":\"115W TGP with a 2347MHz boost clock and 8GB of GDDR7.\"},{\"question\":\"What warranty does ONIN give?\",\"answer\":\"One year of official warranty, plus lifetime free servicing from the store.\"}]','[{\"label\":\"ONIN Infosys \\u2013 Lenovo Legion 5 (Core i9-14900HX, RTX 5070, OLED)\",\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/onin.com.np\\/product\\/lenovo-legion-5-rtx5070-laptop-price-in-nepal\",\"accessed\":\"2026-11-23\"}]',NULL,'https://onin.com.np/product/lenovo-legion-5-rtx5070-laptop-price-in-nepal',0,'2026-11-22 18:15:00','2026-11-22 18:15:00'),(2476,83,6,'Belkin 15W Wireless Charging Pad','belkin-15w-wireless-charging-pad','charger','gadgets/2026/belkin-15w-wireless-charging-pad.webp',NULL,NULL,5800.00,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,'available',NULL,0,0,'<p>Drop your phone on the Belkin 15W pad and it starts charging, no cable to fumble for at the bedside or on the desk. It is Qi-certified, so it works with most recent iPhones and Android phones that support wireless charging, and it charges through most lightweight cases, so you don\'t have to strip the phone every night.</p>\n<p>The 15W output is about as fast as wireless charging gets for most phones, and the pad lets the phone sit at two angles. ONIN Infosys sells the model WIB002btBK for Rs 5,800 with Belkin\'s two-year warranty.</p>','[{\"question\":\"Does the Belkin 15W pad charge iPhones?\",\"answer\":\"Yes. It is a Qi-certified charger, so it charges any iPhone or Android phone that supports Qi wireless charging. iPhones usually charge at a slower rate than the pad\'s 15W maximum.\"},{\"question\":\"Do I need to remove my phone case?\",\"answer\":\"Usually not. It charges through most lightweight cases. Thick cases, metal plates or magnetic rings can block it.\"}]','[{\"label\":\"ONIN Infosys \\u2013 Belkin 15W Wireless Charging Pad\",\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/onin.com.np\\/product\\/belkin-15w-wireless-charging-pad-price-in-nepal\",\"accessed\":\"2026-11-23\"}]',NULL,'https://onin.com.np/product/belkin-15w-wireless-charging-pad-price-in-nepal',0,'2026-11-22 18:15:00','2026-11-22 18:15:00'),(2477,83,6,'Belkin BoostCharge 30W USB-C Fast Charger','belkin-boostcharge-30w-usb-c-fast-charger','charger','gadgets/2026/belkin-boostcharge-30w-usb-c-fast-charger.webp',NULL,NULL,4200.00,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,'available',NULL,0,0,'<p>A 30W USB-C charger is the sweet spot for modern phones, and Belkin\'s BoostCharge (WCA005) hits it. With USB-C Power Delivery 3.0 and PPS, it can top up an iPhone 13 from empty to 50% in about 24 minutes and a Galaxy S23 Ultra in about 21, by Belkin\'s own figures.</p>\n<p>The prongs fold away, so it slips into a laptop bag pocket without scratching anything, and 30W is enough to charge an iPad or a small laptop more slowly too. It costs Rs 4,200 at ONIN Infosys and carries a two-year warranty.</p>','[{\"question\":\"Is the Belkin 30W charger fast enough for a Samsung phone?\",\"answer\":\"Yes. It supports PPS, which Samsung\'s Super Fast Charging uses, and Belkin quotes 0 to 50% on a Galaxy S23 Ultra in about 21 minutes.\"},{\"question\":\"Does it come with a cable?\",\"answer\":\"Check the box contents with ONIN before buying. The charger has a single USB-C port, so you need a USB-C cable for your device.\"}]','[{\"label\":\"ONIN Infosys \\u2013 Belkin BoostCharge 30W Type C Fast Charger\",\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/onin.com.np\\/product\\/belkin-boostcharge-30w-type-c-fast-charger-price-in-nepal\",\"accessed\":\"2026-11-23\"}]',NULL,'https://onin.com.np/product/belkin-boostcharge-30w-type-c-fast-charger-price-in-nepal',0,'2026-11-22 18:15:00','2026-11-22 18:15:00'),(2478,83,6,'Belkin Economy Series 6-Socket Surge Protector (2m)','belkin-economy-series-6-socket-surge-protector-2m','surge-protector','gadgets/2026/belkin-economy-series-6-socket-surge-protector-2m.webp',NULL,NULL,3040.00,3200.00,0,NULL,NULL,'available',NULL,0,0,'<p>Voltage spikes are common in Nepal, and a proper surge protector is cheap insurance for a desktop, monitor and router. This Belkin strip (F9E600zb2M-GRY) gives you six sockets on a 2-metre heavy-duty cord and protects all six with three-line protection, reacting in under a nanosecond.</p>\n<p>It is rated for 1,500W of connected load and 6,500 amps of surge current, which covers a typical home office or study desk. ONIN Infosys sells it for Rs 3,040, down from Rs 3,200, and Belkin backs it with a five-year warranty.</p>','[{\"question\":\"Is this the same as a voltage stabilizer?\",\"answer\":\"No. A surge protector cuts off sudden spikes, but it does not correct low or high voltage over time. For frequent low voltage, pair it with a stabilizer or a UPS.\"},{\"question\":\"How much can I plug into it?\",\"answer\":\"Up to 1,500W in total, enough for a desktop PC, a monitor, a router and chargers, but not a heater or an iron.\"}]','[{\"label\":\"ONIN Infosys \\u2013 Belkin Economy Series 6-Socket Surge Protector\",\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/onin.com.np\\/product\\/belkin-6-socket-surge-protector-price\",\"accessed\":\"2026-11-23\"}]',NULL,'https://onin.com.np/product/belkin-6-socket-surge-protector-price',0,'2026-11-22 18:15:00','2026-11-22 18:15:00'),(2479,83,6,'Belkin 4-Outlet Surge Protector (1.5m, Grey)','belkin-4-outlet-surge-protector-1-5m-grey','surge-protector','gadgets/2026/belkin-4-outlet-surge-protector-1-5m-grey.webp',NULL,NULL,3000.00,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,'available',NULL,0,0,'<p>If you only need to protect a laptop charger, a monitor and a couple of other plugs, Belkin\'s 4-outlet strip (F9E400zb1.5MGRY) is the compact choice. It has the same under-a-nanosecond response and three-line protection as the bigger six-socket model, on a 1.5-metre cord.</p>\n<p>It handles up to 1,500W of load, which is plenty for a laptop setup or a small TV corner. At Rs 3,000 from ONIN Infosys with a five-year Belkin warranty, it costs less than most chargers it protects.</p>','[{\"question\":\"Should I get the 4-socket or 6-socket Belkin?\",\"answer\":\"The 4-outlet strip suits a laptop desk. If you run a desktop, monitor, speakers and router from one point, the 6-socket model gives you room to spare for Rs 40 more.\"},{\"question\":\"What warranty does it have?\",\"answer\":\"Belkin\'s five-year warranty, according to ONIN Infosys.\"}]','[{\"label\":\"ONIN Infosys \\u2013 Belkin Surge Protector 4-Outlet 1.5M Cord - GREY\",\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/onin.com.np\\/product\\/belkin-surge-protector-4-outlet-1-5m-cord-price\",\"accessed\":\"2026-11-23\"}]',NULL,'https://onin.com.np/product/belkin-surge-protector-4-outlet-1-5m-cord-price',0,'2026-11-22 18:15:00','2026-11-22 18:15:00'),(2480,83,6,'Belkin USB-C 4K Triple Display Docking Station (INC007)','belkin-usb-c-4k-triple-display-docking-station-inc007','docking-station','gadgets/2026/belkin-usb-c-4k-triple-display-docking-station-inc007.webp',NULL,NULL,52000.00,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,'available',NULL,0,0,'<p>This is the dock to buy when one laptop has to run a full desk. Belkin\'s INC007 connects up to three extended displays at up to 4K through three HDMI and two DisplayPort outputs, and it works with MacBooks, Chromebooks and Windows laptops over a single USB-C cable.</p>\n<p>Behind that one cable you also get four USB-A ports, a USB-C data port, Gigabit Ethernet, audio in and out, and up to 85W of charging for the laptop. Its own 150W power supply is included. ONIN Infosys sells it for Rs 52,000 with a two-year warranty, which is a lot, but it replaces a drawer full of adapters.</p>','[{\"question\":\"Can a MacBook use three monitors with this dock?\",\"answer\":\"It depends on the chip. Base M1, M2 and M3 MacBooks support only one external display natively, so check your model\'s limit before buying.\"},{\"question\":\"Will it charge my laptop?\",\"answer\":\"Yes, it passes up to 85W of USB-C Power Delivery to the laptop, enough for most 13 to 15-inch models.\"}]','[{\"label\":\"ONIN Infosys \\u2013 Belkin Universal Adapter USB-C 4K Triple Display Dock\",\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/onin.com.np\\/product\\/belkin-universal-adapter-usb-c-4k-triple-display-dock-price-in-nepal\",\"accessed\":\"2026-11-23\"}]',NULL,'https://onin.com.np/product/belkin-universal-adapter-usb-c-4k-triple-display-dock-price-in-nepal',0,'2026-11-22 18:15:00','2026-11-22 18:15:00'),(2481,84,6,'Desview T12S Portable Teleprompter (12.9-inch)','desview-t12s-portable-teleprompter-12-9-inch','teleprompter','gadgets/2026/desview-t12s-portable-teleprompter-12-9-inch.webp',NULL,NULL,29450.00,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,'available',NULL,0,0,'<p>Reading a script while looking straight into the lens is what separates a polished video from a nervous one, and the Desview T12S makes it possible with a phone or tablet. It takes devices up to 12.9 inches, the size of an iPad Pro, and reflects the text on 70/30 beam-splitter glass so the camera sees through it.</p>\n<p>The large mirror area, about 270 x 202 mm, keeps text readable from a normal speaking distance. It folds into an aluminium body with a travel case, works with mirrorless and DSLR rigs in horizontal or vertical setups, and scrolls from a Bluetooth remote and the iOS or Android app. ONIN Infosys sells it for Rs 29,450.</p>','[{\"question\":\"Does the T12S work with a DSLR?\",\"answer\":\"Yes. It supports mirrorless and DSLR cameras as well as phones, in both horizontal and vertical shooting.\"},{\"question\":\"What is the difference between the T12S and the T3?\",\"answer\":\"The T12S takes tablets up to 12.9 inches and has a much bigger glass, so text is easier to read. The T3 is smaller and lighter, for devices up to 11 inches.\"}]','[{\"label\":\"ONIN Infosys \\u2013 Desview T12S 12.9\\u2033 Portable Teleprompter - Phone & Tablet (Remote Control)\",\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/onin.com.np\\/product\\/desview-t12s-12-9-teleprompter-nepal\",\"accessed\":\"2026-11-23\"}]',NULL,'https://onin.com.np/product/desview-t12s-12-9-teleprompter-nepal',0,'2026-11-22 18:15:00','2026-11-22 18:15:00'),(2482,84,6,'Desview T3 Portable Teleprompter','desview-t3-portable-teleprompter','teleprompter','gadgets/2026/desview-t3-portable-teleprompter.webp',NULL,NULL,17955.00,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,'available',NULL,0,0,'<p>The Desview T3 is a compact teleprompter for vloggers, teachers and anyone who records talking-head videos. It holds phones and tablets up to 11 inches behind HD 70/30 beam-splitter glass, so you can read your lines while looking into the lens.</p>\n<p>At about 440 g it is light enough to carry to a shoot, and it comes with lens adapter rings from 49 to 82 mm, two cold-shoe mounts and a standard 1/4-inch thread for tripods. A Bluetooth remote and the phone app handle scrolling. ONIN Infosys sells it for Rs 17,955.</p>','[{\"question\":\"Can I use the Desview T3 with my phone camera?\",\"answer\":\"Yes. It works with smartphones as well as DSLR and mirrorless cameras, and supports vertical shooting for Reels and Shorts.\"},{\"question\":\"Which lens sizes does it fit?\",\"answer\":\"It includes adapter rings for 49, 52, 55, 58, 62, 67, 72, 77 and 82 mm lenses.\"}]','[{\"label\":\"ONIN Infosys \\u2013 Desview T3 Portable Teleprompter - Smartphone & Tablet (DSLR Compatible)\",\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/onin.com.np\\/product\\/desview-t3-teleprompter-nepal\",\"accessed\":\"2026-11-23\"}]',NULL,'https://onin.com.np/product/desview-t3-teleprompter-nepal',0,'2026-11-22 18:15:00','2026-11-22 18:15:00'),(2483,85,6,'Fantech Alpha GC-283 Gaming Chair','fantech-alpha-gc-283-gaming-chair','gaming-chair','gadgets/2026/fantech-alpha-gc-283-gaming-chair.webp',NULL,NULL,39000.00,50000.00,0,NULL,NULL,'available',NULL,0,0,'<p>Long gaming sessions or work days are hard on the back, and the Fantech Alpha GC-283 is built around that. It has adjustable head and lumbar pillows, a recline from 135 to 180 degrees, multi-function tilt and a class 4 hydraulic piston for smooth height changes.</p>\n<p>The frame sits on a steel base with PU wheels and is upholstered in PU leather. Fantech sizes it for people about 160 to 180 cm tall. ONIN Infosys has it for Rs 39,000, down from Rs 50,000, in black, red, orange and blue.</p>','[{\"question\":\"Is the Fantech GC-283 good for tall people?\",\"answer\":\"Fantech recommends it for users about 160 to 180 cm tall. Taller users may find the headrest sits low.\"},{\"question\":\"How far does it recline?\",\"answer\":\"From 135 to 180 degrees, so you can lean back almost flat.\"}]','[{\"label\":\"ONIN Infosys \\u2013 Fantech Alpha Gc-283 Premiun Gaming Chair\",\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/onin.com.np\\/product\\/fantech-gaming-chair-price-in-nepal\",\"accessed\":\"2026-11-23\"}]',NULL,'https://onin.com.np/product/fantech-gaming-chair-price-in-nepal',0,'2026-11-22 18:15:00','2026-11-22 18:15:00'),(2484,86,6,'Huntkey 8-in-1 USB-C Docking Station (HKDC1500800)','huntkey-8-in-1-usb-c-docking-station-hkdc1500800','docking-station','gadgets/2026/huntkey-8-in-1-usb-c-docking-station-hkdc1500800.webp',NULL,NULL,6499.00,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,'available',NULL,0,0,'<p>Thin laptops save weight by dropping ports, and a hub like Huntkey\'s HKDC1500800 puts them back. From one USB-C port you get HDMI out at 4K 30Hz, USB 3.0 and USB 2.0, a USB-C data port, a USB-C Power Delivery port for charging (up to 100W input), Ethernet, and SD and microSD card slots.</p>\n<p>The aluminium body helps it stay cool, and it works across Windows, macOS, Linux, iPadOS and Android. At Rs 6,499 from ONIN Infosys with official Nepal warranty, it is an inexpensive way to turn a MacBook or an iPad into a desk setup.</p>','[{\"question\":\"Can I charge my laptop through the Huntkey hub?\",\"answer\":\"Yes. Plug your USB-C charger into the PD port and it passes power through to the laptop, up to 100W in.\"},{\"question\":\"Does the HDMI port support 4K?\",\"answer\":\"Yes, up to 4K at 30Hz. For smooth 60Hz at 4K you need a dock that supports it.\"}]','[{\"label\":\"ONIN Infosys \\u2013 Huntkey 8-in-1 USB-C Docking Station (HKDC1500800) - Official Nepal Warranty\",\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/onin.com.np\\/product\\/huntkey-usb-c-docking-station-hkdc1500800-price-nepal\",\"accessed\":\"2026-11-23\"}]',NULL,'https://onin.com.np/product/huntkey-usb-c-docking-station-hkdc1500800-price-nepal',0,'2026-11-22 18:15:00','2026-11-22 18:15:00'),(2485,87,6,'Logitech C920 Pro HD Webcam','logitech-c920-pro-hd-webcam','webcam','gadgets/2026/logitech-c920-pro-hd-webcam.webp',NULL,NULL,19800.00,22000.00,0,NULL,NULL,'available',NULL,0,0,'<p>The Logitech C920 has been the default \'good webcam\' for years, and for online classes, interviews and Zoom calls it still is. It records Full HD 1080p at 30fps, with autofocus and a glass lens that look clearly sharper than most laptop cameras, plus stereo microphones.</p>\n<p>The 78-degree field of view fits one person at a desk without showing the whole room, and the clip mounts on laptops and monitors or on a tripod. ONIN Infosys sells it for Rs 19,800 (down from Rs 22,000) with a one-year Logitech warranty.</p>','[{\"question\":\"Is the Logitech C920 good for online classes and meetings?\",\"answer\":\"Yes. 1080p video with autofocus and stereo mics is more than Zoom, Teams or Google Meet use, so it looks noticeably better than built-in laptop cameras.\"},{\"question\":\"C920 or C922: which should I buy?\",\"answer\":\"The C922 adds background replacement and a streaming focus for Rs 1,200 more. For calls and classes, the C920 is enough.\"}]','[{\"label\":\"ONIN Infosys \\u2013 Logitech C920 Pro HD Webcam\",\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/onin.com.np\\/product\\/logitech-c920-pro-hd-webcam\",\"accessed\":\"2026-11-23\"}]',NULL,'https://onin.com.np/product/logitech-c920-pro-hd-webcam',0,'2026-11-22 18:15:00','2026-11-22 18:15:00'),(2486,87,6,'Logitech C922 Pro Stream Webcam','logitech-c922-pro-stream-webcam','webcam','gadgets/2026/logitech-c922-pro-stream-webcam.webp',NULL,NULL,21000.00,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,'available',NULL,0,0,'<p>Logitech built the C922 for streamers, and it shows in the software. You get Full HD 1080p at 30fps, automatic low-light correction and background replacement, all set up through Logitech Capture, plus two omnidirectional mics for voice.</p>\n<p>H.264 compression keeps recordings small and uploads quick, and the adjustable field of view lets you frame a desk shot or a closer face cam. At Rs 21,000 from ONIN Infosys with a one-year warranty, it is a step up from the C920 for anyone going live on YouTube or Twitch.</p>','[{\"question\":\"Does the C922 work for streaming on OBS?\",\"answer\":\"Yes. It works as a standard USB webcam in OBS, Streamlabs, Zoom and Teams.\"},{\"question\":\"Can it blur or replace my background?\",\"answer\":\"Yes, through Logitech Capture\'s background replacement feature.\"}]','[{\"label\":\"ONIN Infosys \\u2013 Logitech C922 PRO HD STREAM WEBCAM\",\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/onin.com.np\\/product\\/logitech-c922-webcam-price-in-nepal\",\"accessed\":\"2026-11-23\"}]',NULL,'https://onin.com.np/product/logitech-c922-webcam-price-in-nepal',0,'2026-11-22 18:15:00','2026-11-22 18:15:00'),(2487,88,6,'Meetion MT-CHR14 Ergonomic Gaming Chair','meetion-mt-chr14-ergonomic-gaming-chair','gaming-chair','gadgets/2026/meetion-mt-chr14-ergonomic-gaming-chair.webp',NULL,NULL,26999.00,28999.00,0,NULL,NULL,'available',NULL,0,0,'<p>Meetion\'s MT-CHR14 is a racing-style chair for people who sit for hours, whether gaming or studying. It comes with a headrest and a lumbar pillow, adjusts its angle automatically as you lean, and is covered in microfibre leather over a diamond-pattern cushion.</p>\n<p>The base rolls on racing-tested wheels and the gas lift is SGS-certified, the safety test you want on a chair you sit on every day. ONIN Infosys sells it for Rs 26,999, down from Rs 28,999.</p>','[{\"question\":\"Does the Meetion MT-CHR14 come with pillows?\",\"answer\":\"Yes. It includes a neck pillow and a lumbar cushion.\"},{\"question\":\"Is the gas lift certified?\",\"answer\":\"Yes. The air rod (gas lift) is SGS-certified.\"}]','[{\"label\":\"ONIN Infosys \\u2013 Meetion MT-CHR14 Ergonomic Gaming Chair \\u2013 Adjustable, Reclining, Comfortable\",\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/onin.com.np\\/product\\/meetion-mt-chr14-gaming-chair-price-nepal\",\"accessed\":\"2026-11-23\"}]',NULL,'https://onin.com.np/product/meetion-mt-chr14-gaming-chair-price-nepal',0,'2026-11-22 18:15:00','2026-11-22 18:15:00'),(2488,89,37,'Rapoo H120 Wired Headset','rapoo-h120-wired-headset',NULL,'gadgets/2026/rapoo-h120-wired-headset.webp',NULL,NULL,1800.00,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,'available',NULL,0,0,'<p>The Rapoo H120 is a no-fuss headset for calls, online classes and everyday listening. It is light, the headband adjusts, the ear cushions are soft, and the omnidirectional microphone picks up your voice without fiddling with a boom.</p>\n<p>It connects with a single 3.5mm jack, so it works with laptops, phones and most PCs. For Rs 1,800 at ONIN Infosys, it is a simple upgrade over a laptop\'s built-in speakers and mic.</p>','[{\"question\":\"Will the Rapoo H120 work with my phone?\",\"answer\":\"Yes, through its 3.5mm jack. Phones without a headphone jack need a USB-C or Lightning adapter.\"},{\"question\":\"Does it have a microphone?\",\"answer\":\"Yes, an omnidirectional mic for calls and classes.\"}]','[{\"label\":\"ONIN Infosys \\u2013 Rapoo H120 Black\",\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/onin.com.np\\/product\\/rapoo-h120-black\",\"accessed\":\"2026-11-23\"}]',NULL,'https://onin.com.np/product/rapoo-h120-black',0,'2026-11-22 18:15:00','2026-11-22 18:15:00'),(2489,89,6,'Rapoo C200 720p Webcam','rapoo-c200-720p-webcam','webcam','gadgets/2026/rapoo-c200-720p-webcam.webp',NULL,NULL,3500.00,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,'available',NULL,0,0,'<p>If you just need a working camera for a desktop PC, the Rapoo C200 does the job for Rs 3,500. It records at 720p and 30fps, has a built-in microphone and is plug-and-play over USB, so there are no drivers to install.</p>\n<p>The universal clip fits monitors and laptops, and the camera rotates 360 degrees to point wherever you need it. It is a budget pick for classes and video calls rather than streaming, and ONIN Infosys has it in stock.</p>','[{\"question\":\"Is 720p good enough for Zoom classes?\",\"answer\":\"For most video calls, yes. Zoom and Meet often send 720p anyway. For recording or streaming, a 1080p camera like the Logitech C920 looks sharper.\"},{\"question\":\"Does it need software?\",\"answer\":\"No. It is plug-and-play over USB.\"}]','[{\"label\":\"ONIN Infosys \\u2013 Rapoo Webcam C200 - 720P\",\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/onin.com.np\\/product\\/rapoo-webcam-c200---720p\",\"accessed\":\"2026-11-23\"}]',NULL,'https://onin.com.np/product/rapoo-webcam-c200---720p',0,'2026-11-22 18:15:00','2026-11-22 18:15:00'),(2490,89,6,'Rapoo XD120 USB-C Hub','rapoo-xd120-usb-c-hub','docking-station','gadgets/2026/rapoo-xd120-usb-c-hub.webp',NULL,NULL,6500.00,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,'available',NULL,0,0,'<p>Rapoo\'s XD120 is a pocket-sized USB-C hub for people who move between home and office. It adds HDMI output, two USB 3.0 ports at 5Gbps, SD and microSD card slots, and a USB-C Power Delivery port, so you can charge while everything else is plugged in.</p>\n<p>It even works with a Nintendo Switch for playing on a TV. The metal casing feels sturdy and the hub is small enough to live in a laptop bag. ONIN Infosys sells the silver model for Rs 6,500.</p>','[{\"question\":\"Can I use the Rapoo XD120 with a Nintendo Switch?\",\"answer\":\"Yes, Rapoo lists Switch compatibility for HDMI output to a TV.\"},{\"question\":\"Does it charge my laptop?\",\"answer\":\"Yes, through the USB-C PD pass-through port when you connect your charger to the hub.\"}]','[{\"label\":\"ONIN Infosys \\u2013 Rapoo XD120 USB-C Hub USB3.0 5Gbps High Speed Docking Station HDMI-compatible Adapter TF S\",\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/onin.com.np\\/product\\/rapoo-xd120-usb-c-hub-usb3-0-5gbps-high-speed-docking-station-hdmi-compatible-adapter-tf-sd-card-reader-usb-type-c-data-transmission-converter---silver\",\"accessed\":\"2026-11-23\"}]',NULL,'https://onin.com.np/product/rapoo-xd120-usb-c-hub-usb3-0-5gbps-high-speed-docking-station-hdmi-compatible-adapter-tf-sd-card-reader-usb-type-c-data-transmission-converter---silver',0,'2026-11-22 18:15:00','2026-11-22 18:15:00'),(2491,90,6,'WiWU Pencil D Universal Stylus','wiwu-pencil-d-universal-stylus','stylus','gadgets/2026/wiwu-pencil-d-universal-stylus.webp',NULL,NULL,4500.00,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,'available',NULL,0,0,'<p>Not everyone needs an Apple Pencil for notes and sketches, and the WiWU Pencil D costs a fraction of one. It works on iPads from 2018 onwards, the 6th to 11th gen iPad, every iPad Pro and recent Air and mini models, as well as many Android and Windows touchscreens.</p>\n<p>On iPad it supports palm rejection and tilt shading, and it snaps magnetically to the side of the tablet. It charges over USB-C, with a 15-minute quick charge for a session, runs about 6 to 10 hours, and turns itself off after five idle minutes. ONIN Infosys sells it for Rs 4,500.</p>','[{\"question\":\"Does the WiWU Pencil D have palm rejection?\",\"answer\":\"Yes, on iPads from 2018 onwards. It also supports tilt for shading.\"},{\"question\":\"Does it work with Android tablets?\",\"answer\":\"Yes, as a universal active stylus, though palm rejection and tilt are optimised for iPad.\"}]','[{\"label\":\"ONIN Infosys \\u2013 WiWU Pencil D Universal Active Stylus Pen\",\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/onin.com.np\\/product\\/wiwu-pencil-d-universal-stylus-price-nepal\",\"accessed\":\"2026-11-23\"}]',NULL,'https://onin.com.np/product/wiwu-pencil-d-universal-stylus-price-nepal',0,'2026-11-22 18:15:00','2026-11-22 18:15:00'),(2492,91,50,'DJI Flip Drone with RC 2','dji-flip-drone-with-rc-2',NULL,'gadgets/2026/dji-flip-drone-with-rc-2.webp',NULL,NULL,112500.00,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,'available',NULL,0,0,'<p>The DJI Flip is aimed at people who want great aerial video without learning to fly a big drone. It weighs under 249 g, its propellers sit inside built-in guards, and it folds flat. Yet it shoots 4K at up to 100fps and 48MP stills, with 10-bit D-Log M for colour grading.</p>\n<p>AI subject tracking and automatic flight modes handle the cinematic moves, O4 transmission gives a range of up to 8 miles, and a battery lasts about 31 minutes. This bundle includes the RC 2 controller with its own screen. ONIN Infosys sells it for Rs 1,12,500. Check Nepal\'s drone flying rules before you take off.</p>','[{\"question\":\"Do I need permission to fly a DJI Flip in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"Drone flying in Nepal is regulated, and some areas need approval. Check the current rules with the authorities before flying, especially near airports and heritage sites.\"},{\"question\":\"How long does the battery last?\",\"answer\":\"Up to about 31 minutes per battery, by DJI\'s figure.\"}]','[{\"label\":\"ONIN Infosys \\u2013 DJI Flip 4k Drone with Remote control (RC 2)\",\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/onin.com.np\\/product\\/dji-flip-rc2-drone-price-in-nepal\",\"accessed\":\"2026-11-23\"}]',NULL,'https://onin.com.np/product/dji-flip-rc2-drone-price-in-nepal',1,'2026-11-22 18:15:00','2026-11-22 18:15:00'),(2493,78,4,'Beats Fit Pro','beats-fit-pro',NULL,'gadgets/2026/beats-fit-pro.webp',NULL,NULL,31000.00,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,'available',NULL,0,0,'<p>Beats Fit Pro is the pair to choose if earbuds keep falling out at the gym or on a run. The flexible wingtips lock into your ear, and you still get active noise cancellation and a full, bass-forward sound that Beats is known for.</p>\n<p>They pair quickly with iPhones and also work with Android over Bluetooth, which makes them a good fit for mixed-phone households. ONIN Infosys sells them for Rs 31,000.</p>','[{\"question\":\"Are Beats Fit Pro good for workouts?\",\"answer\":\"Yes. The wingtip design holds them in place during runs and gym sessions, which is their main advantage over regular earbuds.\"},{\"question\":\"Do Beats Fit Pro work with Android?\",\"answer\":\"Yes, over standard Bluetooth. Some iPhone-only features need an Apple device.\"}]','[{\"label\":\"ONIN Infosys \\u2013 Beats Fit Pro | True Wireless Noise Cancelling Earbuds\",\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/onin.com.np\\/product\\/beats-fit-pro---true-wireless-noise-cancelling-earbuds\",\"accessed\":\"2026-11-23\"}]',NULL,'https://onin.com.np/product/beats-fit-pro---true-wireless-noise-cancelling-earbuds',0,'2026-11-22 18:15:00','2026-11-22 18:15:00'),(2494,85,37,'Fantech HQ53 Flash Gaming Headset','fantech-hq53-flash-gaming-headset',NULL,'gadgets/2026/fantech-hq53-flash-gaming-headset.webp',NULL,NULL,2500.00,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,'available',NULL,0,0,'<p>The Fantech HQ53 Flash keeps a gaming headset simple and affordable. Large 50mm drivers give footsteps and explosions some weight, the frame is light enough for long matches, and red accent lighting gives it a gaming look.</p>\n<p>It connects with a 3.5mm stereo plug for audio, plus USB to power the lights. At Rs 2,500 from ONIN Infosys with a one-year warranty, it is an easy first headset for PC gaming.</p>','[{\"question\":\"Does the Fantech HQ53 need USB?\",\"answer\":\"Only for the lighting. Sound and mic go through the 3.5mm plug, so it also works on phones and consoles with a headphone jack.\"},{\"question\":\"What warranty does it have?\",\"answer\":\"One year, according to ONIN Infosys.\"}]','[{\"label\":\"ONIN Infosys \\u2013 Fantech HQ53 Flash Black Gaming Headphone\",\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/onin.com.np\\/product\\/fantech-hq53-flash-black-gaming-headphone\",\"accessed\":\"2026-11-23\"}]',NULL,'https://onin.com.np/product/fantech-hq53-flash-black-gaming-headphone',0,'2026-11-22 18:15:00','2026-11-22 18:15:00'),(2495,87,37,'Logitech H110 Stereo Headset','logitech-h110-stereo-headset',NULL,'gadgets/2026/logitech-h110-stereo-headset.webp',NULL,NULL,1450.00,1800.00,0,NULL,NULL,'available',NULL,0,0,'<p>For office calls and online classes, the Logitech H110 does exactly what\'s needed and nothing more. You get stereo sound, a unidirectional microphone that focuses on your voice, and separate 3.5mm plugs for headphones and mic, which suits desktop PCs with two jacks.</p>\n<p>It works on Windows, macOS and Chrome OS, and the cable is long enough to reach a tower under the desk. ONIN Infosys sells it for Rs 1,450 (down from Rs 1,800) with a one-year Logitech warranty.</p>','[{\"question\":\"Does the Logitech H110 work with a laptop that has one audio jack?\",\"answer\":\"It uses two separate 3.5mm plugs, so laptops with a single combo jack need a splitter. The H111 uses one combined plug instead.\"},{\"question\":\"H110 or H111?\",\"answer\":\"Same audio. The H110 has separate mic and headphone plugs for desktops, and the H111 has a single combo plug for laptops and phones.\"}]','[{\"label\":\"ONIN Infosys \\u2013 Logitech H110 Pc Stereo Headset\",\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/onin.com.np\\/product\\/logitech-h110-pc-stereo-headset\",\"accessed\":\"2026-11-23\"}]',NULL,'https://onin.com.np/product/logitech-h110-pc-stereo-headset',0,'2026-11-22 18:15:00','2026-11-22 18:15:00'),(2496,87,37,'Logitech H111 Stereo Headset','logitech-h111-stereo-headset',NULL,'gadgets/2026/logitech-h111-stereo-headset.webp',NULL,NULL,1650.00,1950.00,0,NULL,NULL,'available',NULL,0,0,'<p>The Logitech H111 is the laptop-friendly twin of the H110. It has the same stereo audio and directional microphone, but uses a single 3.5mm combo plug that fits the one jack on most laptops and phones.</p>\n<p>Its 2.5-metre cable gives you room to move, and the lightweight band is comfortable through a full day of meetings. ONIN Infosys sells it for Rs 1,650, down from Rs 1,950, with a one-year Logitech warranty.</p>','[{\"question\":\"Will the H111 work with my phone?\",\"answer\":\"Yes, with phones that have a 3.5mm jack. Phones without one need an adapter.\"},{\"question\":\"How long is the cable?\",\"answer\":\"About 2.5 metres.\"}]','[{\"label\":\"ONIN Infosys \\u2013 logitech h111 stereo headset\",\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/onin.com.np\\/product\\/logitech-h111-stereo-headset\",\"accessed\":\"2026-11-23\"}]',NULL,'https://onin.com.np/product/logitech-h111-stereo-headset',0,'2026-11-22 18:15:00','2026-11-22 18:15:00'),(2497,88,37,'Meetion HP010 Backlit Gaming Headset','meetion-hp010-backlit-gaming-headset',NULL,'gadgets/2026/meetion-hp010-backlit-gaming-headset.webp',NULL,NULL,2000.00,2800.00,0,NULL,NULL,'available',NULL,0,0,'<p>Meetion\'s HP010 is a budget gaming headset that looks the part. A leather headband, 40mm speakers and backlighting give it a gamer feel, while the omnidirectional mic rotates through 160 degrees, so you can push it out of the way when you are not talking.</p>\n<p>It plugs in with two 3.5mm jacks and weighs about 264 g. For Rs 2,000 at ONIN Infosys (down from Rs 2,800) with a one-year warranty, it is one of the cheapest ways to get a lit-up headset with a mic.</p>','[{\"question\":\"Does the Meetion HP010 have a microphone?\",\"answer\":\"Yes, an omnidirectional noise-cancelling mic that rotates 160 degrees.\"},{\"question\":\"How does it connect?\",\"answer\":\"Through two 3.5mm plugs, one for audio and one for the mic.\"}]','[{\"label\":\"ONIN Infosys \\u2013 Meetion HP010 Backlit Gaming Stereo Headset with Mic\",\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/onin.com.np\\/product\\/meetion-hp010-backlit-gaming-stereo-headset-with-mic-\",\"accessed\":\"2026-11-23\"}]',NULL,'https://onin.com.np/product/meetion-hp010-backlit-gaming-stereo-headset-with-mic-',0,'2026-11-22 18:15:00','2026-11-22 18:15:00'),(2498,88,37,'Meetion HP020 Backlit Gaming Headset','meetion-hp020-backlit-gaming-headset',NULL,'gadgets/2026/meetion-hp020-backlit-gaming-headset.webp',NULL,NULL,3200.00,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,'available',NULL,0,0,'<p>The HP020 moves up from Meetion\'s entry headset with larger 50mm speakers and a steel headband beam that holds its shape over time. The leather band and noise-cancelling mic make it comfortable for long team chats.</p>\n<p>It connects through a 3.5mm stereo jack, with USB for the lighting, and weighs about 290 g. ONIN Infosys sells it for Rs 3,200 with a one-year warranty.</p>','[{\"question\":\"What\'s different from the HP010?\",\"answer\":\"Bigger 50mm drivers, a steel beam in the headband, and a 3.5mm jack plus USB instead of two audio plugs.\"},{\"question\":\"Does it work without USB?\",\"answer\":\"Audio and mic work through the 3.5mm jack, and USB powers the backlight.\"}]','[{\"label\":\"ONIN Infosys \\u2013 Meetion HP020 Backlit Gaming Headset with Mic\",\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/onin.com.np\\/product\\/meetion-hp020-gaming-headset-with-mic-price-in-nepal\",\"accessed\":\"2026-11-23\"}]',NULL,'https://onin.com.np/product/meetion-hp020-gaming-headset-with-mic-price-in-nepal',0,'2026-11-22 18:15:00','2026-11-22 18:15:00'),(2499,88,37,'Meetion HP021 Gaming Headset','meetion-hp021-gaming-headset',NULL,'gadgets/2026/meetion-hp021-gaming-headset.webp',NULL,NULL,2500.00,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,'available',NULL,0,0,'<p>With 50mm speaker units, a noise-reduction microphone and a one-key mic mute on the cable, the Meetion HP021 covers the things that matter in team games. The leather headband adjusts, and the inline control means you never have to alt-tab to mute yourself.</p>\n<p>It connects through a 3.5mm stereo jack (with USB for the lights) on a 2.2-metre cable. ONIN Infosys sells it for Rs 2,500 with a one-year warranty, which puts it between Meetion\'s HP010 and HP020.</p>','[{\"question\":\"Can I mute the mic quickly on the HP021?\",\"answer\":\"Yes, there is a one-key mic switch on the cable control.\"},{\"question\":\"How long is the cable?\",\"answer\":\"About 2.2 metres, long enough to reach a desktop tower.\"}]','[{\"label\":\"ONIN Infosys \\u2013 Meetion HP021 Stereo Gaming Noise Canceling Headset with Mic\",\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/onin.com.np\\/product\\/meetion-hp021-stereo-gaming-noise-canceling-headset-with-mic\",\"accessed\":\"2026-11-23\"}]',NULL,'https://onin.com.np/product/meetion-hp021-stereo-gaming-noise-canceling-headset-with-mic',0,'2026-11-22 18:15:00','2026-11-22 18:15:00'),(2500,88,37,'Meetion HP030 7.1 Gaming Headset','meetion-hp030-7-1-gaming-headset',NULL,'gadgets/2026/meetion-hp030-7-1-gaming-headset.webp',NULL,NULL,4200.00,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,'available',NULL,0,0,'<p>The HP030 is Meetion\'s step into USB headsets with 7.1 virtual surround, which helps you place footsteps and gunfire in shooters. It plugs into a gold-plated USB connector on a braided, anti-pull cable, so there is no fumbling with separate audio and mic jacks.</p>\n<p>The leather headband and backlighting match the rest of the range. Meetion quotes a 10 Hz to 20 kHz frequency response. ONIN Infosys sells it for Rs 4,200 with a one-year warranty.</p>','[{\"question\":\"Does the HP030 work on a PS4 or PS5?\",\"answer\":\"It connects over USB, which most consoles accept for headsets, but 7.1 surround is intended for PC. Check compatibility with ONIN before buying for a console.\"},{\"question\":\"Is 7.1 surround useful?\",\"answer\":\"In games like Valorant, PUBG or CS2 it can make it easier to hear where sounds come from.\"}]','[{\"label\":\"ONIN Infosys \\u2013 Meetion HP030 HIFI 7.1 Backlit Leather headband Gaming Headset with mic\",\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/onin.com.np\\/product\\/meetion-hp030-gaming-headset-price-in-nepal\",\"accessed\":\"2026-11-23\"}]',NULL,'https://onin.com.np/product/meetion-hp030-gaming-headset-price-in-nepal',0,'2026-11-22 18:15:00','2026-11-22 18:15:00'),(2501,89,37,'Rapoo VH800 Dual-Mode Gaming Headset','rapoo-vh800-dual-mode-gaming-headset',NULL,'gadgets/2026/rapoo-vh800-dual-mode-gaming-headset.webp',NULL,NULL,8750.00,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,'available',NULL,0,0,'<p>Rapoo\'s VH800 drops the cable without dropping the gaming features. It connects over a 2.4GHz wireless dongle for low-latency play or Bluetooth 5.2 for phones and tablets, so one headset covers both PC sessions and mobile gaming.</p>\n<p>Graphene composite drivers handle detail, the microphone detaches when you just want music, and the metal headband retracts to fit. RGB lighting and on-ear controls finish it off. ONIN Infosys sells it for Rs 8,750.</p>','[{\"question\":\"Can the Rapoo VH800 connect to my phone?\",\"answer\":\"Yes, over Bluetooth 5.2. Use the 2.4GHz dongle on a PC for lower latency.\"},{\"question\":\"Is the microphone removable?\",\"answer\":\"Yes, it detaches.\"}]','[{\"label\":\"ONIN Infosys \\u2013 RAPOO VH800 Bluetooth Gaming Headset- RGB (Dual Mode- USB + Bluetooth)\",\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/onin.com.np\\/product\\/rapoo-vh800-bluetooth-gaming-headset--rgb--dual-mode--usb---bluetooth-\",\"accessed\":\"2026-11-23\"}]',NULL,'https://onin.com.np/product/rapoo-vh800-bluetooth-gaming-headset--rgb--dual-mode--usb---bluetooth-',0,'2026-11-22 18:15:00','2026-11-22 18:15:00'),(2502,85,42,'Fantech Helios UX3 Gaming Mouse','fantech-helios-ux3-gaming-mouse',NULL,'gadgets/2026/fantech-helios-ux3-gaming-mouse.webp',NULL,NULL,6200.00,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,'available',NULL,0,0,'<p>At 69 g, the Fantech Helios UX3 is the kind of light mouse competitive players like for fast flicks. Inside is a PixArt PMW3389 sensor that goes from 400 up to 16,000 DPI, with 1,000Hz polling and 400 IPS tracking, the same sensor class found in far pricier mice.</p>\n<p>Huano switches are rated for 50 million clicks, there are seven buttons, and a 1.8m paracord cable barely drags. RGB lighting runs across the body. ONIN Infosys sells it for Rs 6,200 with a one-year warranty.</p>','[{\"question\":\"What sensor does the Fantech UX3 use?\",\"answer\":\"The PixArt PMW3389, adjustable from 400 to 16,000 DPI.\"},{\"question\":\"How heavy is it?\",\"answer\":\"About 69 g without the cable.\"}]','[{\"label\":\"ONIN Infosys \\u2013 Fantech Helios UX3 RGB Gaming Mouse\",\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/onin.com.np\\/product\\/fantech-rgb-gaming-mouse-price-in-nepal\",\"accessed\":\"2026-11-23\"}]',NULL,'https://onin.com.np/product/fantech-rgb-gaming-mouse-price-in-nepal',1,'2026-11-22 18:15:00','2026-11-22 18:15:00'),(2503,87,42,'Logitech G502 HERO Gaming Mouse','logitech-g502-hero-gaming-mouse',NULL,'gadgets/2026/logitech-g502-hero-gaming-mouse.webp',NULL,NULL,8000.00,9000.00,0,NULL,NULL,'available',NULL,0,0,'<p>The G502 HERO is one of the most popular gaming mice ever, mainly for its shape and its eleven programmable buttons. The HERO 25K-class sensor tracks from 100 to 25,600 DPI at over 400 IPS, with a 1,000 Hz report rate.</p>\n<p>At about 121 g it is on the heavy side, which some players prefer for control, and it suits MMO and strategy players who want macros under the thumb. ONIN Infosys has it for Rs 8,000, down from Rs 9,000.</p>','[{\"question\":\"How many buttons does the G502 HERO have?\",\"answer\":\"Eleven, all programmable in Logitech G HUB.\"},{\"question\":\"Is the G502 good for small hands?\",\"answer\":\"It is a large, fairly heavy mouse, so people with small hands may prefer a lighter option like the Fantech UX3.\"}]','[{\"label\":\"ONIN Infosys \\u2013 Logitech G502 Hero Optical 16000dpi Wired USB Gaming Mouse\",\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/onin.com.np\\/product\\/logitech-g502-hero-optical-16000dpi-wired-usb-gaming-mouse\",\"accessed\":\"2026-11-23\"}]',NULL,'https://onin.com.np/product/logitech-g502-hero-optical-16000dpi-wired-usb-gaming-mouse',0,'2026-11-22 18:15:00','2026-11-22 18:15:00'),(2504,87,42,'Logitech MK100 Classic Keyboard and Mouse Combo','logitech-mk100-classic-keyboard-and-mouse-combo',NULL,'gadgets/2026/logitech-mk100-classic-keyboard-and-mouse-combo.webp',NULL,NULL,2700.00,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,'available',NULL,0,0,'<p>The Logitech MK100 is a plain, dependable full-size keyboard and mouse set for office or home desktops. The keyboard has a numeric pad and a spill-resistant design, and it is plug-and-play.</p>\n<p>One detail to check before buying: the keyboard uses a PS/2 connector, which suits older desktops but not most laptops. ONIN Infosys sells the set for Rs 2,700 with a one-year warranty.</p>','[{\"question\":\"Will the MK100 keyboard work with a laptop?\",\"answer\":\"The keyboard is PS\\/2, so it needs a PS\\/2 port or an adapter. For laptops, the USB Logitech MK120 is simpler.\"},{\"question\":\"Is it spill resistant?\",\"answer\":\"Yes, the keyboard is designed to survive minor spills.\"}]','[{\"label\":\"ONIN Infosys \\u2013 Logitech MK100 classic Desktop Combo Keyboard and Mouse\",\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/onin.com.np\\/product\\/logitech-mk100-classic-keyboard-price-in-nepal\",\"accessed\":\"2026-11-23\"}]',NULL,'https://onin.com.np/product/logitech-mk100-classic-keyboard-price-in-nepal',0,'2026-11-22 18:15:00','2026-11-22 18:15:00'),(2505,87,42,'Logitech MK120 Keyboard and Mouse Combo','logitech-mk120-keyboard-and-mouse-combo',NULL,'gadgets/2026/logitech-mk120-keyboard-and-mouse-combo.webp',NULL,NULL,2800.00,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,'available',NULL,0,0,'<p>If a workplace has a hundred desks, there\'s a good chance many have a Logitech MK120. The full-size USB keyboard is spill resistant and rated for 5 million keystrokes, with adjustable tilt legs and lights for Num, Caps and Scroll Lock.</p>\n<p>Both pieces are plug-and-play over USB, so they work on desktops and laptops alike. ONIN Infosys sells the set for Rs 2,800 with a one-year warranty.</p>','[{\"question\":\"Is the MK120 wired or wireless?\",\"answer\":\"Wired, over USB.\"},{\"question\":\"MK100 or MK120?\",\"answer\":\"Choose the MK120 for its USB keyboard, which works with laptops and modern PCs. The MK100\'s keyboard uses PS\\/2.\"}]','[{\"label\":\"ONIN Infosys \\u2013 Logitech MK120 Desktop Combo Keyboard and Mouse\",\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/onin.com.np\\/product\\/logitech-mk120-combo-keyboard-and-mouse-price-in-nepal\",\"accessed\":\"2026-11-23\"}]',NULL,'https://onin.com.np/product/logitech-mk120-combo-keyboard-and-mouse-price-in-nepal',0,'2026-11-22 18:15:00','2026-11-22 18:15:00'),(2506,87,42,'Logitech M187 Wireless Mini Mouse','logitech-m187-wireless-mini-mouse',NULL,'gadgets/2026/logitech-m187-wireless-mini-mouse.webp',NULL,NULL,2200.00,2500.00,0,NULL,NULL,'available',NULL,0,0,'<p>Logitech\'s M187 is small enough to disappear into a laptop sleeve, at about 82 x 49 mm and 52 g with its battery. It connects through a 2.4GHz USB receiver with a range of up to 10 metres, and a single AAA battery lasts up to six months depending on use.</p>\n<p>Three buttons and a scroll wheel cover everyday work. At Rs 2,200 at ONIN Infosys (down from Rs 2,500) with a one-year warranty, it is a travel mouse that costs little to lose.</p>','[{\"question\":\"What battery does the M187 use?\",\"answer\":\"A single AAA battery, lasting up to about six months.\"},{\"question\":\"Is it good for large hands?\",\"answer\":\"It is a mini mouse, so people with large hands may find it cramped for all-day use.\"}]','[{\"label\":\"ONIN Infosys \\u2013 Logitech Wireless Mini Mouse M187\",\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/onin.com.np\\/product\\/logitech-wireless-mini-mouse-m187\",\"accessed\":\"2026-11-23\"}]',NULL,'https://onin.com.np/product/logitech-wireless-mini-mouse-m187',0,'2026-11-22 18:15:00','2026-11-22 18:15:00'),(2507,87,42,'Logitech F310 Gamepad','logitech-f310-gamepad',NULL,'gadgets/2026/logitech-f310-gamepad.webp',NULL,NULL,4500.00,4800.00,0,NULL,NULL,'available',NULL,0,0,'<p>The Logitech F310 is a wired controller with a familiar console-style layout, and it is one of the easiest ways to play PC games that were made for a controller. It has a four-switch D-pad, and the cable runs 1.8 metres.</p>\n<p>It works on Windows from Vista to 11 and on Chrome OS. ONIN Infosys sells it for Rs 4,500 (down from Rs 4,800) with a one-year warranty.</p>','[{\"question\":\"Does the Logitech F310 work on PC games?\",\"answer\":\"Yes. It works with Windows and supports the standard controller mode most PC games use.\"},{\"question\":\"Is it wireless?\",\"answer\":\"No, it uses a 1.8 m USB cable.\"}]','[{\"label\":\"ONIN Infosys \\u2013 logitech F310 Gamepad\",\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/onin.com.np\\/product\\/logitech-f310-gamepad\",\"accessed\":\"2026-11-23\"}]',NULL,'https://onin.com.np/product/logitech-f310-gamepad',0,'2026-11-22 18:15:00','2026-11-22 18:15:00'),(2508,92,42,'Cooler Master MasterKeys Lite L RGB Keyboard and Mouse Combo','cooler-master-masterkeys-lite-l-rgb-keyboard-and-mouse-combo',NULL,'gadgets/2026/cooler-master-masterkeys-lite-l-rgb-keyboard-and-mouse-combo.webp',NULL,NULL,9750.00,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,'available',NULL,0,0,'<p>This Cooler Master combo pairs a MasterKeys Lite L RGB keyboard with a matching RGB mouse. The keyboard uses Cooler Master\'s \'mem-chanical\' switches, a membrane design tuned to feel closer to a mechanical key, with full RGB lighting.</p>\n<p>The mouse uses Omron switches rated for 10 million clicks. Both connect by fixed cables. ONIN Infosys sells the set for Rs 9,750, an easy way to get a matching lit-up desk in one purchase.</p>','[{\"question\":\"Is the MasterKeys Lite L keyboard mechanical?\",\"answer\":\"It uses \'mem-chanical\' switches, a membrane design built to feel closer to mechanical keys.\"},{\"question\":\"What switches does the mouse use?\",\"answer\":\"Omron switches rated for 10 million clicks.\"}]','[{\"label\":\"ONIN Infosys \\u2013 GAMING KB MOUSE - MK LITE L Mem-chanical RGB LED Backlight with REAL effect\",\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/onin.com.np\\/product\\/gaming-kb-mouse---mk-lite-l-mem-chanical-rgb-led-backlight-with-real-effect\",\"accessed\":\"2026-11-23\"}]',NULL,'https://onin.com.np/product/gaming-kb-mouse---mk-lite-l-mem-chanical-rgb-led-backlight-with-real-effect',0,'2026-11-22 18:15:00','2026-11-22 18:15:00'),(2509,88,42,'Meetion C4120 Wireless Keyboard and Mouse Combo','meetion-c4120-wireless-keyboard-and-mouse-combo',NULL,'gadgets/2026/meetion-c4120-wireless-keyboard-and-mouse-combo.webp',NULL,NULL,3500.00,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,'available',NULL,0,0,'<p>Clear the cable clutter off a home or office desk with Meetion\'s C4120. It\'s a full-size keyboard with a number pad and an optical mouse, both on one 2.4GHz receiver, with quiet keys that won\'t bother anyone nearby.</p>\n<p>The mouse runs at 1,600 DPI, the set is plug-and-play on Windows and Mac, and the batteries are built to last. ONIN Infosys sells it for Rs 3,500.</p>','[{\"question\":\"Do both the keyboard and mouse use one receiver?\",\"answer\":\"Yes, one 2.4GHz USB receiver for both.\"},{\"question\":\"Does it work with a Mac?\",\"answer\":\"Yes, it is plug-and-play on Windows and macOS.\"}]','[{\"label\":\"ONIN Infosys \\u2013 Meetion C4120 Combo wireless Keyboard and Mouse\",\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/onin.com.np\\/product\\/meetion-c4120-combo-wireless-keyboard-and-mouse\",\"accessed\":\"2026-11-23\"}]',NULL,'https://onin.com.np/product/meetion-c4120-combo-wireless-keyboard-and-mouse',0,'2026-11-22 18:15:00','2026-11-22 18:15:00'),(2510,88,42,'Meetion K100 Wired Keyboard','meetion-k100-wired-keyboard',NULL,'gadgets/2026/meetion-k100-wired-keyboard.webp',NULL,NULL,700.00,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,'available',NULL,0,0,'<p>For Rs 700, the Meetion K100 is the cheapest way to get a reliable keyboard onto a desk. It\'s a standard 104-key USB layout with a number pad, UV-coated keycaps that resist wear, and a 1.5-metre cable.</p>\n<p>It works on Windows and macOS without drivers, which is why schools and offices buy it by the box. ONIN Infosys includes a one-year warranty.</p>','[{\"question\":\"Does the Meetion K100 have a number pad?\",\"answer\":\"Yes, it is a full 104\\/105-key layout.\"},{\"question\":\"Does it work with Mac?\",\"answer\":\"Yes, it is plug-and-play on Windows and macOS.\"}]','[{\"label\":\"ONIN Infosys \\u2013 Meetion K100 Desktop Wired Keyboard\",\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/onin.com.np\\/product\\/meetion-k100-keyboard-price-in-nepal\",\"accessed\":\"2026-11-23\"}]',NULL,'https://onin.com.np/product/meetion-k100-keyboard-price-in-nepal',0,'2026-11-22 18:15:00','2026-11-22 18:15:00'),(2511,88,42,'Meetion K9300 Rainbow Gaming Keyboard','meetion-k9300-rainbow-gaming-keyboard',NULL,'gadgets/2026/meetion-k9300-rainbow-gaming-keyboard.webp',NULL,NULL,2500.00,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,'available',NULL,0,0,'<p>The Meetion K9300 brings rainbow backlighting with adjustable brightness to a budget keyboard. Nineteen keys have anti-ghosting, which covers the WASD cluster and the keys around it in games, and twelve multimedia shortcuts sit on the function row.</p>\n<p>Keys are rated for over 10 million presses, the 1.8-metre cable reaches under-desk towers, and the board weighs about 835 g, so it stays put. ONIN Infosys sells it for Rs 2,500 with a one-year warranty.</p>','[{\"question\":\"Is the Meetion K9300 mechanical?\",\"answer\":\"No, it is a membrane gaming keyboard with rainbow backlighting.\"},{\"question\":\"How many keys are anti-ghosting?\",\"answer\":\"Nineteen.\"}]','[{\"label\":\"ONIN Infosys \\u2013 Meetion K9300 Rainbow Gaming Keyboard\",\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/onin.com.np\\/product\\/meetion-k9300-rainbow-gaming-keyboard.html\",\"accessed\":\"2026-11-23\"}]',NULL,'https://onin.com.np/product/meetion-k9300-rainbow-gaming-keyboard.html',0,'2026-11-22 18:15:00','2026-11-22 18:15:00'),(2512,88,42,'Meetion M317 Backlit Gaming Mouse','meetion-m317-backlit-gaming-mouse',NULL,'gadgets/2026/meetion-m317-backlit-gaming-mouse.webp',NULL,NULL,1000.00,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,'available',NULL,0,0,'<p>Meetion\'s M317 is a Rs 1,000 wired mouse with a four-colour breathing backlight and a 1,600 DPI optical sensor. It has three buttons plus a soft rubber scroll wheel, and switches rated for over 3 million clicks.</p>\n<p>It is plug-and-play over USB on a 1.5-metre cable. ONIN Infosys stocks it as an inexpensive lit-up mouse for a new PC.</p>','[{\"question\":\"What DPI does the Meetion M317 support?\",\"answer\":\"Up to 1,600 DPI.\"},{\"question\":\"Is it wired?\",\"answer\":\"Yes, USB with a 1.5 m cable.\"}]','[{\"label\":\"ONIN Infosys \\u2013 Meetion M317 USB Wired Backlit Gaming Mouse\",\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/onin.com.np\\/product\\/meetion-m317-usb-wired-backlit-gaming-mouse\",\"accessed\":\"2026-11-23\"}]',NULL,'https://onin.com.np/product/meetion-m317-usb-wired-backlit-gaming-mouse',0,'2026-11-22 18:15:00','2026-11-22 18:15:00'),(2513,88,42,'Meetion M361 Wired Office Mouse','meetion-m361-wired-office-mouse',NULL,'gadgets/2026/meetion-m361-wired-office-mouse.webp',NULL,NULL,450.00,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,'available',NULL,0,0,'<p>The Meetion M361 is the most basic mouse ONIN Infosys sells, and at Rs 450 it doesn\'t need to be anything more. It\'s a compact USB optical mouse with an ergonomic shape for office work, and it plugs in and works straight away.</p>\n<p>Keep one in a drawer as a spare, or kit out a computer lab without spending much.</p>','[{\"question\":\"Is the Meetion M361 wired?\",\"answer\":\"Yes, it connects over USB.\"},{\"question\":\"Does it need drivers?\",\"answer\":\"No, it is plug-and-play.\"}]','[{\"label\":\"ONIN Infosys \\u2013 Meetion M361 USB Wired Office Desktop Mouse\",\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/onin.com.np\\/product\\/meetion-m361-usb-wired-desktop-mouse-price-in-nepal\",\"accessed\":\"2026-11-23\"}]',NULL,'https://onin.com.np/product/meetion-m361-usb-wired-desktop-mouse-price-in-nepal',0,'2026-11-22 18:15:00','2026-11-22 18:15:00'),(2514,88,42,'Meetion M915 Wired Gaming Mouse','meetion-m915-wired-gaming-mouse',NULL,'gadgets/2026/meetion-m915-wired-gaming-mouse.webp',NULL,NULL,1100.00,1500.00,0,NULL,NULL,'available',NULL,0,0,'<p>With a 2,400 DPI optical sensor, a 4,000 fps frame rate and six buttons, the Meetion M915 covers basic gaming without spending much. The two side buttons are handy for browsing back and forward too.</p>\n<p>Its matte soft-touch shell resists sweaty palms, and the four-colour backlight can be adjusted. ONIN Infosys sells it for Rs 1,100, down from Rs 1,500.</p>','[{\"question\":\"What sensor does the Meetion M915 use?\",\"answer\":\"An A704 optical sensor up to 2,400 DPI.\"},{\"question\":\"Does it have side buttons?\",\"answer\":\"Yes, forward and back buttons on the side.\"}]','[{\"label\":\"ONIN Infosys \\u2013 Meetion M915 Wired Backlight Gaming Mouse\",\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/onin.com.np\\/product\\/meetion-m915-wired-gaming-mouse.html\",\"accessed\":\"2026-11-23\"}]',NULL,'https://onin.com.np/product/meetion-m915-wired-gaming-mouse.html',0,'2026-11-22 18:15:00','2026-11-22 18:15:00'),(2515,88,42,'Meetion MK007 Mechanical Keyboard','meetion-mk007-mechanical-keyboard',NULL,'gadgets/2026/meetion-mk007-mechanical-keyboard.webp',NULL,NULL,4500.00,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,'available',NULL,0,0,'<p>If you want a real mechanical keyboard without spending big, the Meetion MK007 is a good start. It uses Outemu Blue switches, the clicky, tactile kind typists love, with full-key anti-ghosting so every press registers in games.</p>\n<p>The top plate is metal and the keycaps are double-shot, so the legends won\'t wear off. Switches are rated for over 50 million presses, it has 12 multimedia shortcuts, and it weighs about 910 g. ONIN Infosys sells it for Rs 4,500.</p>','[{\"question\":\"What switches does the Meetion MK007 use?\",\"answer\":\"Outemu Blue, which are clicky and tactile.\"},{\"question\":\"Is it a full-size keyboard?\",\"answer\":\"Yes, 104\\/105 keys with a number pad.\"}]','[{\"label\":\"ONIN Infosys \\u2013 Meetion MK007 mechanical keyboard\",\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/onin.com.np\\/product\\/meetion-mk007-mechanical-keyboard-price-nepal\",\"accessed\":\"2026-11-23\"}]',NULL,'https://onin.com.np/product/meetion-mk007-mechanical-keyboard-price-nepal',0,'2026-11-22 18:15:00','2026-11-22 18:15:00'),(2516,88,42,'Meetion Mini 4000 Wireless Keyboard and Mouse Combo','meetion-mini-4000-wireless-keyboard-and-mouse-combo',NULL,'gadgets/2026/meetion-mini-4000-wireless-keyboard-and-mouse-combo.webp',NULL,NULL,2500.00,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,'available',NULL,0,0,'<p>Meetion\'s Mini 4000 combo is built for small desks and travel. The 78-key keyboard drops the number pad to save space, the optical mouse has adjustable DPI, and both run off one 2.4GHz nano receiver.</p>\n<p>The whole set weighs about 255 g, so it fits in a laptop bag for working at a café or in a hostel. ONIN Infosys sells it for Rs 2,500 with a one-year warranty.</p>','[{\"question\":\"Does the Mini 4000 keyboard have a number pad?\",\"answer\":\"No, it is a compact 78\\/79-key layout.\"},{\"question\":\"Does it work with Mac?\",\"answer\":\"Yes, it works on Windows and macOS.\"}]','[{\"label\":\"ONIN Infosys \\u2013 Meetion Mini 4000 combo wireless keyboard and mouse\",\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/onin.com.np\\/product\\/meetion-mini-4000-wireless-keyboard-price-in-nepal\",\"accessed\":\"2026-11-23\"}]',NULL,'https://onin.com.np/product/meetion-mini-4000-wireless-keyboard-price-in-nepal',0,'2026-11-22 18:15:00','2026-11-22 18:15:00'),(2517,88,42,'Meetion K9320 RGB Gaming Keyboard','meetion-k9320-rgb-gaming-keyboard',NULL,'gadgets/2026/meetion-k9320-rgb-gaming-keyboard.webp',NULL,NULL,2500.00,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,'available',NULL,0,0,'<p>The Meetion K9320 gives you a mechanical-style feel and rainbow backlighting with adjustable brightness for the price of a regular keyboard. It\'s a full-size membrane board with anti-ghosting and twelve multimedia function keys.</p>\n<p>A water-resistant design survives the odd spilled tea, and the keycaps resist wear. ONIN Infosys sells it for Rs 2,500 with a one-year warranty.</p>','[{\"question\":\"Is the K9320 waterproof?\",\"answer\":\"Meetion describes it as water resistant, so it handles small spills but shouldn\'t be submerged.\"},{\"question\":\"Is it mechanical?\",\"answer\":\"It\'s a membrane board tuned for a tactile feel.\"}]','[{\"label\":\"ONIN Infosys \\u2013 Meetion gaming keyboard and RGB Backlit k9320\",\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/onin.com.np\\/product\\/meetion-gaming-keyboard-and-rgb-backlit-k9320\",\"accessed\":\"2026-11-23\"}]',NULL,'https://onin.com.np/product/meetion-gaming-keyboard-and-rgb-backlit-k9320',0,'2026-11-22 18:15:00','2026-11-22 18:15:00'),(2518,88,42,'Meetion M915 Gaming Mouse (Black and Red)','meetion-m915-gaming-mouse-black-and-red',NULL,'gadgets/2026/meetion-m915-gaming-mouse-black-and-red.webp',NULL,NULL,1400.00,1800.00,0,NULL,NULL,'available',NULL,0,0,'<p>This black and red version of Meetion\'s M915 has the same symmetric shape for right- or left-handed users, plus two side navigation buttons and on-the-fly DPI switching between 800, 1,200, 1,600 and 2,400.</p>\n<p>It uses an A704 optical sensor and weighs about 140 g on a 1.5-metre cable. ONIN Infosys sells it for Rs 1,400, down from Rs 1,800.</p>','[{\"question\":\"Can left-handed people use it?\",\"answer\":\"Yes, the shape is symmetric, though the side buttons are on the left.\"},{\"question\":\"What DPI steps does it have?\",\"answer\":\"800, 1,200, 1,600 and 2,400 DPI.\"}]','[{\"label\":\"ONIN Infosys \\u2013 Mouse Meetion M915 (Gaming Mouse)\",\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/onin.com.np\\/product\\/mouse-meetion-m915--gaming-mouse-\",\"accessed\":\"2026-11-23\"}]',NULL,'https://onin.com.np/product/mouse-meetion-m915--gaming-mouse-',0,'2026-11-22 18:15:00','2026-11-22 18:15:00'),(2519,88,42,'Meetion M371 Backlit Wired Mouse','meetion-m371-backlit-wired-mouse',NULL,'gadgets/2026/meetion-m371-backlit-wired-mouse.webp',NULL,NULL,650.00,1000.00,0,NULL,NULL,'available',NULL,0,0,'<p>The Meetion M371 adds a soft backlight and a DPI switch to a basic wired mouse for Rs 650 at ONIN Infosys (down from Rs 1,000). Three DPI steps, 800, 1,200 and 1,600, let you speed up the cursor on a large screen.</p>\n<p>It is symmetric for either hand, with a soft-touch finish and a 1.5-metre cable, and works on Windows and Mac.</p>','[{\"question\":\"Does the Meetion M371 have a DPI button?\",\"answer\":\"Yes, it switches between 800, 1,200 and 1,600 DPI.\"},{\"question\":\"Is it suitable for left-handed users?\",\"answer\":\"Yes, it has a symmetric design.\"}]','[{\"label\":\"ONIN Infosys \\u2013 USB Wired Backlit Mouse Meetion M371\",\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/onin.com.np\\/product\\/usb-wired-backlit-mouse-meetion-m371\",\"accessed\":\"2026-11-23\"}]',NULL,'https://onin.com.np/product/usb-wired-backlit-mouse-meetion-m371',0,'2026-11-22 18:15:00','2026-11-22 18:15:00'),(2520,89,42,'Rapoo M10 Plus Wireless Mouse','rapoo-m10-plus-wireless-mouse',NULL,'gadgets/2026/rapoo-m10-plus-wireless-mouse.webp',NULL,NULL,1300.00,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,'available',NULL,0,0,'<p>Rapoo\'s M10 Plus is a compact 2.4GHz wireless mouse that you can forget about once it\'s set up. Its 1,000 DPI sensor suits everyday work, and the battery is rated for up to 12 months.</p>\n<p>The small, comfortable shape suits a laptop bag as well as a desk. ONIN Infosys sells it for Rs 1,300.</p>','[{\"question\":\"How long does the battery last?\",\"answer\":\"Up to 12 months, by Rapoo\'s figure.\"},{\"question\":\"Is it Bluetooth?\",\"answer\":\"No, it uses a 2.4GHz USB receiver.\"}]','[{\"label\":\"ONIN Infosys \\u2013 RAPOO M10 Plus Wireless Mouse\",\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/onin.com.np\\/product\\/-rapoo-m10-plus-wireless-mouse\",\"accessed\":\"2026-11-23\"}]',NULL,'https://onin.com.np/product/-rapoo-m10-plus-wireless-mouse',1,'2026-11-22 18:15:00','2026-11-22 18:15:00'),(2521,89,42,'Rapoo M100 Silent Multi-Mode Mouse','rapoo-m100-silent-multi-mode-mouse',NULL,'gadgets/2026/rapoo-m100-silent-multi-mode-mouse.webp',NULL,NULL,1800.00,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,'available',NULL,0,0,'<p>The Rapoo M100 solves two common problems: noisy clicks in a quiet office and juggling devices. Its switches are near silent, and it connects by Bluetooth or a 2.4GHz receiver, so it can move between a laptop, a tablet and a desktop.</p>\n<p>It is small and light enough to carry around, and plug-and-play. ONIN Infosys sells it for Rs 1,800.</p>','[{\"question\":\"Can the Rapoo M100 connect to an iPad?\",\"answer\":\"Yes, over Bluetooth, on iPads that support mouse input.\"},{\"question\":\"Is it really silent?\",\"answer\":\"The clicks are designed to be near silent, which suits libraries and shared offices.\"}]','[{\"label\":\"ONIN Infosys \\u2013 RAPOO M100 Silent Multimode Bluetooth and Wireless Mouse\",\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/onin.com.np\\/product\\/rapoo-m100-silent-multimode-bluetooth-mouse-price-in-nepal\",\"accessed\":\"2026-11-23\"}]',NULL,'https://onin.com.np/product/rapoo-m100-silent-multimode-bluetooth-mouse-price-in-nepal',0,'2026-11-22 18:15:00','2026-11-22 18:15:00'),(2522,89,42,'Rapoo MT550W Multi-Mode Wireless Charging Mouse','rapoo-mt550w-multi-mode-wireless-charging-mouse',NULL,'gadgets/2026/rapoo-mt550w-multi-mode-wireless-charging-mouse.webp',NULL,NULL,4500.00,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,'available',NULL,0,0,'<p>Rapoo\'s MT550W is a multi-mode wireless mouse that charges wirelessly, so you never deal with batteries or cables. Set it on a Qi wireless charging pad and it tops up while you take a break.</p>\n<p>Its ergonomic shape suits long work days, and it connects to several devices. ONIN Infosys sells it for Rs 4,500. Pair it with the Belkin 15W pad if you don\'t already have one.</p>','[{\"question\":\"How do I charge the Rapoo MT550W?\",\"answer\":\"Place it on a Qi wireless charging pad.\"},{\"question\":\"Can it connect to more than one device?\",\"answer\":\"Yes, it is a multi-mode wireless mouse.\"}]','[{\"label\":\"ONIN Infosys \\u2013 RAPOO MT550W Multi-mode Wireless Charging Mouse\",\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/onin.com.np\\/product\\/rapoo-mt550w-multi-mode-wireless-charging-mouse\",\"accessed\":\"2026-11-23\"}]',NULL,'https://onin.com.np/product/rapoo-mt550w-multi-mode-wireless-charging-mouse',0,'2026-11-22 18:15:00','2026-11-22 18:15:00'),(2523,89,42,'Rapoo XK100 Bluetooth Keyboard with Tablet Stand','rapoo-xk100-bluetooth-keyboard-with-tablet-stand',NULL,'gadgets/2026/rapoo-xk100-bluetooth-keyboard-with-tablet-stand.webp',NULL,NULL,4500.00,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,'available',NULL,0,0,'<p>Turn a tablet or phone into a typing station with the Rapoo XK100. A built-in stand holds the screen up while you type, and the keyboard connects over Bluetooth to tablets, phones and computers.</p>\n<p>It runs on a rechargeable lithium battery, so no AAA cells to buy. ONIN Infosys sells it for Rs 4,500 with a one-year warranty, a good fit for students taking notes on an iPad or Android tablet.</p>','[{\"question\":\"Does the Rapoo XK100 work with an iPad?\",\"answer\":\"Yes, over Bluetooth, and the built-in stand holds the iPad upright.\"},{\"question\":\"Is the battery rechargeable?\",\"answer\":\"Yes, it uses a rechargeable lithium battery.\"}]','[{\"label\":\"ONIN Infosys \\u2013 RAPOO XK100 Bluetooth Keyboard with Tablet Stand\",\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/onin.com.np\\/product\\/rapoo-bluetooth-keyboard-price-in-nepal\",\"accessed\":\"2026-11-23\"}]',NULL,'https://onin.com.np/product/rapoo-bluetooth-keyboard-price-in-nepal',0,'2026-11-22 18:15:00','2026-11-22 18:15:00'),(2524,89,42,'Rapoo 3100P Wireless Mouse','rapoo-3100p-wireless-mouse',NULL,'gadgets/2026/rapoo-3100p-wireless-mouse.webp',NULL,NULL,2500.00,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,'available',NULL,0,0,'<p>The Rapoo 3100P is a colourful 2.4GHz wireless mouse in blue, green and white. Its 1,000 DPI sensor handles everyday tasks, and it is plug-and-play.</p>\n<p>Battery life is long and the body is compact enough for travel. ONIN Infosys sells it for Rs 2,500 with a one-year warranty.</p>','[{\"question\":\"What colours does the Rapoo 3100P come in?\",\"answer\":\"Blue, green and white.\"},{\"question\":\"What does \'5G\' mean on this mouse?\",\"answer\":\"It refers to Rapoo\'s 5.8GHz-band wireless connection, not mobile 5G.\"}]','[{\"label\":\"ONIN Infosys \\u2013 Rapoo 3100P 5g wireless mouse in Blue,Green and White\",\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/onin.com.np\\/product\\/rapoo-3100p-5g-wireless-mouse-price-in-nepal\",\"accessed\":\"2026-11-23\"}]',NULL,'https://onin.com.np/product/rapoo-3100p-5g-wireless-mouse-price-in-nepal',0,'2026-11-22 18:15:00','2026-11-22 18:15:00'),(2525,89,42,'Rapoo B30 Silent Wireless Mouse','rapoo-b30-silent-wireless-mouse',NULL,'gadgets/2026/rapoo-b30-silent-wireless-mouse.webp',NULL,NULL,900.00,1050.00,0,NULL,NULL,'available',NULL,0,0,'<p>For Rs 900, the Rapoo B30 is a lot of mouse: silent clicks, a 3,200 DPI sensor, five buttons, and a nano receiver that tucks into the mouse when you travel. Range is up to 10 metres.</p>\n<p>There\'s an on/off switch and an auto sleep mode to save battery, it works on Windows, macOS and Linux, and Rapoo backs it with a two-year replacement warranty. ONIN Infosys sells it at Rs 900, down from Rs 1,050.</p>','[{\"question\":\"Where is the receiver stored?\",\"answer\":\"In a slot on the mouse, so it doesn\'t get lost in a bag.\"},{\"question\":\"What warranty does it have?\",\"answer\":\"Two years of brand replacement warranty.\"}]','[{\"label\":\"ONIN Infosys \\u2013 Rapoo B30 silent wireless mouse\",\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/onin.com.np\\/product\\/rapoo-silent-wireless-mouse-price-in-nepal\",\"accessed\":\"2026-11-23\"}]',NULL,'https://onin.com.np/product/rapoo-silent-wireless-mouse-price-in-nepal',0,'2026-11-22 18:15:00','2026-11-22 18:15:00'),(2526,89,42,'Rapoo N100 Wired Optical Mouse','rapoo-n100-wired-optical-mouse',NULL,'gadgets/2026/rapoo-n100-wired-optical-mouse.webp',NULL,NULL,540.00,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,'available',NULL,0,0,'<p>The Rapoo N100 is a simple, dependable USB mouse with a 1,600 DPI sensor and a non-slip 2D scroll wheel. It needs no drivers, so it works the moment you plug it in on Windows or Mac.</p>\n<p>Compact and ergonomic, it is equally at home on an office desk or in a laptop bag. ONIN Infosys sells it for Rs 540.</p>','[{\"question\":\"What DPI is the Rapoo N100?\",\"answer\":\"1,600 DPI.\"},{\"question\":\"Does it work with a Mac?\",\"answer\":\"Yes, it is plug-and-play on Windows and macOS.\"}]','[{\"label\":\"ONIN Infosys \\u2013 Rapoo N100 Wired optical Mouse\",\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/onin.com.np\\/product\\/rapoo-n100-wired-optical-mouse-price-in-nepal\",\"accessed\":\"2026-11-23\"}]',NULL,'https://onin.com.np/product/rapoo-n100-wired-optical-mouse-price-in-nepal',0,'2026-11-22 18:15:00','2026-11-22 18:15:00'),(2527,89,42,'Rapoo N1200 Silent Wired Mouse','rapoo-n1200-silent-wired-mouse',NULL,'gadgets/2026/rapoo-n1200-silent-wired-mouse.webp',NULL,NULL,580.00,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,'available',NULL,0,0,'<p>The Rapoo N1200 is a quiet wired mouse for shared spaces. Its clicks are muted, the anti-slip grille scroll wheel glides smoothly, and its 1,000 DPI sensor gives steady, accurate tracking.</p>\n<p>It\'s plug-and-play on Windows and Mac. At Rs 580 at ONIN Infosys, it is an easy upgrade from the loud mouse in a busy office.</p>','[{\"question\":\"Is the Rapoo N1200 a silent mouse?\",\"answer\":\"Yes, it has a mute click design.\"},{\"question\":\"What DPI does it use?\",\"answer\":\"1,000 DPI.\"}]','[{\"label\":\"ONIN Infosys \\u2013 Rapoo N1200 Wired Mouse\",\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/onin.com.np\\/product\\/rapoo-n1200-wired-mouse\",\"accessed\":\"2026-11-23\"}]',NULL,'https://onin.com.np/product/rapoo-n1200-wired-mouse',0,'2026-11-22 18:15:00','2026-11-22 18:15:00'),(2528,89,42,'Rapoo NK1800 Wired Keyboard and Mouse Combo','rapoo-nk1800-wired-keyboard-and-mouse-combo',NULL,'gadgets/2026/rapoo-nk1800-wired-keyboard-and-mouse-combo.webp',NULL,NULL,1000.00,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,'available',NULL,0,0,'<p>Rapoo\'s NK1800 is a low-cost wired keyboard and mouse set. The full-size keyboard has a numeric keypad, laser-etched keycaps that won\'t rub off, and a sealed anti-oxidation membrane that resists spills.</p>\n<p>Both connect over USB and work on almost any computer. ONIN Infosys sells the set for Rs 1,000 with a one-year warranty.</p>','[{\"question\":\"Is the Rapoo NK1800 spill resistant?\",\"answer\":\"Yes, it has a spill-resistant design with a sealed membrane.\"},{\"question\":\"Is it wired?\",\"answer\":\"Yes, both keyboard and mouse connect by USB.\"}]','[{\"label\":\"ONIN Infosys \\u2013 Rapoo NK1800 combo keyboad\",\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/onin.com.np\\/product\\/rapoo-nk1800-combo-keyboad\",\"accessed\":\"2026-11-23\"}]',NULL,'https://onin.com.np/product/rapoo-nk1800-combo-keyboad',0,'2026-11-22 18:15:00','2026-11-22 18:15:00'),(2529,89,42,'Rapoo V16 RGB Gaming Mouse','rapoo-v16-rgb-gaming-mouse',NULL,'gadgets/2026/rapoo-v16-rgb-gaming-mouse.webp',NULL,NULL,1800.00,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,'available',NULL,0,0,'<p>Rapoo\'s V16 is an ambidextrous wired gaming mouse with an adjustable sensor up to 12,800 DPI and an RGB light system. It has five buttons, and the switches are rated for 5 million clicks.</p>\n<p>It is shaped to fill the palm, it\'s plug-and-play, and Rapoo covers it with a two-year warranty. ONIN Infosys sells it for Rs 1,800.</p>','[{\"question\":\"What is the maximum DPI of the Rapoo V16?\",\"answer\":\"12,800 DPI.\"},{\"question\":\"Is it good for left-handed players?\",\"answer\":\"Yes, it has an ambidextrous shape.\"}]','[{\"label\":\"ONIN Infosys \\u2013 Rapoo V16 Wired Optical Gaming Mouse\",\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/onin.com.np\\/product\\/rapoo-v16-gaming-mouse-price-in-nepal\",\"accessed\":\"2026-11-23\"}]',NULL,'https://onin.com.np/product/rapoo-v16-gaming-mouse-price-in-nepal',0,'2026-11-22 18:15:00','2026-11-22 18:15:00'),(2530,89,42,'Rapoo X120 Pro Wired Keyboard and Mouse Combo','rapoo-x120-pro-wired-keyboard-and-mouse-combo',NULL,'gadgets/2026/rapoo-x120-pro-wired-keyboard-and-mouse-combo.webp',NULL,NULL,1650.00,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,'available',NULL,0,0,'<p>The Rapoo X120 Pro pairs a spill-resistant full-size keyboard with a 1,600 DPI optical mouse. Laser-carved keycaps and a sealed anti-oxidation membrane help it last through years of daily typing.</p>\n<p>Both plug in over USB and work on Windows and Mac. At Rs 1,650 from ONIN Infosys with a one-year warranty, it\'s a step up from the NK1800 with a better mouse.</p>','[{\"question\":\"What DPI is the X120 Pro mouse?\",\"answer\":\"1,600 DPI.\"},{\"question\":\"Is the keyboard full size?\",\"answer\":\"Yes, with a numeric keypad.\"}]','[{\"label\":\"ONIN Infosys \\u2013 Rapoo X120 Pro Combo Wired Desktop keyboard and mouse\",\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/onin.com.np\\/product\\/rapoo-x120-pro-combo-wired-desktop-keyboard-and-mouse-price-in-nepal\",\"accessed\":\"2026-11-23\"}]',NULL,'https://onin.com.np/product/rapoo-x120-pro-combo-wired-desktop-keyboard-and-mouse-price-in-nepal',0,'2026-11-22 18:15:00','2026-11-22 18:15:00'),(2531,93,42,'UGEE CS06 Electronic Signature Pad','ugee-cs06-electronic-signature-pad',NULL,'gadgets/2026/ugee-cs06-electronic-signature-pad.webp',NULL,NULL,7999.00,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,'available',NULL,0,0,'<p>Banks, clinics and offices that still print forms just to collect a signature can sign digitally instead with the UGEE CS06. It has a 6 x 4-inch active area and a battery-free P57 pen with 8,192 pressure levels, so signatures look natural rather than jagged.</p>\n<p>With 5,080 LPI resolution and a 250 RPS report rate, strokes follow the pen closely. UGEE\'s toolkit lets you sign straight into MS Office, PDF and Adobe files on Windows 7 or later and Linux. ONIN Infosys sells it for Rs 7,999 including VAT, with a one-year warranty on the pad (the pen and cable are excluded).</p>','[{\"question\":\"Can I sign PDF and Word documents with the UGEE CS06?\",\"answer\":\"Yes, UGEE\'s software toolkit lets you sign directly in MS Office, PDF and Adobe applications on Windows.\"},{\"question\":\"Does the pen need charging?\",\"answer\":\"No, the P57 pen is battery-free.\"}]','[{\"label\":\"ONIN Infosys \\u2013 UGEE CS06 Electronic Signature Pad (6x4) - P57 Battery-Free Pen | 8192 Pressure | ONIN Rs.\",\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/onin.com.np\\/product\\/ugee-cs06-signature-pad-6x4-nepal\",\"accessed\":\"2026-11-23\"}]',NULL,'https://onin.com.np/product/ugee-cs06-signature-pad-6x4-nepal',0,'2026-11-22 18:15:00','2026-11-22 18:15:00'),(2532,93,42,'UGEE UG05 LCD Signature Pad','ugee-ug05-lcd-signature-pad',NULL,'gadgets/2026/ugee-ug05-lcd-signature-pad.webp',NULL,NULL,29450.00,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,'available',NULL,0,0,'<p>The UGEE UG05 goes a step beyond a plain signature pad: it has a 5-inch colour LCD (800 x 480), so the person signing sees their signature, and any on-screen prompts, right under the pen. That matters at counters where customers sign receipts, consent forms or delivery slips.</p>\n<p>It uses a battery-free PH02 stylus with 1,024 pressure levels and connects to Windows over mini USB. ONIN Infosys sells it for Rs 29,450 including VAT, with a one-year warranty on the pad itself.</p>','[{\"question\":\"Does the UGEE UG05 have a screen?\",\"answer\":\"Yes, a 5-inch colour LCD at 800 x 480, so signers can see what they write.\"},{\"question\":\"Which systems does it support?\",\"answer\":\"Windows.\"}]','[{\"label\":\"ONIN Infosys \\u2013 UGEE UG05 Electronic LED Signature Pad\",\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/onin.com.np\\/product\\/ugee-ug05-signature-pad-nepal\",\"accessed\":\"2026-11-23\"}]',NULL,'https://onin.com.np/product/ugee-ug05-signature-pad-nepal',0,'2026-11-22 18:15:00','2026-11-22 18:15:00'),(2533,94,42,'XP-PEN Artist 12 (2nd Gen) Pen Display','xp-pen-artist-12-2nd-gen-pen-display',NULL,'gadgets/2026/xp-pen-artist-12-2nd-gen-pen-display.webp',NULL,NULL,48450.00,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,'available',NULL,0,0,'<p>Drawing directly on the screen is far more natural than looking up at a monitor while your hand moves on a tablet, and the XP-PEN Artist 12 (2nd Gen) makes that affordable. Its 11.9-inch Full HD laminated IPS display covers about 127% of sRGB and 94% of Adobe RGB, which is plenty for illustration and photo touch-ups.</p>\n<p>The X3 Elite battery-free stylus offers 8,192 pressure levels and 60-degree tilt, and eight express keys sit on the side for brush, undo and zoom. At 12 mm thin it\'s easy to tuck into a bag. ONIN Infosys sells it for Rs 48,450 including VAT, with a one-year warranty.</p>','[{\"question\":\"Do I need a computer to use the XP-PEN Artist 12?\",\"answer\":\"Yes. It is a pen display that connects to a computer (and some Android devices) rather than a standalone tablet.\"},{\"question\":\"Is the screen good for colour work?\",\"answer\":\"It covers about 127% of sRGB and 94% of Adobe RGB, which is ample for most illustration.\"}]','[{\"label\":\"ONIN Infosys \\u2013 XP-PEN Artist 12 (2nd Gen) Pen Display - 11.9\\\" FHD (263 \\u00d7 148 mm)\",\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/onin.com.np\\/product\\/xp-pen-artist-12-2nd-gen-price-nepal\",\"accessed\":\"2026-11-23\"}]',NULL,'https://onin.com.np/product/xp-pen-artist-12-2nd-gen-price-nepal',0,'2026-11-22 18:15:00','2026-11-22 18:15:00'),(2534,94,42,'XP-PEN Artist 15.6 Pro V2 Pen Display','xp-pen-artist-15-6-pro-v2-pen-display',NULL,'gadgets/2026/xp-pen-artist-15-6-pro-v2-pen-display.webp',NULL,NULL,66500.00,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,'available',NULL,0,0,'<p>The Artist 15.6 Pro V2 is XP-PEN\'s pen display for people who draw for a living. Its 15.4-inch Full HD laminated IPS screen covers 99% of sRGB and 96% of both Adobe RGB and Display P3, and the X3 Pro stylus reads 16,384 pressure levels with 60-degree tilt.</p>\n<p>Accuracy is within about 0.4 mm, with a 5,080 LPI resolution and a report rate of at least 200 RPS, so lines land where you expect. It weighs around 1.5 kg and is 12.9 mm thick. ONIN Infosys sells it for Rs 66,500 including VAT, with a one-year warranty.</p>','[{\"question\":\"Artist 12 or Artist 15.6 Pro V2?\",\"answer\":\"The 15.6 Pro V2 has a larger screen, wider colour coverage and a 16K-level pen. The Artist 12 is smaller and cheaper, and fine for hobbyists and students.\"},{\"question\":\"How many pressure levels does the pen have?\",\"answer\":\"16,384 with the X3 Pro stylus.\"}]','[{\"label\":\"ONIN Infosys \\u2013 XP-PEN Artist 15.6 Pro V2 \\u2013 15.4\\\" Pen Display (X3 Pro, 16K)\",\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/onin.com.np\\/product\\/xp-pen-artist-15-6-pro-v2-price-nepal\",\"accessed\":\"2026-11-23\"}]',NULL,'https://onin.com.np/product/xp-pen-artist-15-6-pro-v2-price-nepal',0,'2026-11-22 18:15:00','2026-11-22 18:15:00'),(2535,94,42,'XP-PEN Deco 01 V3 Graphics Tablet','xp-pen-deco-01-v3-graphics-tablet',NULL,'gadgets/2026/xp-pen-deco-01-v3-graphics-tablet.webp',NULL,NULL,11999.00,12800.00,0,NULL,NULL,'available',NULL,0,0,'<p>The Deco 01 V3 gives you a big 10 x 6.25-inch drawing area in a tablet only 8 mm thin. Its battery-free P05 pen reads 16,384 pressure levels with 60-degree tilt, a spec that used to belong to much pricier tablets.</p>\n<p>Eight express keys handle shortcuts, it connects over USB-C, and it works with Windows, macOS, Linux and Android 10 or later. ONIN Infosys sells it for Rs 11,999, down from Rs 12,800, with a one-year warranty.</p>','[{\"question\":\"Does the XP-PEN Deco 01 V3 work with Android phones?\",\"answer\":\"Yes, it supports Android 10 or later, as well as Windows, macOS and Linux.\"},{\"question\":\"Does the pen need charging?\",\"answer\":\"No, the P05 pen is battery-free.\"}]','[{\"label\":\"ONIN Infosys \\u2013 XP-PEN Deco 01 V3 Graphics Tablet (10 x 6.25\\u2033, 16K Pressure, USB-C)\",\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/onin.com.np\\/product\\/xp-pen-deco-01-v3-price-nepal\",\"accessed\":\"2026-11-23\"}]',NULL,'https://onin.com.np/product/xp-pen-deco-01-v3-price-nepal',0,'2026-11-22 18:15:00','2026-11-22 18:15:00'),(2536,94,42,'XP-PEN Deco Pro Medium Graphics Tablet','xp-pen-deco-pro-medium-graphics-tablet',NULL,'gadgets/2026/xp-pen-deco-pro-medium-graphics-tablet.webp',NULL,NULL,25999.00,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,'available',NULL,0,0,'<p>The Deco Pro Medium is for digital artists who want quick controls without a keyboard. Next to its 11 x 6-inch drawing area sit eight express keys, a mechanical wheel and a virtual touch wheel for zooming, scrolling and brush sizes.</p>\n<p>The battery-free PA1 pen has 8,192 pressure levels and 60-degree tilt, and the tablet connects over USB-C to Windows or Mac. ONIN Infosys sells it for Rs 25,999 including VAT, with a one-year warranty.</p>','[{\"question\":\"What is the virtual wheel on the Deco Pro?\",\"answer\":\"A touch-sensitive ring inside the mechanical wheel, used for zoom, scroll or brush size.\"},{\"question\":\"How big is the drawing area?\",\"answer\":\"11 x 6 inches.\"}]','[{\"label\":\"ONIN Infosys \\u2013 XP-PEN Deco Pro Medium Graphics Tablet (11 \\u00d7 6\\u2033 | 8192 Pressure | Dial & Virtual Wheel)\",\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/onin.com.np\\/product\\/xp-pen-deco-pro-medium-price-nepal\",\"accessed\":\"2026-11-23\"}]',NULL,'https://onin.com.np/product/xp-pen-deco-pro-medium-price-nepal',0,'2026-11-22 18:15:00','2026-11-22 18:15:00'),(2537,94,42,'XP-PEN Star 03 V2 Graphics Tablet','xp-pen-star-03-v2-graphics-tablet',NULL,'gadgets/2026/xp-pen-star-03-v2-graphics-tablet.webp',NULL,NULL,10390.00,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,'available',NULL,0,0,'<p>The XP-PEN Star 03 V2 gives you a roomy 10.2 x 6.7-inch drawing area for sketching and signing, while staying affordable. Its battery-free P01 pen offers 8,192 pressure levels and an accuracy of about 0.01 inches.</p>\n<p>Eight programmable keys cover brush size, undo and zoom, and the 266 RPS report rate keeps strokes smooth. It works on Windows, macOS, Linux and Android. ONIN Infosys sells it for Rs 10,390 with a one-year warranty.</p>','[{\"question\":\"Is the Star 03 V2 good for beginners?\",\"answer\":\"Yes. It has a large drawing area and a battery-free pen at a low price, which suits students and beginners.\"},{\"question\":\"Does it support Android?\",\"answer\":\"Yes, as well as Windows, macOS and Linux.\"}]','[{\"label\":\"ONIN Infosys \\u2013 XP-PEN Star 03 V2 |Pressure 8192 levels| Reading Height 10 mm| Graphics Drawing Tablet\",\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/onin.com.np\\/product\\/xp-pen-star-03-v2-price-nepal\",\"accessed\":\"2026-11-23\"}]',NULL,'https://onin.com.np/product/xp-pen-star-03-v2-price-nepal',0,'2026-11-22 18:15:00','2026-11-22 18:15:00'),(2538,94,42,'XP-PEN Star G640 Graphics Tablet','xp-pen-star-g640-graphics-tablet',NULL,'gadgets/2026/xp-pen-star-g640-graphics-tablet.webp',NULL,NULL,6739.00,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,'available',NULL,0,0,'<p>The XP-PEN Star G640 is the classic first tablet for drawing, photo editing and online teaching. Its 6 x 4-inch area is enough for a full hand movement, and the battery-free pen gives 8,192 pressure levels.</p>\n<p>The tablet is very thin, and the pen is accurate to about 0.01 inches with a 10 mm reading height. At Rs 6,739 from ONIN Infosys, with a one-year warranty, it is the cheapest XP-PEN in the range.</p>','[{\"question\":\"Is the XP-PEN G640 good for online teaching?\",\"answer\":\"Yes. Teachers often use it to write and draw on slides and whiteboard apps during classes.\"},{\"question\":\"How big is the drawing area?\",\"answer\":\"6 x 4 inches.\"}]','[{\"label\":\"ONIN Infosys \\u2013 XP-PEN Star G640 6\\u00d74 Graphic Tablet - Battery-Free Pen\",\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/onin.com.np\\/product\\/xp-pen-star-g640-6x4-tablet-nepal\",\"accessed\":\"2026-11-23\"}]',NULL,'https://onin.com.np/product/xp-pen-star-g640-6x4-tablet-nepal',0,'2026-11-22 18:15:00','2026-11-22 18:15:00'),(2539,94,42,'XP-PEN Star G960S Plus Graphics Tablet','xp-pen-star-g960s-plus-graphics-tablet',NULL,'gadgets/2026/xp-pen-star-g960s-plus-graphics-tablet.webp',NULL,NULL,9850.00,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,'available',NULL,0,0,'<p>The XP-PEN Star G960S Plus stretches the drawing area to 9 x 6 inches, adds four express keys, and pairs it with a battery-free PH2 pen that has a digital eraser on the back. The pen reads 8,192 pressure levels and supports 60-degree tilt.</p>\n<p>It connects over USB-C and works with Photoshop, Clip Studio, Illustrator, Krita and even OneNote or PowerPoint on Windows, macOS, Linux and Android. ONIN Infosys sells it for Rs 9,850 with a one-year warranty.</p>','[{\"question\":\"Does the G960S Plus pen have an eraser?\",\"answer\":\"Yes, a digital eraser on the back end of the PH2 pen.\"},{\"question\":\"Which apps does it work with?\",\"answer\":\"Photoshop, Clip Studio, Illustrator, Krita, MediBang, OneNote, Word and PowerPoint, among others.\"}]','[{\"label\":\"ONIN Infosys \\u2013 XP-PEN Star G960S Plus (9x6 Inch Active Area | 8192 Pressure Sensitivity | 4 Express Keys \",\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/onin.com.np\\/product\\/xp-pen-star-g960s-plus-9x6-nepal\",\"accessed\":\"2026-11-23\"}]',NULL,'https://onin.com.np/product/xp-pen-star-g960s-plus-9x6-nepal',0,'2026-11-22 18:15:00','2026-11-22 18:15:00'),(2540,94,42,'XP-PEN Deco Pro LW (2nd Gen) Wireless Graphics Tablet','xp-pen-deco-pro-lw-2nd-gen-wireless-graphics-tablet',NULL,'gadgets/2026/xp-pen-deco-pro-lw-2nd-gen-wireless-graphics-tablet.webp',NULL,NULL,34499.00,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,'available',NULL,0,0,'<p>The Deco Pro LW (2nd Gen) is XP-PEN\'s top non-screen tablet, and the wireless part is the headline. It connects over Bluetooth 5.0, a 2.4GHz dongle or USB-C, and can pair with two devices and switch between them with one click.</p>\n<p>The 11 x 7-inch area is large enough for professional work, the X3 Pro pen reads 16,384 pressure levels with a built-in eraser, and a separate wireless key-dial with ten custom keys can sit wherever your free hand rests. The 3,030 mAh battery lasts at least 10 hours. ONIN Infosys sells it for Rs 34,499.</p>','[{\"question\":\"Can the Deco Pro LW connect wirelessly?\",\"answer\":\"Yes, over Bluetooth 5.0 or a 2.4GHz receiver, and also by USB-C cable.\"},{\"question\":\"How long does the battery last?\",\"answer\":\"At least 10 hours from its 3,030 mAh battery.\"}]','[{\"label\":\"ONIN Infosys \\u2013 XPPen Deco Pro LW (2nd Gen) Wireless Graphics Tablet | 11 inch Drawing Tablet\",\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/onin.com.np\\/product\\/xppen-deco-pro-lw-2nd-gen-price-nepal\",\"accessed\":\"2026-11-23\"}]',NULL,'https://onin.com.np/product/xppen-deco-pro-lw-2nd-gen-price-nepal',0,'2026-11-22 18:15:00','2026-11-22 18:15:00'),(2541,95,44,'Brother DCP-T230 Ink Tank Printer','brother-dcp-t230-ink-tank-printer',NULL,'gadgets/2026/brother-dcp-t230-ink-tank-printer.webp',NULL,NULL,26499.00,27999.00,0,NULL,NULL,'available',NULL,0,0,'<p>For homes and small offices that print a lot of homework, invoices or forms, an ink tank keeps running costs low, and the Brother DCP-T230 is one of the most economical. It prints, scans and copies, and its tanks are rated for up to 7,500 black and 5,000 colour pages.</p>\n<p>Speeds reach 16 images per minute in black and 9 in colour, and the closed 150-sheet front tray keeps paper free of dust. It connects by USB only, with no Wi-Fi. ONIN Infosys sells it for Rs 26,499, down from Rs 27,999.</p>','[{\"question\":\"Does the Brother DCP-T230 have Wi-Fi?\",\"answer\":\"No, it connects over USB. The DCP-T430W adds Wi-Fi for the same price.\"},{\"question\":\"How many pages does a set of ink print?\",\"answer\":\"Up to 7,500 black pages and 5,000 colour pages.\"}]','[{\"label\":\"ONIN Infosys \\u2013 Brother DCP-T230 Multifunction Ink Tank Printer | Print, Scan, Copy\",\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/onin.com.np\\/product\\/brother-dcp-t230-price-nepal\",\"accessed\":\"2026-11-23\"}]',NULL,'https://onin.com.np/product/brother-dcp-t230-price-nepal',0,'2026-11-22 18:15:00','2026-11-22 18:15:00'),(2542,95,44,'Brother DCP-T430W Wireless Ink Tank Printer','brother-dcp-t430w-wireless-ink-tank-printer',NULL,'gadgets/2026/brother-dcp-t430w-wireless-ink-tank-printer.webp',NULL,NULL,26499.00,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,'available',NULL,0,0,'<p>The Brother DCP-T430W prints, scans and copies, and adds what the T230 lacks: Wi-Fi and Wi-Fi Direct. With the Brother Mobile Connect app you can print straight from a phone, even without a router.</p>\n<p>The front ink tanks deliver very high page yields, print speeds are up to 16 ipm in black and 9 in colour (faster in eco mode), and the first page comes out in about 6.2 seconds. ONIN Infosys sells it for Rs 26,499, the same price as the USB-only T230.</p>','[{\"question\":\"Can I print from my phone with the DCP-T430W?\",\"answer\":\"Yes, using the Brother Mobile Connect app over Wi-Fi or Wi-Fi Direct.\"},{\"question\":\"DCP-T230 or DCP-T430W?\",\"answer\":\"At the same price, the T430W adds wireless printing, so it is the better buy unless you only print from one desktop.\"}]','[{\"label\":\"ONIN Infosys \\u2013 Brother DCP-T430W 3-in-1 Wireless Color Ink Tank Printer\",\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/onin.com.np\\/product\\/brother-dcp-t430w-ink-tank-printer-price-nepal\",\"accessed\":\"2026-11-23\"}]',NULL,'https://onin.com.np/product/brother-dcp-t430w-ink-tank-printer-price-nepal',2,'2026-11-22 18:15:00','2026-11-22 18:15:00'),(2543,96,44,'Canon imageCLASS MF3010 Laser Printer','canon-imageclass-mf3010-laser-printer',NULL,'gadgets/2026/canon-imageclass-mf3010-laser-printer.webp',NULL,NULL,32499.00,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,'available',NULL,0,0,'<p>Canon\'s MF3010 is a compact black-and-white laser printer that also scans and copies, a long-time favourite in small offices. It prints up to 18 pages per minute with sharp text, and the flatbed scanner works in colour.</p>\n<p>It uses the easy-to-swap Canon 925 cartridge (included) and connects by USB 2.0, without Wi-Fi. ONIN Infosys sells it for Rs 32,499 with a one-year warranty.</p>','[{\"question\":\"Does the Canon MF3010 print in colour?\",\"answer\":\"No, it prints in black and white only, though its scanner scans in colour.\"},{\"question\":\"Does it support Wi-Fi?\",\"answer\":\"No, it connects with a USB 2.0 cable.\"}]','[{\"label\":\"ONIN Infosys \\u2013 Canon MF 3010 Digital Multifunctional Laser Printer, Black, Standard | 1 year Warranty\",\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/onin.com.np\\/product\\/canon-mf-3010-digital-multifunctional-laser-printer--black--standard---1-year-warranty\",\"accessed\":\"2026-11-23\"}]',NULL,'https://onin.com.np/product/canon-mf-3010-digital-multifunctional-laser-printer--black--standard---1-year-warranty',0,'2026-11-22 18:15:00','2026-11-22 18:15:00'),(2544,96,44,'Canon PIXMA G2010 Ink Tank Printer','canon-pixma-g2010-ink-tank-printer',NULL,'gadgets/2026/canon-pixma-g2010-ink-tank-printer.webp',NULL,NULL,20999.00,22499.00,0,NULL,NULL,'available',NULL,0,0,'<p>Canon\'s PIXMA G2010 is an all-in-one ink tank printer for homes and small offices that want colour without expensive cartridges. It prints, scans and copies, and handles up to 7,000 pages a month.</p>\n<p>It prints at about 8.8 pages per minute in black and 5 in colour, and a borderless photo takes around 60 seconds. ONIN Infosys sells it for Rs 20,999, down from Rs 22,499, with a 12-month warranty.</p>','[{\"question\":\"Does the Canon G2010 print photos?\",\"answer\":\"Yes, including borderless photos, at about 60 seconds each.\"},{\"question\":\"Is it wireless?\",\"answer\":\"No. For Wi-Fi, look at the PIXMA G3010.\"}]','[{\"label\":\"ONIN Infosys \\u2013 Canon Pixma G2010 Color All-in-One Ink Tank High Volume Printing Printer LCD Diplay\",\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/onin.com.np\\/product\\/canon-g2010-color-printer-price-in-nepal\",\"accessed\":\"2026-11-23\"}]',NULL,'https://onin.com.np/product/canon-g2010-color-printer-price-in-nepal',0,'2026-11-22 18:15:00','2026-11-22 18:15:00'),(2545,96,44,'Canon PIXMA G3010 Wireless Ink Tank Printer','canon-pixma-g3010-wireless-ink-tank-printer',NULL,'gadgets/2026/canon-pixma-g3010-wireless-ink-tank-printer.webp',NULL,NULL,25499.00,26499.00,0,NULL,NULL,'available',NULL,0,0,'<p>The Canon PIXMA G3010 is the G2010 with wireless printing, which is worth the extra money in a house with several phones and laptops. It prints, scans and copies in colour, and the spill-resistant ink bottles make refilling clean.</p>\n<p>It prints at about 8.8 pages per minute in black and 5 in colour, with borderless photos in around 60 seconds. ONIN Infosys sells it for Rs 25,499, down from Rs 26,499, with a 12-month warranty.</p>','[{\"question\":\"Can I print from my phone with the Canon G3010?\",\"answer\":\"Yes, it is a wireless printer, so phones and laptops on the same network can print to it.\"},{\"question\":\"G2010 or G3010?\",\"answer\":\"The G3010 adds Wi-Fi for Rs 4,500 more. If several people print from phones or laptops, it is worth it.\"}]','[{\"label\":\"ONIN Infosys \\u2013 Canon Pixma G3010 Wireless color All-in-one Ink Tank Printer\",\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/onin.com.np\\/product\\/canon-pixma-g3010-wireless-printer-price-in-nepal\",\"accessed\":\"2026-11-23\"}]',NULL,'https://onin.com.np/product/canon-pixma-g3010-wireless-printer-price-in-nepal',0,'2026-11-22 18:15:00','2026-11-22 18:15:00'),(2546,97,44,'Epson EcoTank L3210 All-in-One Printer','epson-ecotank-l3210-all-in-one-printer',NULL,'gadgets/2026/epson-ecotank-l3210-all-in-one-printer.webp',NULL,NULL,23000.00,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,'available',NULL,0,0,'<p>The Epson EcoTank L3210 is one of the most common ink tank printers in Nepali homes and shops, and its integrated tank design is why. The tanks sit inside the body, refills are spill-free, and the printer prints, scans and copies.</p>\n<p>It prints borderless photos up to 4R, holds 30 A4 sheets, and works with Windows 10 and 11 and macOS. ONIN Infosys sells it for Rs 23,000 with a 12-month warranty.</p>','[{\"question\":\"Does the Epson L3210 print in colour?\",\"answer\":\"Yes, it is a colour ink tank printer, including borderless photos up to 4R.\"},{\"question\":\"Does it have Wi-Fi?\",\"answer\":\"No, it connects by USB.\"}]','[{\"label\":\"ONIN Infosys \\u2013 Epson EcoTank L3210 Ink Tank All-in-One Printer\",\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/onin.com.np\\/product\\/epson-ecotank-l3210-printer-price-nepal\",\"accessed\":\"2026-11-23\"}]',NULL,'https://onin.com.np/product/epson-ecotank-l3210-printer-price-nepal',0,'2026-11-22 18:15:00','2026-11-22 18:15:00'),(2547,98,45,'BenQ MX560C Business Projector','benq-mx560c-business-projector',NULL,'gadgets/2026/benq-mx560c-business-projector.webp',NULL,NULL,59399.00,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,'available',NULL,0,0,'<p>With 4,000 ANSI lumens, the BenQ MX560C stays readable in classrooms and meeting rooms where you can\'t fully dim the lights. Its native XGA (1024 x 768) resolution and 4:3 shape suit presentations and spreadsheets.</p>\n<p>Contrast is rated at 20,000:1, the lamp lasts up to 15,000 hours in LampSave mode, and auto vertical keystone corrects up to 40 degrees. It projects 30 to 300 inches (about 100 inches from 3.98 m), has a 10W speaker, and takes two HDMI inputs, VGA and RS232. ONIN Infosys sells it for Rs 59,399.</p>','[{\"question\":\"Is the BenQ MX560C bright enough for a classroom?\",\"answer\":\"Yes. At 4,000 ANSI lumens it is designed for lit rooms.\"},{\"question\":\"How long does the lamp last?\",\"answer\":\"Up to 15,000 hours in LampSave mode, 6,000 hours in normal mode.\"}]','[{\"label\":\"ONIN Infosys \\u2013 BenQ MX560C Business Projector \\u2013 4000 Lumens XGA Data Projector\",\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/onin.com.np\\/product\\/benq-mx560c-4000-lumens-xga-projector-price-nepal\",\"accessed\":\"2026-11-23\"}]',NULL,'https://onin.com.np/product/benq-mx560c-4000-lumens-xga-projector-price-nepal',0,'2026-11-22 18:15:00','2026-11-22 18:15:00'),(2548,97,45,'Epson EB-W53 3LCD Projector','epson-eb-w53-3lcd-projector',NULL,'gadgets/2026/epson-eb-w53-3lcd-projector.webp',NULL,NULL,53999.00,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,'available',NULL,0,0,'<p>Epson\'s EB-W53 uses 3LCD technology, which means colours are as bright as whites and there is no rainbow effect, a real difference for colourful slides and videos. It puts out 4,000 lumens of both colour and white light.</p>\n<p>Its native WXGA (1280 x 800) resolution and 16:10 shape match modern laptops, so slides fill the screen without black bars, and contrast is rated at 16,000:1. ONIN Infosys sells it for Rs 53,999 with a two-year warranty.</p>','[{\"question\":\"What does 3LCD mean on the Epson EB-W53?\",\"answer\":\"Three separate LCD panels for red, green and blue, which keeps colour brightness equal to white brightness and avoids the rainbow effect some projectors show.\"},{\"question\":\"What warranty does it come with?\",\"answer\":\"Two years, according to ONIN Infosys.\"}]','[{\"label\":\"ONIN Infosys \\u2013 Epson EB-W53 WXGA 4000 Lumens 3LCD High-Brightness Projector | 2 years warranty\",\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/onin.com.np\\/product\\/epson-eb-w53-wxga-3lcd-projector-price-nepal\",\"accessed\":\"2026-11-23\"}]',NULL,'https://onin.com.np/product/epson-eb-w53-wxga-3lcd-projector-price-nepal',0,'2026-11-22 18:15:00','2026-11-22 18:15:00'),(2549,99,49,'Hikvision DS-D5A65RB/B3 65-inch Interactive Flat Panel','hikvision-ds-d5a65rb-b3-65-inch-interactive-flat-panel',NULL,'gadgets/2026/hikvision-ds-d5a65rb-b3-65-inch-interactive-flat-panel.webp',NULL,NULL,189999.00,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,'available',NULL,0,0,'<p>The Hikvision DS-D5A65RB/B3 is a 65-inch 4K interactive panel for classrooms and meeting rooms that replaces a whiteboard, a projector and a video-call setup in one. It runs Android 14 with 8 GB of RAM, and this package adds a slot-in Intel Core Windows OPS PC with a 512 GB SSD.</p>\n<p>The zero-lamination display sits behind 9H anti-glare tempered glass and supports 50 touch points, so several students can write at once. Built-in AI video conferencing hardware makes remote classes straightforward. ONIN Infosys sells it for Rs 1,89,999.</p>','[{\"question\":\"Does the Hikvision 65-inch panel run Windows?\",\"answer\":\"This package includes a slot-in Intel Core Windows OPS PC with a 512 GB SSD, alongside the built-in Android 14 system.\"},{\"question\":\"How many people can write on it at once?\",\"answer\":\"It supports 50 simultaneous touch points.\"}]','[{\"label\":\"ONIN Infosys \\u2013 Hikvision DS-D5A65RB\\/B3 65-Inch 4K UHD Interactive Flat Panel Smart Board With 8GB RAM 512\",\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/onin.com.np\\/product\\/hikvision-ds-d5a65rb-b3-65-inch-4k-interactive-smart-board-price-nepal\",\"accessed\":\"2026-11-23\"}]',NULL,'https://onin.com.np/product/hikvision-ds-d5a65rb-b3-65-inch-4k-interactive-smart-board-price-nepal',0,'2026-11-22 18:15:00','2026-11-22 18:15:00'),(2550,99,49,'Hikvision DS-D5A75RB/B3 75-inch Interactive Flat Panel','hikvision-ds-d5a75rb-b3-75-inch-interactive-flat-panel',NULL,'gadgets/2026/hikvision-ds-d5a75rb-b3-75-inch-interactive-flat-panel.webp',NULL,NULL,219999.00,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,'available',NULL,0,0,'<p>For larger classrooms and boardrooms, Hikvision\'s 75-inch DS-D5A75RB/B3 gives the back rows a clear view. It is a 4K UHD panel running Android 14 with official Google EDLA certification, so Google Play and Google apps work properly, plus 8 GB of RAM and 128 GB of storage.</p>\n<p>Fifty-point infrared touch lets a whole group work together, and the built-in 48MP camera, eight-microphone array and two 20W speakers handle video meetings without extra kit. ONIN Infosys sells it for Rs 2,19,999.</p>','[{\"question\":\"Does it have Google Play?\",\"answer\":\"Yes. It runs Android 14 with Google EDLA certification.\"},{\"question\":\"Does it need a separate camera for video calls?\",\"answer\":\"No, it has a 48MP camera, an 8-mic array and 2x20W speakers built in.\"}]','[{\"label\":\"ONIN Infosys \\u2013 Hikvision DS-D5A75RB\\/B3 75-Inch 4K Interactive Flat Panel Display (8GB RAM \\/128GB Storage)\",\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/onin.com.np\\/product\\/hikvision-ds-d5a75rb-b3-price-nepal\",\"accessed\":\"2026-11-23\"}]',NULL,'https://onin.com.np/product/hikvision-ds-d5a75rb-b3-price-nepal',0,'2026-11-22 18:15:00','2026-11-22 18:15:00'),(2551,99,49,'Hikvision DS-D5A86RB/B3 86-inch Interactive Flat Panel','hikvision-ds-d5a86rb-b3-86-inch-interactive-flat-panel',NULL,'gadgets/2026/hikvision-ds-d5a86rb-b3-86-inch-interactive-flat-panel.webp',NULL,NULL,313999.00,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,'available',NULL,0,0,'<p>Hikvision\'s 86-inch DS-D5A86RB/B3 is the biggest panel in its range, sized for lecture halls and large boardrooms. The 4K anti-glare, zero-lamination glass keeps writing precise at the edges, and the infrared touch layer tracks 50 points with a response of 5 ms or less.</p>\n<p>It runs Android 14 with Google EDLA certification on an eight-core processor, 8 GB of RAM and 128 GB of storage, and has a 48MP camera, an eight-mic array with a 12-metre pickup range, and two 20W speakers. ONIN Infosys sells it for Rs 3,13,999.</p>','[{\"question\":\"How far does the microphone pick up voices?\",\"answer\":\"The eight-microphone array picks up speech up to about 12 metres away.\"},{\"question\":\"What resolution is the 86-inch panel?\",\"answer\":\"4K UHD, 3840 x 2160.\"}]','[{\"label\":\"ONIN Infosys \\u2013 Hikvision DS-D5A86RB\\/B3 86-inch 4K UHD Smart Interactive Flat Panel Display (8GB RAM, 128G\",\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/onin.com.np\\/product\\/hikvision-ds-d5a86rb-b3-86-inch-4k-interactive-display-price-nepal\",\"accessed\":\"2026-11-23\"}]',NULL,'https://onin.com.np/product/hikvision-ds-d5a86rb-b3-86-inch-4k-interactive-display-price-nepal',1,'2026-11-22 18:15:00','2026-11-22 18:15:00'),(2552,91,43,'DJI Mic 3 (2 TX + 1 RX + Charging Case)','dji-mic-3-2-tx-plus-1-rx-plus-charging-case',NULL,'gadgets/2026/dji-mic-3-2-tx-plus-1-rx-plus-charging-case.webp',NULL,NULL,54499.00,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,'available',NULL,0,0,'<p>The DJI Mic 3 is a two-person wireless mic kit for interviews, podcasts and vlogs. Each transmitter records 32-bit float audio internally on 32 GB of storage, so even a sudden shout won\'t clip, and you have a backup if the wireless link drops.</p>\n<p>Range reaches up to 400 metres in clear line of sight, each transmitter lasts about 8 hours, and the case brings the total to 28 hours. The receiver connects over USB-C, a 3.5mm TRS cable, or directly by Bluetooth to phones and DJI cameras. ONIN Infosys sells the kit for Rs 54,499.</p>','[{\"question\":\"Can the DJI Mic 3 connect to a phone without the receiver?\",\"answer\":\"Yes, it supports direct Bluetooth connection to smartphones and DJI cameras.\"},{\"question\":\"What is 32-bit float recording?\",\"answer\":\"A recording format with so much headroom that loud sounds don\'t clip, so you can fix levels afterwards.\"}]','[{\"label\":\"ONIN Infosys \\u2013 DJI Mic 3 (2TX + 1RX + Charging Case) | USB-C & 3.5mm TRS Connectivity\",\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/onin.com.np\\/product\\/dji-mic-price-nepal-onin-infosys\",\"accessed\":\"2026-11-23\"}]',NULL,'https://onin.com.np/product/dji-mic-price-nepal-onin-infosys',0,'2026-11-22 18:15:00','2026-11-22 18:15:00'),(2553,87,43,'Logitech Z313 Speaker System with Subwoofer','logitech-z313-speaker-system-with-subwoofer',NULL,'gadgets/2026/logitech-z313-speaker-system-with-subwoofer.webp',NULL,NULL,9000.00,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,'available',NULL,0,0,'<p>Laptop speakers sound thin, and a 2.1 set like the Logitech Z313 fixes that cheaply. You get two desktop satellite speakers plus a separate subwoofer that sits under the desk and fills in the bass for music, movies and games.</p>\n<p>It plugs into the 3.5mm jack of a PC, laptop or TV. ONIN Infosys sells it for Rs 9,000.</p>','[{\"question\":\"Does the Logitech Z313 have Bluetooth?\",\"answer\":\"No, it connects through a 3.5mm cable.\"},{\"question\":\"Can I use it with a TV?\",\"answer\":\"Yes, if your TV has a 3.5mm headphone or audio-out jack.\"}]','[{\"label\":\"ONIN Infosys \\u2013 Logitech z313 speaker with subwoofer\",\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/onin.com.np\\/product\\/logitech-z313-speaker-price-in-nepal\",\"accessed\":\"2026-11-23\"}]',NULL,'https://onin.com.np/product/logitech-z313-speaker-price-in-nepal',0,'2026-11-22 18:15:00','2026-11-22 18:15:00'),(2554,100,41,'Kingston XS2000 4TB Portable SSD','kingston-xs2000-4tb-portable-ssd',NULL,'gadgets/2026/kingston-xs2000-4tb-portable-ssd.webp',NULL,NULL,97000.00,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,'available',NULL,0,0,'<p>The Kingston XS2000 is one of the fastest pocket drives you can buy: up to 2,000 MB/s read and write over USB 3.2 Gen 2x2. Its 4 TB capacity holds a large video library or full backups of several laptops, in a body about the size of a car key and weighing 28.9 g.</p>\n<p>The included rubber sleeve gives it IP55 water and dust resistance, and it works with Windows, macOS, Linux and Chrome OS. ONIN Infosys sells the 4 TB model for Rs 97,000. To reach full speed, your computer needs a USB 3.2 Gen 2x2 port; on others it simply runs slower.</p>','[{\"question\":\"Will the Kingston XS2000 run at 2,000 MB\\/s on my laptop?\",\"answer\":\"Only on a USB 3.2 Gen 2x2 port. On regular USB-C or USB 3.2 Gen 2 ports it works, at around 1,000 MB\\/s.\"},{\"question\":\"Is it waterproof?\",\"answer\":\"With its rubber sleeve on, it is rated IP55 for water and dust.\"}]','[{\"label\":\"ONIN Infosys \\u2013 Kingston XS2000 4TB Pocket Portable SSD \\u2013 High-Speed External Solid State Drive\",\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/onin.com.np\\/product\\/kingston-xs2000-4tb-portable-ssd-price-nepal\",\"accessed\":\"2026-11-23\"}]',NULL,'https://onin.com.np/product/kingston-xs2000-4tb-portable-ssd-price-nepal',0,'2026-11-22 18:15:00','2026-11-22 18:15:00'),(2555,101,41,'Lexar SL200 1TB Portable SSD','lexar-sl200-1tb-portable-ssd',NULL,'gadgets/2026/lexar-sl200-1tb-portable-ssd.webp',NULL,NULL,21999.00,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,'available',NULL,0,0,'<p>If you want SSD speed for backups without paying flagship prices, the Lexar SL200 fits. It reads at up to 550 MB/s and writes at up to 400 MB/s, several times faster than a portable hard drive, and has no moving parts to fail if it gets bumped.</p>\n<p>Lexar adds 256-bit AES encryption, a slim premium shell, and both USB-C to USB-C and USB-C to USB-A cables in the box. ONIN Infosys sells the 1 TB model for Rs 21,999, with three years of Lexar product support.</p>','[{\"question\":\"How fast is the Lexar SL200?\",\"answer\":\"Up to 550 MB\\/s read and 400 MB\\/s write.\"},{\"question\":\"Does it come with a USB-A cable?\",\"answer\":\"Yes, it includes USB-C to USB-C and USB-C to USB-A cables.\"}]','[{\"label\":\"ONIN Infosys \\u2013 Lexar SL200 1TB External Portable SSD\",\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/onin.com.np\\/product\\/lexar--1tb-external-ssd-price-in-nepal\",\"accessed\":\"2026-11-23\"}]',NULL,'https://onin.com.np/product/lexar--1tb-external-ssd-price-in-nepal',0,'2026-11-22 18:15:00','2026-11-22 18:15:00'),(2556,101,41,'Lexar SL500 Portable SSD','lexar-sl500-portable-ssd',NULL,'gadgets/2026/lexar-sl500-portable-ssd.webp',NULL,NULL,42999.00,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,'available',NULL,0,0,'<p>The Lexar SL500 is barely thicker than a credit card (4.8 mm at its thinnest) and weighs about 43 g, yet reaches up to 2,000 MB/s read and 1,800 MB/s write over USB 3.2 Gen 2x2. It is a favourite for recording ProRes video straight from an iPhone 15 Pro or 16 Pro.</p>\n<p>The aluminium unibody is rated IP54 and survives 2-metre drops, and Lexar\'s DataShield adds 256-bit encryption. It also works with Mac, Windows, Android, PS5 and Xbox. ONIN Infosys sells it from Rs 42,999, in 1 TB and 2 TB.</p>','[{\"question\":\"Can I record video from an iPhone to the Lexar SL500?\",\"answer\":\"Yes, it works with iPhone 15 Pro and 16 Pro models over USB-C.\"},{\"question\":\"Which capacities are available?\",\"answer\":\"1 TB and 2 TB.\"}]','[{\"label\":\"ONIN Infosys \\u2013 Lexar SL500 Portable SSD (1TB \\/ 2TB) - High-Speed External Storage\",\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/onin.com.np\\/product\\/lexar-sl500-portable-ssd-price-nepal-1tb-2tb\",\"accessed\":\"2026-11-23\"}]',NULL,'https://onin.com.np/product/lexar-sl500-portable-ssd-price-nepal-1tb-2tb',0,'2026-11-22 18:15:00','2026-11-22 18:15:00'),(2557,101,41,'Lexar SL300 Portable SSD','lexar-sl300-portable-ssd',NULL,'gadgets/2026/lexar-sl300-portable-ssd.webp',NULL,NULL,27499.00,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,'available',NULL,0,0,'<p>The Lexar SL300 sits in the middle of Lexar\'s range: up to 1,050 MB/s read and 1,000 MB/s write over USB 3.2 Gen 2, which most laptops and phones support at full speed. It is IP54 water and dust resistant and survives 2-metre drops.</p>\n<p>It weighs about 42 g, includes a 2-in-1 USB-C and USB-A cable, and has 256-bit AES encryption via Lexar DataShield. It works with Windows, macOS, Android, iPhone 15 and 16 models and gaming consoles. ONIN Infosys sells it from Rs 27,499, in 1 TB and 2 TB.</p>','[{\"question\":\"SL300 or SL500?\",\"answer\":\"The SL300 runs at full speed on almost any USB-C port. The SL500 is twice as fast, but only on USB 3.2 Gen 2x2 ports.\"},{\"question\":\"Is it rugged?\",\"answer\":\"Yes, IP54 water and dust resistant with 2-metre drop protection.\"}]','[{\"label\":\"ONIN Infosys \\u2013 Lexar\\u00ae SL300 Portable SSD (1TB & 2TB Variants) \\u2013 High-Speed Rugged External Storage\",\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/onin.com.np\\/product\\/lexar-sl300-portable-ssd-1tb-2tb-price-nepal\",\"accessed\":\"2026-11-23\"}]',NULL,'https://onin.com.np/product/lexar-sl300-portable-ssd-1tb-2tb-price-nepal',0,'2026-11-22 18:15:00','2026-11-22 18:15:00'),(2558,102,41,'Netac 256GB 2.5-inch SATA SSD','netac-256gb-2-5-inch-sata-ssd',NULL,'gadgets/2026/netac-256gb-2-5-inch-sata-ssd.webp',NULL,NULL,6000.00,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,'available',NULL,0,0,'<p>Swapping an old laptop\'s hard drive for an SSD is the cheapest speed boost there is, and a 256 GB Netac SATA SSD is an easy way to do it. Windows boots in seconds instead of minutes, and apps open noticeably faster.</p>\n<p>It uses the standard 2.5-inch SATA form factor, so it fits most laptops and desktops from the past decade, and even some consoles. ONIN Infosys sells it for Rs 6,000.</p>','[{\"question\":\"Will this Netac SSD fit my laptop?\",\"answer\":\"If your laptop has a 2.5-inch SATA drive bay, which most older laptops do, yes. Newer thin laptops often use M.2 slots instead.\"},{\"question\":\"Is 256 GB enough?\",\"answer\":\"It is enough for Windows, office apps and a few programs. Keep large media on an external drive.\"}]','[{\"label\":\"ONIN Infosys \\u2013 Netac 256GB 2.5 Inch SATA Internal Solid State Drive SSD\",\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/onin.com.np\\/product\\/netac-256gb-2-5-inch-sata-internal-solid-state-drive-ssd\",\"accessed\":\"2026-11-23\"}]',NULL,'https://onin.com.np/product/netac-256gb-2-5-inch-sata-internal-solid-state-drive-ssd',0,'2026-11-22 18:15:00','2026-11-22 18:15:00'),(2559,103,41,'Transcend MTS832S 256GB M.2 SATA SSD','transcend-mts832s-256gb-m-2-sata-ssd',NULL,'gadgets/2026/transcend-mts832s-256gb-m-2-sata-ssd.webp',NULL,NULL,4375.00,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,'available',NULL,0,0,'<p>Transcend\'s MTS832S is an M.2 2280 SSD on the SATA III (6Gb/s) interface, made for ultrabooks and thin notebooks that have an M.2 slot rather than a 2.5-inch bay. It uses quality flash chips with a DDR3 DRAM cache, which keeps performance steady during long file copies.</p>\n<p>Before buying, check that your laptop\'s M.2 slot supports SATA, as some only accept NVMe drives. ONIN Infosys sells the 256 GB model for Rs 4,375.</p>','[{\"question\":\"Is the Transcend MTS832S NVMe?\",\"answer\":\"No, it is an M.2 SATA III SSD. Check that your laptop\'s M.2 slot supports SATA drives.\"},{\"question\":\"Does it have a DRAM cache?\",\"answer\":\"Yes, a DDR3 DRAM cache.\"}]','[{\"label\":\"ONIN Infosys \\u2013 SATA III - MTS 832 M.2 - 256 GB - 6 gbps\",\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/onin.com.np\\/product\\/sata-iii---mts-832-m-2---256-gb---6-gbps\",\"accessed\":\"2026-11-23\"}]',NULL,'https://onin.com.np/product/sata-iii---mts-832-m-2---256-gb---6-gbps',0,'2026-11-22 18:15:00','2026-11-22 18:15:00'),(2560,104,41,'SanDisk Extreme Portable SSD V2','sandisk-extreme-portable-ssd-v2',NULL,'gadgets/2026/sandisk-extreme-portable-ssd-v2.webp',NULL,NULL,33499.00,35499.00,0,NULL,NULL,'available',NULL,0,0,'<p>The SanDisk Extreme Portable SSD is the drive you see clipped to photographers\' bags, thanks to its carabiner loop. It uses NVMe flash to reach up to 1,050 MB/s read and 1,000 MB/s write, and is rated IP65 for water and dust with up to 3-metre drop protection.</p>\n<p>Built-in 256-bit AES hardware encryption adds password protection, and USB-C makes it work with PCs, Macs, Android phones and iPhone 15 and 16 models. ONIN Infosys sells it from Rs 33,499 (down from Rs 35,499), in 1 TB and 2 TB.</p>','[{\"question\":\"Is the SanDisk Extreme Portable SSD waterproof?\",\"answer\":\"It is rated IP65 for water and dust resistance, so it handles rain and splashes.\"},{\"question\":\"Does it work with iPhone?\",\"answer\":\"Yes, with USB-C iPhones such as the iPhone 15 and 16 series.\"}]','[{\"label\":\"ONIN Infosys \\u2013 SanDisk Extreme Portable SSD (V2) - 1TB & 2TB Variants\",\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/onin.com.np\\/product\\/sandisk-extreme-portable-ssd-price-nepal-1tb-2tb\",\"accessed\":\"2026-11-23\"}]',NULL,'https://onin.com.np/product/sandisk-extreme-portable-ssd-price-nepal-1tb-2tb',0,'2026-11-22 18:15:00','2026-11-22 18:15:00'),(2561,104,41,'SanDisk Extreme Portable SSD 4TB','sandisk-extreme-portable-ssd-4tb',NULL,'gadgets/2026/sandisk-extreme-portable-ssd-4tb.webp',NULL,NULL,75500.00,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,'available',NULL,0,0,'<p>The 4 TB SanDisk Extreme gives video makers enough room for whole projects of 4K footage or RAW photos in a drive that fits in a shirt pocket. Speeds are up to 1,050 MB/s read and 1,000 MB/s write over USB 3.2 Gen 2.</p>\n<p>Like the smaller models it is IP65 dust and water resistant, survives drops of up to 3 metres, and has hardware encryption with password protection. ONIN Infosys sells the black 4 TB model for Rs 75,500.</p>','[{\"question\":\"How much 4K video fits on 4 TB?\",\"answer\":\"Many hours, depending on bitrate and codec. It is sized for multi-day shoots.\"},{\"question\":\"Is the 4 TB model as fast as the 1 TB?\",\"answer\":\"Yes, up to 1,050 MB\\/s read and 1,000 MB\\/s write.\"}]','[{\"label\":\"ONIN Infosys \\u2013 SanDisk Extreme Portable SSD - 4TB (Black) - 1050MB\\/s NVMe Performance\",\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/onin.com.np\\/product\\/sandisk-extreme-portable-ssd-4tb-black-nepal\",\"accessed\":\"2026-11-23\"}]',NULL,'https://onin.com.np/product/sandisk-extreme-portable-ssd-4tb-black-nepal',0,'2026-11-22 18:15:00','2026-11-22 18:15:00'),(2562,105,41,'Seagate Expansion 4TB Portable Hard Drive','seagate-expansion-4tb-portable-hard-drive',NULL,'gadgets/2026/seagate-expansion-4tb-portable-hard-drive.webp',NULL,NULL,34999.00,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,'available',NULL,0,0,'<p>If you need lots of space for backups and don\'t mind slower speeds than an SSD, the Seagate Expansion 4 TB is the cheapest way to get it from ONIN. It is a 2.5-inch portable hard drive that runs off its USB 3.0 cable, with no power adapter needed.</p>\n<p>It works with Windows and Mac. ONIN Infosys sells it for Rs 34,999, about Rs 8.75 per gigabyte, far less per GB than a portable SSD.</p>','[{\"question\":\"Does the Seagate Expansion 4TB need a power adapter?\",\"answer\":\"No, it is powered through its USB cable.\"},{\"question\":\"SSD or hard drive for backups?\",\"answer\":\"For large, occasional backups a hard drive is cheaper per GB. For daily use, editing or travel, an SSD is faster and tougher.\"}]','[{\"label\":\"ONIN Infosys \\u2013 Seagate Expansion 4TB External HDD USB 3.0 Windows & Mac, Portable Hard Drive\",\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/onin.com.np\\/product\\/seagate-expansion-4tb-external-hdd---usb-3-0-for-windows-and-mac-with-3-yr-data-recovery-services--portable-hard-drive\",\"accessed\":\"2026-11-23\"}]',NULL,'https://onin.com.np/product/seagate-expansion-4tb-external-hdd---usb-3-0-for-windows-and-mac-with-3-yr-data-recovery-services--portable-hard-drive',0,'2026-11-22 18:15:00','2026-11-22 18:15:00'),(2563,105,41,'Seagate Expansion Desktop Hard Drive (12TB / 14TB)','seagate-expansion-desktop-hard-drive-12tb-14tb',NULL,'gadgets/2026/seagate-expansion-desktop-hard-drive-12tb-14tb.webp',NULL,NULL,54999.00,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,'available',NULL,0,0,'<p>The Seagate Expansion Desktop is built to stay on a desk as the home for family photos, project archives or CCTV exports. It comes in 12 TB and 14 TB and connects over USB 3.0, backward compatible with USB 2.0.</p>\n<p>This is a 3.5-inch drive, so it needs its included 18W power adapter rather than running off USB power. It is plug-and-play on Windows 10 or later, macOS 10.12 or later and ChromeOS. ONIN Infosys sells it from Rs 54,999.</p>','[{\"question\":\"Is the Seagate Expansion Desktop portable?\",\"answer\":\"No, it is a 3.5-inch desktop drive that needs its 18W power adapter.\"},{\"question\":\"Which capacities are available?\",\"answer\":\"12 TB and 14 TB.\"}]','[{\"label\":\"ONIN Infosys \\u2013 Seagate Expansion Desktop External Hard Drive - 12TB & 14TB Variants\",\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/onin.com.np\\/product\\/seagate-expansion-desktop-external-hard-drive-nepal\",\"accessed\":\"2026-11-23\"}]',NULL,'https://onin.com.np/product/seagate-expansion-desktop-external-hard-drive-nepal',0,'2026-11-22 18:15:00','2026-11-22 18:15:00'),(2564,103,41,'Transcend StoreJet 25M3 1TB Portable Hard Drive','transcend-storejet-25m3-1tb-portable-hard-drive',NULL,'gadgets/2026/transcend-storejet-25m3-1tb-portable-hard-drive.webp',NULL,NULL,21999.00,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,'available',NULL,0,0,'<p>Transcend\'s StoreJet 25M3 is built for people who drop things. A three-stage shock protection system and military-grade drop resistance protect the 2.5-inch drive inside, which matters for a hard drive carried in a bag every day.</p>\n<p>It connects over USB 3.1 Gen 1 for quick backups. ONIN Infosys sells the 1 TB model (TS1TSJ25M3S) for Rs 21,999.</p>','[{\"question\":\"Is the Transcend StoreJet 25M3 shockproof?\",\"answer\":\"It has a three-stage shock protection system and military-grade drop resistance.\"},{\"question\":\"What interface does it use?\",\"answer\":\"USB 3.1 Gen 1.\"}]','[{\"label\":\"ONIN Infosys \\u2013 Transcend 1TB TS1TSJ25M3S , Portable HDD , Storejet M3 , USB 3.1\",\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/onin.com.np\\/product\\/1tb-external-hdd-transcend\",\"accessed\":\"2026-11-23\"}]',NULL,'https://onin.com.np/product/1tb-external-hdd-transcend',0,'2026-11-22 18:15:00','2026-11-22 18:15:00'),(2565,103,41,'Transcend StoreJet 25M3 2TB Portable Hard Drive','transcend-storejet-25m3-2tb-portable-hard-drive',NULL,'gadgets/2026/transcend-storejet-25m3-2tb-portable-hard-drive.webp',NULL,NULL,28999.00,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,'available',NULL,0,0,'<p>The 2 TB StoreJet 25M3 gives you twice the space of the 1 TB model in the same rugged, shock-protected shell. It weighs about 189 g in iron grey and connects over USB 3.1 Gen 1, with both USB-C to USB-A and USB-C to USB-C cables.</p>\n<p>It works with Windows 7 to 10, macOS 10.7 or later and Linux. ONIN Infosys sells it for Rs 28,999, only Rs 7,000 more than the 1 TB version.</p>','[{\"question\":\"Which cables come with the 2TB StoreJet 25M3?\",\"answer\":\"USB-C to USB-A and USB-C to USB-C.\"},{\"question\":\"How heavy is it?\",\"answer\":\"About 189 g.\"}]','[{\"label\":\"ONIN Infosys \\u2013 Transcend 2TB External HDD, Storejet M3 , USB 3.1\",\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/onin.com.np\\/product\\/transcend-2tb-external-hdd\",\"accessed\":\"2026-11-23\"}]',NULL,'https://onin.com.np/product/transcend-2tb-external-hdd',0,'2026-11-22 18:15:00','2026-11-22 18:15:00'),(2566,106,41,'WD My Passport 2TB Portable Hard Drive','wd-my-passport-2tb-portable-hard-drive',NULL,'gadgets/2026/wd-my-passport-2tb-portable-hard-drive.webp',NULL,NULL,23499.00,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,'available',NULL,0,0,'<p>WD\'s My Passport is one of the best-known portable drives, and the 2 TB model is a sensible size for a laptop backup plus a photo archive. It includes WD Backup software for automatic backups and hardware encryption with password protection.</p>\n<p>It connects over USB 3.2 Gen 1, works with Windows 10 and later and Chrome OS, and needs reformatting or a free NTFS driver to write from a Mac. ONIN Infosys sells it for Rs 23,499.</p>','[{\"question\":\"Does the WD My Passport work with a Mac?\",\"answer\":\"Yes, after reformatting it for macOS or installing WD\'s NTFS driver.\"},{\"question\":\"Can I password-protect it?\",\"answer\":\"Yes, it has hardware encryption with password protection.\"}]','[{\"label\":\"ONIN Infosys \\u2013 My Passport 2TB Portable External Hard Drive\",\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/onin.com.np\\/product\\/my-passport-2tb--portable-external-hard-drive\",\"accessed\":\"2026-11-23\"}]',NULL,'https://onin.com.np/product/my-passport-2tb--portable-external-hard-drive',0,'2026-11-22 18:15:00','2026-11-22 18:15:00'),(2567,107,48,'Elista NH32ECA60 E 32-inch HD LED TV','elista-nh32eca60-e-32-inch-hd-led-tv',NULL,'gadgets/2026/elista-nh32eca60-e-32-inch-hd-led-tv.webp',NULL,NULL,19999.00,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,'available',NULL,0,0,'<p>The Elista NH32ECA60 E is a simple 32-inch HD TV for a bedroom, hostel or shop counter. It is not a smart TV, so you connect a set-top box, laptop or streaming stick, but it has two HDMI ports, two USB ports for media files (and hard drives up to 2 TB), plus AV and headphone outputs.</p>\n<p>The bezel-less design makes the screen look larger, the A+ grade panel shows 1366 x 768, and 24W side-firing speakers are louder than most budget TVs. It uses about 48W of power. ONIN Infosys sells it for Rs 19,999 with a one-year official warranty.</p>','[{\"question\":\"Is the Elista NH32ECA60 E a smart TV?\",\"answer\":\"No, this is the non-smart version. Add a streaming stick or set-top box for apps.\"},{\"question\":\"Can I play movies from a USB drive?\",\"answer\":\"Yes, through its two USB ports, including hard drives up to 2 TB.\"}]','[{\"label\":\"ONIN Infosys \\u2013 Elista NH32ECA60 E 32\\\" Bezel-less HD LED TV (Non-Smart Variant) | 1 year official warranty\",\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/onin.com.np\\/product\\/elista-nh32eca60-e-non-smart-32-inch-led-tv-price-nepal\",\"accessed\":\"2026-11-23\"}]',NULL,'https://onin.com.np/product/elista-nh32eca60-e-non-smart-32-inch-led-tv-price-nepal',0,'2026-11-22 18:15:00','2026-11-22 18:15:00'),(2568,108,46,'Dahua DH-PFM3350-600 600VA UPS','dahua-dh-pfm3350-600-600va-ups',NULL,'gadgets/2026/dahua-dh-pfm3350-600-600va-ups.webp',NULL,NULL,4950.00,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,'available',NULL,0,0,'<p>Even a short power cut can corrupt files or reset a router, and a small UPS like Dahua\'s DH-PFM3350-600 bridges the gap. Rated at 600VA / 360W, it keeps a desktop PC and monitor running long enough to save your work and shut down properly, or keeps a router and CCTV recorder online.</p>\n<p>It accepts 170 to 280V input, switches to battery in 4 to 8 ms, and protects against overload and over- or under-voltage. The internal 12V 7Ah battery recharges to 90% in 4 to 6 hours. ONIN Infosys sells it for Rs 4,950.</p>','[{\"question\":\"How long will the Dahua 600VA UPS run my computer?\",\"answer\":\"A few minutes for a typical desktop and monitor, enough to save and shut down. It runs much longer on light loads like a router.\"},{\"question\":\"What battery does it use?\",\"answer\":\"A sealed lead-acid 12V\\/7Ah battery.\"}]','[{\"label\":\"ONIN Infosys \\u2013 Dahua DH-PFM3350-600 | 600VA\\/360W Offline UPS\",\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/onin.com.np\\/product\\/dahua-dh-pfm3350-600-ups-nepal\",\"accessed\":\"2026-11-23\"}]',NULL,'https://onin.com.np/product/dahua-dh-pfm3350-600-ups-nepal',0,'2026-11-22 18:15:00','2026-11-22 18:15:00'),(2569,108,46,'Dahua DH-PFM350-720-A 1200VA UPS','dahua-dh-pfm350-720-a-1200va-ups',NULL,'gadgets/2026/dahua-dh-pfm350-720-a-1200va-ups.webp',NULL,NULL,9999.00,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,'available',NULL,0,0,'<p>Dahua\'s DH-PFM350-720-A is the biggest of its three UPS models at ONIN, rated at 1200VA with 720W on mains and 530W on battery. That is enough for a gaming PC or a workstation with a large monitor, or a CCTV setup with its recorder.</p>\n<p>It accepts a wide 150 to 275V input, switches in under 10 ms, has a power factor of 0.85, and supports cold start, so you can turn it on during a power cut. Protection covers overload, deep discharge and overcharge. ONIN Infosys sells it for Rs 9,999.</p>','[{\"question\":\"Can the Dahua 1200VA UPS run a gaming PC?\",\"answer\":\"Its 530W battery output suits most mid-range gaming PCs with a monitor, for a short shutdown window.\"},{\"question\":\"Can I start it during a power cut?\",\"answer\":\"Yes, it supports cold start.\"}]','[{\"label\":\"ONIN Infosys \\u2013 Dahua DH-PFM350-720-A | 1200VA\\/720W | Uninterruptible Power Supply\",\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/onin.com.np\\/product\\/dahua-ups-1200va-720w-dh-pfm350-720-a-nepal\",\"accessed\":\"2026-11-23\"}]',NULL,'https://onin.com.np/product/dahua-ups-1200va-720w-dh-pfm350-720-a-nepal',0,'2026-11-22 18:15:00','2026-11-22 18:15:00'),(2570,108,46,'Dahua DH-PFM3350-1000 1000VA UPS','dahua-dh-pfm3350-1000-1000va-ups',NULL,'gadgets/2026/dahua-dh-pfm3350-1000-1000va-ups.webp',NULL,NULL,7150.00,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,'available',NULL,0,0,'<p>Sitting between Dahua\'s 600VA and 1200VA models, the DH-PFM3350-1000 is rated at 1000VA / 600W, a good match for an office desktop with a monitor or a small home setup with a router and NVR.</p>\n<p>It accepts 170 to 280V, switches over in 4 to 8 ms, and gives pure sine wave output on mains and a simulated sine wave on battery. The internal battery (about 9 Ah) fast-charges in 4 to 6 hours, with protection against overload, short circuit, overcharge and over-discharge. ONIN Infosys sells it for Rs 7,150.</p>','[{\"question\":\"Which Dahua UPS should I buy?\",\"answer\":\"The 600VA suits a router or a basic PC, the 1000VA an office desktop with a monitor, and the 1200VA a gaming PC or heavier load.\"},{\"question\":\"How long does it take to recharge?\",\"answer\":\"About 4 to 6 hours.\"}]','[{\"label\":\"ONIN Infosys \\u2013 Dahua DH\\u2011PFM3350\\u20111000 | 1000VA\\/600W | Offline UPS\",\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/onin.com.np\\/product\\/dahua-dh-pfm3350-1000-ups-1000va-600w-nepal\",\"accessed\":\"2026-11-23\"}]',NULL,'https://onin.com.np/product/dahua-dh-pfm3350-1000-ups-1000va-600w-nepal',0,'2026-11-22 18:15:00','2026-11-22 18:15:00'),(2571,41,3,'Acer Aspire Lite 14 AL14-45P (Ryzen 3 5400U, 8GB/512GB)','acer-aspire-lite-14-al14-45p-ryzen-3-5400u',NULL,'gadgets/2026/acer-aspire-lite-14-al14-45p-ryzen-3-5400u.webp',NULL,NULL,73999.00,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,'available',NULL,0,0,'<p>At <strong>Rs 73,999</strong>, the Aspire Lite 14 AL14-45P gets two things right that budget laptops often miss: a <strong>58Wh battery</strong> and a taller <strong>14-inch WUXGA (1920 × 1200)</strong> IPS screen. Battery life is good for its class, and you see more of each document without scrolling. It weighs 1.35 kg and comes in Light Silver.</p>\n<p>The <strong>Ryzen 3 5400U</strong> has 4 cores and 8 threads (up to 4.0GHz). It\'s an older-generation chip, but it\'s capable for study and office work. With 8GB of DDR4 and a <strong>512GB</strong> SSD, there\'s space for files and apps from day one. Ports are practical: a USB-C, three USB-A ports, HDMI and a microSD reader for camera cards. Windows 11 Home comes preinstalled.</p>\n<p>This sits at the same price as the <a href=\"/products/acer-aspire-go-15-ag15-32p-39r2-2025-intel-core-3-n355-8gb-256gb-156-fhd\">Aspire Go 15</a>. Choose the Lite 14 for the bigger SSD, larger battery and lighter body. Choose the Go 15 if you want the bigger 15.6-inch screen. For a newer processor and a 2-year warranty, see the <a href=\"/products/acer-aspire-lite-14-al14-32p-39zh-2024-intel-core-i3-n355\">Aspire Lite 14 with Core i3 N355</a>.</p>','[{\"question\":\"What is the Acer Aspire Lite 14 AL14-45P price in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"ONIN Infosys sells the Aspire Lite 14 AL14-45P-R9NR with Ryzen 3 5400U, 8GB RAM and 512GB SSD for Rs 73,999.\"},{\"question\":\"What is the screen resolution of the Aspire Lite 14?\",\"answer\":\"14-inch WUXGA (1920 \\u00d7 1200) IPS in a 16:10 shape.\"},{\"question\":\"How big is the battery?\",\"answer\":\"58Wh, large for a laptop at this price.\"}]','[{\"label\":\"ONIN Infosys \\u2013 Acer Aspire Lite 14 AL14-45P (Ryzen 3 5400U, 8GB\\/512GB)\",\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/onin.com.np\\/product\\/acer-aspire-lite-al14-45p-ryzen-5400u-price-nepal\",\"accessed\":\"2026-11-23\"}]',NULL,'https://onin.com.np/product/acer-aspire-lite-al14-45p-ryzen-5400u-price-nepal',0,'2026-11-22 18:15:00','2026-11-22 18:15:00'),(2572,41,3,'Acer Aspire Lite 15 AL15-72P (13th-gen Core i5 / i7)','acer-aspire-lite-15-al15-72p',NULL,'gadgets/2026/acer-aspire-lite-15-al15-72p.webp',NULL,NULL,96500.00,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,'available',NULL,0,0,'<p>The Aspire Lite 15 is Acer\'s plain-looking 15.6-inch workhorse, and ONIN Infosys stocks three versions of the AL15-72P. All use 13th-gen Intel H-series processors, which are much faster than the U-series chips in most budget laptops, with a 15.6-inch FHD IPS anti-glare screen, a 58Wh battery and a Light Silver aluminium-look body.</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Core i5-13500H, 8GB, 512GB – Rs 96,500.</strong> 12 cores, 16 threads, up to 4.7GHz. This is the pick of the range.</li>\n<li><strong>Core i5-13420H, 8GB, 512GB – Rs 97,000.</strong> 8 cores, 12 threads. Slower than the 13500H yet costs more. Only buy it if the 13500H is out of stock.</li>\n<li><strong>Core i7-13620H, 16GB – Rs 1,34,999.</strong> 10 cores, 16 threads, up to 4.9GHz. ONIN\'s details list a 1TB SSD while the title says 512GB, so confirm when ordering.</li>\n</ul>\n<p>Everything runs on Intel UHD integrated graphics, so these are productivity laptops: Excel models, ERP and accounting software, programming, browser-heavy work. They\'re not for gaming. Ports include USB-C, USB-A and HDMI. At 1.8 kg it\'s a laptop for home and office more than daily commuting.</p>\n<p>The 8GB models are the weak point. Memory runs out quickly with modern browsers, so plan to add a stick, or step up to the 16GB <a href=\"/products/acer-aspire-lite-15-al15-42p-ryzen-5-7430u\">Aspire Lite 15 with Ryzen 5 7430U</a>.</p>','[{\"question\":\"What is the Acer Aspire Lite 15 AL15-72P price in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"At ONIN Infosys it costs Rs 96,500 with Core i5-13500H, Rs 97,000 with Core i5-13420H (both 8GB\\/512GB), and Rs 1,34,999 with Core i7-13620H and 16GB RAM.\"},{\"question\":\"Which Aspire Lite 15 processor is best value?\",\"answer\":\"The Core i5-13500H. It has 12 cores and 16 threads, more than the i5-13420H, at a slightly lower price.\"},{\"question\":\"Can the Aspire Lite 15 play games?\",\"answer\":\"Only light games. It uses Intel UHD integrated graphics.\"}]','[{\"label\":\"ONIN Infosys \\u2013 Acer Aspire Lite 15 AL15-72P (13th-gen Core i5 \\/ i7)\",\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/onin.com.np\\/product\\/acer-aspire-lite-al15-72p-i5-13500h-price-nepal\",\"accessed\":\"2026-11-23\"},{\"label\":\"ONIN Infosys \\u2013 Acer Aspire Lite 15 AL15-72P (13th-gen Core i5 \\/ i7) (edition=Core i5-13420H, ram=8GB, storage=512GB)\",\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/onin.com.np\\/product\\/acer-aspire-lite-al15-72p-58x5-i5-13420h-price-nepal\",\"accessed\":\"2026-11-23\"},{\"label\":\"ONIN Infosys \\u2013 Acer Aspire Lite 15 AL15-72P (13th-gen Core i5 \\/ i7) (edition=Core i7-13620H, ram=16GB, storage=1TB)\",\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/onin.com.np\\/product\\/acer-aspire-lite-15-al15-72p-71x1-i7-13th-gen-price-nepal\",\"accessed\":\"2026-11-23\"}]',NULL,'https://onin.com.np/product/acer-aspire-lite-al15-72p-i5-13500h-price-nepal',0,'2026-11-22 18:15:00','2026-11-22 18:15:00'),(2573,41,3,'Acer Aspire Lite 15 AL15-42P (Ryzen 5 7430U, 16GB/512GB)','acer-aspire-lite-15-al15-42p-ryzen-5-7430u',NULL,'gadgets/2026/acer-aspire-lite-15-al15-42p-ryzen-5-7430u.webp',NULL,NULL,99999.00,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,'available',NULL,0,0,'<p>If you have exactly one lakh to spend and want a laptop that won\'t feel slow in two years, the Aspire Lite 15 AL15-42P is a strong candidate. ONIN Infosys lists it at <strong>Rs 99,999</strong>, and it ships with <strong>16GB of RAM</strong>. That\'s double the 8GB most laptops at this price come with, and it\'s what keeps a busy browser, Teams and Excel running smoothly together.</p>\n<p>The <strong>Ryzen 5 7430U</strong> has 6 cores and 12 threads (up to 4.3GHz), so it\'s faster than the 4-core chips around it. The 16GB DDR4-3200 is <strong>upgradeable to 32GB</strong>, and the 512GB SSD can be expanded. You get a full-size keyboard with number pad, Windows 11, a 15.6-inch FHD IPS display and, unusually, an <strong>Ethernet port</strong> alongside USB-C, USB-A and HDMI. It weighs 1.59 kg.</p>\n<p>The battery is the compromise. It\'s only 36Wh, so expect a few hours of real use rather than a full day. The screen is a basic 250-nit, 45% NTSC panel, fine for documents but dull for photos. If battery life matters more to you than memory, the <a href=\"/products/acer-aspire-lite-14-al14-45p-ryzen-3-5400u\">Aspire Lite 14 AL14-45P</a> has a 58Wh battery.</p>','[{\"question\":\"What is the Acer Aspire Lite 15 AL15-42P price in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"ONIN Infosys sells the Aspire Lite 15 AL15-42P-R86X with Ryzen 5 7430U, 16GB DDR4 and 512GB SSD for Rs 99,999.\"},{\"question\":\"Can I upgrade the RAM on the Aspire Lite 15 AL15-42P?\",\"answer\":\"Yes, up to 32GB DDR4.\"},{\"question\":\"How good is the battery?\",\"answer\":\"It is a small 36Wh battery, so this laptop suits desk use more than long days away from a charger.\"}]','[{\"label\":\"ONIN Infosys \\u2013 Acer Aspire Lite 15 AL15-42P (Ryzen 5 7430U, 16GB\\/512GB)\",\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/onin.com.np\\/product\\/acer-aspire-lite-15-al15-41-ryzen-5-7430u-16gb-ram-price-nepal\",\"accessed\":\"2026-11-23\"}]',NULL,'https://onin.com.np/product/acer-aspire-lite-15-al15-41-ryzen-5-7430u-16gb-ram-price-nepal',0,'2026-11-22 18:15:00','2026-11-22 18:15:00'),(2574,41,3,'Acer Aspire 14 AS14H-53 (Core 5 210H, 16GB/512GB)','acer-aspire-14-as14h-53-core-5-210h',NULL,'gadgets/2026/acer-aspire-14-as14h-53-core-5-210h.webp',NULL,NULL,114999.00,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,'available',NULL,0,0,'<p>The Aspire 14 AS14H-53 brings an H-series processor into a compact 1.44 kg laptop at a mid-range price. ONIN Infosys currently asks <strong>Rs 1,14,999</strong>, with lifetime software support from the store.</p>\n<p>Intel\'s <strong>Core 5 210H</strong> has 8 cores, 12 threads and a 4.8GHz boost. In practice it\'s a big step up from U-series chips when you\'re compiling code, working with large datasets or editing photos. It comes with <strong>16GB of LPDDR5</strong> (soldered, so 16GB is what you\'ll keep) and a fast 512GB Gen 4 SSD, expandable to 1TB. The 54Wh battery is solid for a 14-inch laptop.</p>\n<p>The 14-inch Full HD IPS display has an <strong>anti-glare</strong> finish, which helps under bright office lighting. Ports include three USB-A, HDMI 2.1 and a full-size SD card reader, which photographers will appreciate.</p>\n<p>Who is it for? Students in engineering or IT, and professionals who want a fast, light Windows laptop around a lakh. If you\'d value a sharper OLED screen and an AI NPU more than CPU speed, look at the <a href=\"/products/acer-swift-neo-14-oled-core-ultra-5-115u\">Swift Neo 14 OLED</a>, only Rs 6,000 more.</p>','[{\"question\":\"What is the Acer Aspire 14 AS14H-53 price in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"ONIN Infosys sells the Aspire 14 AS14H-53 with Core 5 210H, 16GB LPDDR5 and 512GB SSD for Rs 1,14,999.\"},{\"question\":\"Is the Intel Core 5 210H fast?\",\"answer\":\"Yes. It is an 8-core, 12-thread H-series chip boosting to 4.8GHz, much quicker than the U-series processors common at this price.\"},{\"question\":\"Does it have an SD card reader?\",\"answer\":\"Yes, it has an SD card slot along with three USB-A ports and HDMI 2.1.\"}]','[{\"label\":\"ONIN Infosys \\u2013 Acer Aspire 14 AS14H-53 (Core 5 210H, 16GB\\/512GB)\",\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/onin.com.np\\/product\\/acer-aspire-14-as14h-53-core-5-210h-price-nepal\",\"accessed\":\"2026-11-23\"}]',NULL,'https://onin.com.np/product/acer-aspire-14-as14h-53-core-5-210h-price-nepal',0,'2026-11-22 18:15:00','2026-11-22 18:15:00'),(2575,41,3,'Acer Aspire Go 15 AG15-42P (Ryzen 7 7730U, 16GB/512GB)','acer-aspire-go-15-ag15-42p-ryzen-7-7730u',NULL,'gadgets/2026/acer-aspire-go-15-ag15-42p-ryzen-7-7730u.webp',NULL,NULL,114999.00,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,'available',NULL,0,0,'<p>Same 8-core <strong>Ryzen 7 7730U</strong> as the <a href=\"/products/acer-aspire-3-2023-ryzen-7-7730u\">Aspire 3 A325-42</a>, but a more modern set of ports. That\'s the short version of the Aspire Go 15 AG15-42P. It\'s on ONIN Infosys\'s shelf at <strong>Rs 1,14,999</strong>.</p>\n<p>The USB-C port here supports <strong>power delivery and DisplayPort</strong>, so you can charge from a USB-C charger or a monitor with one cable. There\'s also a <strong>Gigabit Ethernet</strong> port, three USB-A ports and HDMI 2.1. For office workers on a wired network, or anyone with a USB-C monitor at home, that convenience is worth the extra Rs 8,000 over the Aspire 3.</p>\n<p>Inside: Ryzen 7 7730U (8 cores, 16 threads, up to 4.5GHz), 16GB of dual-channel DDR4 (expandable to 32GB) and a 512GB NVMe SSD (expandable to 1TB). The 15.6-inch Full HD IPS display has a matte ComfyView finish. Acer quotes up to 12.5 hours from the 53Wh battery with light use. Expect less with heavy multitasking, but it\'s good for this class.</p>','[{\"question\":\"What is the Acer Aspire Go 15 AG15-42P price in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"ONIN Infosys sells the Aspire Go 15 AG15-42P-R917 with Ryzen 7 7730U, 16GB RAM and 512GB SSD for Rs 1,14,999.\"},{\"question\":\"Can the Aspire Go 15 charge over USB-C?\",\"answer\":\"Yes. Its USB-C port supports power delivery and DisplayPort output.\"},{\"question\":\"Does it have an Ethernet port?\",\"answer\":\"Yes, a Gigabit RJ-45 port.\"}]','[{\"label\":\"ONIN Infosys \\u2013 Acer Aspire Go 15 AG15-42P (Ryzen 7 7730U, 16GB\\/512GB)\",\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/onin.com.np\\/product\\/acer-aspire-go-15-ag15-42p-r917-ryzen-7-price-nepal\",\"accessed\":\"2026-11-23\"}]',NULL,'https://onin.com.np/product/acer-aspire-go-15-ag15-42p-r917-ryzen-7-price-nepal',0,'2026-11-22 18:15:00','2026-11-22 18:15:00'),(2576,41,3,'Acer Aspire 5 AI A514-54H (Core Ultra 5 125H, 16GB/512GB)','acer-aspire-5-a514-54h-core-ultra-5-125h',NULL,'gadgets/2026/acer-aspire-5-a514-54h-core-ultra-5-125h.webp',NULL,NULL,120499.00,127499.00,0,NULL,NULL,'available',NULL,0,0,'<p>The Aspire 5 A514-54H is an AI-ready 14-inch laptop that\'s also good at ordinary work. ONIN Infosys sells it for <strong>Rs 1,20,499</strong>.</p>\n<p>The <strong>Core Ultra 5 125H</strong> has 14 cores and 18 threads (up to 4.5GHz) and an NPU for background AI tasks like noise suppression, blur and auto-framing on calls. Its <strong>Intel Arc</strong> graphics are a big jump over older Intel UHD chips. Light photo and video editing feel smoother, and older or esports games become playable. You get 16GB of LPDDR5 and a 512GB PCIe SSD.</p>\n<p>It\'s practical too: a backlit keyboard, a 54Wh battery, three USB-A ports, USB-C, HDMI and even <strong>Ethernet</strong>, all in a compact 14-inch body. The 14-inch anti-glare IPS screen is fine for office use, but not colour-accurate enough for professional photo work.</p>\n<p>If the screen matters to you, the <a href=\"/products/acer-swift-neo-14-oled-core-ultra-5-115u\">Swift Neo 14 OLED</a> costs about the same and has a far nicer OLED panel, with a slower U-series chip. The Aspire 5\'s 125H is the faster processor.</p>','[{\"question\":\"What is the Acer Aspire 5 A514-54H price in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"ONIN Infosys sells the Aspire 5 AI A514-54H with Core Ultra 5 125H, 16GB LPDDR5 and 512GB SSD for Rs 1,20,499.\"},{\"question\":\"What graphics does the Core Ultra 5 125H use?\",\"answer\":\"Integrated Intel Arc graphics, considerably faster than older Intel UHD or Iris Xe.\"},{\"question\":\"Does the Aspire 5 A514-54H have a backlit keyboard?\",\"answer\":\"Yes, it has a backlit keyboard.\"}]','[{\"label\":\"ONIN Infosys \\u2013 Acer Aspire 5 AI A514-54H (Core Ultra 5 125H, 16GB\\/512GB)\",\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/onin.com.np\\/product\\/acer-aspire-5-ultra-5-125h-price-nepal\",\"accessed\":\"2026-11-23\"}]',NULL,'https://onin.com.np/product/acer-aspire-5-ultra-5-125h-price-nepal',0,'2026-11-22 18:15:00','2026-11-22 18:15:00'),(2577,41,3,'Acer Swift Neo 14 OLED (Core Ultra 5 115U, 16GB/512GB)','acer-swift-neo-14-oled-core-ultra-5-115u',NULL,'gadgets/2026/acer-swift-neo-14-oled-core-ultra-5-115u.webp',NULL,NULL,121000.00,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,'available',NULL,0,0,'<p>OLED screens used to start at two lakh in Nepal. The Swift Neo 14 brings one down to <strong>Rs 1,21,000</strong> at ONIN Infosys, and it\'s the best reason to choose this laptop. The <strong>14-inch WUXGA OLED</strong> has deep blacks, rich colour (100% sRGB) and 400 nits of brightness, so films, photos and even plain documents look noticeably better than on an IPS panel at this price.</p>\n<p>The rest is solid. Intel\'s <strong>Core Ultra 5 115U</strong> (8 cores, 10 threads, up to 4.2GHz) is an efficient chip for office work, study and streaming, with Intel graphics and an NPU for Windows\' AI features. Memory is 16GB of soldered LPDDR5 with a 512GB PCIe Gen 4 SSD. The <strong>55Wh battery</strong> and 1.3 kg body make it a good everyday carry.</p>\n<p>Ports include USB-C, USB-A, HDMI 2.0 and a microSD reader. One honest caveat: this is a U-series processor, so heavy workloads like big exports or code compiles will be slower than on H-series laptops like the <a href=\"/products/acer-aspire-14-as14h-53-core-5-210h\">Aspire 14 AS14H-53</a>. For students, writers and anyone who looks at a screen all day, the OLED is the better trade.</p>','[{\"question\":\"What is the Acer Swift Neo 14 OLED price in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"ONIN Infosys sells the Swift Neo 14 OLED with Core Ultra 5 115U, 16GB RAM and 512GB SSD for Rs 1,21,000.\"},{\"question\":\"What type of screen does the Swift Neo 14 have?\",\"answer\":\"A 14-inch WUXGA (1920 \\u00d7 1200) OLED with 400 nits and 100% sRGB.\"},{\"question\":\"How heavy is the Swift Neo 14?\",\"answer\":\"It starts at about 1.3 kg.\"}]','[{\"label\":\"ONIN Infosys \\u2013 Acer Swift Neo 14 OLED (Core Ultra 5 115U, 16GB\\/512GB)\",\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/onin.com.np\\/product\\/acer-swift-neo-14-ultra-5-oled-price-nepal\",\"accessed\":\"2026-11-23\"}]',NULL,'https://onin.com.np/product/acer-swift-neo-14-ultra-5-oled-price-nepal',0,'2026-11-22 18:15:00','2026-11-22 18:15:00'),(2578,41,3,'Acer Aspire 7 (Core 7 240H, RTX 3050 6GB)','acer-aspire-7-core-7-240h-rtx-3050',NULL,'gadgets/2026/acer-aspire-7-core-7-240h-rtx-3050.webp',NULL,NULL,157499.00,161499.00,0,NULL,NULL,'available',NULL,0,0,'<p>The Aspire 7 is a laptop for people who want to game a bit without carrying something that looks like a gaming laptop. It has a quiet, grown-up design, an <strong>RTX 3050 6GB</strong>, and a <strong>144Hz</strong> 15.6-inch screen. ONIN Infosys has it at <strong>Rs 1,57,499</strong>.</p>\n<p>The CPU is Intel\'s <strong>Core 7 240H</strong>, a 10-core, 16-thread chip that boosts to 5.2GHz, quick for work and study software. The RTX 3050 here runs at a modest <strong>60W TGP</strong>, though, so it\'s slower than the 95W version in the <a href=\"/products/lenovo-loq-15-15ahp9-2024-ryzen-7-7445hs\">Lenovo LOQ 15AHP9</a>. Think esports titles at high frame rates and older AAA games at medium settings rather than new releases at high.</p>\n<p>Memory is a single 16GB DDR4 stick in one of <strong>two slots</strong>, so adding a second stick for dual channel is cheap and worthwhile. The 512GB SSD can be upgraded to 1TB. The 144Hz panel is smooth but only 45% NTSC, so it\'s not for colour work. It weighs just under 2 kg with a 54Wh battery.</p>\n<p>Who should buy it? A student or office worker who plays after hours and values a subtle design. If gaming is the priority, the LOQ is the faster choice for less money.</p>','[{\"question\":\"What is the Acer Aspire 7 RTX 3050 price in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"ONIN Infosys sells the Acer Aspire 7 with Core 7 240H, RTX 3050 6GB, 16GB DDR4 and 512GB SSD for Rs 1,57,499.\"},{\"question\":\"What is the TGP of the RTX 3050 in the Aspire 7?\",\"answer\":\"ONIN lists it at 60W, lower than many gaming laptops\' RTX 3050, so performance is more modest.\"},{\"question\":\"Can I add more RAM?\",\"answer\":\"Yes. It ships with one 16GB DDR4 stick and has a second slot free.\"}]','[{\"label\":\"ONIN Infosys \\u2013 Acer Aspire 7 (Core 7 240H, RTX 3050 6GB)\",\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/onin.com.np\\/product\\/acer-aspire-7-core-7-240h-rtx-3050-price-nepal\",\"accessed\":\"2026-11-23\"}]',NULL,'https://onin.com.np/product/acer-aspire-7-core-7-240h-rtx-3050-price-nepal',0,'2026-11-22 18:15:00','2026-11-22 18:15:00'),(2579,41,3,'Acer Nitro Lite 16 NL16-71G (Core i7-13620H, RTX 3050)','acer-nitro-lite-16-nl16-71g-i7-13620h-rtx-3050',NULL,'gadgets/2026/acer-nitro-lite-16-nl16-71g-i7-13620h-rtx-3050.webp',NULL,NULL,172499.00,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,'available',NULL,0,0,'<p>The Nitro Lite is Acer\'s attempt at a gaming laptop that\'s easier to carry. It\'s slimmer and lighter (about 2.2 kg) than the regular Nitro, with a calmer Shale Black finish. ONIN Infosys sells the NL16-71G-790D for <strong>Rs 1,72,499</strong>.</p>\n<p>Inside is a 10-core <strong>Core i7-13620H</strong> (up to 4.9GHz), an <strong>RTX 3050 6GB</strong>, 16GB DDR5-5200 and a 512GB PCIe 4.0 SSD. The <strong>16-inch WUXGA</strong> (1920 × 1200) screen has a high refresh rate. ONIN\'s title says 180Hz and its spec table says 165Hz, and either is very smooth for shooters. The taller 16:10 shape is also nicer for work than the usual 15.6-inch 16:9 gaming panel.</p>\n<p>Ports are good: a 10Gbps USB-C with DisplayPort and charging, two USB-A, HDMI 2.1 and Ethernet. The 53Wh battery is modest. Like the Aspire 7, the RTX 3050 here suits esports and older AAA games at 1080p better than the newest releases.</p>\n<p>The <a href=\"/products/acer-nitro-v15-i7-13620h-rtx-4050\">Nitro V15 with RTX 4050</a> costs about Rs 8,500 more and is noticeably faster in games, thanks to DLSS 3 frame generation and more GPU power. Choose the Lite for its lighter, slimmer build and bigger 16:10 screen.</p>','[{\"question\":\"What is the Acer Nitro Lite 16 price in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"ONIN Infosys sells the Nitro Lite 16 NL16-71G-790D with Core i7-13620H, RTX 3050 6GB, 16GB DDR5 and 512GB SSD for Rs 1,72,499.\"},{\"question\":\"How heavy is the Acer Nitro Lite 16?\",\"answer\":\"About 2.2 kg.\"},{\"question\":\"What refresh rate is the Nitro Lite 16 display?\",\"answer\":\"It is a high-refresh 16-inch WUXGA IPS panel. ONIN lists 180Hz in the title and 165Hz in the spec table.\"}]','[{\"label\":\"ONIN Infosys \\u2013 Acer Nitro Lite 16 NL16-71G (Core i7-13620H, RTX 3050)\",\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/onin.com.np\\/product\\/acer-nitro-lite-nl16-71g-790d-price-in-nepal\",\"accessed\":\"2026-11-23\"}]',NULL,'https://onin.com.np/product/acer-nitro-lite-nl16-71g-790d-price-in-nepal',0,'2026-11-22 18:15:00','2026-11-22 18:15:00'),(2580,41,3,'Acer Nitro V 15 (Core i7-13620H, RTX 4050)','acer-nitro-v15-i7-13620h-rtx-4050',NULL,'gadgets/2026/acer-nitro-v15-i7-13620h-rtx-4050.webp',NULL,NULL,180999.00,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,'available',NULL,0,0,'<p>The Nitro V 15 is one of the best-selling budget gaming laptops in Nepal for a simple reason: it puts an <strong>RTX 4050</strong> and an i7 in a straightforward package at a price students can reach. ONIN Infosys sells this configuration for <strong>Rs 1,80,999</strong>, including a laptop bag, mouse and mousepad.</p>\n<p>The <strong>RTX 4050 6GB</strong> supports DLSS 3 frame generation, which makes a real difference in games like Cyberpunk 2077, Alan Wake 2 and Forza Horizon at 1080p. Esports titles easily max out the <strong>144Hz</strong> Full HD IPS screen. The 10-core <strong>Core i7-13620H</strong> and 16GB of DDR5 handle streaming, Discord and browsers alongside the game.</p>\n<p>The ports suit a desk setup: three USB-A, a 10Gbps USB-C, HDMI and Ethernet. The 57.5Wh battery and 2.1 kg weight are typical. Our usual advice applies: add a second SSD early, because 512GB disappears after a few modern games.</p>\n<p>For newer hardware, the <a href=\"/products/lenovo-loq-15-2025\">Lenovo LOQ 15 with RTX 5050</a> costs about Rs 14,000 more and has 8GB of VRAM. The <a href=\"/products/acer-nitro-v-16-anv16-71-2025-core-i7-14650hx-rtx-4050-16gb-512gb-16-wuxga-165hz\">Nitro V 16</a> offers a faster HX processor and a 16-inch 165Hz screen.</p>','[{\"question\":\"What is the Acer Nitro V15 RTX 4050 price in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"ONIN Infosys sells the Nitro V15 with Core i7-13620H, RTX 4050 6GB, 16GB DDR5 and 512GB SSD for Rs 1,80,999, including a bag, mouse and mousepad.\"},{\"question\":\"Does the RTX 4050 support DLSS 3?\",\"answer\":\"Yes, including frame generation in supported games.\"},{\"question\":\"What refresh rate is the Nitro V15 screen?\",\"answer\":\"144Hz on a 15.6-inch Full HD IPS panel.\"}]','[{\"label\":\"ONIN Infosys \\u2013 Acer Nitro V 15 (Core i7-13620H, RTX 4050)\",\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/onin.com.np\\/product\\/acer-nitro-v15-i7-price-in-nepal\",\"accessed\":\"2026-11-23\"}]',NULL,'https://onin.com.np/product/acer-nitro-v15-i7-price-in-nepal',0,'2026-11-22 18:15:00','2026-11-22 18:15:00'),(2581,41,3,'Acer Nitro V 15 ANV15-51 (Core i9-13900H, RTX 5060)','acer-nitro-v15-anv15-51-i9-13900h-rtx-5060',NULL,'gadgets/2026/acer-nitro-v15-anv15-51-i9-13900h-rtx-5060.webp',NULL,NULL,259999.00,270499.00,0,NULL,NULL,'available',NULL,0,0,'<p>This Nitro V 15 pairs a 14-core <strong>Core i9-13900H</strong> (up to 5.4GHz) with an <strong>RTX 5060 8GB GDDR7</strong>. That\'s a big jump in gaming performance over the RTX 4050 Nitros, thanks to the newer GPU and its extra VRAM. ONIN Infosys lists it at <strong>Rs 2,59,999</strong>, with lifetime service and software support.</p>\n<p>At 1080p, the RTX 5060 runs current AAA games at high settings comfortably, and DLSS 4 multi-frame generation pushes frame rates even higher on the <strong>165Hz</strong> Full HD IPS screen. The i9 is a strong partner for streaming or video work. Memory is 16GB DDR5-4800 with a 512GB PCIe 4.0 SSD, and the ports include three USB-A, a 10Gbps USB-C, HDMI and Ethernet. It weighs 2.1 kg.</p>\n<p>Should you buy it? It\'s a good gaming laptop, but the competition at this price is fierce. The <a href=\"/products/lenovo-loq-15ahp10-ryzen-7-250\">Lenovo LOQ with RTX 5060</a> costs about Rs 20,000 less, and the <a href=\"/products/asus-tuf-a16-fa608umi-ryzen-7-260-rtx-5060\">ASUS TUF A16 with RTX 5060</a> has a bigger 16-inch screen and a 70Wh battery. Choose the Nitro V 15 if you specifically want Intel\'s i9.</p>','[{\"question\":\"What is the Acer Nitro V15 i9 RTX 5060 price in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"ONIN Infosys sells the Nitro V15 ANV15-51 with Core i9-13900H, RTX 5060 8GB, 16GB DDR5 and 512GB SSD for Rs 2,59,999.\"},{\"question\":\"What refresh rate is the screen?\",\"answer\":\"165Hz on a 15.6-inch Full HD IPS panel.\"},{\"question\":\"Is the RTX 5060 good for 1080p gaming?\",\"answer\":\"Yes. It handles current games at 1080p high settings, especially with DLSS 4.\"}]','[{\"label\":\"ONIN Infosys \\u2013 Acer Nitro V 15 ANV15-51 (Core i9-13900H, RTX 5060)\",\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/onin.com.np\\/product\\/acer-nitro-v15-i9-price-in-nepal\",\"accessed\":\"2026-11-23\"}]',NULL,'https://onin.com.np/product/acer-nitro-v15-i9-price-in-nepal',0,'2026-11-22 18:15:00','2026-11-22 18:15:00'),(2582,41,3,'Acer Predator Helios Neo 16 (Core i9-14900HX, RTX 4080 12GB)','acer-predator-helios-neo-16-i9-14900hx-rtx-4080',NULL,'gadgets/2026/acer-predator-helios-neo-16-i9-14900hx-rtx-4080.webp',NULL,NULL,369000.00,385000.00,0,NULL,NULL,'available',NULL,0,0,'<p>The previous generation\'s high-end GPUs can be a smart buy, and this Helios Neo 16 shows why. The <strong>RTX 4080 with 12GB of VRAM</strong> is still a very fast laptop GPU, roughly on par with or ahead of the newer RTX 5070 in many games. The price at ONIN Infosys is <strong>Rs 3,69,000</strong> with a <strong>2-year warranty</strong>.</p>\n<p>It\'s paired with a 24-core, 32-thread <strong>Core i9-14900HX</strong> boosting to 5.8GHz, 16GB of DDR5 (expandable to 64GB) and a 1TB SSD (with room for a second up to 2TB). The <strong>16-inch WQXGA 240Hz</strong> IPS display covers 100% sRGB with a 3ms response time. Games at 2560 × 1600 run at high settings, and DLSS 3 frame generation pushes frame rates further.</p>\n<p>It also has a large <strong>90Wh battery</strong>, Thunderbolt 4, three USB-A ports, HDMI and Ethernet, and weighs about 2.5 kg. The main reason to hesitate is the newer RTX 50-series features, mainly DLSS 4 multi-frame generation, which RTX 40 cards don\'t support. If that matters, the <a href=\"/products/acer-nitro-16s-ai-an16s-61-2025-amd-ryzen-ai-7-350-rtx-5070ti-16gb-1tb-16-wqxga-180hz\">Nitro 16S AI with RTX 5070 Ti</a> costs about Rs 70,000 less and is also 12GB.</p>','[{\"question\":\"What is the Acer Predator Helios Neo 16 RTX 4080 price in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"ONIN Infosys sells the Predator Helios Neo 16 with Core i9-14900HX, RTX 4080 12GB, 16GB DDR5 and 1TB SSD for Rs 3,69,000 with a 2-year warranty.\"},{\"question\":\"Is the RTX 4080 laptop GPU still good?\",\"answer\":\"Yes. It remains a high-end GPU for 1440p-class gaming, though it lacks DLSS 4 multi-frame generation.\"},{\"question\":\"How big is the battery?\",\"answer\":\"90Wh.\"}]','[{\"label\":\"ONIN Infosys \\u2013 Acer Predator Helios Neo 16 (Core i9-14900HX, RTX 4080 12GB)\",\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/onin.com.np\\/product\\/acer-predator-helios-neo-16-12gb-graphics-price-nepal\",\"accessed\":\"2026-11-23\"}]',NULL,'https://onin.com.np/product/acer-predator-helios-neo-16-12gb-graphics-price-nepal',0,'2026-11-22 18:15:00','2026-11-22 18:15:00'),(2583,109,3,'Alienware 16X Aurora AC16251 (Core Ultra 9 275HX, RTX 5060)','alienware-16x-aurora-ac16251-core-ultra-9-275hx-rtx-5060',NULL,'gadgets/2026/alienware-16x-aurora-ac16251-core-ultra-9-275hx-rtx-5060.webp',NULL,NULL,309999.00,314499.00,0,NULL,NULL,'available',NULL,0,0,'<p>Alienware has always been about design as much as speed, and the 16X Aurora is the most affordable way into the brand in Nepal. ONIN Infosys sells the AC16251 in <strong>Interstellar Indigo</strong> for <strong>Rs 3,09,999</strong>, with lifetime software support and servicing from the store.</p>\n<p>The specification is serious. There\'s Intel\'s 24-core <strong>Core Ultra 9 275HX</strong> (up to 5.4GHz), an <strong>RTX 5060 8GB GDDR7</strong>, 16GB DDR5-5600 and a <strong>1TB</strong> SSD. The <strong>16-inch WQXGA panel runs at 240Hz</strong>, covers 100% DCI-P3, and supports G-SYNC and Dell\'s ComfyView Plus low-blue-light tech. It\'s bright, colourful and very smooth.</p>\n<p>Alienware details include a <strong>1080p IR webcam</strong> with HDR for Windows Hello, an <strong>84Wh battery</strong>, Wi-Fi 7 and a Thunderbolt 4 port with DisplayPort 2.1. The HDMI 2.1 port is wired directly to the NVIDIA GPU, which lowers latency on an external monitor. There\'s also a 10Gbps USB-C with charging and two USB-A ports. It weighs about 2.57 kg.</p>\n<p>For pure gaming value, the <a href=\"/products/acer-nitro-16s-ai-an16s-61-2025-amd-ryzen-ai-7-350-rtx-5070ti-16gb-1tb-16-wqxga-180hz\">Acer Nitro 16S AI with RTX 5070 Ti</a> is faster for less money. You buy the Alienware for its build, screen quality and brand.</p>','[{\"question\":\"What is the Alienware 16X Aurora price in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"ONIN Infosys sells the Alienware 16X Aurora AC16251 with Core Ultra 9 275HX, RTX 5060 8GB, 16GB DDR5 and 1TB SSD for Rs 3,09,999.\"},{\"question\":\"What display does the Alienware 16X Aurora have?\",\"answer\":\"A 16-inch WQXGA (2560 \\u00d7 1600) panel at 240Hz with 100% DCI-P3, G-SYNC and ComfyView Plus.\"},{\"question\":\"Does the Alienware 16X Aurora support Windows Hello?\",\"answer\":\"Yes. It has a 1080p FHD RGB-IR HDR camera.\"}]','[{\"label\":\"ONIN Infosys \\u2013 Alienware 16X Aurora AC16251 (Core Ultra 9 275HX, RTX 5060)\",\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/onin.com.np\\/product\\/dell-alienware-16x-aurora-gaming-laptop-core-ultra-9-rtx-5060-nepal\",\"accessed\":\"2026-11-23\"}]',NULL,'https://onin.com.np/product/dell-alienware-16x-aurora-gaming-laptop-core-ultra-9-rtx-5060-nepal',0,'2026-11-22 18:15:00','2026-11-22 18:15:00'),(2584,9,3,'Dell 15 DC15250 (Core i5-1334U, 8GB/512GB)','dell-15-dc15250-core-i5-1334u',NULL,'gadgets/2026/dell-15-dc15250-core-i5-1334u.webp',NULL,NULL,96499.00,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,'available',NULL,0,0,'<p>The Dell 15 DC15250 is Dell\'s everyday 15.6-inch laptop, the kind of dependable machine that ends up in a lot of offices and family homes. ONIN Infosys sells the Core i5 version for <strong>Rs 96,499</strong>.</p>\n<p>The <strong>Core i5-1334U</strong> (10 cores, 12 threads, up to 4.6GHz) handles Office, browser apps and video calls smoothly. Like the <a href=\"/products/dell-pro-15-pv15255-2025\">Dell Pro 15</a>, it has a <strong>120Hz</strong> Full HD anti-glare panel, a nice touch at this price. Memory is 8GB of DDR4 on a <strong>single module</strong>, so you can add a second stick later for 16GB in dual channel, which also speeds up Intel\'s integrated graphics. The 512GB NVMe SSD is standard.</p>\n<p>Ports include USB-A 5Gbps, USB 2.0, USB-C, HDMI 1.4 and an SD card slot, with a 41Wh battery.</p>\n<p>Who should buy it? Anyone who prefers Intel and Dell\'s service network, and is happy to upgrade the RAM. If you\'d rather have more memory out of the box, the <a href=\"/products/acer-aspire-lite-15-al15-42p-ryzen-5-7430u\">Acer Aspire Lite 15 with 16GB</a> is a little cheaper.</p>','[{\"question\":\"What is the Dell 15 DC15250 price in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"ONIN Infosys sells the Dell 15 DC15250 with Core i5-1334U, 8GB RAM and 512GB SSD for Rs 96,499.\"},{\"question\":\"Can I upgrade the RAM on the Dell 15 DC15250?\",\"answer\":\"Yes. It ships with one 8GB DDR4 module, so you can add another.\"},{\"question\":\"What is the screen refresh rate?\",\"answer\":\"120Hz on a 15.6-inch Full HD anti-glare panel.\"}]','[{\"label\":\"ONIN Infosys \\u2013 Dell 15 DC15250 (Core i5-1334U, 8GB\\/512GB)\",\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/onin.com.np\\/product\\/dell-15-dc15250-i5-1334u-price-nepal-onin-infosys\",\"accessed\":\"2026-11-23\"}]',NULL,'https://onin.com.np/product/dell-15-dc15250-i5-1334u-price-nepal-onin-infosys',0,'2026-11-22 18:15:00','2026-11-22 18:15:00'),(2585,9,3,'Dell 16 Plus DB16250 (Core Ultra 9 288V, 32GB/2TB)','dell-inspiron-16-plus-db16250-core-ultra-9-288v',NULL,'gadgets/2026/dell-inspiron-16-plus-db16250-core-ultra-9-288v.webp',NULL,NULL,299999.00,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,'available',NULL,0,0,'<p>The Dell 16 Plus DB16250, sold by ONIN Infosys as the Inspiron 16 Plus, is a big-screen productivity laptop configured to the maximum: <strong>Core Ultra 9 288V</strong>, <strong>32GB</strong> of LPDDR5x-8533 and a <strong>2TB</strong> SSD. It costs <strong>Rs 2,99,999</strong> with a 2-year warranty, in Ice Blue.</p>\n<p>The 288V is Intel\'s top Lunar Lake chip. It has 8 cores up to 5.1GHz, a <strong>48 TOPS NPU</strong> and <strong>Arc 140V</strong> graphics, which are strong enough for Lightroom, DaVinci Resolve proxies and light gaming. Its efficiency keeps the 64Wh battery going well. With 32GB and 2TB, you won\'t run out of room for big photo libraries or projects.</p>\n<p>The <strong>16-inch QHD+ display</strong> runs at 120Hz with 100% sRGB, Dolby Vision and ComfortView Plus. It\'s anti-glare at 300 nits, ideal for a long workday indoors. Ports are thoughtful: Thunderbolt 4, a 10Gbps USB-C, USB-A, HDMI 2.1 and a <strong>full-size SD card slot</strong> for photographers.</p>\n<p>It\'s worth asking whether you need this much. The <a href=\"/products/acer-aspire-14-ai-a14-52mt-94h5-2025-intel-core-ultra-9-288v-32gb-1tb-14-wuxga-touch\">Acer Aspire 14 AI</a> has the same chip and 32GB in a 14-inch body for about Rs 1,13,000 less. You\'re paying for the bigger 120Hz screen, 2TB and the Dell build.</p>','[{\"question\":\"What is the Dell 16 Plus DB16250 price in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"ONIN Infosys sells the Dell 16 Plus (Inspiron 16 Plus) DB16250 with Core Ultra 9 288V, 32GB RAM and 2TB SSD for Rs 2,99,999 with a 2-year warranty.\"},{\"question\":\"What display does the Dell 16 Plus have?\",\"answer\":\"A 16-inch QHD+ anti-glare panel at 120Hz with 100% sRGB, Dolby Vision and ComfortView Plus.\"},{\"question\":\"Does it have an SD card slot?\",\"answer\":\"Yes, a full-size SD card slot.\"}]','[{\"label\":\"ONIN Infosys \\u2013 Dell 16 Plus DB16250 (Core Ultra 9 288V, 32GB\\/2TB)\",\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/onin.com.np\\/product\\/dell-inspiron-16-plus-db16250-ultra-9-288v-price-nepal\",\"accessed\":\"2026-11-23\"}]',NULL,'https://onin.com.np/product/dell-inspiron-16-plus-db16250-ultra-9-288v-price-nepal',0,'2026-11-22 18:15:00','2026-11-22 18:15:00'),(2586,8,3,'HP 15-fc0130nia (Ryzen 3 7320U, 4GB/256GB)','hp-15-fc0130nia-ryzen-3-7320u',NULL,'gadgets/2026/hp-15-fc0130nia-ryzen-3-7320u.webp',NULL,NULL,62499.00,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,'available',NULL,0,0,'<p>The HP 15-fc0130nia is the cheapest laptop in our ONIN Infosys listings at <strong>Rs 62,499</strong>, and it\'s worth being clear about what that buys. It\'s an HP-built 15.6-inch laptop with a 4-core <strong>Ryzen 3 7320U</strong> (8 threads, up to 4.1GHz), a 256GB NVMe SSD and a Full HD anti-glare screen. That\'s a solid base for basic tasks.</p>\n<p>Two details matter. First, it has only <strong>4GB of LPDDR5 memory</strong>, and it\'s soldered. Windows 11 runs, but slowly once you open a few browser tabs, and you can\'t add more later. Second, it ships with <strong>FreeDOS</strong>, not Windows, so budget for a licence or ask the store about installation.</p>\n<p>Who is it actually right for? A single-purpose machine: a shop billing counter, a reception PC that runs one web app, a lightweight Linux box, or a child\'s first computer for typing practice and educational sites. For anything more, spend the extra on 8GB. The <a href=\"/products/acer-aspire-go-15-ag15-32p-39r2-2025-intel-core-3-n355-8gb-256gb-156-fhd\">Acer Aspire Go 15</a> costs about Rs 11,500 more with double the memory, and the <a href=\"/products/hp-15-fc0043nq-2024\">HP 15 with Ryzen 5</a> is a big step up.</p>','[{\"question\":\"What is the HP 15-fc0130nia price in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"ONIN Infosys sells the HP 15-fc0130nia with Ryzen 3 7320U, 4GB RAM and 256GB SSD for Rs 62,499.\"},{\"question\":\"Does the HP 15-fc0130nia come with Windows?\",\"answer\":\"No. ONIN lists it with FreeDOS, so Windows must be installed separately.\"},{\"question\":\"Is 4GB RAM enough?\",\"answer\":\"Only for very light, single-task use. The memory is soldered and cannot be upgraded.\"}]','[{\"label\":\"ONIN Infosys \\u2013 HP 15-fc0130nia (Ryzen 3 7320U, 4GB\\/256GB)\",\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/onin.com.np\\/product\\/hp-15-fc0130nia-ryzen-3-laptop-price-nepal\",\"accessed\":\"2026-11-23\"}]',NULL,'https://onin.com.np/product/hp-15-fc0130nia-ryzen-3-laptop-price-nepal',0,'2026-11-22 18:15:00','2026-11-22 18:15:00'),(2587,8,3,'HP 15 (Ryzen 7 7730U, 8GB/512GB)','hp-15-ryzen-7-7730u-8gb',NULL,'gadgets/2026/hp-15-ryzen-7-7730u-8gb.webp',NULL,NULL,106000.00,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,'available',NULL,0,0,'<p>This HP 15 swaps in an <strong>8-core, 16-thread Ryzen 7 7730U</strong> (up to 4.5GHz, 16MB cache). It\'s twice the cores of the Ryzen 5 model, which matters for compiling code, data analysis and multitasking. ONIN Infosys currently asks <strong>Rs 1,06,000</strong>.</p>\n<p>Unlike the Ryzen 5 HP 15s, its 8GB of DDR4-3200 sits on an <strong>SO-DIMM</strong>, so you can upgrade it. Adding a second 8GB stick for 16GB in dual channel is one of the cheapest ways to make this laptop noticeably quicker, and it also speeds up the integrated Radeon graphics. The 512GB NVMe SSD is standard.</p>\n<p>The rest is the familiar HP 15: a 15.6-inch FHD anti-glare panel at 250 nits, a full keyboard with number pad, a USB-C, two USB-A ports and HDMI, a 41Wh battery and about 1.59 kg in weight.</p>\n<p>If you\'d rather not open the laptop, the <a href=\"/products/acer-aspire-3-2023-ryzen-7-7730u\">Acer Aspire 3</a> and <a href=\"/products/lenovo-v15-g4-ryzen-7-7730u-16gb\">Lenovo V15 G4</a> come with 16GB and the same chip at similar prices.</p>','[{\"question\":\"What is the HP 15 Ryzen 7 7730U price in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"ONIN Infosys sells the HP 15 with Ryzen 7 7730U, 8GB DDR4 and 512GB SSD for Rs 1,06,000.\"},{\"question\":\"Can I upgrade the RAM on the HP 15 Ryzen 7?\",\"answer\":\"Yes. The 8GB is on an SO-DIMM module, so you can add or replace memory.\"},{\"question\":\"How many cores does the Ryzen 7 7730U have?\",\"answer\":\"8 cores and 16 threads, boosting to 4.5GHz.\"}]','[{\"label\":\"ONIN Infosys \\u2013 HP 15 (Ryzen 7 7730U, 8GB\\/512GB)\",\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/onin.com.np\\/product\\/hp-laptop-15-ryzen-7-7730u-price-nepal\",\"accessed\":\"2026-11-23\"}]',NULL,'https://onin.com.np/product/hp-laptop-15-ryzen-7-7730u-price-nepal',0,'2026-11-22 18:15:00','2026-11-22 18:15:00'),(2588,8,3,'HP 250R G10 (Core 5 120U, 24GB/512GB)','hp-250r-g10-core-5-120u-24gb',NULL,'gadgets/2026/hp-250r-g10-core-5-120u-24gb.webp',NULL,NULL,124999.00,135999.00,0,NULL,NULL,'available',NULL,0,0,'<p>Most business laptops at this price come with 8GB or 16GB. The HP 250R G10 at ONIN Infosys ships with <strong>24GB of DDR5-5200</strong>, and that\'s the reason to consider it. For finance teams living in big spreadsheets, developers running containers, or anyone who keeps 40 browser tabs open, that headroom keeps things smooth. It costs <strong>Rs 1,24,999</strong>.</p>\n<p>The <strong>Intel Core 5 120U</strong> (10 cores, 12 threads, up to 5.0GHz) is an efficient, cool-running chip for office work. The 512GB NVMe SSD is quick. Usefully, the USB-C port supports <strong>Power Delivery and DisplayPort 1.4</strong>, so a single cable can charge the laptop and run a monitor at a hot desk. There are also two USB-A ports, HDMI and a headset jack.</p>\n<p>HP\'s 250 series is designed for fleets: durable enough, easy to service, and anonymous in design. The 15.6-inch FHD screen is a basic 250-nit SVA panel, comfortable indoors but not vivid, and the 41Wh battery is average. If your work benefits more from a fast H-series CPU than from extra RAM, look at the <a href=\"/products/lenovo-v14-g5-irl-core-i7-13620h\">Lenovo V14 G5 with Core i7</a>.</p>','[{\"question\":\"What is the HP 250R G10 price in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"ONIN Infosys sells the HP 250R G10 with Core 5 120U, 24GB DDR5 and 512GB SSD for Rs 1,24,999.\"},{\"question\":\"Does the HP 250R G10 charge over USB-C?\",\"answer\":\"Yes. Its 10Gbps USB-C port supports USB Power Delivery and DisplayPort 1.4.\"},{\"question\":\"How much RAM does the HP 250R G10 have?\",\"answer\":\"24GB of DDR5-5200 in this configuration.\"}]','[{\"label\":\"ONIN Infosys \\u2013 HP 250R G10 (Core 5 120U, 24GB\\/512GB)\",\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/onin.com.np\\/product\\/hp-250r-g10-price-in-nepal-core-5-120u-24gb-ram\",\"accessed\":\"2026-11-23\"}]',NULL,'https://onin.com.np/product/hp-250r-g10-price-in-nepal-core-5-120u-24gb-ram',0,'2026-11-22 18:15:00','2026-11-22 18:15:00'),(2589,8,3,'HP OmniBook X Flip 14 2-in-1 (Core Ultra 5 226V, 16GB/512GB)','hp-omnibook-x-flip-14-core-ultra-5-226v',NULL,'gadgets/2026/hp-omnibook-x-flip-14-core-ultra-5-226v.webp',NULL,NULL,152499.00,158499.00,0,NULL,NULL,'available',NULL,0,0,'<p>The OmniBook X Flip is HP\'s AI-era convertible. The screen folds all the way back so you can use it as a tablet, prop it up as a tent for a recipe or presentation, or sketch on it. ONIN Infosys sells the Core Ultra 5 226V model for <strong>Rs 1,52,499</strong>.</p>\n<p>Intel\'s <strong>Core Ultra 5 226V</strong> (Lunar Lake) is built for efficiency. It has 8 cores, an NPU for Copilot+ features and <strong>Arc 130V</strong> graphics, with 16GB of LPDDR5X-8533 in the chip package. Combined with a 59Wh battery, that means long days of notes, documents and video without hunting for a socket.</p>\n<p>The 14-inch 1920 × 1200 touchscreen sits under <strong>Corning Gorilla Glass 3</strong>, reaches 400 nits, and is fine for pen input and media, though at 62.5% sRGB it isn\'t a colour-accurate panel. Ports are generous for a convertible: <strong>Thunderbolt 4</strong>, a second 10Gbps USB-C, two 10Gbps USB-A ports and HDMI 2.1.</p>\n<p>Comparing 2-in-1s? The <a href=\"/products/hp-omnibook-5-flip-14-fp0023-2025-intel-core-7-150u-16gb-512gb-14-2k-ips-touch\">OmniBook 5 Flip</a> costs about the same with a bigger 68Wh battery and a 5MP camera. The <a href=\"/products/dell-14-plus-2-in-1-db04255-2025-ryzen-ai-7-350-16gb-1tb-14-fhd\">Dell 14 Plus 2-in-1</a> adds a 1TB SSD.</p>','[{\"question\":\"What is the HP OmniBook X Flip price in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"ONIN Infosys sells the HP OmniBook X Flip 14 with Core Ultra 5 226V, 16GB LPDDR5X and 512GB SSD for Rs 1,52,499.\"},{\"question\":\"Is the HP OmniBook X Flip a 2-in-1?\",\"answer\":\"Yes. It is a 360-degree convertible with a 14-inch multitouch display under Gorilla Glass 3.\"},{\"question\":\"Does it have Thunderbolt 4?\",\"answer\":\"Yes, one Thunderbolt 4 port at 40Gbps, plus a second 10Gbps USB-C.\"}]','[{\"label\":\"ONIN Infosys \\u2013 HP OmniBook X Flip 14 2-in-1 (Core Ultra 5 226V, 16GB\\/512GB)\",\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/onin.com.np\\/product\\/hp-omnibook-ultra-flip-intel-core-ultra-5-price-nepal\",\"accessed\":\"2026-11-23\"}]',NULL,'https://onin.com.np/product/hp-omnibook-ultra-flip-intel-core-ultra-5-price-nepal',0,'2026-11-22 18:15:00','2026-11-22 18:15:00'),(2590,8,3,'HP Victus 15 (Core i5-13420H, RTX 4050 6GB)','hp-victus-15-i5-13420h-rtx-4050',NULL,'gadgets/2026/hp-victus-15-i5-13420h-rtx-4050.webp',NULL,NULL,167499.00,175499.00,0,NULL,NULL,'available',NULL,0,0,'<p>This Victus 15 keeps the same understated chassis as the RTX 3050 model and upgrades the parts that matter for gaming. It\'s on ONIN Infosys\'s shelf at <strong>Rs 1,67,499</strong>, with a free laptop bag.</p>\n<p>The <strong>RTX 4050 6GB</strong> brings DLSS 3 frame generation, which lifts frame rates in supported games well beyond what the RTX 3050 manages. Memory moves to <strong>16GB of DDR5-4800</strong>, and the battery grows to <strong>70Wh</strong>, a lot more time away from the socket. The 8-core <strong>Core i5-13420H</strong> and 512GB Gen 4 SSD carry over.</p>\n<p>Ports now include Ethernet and HDMI 2.1, plus a USB-C with DisplayPort and two USB-A ports (two support HP Sleep and Charge). It weighs 2.2 kg. The weak spot is the screen: a 144Hz FHD IPS panel at only 250 nits and 45% NTSC, so colours look flat. That\'s fine for games, not for photo editing.</p>\n<p>At this price, compare it with the <a href=\"/products/acer-nitro-v15-i7-13620h-rtx-4050\">Acer Nitro V 15 with i7 and RTX 4050</a>, which has a faster CPU for about Rs 13,500 more, and the <a href=\"/products/lenovo-loq-15-2025\">LOQ 15 with RTX 5050</a>.</p>','[{\"question\":\"What is the HP Victus 15 RTX 4050 price in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"ONIN Infosys sells the HP Victus 15 with Core i5-13420H, RTX 4050 6GB, 16GB DDR5 and 512GB SSD for Rs 1,67,499.\"},{\"question\":\"How big is the HP Victus 15 battery?\",\"answer\":\"70Wh in this RTX 4050 configuration.\"},{\"question\":\"Does the Victus 15 RTX 4050 have Ethernet?\",\"answer\":\"Yes, it has an RJ-45 Ethernet port.\"}]','[{\"label\":\"ONIN Infosys \\u2013 HP Victus 15 (Core i5-13420H, RTX 4050 6GB)\",\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/onin.com.np\\/product\\/hp-victus-15-i5-price-in-nepal\",\"accessed\":\"2026-11-23\"}]',NULL,'https://onin.com.np/product/hp-victus-15-i5-price-in-nepal',0,'2026-11-22 18:15:00','2026-11-22 18:15:00'),(2591,48,3,'MSI Venture 14 AI A1MG (Core Ultra 5 125H, 8GB/512GB)','msi-venture-14-ai-a1mg-core-ultra-5-125h',NULL,'gadgets/2026/msi-venture-14-ai-a1mg-core-ultra-5-125h.webp',NULL,NULL,119999.00,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,'available',NULL,0,0,'<p>The MSI Venture 14 AI is a compact work laptop with a 14-core <strong>Core Ultra 5 125H</strong> (18 threads, up to 4.5GHz), an AI NPU and <strong>Intel Arc</strong> graphics. ONIN Infosys lists it at <strong>Rs 1,19,999</strong>.</p>\n<p>The upgradeability is excellent. Memory uses <strong>two SO-DIMM slots</strong> and supports up to 96GB. It ships with a single 8GB DDR5-5600 stick, though, and that\'s the one thing we\'d change straight away. Intel Arc graphics need <strong>dual-channel memory</strong> to perform properly, so adding a second 8GB stick nearly doubles graphics performance and makes multitasking much smoother.</p>\n<p>The 14-inch FHD+ (1920 × 1200) IPS screen is a sensible 16:10. The 55.2Wh battery is solid, and the ports are complete: a 10Gbps USB-C with DisplayPort and charging, two USB-A ports, HDMI 2.1 (4K60) and <strong>Ethernet</strong>.</p>\n<p>The <a href=\"/products/acer-aspire-5-a514-54h-core-ultra-5-125h\">Acer Aspire 5 A514-54H</a> has the same chip with 16GB already installed for Rs 500 more. That\'s the better buy unless you plan a large memory upgrade.</p>','[{\"question\":\"What is the MSI Venture 14 AI price in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"ONIN Infosys sells the MSI Venture 14 AI A1MG with Core Ultra 5 125H, 8GB DDR5 and 512GB SSD for Rs 1,19,999.\"},{\"question\":\"How much RAM can the MSI Venture 14 AI take?\",\"answer\":\"Up to 96GB across two DDR5 SO-DIMM slots.\"},{\"question\":\"Why add a second RAM stick?\",\"answer\":\"Intel Arc integrated graphics need dual-channel memory for full performance, and 16GB is better for multitasking.\"}]','[{\"label\":\"ONIN Infosys \\u2013 MSI Venture 14 AI A1MG (Core Ultra 5 125H, 8GB\\/512GB)\",\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/onin.com.np\\/product\\/msi-venture-14-ai-a1mg-ultra-5-price-nepal\",\"accessed\":\"2026-11-23\"}]',NULL,'https://onin.com.np/product/msi-venture-14-ai-a1mg-ultra-5-price-nepal',0,'2026-11-22 18:15:00','2026-11-22 18:15:00'),(2592,48,3,'MSI Cyborg 15 B2RWEKG (Core 7 240H, RTX 5050)','msi-cyborg-15-b2rwekg-core-7-240h-rtx-5050',NULL,'gadgets/2026/msi-cyborg-15-b2rwekg-core-7-240h-rtx-5050.webp',NULL,NULL,214999.00,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,'available',NULL,0,0,'<p>The MSI Cyborg 15 has one of the most distinctive designs in gaming laptops: a semi-translucent, sci-fi look that stands out on a desk. ONIN Infosys sells the B2RWEKG for <strong>Rs 2,14,999</strong>, with Intel\'s <strong>Core 7 240H</strong> (10 cores, 16 threads, up to 5.2GHz), an <strong>RTX 5050 8GB</strong>, 16GB DDR5 and a 512GB SSD.</p>\n<p>Before you buy, know this: the RTX 5050 here is limited to <strong>45W maximum graphics power</strong>. That\'s less than half what the same GPU gets in the <a href=\"/products/lenovo-loq-15-2025\">Lenovo LOQ 15 (100W)</a> or the <a href=\"/products/asus-tuf-f16-fx608-i5-14450hx-rtx-5050\">ASUS TUF F16 (115W)</a>, and frame rates in demanding games will be noticeably lower. In return, it runs cooler and quieter and is easier on the battery.</p>\n<p>The rest is fine. You get a 15.6-inch FHD 144Hz IPS screen, 16GB DDR5-5600 in two slots (up to 64GB), a 55.2Wh battery, and USB-C with DisplayPort, two USB-A ports, HDMI (4K60) and Ethernet.</p>\n<p>Who should buy it? Players who mainly run esports titles and love the look. For maximum frame rates at this price, the LOQ or TUF are clearly faster and cheaper.</p>','[{\"question\":\"What is the MSI Cyborg 15 B2RWEKG price in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"ONIN Infosys sells the MSI Cyborg 15 B2RWEKG with Core 7 240H, RTX 5050 8GB, 16GB DDR5 and 512GB SSD for Rs 2,14,999.\"},{\"question\":\"What is the GPU power of the RTX 5050 in the MSI Cyborg 15?\",\"answer\":\"Up to 45W maximum graphics power with Dynamic Boost, lower than most RTX 5050 laptops.\"},{\"question\":\"Can I upgrade the RAM?\",\"answer\":\"Yes. It has two DDR5 slots supporting up to 64GB.\"}]','[{\"label\":\"ONIN Infosys \\u2013 MSI Cyborg 15 B2RWEKG (Core 7 240H, RTX 5050)\",\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/onin.com.np\\/product\\/msi-cyborg-15-b2rwekg-price-nepal\",\"accessed\":\"2026-11-23\"}]',NULL,'https://onin.com.np/product/msi-cyborg-15-b2rwekg-price-nepal',0,'2026-11-22 18:15:00','2026-11-22 18:15:00'),(2593,48,3,'MSI Cyborg A15 AI B2HWEKG (Ryzen 7 260, RTX 5050)','msi-cyborg-a15-ai-b2hwekg-ryzen-7-260-rtx-5050',NULL,'gadgets/2026/msi-cyborg-a15-ai-b2hwekg-ryzen-7-260-rtx-5050.webp',NULL,NULL,214999.00,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,'available',NULL,0,0,'<p>The Cyborg A15 AI is the AMD twin of the <a href=\"/products/msi-cyborg-15-b2rwekg-core-7-240h-rtx-5050\">Cyborg 15</a>, with the same translucent styling and the same <strong>Rs 2,14,999</strong> price at ONIN Infosys. The difference is the processor: AMD\'s <strong>Ryzen 7 260</strong>, with 8 cores, 16 threads and up to 5.1GHz, plus Ryzen AI acceleration.</p>\n<p>The Ryzen chip is slightly stronger in multi-threaded work and tends to be more efficient on battery. Otherwise the two are nearly identical: an <strong>RTX 5050 8GB</strong> limited to <strong>45W</strong>, 16GB DDR5-5600 (two slots, up to 96GB), a 512GB PCIe Gen 4 SSD, a 15.6-inch FHD 144Hz IPS screen and a 55.2Wh battery. Ports are a USB-C with DisplayPort and charging, two USB-A ports and HDMI 2.1. Note that ONIN doesn\'t list Ethernet on this model.</p>\n<p>The same caution applies as with the Intel version. 45W is a low ceiling for the RTX 5050, so if you want maximum frame rates, the <a href=\"/products/lenovo-loq-15ahp10-ryzen-7-250\">Lenovo LOQ 15AHP10</a> uses a similar Ryzen chip with a 100W RTX 5050 for less money. Choose the Cyborg for its looks and its cooler, quieter running.</p>','[{\"question\":\"What is the MSI Cyborg A15 AI price in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"ONIN Infosys sells the MSI Cyborg A15 AI B2HWEKG with Ryzen 7 260, RTX 5050 8GB, 16GB DDR5 and 512GB SSD for Rs 2,14,999.\"},{\"question\":\"What is the difference between the Cyborg 15 and Cyborg A15 AI?\",\"answer\":\"The A15 AI uses an AMD Ryzen 7 260 instead of Intel\'s Core 7 240H. Both have a 45W RTX 5050, 16GB DDR5 and a 144Hz screen at the same price.\"},{\"question\":\"How much RAM can it take?\",\"answer\":\"Up to 96GB across two DDR5 slots.\"}]','[{\"label\":\"ONIN Infosys \\u2013 MSI Cyborg A15 AI B2HWEKG (Ryzen 7 260, RTX 5050)\",\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/onin.com.np\\/product\\/msi-cyborg-a15-ai-b2hwekg-price-nepal\",\"accessed\":\"2026-11-23\"}]',NULL,'https://onin.com.np/product/msi-cyborg-a15-ai-b2hwekg-price-nepal',0,'2026-11-22 18:15:00','2026-11-22 18:15:00'),(2594,98,38,'BenQ GW2491 24\" FHD IPS 100Hz Eye-Care Monitor','benq-gw2491-24-inch-ips-100hz',NULL,'gadgets/2026/benq-gw2491-24-inch-ips-100hz.webp',NULL,NULL,18499.00,18800.00,0,NULL,NULL,'available',NULL,0,0,'<p>BenQ built its reputation on eye-care monitors, and the GW2491 is the most affordable way into that range at ONIN Infosys: <strong>Rs 18,499</strong> for a 23.8-inch Full HD IPS screen.</p>\n<p>It covers <strong>99% sRGB</strong>, so colours are accurate enough for photo browsing, design students and online shopping where \"what colour is this, really?\" matters. It runs at 100Hz with a 5 ms response time. BenQ\'s flicker-free backlight and low-blue-light modes make long study or work sessions easier on the eyes. The frameless design looks great as a pair in a dual-monitor setup.</p>\n<p>You get HDMI and DisplayPort, plus a headphone jack. There are <strong>no speakers</strong>, which is a deliberate choice for people who use headphones or desk speakers anyway. If you want them built in, the <a href=\"/products/benq-gw2490-24-inch-ips-100hz-speakers\">BenQ GW2490</a> adds 2W × 2 speakers for about Rs 3,000 more.</p>','[{\"question\":\"What is the BenQ GW2491 price in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"ONIN Infosys sells the BenQ GW2491 23.8-inch FHD IPS 100Hz monitor for Rs 18,499.\"},{\"question\":\"Does the BenQ GW2491 have speakers?\",\"answer\":\"No. It has a headphone jack for audio output.\"},{\"question\":\"What inputs does the BenQ GW2491 have?\",\"answer\":\"One HDMI 1.4 and one DisplayPort 1.2.\"}]','[{\"label\":\"ONIN Infosys \\u2013 BenQ GW2491 24\\\" FHD IPS 100Hz Eye-Care Monitor\",\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/onin.com.np\\/product\\/benq-gw2491-24-fhd-ips-monitor-price-nepal\",\"accessed\":\"2026-11-23\"}]',NULL,'https://onin.com.np/product/benq-gw2491-24-fhd-ips-monitor-price-nepal',0,'2026-11-22 18:15:00','2026-11-22 18:15:00'),(2595,98,38,'BenQ GW2490 24\" FHD IPS 100Hz Monitor with Speakers','benq-gw2490-24-inch-ips-100hz-speakers',NULL,'gadgets/2026/benq-gw2490-24-inch-ips-100hz-speakers.webp',NULL,NULL,21499.00,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,'available',NULL,0,0,'<p>The BenQ GW2490 is the GW2491 with one addition many people want: <strong>built-in 2W × 2 stereo speakers</strong>. For Zoom calls, YouTube tutorials and system sounds, that means one less thing on your desk. It\'s on ONIN Infosys\'s shelf at <strong>Rs 21,499</strong>.</p>\n<p>The rest is classic BenQ eye-care: a 23.8-inch Full HD IPS panel with 99% sRGB coverage, a <strong>100Hz</strong> refresh rate, a 5 ms response time and a flicker-free, low-blue-light backlight. Inputs are generous for the price: HDMI, DisplayPort and VGA, plus an audio-out jack. It\'s VESA-mountable with slim bezels.</p>\n<p>If you\'ll always use headphones or proper desk speakers, save Rs 3,000 with the <a href=\"/products/benq-gw2491-24-inch-ips-100hz\">GW2491</a>. If you want a height-adjustable stand, look at the <a href=\"/products/benq-gw2490t-24-inch-ergonomic-100hz\">GW2490T</a>.</p>','[{\"question\":\"What is the BenQ GW2490 price in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"ONIN Infosys sells the BenQ GW2490 23.8-inch FHD IPS 100Hz monitor with built-in speakers for Rs 21,499.\"},{\"question\":\"Does the BenQ GW2490 have speakers?\",\"answer\":\"Yes, built-in 2W \\u00d7 2 stereo speakers.\"},{\"question\":\"What colour coverage does it have?\",\"answer\":\"99% sRGB.\"}]','[{\"label\":\"ONIN Infosys \\u2013 BenQ GW2490 24\\\" FHD IPS 100Hz Monitor with Speakers\",\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/onin.com.np\\/product\\/benq-gw2490-24-inch-monitor-nepal\",\"accessed\":\"2026-11-23\"}]',NULL,'https://onin.com.np/product/benq-gw2490-24-inch-monitor-nepal',1,'2026-11-22 18:15:00','2026-11-22 18:15:00'),(2596,98,38,'BenQ GW2490C 23.8\" FHD 144Hz USB-C Eye-Care Monitor','benq-gw2490c-24-inch-144hz-usb-c',NULL,'gadgets/2026/benq-gw2490c-24-inch-144hz-usb-c.webp',NULL,NULL,22999.00,23300.00,0,NULL,NULL,'available',NULL,0,0,'<p>Most modern laptops output video over USB-C, and the BenQ GW2490C is one of the cheapest monitors in Nepal that takes it directly: plug one USB-C cable from a MacBook or ultrabook and you get a picture, no HDMI adapter needed. ONIN Infosys has it at <strong>Rs 22,999</strong>.</p>\n<p>It\'s also faster than BenQ\'s other office monitors at <strong>144Hz</strong> with FreeSync, so it doubles as a capable casual gaming screen. The 23.8-inch Full HD IPS panel covers 99% sRGB with 250 nits and 1500:1 contrast. BenQ\'s Eye-Care Triple Protection (flicker-free, Low Blue Light Plus and Visual Optimizer) is on board, with ePaper and colour-weakness modes.</p>\n<p>Inputs are HDMI 1.4, DisplayPort 1.2, USB-C (DisplayPort Alt Mode plus data) and a headphone jack. Note that ONIN\'s listing doesn\'t mention laptop charging over USB-C. If you want one cable to power your laptop too, look at the <a href=\"/products/benq-ew270q-27-inch-2k-200hz-usb-c\">BenQ EW270Q with 65W USB-C</a>.</p>','[{\"question\":\"What is the BenQ GW2490C price in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"ONIN Infosys sells the BenQ GW2490C 23.8-inch FHD 144Hz IPS USB-C monitor for Rs 22,999.\"},{\"question\":\"Can I connect a MacBook to the BenQ GW2490C with USB-C?\",\"answer\":\"Yes. Its USB-C port supports DisplayPort Alt Mode for video.\"},{\"question\":\"What refresh rate is the GW2490C?\",\"answer\":\"144Hz with FreeSync.\"}]','[{\"label\":\"ONIN Infosys \\u2013 BenQ GW2490C 23.8\\\" FHD 144Hz USB-C Eye-Care Monitor\",\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/onin.com.np\\/product\\/benq-gw2490c-price-in-nepal\",\"accessed\":\"2026-11-23\"}]',NULL,'https://onin.com.np/product/benq-gw2490c-price-in-nepal',0,'2026-11-22 18:15:00','2026-11-22 18:15:00'),(2597,98,38,'BenQ GW2490T 23.8\" FHD 100Hz Ergonomic Eye-Care Monitor','benq-gw2490t-24-inch-ergonomic-100hz',NULL,'gadgets/2026/benq-gw2490t-24-inch-ergonomic-100hz.webp',NULL,NULL,26499.00,27499.00,0,NULL,NULL,'available',NULL,0,0,'<p>If you spend eight hours a day at a screen, the stand matters as much as the panel. The BenQ GW2490T\'s main upgrade over cheaper 24-inch monitors is a fully adjustable stand. It offers <strong>110 mm height adjustment</strong>, 90° pivot into portrait, 20° swivel and tilt. The price at ONIN Infosys is <strong>Rs 26,499</strong>.</p>\n<p>Getting the top of the screen to eye level is the single best thing you can do for neck strain. Portrait mode is great for coding, reading long documents or scrolling social feeds. Underneath is BenQ\'s familiar eye-care panel: 23.8-inch Full HD IPS, 99% sRGB, 100Hz, TÜV-certified flicker-free and Low Blue Light Plus. There\'s also <strong>Brightness Intelligence Gen2</strong>, which adjusts brightness automatically to your room.</p>\n<p>Inputs are two HDMI and one DisplayPort. If you\'d like USB-C, a webcam-friendly microphone and USB ports as well, the <a href=\"/products/benq-gw2486tc-24-inch-usb-c-height-adjust\">BenQ GW2486TC</a> costs about Rs 4,500 more.</p>','[{\"question\":\"What is the BenQ GW2490T price in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"ONIN Infosys sells the BenQ GW2490T 23.8-inch FHD IPS 100Hz ergonomic monitor for Rs 26,499.\"},{\"question\":\"Is the BenQ GW2490T height adjustable?\",\"answer\":\"Yes. It offers 110 mm of height adjustment, 90\\u00b0 pivot, 20\\u00b0 swivel and -5\\u00b0 to 20\\u00b0 tilt.\"},{\"question\":\"What inputs does the GW2490T have?\",\"answer\":\"Two HDMI 1.4 ports and one DisplayPort 1.2.\"}]','[{\"label\":\"ONIN Infosys \\u2013 BenQ GW2490T 23.8\\\" FHD 100Hz Ergonomic Eye-Care Monitor\",\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/onin.com.np\\/product\\/benq-gw2490t-100hz-eye-care-monitor-price-nepal\",\"accessed\":\"2026-11-23\"}]',NULL,'https://onin.com.np/product/benq-gw2490t-100hz-eye-care-monitor-price-nepal',0,'2026-11-22 18:15:00','2026-11-22 18:15:00'),(2598,98,38,'BenQ ZOWIE XL2411K 24\" 144Hz Esports Monitor','benq-zowie-xl2411k-24-inch-144hz-tn',NULL,'gadgets/2026/benq-zowie-xl2411k-24-inch-144hz-tn.webp',NULL,NULL,27999.00,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,'available',NULL,0,0,'<p>Walk into a serious esports tournament and you\'ll see BenQ\'s ZOWIE XL monitors on the tables. The XL2411K is the entry model in that line, built for one job: competitive shooters. It\'s on ONIN Infosys\'s shelf at <strong>Rs 27,999</strong>.</p>\n<p>It uses a <strong>TN</strong> panel at <strong>144Hz</strong>. TN looks less colourful than IPS from an angle, but it\'s very responsive, and BenQ adds <strong>DyAc</strong> motion-blur reduction, so enemies stay sharp during fast flicks in Valorant and CS2. <strong>Black eQualizer</strong> brightens dark corners without washing out the whole image, and Color Vibrance lets you tune saturation for visibility. FreeSync Premium is supported.</p>\n<p>The stand is pro-grade: 155 mm of height adjustment, 45° swivel each way and tilt, so it\'s easy to match tournament setups. Inputs are HDMI 2.0, DisplayPort 1.2 and DVI-DL. Brightness is 320 nits.</p>\n<p>For movies, photo editing or story games, an IPS screen like the <a href=\"/products/msi-mag-256f-24-5-inch-180hz\">MSI MAG 256F</a> will look better. For ranked matches, this is the tool.</p>','[{\"question\":\"What is the BenQ XL2411K price in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"ONIN Infosys sells the BenQ XL2411K 24-inch FHD 144Hz esports monitor for Rs 27,999.\"},{\"question\":\"What is DyAc on the BenQ XL2411K?\",\"answer\":\"Dynamic Accuracy, BenQ\'s motion-blur reduction technology, which keeps fast movement clearer in competitive games.\"},{\"question\":\"Is the BenQ XL2411K height adjustable?\",\"answer\":\"Yes, with 155 mm of height adjustment, 45\\u00b0 swivel and tilt.\"}]','[{\"label\":\"ONIN Infosys \\u2013 BenQ ZOWIE XL2411K 24\\\" 144Hz Esports Monitor\",\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/onin.com.np\\/product\\/benq-xl2411k-monitor-price-in-nepal\",\"accessed\":\"2026-11-23\"}]',NULL,'https://onin.com.np/product/benq-xl2411k-monitor-price-in-nepal',0,'2026-11-22 18:15:00','2026-11-22 18:15:00'),(2599,98,38,'BenQ GW2790T 27\" FHD IPS Eye-Care Monitor with Adjustable Stand','benq-gw2790t-27-inch-ergonomic-100hz',NULL,'gadgets/2026/benq-gw2790t-27-inch-ergonomic-100hz.webp',NULL,NULL,30499.00,30999.00,0,NULL,NULL,'available',NULL,0,0,'<p>The BenQ GW2790T is the 27-inch version of BenQ\'s ergonomic eye-care monitor. It has a bigger screen for spreadsheets and side-by-side windows, and the same adjustable stand that makes long workdays more comfortable. ONIN Infosys lists it at <strong>Rs 30,499</strong>.</p>\n<p>The frameless 27-inch Full HD IPS panel covers <strong>99% sRGB</strong> with 250 nits and 1300:1 contrast, and runs at <strong>100Hz</strong> with a 5 ms response time. It has TÜV-certified flicker-free and low-blue-light hardware, so the protection is built into the backlight rather than relying on a software filter. Built-in 2 × 1W speakers handle calls.</p>\n<p>The stand adjusts for height and pivots 90° into portrait, a real plus for reading, coding or vertical design work. If you prefer a sharper image at this size, the <a href=\"/products/benq-gw2790q-27-inch-qhd-100hz\">BenQ GW2790Q</a> moves to 2560 × 1440 for about Rs 5,000 more, though without the height-adjustable stand.</p>','[{\"question\":\"What is the BenQ GW2790T price in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"ONIN Infosys sells the BenQ GW2790T 27-inch FHD IPS 100Hz monitor for Rs 30,499.\"},{\"question\":\"Can the BenQ GW2790T rotate to portrait?\",\"answer\":\"Yes. Its stand is height adjustable and pivots 90\\u00b0.\"},{\"question\":\"Does it have speakers?\",\"answer\":\"Yes, 2 \\u00d7 1W stereo speakers.\"}]','[{\"label\":\"ONIN Infosys \\u2013 BenQ GW2790T 27\\\" FHD IPS Eye-Care Monitor with Adjustable Stand\",\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/onin.com.np\\/product\\/benq-gw2790t-27-inch-fhd-ips-monitor-nepal\",\"accessed\":\"2026-11-23\"}]',NULL,'https://onin.com.np/product/benq-gw2790t-27-inch-fhd-ips-monitor-nepal',0,'2026-11-22 18:15:00','2026-11-22 18:15:00'),(2600,98,38,'BenQ GW2486TC 24\" FHD IPS USB-C Monitor (White)','benq-gw2486tc-24-inch-usb-c-height-adjust',NULL,'gadgets/2026/benq-gw2486tc-24-inch-usb-c-height-adjust.webp',NULL,NULL,30999.00,32499.00,0,NULL,NULL,'available',NULL,0,0,'<p>The white BenQ GW2486TC is built for the modern laptop desk. One <strong>USB-C</strong> cable carries video from your laptop, and the monitor\'s own <strong>USB-A ports</strong> connect your keyboard and mouse. It also has a <strong>built-in microphone</strong> and speakers for video calls. The price at ONIN Infosys is <strong>Rs 30,999</strong>.</p>\n<p>The panel is BenQ\'s reliable 23.8-inch Full HD IPS with 99% sRGB, 100Hz, a 5 ms response time and 1300:1 contrast, with flicker-free and low-blue-light eye care. The stand is <strong>height adjustable</strong>, so you can set it at a healthy eye level. The white finish looks great in a bright home office.</p>\n<p>Inputs are HDMI 1.4, DisplayPort 1.2 and USB-C, plus two USB-A ports. ONIN\'s listing doesn\'t specify USB-C laptop charging wattage, so plan to keep your laptop charger. For a bigger 27-inch version with the same features, see the <a href=\"/products/benq-gw2786tc-27-inch-usb-c-mic-white\">BenQ GW2786TC</a>.</p>','[{\"question\":\"What is the BenQ GW2486TC price in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"ONIN Infosys sells the BenQ GW2486TC (White) 23.8-inch FHD IPS 100Hz USB-C monitor for Rs 30,999.\"},{\"question\":\"Does the BenQ GW2486TC have a microphone?\",\"answer\":\"Yes, it has a built-in microphone and 2 \\u00d7 1W speakers for video calls.\"},{\"question\":\"What ports does the GW2486TC have?\",\"answer\":\"HDMI 1.4, DisplayPort 1.2, USB-C and two USB-A ports.\"}]','[{\"label\":\"ONIN Infosys \\u2013 BenQ GW2486TC 24\\\" FHD IPS USB-C Monitor (White)\",\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/onin.com.np\\/product\\/benq-gw2486tc-24-inch-monitor-price-nepal\",\"accessed\":\"2026-11-23\"}]',NULL,'https://onin.com.np/product/benq-gw2486tc-24-inch-monitor-price-nepal',0,'2026-11-22 18:15:00','2026-11-22 18:15:00'),(2601,98,38,'BenQ GW2790Q 27\" 2K QHD 100Hz Eye-Care IPS Monitor','benq-gw2790q-27-inch-qhd-100hz',NULL,'gadgets/2026/benq-gw2790q-27-inch-qhd-100hz.webp',NULL,NULL,35499.00,36499.00,0,NULL,NULL,'available',NULL,0,0,'<p>A 27-inch screen at <strong>2K QHD (2560 × 1440)</strong> gives you about 77% more workspace than Full HD. That\'s enough to put a document and a browser side by side comfortably, and text looks noticeably sharper. The BenQ GW2790Q is one of the most affordable ways to get there, at <strong>Rs 35,499</strong> from ONIN Infosys with a <strong>2-year warranty</strong>.</p>\n<p>The IPS panel is brighter than BenQ\'s entry models at <strong>350 nits</strong>, covers 99% sRGB, and runs at <strong>100Hz</strong> with a 5 ms response time. BenQ\'s eye-care set (flicker-free, low blue light) is built in, and 2W × 2 speakers handle calls. Inputs are two HDMI 2.0 and one DisplayPort.</p>\n<p>The stand tilts only, so if you need height adjustment, add an arm. For a gaming-focused alternative at the same price, the <a href=\"/products/msi-mag-275qf-27-inch-qhd-180hz\">MSI MAG 275QF</a> runs at 180Hz but has no speakers. For a sharper image still, see the 4K <a href=\"/products/msi-pro-mp273u-27-inch-4k\">MSI PRO MP273U</a>.</p>','[{\"question\":\"What is the BenQ GW2790Q price in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"ONIN Infosys sells the BenQ GW2790Q 27-inch 2K QHD 100Hz IPS monitor for Rs 35,499 with a 2-year warranty.\"},{\"question\":\"What resolution is the BenQ GW2790Q?\",\"answer\":\"2560 \\u00d7 1440 (QHD) on a 27-inch IPS panel.\"},{\"question\":\"Does it have speakers?\",\"answer\":\"Yes, built-in 2W \\u00d7 2 speakers.\"}]','[{\"label\":\"ONIN Infosys \\u2013 BenQ GW2790Q 27\\\" 2K QHD 100Hz Eye-Care IPS Monitor\",\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/onin.com.np\\/product\\/benq-gw2790q-27-inch-2k-qhd-100hz-ips-monitor-price-nepal\",\"accessed\":\"2026-11-23\"}]',NULL,'https://onin.com.np/product/benq-gw2790q-27-inch-2k-qhd-100hz-ips-monitor-price-nepal',0,'2026-11-22 18:15:00','2026-11-22 18:15:00'),(2602,98,38,'BenQ GW2786TC 27\" FHD IPS USB-C Monitor (White)','benq-gw2786tc-27-inch-usb-c-mic-white',NULL,'gadgets/2026/benq-gw2786tc-27-inch-usb-c-mic-white.webp',NULL,NULL,39999.00,41499.00,0,NULL,NULL,'available',NULL,0,0,'<p>The BenQ GW2786TC is a one-cable home office in white. Its <strong>USB-C port delivers 60W</strong>, enough to charge most ultrabooks while carrying video, and there\'s a built-in <strong>noise-cancelling microphone</strong> and 2 × 1W speakers for calls. The price at ONIN Infosys is <strong>Rs 39,999</strong>.</p>\n<p>The 27-inch Full HD IPS panel covers 99% sRGB and runs at 100Hz with a 5 ms response time, with BenQ\'s flicker-free and low-blue-light eye care. The stand is <strong>height adjustable</strong>, and the frameless white design suits a clean, bright workspace. Inputs are USB-C, HDMI and DisplayPort, plus audio out.</p>\n<p>The main question is resolution. At 27 inches, Full HD text is a little soft. If you spend all day in documents, the <a href=\"/products/benq-ew270q-27-inch-2k-200hz-usb-c\">BenQ EW270Q</a> moves to QHD with 65W USB-C for only Rs 1,300 more, though it lacks the mic and height adjustment. For the same features in a 24-inch size, see the <a href=\"/products/benq-gw2486tc-24-inch-usb-c-height-adjust\">GW2486TC</a>.</p>','[{\"question\":\"What is the BenQ GW2786TC price in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"ONIN Infosys sells the BenQ GW2786TC (White) 27-inch FHD IPS USB-C monitor for Rs 39,999.\"},{\"question\":\"Can the BenQ GW2786TC charge a laptop?\",\"answer\":\"Yes. Its USB-C port supplies up to 60W Power Delivery.\"},{\"question\":\"Does it have a microphone?\",\"answer\":\"Yes, a built-in noise-cancelling microphone.\"}]','[{\"label\":\"ONIN Infosys \\u2013 BenQ GW2786TC 27\\\" FHD IPS USB-C Monitor (White)\",\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/onin.com.np\\/product\\/benq-gw2786tc-27-monitor-usb-c-price-nepal\",\"accessed\":\"2026-11-23\"}]',NULL,'https://onin.com.np/product/benq-gw2786tc-27-monitor-usb-c-price-nepal',0,'2026-11-22 18:15:00','2026-11-22 18:15:00'),(2603,98,38,'BenQ EW270Q 27\" 2K QHD 200Hz Monitor with 65W USB-C (White)','benq-ew270q-27-inch-2k-200hz-usb-c',NULL,'gadgets/2026/benq-ew270q-27-inch-2k-200hz-usb-c.webp',NULL,NULL,41299.00,42999.00,0,NULL,NULL,'available',NULL,0,0,'<p>The BenQ EW270Q is a rare all-rounder: a <strong>27-inch QHD</strong> IPS panel at <strong>200Hz</strong>, <strong>65W USB-C</strong> to charge and connect a laptop with one cable, and loud <strong>5W × 2 speakers</strong>. It works as well for gaming in the evening as for spreadsheets during the day. ONIN Infosys sells it in white for <strong>Rs 41,299</strong>.</p>\n<p>The picture is good: 350 nits, 90% DCI-P3, HDR10 with BenQ\'s HDRi tuning, and a 1 ms response time with FreeSync Premium. A matte anti-glare finish and TÜV-certified flicker-free and low-blue-light eye care keep long sessions comfortable. Inputs are USB-C, HDMI and DisplayPort. The stand tilts and swivels, and it\'s VESA compatible.</p>\n<p>For a laptop user who also games on a desktop or console, it\'s hard to beat at this price. A pure gamer could save a little with the <a href=\"/products/msi-mag-275qf-27-inch-qhd-180hz\">MSI MAG 275QF</a>. A pure office user might prefer the height-adjustable <a href=\"/products/benq-gw2786tc-27-inch-usb-c-mic-white\">GW2786TC</a> with its built-in mic.</p>','[{\"question\":\"What is the BenQ EW270Q price in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"ONIN Infosys sells the BenQ EW270Q 27-inch QHD 200Hz IPS monitor with 65W USB-C for Rs 41,299.\"},{\"question\":\"Can the BenQ EW270Q charge a laptop over USB-C?\",\"answer\":\"Yes, with up to 65W Power Delivery.\"},{\"question\":\"What refresh rate is the EW270Q?\",\"answer\":\"200Hz with a 1 ms response time and FreeSync Premium.\"}]','[{\"label\":\"ONIN Infosys \\u2013 BenQ EW270Q 27\\\" 2K QHD 200Hz Monitor with 65W USB-C (White)\",\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/onin.com.np\\/product\\/benq-ew270q-monitor-price-in-nepal\",\"accessed\":\"2026-11-23\"}]',NULL,'https://onin.com.np/product/benq-ew270q-monitor-price-in-nepal',0,'2026-11-22 18:15:00','2026-11-22 18:15:00'),(2604,98,38,'BenQ EW2790U 27\" 4K UHD USB-C Eye-Care Monitor (White)','benq-ew2790u-27-inch-4k-usb-c',NULL,'gadgets/2026/benq-ew2790u-27-inch-4k-usb-c.webp',NULL,NULL,67499.00,68999.00,0,NULL,NULL,'available',NULL,0,0,'<p>The BenQ EW2790U is a 4K monitor designed for home: films, photos, a little work and good sound. ONIN Infosys sells it in white for <strong>Rs 67,499</strong>.</p>\n<p>The 27-inch <strong>4K (3840 × 2160)</strong> IPS panel covers <strong>95% DCI-P3</strong> and is <strong>VESA DisplayHDR 400</strong> certified, with 350 nits typical and 400 nits peak. HDR video and photos have real punch for a monitor at this price. The <strong>treVolo 5W × 2 speakers</strong> are among the better ones built into any monitor, with six sound modes for movies, music and games. USB-C carries video from a laptop, and Brightness Intelligence Gen2 adjusts brightness to your room automatically.</p>\n<p>The stand is properly adjustable: 110 mm of height, tilt, swivel and 90° pivot. Refresh rate is 60Hz, so this isn\'t a fast gaming monitor. For high refresh at 4K, see the <a href=\"/products/msi-mag-275upd-e14-27-inch-4k-dual-mode\">MSI MAG 275UPD</a>. For laptop charging at 90W and Mac colour matching, the <a href=\"/products/benq-ma270u-27-4k-mac-monitor\">BenQ MA270U</a> is the step up.</p>','[{\"question\":\"What is the BenQ EW2790U price in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"ONIN Infosys sells the BenQ EW2790U (White) 27-inch 4K USB-C monitor for Rs 67,499.\"},{\"question\":\"Is the BenQ EW2790U HDR certified?\",\"answer\":\"Yes, VESA DisplayHDR 400, with up to 400 nits peak brightness.\"},{\"question\":\"Is the stand adjustable?\",\"answer\":\"Yes, with 110 mm height adjustment, tilt, swivel and 90\\u00b0 pivot.\"}]','[{\"label\":\"ONIN Infosys \\u2013 BenQ EW2790U 27\\\" 4K UHD USB-C Eye-Care Monitor (White)\",\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/onin.com.np\\/product\\/benq-ew2790u-27-4k-usb-c-eye-care-nepal\",\"accessed\":\"2026-11-23\"}]',NULL,'https://onin.com.np/product/benq-ew2790u-27-4k-usb-c-eye-care-nepal',0,'2026-11-22 18:15:00','2026-11-22 18:15:00'),(2605,98,38,'BenQ DesignVue PD2706QN 27\" QHD Designer Monitor','benq-designvue-pd2706qn-27-inch-qhd',NULL,'gadgets/2026/benq-designvue-pd2706qn-27-inch-qhd.webp',NULL,NULL,71499.00,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,'available',NULL,0,0,'<p>BenQ\'s DesignVue line is aimed at designers, architects and video editors who need colours they can trust. The PD2706QN is the QHD entry point at <strong>Rs 71,499</strong> from ONIN Infosys.</p>\n<p>The 27-inch <strong>2560 × 1440</strong> IPS panel covers 100% sRGB, 100% Rec.709 and 95% DCI-P3, and arrives <strong>Pantone Validated, Pantone SkinTone Validated and Calman Verified</strong>. A <strong>Nano Matte</strong> coating cuts reflections without the grainy look of cheap matte screens. It runs at 100Hz, with 350 nits and HDR10.</p>\n<p>It\'s also a docking station. A single <strong>USB-C cable delivers 90W</strong> to charge a laptop while carrying video and data, and the monitor adds USB-A downstream ports plus USB-C out for daisy-chaining a second screen (MST). The stand adjusts height (115 mm), pivot, swivel and tilt.</p>\n<p>If you work in print or video at 4K, step up to the <a href=\"/products/benq-designvue-pd2705u-27-inch-4k\">PD2705U</a>. For QHD design work on a budget, this is a superb buy.</p>','[{\"question\":\"What is the BenQ PD2706QN price in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"ONIN Infosys sells the BenQ DesignVue PD2706QN 27-inch QHD designer monitor for Rs 71,499.\"},{\"question\":\"Can the BenQ PD2706QN charge my laptop?\",\"answer\":\"Yes. Its USB-C port supplies 90W Power Delivery with DisplayPort Alt Mode and data.\"},{\"question\":\"Is the PD2706QN colour-calibrated?\",\"answer\":\"It is Pantone Validated, Pantone SkinTone Validated and Calman Verified, covering 95% DCI-P3 and 100% sRGB.\"}]','[{\"label\":\"ONIN Infosys \\u2013 BenQ DesignVue PD2706QN 27\\\" QHD Designer Monitor\",\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/onin.com.np\\/product\\/benq-pd2706qn-designer-monitor-price-nepal\",\"accessed\":\"2026-11-23\"}]',NULL,'https://onin.com.np/product/benq-pd2706qn-designer-monitor-price-nepal',0,'2026-11-22 18:15:00','2026-11-22 18:15:00'),(2606,98,38,'BenQ DesignVue PD2705U 27\" 4K Designer Monitor','benq-designvue-pd2705u-27-inch-4k',NULL,'gadgets/2026/benq-designvue-pd2705u-27-inch-4k.webp',NULL,NULL,79499.00,81999.00,0,NULL,NULL,'available',NULL,0,0,'<p>The BenQ PD2705U is one of the most popular 4K monitors for designers, and it\'s easy to see why. It\'s on ONIN Infosys\'s shelf at <strong>Rs 79,499</strong>.</p>\n<p>The 27-inch <strong>4K UHD</strong> IPS panel is <strong>factory-calibrated</strong> to 99% sRGB and Rec.709 with Delta E ≤ 3, and Pantone-validated. What you design on screen will match what clients see on the web and in video. It has HDR10 support and 250 nits, comfortable for typical studio lighting.</p>\n<p>The workflow features are where it shines. <strong>65W USB-C</strong> runs video, data and laptop charging over one cable. A built-in <strong>KVM switch</strong> lets you control two computers, say a Mac laptop and a Windows desktop, with one keyboard and mouse. A USB hub adds three USB 3.2 ports. The stand offers height adjustment (110 mm), pivot, swivel and tilt.</p>\n<p>The <a href=\"/products/benq-designvue-pd2706ua-27-inch-4k-ergo-arm\">PD2706UA</a> adds a desk-clamp ergonomic arm, 90W charging and wider P3 colour for about Rs 18,000 more. For most designers, the PD2705U is the value pick.</p>','[{\"question\":\"What is the BenQ PD2705U price in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"ONIN Infosys sells the BenQ DesignVue PD2705U 27-inch 4K designer monitor for Rs 79,499.\"},{\"question\":\"Does the BenQ PD2705U have a KVM switch?\",\"answer\":\"Yes. The built-in KVM lets you control two computers with one keyboard and mouse.\"},{\"question\":\"How much power does its USB-C deliver?\",\"answer\":\"Up to 65W.\"}]','[{\"label\":\"ONIN Infosys \\u2013 BenQ DesignVue PD2705U 27\\\" 4K Designer Monitor\",\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/onin.com.np\\/product\\/benq-pd2705u-4k-designer-monitor-price-nepal\",\"accessed\":\"2026-11-23\"}]',NULL,'https://onin.com.np/product/benq-pd2705u-4k-designer-monitor-price-nepal',0,'2026-11-22 18:15:00','2026-11-22 18:15:00'),(2607,98,38,'BenQ SW242Q 24.1\" 2K PhotoVue Photographer Monitor','benq-sw242q-24-inch-photographer-monitor',NULL,'gadgets/2026/benq-sw242q-24-inch-photographer-monitor.webp',NULL,NULL,86999.00,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,'available',NULL,0,0,'<p>Photographers who print their work need Adobe RGB, and that\'s where the BenQ SW242Q comes in. It covers <strong>99% Adobe RGB</strong> (plus 100% sRGB and 98% DCI-P3) with Delta E ≤ 1.5 accuracy, so the prints you send to the lab match what you edited. ONIN Infosys has it at <strong>Rs 86,999</strong>.</p>\n<p>It supports <strong>hardware calibration</strong>. With a calibrator and BenQ\'s Palette Master Ultimate software, the 16-bit 3D LUT inside the monitor is recalibrated directly, keeping colour accurate for years. It\'s also Calman Verified and Pantone Validated, with 10-bit colour. The 24.1-inch panel uses a tall <strong>16:10</strong> 2560 × 1600 resolution, which gives more room for Lightroom\'s panels. It reaches 400 nits with an anti-reflection matte surface.</p>\n<p>Photographer-friendly extras include an <strong>SD card reader</strong>, <strong>90W USB-C</strong> for one-cable laptop connection, a USB hub, Gamut Duo for side-by-side colour spaces, and a dedicated black-and-white mode. The stand adjusts height (120 mm), pivot and swivel. For 4K and a larger canvas, see the <a href=\"/products/benq-sw272u-27-inch-4k-photographer-monitor\">BenQ SW272U</a>.</p>','[{\"question\":\"What is the BenQ SW242Q price in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"ONIN Infosys sells the BenQ SW242Q 24.1-inch 2K PhotoVue photographer monitor for Rs 86,999.\"},{\"question\":\"Does the BenQ SW242Q support hardware calibration?\",\"answer\":\"Yes, with BenQ Palette Master Ultimate and a supported calibrator. It has a 16-bit 3D LUT.\"},{\"question\":\"Does it have an SD card reader?\",\"answer\":\"Yes, it supports SD, SDHC, SDXC and MMC cards.\"}]','[{\"label\":\"ONIN Infosys \\u2013 BenQ SW242Q 24.1\\\" 2K PhotoVue Photographer Monitor\",\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/onin.com.np\\/product\\/benq-sw242q-price-in-nepal\",\"accessed\":\"2026-11-23\"}]',NULL,'https://onin.com.np/product/benq-sw242q-price-in-nepal',0,'2026-11-22 18:15:00','2026-11-22 18:15:00'),(2608,98,38,'BenQ MA270U 27\" 4K Monitor for MacBook','benq-ma270u-27-4k-mac-monitor',NULL,'gadgets/2026/benq-ma270u-27-4k-mac-monitor.webp',NULL,NULL,95999.00,100999.00,0,NULL,NULL,'available',NULL,0,0,'<p>Plugging a MacBook into an ordinary monitor often looks disappointing: soft text, dull colours, and a stack of dongles. BenQ\'s MA series is designed specifically to fix that, and the MA270U is the 27-inch version. ONIN Infosys lists it at <strong>Rs 95,999</strong>.</p>\n<p>At <strong>27-inch 4K</strong>, macOS scaling looks crisp, close to a Retina display. The IPS panel covers <strong>95% P3</strong>, the same colour space Apple uses, and <strong>M-Book mode</strong> tunes it to match your MacBook\'s screen so photos look the same on both. It has DisplayHDR 400, 400 nits, and a <strong>Nano Matte</strong> finish that stays clear in bright offices.</p>\n<p>One <strong>USB-C cable delivers 90W</strong>, enough for a MacBook Pro, along with 4K video and data. The monitor adds two USB-A ports and a USB-C port for accessories, plus two HDMI ports and 3W × 2 speakers. You can even adjust brightness and volume from your Mac keyboard. The stand pivots and swivels.</p>\n<p>It pairs beautifully with the <a href=\"/products/apple-mac-mini-m4-16gb-512gb\">Mac mini</a> or a <a href=\"/products/macbook-air-m5-13\">MacBook Air</a>. Prefer glossy? The <a href=\"/products/benq-ma270up-27-inch-4k-glossy-mac\">MA270UP</a> has a Nano Gloss panel.</p>','[{\"question\":\"What is the BenQ MA270U price in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"ONIN Infosys sells the BenQ MA270U 27-inch 4K Mac monitor for Rs 95,999.\"},{\"question\":\"Can the BenQ MA270U charge a MacBook Pro?\",\"answer\":\"Yes. Its USB-C port delivers up to 90W along with 4K video and data.\"},{\"question\":\"What is M-Book mode?\",\"answer\":\"A colour mode tuned to match MacBook displays, so colours look consistent between your laptop and the monitor.\"}]','[{\"label\":\"ONIN Infosys \\u2013 BenQ MA270U 27\\\" 4K Monitor for MacBook\",\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/onin.com.np\\/product\\/benq-ma270u-4k-mac-monitor-price-nepa\",\"accessed\":\"2026-11-23\"}]',NULL,'https://onin.com.np/product/benq-ma270u-4k-mac-monitor-price-nepa',1,'2026-11-22 18:15:00','2026-11-22 18:15:00'),(2609,98,38,'BenQ DesignVue PD2706UA 27\" 4K Designer Monitor with Ergo Arm','benq-designvue-pd2706ua-27-inch-4k-ergo-arm',NULL,'gadgets/2026/benq-designvue-pd2706ua-27-inch-4k-ergo-arm.webp',NULL,NULL,97499.00,99999.00,0,NULL,NULL,'available',NULL,0,0,'<p>The BenQ PD2706UA\'s party trick is its stand, or rather its lack of one. It comes with an <strong>ergonomic C-clamp arm</strong> that frees desk space and gives a huge range of movement: 150 mm of height, <strong>275° swivel</strong>, tilt up to 30° and 90° pivot. The price at ONIN Infosys is <strong>Rs 97,499</strong>.</p>\n<p>The panel is a 27-inch <strong>4K UHD</strong> IPS with 100% sRGB and Rec.709, <strong>95% Display P3</strong>, factory calibration to Delta E ≤ 3, and Pantone and Calman certification. HDR10 and DisplayHDR 400 are supported at 350 nits. Designers, photographers and video editors get colours they can rely on.</p>\n<p>A single <strong>USB-C cable charges at 90W</strong> while carrying 4K video, audio and data, which means one plug for your laptop every morning. There are 2.5W × 2 speakers, and BenQ\'s flicker-free and low-blue-light eye care is included.</p>\n<p>If you don\'t need the arm, the <a href=\"/products/benq-designvue-pd2705u-27-inch-4k\">PD2705U</a> offers similar colour accuracy with a KVM switch for about Rs 18,000 less.</p>','[{\"question\":\"What is the BenQ PD2706UA price in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"ONIN Infosys sells the BenQ DesignVue PD2706UA 27-inch 4K designer monitor with ergonomic arm for Rs 97,499.\"},{\"question\":\"Does the BenQ PD2706UA come with a monitor arm?\",\"answer\":\"Yes. It includes a C-clamp ergonomic arm with height, swivel, tilt and pivot adjustment.\"},{\"question\":\"How much power does its USB-C provide?\",\"answer\":\"Up to 90W.\"}]','[{\"label\":\"ONIN Infosys \\u2013 BenQ DesignVue PD2706UA 27\\\" 4K Designer Monitor with Ergo Arm\",\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/onin.com.np\\/product\\/benq-pd2706ua-4k-designer-monitor-price-nepal\",\"accessed\":\"2026-11-23\"}]',NULL,'https://onin.com.np/product/benq-pd2706ua-4k-designer-monitor-price-nepal',0,'2026-11-22 18:15:00','2026-11-22 18:15:00'),(2610,98,38,'BenQ MA270UP 27\" 4K Nano Gloss Monitor for MacBook','benq-ma270up-27-inch-4k-glossy-mac',NULL,'gadgets/2026/benq-ma270up-27-inch-4k-glossy-mac.webp',NULL,NULL,108999.00,110499.00,0,NULL,NULL,'available',NULL,0,0,'<p>MacBook screens are glossy, and many Mac users find matte monitors look a little flat beside them. The BenQ MA270UP answers that with a <strong>Nano Gloss</strong> finish that gives deeper blacks and punchier contrast, much closer to the look of your laptop. ONIN Infosys currently asks <strong>Rs 1,08,999</strong>.</p>\n<p>Otherwise it\'s the excellent MA270U formula. You get <strong>27-inch 4K</strong> for crisp macOS scaling, <strong>95% P3</strong> colour with M-Book matching, DisplayHDR 400, and slightly higher brightness at <strong>450 nits</strong>. <strong>90W USB-C</strong> carries video, data and charging over one cable, and there are USB-A and USB-C downstream ports, two HDMI, 3W × 2 speakers, and brightness and volume control from your Mac keyboard. The stand is height adjustable.</p>\n<p>Which BenQ MA should you buy? If your desk faces a window or bright overhead lights, the matte <a href=\"/products/benq-ma270u-27-4k-mac-monitor\">MA270U</a> handles reflections better and costs Rs 13,000 less. In a controlled room, the MA270UP\'s gloss looks gorgeous.</p>','[{\"question\":\"What is the BenQ MA270UP price in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"ONIN Infosys sells the BenQ MA270UP 27-inch 4K Nano Gloss Mac monitor for Rs 1,08,999.\"},{\"question\":\"What is the difference between the BenQ MA270U and MA270UP?\",\"answer\":\"The MA270UP has a glossy Nano Gloss panel, 450 nits brightness and a height-adjustable stand. The MA270U has a matte Nano Matte panel and costs less.\"},{\"question\":\"Can it charge a MacBook?\",\"answer\":\"Yes, with up to 90W over USB-C.\"}]','[{\"label\":\"ONIN Infosys \\u2013 BenQ MA270UP 27\\\" 4K Nano Gloss Monitor for MacBook\",\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/onin.com.np\\/product\\/benq-ma270up-4k-macbook-monitor-price-nepal\",\"accessed\":\"2026-11-23\"}]',NULL,'https://onin.com.np/product/benq-ma270up-4k-macbook-monitor-price-nepal',0,'2026-11-22 18:15:00','2026-11-22 18:15:00'),(2611,98,38,'BenQ DesignVue PD3205U 31.5\" 4K Designer Monitor','benq-designvue-pd3205u-32-inch-4k',NULL,'gadgets/2026/benq-designvue-pd3205u-32-inch-4k.webp',NULL,NULL,119999.00,124499.00,0,NULL,NULL,'available',NULL,0,0,'<p>Some work simply needs more canvas: architectural drawings, long video timelines, large spreadsheets, multi-panel design files. The BenQ PD3205U delivers a <strong>31.5-inch 4K</strong> screen with designer-grade colour for <strong>Rs 1,19,999</strong> at ONIN Infosys.</p>\n<p>At 31.5 inches, 4K gives about 140 PPI. You can run it at 100% scaling for maximum space or lightly scaled for crisp text. The IPS panel is <strong>factory-calibrated</strong> to 99% sRGB and Rec.709 with Delta E ≤ 3. Brightness is 250 nits, which suits controlled studio lighting.</p>\n<p>The DesignVue workflow features are all here: <strong>90W USB-C</strong> for one-cable laptop docking, a built-in <strong>KVM switch</strong> to control two computers, a USB 3.2 hub, and the <strong>Hotkey Puck G2</strong>, a desk dial for switching colour modes and shortcuts instantly. It has 2.5W × 2 speakers and flicker-free, low-blue-light eye care.</p>\n<p>For more brightness, better contrast (IPS Black) and Thunderbolt, see the <a href=\"/products/benq-designvue-pd3225u-32-inch-4k-thunderbolt\">PD3225U</a>.</p>','[{\"question\":\"What is the BenQ PD3205U price in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"ONIN Infosys sells the BenQ DesignVue PD3205U 31.5-inch 4K designer monitor for Rs 1,19,999.\"},{\"question\":\"What is the Hotkey Puck G2?\",\"answer\":\"A physical desk controller included with the PD3205U for switching colour modes, inputs and shortcuts quickly.\"},{\"question\":\"Does the PD3205U have a KVM switch?\",\"answer\":\"Yes, so you can control two computers with one keyboard and mouse.\"}]','[{\"label\":\"ONIN Infosys \\u2013 BenQ DesignVue PD3205U 31.5\\\" 4K Designer Monitor\",\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/onin.com.np\\/product\\/benq-pd3205u-4k-designer-monitor-price-nepal\",\"accessed\":\"2026-11-23\"}]',NULL,'https://onin.com.np/product/benq-pd3205u-4k-designer-monitor-price-nepal',0,'2026-11-22 18:15:00','2026-11-22 18:15:00'),(2612,98,38,'BenQ DesignVue PD2725U 27\" 4K Thunderbolt 3 Designer Monitor','benq-designvue-pd2725u-27-inch-4k-thunderbolt',NULL,'gadgets/2026/benq-designvue-pd2725u-27-inch-4k-thunderbolt.webp',NULL,NULL,130499.00,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,'available',NULL,0,0,'<p>The BenQ PD2725U is the DesignVue monitor for Mac-based studios. It has <strong>Thunderbolt 3</strong>, MacBook colour matching and a daisy-chain port for a second display. It\'s on ONIN Infosys\'s shelf at <strong>Rs 1,30,499</strong>.</p>\n<p>Its 27-inch <strong>4K</strong> IPS panel covers 100% sRGB and Rec.709 and <strong>95% DCI-P3</strong>, with Calman and Pantone validation and DisplayHDR 400. The <strong>M-Book mode</strong> matches MacBook Pro and Air colour profiles. Thunderbolt 3 handles video, data and <strong>65W</strong> charging over one cable, and a second Thunderbolt port lets you <strong>daisy-chain</strong> another 4K monitor.</p>\n<p>There\'s also a <strong>KVM switch</strong> for using a Mac and a PC with one keyboard and mouse, a Hotkey Puck for quick mode changes, two HDMI and one DisplayPort, a USB hub and 2.5W × 2 speakers. The stand offers 150 mm of height adjustment, pivot and swivel.</p>\n<p>If you don\'t need Thunderbolt or daisy-chaining, the <a href=\"/products/benq-designvue-pd2705u-27-inch-4k\">PD2705U</a> covers most of the same ground for about Rs 51,000 less.</p>','[{\"question\":\"What is the BenQ PD2725U price in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"ONIN Infosys sells the BenQ DesignVue PD2725U 27-inch 4K Thunderbolt 3 designer monitor for Rs 1,30,499.\"},{\"question\":\"Can the BenQ PD2725U daisy-chain monitors?\",\"answer\":\"Yes. Its second Thunderbolt 3 port can drive another 4K display.\"},{\"question\":\"How much charging power does the Thunderbolt port provide?\",\"answer\":\"Up to 65W.\"}]','[{\"label\":\"ONIN Infosys \\u2013 BenQ DesignVue PD2725U 27\\\" 4K Thunderbolt 3 Designer Monitor\",\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/onin.com.np\\/product\\/benq-pd2725u-4k-designer-monitor-price-nepal\",\"accessed\":\"2026-11-23\"}]',NULL,'https://onin.com.np/product/benq-pd2725u-4k-designer-monitor-price-nepal',0,'2026-11-22 18:15:00','2026-11-22 18:15:00'),(2613,98,38,'BenQ MA320U 32\" 4K Nano Matte Monitor for MacBook','benq-ma320u-32-inch-4k-nano-matte-mac',NULL,'gadgets/2026/benq-ma320u-32-inch-4k-nano-matte-mac.webp',NULL,NULL,136999.00,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,'available',NULL,0,0,'<p>The BenQ MA320U is the big-screen version of BenQ\'s MacBook monitor. It has a <strong>31.5-inch 4K</strong> panel that\'s bright enough for any office in Kathmandu. ONIN Infosys sells it for <strong>Rs 1,36,999</strong>.</p>\n<p>Brightness is the headline: <strong>550 nits</strong> typical and <strong>VESA DisplayHDR 600</strong> certification, a real step up for HDR video and photos. The panel covers <strong>97% DCI-P3</strong> and 99% sRGB with 1.07 billion colours, M-Book mode matches your MacBook\'s profile, and the <strong>Nano Matte</strong> coating removes reflections without dulling contrast.</p>\n<p>The rest is BenQ\'s polished Mac setup: <strong>90W USB-C</strong> for one-cable charging and video, a height-adjustable stand (115 mm) with pivot and swivel, and flicker-free, low-blue-light eye care. At 140 PPI, macOS looks sharp at sensible scaling.</p>\n<p>The <a href=\"/products/benq-ma320up-32-inch-4k-mac-monitor\">MA320UP</a> costs the same at ONIN. Compare the two listings for which ports and extras you need. For a smaller desk, the 27-inch <a href=\"/products/benq-ma270u-27-4k-mac-monitor\">MA270U</a> saves about Rs 41,000.</p>','[{\"question\":\"What is the BenQ MA320U price in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"ONIN Infosys sells the BenQ MA320U 31.5-inch 4K Nano Matte Mac monitor for Rs 1,36,999 with a 1-year warranty.\"},{\"question\":\"How bright is the BenQ MA320U?\",\"answer\":\"550 nits typical, with VESA DisplayHDR 600 certification.\"},{\"question\":\"Can it charge a MacBook?\",\"answer\":\"Yes, with up to 90W over USB-C.\"}]','[{\"label\":\"ONIN Infosys \\u2013 BenQ MA320U 32\\\" 4K Nano Matte Monitor for MacBook\",\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/onin.com.np\\/product\\/benq-ma320u-4k-macbook-monitor-price-nepal\",\"accessed\":\"2026-11-23\"}]',NULL,'https://onin.com.np/product/benq-ma320u-4k-macbook-monitor-price-nepal',0,'2026-11-22 18:15:00','2026-11-22 18:15:00'),(2614,98,38,'BenQ MA320UP 32\" 4K Professional Monitor for Mac','benq-ma320up-32-inch-4k-mac-monitor',NULL,'gadgets/2026/benq-ma320up-32-inch-4k-mac-monitor.webp',NULL,NULL,136999.00,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,'available',NULL,0,0,'<p>The BenQ MA320UP is a 31.5-inch 4K monitor tuned for Mac users who want a big, bright screen and a tidy single-cable desk. ONIN Infosys has it at <strong>Rs 1,36,999</strong>.</p>\n<p>The IPS panel reaches <strong>550 nits</strong> with <strong>DisplayHDR 600</strong>, covers <strong>97% P3</strong> and 99% sRGB, and ships with M-Book colour matching for MacBook Air and Pro. A <strong>90W USB-C</strong> port carries 4K video, data and enough power for a 14-inch MacBook Pro. The monitor adds two USB-A ports (7.5W charging) and a 15W USB-C port for accessories, plus HDMI and <strong>3W × 2 speakers</strong>. You can control brightness and volume from your Mac keyboard.</p>\n<p>The stand offers 115 mm of height, tilt, swivel and 90° pivot, and it\'s VESA mountable. Next to the <a href=\"/products/benq-ma320u-32-inch-4k-nano-matte-mac\">MA320U</a> at the same price, the MA320UP is the one with the fuller hub and speakers listed. If your room is very bright, check which panel finish you prefer before buying.</p>','[{\"question\":\"What is the BenQ MA320UP price in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"ONIN Infosys sells the BenQ MA320UP 31.5-inch 4K Mac monitor for Rs 1,36,999.\"},{\"question\":\"What ports does the BenQ MA320UP have?\",\"answer\":\"HDMI 2.0, USB-C with 90W Power Delivery, two USB-A downstream ports and one USB-C downstream port.\"},{\"question\":\"Does it have speakers?\",\"answer\":\"Yes, 3W \\u00d7 2 built-in speakers.\"}]','[{\"label\":\"ONIN Infosys \\u2013 BenQ MA320UP 32\\\" 4K Professional Monitor for Mac\",\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/onin.com.np\\/product\\/benq-ma320up-4k-mac-monitor-price-nepal\",\"accessed\":\"2026-11-23\"}]',NULL,'https://onin.com.np/product/benq-ma320up-4k-mac-monitor-price-nepal',0,'2026-11-22 18:15:00','2026-11-22 18:15:00'),(2615,98,38,'BenQ DesignVue PD3225U 31.5\" 4K Thunderbolt Designer Monitor','benq-designvue-pd3225u-32-inch-4k-thunderbolt',NULL,'gadgets/2026/benq-designvue-pd3225u-32-inch-4k-thunderbolt.webp',NULL,NULL,214499.00,219499.00,0,NULL,NULL,'available',NULL,0,0,'<p>The BenQ PD3225U is the top of BenQ\'s DesignVue range on ONIN Infosys\'s shelf, and it\'s the monitor we\'d recommend to a Mac-based design or video studio that wants one large, accurate, fully docked screen. It costs <strong>Rs 2,14,499</strong>.</p>\n<p>Its 31.5-inch <strong>4K</strong> panel uses <strong>IPS Black</strong> technology, with <strong>2000:1</strong> contrast, about double ordinary IPS, so shadows and dark UI themes look deeper. Colour covers <strong>98% Display P3</strong>, 100% sRGB and Rec.709, factory-calibrated and Pantone validated, with M-Book mode for matching MacBooks. Brightness is 400 nits with DisplayHDR 400.</p>\n<p>A <strong>Thunderbolt 3</strong> port delivers <strong>85W</strong> to your laptop along with video and data, and a second Thunderbolt port daisy-chains another monitor. There\'s also a built-in <strong>KVM</strong>, a USB hub, two HDMI, DisplayPort and 2.5W × 2 speakers. The stand offers 150 mm of height, pivot and swivel.</p>\n<p>For a smaller desk, the 27-inch <a href=\"/products/benq-designvue-pd2725u-27-inch-4k-thunderbolt\">PD2725U</a> has a similar feature set. If you also play games, the <a href=\"/products/benq-creativepro-pd3226g-32-inch-4k-144hz\">PD3226G</a> adds 144Hz.</p>','[{\"question\":\"What is the BenQ PD3225U price in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"ONIN Infosys sells the BenQ DesignVue PD3225U 31.5-inch 4K designer monitor for Rs 2,14,499.\"},{\"question\":\"What is IPS Black?\",\"answer\":\"A newer IPS panel type with about 2000:1 contrast, roughly double standard IPS, giving deeper blacks.\"},{\"question\":\"How much charging power does the PD3225U provide?\",\"answer\":\"Up to 85W over Thunderbolt 3.\"}]','[{\"label\":\"ONIN Infosys \\u2013 BenQ DesignVue PD3225U 31.5\\\" 4K Thunderbolt Designer Monitor\",\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/onin.com.np\\/product\\/benq-pd3225u-4k-monitor-price-nepal\",\"accessed\":\"2026-11-23\"}]',NULL,'https://onin.com.np/product/benq-pd3225u-4k-monitor-price-nepal',0,'2026-11-22 18:15:00','2026-11-22 18:15:00'),(2616,98,38,'BenQ CreativePro PD3226G 32\" 4K 144Hz Designer Monitor','benq-creativepro-pd3226g-32-inch-4k-144hz',NULL,'gadgets/2026/benq-creativepro-pd3226g-32-inch-4k-144hz.webp',NULL,NULL,223499.00,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,'available',NULL,0,0,'<p>Designers who also animate, develop games or simply play at night have always had to choose between a colour-accurate 60Hz monitor and a fast but less accurate gaming one. The BenQ CreativePro PD3226G removes that choice. It\'s a <strong>31.5-inch 4K</strong> panel at <strong>144Hz</strong> with factory calibration to Delta E ≤ 2. The price at ONIN Infosys is <strong>Rs 2,23,499</strong>.</p>\n<p>It covers 95% DCI-P3 and 100% sRGB and Rec.709, with Calman and Pantone certification, DisplayHDR 400 and 400 nits. The 1 ms response time and 144Hz refresh make 3D viewport navigation, scrubbing timelines and real-time engines like Unreal and Unity feel fluid. Games look excellent too.</p>\n<p>Connectivity is top-tier: <strong>Thunderbolt 4</strong> with 90W charging and a Thunderbolt out for daisy-chaining, <strong>HDMI 2.1</strong> (4K 144Hz for consoles), DisplayPort 1.4 and a USB hub. It has 3W × 2 speakers and a fully adjustable stand (150 mm height, pivot, swivel).</p>\n<p>If you never need more than 60Hz, the <a href=\"/products/benq-designvue-pd3225u-32-inch-4k-thunderbolt\">PD3225U</a> has an IPS Black panel with higher contrast for a little less.</p>','[{\"question\":\"What is the BenQ PD3226G price in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"ONIN Infosys sells the BenQ CreativePro PD3226G 31.5-inch 4K 144Hz designer monitor for Rs 2,23,499.\"},{\"question\":\"Does the BenQ PD3226G have Thunderbolt 4?\",\"answer\":\"Yes, with 90W Power Delivery and a Thunderbolt out port for daisy-chaining.\"},{\"question\":\"Can I connect a PS5 at 4K to the PD3226G?\",\"answer\":\"Yes, through its HDMI 2.1 port.\"}]','[{\"label\":\"ONIN Infosys \\u2013 BenQ CreativePro PD3226G 32\\\" 4K 144Hz Designer Monitor\",\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/onin.com.np\\/product\\/benq-pd3226g-4k-144hz-designer-monitor-price-nepal\",\"accessed\":\"2026-11-23\"}]',NULL,'https://onin.com.np/product/benq-pd3226g-4k-144hz-designer-monitor-price-nepal',0,'2026-11-22 18:15:00','2026-11-22 18:15:00'),(2617,98,38,'BenQ SW272U 27\" 4K Adobe RGB Photographer Monitor','benq-sw272u-27-inch-4k-photographer-monitor',NULL,'gadgets/2026/benq-sw272u-27-inch-4k-photographer-monitor.webp',NULL,NULL,269400.00,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,'available',NULL,0,0,'<p>The BenQ SW272U is a reference-grade tool for professional photographers, retouchers and colourists, the kind of monitor that sits at the centre of a commercial studio. ONIN Infosys currently asks <strong>Rs 2,69,400</strong>.</p>\n<p>Its 27-inch <strong>4K</strong> IPS panel covers <strong>99% Adobe RGB</strong>, 99% DCI-P3, 100% sRGB and Rec.709 with Delta E ≤ 2. It supports <strong>hardware calibration</strong> through a 16-bit 3D LUT with Palette Master Element, so accuracy can be maintained for years. HDR10 and HLG are supported at 400 nits. A <strong>shading hood</strong> is included to block stray light, which is essential for judging colour properly.</p>\n<p>Workflow features include <strong>90W USB-C</strong>, two HDMI, DisplayPort, a USB hub, an <strong>SD card reader</strong>, a <strong>KVM</strong> switch, and the <strong>Hotkey Puck G2</strong> for flipping between colour spaces, such as Adobe RGB for print and sRGB for web, in a second. The stand offers 140 mm of height, pivot, swivel and tilt.</p>\n<p>For a smaller 2K display with the same Adobe RGB focus, the <a href=\"/products/benq-sw242q-24-inch-photographer-monitor\">BenQ SW242Q</a> costs about a third as much.</p>','[{\"question\":\"What is the BenQ SW272U price in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"ONIN Infosys sells the BenQ SW272U 27-inch 4K Adobe RGB photographer monitor for Rs 2,69,400.\"},{\"question\":\"Does the BenQ SW272U come with a shading hood?\",\"answer\":\"Yes, along with the Hotkey Puck G2.\"},{\"question\":\"Can the BenQ SW272U be hardware-calibrated?\",\"answer\":\"Yes. It has a 16-bit 3D LUT and supports hardware calibration with BenQ Palette Master Element.\"}]','[{\"label\":\"ONIN Infosys \\u2013 BenQ SW272U 27\\\" 4K Adobe RGB Photographer Monitor\",\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/onin.com.np\\/product\\/benq-sw272u-monitor-price-in-nepal\",\"accessed\":\"2026-11-23\"}]',NULL,'https://onin.com.np/product/benq-sw272u-monitor-price-in-nepal',0,'2026-11-22 18:15:00','2026-11-22 18:15:00'),(2618,108,38,'Dahua DHI-LM22-B201SW 21.5\" FHD IPS 100Hz Monitor','dahua-lm22-b201sw-22-inch-ips-100hz',NULL,'gadgets/2026/dahua-lm22-b201sw-22-inch-ips-100hz.webp',NULL,NULL,12499.00,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,'available',NULL,0,0,'<p>For Rs 12,499 at ONIN Infosys, the Dahua LM22-B201SW gets you something most monitors at this price skip: <strong>built-in speakers</strong> (two 1W drivers). That\'s handy on a reception desk, at a billing counter or in a hostel room where you don\'t want extra boxes and cables.</p>\n<p>The 21.5-inch Full HD <strong>IPS</strong> panel has wide 178° viewing angles, runs at up to <strong>100Hz</strong> and covers 100% sRGB, so colours look natural for office work, YouTube and casual photo browsing. Brightness is 250 nits with 1000:1 contrast, which is typical for IPS. Low blue light and flicker-free modes are built in. The ultra-narrow bezels and metal base look tidier than the price suggests, and Dahua backs it with a <strong>2-year warranty</strong>.</p>\n<p>The built-in speakers are fine for voice and notifications, not music. Pair it with the <a href=\"/products/msi-pro-mp225v-22-inch-va-100hz\">MSI PRO MP225V</a> if you\'d rather have VA contrast.</p>','[{\"question\":\"What is the Dahua DHI-LM22-B201SW price in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"ONIN Infosys sells the Dahua DHI-LM22-B201SW 21.5-inch FHD IPS 100Hz monitor for Rs 12,499.\"},{\"question\":\"Does the Dahua LM22-B201SW have speakers?\",\"answer\":\"Yes, two 1W built-in speakers.\"},{\"question\":\"What warranty does it have?\",\"answer\":\"A 2-year warranty.\"}]','[{\"label\":\"ONIN Infosys \\u2013 Dahua DHI-LM22-B201SW 21.5\\\" FHD IPS 100Hz Monitor\",\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/onin.com.np\\/product\\/dahua-dhi-lm22-b201sw-monitor-price-nepal\",\"accessed\":\"2026-11-23\"}]',NULL,'https://onin.com.np/product/dahua-dhi-lm22-b201sw-monitor-price-nepal',0,'2026-11-22 18:15:00','2026-11-22 18:15:00'),(2619,108,38,'Dahua LM24-B201S 24\" IPS Borderless Monitor','dahua-lm24-b201s-24-inch-ips',NULL,'gadgets/2026/dahua-lm24-b201s-24-inch-ips.webp',NULL,NULL,22500.00,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,'available',NULL,0,0,'<p>Dahua is best known in Nepal for CCTV, and its monitors carry the same practical, built-to-run-all-day approach. The LM24-B201S is a 24-inch IPS screen with ultra-narrow bezels and a sturdy metal base. ONIN Infosys sells it for <strong>Rs 22,500</strong>.</p>\n<p>The IPS panel gives 178° viewing angles, refreshes at up to <strong>100Hz</strong>, and takes HDMI and VGA inputs. That makes it a natural fit for CCTV viewing stations, reception desks and office PCs where older VGA machines are still around. Dahua\'s low-energy design keeps running costs down on screens that stay on all day.</p>\n<p>ONIN\'s listing doesn\'t give full colour and brightness figures, so if colour accuracy matters to your work, a BenQ like the <a href=\"/products/benq-gw2490-24-inch-ips-100hz-speakers\">GW2490</a> (99% sRGB) is the safer choice for about the same money.</p>','[{\"question\":\"What is the Dahua LM24-B201S price in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"ONIN Infosys sells the Dahua LM24-B201S 24-inch IPS borderless monitor for Rs 22,500.\"},{\"question\":\"What inputs does the Dahua LM24-B201S have?\",\"answer\":\"HDMI and VGA.\"},{\"question\":\"What refresh rate does it support?\",\"answer\":\"Up to 100Hz.\"}]','[{\"label\":\"ONIN Infosys \\u2013 Dahua LM24-B201S 24\\\" IPS Borderless Monitor\",\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/onin.com.np\\/product\\/dahua-24-inch-monitor-price-in-nepal\",\"accessed\":\"2026-11-23\"}]',NULL,'https://onin.com.np/product/dahua-24-inch-monitor-price-in-nepal',0,'2026-11-22 18:15:00','2026-11-22 18:15:00'),(2620,108,38,'Dahua PM16-F201SDT 15.6\" FHD Portable Touchscreen Monitor','dahua-pm16-f201sdt-15-6-portable-touch-monitor',NULL,'gadgets/2026/dahua-pm16-f201sdt-15-6-portable-touch-monitor.webp',NULL,NULL,25499.00,33499.00,0,NULL,NULL,'available',NULL,0,0,'<p>A portable monitor turns any laptop into a two-screen workstation. That\'s handy in a co-working space, a hotel room or a client\'s office. The Dahua PM16-F201SDT adds <strong>touch</strong>, which few portable screens at this price offer. ONIN Infosys lists it at <strong>Rs 25,499</strong>.</p>\n<p>It\'s a 15.6-inch Full HD IPS panel with 10-point multi-touch and weighs just <strong>0.87 kg</strong>. The clever part is the connectivity. <strong>Two full-function USB-C ports</strong> carry video, touch data and power over a single cable from a compatible laptop. If you plug your charger into the monitor, it passes up to <strong>45W</strong> back to the laptop. It has 2 × 1W speakers and a 3H-hardness anti-glare surface.</p>\n<p>The panel is a basic 250-nit, 45% NTSC type at 60Hz. It\'s fine for documents, chat and reference material, but not for colour work or fast gaming. Also check that your laptop\'s USB-C port supports DisplayPort output. Many budget laptops have data-only USB-C, including some on this site.</p>','[{\"question\":\"What is the Dahua PM16-F201SDT price in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"ONIN Infosys sells the Dahua PM16-F201SDT 15.6-inch FHD portable touchscreen monitor for Rs 25,499.\"},{\"question\":\"Can the Dahua portable monitor work with one cable?\",\"answer\":\"Yes, with a laptop whose USB-C port supports DisplayPort Alt Mode and power. One cable carries video, touch and power.\"},{\"question\":\"How heavy is the Dahua PM16-F201SDT?\",\"answer\":\"About 0.87 kg.\"}]','[{\"label\":\"ONIN Infosys \\u2013 Dahua PM16-F201SDT 15.6\\\" FHD Portable Touchscreen Monitor\",\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/onin.com.np\\/product\\/dahua-pm16-f201sdt-portable-touchscreen-monitor-price-nepal\",\"accessed\":\"2026-11-23\"}]',NULL,'https://onin.com.np/product/dahua-pm16-f201sdt-portable-touchscreen-monitor-price-nepal',0,'2026-11-22 18:15:00','2026-11-22 18:15:00'),(2621,108,38,'Dahua DHI-LM24-E240C 23.6\" Curved 240Hz Gaming Monitor','dahua-lm24-e240c-24-inch-curved-240hz',NULL,'gadgets/2026/dahua-lm24-e240c-24-inch-curved-240hz.webp',NULL,NULL,31000.00,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,'available',NULL,0,0,'<p>The Dahua LM24-E240C brings <strong>240Hz</strong> to a compact 23.6-inch curved screen. At that size Full HD stays sharp, and your eyes take in the whole screen without moving your head, which is exactly what competitive players want. ONIN Infosys currently asks <strong>Rs 31,000</strong> with a <strong>2-year warranty</strong>.</p>\n<p>It\'s a <strong>VA</strong> panel with a 1500R curve, 3000:1 contrast and 1ms MPRT. Dark maps look deeper than on IPS, and motion is very smooth at high frame rates. HDR10 input is supported. That\'s handy for consoles, but don\'t expect real HDR brightness from a monitor at this price.</p>\n<p>Should you buy this or a flat 24.5-inch esports monitor? The curve adds immersion, while flat Rapid IPS panels like the <a href=\"/products/msi-mag-255pxf-24-5-inch-300hz\">MSI MAG 255PXF</a> offer cleaner motion in dark scenes and better colour. For the money, the Dahua is one of the cheapest true 240Hz screens on ONIN\'s shelf.</p>','[{\"question\":\"What is the Dahua DHI-LM24-E240C price in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"ONIN Infosys sells the Dahua DHI-LM24-E240C 23.6-inch curved 240Hz gaming monitor for Rs 31,000 with a 2-year warranty.\"},{\"question\":\"What panel type does the Dahua LM24-E240C use?\",\"answer\":\"A VA panel with 1500R curvature and 3000:1 contrast.\"},{\"question\":\"Does it support HDR?\",\"answer\":\"It accepts HDR10 signals.\"}]','[{\"label\":\"ONIN Infosys \\u2013 Dahua DHI-LM24-E240C 23.6\\\" Curved 240Hz Gaming Monitor\",\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/onin.com.np\\/product\\/dahua-dhi-lm24-e240c-240hz-curved-gaming-monitor-price-nepal\",\"accessed\":\"2026-11-23\"}]',NULL,'https://onin.com.np/product/dahua-dhi-lm24-e240c-240hz-curved-gaming-monitor-price-nepal',0,'2026-11-22 18:15:00','2026-11-22 18:15:00'),(2622,108,38,'Dahua DHI-LM27-B200 27\" Full HD LED Monitor','dahua-lm27-b200-27-inch-fhd',NULL,'gadgets/2026/dahua-lm27-b200-27-inch-fhd.webp',NULL,NULL,32000.00,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,'available',NULL,0,0,'<p>The Dahua LM27-B200 is a big, simple 27-inch screen built to run all day. It\'s a natural partner for Dahua\'s CCTV systems in shops and offices, and equally at home as a large office monitor. ONIN Infosys sells it for <strong>Rs 32,000</strong>.</p>\n<p>It\'s a Full HD (1920 × 1080) panel at 60Hz with 178°/178° viewing angles, 16.7 million colours, narrow bezels and a blue light filter. Inputs are HDMI and VGA, covering both new and old PCs and DVR/NVR recorders. It\'s VESA-mountable, so it can go on a wall in a security room. Low power consumption helps when it stays on 24/7.</p>\n<p>For a home or office desk where smoothness and colour matter, MSI\'s 27-inch 144Hz models like the <a href=\"/products/msi-pro-mp275-e14l-27-inch-144hz\">PRO MP275 E14L</a> cost less and come with a 2-year warranty. The Dahua makes most sense in installations already built around Dahua hardware.</p>','[{\"question\":\"What is the Dahua DHI-LM27-B200 price in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"ONIN Infosys sells the Dahua DHI-LM27-B200 27-inch Full HD LED monitor for Rs 32,000.\"},{\"question\":\"Can the Dahua 27-inch monitor connect to a CCTV recorder?\",\"answer\":\"Yes. It has HDMI and VGA inputs, which most DVRs and NVRs support.\"},{\"question\":\"What refresh rate does it have?\",\"answer\":\"60Hz.\"}]','[{\"label\":\"ONIN Infosys \\u2013 Dahua DHI-LM27-B200 27\\\" Full HD LED Monitor\",\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/onin.com.np\\/product\\/dahua-dh9-lm27-b200-monitor-27-inch-nepal\",\"accessed\":\"2026-11-23\"}]',NULL,'https://onin.com.np/product/dahua-dh9-lm27-b200-monitor-27-inch-nepal',0,'2026-11-22 18:15:00','2026-11-22 18:15:00'),(2623,108,38,'Dahua DHI-LM27-E341AY 27\" QHD 275Hz Fast IPS Gaming Monitor','dahua-lm27-e341ay-27-inch-qhd-275hz',NULL,'gadgets/2026/dahua-lm27-e341ay-27-inch-qhd-275hz.webp',NULL,NULL,44999.00,50499.00,0,NULL,NULL,'available',NULL,0,0,'<p>High refresh <em>and</em> high resolution used to cost a fortune. The Dahua LM27-E341AY delivers <strong>27-inch QHD at 275Hz</strong> for <strong>Rs 44,999</strong> at ONIN Infosys, with a <strong>2-year warranty</strong>.</p>\n<p>The <strong>Fast IPS</strong> panel runs at 275Hz over DisplayPort (240Hz over HDMI), with a 0.5 ms overdrive response. At 2560 × 1440 you get sharp detail for strategy games and work, plus extreme smoothness when a strong GPU (RTX 5070 class and up) pushes high frame rates in shooters. Colour is excellent at 95% DCI-P3, brightness is 350 nits, and HDR10 is supported. Hardware low-blue-light protection and an anti-glare coating help during long sessions.</p>\n<p>Compared with the <a href=\"/products/msi-mag-275qf-27-inch-qhd-180hz\">MSI MAG 275QF</a> at 180Hz, which costs Rs 9,500 less, this Dahua is the pick if your GPU can actually exceed 180 fps at 1440p. Otherwise the MSI is the better value.</p>','[{\"question\":\"What is the Dahua DHI-LM27-E341AY price in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"ONIN Infosys sells the Dahua DHI-LM27-E341AY 27-inch QHD 275Hz gaming monitor for Rs 44,999 with a 2-year warranty.\"},{\"question\":\"Does the Dahua LM27-E341AY reach 275Hz over HDMI?\",\"answer\":\"No. 275Hz is over DisplayPort; HDMI supports up to 240Hz.\"},{\"question\":\"What colour gamut does it cover?\",\"answer\":\"95% DCI-P3.\"}]','[{\"label\":\"ONIN Infosys \\u2013 Dahua DHI-LM27-E341AY 27\\\" QHD 275Hz Fast IPS Gaming Monitor\",\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/onin.com.np\\/product\\/dahua-dhi-lm27-e341ay-275hz-qhd-gaming-monitor-price-nepal\",\"accessed\":\"2026-11-23\"}]',NULL,'https://onin.com.np/product/dahua-dhi-lm27-e341ay-275hz-qhd-gaming-monitor-price-nepal',0,'2026-11-22 18:15:00','2026-11-22 18:15:00'),(2624,108,38,'Dahua DHI-LM34-E330C 34\" UWQHD Curved 180Hz Gaming Monitor','dahua-lm34-e330c-34-inch-ultrawide-180hz',NULL,'gadgets/2026/dahua-lm34-e330c-34-inch-ultrawide-180hz.webp',NULL,NULL,58999.00,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,'available',NULL,0,0,'<p>Ultrawide monitors change how you use a computer. A 34-inch <strong>3440 × 1440</strong> screen is roughly the width of two smaller monitors without a bezel down the middle. The Dahua LM34-E330C brings that to <strong>Rs 58,999</strong> at ONIN Infosys, with a <strong>2-year warranty</strong>.</p>\n<p>For work, you can keep a timeline, spreadsheet or code editor wide open with reference windows alongside. For games that support 21:9, such as racing, flight sims and open-world RPGs, the <strong>1500R curve</strong> wraps the view around you. The VA panel runs at <strong>180Hz</strong> with 1ms MPRT, 3000:1 contrast, 350 nits and wide colour (120% sRGB, 85% DCI-P3). There\'s even a built-in backlight effect at the rear for desk ambience.</p>\n<p>Inputs are two DisplayPort 1.4 and two HDMI 2.0, plus audio out. Driving 3440 × 1440 at high frame rates takes a capable GPU, around RTX 5060 Ti/5070 or better. For a QD-OLED ultrawide with true blacks, the <a href=\"/products/msi-mpg-341cqpx-34-inch-qd-oled-240hz\">MSI MPG 341CQPX</a> is the premium alternative.</p>','[{\"question\":\"What is the Dahua DHI-LM34-E330C price in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"ONIN Infosys sells the Dahua DHI-LM34-E330C 34-inch UWQHD curved 180Hz monitor for Rs 58,999 with a 2-year warranty.\"},{\"question\":\"What resolution is the Dahua 34-inch monitor?\",\"answer\":\"3440 \\u00d7 1440 (UWQHD), a 21:9 ultrawide format.\"},{\"question\":\"What inputs does it have?\",\"answer\":\"Two DisplayPort 1.4, two HDMI 2.0 and a 3.5 mm audio out.\"}]','[{\"label\":\"ONIN Infosys \\u2013 Dahua DHI-LM34-E330C 34\\\" UWQHD Curved 180Hz Gaming Monitor\",\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/onin.com.np\\/product\\/dahua-dhi-lm34-e330c-monitor-nepal\",\"accessed\":\"2026-11-23\"}]',NULL,'https://onin.com.np/product/dahua-dhi-lm34-e330c-monitor-nepal',0,'2026-11-22 18:15:00','2026-11-22 18:15:00'),(2625,108,38,'Dahua LM55-F400N 55\" 4K UHD LED Display','dahua-lm55-f400n-55-inch-4k-display',NULL,'gadgets/2026/dahua-lm55-f400n-55-inch-4k-display.webp',NULL,NULL,86499.00,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,'available',NULL,0,0,'<p>The Dahua LM55-F400N is a <strong>55-inch 4K</strong> display for places where a normal monitor is too small: security control rooms, meeting rooms, shop windows, digital menu boards and classrooms. ONIN Infosys sells it for <strong>Rs 86,499</strong>.</p>\n<p>Unlike a consumer TV, it\'s built as a monitor for long, continuous operation, with an ultra-narrow bezel, so several units can sit side by side in a video wall. The 3840 × 2160 panel is bright at <strong>400 nits</strong>, has 178° viewing angles so everyone in the room sees the same picture, and responds in 6.5 ms. Built-in <strong>10W × 2 speakers</strong> are loud enough for presentations.</p>\n<p>Colour is a standard 72% NTSC and refresh is 60Hz, so it\'s meant for content, dashboards and CCTV feeds rather than colour-critical editing or gaming. It pairs naturally with Dahua NVRs. If you need touch and annotation for teaching, look at Hikvision\'s interactive flat panels instead.</p>','[{\"question\":\"What is the Dahua LM55-F400N price in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"ONIN Infosys sells the Dahua DHI-LM55-F400N 55-inch 4K UHD LED monitor for Rs 86,499.\"},{\"question\":\"Does the Dahua 55-inch monitor have speakers?\",\"answer\":\"Yes, built-in 10W \\u00d7 2 speakers.\"},{\"question\":\"How bright is it?\",\"answer\":\"400 nits typical.\"}]','[{\"label\":\"ONIN Infosys \\u2013 Dahua LM55-F400N 55\\\" 4K UHD LED Display\",\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/onin.com.np\\/product\\/dahua-55-inch-4k-monitor-lm55-f400n-price-in-nepal\",\"accessed\":\"2026-11-23\"}]',NULL,'https://onin.com.np/product/dahua-55-inch-4k-monitor-lm55-f400n-price-in-nepal',0,'2026-11-22 18:15:00','2026-11-22 18:15:00'),(2626,108,38,'Dahua DHI-LM27-GO34A 27\" QHD 240Hz QD-OLED Gaming Monitor','dahua-lm27-go34a-27-inch-qd-oled-240hz',NULL,'gadgets/2026/dahua-lm27-go34a-27-inch-qd-oled-240hz.webp',NULL,NULL,143999.00,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,'available',NULL,0,0,'<p>Once you\'ve gamed on an OLED, it\'s hard to go back. Every pixel lights itself, so blacks are truly black, contrast is effectively infinite, and motion is almost perfectly clear. The Dahua LM27-GO34A brings a <strong>QD-OLED</strong> panel to ONIN Infosys\'s shelf for <strong>Rs 1,43,999</strong>, with a <strong>2-year warranty</strong>.</p>\n<p>It\'s a 26.5-inch <strong>QHD (2560 × 1440)</strong> screen at <strong>240Hz</strong> with a <strong>0.03 ms</strong> response time, about the fastest pixel response any display offers. QD-OLED delivers vivid colour (99% DCI-P3) and HDR 400 with up to 400 nits. Dark scenes in horror and space games look extraordinary. It also has HDMI 2.1 and DisplayPort 1.4, 5W × 2 speakers, and a fully adjustable stand (height, tilt, swivel, pivot).</p>\n<p>A note on OLED care: static elements like taskbars and HUDs can cause burn-in over long periods, so use the monitor\'s protection features and an auto-hiding taskbar. For a wider, curved QD-OLED with a longer warranty plan, look at the <a href=\"/products/msi-mpg-341cqpx-34-inch-qd-oled-240hz\">MSI MPG 341CQPX</a>.</p>','[{\"question\":\"What is the Dahua DHI-LM27-GO34A price in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"ONIN Infosys sells the Dahua DHI-LM27-GO34A 26.5-inch QHD 240Hz QD-OLED gaming monitor for Rs 1,43,999 with a 2-year warranty.\"},{\"question\":\"What is the response time of the Dahua QD-OLED monitor?\",\"answer\":\"0.03 ms.\"},{\"question\":\"Can OLED monitors get burn-in?\",\"answer\":\"Yes, static images over long periods can cause it. Use the monitor\'s protection features and avoid leaving static content on screen for hours.\"}]','[{\"label\":\"ONIN Infosys \\u2013 Dahua DHI-LM27-GO34A 27\\\" QHD 240Hz QD-OLED Gaming Monitor\",\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/onin.com.np\\/product\\/dahua-dhi-lm27-go34a-qd-oled-240hz-gaming-monitor-price-nepal\",\"accessed\":\"2026-11-23\"}]',NULL,'https://onin.com.np/product/dahua-dhi-lm27-go34a-qd-oled-240hz-gaming-monitor-price-nepal',0,'2026-11-22 18:15:00','2026-11-22 18:15:00'),(2627,9,38,'Dell 22 Monitor SE2225HM (FHD 100Hz VA)','dell-se2225hm-22-inch-va-100hz',NULL,'gadgets/2026/dell-se2225hm-22-inch-va-100hz.webp',NULL,NULL,14999.00,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,'available',NULL,0,0,'<p>If your office is standardised on Dell, the SE2225HM is the simple monitor to add to every desk. ONIN Infosys currently asks <strong>Rs 14,999</strong>.</p>\n<p>It\'s a 21.45-inch Full HD <strong>VA</strong> panel with a 3000:1 contrast ratio and a <strong>100Hz</strong> refresh rate. Text looks crisp against deep blacks, and scrolling is smoother than on older 60Hz Dell screens. Dell\'s ComfortView eye-comfort technology reduces blue light, and the anti-glare coating handles overhead office lighting well. Brightness is 250 nits, with a 5 ms response time.</p>\n<p>Inputs are HDMI (1080p at 100Hz) and VGA, and there\'s a security lock slot. It has no speakers, no height adjustment and no DisplayPort. It\'s a straightforward, dependable screen. You pay a little more than for the <a href=\"/products/msi-pro-mp225v-22-inch-va-100hz\">MSI PRO MP225V</a>, which has similar specs and a 2-year warranty. Choose the Dell for brand consistency and Dell\'s service network.</p>','[{\"question\":\"What is the Dell SE2225HM price in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"ONIN Infosys sells the Dell 22 Monitor SE2225HM for Rs 14,999 with a 1-year official warranty.\"},{\"question\":\"What panel does the Dell SE2225HM use?\",\"answer\":\"A 21.45-inch Full HD VA panel at 100Hz with 3000:1 contrast.\"},{\"question\":\"Does the Dell SE2225HM have HDMI?\",\"answer\":\"Yes, one HDMI port (up to FHD 100Hz) and one VGA port.\"}]','[{\"label\":\"ONIN Infosys \\u2013 Dell 22 Monitor SE2225HM (FHD 100Hz VA)\",\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/onin.com.np\\/product\\/dell-se2225hm-22-inch-monitor-price-nepal\",\"accessed\":\"2026-11-23\"}]',NULL,'https://onin.com.np/product/dell-se2225hm-22-inch-monitor-price-nepal',0,'2026-11-22 18:15:00','2026-11-22 18:15:00'),(2628,9,38,'Dell S2725H 27\" FHD IPS 100Hz Monitor','dell-s2725h-27-inch-ips-100hz',NULL,'gadgets/2026/dell-s2725h-27-inch-ips-100hz.webp',NULL,NULL,28499.00,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,'available',NULL,0,0,'<p>Dell\'s S-series is designed for homes rather than offices, with a more stylish design and built-in speakers. The S2725H brings that to a 27-inch screen. ONIN Infosys has it at <strong>Rs 28,499</strong>.</p>\n<p>It\'s a 27-inch Full HD IPS panel at <strong>100Hz</strong>, with <strong>99% sRGB</strong> colour, 300 nits and 1500:1 contrast. That\'s brighter and more colour-accurate than budget 27-inch screens. Response time can be set to 4 ms in Extreme mode for casual gaming. There are two HDMI ports, so a laptop and a game console can share it without swapping cables, and the speakers handle calls and YouTube. The stand tilts from -5° to +21°.</p>\n<p>As with every 27-inch Full HD monitor, text is a little softer up close than on a 24-inch or a QHD screen. At a normal viewing distance it\'s fine. If smoothness matters more than colour, the <a href=\"/products/msi-pro-mp273w-e14a-27-inch-144hz\">MSI PRO MP273W</a> is 144Hz with a 2-year warranty for Rs 5,000 less.</p>','[{\"question\":\"What is the Dell S2725H price in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"ONIN Infosys sells the Dell S2725H 27-inch FHD IPS 100Hz monitor for Rs 28,499.\"},{\"question\":\"Does the Dell S2725H have speakers?\",\"answer\":\"Yes, it has built-in speakers.\"},{\"question\":\"How many HDMI ports does the Dell S2725H have?\",\"answer\":\"Two HDMI ports (HDCP 1.4), supporting FHD at 100Hz.\"}]','[{\"label\":\"ONIN Infosys \\u2013 Dell S2725H 27\\\" FHD IPS 100Hz Monitor\",\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/onin.com.np\\/product\\/dell-27-inch-100hz-monitor-price-nepal\",\"accessed\":\"2026-11-23\"}]',NULL,'https://onin.com.np/product/dell-27-inch-100hz-monitor-price-nepal',0,'2026-11-22 18:15:00','2026-11-22 18:15:00'),(2629,48,38,'MSI PRO MP225V 22\" FHD 100Hz VA Monitor','msi-pro-mp225v-22-inch-va-100hz',NULL,'gadgets/2026/msi-pro-mp225v-22-inch-va-100hz.webp',NULL,NULL,12300.00,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,'available',NULL,0,0,'<p>The MSI PRO MP225V is about the least you can spend on a good new monitor in Nepal: <strong>Rs 12,300</strong> at ONIN Infosys, with a <strong>2-year warranty</strong>. That\'s double the warranty you get on most budget screens.</p>\n<p>It\'s a 21.45-inch Full HD <strong>VA</strong> panel. VA\'s strength is contrast, and at 4000:1 blacks look properly dark, so films and dark games have more depth than on a typical IPS office monitor. It refreshes at <strong>100Hz</strong> with Adaptive-Sync, which makes scrolling and cursor movement noticeably smoother than 60Hz. MSI rates it at 300 nits and 100% sRGB. Anti-flicker, low blue light and MSI\'s EyesErgo modes help on long days.</p>\n<p>There are no built-in speakers. Audio goes out through a 3.5 mm jack. The stand tilts only, but it\'s VESA 100 × 100 mountable if you want an arm. As a second screen for a laptop, a home-office starter or a student\'s desk, it\'s hard to argue with. If you prefer IPS colours and viewing angles, the <a href=\"/products/msi-pro-mp225-22-inch-ips-100hz\">MSI PRO MP225</a> costs Rs 700 more.</p>','[{\"question\":\"What is the MSI PRO MP225V price in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"ONIN Infosys sells the MSI PRO MP225V 21.45-inch FHD 100Hz VA monitor for Rs 12,300 with a 2-year warranty.\"},{\"question\":\"Does the MSI PRO MP225V have speakers?\",\"answer\":\"No. It has a 3.5 mm audio output for headphones or external speakers.\"},{\"question\":\"Is the MP225V VA or IPS?\",\"answer\":\"It uses a VA panel with a 4000:1 contrast ratio.\"}]','[{\"label\":\"ONIN Infosys \\u2013 MSI PRO MP225V 22\\\" FHD 100Hz VA Monitor\",\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/onin.com.np\\/product\\/msi-pro-mp225v-22-inch-fhd-100hz-va-eye-care-nepal\",\"accessed\":\"2026-11-23\"}]',NULL,'https://onin.com.np/product/msi-pro-mp225v-22-inch-fhd-100hz-va-eye-care-nepal',0,'2026-11-22 18:15:00','2026-11-22 18:15:00'),(2630,48,38,'MSI PRO MP225 21.5\" FHD 100Hz IPS Monitor','msi-pro-mp225-22-inch-ips-100hz',NULL,'gadgets/2026/msi-pro-mp225-22-inch-ips-100hz.webp',NULL,NULL,12999.00,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,'available',NULL,0,0,'<p>The MSI PRO MP225 is the IPS sibling of the MP225V, and that\'s the main reason to pick it. IPS keeps colours consistent when you look from an angle, which helps when two people share a screen or when the monitor sits beside your laptop rather than straight ahead. The price at ONIN Infosys is <strong>Rs 12,999</strong> with a <strong>2-year warranty</strong>.</p>\n<p>It\'s a 21.5-inch Full HD panel at <strong>100Hz</strong> with 1ms MPRT, 250 nits and 1300:1 contrast. MSI\'s eye-care suite includes flicker-free, Low Blue Light Plus, an ePaper reading mode and a colour-weakness mode. Inputs are HDMI (1080p at 100Hz) and VGA, useful for older office PCs, plus a headphone jack. It has a frameless three-sided design, tilt adjustment and VESA 100 × 100 mounting.</p>\n<p>Should you go bigger? If desk space allows, the <a href=\"/products/msi-pro-mp243l-e14-24-inch-144hz\">MSI PRO MP243L</a> moves to 23.8 inches and 144Hz for about Rs 5,500 more.</p>','[{\"question\":\"What is the MSI PRO MP225 price in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"ONIN Infosys sells the MSI PRO MP225 21.5-inch FHD 100Hz IPS monitor for Rs 12,999 with a 2-year warranty.\"},{\"question\":\"What inputs does the MSI PRO MP225 have?\",\"answer\":\"HDMI 1.4b (FHD at 100Hz), VGA and a 3.5 mm headphone jack.\"},{\"question\":\"Can the MSI PRO MP225 be wall-mounted?\",\"answer\":\"Yes, it supports VESA 100 \\u00d7 100 mm mounts.\"}]','[{\"label\":\"ONIN Infosys \\u2013 MSI PRO MP225 21.5\\\" FHD 100Hz IPS Monitor\",\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/onin.com.np\\/product\\/msi-pro-mp225-22-inch-fhd-100hz-eye-care-nepal\",\"accessed\":\"2026-11-23\"}]',NULL,'https://onin.com.np/product/msi-pro-mp225-22-inch-fhd-100hz-eye-care-nepal',0,'2026-11-22 18:15:00','2026-11-22 18:15:00'),(2631,48,38,'MSI PRO MP243L E14 23.8\" FHD 144Hz IPS Monitor','msi-pro-mp243l-e14-24-inch-144hz',NULL,'gadgets/2026/msi-pro-mp243l-e14-24-inch-144hz.webp',NULL,NULL,18499.00,23999.00,0,NULL,NULL,'available',NULL,0,0,'<p>A <strong>144Hz</strong> IPS monitor for <strong>Rs 18,499</strong>, with a <strong>2-year warranty</strong>, is excellent value. The MSI PRO MP243L E14 is sold as an office monitor, but the refresh rate makes it a genuinely good budget gaming screen too.</p>\n<p>The 23.8-inch Full HD IPS panel runs at 144Hz with 1ms MPRT and AMD FreeSync, so Valorant, CS2 and Fortnite look smooth and tear-free when your GPU can keep up. Everyday scrolling feels fluid as well. Brightness is 250 nits, with 1500:1 contrast and an anti-glare matte finish. The eye-care features are TÜV-certified anti-flicker and low blue light.</p>\n<p>Inputs are HDMI 2.0 (1080p at 144Hz) and VGA. There\'s no DisplayPort, so check that your PC or laptop has HDMI. The stand tilts, and the PerfectEdge four-side frameless design suits multi-monitor setups. For more serious gaming with a better stand and faster IPS, look at the <a href=\"/products/msi-mag-256f-24-5-inch-180hz\">MSI MAG 256F at 180Hz</a>.</p>','[{\"question\":\"What is the MSI PRO MP243L E14 price in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"ONIN Infosys sells the MSI PRO MP243L E14 23.8-inch FHD 144Hz IPS monitor for Rs 18,499 with a 2-year warranty.\"},{\"question\":\"Is the MSI PRO MP243L good for gaming?\",\"answer\":\"For casual and esports gaming, yes. It runs at 144Hz with 1ms MPRT and FreeSync.\"},{\"question\":\"Does it have DisplayPort?\",\"answer\":\"No. It has HDMI 2.0 (supports 144Hz) and VGA.\"}]','[{\"label\":\"ONIN Infosys \\u2013 MSI PRO MP243L E14 23.8\\\" FHD 144Hz IPS Monitor\",\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/onin.com.np\\/product\\/msi-pro-mp243l-e14-144hz-monitor-price-nepal\",\"accessed\":\"2026-11-23\"}]',NULL,'https://onin.com.np/product/msi-pro-mp243l-e14-144hz-monitor-price-nepal',0,'2026-11-22 18:15:00','2026-11-22 18:15:00'),(2632,48,38,'MSI PRO MP273W E14A 27\" FHD 144Hz IPS Monitor','msi-pro-mp273w-e14a-27-inch-144hz',NULL,'gadgets/2026/msi-pro-mp273w-e14a-27-inch-144hz.webp',NULL,NULL,23499.00,24999.00,0,NULL,NULL,'available',NULL,0,0,'<p>A 27-inch monitor at 144Hz with speakers and a 2-year warranty for <strong>Rs 23,499</strong>: the MSI PRO MP273W E14A is one of the best-value big screens on ONIN Infosys\'s shelf.</p>\n<p>The 27-inch IPS panel runs at <strong>144Hz</strong> with 1ms MPRT and AMD FreeSync, so everything from spreadsheets to shooters moves smoothly. Brightness is 250 nits, with 1500:1 contrast and an anti-glare finish. Built-in <strong>3W × 2 speakers</strong> are louder than most monitor speakers. MSI\'s TÜV-certified EyesErgo low-blue-light and anti-flicker features help through long days.</p>\n<p>One thing to know before buying: 27 inches at Full HD (1920 × 1080) means larger pixels than on a 24-inch screen. Text looks slightly softer up close. Sit about an arm\'s length away and it\'s comfortable. If sharpness matters, step up to a 27-inch QHD like the <a href=\"/products/msi-mag-275qf-27-inch-qhd-180hz\">MSI MAG 275QF</a>. For a near-identical 27-inch at the same price with a brighter 300-nit panel, compare the <a href=\"/products/msi-pro-mp275-e14l-27-inch-144hz\">MSI PRO MP275 E14L</a>.</p>','[{\"question\":\"What is the MSI PRO MP273W E14A price in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"ONIN Infosys sells the MSI PRO MP273W E14A 27-inch FHD 144Hz IPS monitor for Rs 23,499 with a 2-year warranty.\"},{\"question\":\"Does the MSI PRO MP273W have speakers?\",\"answer\":\"Yes, built-in 3W \\u00d7 2 speakers.\"},{\"question\":\"Is Full HD sharp enough at 27 inches?\",\"answer\":\"It is comfortable at normal desk distance, though text is less crisp than on a 27-inch QHD monitor.\"}]','[{\"label\":\"ONIN Infosys \\u2013 MSI PRO MP273W E14A 27\\\" FHD 144Hz IPS Monitor\",\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/onin.com.np\\/product\\/msi-pro-mp273w-e14a-price-nepal-144hz-monitor\",\"accessed\":\"2026-11-23\"}]',NULL,'https://onin.com.np/product/msi-pro-mp273w-e14a-price-nepal-144hz-monitor',0,'2026-11-22 18:15:00','2026-11-22 18:15:00'),(2633,48,38,'MSI PRO MP275 E14L 27\" FHD 144Hz IPS Monitor','msi-pro-mp275-e14l-27-inch-144hz',NULL,'gadgets/2026/msi-pro-mp275-e14l-27-inch-144hz.webp',NULL,NULL,23499.00,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,'available',NULL,0,0,'<p>The MSI PRO MP275 E14L is the same price as the <a href=\"/products/msi-pro-mp273w-e14a-27-inch-144hz\">MP273W</a>, <strong>Rs 23,499</strong> at ONIN Infosys, and nearly the same monitor. A few details tip it for some buyers: a brighter <strong>300-nit</strong> panel and wider colour (110% sRGB, 85% DCI-P3), which make photos and video a bit punchier.</p>\n<p>It\'s a 27-inch Full HD IPS panel at <strong>144Hz</strong> with 1ms MPRT and FreeSync. It has PerfectEdge four-side frameless bezels, 2W × 2 speakers, headphone-out and line-in, and HDMI 2.0 plus VGA inputs. Eye comfort comes from TÜV-certified anti-flicker and low blue light, and it\'s ENERGY STAR certified. The stand tilts, and it\'s VESA mountable. A <strong>2-year warranty</strong> applies.</p>\n<p>Which MSI 27-inch should you buy? If you watch a lot of video or edit photos casually, the MP275\'s brighter, more colourful panel is worth choosing. If you want louder speakers, the MP273W\'s 3W drivers win. Either way, there\'s no DisplayPort, so you\'ll connect over HDMI.</p>','[{\"question\":\"What is the MSI PRO MP275 E14L price in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"ONIN Infosys sells the MSI PRO MP275 E14L 27-inch FHD 144Hz IPS monitor for Rs 23,499 with a 2-year warranty.\"},{\"question\":\"How bright is the MSI PRO MP275?\",\"answer\":\"300 nits, with 110% sRGB and 85% DCI-P3 colour coverage.\"},{\"question\":\"What inputs does it have?\",\"answer\":\"HDMI 2.0 (FHD at 144Hz) and VGA, plus headphone-out and line-in.\"}]','[{\"label\":\"ONIN Infosys \\u2013 MSI PRO MP275 E14L 27\\\" FHD 144Hz IPS Monitor\",\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/onin.com.np\\/product\\/msi-pro-mp275-e14l-27-inch-144hz-ips-monitor-price-nepal\",\"accessed\":\"2026-11-23\"}]',NULL,'https://onin.com.np/product/msi-pro-mp275-e14l-27-inch-144hz-ips-monitor-price-nepal',0,'2026-11-22 18:15:00','2026-11-22 18:15:00'),(2634,48,38,'MSI PRO MP245PG E14 23.8\" FHD 144Hz IPS Monitor','msi-pro-mp245pg-e14-24-inch-144hz-ergonomic',NULL,'gadgets/2026/msi-pro-mp245pg-e14-24-inch-144hz-ergonomic.webp',NULL,NULL,27499.00,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,'available',NULL,0,0,'<p>The MSI PRO MP245PG E14 combines a <strong>144Hz</strong> IPS panel with a <strong>four-way adjustable stand</strong> (height, tilt, swivel and pivot), a combination usually reserved for more expensive monitors. ONIN Infosys currently asks <strong>Rs 27,499</strong> with a <strong>2-year warranty</strong>.</p>\n<p>The 23.8-inch Full HD panel has 178° viewing angles, 1500:1 contrast and an anti-glare finish. Adaptive-Sync with 1ms MPRT keeps games and scrolling smooth. The adjustable stand lets you set it up properly for long work sessions, or rotate it to portrait for code and documents. It\'s VESA 100 × 100 if you\'d rather use an arm.</p>\n<p>It costs about Rs 1,000 more than BenQ\'s <a href=\"/products/benq-gw2490t-24-inch-ergonomic-100hz\">GW2490T</a>, which has a similar stand. The MSI\'s advantage is 144Hz against 100Hz and an extra year of warranty. The BenQ\'s is auto-brightness and BenQ\'s eye-care tuning. For a work monitor you\'ll also game on, we\'d lean MSI.</p>','[{\"question\":\"What is the MSI PRO MP245PG E14 price in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"ONIN Infosys sells the MSI PRO MP245PG E14 23.8-inch FHD 144Hz IPS monitor for Rs 27,499 with a 2-year warranty.\"},{\"question\":\"Does the MSI PRO MP245PG have a height-adjustable stand?\",\"answer\":\"Yes, a 4-way ergonomic stand with height, tilt, swivel and pivot.\"},{\"question\":\"What refresh rate is it?\",\"answer\":\"144Hz with 1ms MPRT and Adaptive-Sync.\"}]','[{\"label\":\"ONIN Infosys \\u2013 MSI PRO MP245PG E14 23.8\\\" FHD 144Hz IPS Monitor\",\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/onin.com.np\\/product\\/msi-pro-mp245pg-e14-price-nepal\",\"accessed\":\"2026-11-23\"}]',NULL,'https://onin.com.np/product/msi-pro-mp245pg-e14-price-nepal',0,'2026-11-22 18:15:00','2026-11-22 18:15:00'),(2635,48,38,'MSI MAG 276CXF 27\" Curved FHD 280Hz Gaming Monitor','msi-mag-276cxf-27-inch-curved-280hz',NULL,'gadgets/2026/msi-mag-276cxf-27-inch-curved-280hz.webp',NULL,NULL,30499.00,32499.00,0,NULL,NULL,'available',NULL,0,0,'<p><strong>280Hz</strong> for Rs 30,499 is remarkable. That\'s what ONIN Infosys charges for the MSI MAG 276CXF, a 27-inch 1500R curved gaming monitor that suits players chasing very high frame rates in esports titles. It comes with a <strong>2-year warranty</strong>.</p>\n<p>It uses a <strong>Rapid VA</strong> panel, which pairs VA\'s deep 4000:1 contrast (rich blacks in dark maps) with a quoted 0.5 ms response time. You get 280Hz over DisplayPort 1.4a, or 240Hz over its two HDMI 2.0b ports, which is useful for consoles and secondary PCs. Colour covers 102% sRGB at 300 nits, and Adaptive-Sync eliminates tearing.</p>\n<p>The trade-offs: it\'s Full HD at 27 inches, so text is softer than on QHD screens. VA panels can show slight smearing in very dark, fast scenes. And you\'ll only see the benefit of 280Hz if your GPU pushes those frame rates, which means esports titles rather than AAA games. For a flat, colour-accurate alternative, see the <a href=\"/products/msi-mag-255pxf-24-5-inch-300hz\">MSI MAG 255PXF at 300Hz</a>.</p>','[{\"question\":\"What is the MSI MAG 276CXF price in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"ONIN Infosys sells the MSI MAG 276CXF 27-inch curved 280Hz gaming monitor for Rs 30,499 with a 2-year warranty.\"},{\"question\":\"Does the MSI MAG 276CXF reach 280Hz over HDMI?\",\"answer\":\"No. 280Hz needs DisplayPort 1.4a; HDMI 2.0b supports up to 240Hz.\"},{\"question\":\"What is the curvature of the MSI MAG 276CXF?\",\"answer\":\"1500R.\"}]','[{\"label\":\"ONIN Infosys \\u2013 MSI MAG 276CXF 27\\\" Curved FHD 280Hz Gaming Monitor\",\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/onin.com.np\\/product\\/msi-mag-276cxf-price-nepal-280hz-gaming-monitor\",\"accessed\":\"2026-11-23\"}]',NULL,'https://onin.com.np/product/msi-mag-276cxf-price-nepal-280hz-gaming-monitor',0,'2026-11-22 18:15:00','2026-11-22 18:15:00'),(2636,48,38,'MSI MAG 256F 24.5\" FHD 180Hz Rapid IPS Gaming Monitor','msi-mag-256f-24-5-inch-180hz',NULL,'gadgets/2026/msi-mag-256f-24-5-inch-180hz.webp',NULL,NULL,31499.00,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,'available',NULL,0,0,'<p>The MSI MAG 256F is a well-rounded gaming monitor. A <strong>Rapid IPS</strong> panel gives you IPS colour and viewing angles with fast response, at <strong>180Hz</strong> on a 24.5-inch Full HD screen, the classic esports size. It\'s on ONIN Infosys\'s shelf at <strong>Rs 31,499</strong>.</p>\n<p>Response time is 1 ms GtG, so motion stays clean. Adaptive-Sync (G-SYNC compatible) prevents tearing, and the panel shows 1.07 billion colours. That makes it equally comfortable for competitive shooters, story games, YouTube and light photo editing. Inputs are two HDMI and one DisplayPort, plus a headphone jack, so a PC and a console can both stay connected.</p>\n<p>It\'s a step up in motion clarity and colour from the budget <a href=\"/products/msi-pro-mp243l-e14-24-inch-144hz\">MSI PRO MP243L</a>. If you want the absolute highest refresh rate, the <a href=\"/products/msi-mag-255pxf-24-5-inch-300hz\">MSI MAG 255PXF</a> goes to 300Hz for Rs 4,000 more.</p>','[{\"question\":\"What is the MSI MAG 256F price in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"ONIN Infosys sells the MSI MAG 256F 24.5-inch FHD 180Hz Rapid IPS gaming monitor for Rs 31,499.\"},{\"question\":\"What is Rapid IPS?\",\"answer\":\"A faster type of IPS panel that keeps IPS colour and viewing angles while reducing response time for gaming.\"},{\"question\":\"What inputs does the MSI MAG 256F have?\",\"answer\":\"Two HDMI ports, one DisplayPort and a headphone-out jack.\"}]','[{\"label\":\"ONIN Infosys \\u2013 MSI MAG 256F 24.5\\\" FHD 180Hz Rapid IPS Gaming Monitor\",\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/onin.com.np\\/product\\/msi-mag-256f-monitor-price-in-nepal\",\"accessed\":\"2026-11-23\"}]',NULL,'https://onin.com.np/product/msi-mag-256f-monitor-price-in-nepal',0,'2026-11-22 18:15:00','2026-11-22 18:15:00'),(2637,48,38,'MSI MAG 275QF 27\" WQHD 180Hz Rapid IPS Gaming Monitor','msi-mag-275qf-27-inch-qhd-180hz',NULL,'gadgets/2026/msi-mag-275qf-27-inch-qhd-180hz.webp',NULL,NULL,35499.00,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,'available',NULL,0,0,'<p>If we had to pick one gaming monitor for most people in Nepal, it would be a 27-inch QHD screen, and the MSI MAG 275QF is an excellent one at <strong>Rs 35,499</strong> from ONIN Infosys, with a <strong>2-year warranty</strong>.</p>\n<p>At 27 inches, <strong>2560 × 1440</strong> is the sweet spot. Text is crisp, there\'s far more room for windows than on Full HD, and modern mid-range GPUs (RTX 4060/5060 class) can drive it at high frame rates. The <strong>Rapid IPS</strong> panel runs at <strong>180Hz</strong> over DisplayPort (144Hz over HDMI) with a 0.5 ms response time, and covers 101% sRGB and 82% Adobe RGB at 300 nits. Games look sharp and smooth, and photos look accurate.</p>\n<p>Inputs are one DisplayPort 1.4 and two HDMI 2.0b, plus a headphone jack. There are no speakers. FreeSync/Adaptive-Sync, MSI\'s AI Vision modes and TÜV-certified eye care are included. The stand is basic, so consider a monitor arm (it\'s VESA compatible).</p>\n<p>For work rather than play, the <a href=\"/products/benq-gw2790q-27-inch-qhd-100hz\">BenQ GW2790Q</a> has the same resolution at 100Hz with speakers and BenQ\'s eye-care tuning for the same price.</p>','[{\"question\":\"What is the MSI MAG 275QF price in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"ONIN Infosys sells the MSI MAG 275QF 27-inch WQHD 180Hz Rapid IPS gaming monitor for Rs 35,499 with a 2-year warranty.\"},{\"question\":\"Does the MSI MAG 275QF reach 180Hz over HDMI?\",\"answer\":\"No. 180Hz needs DisplayPort; HDMI 2.0b supports up to 144Hz at WQHD.\"},{\"question\":\"Does it have speakers?\",\"answer\":\"No. It has a headphone-out jack.\"}]','[{\"label\":\"ONIN Infosys \\u2013 MSI MAG 275QF 27\\\" WQHD 180Hz Rapid IPS Gaming Monitor\",\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/onin.com.np\\/product\\/msi-mag-275qf-27-2k-180hz-hdr-free-sync-nepal\",\"accessed\":\"2026-11-23\"}]',NULL,'https://onin.com.np/product/msi-mag-275qf-27-2k-180hz-hdr-free-sync-nepal',0,'2026-11-22 18:15:00','2026-11-22 18:15:00'),(2638,48,38,'MSI MAG 255PXF 24.5\" FHD 300Hz Rapid IPS Gaming Monitor','msi-mag-255pxf-24-5-inch-300hz',NULL,'gadgets/2026/msi-mag-255pxf-24-5-inch-300hz.webp',NULL,NULL,35499.00,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,'available',NULL,0,0,'<p>The MSI MAG 255PXF is built for competitive players who want every possible frame. It runs at <strong>300Hz</strong> over DisplayPort (240Hz over HDMI) on a 24.5-inch Full HD <strong>Rapid IPS</strong> panel with a 0.5 ms response time. ONIN Infosys has it at <strong>Rs 35,499</strong> with a <strong>2-year warranty</strong>.</p>\n<p>Unlike older esports TN panels, this IPS screen also looks good. It covers 120% sRGB and 90% DCI-P3, so you don\'t sacrifice colour for speed. FreeSync Premium eliminates tearing, and it\'s G-SYNC compatible. Built-in 2W × 2 speakers, an anti-glare finish and VESA mounting round it out.</p>\n<p>Will you notice 300Hz? In CS2, Valorant and Apex on a GPU that sustains very high frame rates, motion feels clearer and more responsive. If your PC averages under 150 fps, a 180Hz monitor like the <a href=\"/products/msi-mag-256f-24-5-inch-180hz\">MSI MAG 256F</a> gives most of the benefit for less. For a contrast-rich curved alternative, see the <a href=\"/products/msi-mag-276cxf-27-inch-curved-280hz\">MAG 276CXF at 280Hz</a>.</p>','[{\"question\":\"What is the MSI MAG 255PXF price in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"ONIN Infosys sells the MSI MAG 255PXF 24.5-inch FHD 300Hz Rapid IPS gaming monitor for Rs 35,499 with a 2-year warranty.\"},{\"question\":\"Can the MSI MAG 255PXF run at 300Hz over HDMI?\",\"answer\":\"No. 300Hz needs DisplayPort 1.4a; HDMI 2.0b supports up to 240Hz.\"},{\"question\":\"Does the MSI MAG 255PXF have speakers?\",\"answer\":\"Yes, built-in 2W \\u00d7 2 speakers.\"}]','[{\"label\":\"ONIN Infosys \\u2013 MSI MAG 255PXF 24.5\\\" FHD 300Hz Rapid IPS Gaming Monitor\",\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/onin.com.np\\/product\\/msi-mag-255pxf-price-nepal-300hz-gaming-monitor\",\"accessed\":\"2026-11-23\"}]',NULL,'https://onin.com.np/product/msi-mag-255pxf-price-nepal-300hz-gaming-monitor',0,'2026-11-22 18:15:00','2026-11-22 18:15:00'),(2639,48,38,'MSI PRO MP272PMG 27\" FHD 120Hz Monitor with Webcam','msi-pro-mp272pmg-27-inch-webcam-monitor',NULL,'gadgets/2026/msi-pro-mp272pmg-27-inch-webcam-monitor.webp',NULL,NULL,37999.00,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,'available',NULL,0,0,'<p>Video calls are part of every job now, and the MSI PRO MP272PMG builds the whole setup into the screen. It has a <strong>1080p webcam</strong> with a physical privacy cover, a digital microphone and 2W × 2 speakers, so a desktop PC needs nothing else to join a meeting. ONIN Infosys lists it at <strong>Rs 37,999</strong>.</p>\n<p>The 27-inch Full HD IPS panel runs at <strong>120Hz</strong>, smoother than a typical 60Hz office monitor, with 300 nits and wide colour (116% sRGB, 90% DCI-P3). The <strong>four-way stand</strong> adjusts for height (up to 130 mm), tilt, swivel and pivot. That\'s the kind of ergonomics you want on a screen used eight hours a day. Inputs are HDMI, DisplayPort and VGA, which covers both modern and older office PCs.</p>\n<p>It\'s ideal for HR teams, call centres, managers working from home, and anyone sharing a desktop PC who doesn\'t want a webcam clipped to the top. The trade-off is resolution: 27 inches at Full HD is less crisp than QHD for heavy spreadsheet work.</p>','[{\"question\":\"What is the MSI PRO MP272PMG price in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"ONIN Infosys sells the MSI PRO MP272PMG 27-inch FHD 120Hz monitor with built-in webcam for Rs 37,999.\"},{\"question\":\"Does the MSI PRO MP272PMG have a webcam and mic?\",\"answer\":\"Yes. It has a 1080p webcam with a privacy cover and a built-in microphone.\"},{\"question\":\"Is the stand height adjustable?\",\"answer\":\"Yes, it offers height, tilt, swivel and 90\\u00b0 pivot adjustment.\"}]','[{\"label\":\"ONIN Infosys \\u2013 MSI PRO MP272PMG 27\\\" FHD 120Hz Monitor with Webcam\",\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/onin.com.np\\/product\\/msi-pro-mp272pmg-price-nepal-120hz-webcam-monitor\",\"accessed\":\"2026-11-23\"}]',NULL,'https://onin.com.np/product/msi-pro-mp272pmg-price-nepal-120hz-webcam-monitor',0,'2026-11-22 18:15:00','2026-11-22 18:15:00'),(2640,48,38,'MSI PRO MP273U 27\" 4K UHD IPS Monitor','msi-pro-mp273u-27-inch-4k',NULL,'gadgets/2026/msi-pro-mp273u-27-inch-4k.webp',NULL,NULL,41499.00,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,'available',NULL,0,0,'<p>This is the most affordable 4K monitor on ONIN Infosys\'s shelf, at <strong>Rs 41,499</strong> with a <strong>2-year warranty</strong>, and its colour figures are impressive for the price.</p>\n<p>The 27-inch <strong>3840 × 2160</strong> IPS panel is pin-sharp. Text looks print-like with 150% scaling, and 4K video shows full detail. It covers <strong>98% DCI-P3, 93% Adobe RGB and 130% sRGB</strong>, so it suits photo editing, design work and colour-sensitive video at a fraction of designer-monitor prices. Brightness is 300 nits at 60Hz, and it\'s HDR Ready.</p>\n<p>Inputs are two HDMI 2.0b ports (4K60) and a DisplayPort 1.4a, and there are 3W × 2 speakers. What you don\'t get is USB-C, factory calibration reports or a height-adjustable stand. Those are what the BenQ DesignVue models charge more for. If you edit on a MacBook and want one-cable charging, the <a href=\"/products/benq-ma270u-27-4k-mac-monitor\">BenQ MA270U</a> is the upgrade.</p>','[{\"question\":\"What is the MSI PRO MP273U price in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"ONIN Infosys sells the MSI PRO MP273U 27-inch 4K UHD IPS monitor for Rs 41,499 with a 2-year warranty.\"},{\"question\":\"Is the MSI PRO MP273U good for photo editing?\",\"answer\":\"It covers 98% DCI-P3 and 93% Adobe RGB, which is strong for the price, though it is not factory-calibrated like professional designer monitors.\"},{\"question\":\"Does the MSI PRO MP273U have USB-C?\",\"answer\":\"No. It has two HDMI 2.0b ports and one DisplayPort 1.4a.\"}]','[{\"label\":\"ONIN Infosys \\u2013 MSI PRO MP273U 27\\\" 4K UHD IPS Monitor\",\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/onin.com.np\\/product\\/msi-pro-mp273u-4k-monitor-price-nepal\",\"accessed\":\"2026-11-23\"}]',NULL,'https://onin.com.np/product/msi-pro-mp273u-4k-monitor-price-nepal',0,'2026-11-22 18:15:00','2026-11-22 18:15:00'),(2641,48,38,'MSI MAG 321CQF E18 31.5\" WQHD 180Hz Curved Gaming Monitor','msi-mag-321cqf-e18-32-inch-curved-qhd-180hz',NULL,'gadgets/2026/msi-mag-321cqf-e18-32-inch-curved-qhd-180hz.webp',NULL,NULL,51499.00,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,'available',NULL,0,0,'<p>A 32-inch curved screen fills your vision in a way 27-inch monitors don\'t. The MSI MAG 321CQF E18 does it at <strong>WQHD (2560 × 1440)</strong> and <strong>180Hz</strong> for <strong>Rs 51,499</strong> at ONIN Infosys, with a <strong>2-year warranty</strong>.</p>\n<p>It uses a <strong>Rapid VA</strong> panel with a 1500R curve. VA\'s 3000:1 contrast gives deep, cinematic blacks for racing games, RPGs and films. Response is quoted at 0.5 ms, and colour is wide at 92% DCI-P3 and 124% sRGB with 300 nits. It runs 180Hz over DisplayPort 1.4a and 144Hz over its two HDMI 2.0b ports, enough for a PS5 or Xbox as well as a PC.</p>\n<p>At 31.5 inches, QHD has slightly lower pixel density than on a 27-inch screen, so sit a bit further back for the best look. If you want even more immersion, the <a href=\"/products/dahua-lm34-e330c-34-inch-ultrawide-180hz\">Dahua 34-inch ultrawide</a> adds a 21:9 aspect ratio for about Rs 7,500 more.</p>','[{\"question\":\"What is the MSI MAG 321CQF E18 price in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"ONIN Infosys sells the MSI MAG 321CQF E18 31.5-inch curved WQHD 180Hz gaming monitor for Rs 51,499 with a 2-year warranty.\"},{\"question\":\"What is the curvature of the MSI MAG 321CQF?\",\"answer\":\"1500R.\"},{\"question\":\"Can I connect a PS5 to the MSI MAG 321CQF?\",\"answer\":\"Yes, through either HDMI 2.0b port, which support WQHD at 144Hz.\"}]','[{\"label\":\"ONIN Infosys \\u2013 MSI MAG 321CQF E18 31.5\\\" WQHD 180Hz Curved Gaming Monitor\",\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/onin.com.np\\/product\\/msi-mag-321cqf-e18-curved-gaming-monitor-price-nepal\",\"accessed\":\"2026-11-23\"}]',NULL,'https://onin.com.np/product/msi-mag-321cqf-e18-curved-gaming-monitor-price-nepal',0,'2026-11-22 18:15:00','2026-11-22 18:15:00'),(2642,48,38,'MSI MAG 275UPD E14 27\" 4K 144Hz / FHD 288Hz Dual-Mode Monitor','msi-mag-275upd-e14-27-inch-4k-dual-mode',NULL,'gadgets/2026/msi-mag-275upd-e14-27-inch-4k-dual-mode.webp',NULL,NULL,56499.00,58499.00,0,NULL,NULL,'available',NULL,0,0,'<p>Why choose between a sharp 4K monitor and a lightning-fast esports one? The MSI MAG 275UPD E14 does both. At the press of a button it switches between <strong>4K UHD at 144Hz</strong> for AAA games and work, and <strong>Full HD at 288Hz</strong> for competitive shooters. ONIN Infosys currently asks <strong>Rs 56,499</strong> with a <strong>2-year warranty</strong>.</p>\n<p>The 27-inch <strong>Rapid IPS</strong> panel covers 90% DCI-P3 and 130% sRGB with 1500:1 contrast and 1 ms MPRT, with FreeSync Premium. Two <strong>HDMI 2.1</strong> ports support 4K at 144Hz plus VRR and ALLM, so a <strong>PS5 or Xbox Series X runs at 4K 120Hz</strong>. That\'s a big draw for console players. There\'s also DisplayPort 1.4a and 2W × 2 speakers.</p>\n<p>Brightness is 250 nits in SDR, adequate indoors but not a real HDR experience. For a pure work 4K monitor with USB-C and calibration, look at BenQ\'s <a href=\"/products/benq-designvue-pd2705u-27-inch-4k\">DesignVue PD2705U</a> instead.</p>','[{\"question\":\"What is the MSI MAG 275UPD E14 price in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"ONIN Infosys sells the MSI MAG 275UPD E14 27-inch dual-mode 4K gaming monitor for Rs 56,499 with a 2-year warranty.\"},{\"question\":\"What is dual mode on the MSI MAG 275UPD?\",\"answer\":\"It switches between 4K UHD at 144Hz and Full HD at 288Hz.\"},{\"question\":\"Does the MSI MAG 275UPD support PS5 at 4K 120Hz?\",\"answer\":\"Yes. Its HDMI 2.1 ports support 4K high refresh, VRR and ALLM.\"}]','[{\"label\":\"ONIN Infosys \\u2013 MSI MAG 275UPD E14 27\\\" 4K 144Hz \\/ FHD 288Hz Dual-Mode Monitor\",\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/onin.com.np\\/product\\/msi-mag-275upd-e14-dual-mode-4k-gaming-monitor-price-nepal\",\"accessed\":\"2026-11-23\"}]',NULL,'https://onin.com.np/product/msi-mag-275upd-e14-dual-mode-4k-gaming-monitor-price-nepal',0,'2026-11-22 18:15:00','2026-11-22 18:15:00'),(2643,48,38,'MSI MPG 341CQPX 34\" QD-OLED 240Hz Curved Ultrawide','msi-mpg-341cqpx-34-inch-qd-oled-240hz',NULL,'gadgets/2026/msi-mpg-341cqpx-34-inch-qd-oled-240hz.webp',NULL,NULL,189999.00,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,'available',NULL,0,0,'<p>The MSI MPG 341CQPX combines the two most immersive things in gaming displays: a <strong>34-inch 21:9 ultrawide</strong> curve and a <strong>QD-OLED</strong> panel. ONIN Infosys lists it at <strong>Rs 1,89,999</strong> with a <strong>2-year warranty</strong>.</p>\n<p>The 3440 × 1440 panel runs at <strong>240Hz</strong> with a 0.03 ms response, wraps around you with an 1800R curve, and reaches 1,000 nits on HDR highlights (DisplayHDR True Black 400). Colour is outstanding at 99.3% DCI-P3, factory-calibrated to Delta E ≤ 2. Racing games, flight sims and cinematic RPGs look spectacular, and the extra width is a real productivity boost for editing timelines.</p>\n<p>Connectivity is modern: two <strong>HDMI 2.1</strong> ports (240Hz at full resolution), DisplayPort 1.4a, and <strong>USB-C with 98W</strong> Power Delivery, so even a gaming laptop can connect with one cable. An anti-reflection coating keeps glare under control.</p>\n<p>You\'ll need a strong GPU (RTX 5070 Ti class or better) to make full use of 240Hz at this resolution. For the ultimate width, the <a href=\"/products/msi-mpg-491cqpx-49-inch-qd-oled-240hz\">49-inch MPG 491CQPX</a> doubles down. For a non-OLED ultrawide, the <a href=\"/products/dahua-lm34-e330c-34-inch-ultrawide-180hz\">Dahua 34-inch</a> costs a third as much.</p>','[{\"question\":\"What is the MSI MPG 341CQPX price in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"ONIN Infosys sells the MSI MPG 341CQPX 34-inch curved QD-OLED 240Hz monitor for Rs 1,89,999 with a 2-year warranty.\"},{\"question\":\"Does the MSI MPG 341CQPX have USB-C?\",\"answer\":\"Yes, with DisplayPort Alt Mode and 98W Power Delivery.\"},{\"question\":\"What is the peak HDR brightness?\",\"answer\":\"Up to 1,000 nits peak at 3% window, with DisplayHDR True Black 400 certification.\"}]','[{\"label\":\"ONIN Infosys \\u2013 MSI MPG 341CQPX 34\\\" QD-OLED 240Hz Curved Ultrawide\",\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/onin.com.np\\/product\\/msi-mpg-341cqpx-qd-oled-price-nepal\",\"accessed\":\"2026-11-23\"}]',NULL,'https://onin.com.np/product/msi-mpg-341cqpx-qd-oled-price-nepal',0,'2026-11-22 18:15:00','2026-11-22 18:15:00'),(2644,48,38,'MSI MPG 491CQPX 49\" QD-OLED 240Hz Super Ultrawide','msi-mpg-491cqpx-49-inch-qd-oled-240hz',NULL,'gadgets/2026/msi-mpg-491cqpx-49-inch-qd-oled-240hz.webp',NULL,NULL,249999.00,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,'available',NULL,0,0,'<p>The MSI MPG 491CQPX is the most dramatic monitor on ONIN Infosys\'s shelf: a <strong>49-inch 32:9 super ultrawide</strong>, the equivalent of two 27-inch 1440p monitors side by side with no bezel in the middle, built on a <strong>QD-OLED</strong> panel. It costs <strong>Rs 2,49,999</strong> with a <strong>2-year warranty</strong>.</p>\n<p>The <strong>5120 × 1440</strong> panel runs at <strong>240Hz</strong> with a 0.03 ms response and an 1800R curve, with near-infinite contrast and 99% DCI-P3. HDR highlights peak at 1,000 nits (DisplayHDR True Black 400). Sim racing, flight sims and strategy games become extraordinary. For work, it holds three full-size windows at once: editing timelines, trading dashboards, code and docs.</p>\n<p>It\'s also a hub. <strong>USB-C with 98W</strong> charges a laptop over one cable, and a built-in <strong>KVM</strong> lets you control a work laptop and a gaming PC with one keyboard and mouse. There are two HDMI 2.1 ports and DisplayPort 1.4a. MSI\'s OLED Care features help protect against burn-in.</p>\n<p>Make sure your desk is at least 1.2 m wide and your GPU is high-end. Driving 5120 × 1440 at high frame rates takes RTX 5080-class hardware. For a more manageable size, the 34-inch <a href=\"/products/msi-mpg-341cqpx-34-inch-qd-oled-240hz\">MPG 341CQPX</a> is the sensible sibling.</p>','[{\"question\":\"What is the MSI MPG 491CQPX price in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"ONIN Infosys sells the MSI MPG 491CQPX 49-inch QD-OLED 240Hz super ultrawide monitor for Rs 2,49,999 with a 2-year warranty.\"},{\"question\":\"What resolution is the MSI MPG 491CQPX?\",\"answer\":\"5120 \\u00d7 1440 (DQHD) in a 32:9 aspect ratio.\"},{\"question\":\"Does it have a KVM switch?\",\"answer\":\"Yes, plus USB-C with 98W Power Delivery.\"}]','[{\"label\":\"ONIN Infosys \\u2013 MSI MPG 491CQPX 49\\\" QD-OLED 240Hz Super Ultrawide\",\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/onin.com.np\\/product\\/msi-mpg-491cqpx-qd-oled-price-nepal\",\"accessed\":\"2026-11-23\"}]',NULL,'https://onin.com.np/product/msi-mpg-491cqpx-qd-oled-price-nepal',0,'2026-11-22 18:15:00','2026-11-22 18:15:00'),(2645,1,38,'Samsung 22\" T35F IPS FHD 75Hz Monitor (LF22T350FH)','samsung-t35f-22-inch-ips-75hz',NULL,'gadgets/2026/samsung-t35f-22-inch-ips-75hz.webp',NULL,NULL,19499.00,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,'available',NULL,0,0,'<p>The Samsung T35F is a clean, minimalist 22-inch monitor with a three-sided borderless design that looks good in a living room or a design-conscious office. ONIN Infosys sells the LF22T350FH for <strong>Rs 19,499</strong>.</p>\n<p>It\'s a Full HD <strong>IPS</strong> panel with 178° viewing angles, 250 nits brightness and a 5 ms response time. Refresh rate tops out at <strong>75Hz</strong> with AMD FreeSync, a small step up from 60Hz. Samsung\'s Eye Saver Mode and flicker-free backlight help with long sessions. Inputs are HDMI 1.4 and VGA.</p>\n<p>Being honest about value: you\'re paying for the Samsung name and the design. The <a href=\"/products/msi-pro-mp243l-e14-24-inch-144hz\">MSI PRO MP243L</a> is bigger at 23.8 inches, much smoother at 144Hz, comes with a 2-year warranty and costs Rs 1,000 less. Choose the Samsung if you want that particular look or need to match other Samsung monitors.</p>','[{\"question\":\"What is the Samsung 22-inch T35F monitor price in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"ONIN Infosys sells the Samsung T35F 22-inch Full HD IPS 75Hz monitor for Rs 19,499 with a 1-year warranty.\"},{\"question\":\"What refresh rate does the Samsung T35F support?\",\"answer\":\"Up to 75Hz with AMD FreeSync.\"},{\"question\":\"What inputs does it have?\",\"answer\":\"One HDMI 1.4 port and one VGA (D-Sub) port.\"}]','[{\"label\":\"ONIN Infosys \\u2013 Samsung 22\\\" T35F IPS FHD 75Hz Monitor (LF22T350FH)\",\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/onin.com.np\\/product\\/samsung-22-inch-t35f-ips-monitor-price-nepal\",\"accessed\":\"2026-11-23\"}]',NULL,'https://onin.com.np/product/samsung-22-inch-t35f-ips-monitor-price-nepal',0,'2026-11-22 18:15:00','2026-11-22 18:15:00'),(2646,3,38,'Xiaomi Mi 23.8\" FHD Desktop Monitor','xiaomi-mi-23-8-inch-desktop-monitor',NULL,'gadgets/2026/xiaomi-mi-23-8-inch-desktop-monitor.webp',NULL,NULL,28000.00,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,'available',NULL,0,0,'<p>The Xiaomi Mi 23.8-inch Desktop Monitor (RMMNT238NF) is a slim, minimalist IPS screen that suits a clean desk. ONIN Infosys sells it for <strong>Rs 28,000</strong>.</p>\n<p>It has a Full HD IPS panel with 178° viewing angles, narrow bezels on three sides, a flicker-free backlight and <strong>TÜV Rheinland low-blue-light certification</strong>. It\'s a pleasant screen for documents, browsing and video. The refresh rate is a standard 60Hz with a 6 ms response time.</p>\n<p>We have to be straightforward about value. At this price, it\'s competing with monitors that do more. The <a href=\"/products/msi-pro-mp245pg-e14-24-inch-144hz-ergonomic\">MSI PRO MP245PG</a> is the same size with 144Hz, a fully adjustable stand and a 2-year warranty for less money. The <a href=\"/products/benq-gw2490t-24-inch-ergonomic-100hz\">BenQ GW2490T</a> adds a height-adjustable stand and 99% sRGB. Choose the Xiaomi if you\'re matching other Mi products or love its look.</p>','[{\"question\":\"What is the Xiaomi Mi 23.8-inch monitor price in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"ONIN Infosys sells the Xiaomi Mi 23.8-inch Full HD desktop monitor for Rs 28,000.\"},{\"question\":\"What refresh rate does the Mi Desktop Monitor have?\",\"answer\":\"60Hz with a 6 ms (GtG) response time.\"},{\"question\":\"Is the Mi monitor eye-friendly?\",\"answer\":\"It is flicker-free and T\\u00dcV Rheinland certified for low blue light.\"}]','[{\"label\":\"ONIN Infosys \\u2013 Xiaomi Mi 23.8\\\" FHD Desktop Monitor\",\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/onin.com.np\\/product\\/mi-23-8-inch-desktop-monitor-price-in-nepal\",\"accessed\":\"2026-11-23\"}]',NULL,'https://onin.com.np/product/mi-23-8-inch-desktop-monitor-price-in-nepal',0,'2026-11-22 18:15:00','2026-11-22 18:15:00'),(2647,48,40,'MSI GeForce GT 210 1GB GDDR3 Low-Profile Graphics Card','msi-geforce-gt-210-1gb-low-profile','graphics-card','gadgets/2026/msi-geforce-gt-210-1gb-low-profile.webp',NULL,NULL,8499.00,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,'available',NULL,0,0,'<p>Let\'s be clear about what the GeForce GT 210 is for, because the name \"graphics card\" can mislead. This is <strong>not a gaming card</strong>. It\'s a basic display adapter that adds video outputs to a PC that lacks them, or replaces a failed onboard graphics chip in an older machine. ONIN Infosys sells MSI\'s 1GB GDDR3 version for <strong>Rs 8,499</strong>.</p>\n<p>Where it makes sense:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Office or bank PCs whose processors have no integrated graphics and need a working display output.</li>\n<li>Adding a second or third monitor to an old desktop for billing, CCTV viewing or reception screens.</li>\n<li>Small home-theatre PCs and slim office cases. It\'s a <strong>low-profile</strong> card (bracket permitting) that draws very little power and needs no extra power cable.</li>\n</ul>\n<p>It uses PCI Express x16 2.0 and works in modern slots. Driver support for this generation is limited on the newest Windows versions, so it\'s best suited to stable office setups. If you want to play games, edit video or use AI tools, look at a modern card such as the <a href=\"/products/pny-geforce-rtx-5060-8gb-oc-dual-fan\">PNY RTX 5060</a>.</p>','[{\"question\":\"What is the MSI GeForce GT 210 price in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"ONIN Infosys sells the MSI GeForce GT 210 1GB GDDR3 low-profile graphics card for Rs 8,499 with a 1-year warranty.\"},{\"question\":\"Can the GT 210 play games?\",\"answer\":\"Only very old or simple games. It is meant as a display adapter for office and older PCs.\"},{\"question\":\"Does the GT 210 need a separate power connector?\",\"answer\":\"No. It draws power from the PCIe slot.\"}]','[{\"label\":\"ONIN Infosys \\u2013 MSI GeForce GT 210 1GB GDDR3 Low-Profile Graphics Card\",\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/onin.com.np\\/product\\/msi-geforce-gt210-1gd3-lp-1gb-gddr3-price-nepal\",\"accessed\":\"2026-11-23\"}]',NULL,'https://onin.com.np/product/msi-geforce-gt210-1gd3-lp-1gb-gddr3-price-nepal',0,'2026-11-22 18:15:00','2026-11-22 18:15:00'),(2648,110,40,'PNY GeForce RTX 5060 8GB GDDR7 OC Dual Fan (VCG50608DFXPB1-O)','pny-geforce-rtx-5060-8gb-oc-dual-fan','graphics-card','gadgets/2026/pny-geforce-rtx-5060-8gb-oc-dual-fan.webp',NULL,NULL,87999.00,93499.00,0,NULL,NULL,'available',NULL,0,0,'<p>The RTX 5060 is the graphics card most people building a 1080p gaming PC in Nepal should look at first, and PNY\'s overclocked dual-fan version costs <strong>Rs 87,999</strong> at ONIN Infosys.</p>\n<p>Built on NVIDIA\'s Blackwell architecture, it has <strong>3,840 CUDA cores</strong> and <strong>8GB of fast GDDR7</strong> on a 128-bit bus. In practice it runs current games at 1080p high settings, and DLSS 4 with multi-frame generation pushes frame rates far higher in supported titles. That\'s enough for a 144–180Hz monitor in most games. It\'s also useful for Stable Diffusion and video encoding with NVENC.</p>\n<p>It\'s an easy card to fit into a typical build. Total board power is just <strong>145W</strong> from one 8-pin connector, PNY recommends a <strong>550W</strong> power supply, and the compact dual-fan design suits most mid-tower cases. Outputs are three DisplayPort 2.1b and one HDMI 2.1b. Note that it runs on PCIe 5.0 <strong>x8</strong>. On older PCIe 3.0 motherboards, that can cost some performance, so it\'s best paired with a PCIe 4.0 or newer board.</p>\n<p>For 1440p gaming or 12GB of VRAM, step up to the <a href=\"/products/pny-geforce-rtx-5070-12gb-oc-triple-fan\">PNY RTX 5070</a>. A good screen to pair with this card is the <a href=\"/products/msi-mag-256f-24-5-inch-180hz\">MSI MAG 256F 180Hz monitor</a>.</p>','[{\"question\":\"What is the PNY RTX 5060 8GB price in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"ONIN Infosys sells the PNY GeForce RTX 5060 8GB GDDR7 OC dual-fan graphics card for Rs 87,999 with a 1-year warranty.\"},{\"question\":\"What power supply do I need for the RTX 5060?\",\"answer\":\"PNY recommends a 550W or larger PSU with one 8-pin PCIe connector. The card\'s total board power is 145W.\"},{\"question\":\"Is the RTX 5060 good for 1080p gaming?\",\"answer\":\"Yes. It runs current games at 1080p high settings, and DLSS 4 raises frame rates further in supported titles.\"}]','[{\"label\":\"ONIN Infosys \\u2013 PNY GeForce RTX 5060 8GB GDDR7 OC Dual Fan (VCG50608DFXPB1-O)\",\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/onin.com.np\\/product\\/pny-geforce-rtx-5060-8gb-oc-dual-fan-price-nepal\",\"accessed\":\"2026-11-23\"}]',NULL,'https://onin.com.np/product/pny-geforce-rtx-5060-8gb-oc-dual-fan-price-nepal',2,'2026-11-22 18:15:00','2026-11-22 18:15:00'),(2649,110,40,'PNY GeForce RTX 5070 12GB GDDR7 OC Triple Fan (VCG507012TFXPB1-O)','pny-geforce-rtx-5070-12gb-oc-triple-fan','graphics-card','gadgets/2026/pny-geforce-rtx-5070-12gb-oc-triple-fan.webp',NULL,NULL,164999.00,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,'available',NULL,0,0,'<p>The RTX 5070 is the card for 1440p gaming, and the extra VRAM is the big reason to choose it over the RTX 5060. PNY\'s overclocked triple-fan model costs <strong>Rs 1,64,999</strong> at ONIN Infosys.</p>\n<p>It has <strong>6,144 CUDA cores</strong> (60% more than the RTX 5060), <strong>12GB of GDDR7</strong> and a 2,587MHz overclocked boost. That\'s enough to run current games at 2560 × 1440 with high settings and ray tracing, especially with DLSS 4 multi-frame generation on a 165–240Hz monitor. The 12GB frame buffer also gives breathing room for high-resolution textures and for creative and AI work: Blender, DaVinci Resolve and local image generation.</p>\n<p>The triple-fan cooler keeps it quiet under load but makes it a longer card, so measure your case first. It uses a full <strong>PCIe 5.0 x16</strong> interface, with outputs of three DisplayPort 2.1b and one HDMI 2.1b. Budget for a quality power supply (650–750W is a sensible target for a typical build).</p>\n<p>Pair it with a 27-inch QHD high-refresh monitor such as the <a href=\"/products/msi-mag-275qf-27-inch-qhd-180hz\">MSI MAG 275QF</a> or the <a href=\"/products/dahua-lm27-e341ay-27-inch-qhd-275hz\">Dahua LM27-E341AY</a>. For 1080p only, the <a href=\"/products/pny-geforce-rtx-5060-8gb-oc-dual-fan\">RTX 5060</a> saves you about Rs 77,000.</p>','[{\"question\":\"What is the PNY RTX 5070 12GB price in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"ONIN Infosys sells the PNY GeForce RTX 5070 12GB GDDR7 OC triple-fan graphics card for Rs 1,64,999 with a 1-year warranty.\"},{\"question\":\"Is the RTX 5070 good for 1440p gaming?\",\"answer\":\"Yes. With 6,144 CUDA cores and 12GB of GDDR7, it handles current games at 1440p high settings, especially with DLSS 4.\"},{\"question\":\"What outputs does the PNY RTX 5070 have?\",\"answer\":\"Three DisplayPort 2.1b ports and one HDMI 2.1b port.\"}]','[{\"label\":\"ONIN Infosys \\u2013 PNY GeForce RTX 5070 12GB GDDR7 OC Triple Fan (VCG507012TFXPB1-O)\",\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/onin.com.np\\/product\\/pny-geforce-rtx-5070-12gb-oc-price-nepal\",\"accessed\":\"2026-11-23\"}]',NULL,'https://onin.com.np/product/pny-geforce-rtx-5070-12gb-oc-price-nepal',0,'2026-11-22 18:15:00','2026-11-22 18:15:00'),(2730,40,3,'ASUS Zenbook 14 (Core Ultra 9 185H, 16GB/1TB)','asus-zenbook-14-core-ultra-9-185h-16gb-1tb',NULL,'gadgets/2026/asus-zenbook-14-core-ultra-9-185h-16gb-1tb.webp',NULL,NULL,0.00,NULL,0,'Rs 1,91,499 last listed price in Nepal',NULL,'discontinued',NULL,0,0,'<p>With a thin body and a better-than-average screen, this ASUS Zenbook 14 was listed by ONIN Infosys at Rs 1,91,499. ONIN listed it as out of stock when we checked on 23 November 2026, and the model has since been replaced by newer versions, so treat that figure as its last listed price in Nepal.</p>\n<p>The Core Ultra 9 185H (Meteor Lake) was Intel\'s first chip with a built-in NPU, and its Arc integrated graphics are a clear step up from older Iris Xe for light editing and casual games. 16GB of RAM is comfortable for heavy browsing, Office, coding and light editing at the same time. A 1TB SSD leaves room for a big game library or years of photos and projects.</p>\n<p>The 14-inch 3K OLED 120Hz screen is a highlight: true blacks, rich colour and excellent contrast for films and photo work; it is also a touchscreen. It carries a 75Wh battery and weighs about 1.28 kg, light enough to carry every day. Ports include HDMI. It suits professionals and students who value portability, battery life and a nicer screen.</p>','[{\"question\":\"What is the price of the ASUS Zenbook 14 (Core Ultra 9 185H, 16GB\\/1TB) in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"ONIN Infosys last listed it at Rs 1,91,499. It showed as out of stock on 23 November 2026, and it has been replaced by newer models.\"},{\"question\":\"Is the ASUS Zenbook 14 good for gaming?\",\"answer\":\"Only for light and older games. It has no dedicated graphics card, so modern AAA titles will need low settings and reduced resolution.\"},{\"question\":\"Can I upgrade the RAM on this ASUS Zenbook 14?\",\"answer\":\"It depends on whether the memory is soldered. ONIN\'s listing doesn\'t say, so ask the shop to confirm the free slots before you buy.\"}]','[{\"label\":\"ONIN Infosys \\u2013 Asus Zenbook 14 (UX3405MA) with AI Intel Core Ultra 9 185H 16GB RAM 1TB ssd 14\\u201d 3K Oled Di\",\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/onin.com.np\\/product\\/asus-zenbook-14-ulta-9 -price-in-nepal\",\"accessed\":\"2026-11-23\"}]',NULL,'https://onin.com.np/product/asus-zenbook-14-ulta-9 -price-in-nepal',0,'2026-11-22 18:15:00','2026-11-22 18:15:00'),(2731,84,6,'Desview P8 Teleprompter','desview-p8-teleprompter','teleprompter','gadgets/2026/desview-p8-teleprompter.webp',NULL,NULL,23710.00,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,'available',NULL,0,0,'<p>The Desview P8 is a compact teleprompter that turns a phone or tablet into a script screen in front of your camera, so you can read lines while looking straight down the lens. ONIN Infosys listed it at Rs 23,710. When we checked on 23 November 2026, it was out of stock, so confirm availability with ONIN before planning a shoot around it.</p>\n<p>It fits smartphones, DSLR and mirrorless cameras and camcorders. The frame is ABS with aluminium parts, it weighs about 920 g, and it packs down to roughly 200 × 203 × 105 mm, small enough for a camera bag. The box includes a light-shading hood and board, which matter more than they sound: they stop room light from washing out the reflected text.</p>\n<p>It suits YouTubers, teachers recording lessons, news and corporate video teams, and anyone filming talking-head content who is tired of memorising scripts or glancing off-camera. Pair it with a free prompter app on your phone and a Bluetooth remote to control scrolling speed. ONIN lists a one-year official warranty.</p>','[{\"question\":\"Does the Desview P8 work with a DSLR?\",\"answer\":\"Yes. ONIN lists it as compatible with smartphones, DSLR and mirrorless cameras, and camcorders. The camera sits behind the glass and the phone or tablet shows the script.\"},{\"question\":\"What do I need to use it?\",\"answer\":\"A phone or small tablet running a teleprompter app to show the mirrored script. A Bluetooth remote makes scrolling easier.\"}]','[{\"label\":\"ONIN Infosys \\u2013 Desview P8 Teleprompter for Smartphones, Tablets, and Cameras\",\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/onin.com.np\\/product\\/desview-p8-teleprompter-price-nepal\",\"accessed\":\"2026-11-23\"}]',NULL,'https://onin.com.np/product/desview-p8-teleprompter-price-nepal',0,'2026-11-22 18:15:00','2026-11-22 18:15:00'),(2732,84,6,'Desview T17 17-inch Broadcast Teleprompter','desview-t17-17-inch-broadcast-teleprompter','teleprompter','gadgets/2026/desview-t17-17-inch-broadcast-teleprompter.webp',NULL,NULL,99750.00,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,'available',NULL,0,0,'<p>The Desview T17 is a full studio teleprompter kit with its own 17-inch self-reversing monitor, built for broadcast and corporate studios rather than phone-based setups. ONIN Infosys listed it at Rs 99,750. It was out of stock at ONIN when we checked on 23 November 2026.</p>\n<p>The monitor runs at 1280 × 1024 and up to 300 nits, and flips the image in hardware, so you can feed it directly from a laptop or switcher without mirroring software. Inputs cover HDMI, SDI (BNC), VGA, composite and USB, which suits both modern and older studio chains. The 70/30 broadcast beamsplitter glass keeps the camera image clean while the presenter reads clearly.</p>\n<p>A height-adjustable mount takes DSLRs and camcorders, and you can control scrolling with the included Bluetooth remote, a foot pedal or an app on Windows, iOS or Android. It suits TV and news studios, colleges with media labs, and production houses filming interviews and corporate videos. It runs on 12V DC, and ONIN lists a one-year warranty.</p>','[{\"question\":\"Does the Desview T17 need a separate monitor?\",\"answer\":\"No. It includes a 17-inch self-reversing monitor, so you connect your script source directly over HDMI, SDI, VGA or composite.\"},{\"question\":\"How is scrolling controlled?\",\"answer\":\"With a Bluetooth remote, a foot pedal, or an app on Windows, iOS or Android, according to ONIN\'s listing.\"}]','[{\"label\":\"ONIN Infosys \\u2013 Desview T17 Teleprompter Set - 17\\\" Self-Reversing Monitor (Broadcast Kit)\",\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/onin.com.np\\/product\\/desview-t17-17-teleprompter-nepal\",\"accessed\":\"2026-11-23\"}]',NULL,'https://onin.com.np/product/desview-t17-17-teleprompter-nepal',0,'2026-11-22 18:15:00','2026-11-22 18:15:00'),(2733,113,46,'Hitech POE-530P Mini DC UPS (8800mAh)','hitech-poe-530p-mini-dc-ups-8800mah',NULL,'gadgets/2026/hitech-poe-530p-mini-dc-ups-8800mah.webp',NULL,NULL,2399.00,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,'available',NULL,0,0,'<p>The Hitech POE-530P is a small DC UPS that keeps a Wi-Fi router, ONU or CCTV camera running through Nepal\'s short power cuts. ONIN Infosys listed it at just Rs 2,399. It was out of stock at ONIN when we checked on 23 November 2026.</p>\n<p>It holds an 8,800mAh battery and sits between the device\'s adapter and the device itself, so it switches over instantly with no break in your internet connection or recording. A mini DC UPS like this is far cheaper and quieter than a full inverter when all you need is to keep the network alive. How long it lasts depends on your router\'s power draw. Typical home routers run for a few hours.</p>\n<p>Before you buy, check your router or camera\'s input voltage and connector (most run on 9V or 12V DC) and make sure the UPS supports it. It suits homes, small offices and shops that lose work, online classes or CCTV footage during outages. ONIN lists a six-month warranty, and it comes in white.</p>','[{\"question\":\"Will the Hitech POE-530P keep my Wi-Fi on during load-shedding?\",\"answer\":\"Yes, for most home routers and ONUs. It switches over instantly. Runtime depends on how much power your router draws.\"},{\"question\":\"What should I check before buying a mini DC UPS?\",\"answer\":\"Your router or camera\'s input voltage (usually 9V or 12V) and the connector type, so the UPS outputs match.\"}]','[{\"label\":\"ONIN Infosys \\u2013 Hitech POE-530P Mini DC UPS - Router & CCTV Power Backup (8800mAh)\",\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/onin.com.np\\/product\\/poe-430p-mini-dc-ups-router-backup-price-nepal\",\"accessed\":\"2026-11-23\"}]',NULL,'https://onin.com.np/product/poe-430p-mini-dc-ups-router-backup-price-nepal',0,'2026-11-22 18:15:00','2026-11-22 18:15:00'),(2734,39,39,'Lenovo ThinkCentre Neo 50a Gen 5 24-inch All-in-One (Core i7-13620H, 16GB/512GB)','lenovo-thinkcentre-neo-50a-gen-5-24-inch-all-in-one-core-i7-13620h-16gb-512gb',NULL,'gadgets/2026/lenovo-thinkcentre-neo-50a-gen-5-24-inch-all-in-one-core-i7-13620h-16gb-512gb.webp',NULL,NULL,149999.00,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,'available',NULL,0,0,'<p>The ThinkCentre Neo 50a Gen 5 is a 24-inch all-in-one PC for offices, reception desks and homes that want one tidy machine instead of a tower, monitor and cables. ONIN Infosys listed this Core i7 configuration at Rs 1,49,999. It was out of stock at ONIN when we checked on 23 November 2026.</p>\n<p>It runs Intel\'s Core i7-13620H, a 10-core chip that handles heavy spreadsheets, accounting software and many browser tabs with ease, with 16GB of DDR5-5200 memory and a 512GB PCIe Gen4 SSD. The 23.8-inch Full HD IPS screen is a touchscreen, covers 99% of sRGB and has an anti-glare finish, which is good news for long office hours. Graphics are integrated, so it\'s not meant for gaming.</p>\n<p>Video calls get a 5MP camera with an infrared sensor for Windows Hello face login, plus dual microphones and 2 × 3W Harman speakers with Dolby Audio. Ports include an HDMI input (so the screen can double as a monitor), USB-A and Ethernet, with Wi-Fi 6 and Bluetooth 5.3. It weighs about 6 kg and comes with a 90W power supply and a USB keyboard and mouse.</p>','[{\"question\":\"Can the ThinkCentre Neo 50a be used as a monitor?\",\"answer\":\"Yes. It has an HDMI input, so you can connect a laptop or another device to its 23.8-inch screen.\"},{\"question\":\"Does it have a touchscreen?\",\"answer\":\"Yes. ONIN\'s listing describes a 23.8-inch Full HD IPS touch display with 99% sRGB coverage.\"}]','[{\"label\":\"ONIN Infosys \\u2013 Lenovo All in one ThinkCentre Neo 50a | 24-inch| Gen 5 | i7 13620H | 16 GB DDR5 RAM | 512G\",\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/onin.com.np\\/product\\/lenovo-thinkcentre-neo-50a-gen5-price-in-nepal\",\"accessed\":\"2026-11-23\"}]',NULL,'https://onin.com.np/product/lenovo-thinkcentre-neo-50a-gen5-price-in-nepal',0,'2026-11-22 18:15:00','2026-11-22 18:15:00'),(2735,78,4,'Beats Flex Wireless Earphones','beats-flex-wireless-earphones',NULL,'gadgets/2026/beats-flex-wireless-earphones.webp',NULL,NULL,6500.00,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,'available',NULL,0,0,'<p>Beats Flex are neckband-style wireless earphones: the two buds hang from a flexible band around your neck, so they\'re hard to lose and always ready to use. ONIN Infosys listed them at Rs 6,500. They were out of stock at ONIN when we checked on 23 November 2026.</p>\n<p>They use Apple\'s W1 chip, so pairing with an iPhone takes one tap, and they switch between your Apple devices automatically. Android phones connect over regular Bluetooth. Battery life is rated at up to 12 hours, and a 10-minute charge gives about 1.5 hours of playback, which is handy before a commute. Magnetic buds snap together when not in use.</p>\n<p>The sound is balanced rather than bass-heavy, with an inline microphone and controls for calls, music and Siri. Several ear-tip sizes are included for a secure fit, and they\'re light enough for workouts. They suit students and commuters who want reliable wireless audio at a lower price than true wireless earbuds.</p>','[{\"question\":\"How long does the Beats Flex battery last?\",\"answer\":\"Up to 12 hours of listening, and a 10-minute charge gives about 1.5 hours.\"},{\"question\":\"Do Beats Flex work with Android?\",\"answer\":\"Yes, over standard Bluetooth. The one-tap pairing and automatic switching are Apple-device features.\"}]','[{\"label\":\"ONIN Infosys \\u2013 BEATS FLEX | Stay connected to the world you love with all-day wireless Beats Flex earphon\",\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/onin.com.np\\/product\\/beats-flex---stay-connected-to-the-world-you-love-with-all-day-wireless-beats-flex-earphones-\",\"accessed\":\"2026-11-23\"}]',NULL,'https://onin.com.np/product/beats-flex---stay-connected-to-the-world-you-love-with-all-day-wireless-beats-flex-earphones-',0,'2026-11-22 18:15:00','2026-11-22 18:15:00'),(2736,41,3,'Acer Aspire 7 A715 (Ryzen 5 5500U, 8GB/512GB, GTX 1650)','acer-aspire-7-a715-ryzen-5-5500u-8gb-512gb-gtx-1650',NULL,'gadgets/2026/acer-aspire-7-a715-ryzen-5-5500u-8gb-512gb-gtx-1650.webp',NULL,NULL,0.00,NULL,0,'Rs 80,000 last listed price in Nepal',NULL,'discontinued',NULL,0,0,'<p>Acer Aspire 7 A715 (Ryzen 5 5500U, 8GB/512GB, GTX 1650) is an everyday laptop for study, office files, online classes and streaming. ONIN Infosys listed it at Rs 80,000. ONIN listed it as out of stock when we checked on 23 November 2026, and the model has since been replaced by newer versions, so treat that figure as its last listed price in Nepal.</p>\n<p>The Ryzen 5 5500U is an efficient AMD U-series chip from an older generation. It\'s good for office work, browsing and study, with reasonable battery life, but not built for sustained heavy loads. The NVIDIA GTX 1650 is an entry gaming GPU: esports titles run at high frame rates, and most big games are playable at 1080p medium with DLSS turned on. With 8GB of memory it copes with everyday multitasking. Heavier users should plan an upgrade to 16GB if the board allows it. The 512GB SSD is enough for most people, though it fills quickly if you install several modern games.</p>\n<p>The 15.6-inch Full HD screen is fine for documents, classes and streaming. Ports include USB-C and Ethernet. It suits first-time buyers, students and families who need a dependable machine for daily work.</p>\n<p>ONIN\'s listing notes the warranty as: 1-Year company warranty.</p>','[{\"question\":\"What is the price of the Acer Aspire 7 A715 (Ryzen 5 5500U, 8GB\\/512GB, GTX 1650) in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"ONIN Infosys last listed it at Rs 80,000. It showed as out of stock on 23 November 2026, and it has been replaced by newer models.\"},{\"question\":\"Can the Acer Aspire 7 A715 run modern games?\",\"answer\":\"Graphics come from the NVIDIA GTX 1650. Expect smooth Valorant, CS2 and Fortnite, and 1080p medium settings in heavier AAA games.\"},{\"question\":\"Can I upgrade the RAM on this Acer Aspire 7 A715?\",\"answer\":\"It depends on whether the memory is soldered. ONIN\'s listing doesn\'t say, so ask the shop to confirm the free slots before you buy.\"}]','[{\"label\":\"ONIN Infosys \\u2013 ACER ASPIRE 7 A715 |AMD Ryzen 5 5500U | 8 GB DDR4 RAM | 512 GB NVME SSD | 15.6\\\" Full HD Di\",\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/onin.com.np\\/product\\/acer-aspire-7-a715--amd-ryzen-5-5500u---8-gb-ddr4-ram---512-gb-nvme-ssd---15-6--full-hd-display\",\"accessed\":\"2026-11-23\"}]',NULL,'https://onin.com.np/product/acer-aspire-7-a715--amd-ryzen-5-5500u---8-gb-ddr4-ram---512-gb-nvme-ssd---15-6--full-hd-display',0,'2026-11-22 18:15:00','2026-11-22 18:15:00'),(2737,41,3,'Acer Aspire 14 AI A14-52MT-701K (Core Ultra 7 258V, 32GB/1TB)','acer-aspire-14-ai-a14-52mt-701k-core-ultra-7-258v-32gb-1tb',NULL,'gadgets/2026/acer-aspire-14-ai-a14-52mt-701k-core-ultra-7-258v-32gb-1tb.webp',NULL,NULL,144999.00,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,'available',NULL,0,0,'<p>Acer Aspire 14 AI A14-52MT-701K (Core Ultra 7 258V, 32GB/1TB) is a slim, premium laptop for people who carry their machine every day. ONIN Infosys listed it at Rs 1,44,999. When we checked on 23 November 2026, ONIN listed it as out of stock, so the price shown is ONIN\'s last listed price. Confirm the current price and availability with ONIN before buying.</p>\n<p>The Core Ultra 7 258V (Lunar Lake) is built for efficiency: memory sits on the chip package, standby drain is very low, and its NPU meets Copilot+ requirements. It\'s not meant for heavy rendering, but it\'s quick and very frugal for office and study work. 32GB of RAM is generous: large projects, virtual machines and big Photoshop or video timelines are all fine. A 1TB SSD leaves room for a big game library or years of photos and projects.</p>\n<p>The 14-inch WUXGA (1920 × 1200) panel uses a 16:10 shape, so you see more of each web page or document without scrolling, and it is touch-enabled. The battery is rated at 65Wh. Ports include Thunderbolt and HDMI. It suits professionals and students who value portability, battery life and a nicer screen.</p>\n<p>ONIN\'s listing notes the warranty as: 1 year official warranty.</p>','[{\"question\":\"What is the price of the Acer Aspire 14 AI A14-52MT-701K (Core Ultra 7 258V, 32GB\\/1TB) in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"ONIN Infosys last listed it at Rs 1,44,999. It showed as out of stock on 23 November 2026, so check ONIN for the current price and stock.\"},{\"question\":\"Is the Acer Aspire 14 AI A14-52MT-701K good for gaming?\",\"answer\":\"Only for light and older games. It has no dedicated graphics card, so modern AAA titles will need low settings and reduced resolution.\"},{\"question\":\"Can I upgrade the RAM on this Acer Aspire 14 AI A14-52MT-701K?\",\"answer\":\"It depends on whether the memory is soldered. ONIN\'s listing doesn\'t say, so ask the shop to confirm the free slots before you buy.\"}]','[{\"label\":\"ONIN Infosys \\u2013 Acer Aspire 14 AI A14-52MT-701K | Core Ultra 7 258V | 32GB RAM | 1TB SSD | 14\\\" (1920 x 120\",\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/onin.com.np\\/product\\/acer-aspire-14-ai-a14-52mt-701k-price-nepal\",\"accessed\":\"2026-11-23\"}]',NULL,'https://onin.com.np/product/acer-aspire-14-ai-a14-52mt-701k-price-nepal',0,'2026-11-22 18:15:00','2026-11-22 18:15:00'),(2738,41,3,'Acer Aspire 15 (Core 3 100U, 8GB/512GB)','acer-aspire-15-core-3-100u-8gb-512gb',NULL,'gadgets/2026/acer-aspire-15-core-3-100u-8gb-512gb.webp',NULL,NULL,65000.00,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,'available',NULL,0,0,'<p>Acer Aspire 15 (Core 3 100U, 8GB/512GB) is an everyday laptop for study, office files, online classes and streaming. ONIN Infosys listed it at Rs 65,000. When we checked on 23 November 2026, ONIN listed it as out of stock, so the price shown is ONIN\'s last listed price. Confirm the current price and availability with ONIN before buying.</p>\n<p>The Core 3 100U is a low-power U-series chip. It\'s quick enough for Office, browsing, online classes and light photo edits, and it helps the battery last. 8GB of RAM is enough for study and office work, but it fills up quickly with many browser tabs or creative apps, so check whether a second slot is free before you buy. The 512GB SSD is enough for most people, though it fills quickly if you install several modern games.</p>\n<p>The 15.6-inch Full HD screen is fine for documents, classes and streaming. It carries a 50Wh battery and weighs about 1.77 kg. Ports include USB-C and HDMI. It suits first-time buyers, students and families who need a dependable machine for daily work.</p>\n<p>ONIN\'s listing notes the warranty as: 2 Year Warranty.</p>','[{\"question\":\"What is the price of the Acer Aspire 15 (Core 3 100U, 8GB\\/512GB) in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"ONIN Infosys last listed it at Rs 65,000. It showed as out of stock on 23 November 2026, so check ONIN for the current price and stock.\"},{\"question\":\"Is the Acer Aspire 15 good for gaming?\",\"answer\":\"Only for light and older games. It has no dedicated graphics card, so modern AAA titles will need low settings and reduced resolution.\"},{\"question\":\"Can I upgrade the RAM on this Acer Aspire 15?\",\"answer\":\"It depends on whether the memory is soldered. ONIN\'s listing doesn\'t say, so ask the shop to confirm the free slots before you buy.\"}]','[{\"label\":\"ONIN Infosys \\u2013 Acer Aspire 15 Intel Core 3 100U 8GB RAM 512GB NVMe SSD 15.6\\\" FHD Display 2 years authoriz\",\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/onin.com.np\\/product\\/acer-aspire-15-core-3-price-in-nepal\",\"accessed\":\"2026-11-23\"}]',NULL,'https://onin.com.np/product/acer-aspire-15-core-3-price-in-nepal',0,'2026-11-22 18:15:00','2026-11-22 18:15:00'),(2739,41,3,'Acer Aspire 15 (Core 5 120U, 8GB/512GB)','acer-aspire-15-core-5-120u-8gb-512gb',NULL,'gadgets/2026/acer-aspire-15-core-5-120u-8gb-512gb.webp',NULL,NULL,79000.00,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,'available',NULL,0,0,'<p>This Acer Aspire 15 covers the basics students and home users need. ONIN Infosys listed it at Rs 79,000. When we checked on 23 November 2026, ONIN listed it as out of stock, so the price shown is ONIN\'s last listed price. Confirm the current price and availability with ONIN before buying.</p>\n<p>The Core 5 120U is a low-power U-series chip. It\'s quick enough for Office, browsing, online classes and light photo edits, and it helps the battery last. With 8GB of memory it copes with everyday multitasking. Heavier users should plan an upgrade to 16GB if the board allows it. The 512GB SSD is enough for most people, though it fills quickly if you install several modern games.</p>\n<p>The 15.6-inch Full HD screen is fine for documents, classes and streaming. It carries a 50Wh battery and weighs about 1.77 kg. Ports include USB-C and HDMI. It suits first-time buyers, students and families who need a dependable machine for daily work.</p>\n<p>ONIN\'s listing notes the warranty as: 2 Year Warranty.</p>','[{\"question\":\"What is the price of the Acer Aspire 15 (Core 5 120U, 8GB\\/512GB) in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"ONIN Infosys last listed it at Rs 79,000. It showed as out of stock on 23 November 2026, so check ONIN for the current price and stock.\"},{\"question\":\"Is the Acer Aspire 15 good for gaming?\",\"answer\":\"Only for light and older games. It has no dedicated graphics card, so modern AAA titles will need low settings and reduced resolution.\"},{\"question\":\"Can I upgrade the RAM on this Acer Aspire 15?\",\"answer\":\"It depends on whether the memory is soldered. ONIN\'s listing doesn\'t say, so ask the shop to confirm the free slots before you buy.\"}]','[{\"label\":\"ONIN Infosys \\u2013 Acer Aspire 15 Intel Core 5 120U 8GB RAM 512GB NVMe SSD 15.6\\\" FHD Display 2 years authoriz\",\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/onin.com.np\\/product\\/acer-aspire-15-core-5-price-in-nepal\",\"accessed\":\"2026-11-23\"}]',NULL,'https://onin.com.np/product/acer-aspire-15-core-5-price-in-nepal',0,'2026-11-22 18:15:00','2026-11-22 18:15:00'),(2740,41,3,'Acer Aspire 3 15 (Ryzen 5 7520U, 8GB/512GB)','acer-aspire-3-15-ryzen-5-7520u-8gb-512gb',NULL,'gadgets/2026/acer-aspire-3-15-ryzen-5-7520u-8gb-512gb.webp',NULL,NULL,0.00,NULL,0,'Rs 57,000 last listed price in Nepal',NULL,'discontinued',NULL,0,0,'<p>For school, college and office work, this Acer Aspire 3 15 configuration was listed by ONIN Infosys at Rs 57,000. ONIN listed it as out of stock when we checked on 23 November 2026, and the model has since been replaced by newer versions, so treat that figure as its last listed price in Nepal.</p>\n<p>The Ryzen 5 7520U is an efficient AMD U-series chip. It\'s good for office work, browsing and study, with reasonable battery life, but not built for sustained heavy loads. With 8GB of memory it copes with everyday multitasking. Heavier users should plan an upgrade to 16GB if the board allows it. The 512GB SSD is enough for most people, though it fills quickly if you install several modern games.</p>\n<p>The 14-inch Full HD screen is fine for documents, classes and streaming. It carries a 40Wh battery and weighs about 1.7 kg. Ports include USB-C and HDMI. It suits first-time buyers, students and families who need a dependable machine for daily work.</p>\n<p>ONIN\'s listing notes the warranty as: 1 Year Warranty.</p>','[{\"question\":\"What is the price of the Acer Aspire 3 15 (Ryzen 5 7520U, 8GB\\/512GB) in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"ONIN Infosys last listed it at Rs 57,000. It showed as out of stock on 23 November 2026, and it ha