r models.\"},{\"question\":\"Is the Acer Swift Go 14 OLED good for gaming?\",\"answer\":\"Only for light and older games. It has no dedicated graphics card, so modern AAA titles will need low settings and reduced resolution.\"},{\"question\":\"Can I upgrade the RAM on this Acer Swift Go 14 OLED?\",\"answer\":\"It depends on whether the memory is soldered. ONIN\'s listing doesn\'t say, so ask the shop to confirm the free slots before you buy.\"}]','[{\"label\":\"ONIN Infosys \\u2013 Acer Swift Go 14 OLED Intel Core i5 13500H Processor 16GB RAM 512GB NVMe Gen4 SSD 14-inch \",\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/onin.com.np\\/product\\/acer-swift-go-14-i5-price-in-nepal\",\"accessed\":\"2026-11-23\"}]',NULL,'https://onin.com.np/product/acer-swift-go-14-i5-price-in-nepal',0,'2026-11-22 18:15:00','2026-11-22 18:15:00'),(2766,41,3,'Acer Swift X14 OLED (Core Ultra 5 125H, 16GB/512GB, RTX 3050)','acer-swift-x14-oled-core-ultra-5-125h-16gb-512gb-rtx-3050',NULL,'gadgets/2026/acer-swift-x14-oled-core-ultra-5-125h-16gb-512gb-rtx-3050.webp',NULL,NULL,0.00,NULL,0,'Rs 1,27,000 last listed price in Nepal',NULL,'discontinued',NULL,0,0,'<p>Acer Swift X14 OLED (Core Ultra 5 125H, 16GB/512GB, RTX 3050) is aimed at creators who want a colour-rich screen and a dedicated GPU in a portable body. ONIN Infosys listed it at Rs 1,27,000. ONIN listed it as out of stock when we checked on 23 November 2026, and the model has since been replaced by newer versions, so treat that figure as its last listed price in Nepal.</p>\n<p>The Core Ultra 5 125H (Meteor Lake) was Intel\'s first chip with a built-in NPU, and its Arc integrated graphics are a clear step up from older Iris Xe for light editing and casual games. Graphics come from the NVIDIA RTX 3050 with 6GB of VRAM. Expect smooth Valorant, CS2 and Fortnite, and 1080p medium settings in heavier AAA games. 16GB of RAM is comfortable for heavy browsing, Office, coding and light editing at the same time. The 512GB SSD is enough for most people, though it fills quickly if you install several modern games.</p>\n<p>The 14.5-inch 2.8K OLED 120Hz screen is a highlight: true blacks, rich colour and excellent contrast for films and photo work. It carries a 76Wh battery and weighs about 1.5 kg. Ports include USB-C and HDMI. It suits photographers, designers and video editors who also need to travel with their machine.</p>\n<p>ONIN\'s listing notes the warranty as: 1 Year Warranty.</p>','[{\"question\":\"What is the price of the Acer Swift X14 OLED (Core Ultra 5 125H, 16GB\\/512GB, RTX 3050) in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"ONIN Infosys last listed it at Rs 1,27,000. It showed as out of stock on 23 November 2026, and it has been replaced by newer models.\"},{\"question\":\"Can the Acer Swift X14 OLED run modern games?\",\"answer\":\"Graphics come from the NVIDIA RTX 3050 with 6GB of VRAM. Expect smooth Valorant, CS2 and Fortnite, and 1080p medium settings in heavier AAA games.\"},{\"question\":\"Can I upgrade the RAM on this Acer Swift X14 OLED?\",\"answer\":\"It depends on whether the memory is soldered. ONIN\'s listing doesn\'t say, so ask the shop to confirm the free slots before you buy.\"}]','[{\"label\":\"ONIN Infosys \\u2013 Acer Swift X14 OLED Intel Core Ultra 5 125H Processor 16GB RAM 512GB SSD RTX 3050 6GB Grap\",\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/onin.com.np\\/product\\/acer-swift-x14-oled-ultra-5-price-in-nepal\",\"accessed\":\"2026-11-23\"}]',NULL,'https://onin.com.np/product/acer-swift-x14-oled-ultra-5-price-in-nepal',0,'2026-11-22 18:15:00','2026-11-22 18:15:00'),(2767,9,3,'Dell Alienware Aurora 16 (Core 7 240H, 16GB/1TB, RTX 5050)','dell-alienware-aurora-16-core-7-240h-16gb-1tb-rtx-5050',NULL,'gadgets/2026/dell-alienware-aurora-16-core-7-240h-16gb-1tb-rtx-5050.webp',NULL,NULL,189499.00,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,'available',NULL,0,0,'<p>Dell Alienware Aurora 16 (Core 7 240H, 16GB/1TB, RTX 5050) is a gaming laptop that ONIN Infosys sold in Nepal for Rs 1,89,499. When we checked on 23 November 2026, ONIN listed it as out of stock, so the price shown is ONIN\'s last listed price. Confirm the current price and availability with ONIN before buying.</p>\n<p>The Core 7 240H is a 2025 H-series chip (a refreshed Raptor Lake design) with plenty of cores for multitasking, coding and gaming. Graphics come from the NVIDIA RTX 5050 with 8GB of VRAM. Expect smooth Valorant, CS2 and Fortnite, and 1080p medium settings in heavier AAA games, where DLSS 4 adds a lot. 16GB of RAM is comfortable for heavy browsing, Office, coding and light editing at the same time. A 1TB SSD leaves room for a big game library or years of photos and projects.</p>\n<p>Its 16-inch WQXGA (2560 × 1600) 120Hz display makes games and even scrolling look smooth, and the 16:10 shape gives extra vertical room for documents. It carries a 96Wh battery and weighs about 2.49 kg, so it is better suited to a desk than daily commuting. Ports include USB-C, HDMI and Ethernet. It suits gamers, engineering students running CAD or simulation software, and anyone editing video on a budget.</p>\n<p>ONIN\'s listing notes the warranty as: 1 year official warranty.</p>','[{\"question\":\"What is the price of the Dell Alienware Aurora 16 (Core 7 240H, 16GB\\/1TB, RTX 5050) in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"ONIN Infosys last listed it at Rs 1,89,499. It showed as out of stock on 23 November 2026, so check ONIN for the current price and stock.\"},{\"question\":\"Can the Dell Alienware Aurora 16 run modern games?\",\"answer\":\"The NVIDIA RTX 5050 with 8GB of VRAM is an entry gaming GPU: esports titles run at high frame rates, and most big games are playable at 1080p medium, with DLSS 4 frame generation helping in supported games.\"},{\"question\":\"Can I upgrade the RAM on this Dell Alienware Aurora 16?\",\"answer\":\"It depends on whether the memory is soldered. ONIN\'s listing doesn\'t say, so ask the shop to confirm the free slots before you buy.\"}]','[{\"label\":\"ONIN Infosys \\u2013 Dell Alienware Aurora 16 (2025) - Intel Core 7 240H | RTX 5050 8GB | 16GB RAM | 1TB SSD | \",\"u