omfortable for heavy browsing, Office, coding and light editing at the same time. The 256GB SSD fills up fast once Windows updates, apps and photos pile up, so budget for an external drive or cloud storage.</p>\n<p>Its 13.4-inch 2K 120Hz display makes games and even scrolling look smooth. It carries a 55Wh battery and weighs about 1.19 kg, light enough to carry every day. Ports include USB-C. It suits professionals and students who value portability, battery life and a nicer screen.</p>\n<p>ONIN\'s listing notes the warranty as: 1 year warranty + life time software warranty + free servicing for lifetime +we offer extended warranty also.</p>','[{\"question\":\"What is the price of the Dell XPS 13 9345 (Snapdragon X Plus, 16GB\\/256GB) in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"ONIN Infosys last listed it at Rs 1,69,999. It showed as out of stock on 23 November 2026, so check ONIN for the current price and stock.\"},{\"question\":\"Is the Dell XPS 13 9345 good for gaming?\",\"answer\":\"Only for light and older games. It has no dedicated graphics card, so modern AAA titles will need low settings and reduced resolution.\"},{\"question\":\"Can I upgrade the RAM on this Dell XPS 13 9345?\",\"answer\":\"It depends on whether the memory is soldered. ONIN\'s listing doesn\'t say, so ask the shop to confirm the free slots before you buy.\"}]','[{\"label\":\"ONIN Infosys \\u2013 Dell XPS 13 9345 \\u2013 Snapdragon X Plus | 16\\u202fGB LPDDR5X | 256\\u202fGB NVMe | 13.4\\u2033 2K 120\\u202fHz IPS |\",\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/onin.com.np\\/product\\/dell-xps-13-9345-snapdragon-x-plus-16gb-256gb-nepal\",\"accessed\":\"2026-11-23\"}]',NULL,'https://onin.com.np/product/dell-xps-13-9345-snapdragon-x-plus-16gb-256gb-nepal',0,'2026-11-22 18:15:00','2026-11-22 18:15:00'),(2834,9,3,'Dell XPS 15 9530 (Core i9-13900H, 32GB/1TB, RTX 4060)','dell-xps-15-9530-core-i9-13900h-32gb-1tb-rtx-4060',NULL,'gadgets/2026/dell-xps-15-9530-core-i9-13900h-32gb-1tb-rtx-4060.webp',NULL,NULL,0.00,NULL,0,'Rs 4,41,000 last listed price in Nepal',NULL,'discontinued',NULL,0,0,'<p>This Dell XPS 15 9530 configuration is built for games first: ONIN Infosys listed it at Rs 4,41,000. ONIN listed it as out of stock when we checked on 23 November 2026, and the model has since been replaced by newer versions, so treat that figure as its last listed price in Nepal.</p>\n<p>The Core i9-13900H is a 13th-gen H-series chip with enough cores and clock speed for programming, editing and gaming alongside a dedicated GPU. With the NVIDIA RTX 4060 with 8GB of VRAM, most current games run at 1080p high, and esports titles can use a high-refresh screen properly. 32GB of RAM is generous: large projects, virtual machines and big Photoshop or video timelines are all fine. A 1TB SSD leaves room for a big game library or years of photos and projects.</p>\n<p>The 15.6-inch 3.5K OLED screen is a highlight: true blacks, rich colour and excellent contrast for films and photo work; it is also a touchscreen. It carries a 86Wh battery and weighs about 1.92 kg. Ports include USB-C. It suits gamers, engineering students running CAD or simulation software, and anyone editing video on a budget.</p>\n<p>ONIN\'s listing notes the warranty as: 2 Year Global Warranty.</p>','[{\"question\":\"What is the price of the Dell XPS 15 9530 (Core i9-13900H, 32GB\\/1TB, RTX 4060) in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"ONIN Infosys last listed it at Rs 4,41,000. It showed as out of stock on 23 November 2026, and it has been replaced by newer models.\"},{\"question\":\"Can the Dell XPS 15 9530 run modern games?\",\"answer\":\"The NVIDIA RTX 4060 with 8GB of VRAM is the sweet spot for 1080p gaming: high settings in most new games, and it\'s also good for Blender, Premiere and local AI tools.\"},{\"question\":\"Can I upgrade the RAM on this Dell XPS 15 9530?\",\"answer\":\"It depends on whether the memory is soldered. ONIN\'s listing doesn\'t say, so ask the shop to confirm the free slots before you buy.\"}]','[{\"label\":\"ONIN Infosys \\u2013 Dell XPS 15 9530 intel core- i9 13 gen 32GB RAM 1TB SSD 15.6\\\" 3.5K OLED Touch Display Nvdi\",\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/onin.com.np\\/product\\/dell-xps-15-9530-i9-13-gen-2023-price-in-nepal\",\"accessed\":\"2026-11-23\"}]',NULL,'https://onin.com.np/product/dell-xps-15-9530-i9-13-gen-2023-price-in-nepal',0,'2026-11-22 18:15:00','2026-11-22 18:15:00'),(2835,9,3,'Dell Inspiron 15 3520 (Core i5-1235G7, 8GB/256GB)','dell-inspiron-15-3520-core-i5-1235g7-8gb-256gb',NULL,'gadgets/2026/dell-inspiron-15-3520-core-i5-1235g7-8gb-256gb.webp',NULL,NULL,0.00,NULL,0,'Rs 62,000 last listed price in Nepal',NULL,'discontinued',NULL,0,0,'<p>This Dell Inspiron 15 3520 covers the basics students and home users need. ONIN Infosys listed it at Rs 62,000. ONIN listed it as out of stock when we checked on 23 November 2026, and the model has since been replaced by newer versions, so treat that figure as its last listed price in Nepal.</p>\n<p>The Core i5-1235G7 is a 12th-gen low-power chip suited to office work, browsing and study rather than heavy creative workloads. 8GB of RAM is enough for study and office work, but it fills up quickly with many browser tabs or creative apps, so check whether a second slot is free before you buy. The 256GB SSD fills up fast once Windows updates, apps and photos pile up, so budget for an external drive or cloud storage.</p>\n<p>The 15.6-inch Full HD screen is fine for documents, classes and streaming, and it supports touch. It carries a 54Wh battery and weighs about 1.79 kg. Ports include USB-C, HDMI and Ethernet. It suits first-time buyers, students and families who need a dependable machine for daily work.</p>','[{\"question\":\"What is the price of the Dell Inspiron 15 3520 (Core i5-1235G7, 8GB\\/256GB) in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"ONIN Infosys last listed it at Rs 62,000. It showed as out of stock on 23 November 2026, and it has been replaced by newer models.\"},{\"question\":\"Is the Dell Inspiron 15 3520 good for gaming?\",\"answer\":\"Only for light and older games. I