virtual machines and big Photoshop or video timelines are all fine. A 1TB SSD leaves room for a big game library or years of photos and projects.</p>\n<p>Its 16-inch WQXGA (2560 × 1600) 240Hz display makes games and even scrolling look smooth, and the 16:10 shape gives extra vertical room for documents. It carries a 83Wh battery and weighs about 2.43 kg, so it is better suited to a desk than daily commuting. Ports include USB-C, HDMI and Ethernet. It suits gamers, engineering students running CAD or simulation software, and anyone editing video on a budget.</p>\n<p>ONIN\'s listing notes the warranty as: 1 year official warranty + lifetime servicing free.</p>','[{\"question\":\"What is the price of the HP OMEN 16 (Core i9-14900HX, 32GB\\/1TB, RTX 5060) in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"ONIN Infosys last listed it at Rs 2,38,999. It showed as out of stock on 23 November 2026, so check ONIN for the current price and stock.\"},{\"question\":\"Can the HP OMEN 16 run modern games?\",\"answer\":\"With the NVIDIA RTX 5060 with 8GB of VRAM, most current games run at 1080p high, and esports titles can use a high-refresh screen properly.\"},{\"question\":\"Can I upgrade the RAM on this HP OMEN 16?\",\"answer\":\"It depends on whether the memory is soldered. ONIN\'s listing doesn\'t say, so ask the shop to confirm the free slots before you buy.\"}]','[{\"label\":\"ONIN Infosys \\u2013 Hp omen 16 intel i9 14900HX - RTX 5060 8GB - 32GB RAM - 1TB SSD - 16\\\" (2560x1600) WQXGA 24\",\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/onin.com.np\\/product\\/hp-omen-16-intel-i9-14900hx-rtx-5060-32gb-1tb-ssd-price-in-nepal\",\"accessed\":\"2026-11-23\"}]',NULL,'https://onin.com.np/product/hp-omen-16-intel-i9-14900hx-rtx-5060-32gb-1tb-ssd-price-in-nepal',0,'2026-11-22 18:15:00','2026-11-22 18:15:00'),(2862,8,3,'HP Pavilion 14 (Ryzen 5 7450U, 16GB/512GB)','hp-pavilion-14-ryzen-5-7450u-16gb-512gb',NULL,'gadgets/2026/hp-pavilion-14-ryzen-5-7450u-16gb-512gb.webp',NULL,NULL,0.00,NULL,0,'Rs 82,000 last listed price in Nepal',NUL