 the MSI Optix G24C6 24-inch Curved Gaming Monitor in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"ONIN Infosys last listed it at Rs 28,000. It showed as out of stock on 23 November 2026.\"},{\"question\":\"Is the MSI Optix G24C6 24-inch Curved Gaming Monitor good for gaming?\",\"answer\":\"Yes. Its 144Hz refresh rate makes fast games look smooth, provided your graphics card can reach high frame rates.\"}]','[{\"label\":\"ONIN Infosys \\u2013 MSI optix G24C6 Curved Gaming Monitor\",\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/onin.com.np\\/product\\/msi-g24c6-curved-monitor-price-in-nepal\",\"accessed\":\"2026-11-23\"}]',NULL,'https://onin.com.np/product/msi-g24c6-curved-monitor-price-in-nepal',0,'2026-11-22 18:15:00','2026-11-22 18:15:00'),(2977,1,38,'Samsung S31C 27-inch Full HD Essential Monitor','samsung-s31c-27-inch-full-hd-essential-monitor',NULL,'gadgets/2026/samsung-s31c-27-inch-full-hd-essential-monitor.webp',NULL,NULL,35000.00,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,'available',NULL,0,0,'<p>Samsung S31C 27-inch Full HD Essential Monitor is a practical desk monitor for work-from-home setups and offices. ONIN Infosys listed it at Rs 35,000. It was out of stock at ONIN when we checked on 23 November 2026, so the price shown is ONIN\'s last listed price. Confirm current stock and price with ONIN before buying.</p>\n<p>The panel is 27-inch Full HD 75Hz. Full HD stretched to 27 inches looks a little soft for text up close. It\'s fine for games and video, but QHD is better for office work at this size.</p>\n<p>It suits home offices, students and businesses that want a reliable second screen for a laptop.</p>','[{\"question\":\"What is the price of the Samsung S31C 27-inch Full HD Essential Monitor in Nepal?\",\"answer\":\"ONIN Infosys last listed it at Rs 35,000. It showed as out of stock on 23 November 2026.\"},{\"question\":\"Is the Samsung S31C 27-inch Full HD Essential Monitor good for gaming?\",\"answer\":\"For casual games, yes. At 75Hz it isn\'t made for competitive esports, where 144Hz or faster is better.\"}]','[{\"label\