INSERT INTO `news_articles` VALUES (1,20,'Snapdragon 8 Gen 4 Became the 8 Elite: How to Read Qualcomm Chip Names When You Shop','snapdragon-8-gen-4-debut-qualcomm-summit-2024','<p>If you remember waiting for a \"Snapdragon 8 Gen 4\", you won\'t find it on any spec sheet. Qualcomm launched that chip in October 2024 under a new name, the <strong>Snapdragon 8 Elite</strong>. It was the first phone chip to use Qualcomm\'s own Oryon CPU cores, the same family that powers Snapdragon X laptops, and it was a big jump in speed over the 8 Gen 3.</p>\n<p>The new name stuck, and the numbering started again. Since then we\'ve had the <strong>Snapdragon 8 Elite Gen 5</strong> and, most recently, the 2nm <strong>8 Elite Gen 6</strong>, which arrived first in the <a href=\"/news/xiaomi-18-pro-snapdragon-8-elite-gen-6-launch\">Xiaomi 18 Pro</a>.</p>\n<h2>Why this matters in a shop</h2>\n<p>Older and newer flagships sit side by side in Nepal, and the names make them easy to mix up. Two examples from our catalogue:</p>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"/products/samsung-galaxy-s25-ultra\">Galaxy S25 Ultra</a>: Snapdragon 8 Elite, Rs 1,84,999.</li>\n<li><a href=\"/products/samsung-galaxy-s26-ultra\">Galaxy S26 Ultra</a>: Snapdragon 8 Elite Gen 5 for Galaxy, Rs 2,24,999.</li>\n</ul>\n<p>The Gen 5 is faster, but the original 8 Elite is still far more power than most people will use. If a seller offers last year\'s flagship at a good discount, the chip alone is not a reason to say no. Battery health, the warranty and how many years of updates are left matter more.</p>\n<p>A quick rule: \"8 Elite\" with no generation number is the 2024 chip, and a \"Gen 5\" or \"Gen 6\" label means a newer one. \"For Galaxy\" versions are slightly higher-clocked editions that Samsung uses.</p>','technology','news/news-snapdragon.jpg',1,2736,'Qualcomm renamed the Snapdragon 8 Gen 4 to Snapdragon 8 Elite, then added Gen 5 and Gen 6. What the names mean when you compare phones in Nepal.',0,0,0,0,0,0,'2026-11-22 18:15:00','2026-11-24 00:14:02'),(2,20,'Apple Intelligence in Nepal: Which iPhones Get It and How to Switch It On','apple-intelligence-nepal-iphone-users-guide','<p>Apple Intelligence is Apple\'s name for the AI features built into iOS, such as rewriting text, summarising notifications and removing people from photos. A lot of Nepali iPhone owners ask us whether it works here. In short, it does on the right phone, but you have to turn it on yourself.</p>\n<h2>Which iPhones support it</h2>\n<p>It needs an <strong>iPhone 15 Pro or 15 Pro Max</strong>, or <strong>any iPhone 16 or 17 model</strong>, including the cheaper 16e and 17e. Older phones, including the regular iPhone 15, don\'t get it, because the feature needs more memory than they have.</p>\n<p>If you\'re buying new, the cheapest current model with Apple Intelligence is the <a href=\"/products/iphone-17e\">iPhone 17e</a> at Rs 1,32,499, followed by the <a href=\"/products/apple-iphone-16\">iPhone 16</a> (Rs 1,46,599) and <a href=\"/products/iphone-17\">iPhone 17</a> (Rs 1,64,999).</p>\n<h2>How to turn it on</h2>\n<ol>\n<li>Update to the latest iOS.</li>\n<li>Set your iPhone language and Siri language to a supported language. English works.</li>\n<li>Go to <em>Settings › Apple Intelligence &amp; Siri</em> and switch it on. The phone downloads the models, which can take a while on mobile data, so use Wi-Fi.</li>\n</ol>\n<h2>What you\'ll actually use</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Writing Tools</strong>: select text in almost any app to proofread it, change the tone or shorten it.</li>\n<li><strong>Clean Up</strong> in Photos removes a stranger from the background of a shot.</li>\n<li><strong>Notification summaries</strong> condense busy group chats. They\'re handy, but they occasionally get the meaning wrong.</li>\n<li><strong>ChatGPT in Siri</strong> is optional, and the phone asks before it sends anything to ChatGPT.</li>\n</ul>\n<p>Apple keeps adding languages and features, so if something isn\'t showing, check for an iOS update first.</p>','mobile','news/news-apple-intelligence.jpg',1,1427,'Which iPhones support Apple Intelligence, how to turn it on in Nepal, and what the features actually do. Plus the cheapest current iPhone that has it.',0,0,0,0,0,0,'2026-11-22 18:15:00','2026-11-24 00:14:02'),(3,20,'Gaming Laptops Under Rs 1.5 Lakh in Nepal: What Is Actually Left in 2026','best-gaming-laptops-nepal-under-150000-2024','<p>A couple of years ago Rs 1.5 lakh bought a decent RTX 4060 laptop in Nepal. Prices have moved a lot since then, and that budget is now the very bottom of the gaming market. You can still play, but you need to know where the compromises are.</p>\n<h2>What we\'d consider</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"/products/hp-victus-15-2023-intel-core-i5-13420h-rtx-3050-8gb-512gb-156-fhd-144hz\">HP Victus 15 (i5-13420H, RTX 3050 6GB)</a>: Rs 1,46,499 at ONIN Infosys. A quiet-looking laptop that runs esports titles well on its 144Hz screen.</li>\n<li><a href=\"/products/asus-tuf-f16-fx607-core-5-210h-16gb-512gb-rtx-3050\">ASUS TUF F16 (Core 5 210H, RTX 3050)</a>: Rs 1,42,999. A bigger 16-inch screen and the sturdy TUF build.</li>\n<li><a href=\"/products/acer-nitro-v-16-ai-ryzen-5-240-16gb-512gb-rtx-5050\">Acer Nitro V 16 AI (RTX 5050)</a>: listed at Rs 1,39,999. It\'s the only RTX 50-series laptop near this price, so check that it\'s actually in stock before you plan around it.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2>The honest advice</h2>\n<p>The RTX 3050 handles Valorant, CS2, Dota 2 and Fortnite comfortably, but new AAA games will need low or medium settings. If you mostly play big single-player games, stretching to the <a href=\"/products/lenovo-loq-15-15ahp9-2024-ryzen-7-7445hs\">LOQ 15AHP9</a> (Rs 1,64,499, a full 95W RTX 3050) or the <a href=\"/products/lenovo-loq-15-2025\">LOQ 15 with an RTX 5050</a> (Rs 1,94,999) makes a real difference.</p>\n<p>Whatever you choose, ask the shop for the GPU wattage (TGP). The same chip name can mean very different performance. For the full range at every budget, see our <a href=\"/guides/best-gaming-laptops-nepal\">gaming laptop guide</a>.</p>','laptop','news/news-gaming-laptops.jpg',1,5997,'Laptop prices rose in 2026, so under Rs 1.5 lakh the gaming options are thin. The few worth buying, and when to stretch your budget instead.',0,0,0,0,0,0,'2026-11-22 18:15:00','2026-11-24 00:14:02'),(4,20,'5G in Nepal: Where Things Stand, and Whether Your Next Phone Needs It','ntc-ncell-5g-rollout-nepal-2024','<p>NTC and Ncell have both run 5G trials, and 5G gets mentioned in every phone launch here. For most people in Nepal, though, the phone in their pocket still spends its whole day on 4G. That\'s worth keeping in mind when a salesperson leads with \"5G\" as the reason to spend more.</p>\n<h2>What to know before you buy</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>A good 4G phone today beats a weak 5G phone.</strong> Signal quality, the battery and the chip matter more for how fast your phone feels on NTC and Ncell right now.</li>\n<li><strong>5G is cheap to get now.</strong> Phones like the <a href=\"/products/redmi-17-5g\">Redmi 17 5G</a> start around Rs 34,000, so you rarely need to pay much extra for it.</li>\n<li><strong>Keeping a phone four or five years?</strong> Then choose 5G if the price is close. It costs little and keeps the option open for when commercial service reaches your area.</li>\n<li><strong>Buy official units.</strong> Network support depends on the model sold for this region, and unregistered phones can be blocked. Here is <a href=\"/guides/how-to-check-phone-is-official-in-nepal\">how to check a phone is official</a>.</li>\n</ul>\n<p>When NTC or Ncell announce commercial 5G for your city, we\'ll cover which phones and bands work. Until then, treat 5G as a nice extra rather than the main reason to buy.</p>','telecom','news/news-5g-rollout.jpg',1,6631,'NTC and Ncell have trialled 5G, but day-to-day you are still on 4G. What that means for the phone you buy now, and when paying extra for 5G makes sense.',0,0,0,0,0,0,'2026-11-22 18:15:00','2026-11-24 00:14:02'),(5,20,'On-Device AI on Phones: What Really Runs Offline, and What Still Needs the Internet','on-device-ai-revolution-npu-gemini-nano-apple-intelligence','<p>Every phone launch now leans on \"AI\", and the chip makers quote ever-bigger NPU numbers. It\'s fair to ask what that changes for someone in Kathmandu using a phone on a Rs 799 data pack.</p>\n<h2>What usually runs on the phone</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Live transcription of recordings, and some call and voice translation.</li>\n<li>Photo edits like removing objects or improving low-light shots.</li>\n<li>Smart replies, notification summaries and text proofreading on newer iPhones and Galaxies.</li>\n</ul>\n<p>Because these run locally, they work without signal and don\'t use your data. That\'s genuinely useful on a long bus ride or a trek.</p>\n<h2>What still goes online</h2>\n<p>Chatbots like Gemini and ChatGPT, image generation and longer \"ask me anything\" requests mostly run on the company\'s servers. They need data, and they\'re only as fast as your connection. Apple sends some heavier requests to its own Private Cloud Compute servers, and Samsung lets you choose to keep Galaxy AI processing on the device in settings.</p>\n<h2>Does it change what you should buy?</h2>\n<p>A little. AI features lean on memory, so for a phone you plan to keep four or five years, <strong>12GB of RAM</strong> is a sensible target on Android. On iPhone, Apple Intelligence needs an iPhone 15 Pro or newer. See <a href=\"/news/apple-intelligence-nepal-iphone-users-guide\">which iPhones support it</a>. Beyond that, buy for the camera, battery and screen you\'ll use every day.</p>','ai',NULL,1,4520,'Phone makers call everything \"AI\" now. Which features run on the phone itself, which go to the cloud, and how much RAM you actually need for them.',0,0,0,0,0,0,'2026-11-22 18:15:00','2026-11-22 18:15:00'),(6,20,'RTX 50-Series in Nepal: Graphics Card and Laptop Prices, and Which One to Buy','nvidia-rtx-50-series-blackwell-gpus-nepal-guide','<p>NVIDIA\'s RTX 50-series has been on sale since early 2025, and both desktop cards and laptops with these GPUs are now easy to find in Nepal. Here is what the main desktop cards cost in our catalogue, and what each one is for.</p>\n<h2>Desktop graphics cards</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"/products/pny-geforce-rtx-5050-8gb-gddr6-dual-fan-graphics-card\">RTX 5050 8GB</a>: Rs 54,999. An entry card for 1080p esports and lighter games.</li>\n<li><a href=\"/products/pny-geforce-rtx-5060-8gb-oc-dual-fan\">RTX 5060 8GB</a>: from about Rs 75,000 to Rs 87,999, depending on the model. The sensible 1080p card for most builds.</li>\n<li><a href=\"/products/pny-geforce-rtx-5060-ti-16gb-overclocked-dual-fan-graphics-card\">RTX 5060 Ti 16GB</a>: Rs 1,03,999. Pay the extra over the 8GB Ti. The added memory keeps new games and AI tools happy for longer.</li>\n<li><a href=\"/products/pny-geforce-rtx-5070-12gb-oc-triple-fan\">RTX 5070 12GB</a>: Rs 1,64,999. The card for 1440p gaming.</li>\n<li><a href=\"/products/pny-geforce-rtx-5070-ti-16gb-gddr7-triple-fan-graphics-card\">RTX 5070 Ti 16GB</a>: from Rs 1,75,999. High settings at 1440p with room to spare, and a strong choice for Blender and video work.</li>\n</ul>\n<p>All of them support DLSS 4 with multi-frame generation, which lifts frame rates a lot in games that support it. Check your power supply before you buy. A typical RTX 5060 build is happy with a good 550W unit, while a 5070 Ti wants more.</p>\n<h2>Laptops are a different story</h2>\n<p>A laptop \"RTX 5050\" or \"RTX 5060\" can run anywhere from about 45W to over 100W depending on the model, and performance follows the wattage. The <a href=\"/products/lenovo-loq-15-2025\">Lenovo LOQ 15</a> runs its RTX 5050 at 100W, while some slimmer laptops cap the same chip at 45W. Always ask for the TGP. Our <a href=\"/guides/best-gaming-laptops-nepal\">gaming laptop guide</a> lists it where we know it.</p>','gpu',NULL,1,6340,'RTX 5050, 5060, 5060 Ti, 5070 and 5070 Ti desktop card prices in Nepal, what each is good for, and why laptop RTX 50 chips depend so much on wattage.',0,0,0,0,0,0,'2026-11-22 18:15:00','2026-11-22 18:15:00'),(7,20,'RAM and SSD Prices Rose in 2026: What to Buy Now and What Can Wait','electronic-price-hikes-nepal-ram-ssd-smartphones-analysis','<p>Memory has been the story of 2026. Huge demand for AI data-centre hardware squeezed the supply of RAM and flash storage, and the higher costs worked their way into the price of phones, laptops and upgrade parts here. We\'ve tracked the device price rises separately in <a href=\"/news/why-gadget-prices-rose-nepal-2026\">why gadgets got more expensive in Nepal this year</a>. This piece is about what to do with your own money.</p>\n<h2>Buy now</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>The storage size you\'ll need.</strong> On phones and MacBooks, storage can\'t be upgraded later, and the jump between sizes hasn\'t got cheaper. If you know 128GB won\'t last, buy 256GB now.</li>\n<li><strong>16GB in a new laptop.</strong> Many laptops have soldered memory. An 8GB machine bought today will feel tight long before the rest of it wears out.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2>It can wait</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>A bigger external drive.</strong> Portable SSDs like the <a href=\"/products/lexar-sl300-portable-ssd\">Lexar SL300</a> go on offer from time to time. If your current drive isn\'t full, wait for a better price.</li>\n<li><strong>A RAM upgrade for a desktop that works fine.</strong> Unless you\'re running out of memory today, there\'s no rush.</li>\n</ul>\n<p>Every product page here shows the dated prices we\'ve recorded, so you can see whether something is near its usual price before you pay.</p>','price-trends',NULL,1,8120,'Memory and storage got more expensive in 2026. Practical advice for Nepali buyers: which upgrades to make now and where to save.',0,0,0,0,0,0,'2026-11-22 18:15:00','2026-11-22 18:15:00'),(8,20,'Sci-Fi Tech You Can Actually Buy in Nepal Today','from-cyberpunk-to-reality-sci-fi-cinema-tech-exists-today','<p>It\'s easy to forget how much once-futuristic tech now just sits on shop shelves in New Road. A few examples you can actually buy here, and what they\'re like to live with.</p>\n<h2>A phone that unfolds into a tablet</h2>\n<p>Folding phones used to look like film props. Apple\'s first foldable, the <a href=\"/products/iphone-duo\">iPhone Duo</a>, now sells in Nepal from Rs 4,30,900, with a 7.6-inch screen inside a phone-sized body. It\'s expensive, but the idea is no longer an experiment.</p>\n<h2>A laptop with two screens</h2>\n<p>The <a href=\"/products/asus-rog-zephyrus-duo-gx651ax-2026\">ROG Zephyrus Duo</a> puts two 16-inch OLED touchscreens in one laptop, with a keyboard that comes off. It looks like a prop from a heist film and costs about the same as a motorbike, Rs 13,38,900. Video editors and traders do get real use out of the second screen, though.</p>\n<h2>A camera drone that fits in a bag</h2>\n<p>The <a href=\"/products/dji-flip-drone-with-rc-2\">DJI Flip</a> folds down small, records 4K and follows you on its own. Check the rules before you fly it: drone flights in Nepal need permission, and many areas around airports and heritage sites are off limits.</p>\n<h2>Translation in your pocket</h2>\n<p>Recent phones from Apple, Samsung and Google can translate a conversation as it happens, some of it without internet. It isn\'t perfect with Nepali yet, but for a tourist asking directions in Thamel, it already works.</p>','sci-fi',NULL,1,5890,'Folding phones, dual-screen laptops, palm-sized drones and live translation: film ideas that have quietly become things you can buy in Nepal.',0,0,0,0,0,0,'2026-11-22 18:15:00','2026-11-22 18:15:00'),(20,20,'iPhone 17 Pro Max: What the Leaks Got Right, What They Missed, and the Nepal Price','iphone-17-pro-max-leaks-2nm-a19-pro-nepal-pricing-radar','<p>For most of 2025, the iPhone 17 Pro Max rumours ran ahead of reality. Now that the phone is on sale in Nepal, we can check them against what Apple actually shipped.</p>\n<h2>What the leaks got wrong</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>The chip.</strong> Several reports promised a 2nm processor. The A19 Pro is built on a 3nm process. The 2nm jump came a year later with the A20 Pro in the <a href=\"/news/iphone-18-pro-pro-max-iphone-duo-nepal-price\">iPhone 18 Pro</a>.</li>\n<li><strong>The price.</strong> Early Nepali estimates of about Rs 2.2 lakh were too optimistic. The 256GB model costs <strong>Rs 2,42,499</strong>.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2>What they got right, and what surprised us</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>A bigger change in design than usual: an aluminium unibody with vapour-chamber cooling replaced the titanium frame.</li>\n<li>Three 48MP rear cameras, including a 4x periscope telephoto.</li>\n<li>12GB of RAM, the most Apple had put in an iPhone at the time.</li>\n<li>A larger battery, rated at 5,088mAh in our listing. Battery life is the improvement owners notice most.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2>Nepal prices</h2>\n<p>256GB Rs 2,42,499 · 512GB Rs 2,84,599 · 1TB Rs 3,27,099 · 2TB Rs 4,11,399. See the <a href=\"/products/apple-iphone-17-pro-max\">iPhone 17 Pro Max page</a> for full specs and price history. If you want the newest Apple flagship, the <a href=\"/products/iphone-18-pro-max\">iPhone 18 Pro Max</a> is now on sale too.</p>','mobile',NULL,1,9450,'Before launch, leaks promised a 2nm chip and a Rs 2.2 lakh price. The iPhone 17 Pro Max shipped with a 3nm A19 Pro and costs Rs 2,42,499 in Nepal.',0,0,0,0,0,0,'2026-11-22 18:15:00','2026-11-22 18:15:00'),(21,20,'Galaxy S25 Ultra in Late 2026: Still Worth Buying Next to the S26 Ultra?','samsung-galaxy-s25-ultra-leak-roundup-snapdragon-8-elite-nepal','<p>The Galaxy S25 Ultra is a year old, and it\'s now <strong>Rs 40,000 cheaper</strong> than its replacement. In our catalogue it lists at <a href=\"/products/samsung-galaxy-s25-ultra\">Rs 1,84,999</a>, against <a href=\"/products/samsung-galaxy-s26-ultra\">Rs 2,24,999</a> for the S26 Ultra. That gap makes it worth a serious look.</p>\n<h2>What you keep</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The Snapdragon 8 Elite, still one of the fastest chips in any phone.</li>\n<li>A 6.9-inch AMOLED screen, the titanium frame and the S Pen.</li>\n<li>The 200MP main camera and a 5x periscope.</li>\n<li>Seven years of Android and security updates. Even bought now, it will be supported for years.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2>What the S26 Ultra adds</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Faster charging, 60W against 45W.</li>\n<li>The Privacy Display, which hides your screen from people beside you, useful on a crowded micro bus.</li>\n<li>A brighter f/1.4 main camera, and the newer Snapdragon 8 Elite Gen 5.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2>Our take</h2>\n<p>If the S25 Ultra is an official unit with a full warranty, it\'s the better value. You lose a little charging speed and some new extras, not anything essential. Buy the S26 Ultra if you keep phones for many years and want the newest hardware. Our <a href=\"/reviews/samsung-galaxy-s26-ultra-review-nepal\">S26 Ultra review</a> goes deeper, and the <a href=\"/news/galaxy-s27-ultra-leaks-launch-date-nepal-price\">S27 Ultra</a> is expected early next year.</p>','mobile',NULL,1,8720,'The Galaxy S25 Ultra costs Rs 1,84,999 in Nepal, Rs 40,000 less than the S26 Ultra. What you give up, what you keep, and who should buy which.',0,0,0,0,0,0,'2026-11-22 18:15:00','2026-11-22 18:15:00'),(22,20,'ROG Zephyrus G16 in Nepal: The 2025 and 2026 Models Compared','asus-rog-zephyrus-g16-2025-rtx-5080-benchmarks-leaked','<p>The Zephyrus G16 is ASUS\'s answer to people who want a gaming laptop that doesn\'t look or weigh like one. It has a 16-inch OLED screen in an aluminium body under 2 kg. Two generations are listed in Nepal right now.</p>\n<h2>Zephyrus G16 (2025)</h2>\n<p>The <a href=\"/products/asus-rog-zephyrus-g16-gu605cm-2025\">GU605CM</a> configuration costs <strong>Rs 5,05,900</strong>. It pairs an Intel Core Ultra 7 255H with 16GB of RAM, a 1TB SSD and a 2.5K 240Hz OLED, in a body that weighs 1.85 kg. It has a 90Wh battery, so it lasts better away from the socket than most gaming laptops.</p>\n<h2>Zephyrus G16 (2026)</h2>\n<p>The <a href=\"/products/asus-rog-zephyrus-g16-gu606aw-tb103x-2026-intel-core-ultra-9-386h-rtx-5080\">GU606AW</a> moves to a Core Ultra 9 386H and an <strong>RTX 5080</strong>, for <strong>Rs 7,49,999</strong>. That\'s the one to choose for 1440p gaming at high settings or serious 3D and video work on the move.</p>\n<h2>Which one?</h2>\n<p>Both are premium laptops, and you pay a lot for thinness. If you don\'t need to carry it every day, a thicker gaming laptop gets you the same GPU for much less. The <a href=\"/products/asus-rog-strix-scar-16-2025-intel-core-ultra-9-275hx-rtx-5080\">ROG Strix Scar 16 with RTX 5080</a> costs Rs 6,01,499 at ONIN Infosys. If you want the Zephyrus look but also need two screens, there\'s the <a href=\"/products/asus-rog-zephyrus-duo-gx651ax-2026\">Zephyrus Duo</a>.</p>','laptop',NULL,1,7630,'The Zephyrus G16 is ASUS\'s thin gaming laptop. The 2025 model costs Rs 5,05,900 in Nepal and the 2026 RTX 5080 version Rs 7,49,999. Which makes sense?',0,0,0,0,0,0,'2026-11-22 18:15:00','2026-11-22 18:15:00'),(23,20,'Snapdragon X Laptops in Nepal: Battery Life, App Compatibility and Prices','qualcomm-oryon-snapdragon-x-elite-laptops-nepal-battery-benchmarks','<p>Windows laptops with Qualcomm\'s Snapdragon X chips have one big selling point: they last a very long time on a charge, close to what MacBook owners are used to. They also have one big question mark, and that\'s app compatibility. Both are worth understanding before you buy.</p>\n<h2>What\'s on sale in Nepal</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"/products/acer-aspire-16-ai-2025-snapdragon-x-x1-26100-16gb-512gb-16-wuxga\">Acer Aspire 16 AI</a> (Snapdragon X): Rs 1,19,999. The cheapest way in.</li>\n<li><a href=\"/products/dell-inspiron-14-5441-2024-snapdragon-x-plus-x1p-42-100\">Dell Inspiron 14 5441</a> (X Plus): Rs 1,31,999.</li>\n<li><a href=\"/products/asus-vivobook-s15-2024-x-elite-x1e-78-100\">ASUS Vivobook S15 OLED</a> (X Elite, 1TB): Rs 1,54,999 at ONIN Infosys, with a 3K 120Hz OLED screen.</li>\n<li><a href=\"/products/dell-xps-13-9345-snapdragon-x-plus-16gb-256gb\">Dell XPS 13 9345</a> (X Plus): from Rs 1,69,999.</li>\n<li><a href=\"/products/hp-elitebook-ultra-g1q-b16xzua-2025-snapdragon-x-elite-x1e-78-100\">HP EliteBook Ultra G1q</a> (X Elite): about Rs 1,88,000, a business laptop.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2>What works and what doesn\'t</h2>\n<p>Office, Chrome, Edge, Zoom, Teams, Spotify, Photoshop and Lightroom all run natively and fast. Most other programs run through Windows\' built-in translation layer, called Prism, and you usually won\'t notice. The trouble spots are online games with anti-cheat software, some VPN clients, older printer and scanner drivers, and specialist engineering or accounting software.</p>\n<p>Our advice: if your work lives in a browser and Office, these laptops are excellent. If you depend on one particular program, check that it supports Windows on Arm before you pay. If you game, buy an Intel or AMD laptop instead.</p>','technology',NULL,1,6210,'Windows laptops with Qualcomm Snapdragon X chips last a long time on battery. Prices in Nepal, which apps work, and who should avoid them.',0,0,0,0,0,0,'2026-11-22 18:15:00','2026-11-22 18:15:00'),(24,20,'Do You Need Wi-Fi 7 in Nepal Yet?','wifi-7-adoption-nepal-routers-speed-isp-support','<p>Wi-Fi 7 is showing up on spec sheets everywhere. Well over ninety laptops in our catalogue list it, including the <a href=\"/products/macbook-air-m5-13\">MacBook Air M5</a> and most new gaming laptops. That\'s no reason to rush out and replace your router.</p>\n<h2>Why your new laptop may not feel faster</h2>\n<p>Wi-Fi 7 only helps when <strong>both ends</strong> support it: the laptop or phone, and the router. Most homes in Nepal use the router their fibre ISP supplied, and those are usually Wi-Fi 5 or Wi-Fi 6. A Wi-Fi 7 laptop connects to them happily, at Wi-Fi 6 speeds.</p>\n<h2>When upgrading the router makes sense</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>You pay for a fast plan, say 300Mbps or more, and don\'t get close to it over Wi-Fi.</li>\n<li>Many devices share the network: a family on video calls, a smart TV and a gaming PC at the same time.</li>\n<li>You move large files around the house, for example to a home NAS.</li>\n</ul>\n<p>For most people a good Wi-Fi 6 router placed in the middle of the house, or a mesh system in a multi-storey home, fixes more problems than Wi-Fi 7 does. Slow Wi-Fi in a concrete building is usually about coverage, not the Wi-Fi standard.</p>','technology',NULL,1,5481,'Lots of new laptops and phones have Wi-Fi 7, but you only benefit with a Wi-Fi 7 router. When it is worth upgrading your home network in Nepal.',0,0,0,0,0,0,'2026-11-22 18:15:00','2026-11-22 18:15:00'),(36,20,'GTA VI Is Out: A Record Launch, and How to Buy It in Nepal','gta-6-launch-record-sales-how-to-buy-nepal','<p>Grand Theft Auto VI finally launched on <strong>19 November 2026</strong> for PlayStation 5 and Xbox Series X|S, after being delayed twice from its original 2025 window. There is still no PC version.</p>\n\n<h2>A record-breaking first day</h2>\n<p>Variety reported that Take-Two counted <strong>$3.79 billion</strong> in sales within the first 24 hours. Sensor Tower\'s independent estimate was lower, at about 24.6 million copies and $2.36 billion on launch day including pre-orders, with roughly 18.4 million of those copies on PS5. The two figures measure different things, but by either count it\'s one of the biggest entertainment launches ever.</p>\n\n<h2>How to buy GTA VI in Nepal</h2>\n<p>Rockstar doesn\'t sell the game at a Nepal-specific price, so players here have two options:</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>The PlayStation Store</strong>, paying $79.99 for the Standard Edition or $99.99 for the Ultimate Edition with a dollar card.</li>\n<li><strong>A local game shop.</strong> GameShop Nepal lists the Standard Edition at Rs 13,499 and the Ultimate at Rs 16,999.</li>\n</ul>\n<p>Be careful with very cheap \"secondary account\" offers. You are sharing someone else\'s account, and access can disappear if they change the password.</p>\n\n<h2>Which console?</h2>\n<p>GTA VI runs on every PS5 model. See our <a href=\"/reviews/ps5-digital-slim-pro-review-nepal\">PS5 buying verdict</a>. The Digital Edition at Rs 95,000 is the cheapest way in, and the PS5 Pro gives the best image on a 4K TV. Full details are on our <a href=\"/products/gta-6\">GTA VI page</a>.</p>\n<h3>Sources</h3>\n<ul><li><a href=\"https://variety.com/2026/gaming/news/gta-6-sales-billions-first-day-1236954198/\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" target=\"_blank\">Variety – GTA 6 first-day sales</a></li><li><a href=\"https://hothardware.com/news/gta-6-launch-haul-dwarfs-gta-5s-day-one-record\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" target=\"_blank\">HotHardware – Sensor Tower launch estimate</a></li><li><a href=\"https://gameshopnepal.com/blog/gta-vi-pre-order-nepal-2026\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" target=\"_blank\">GameShop Nepal – GTA VI pre-order prices</a></li></ul>','gaming','news/news-gta-6.jpg',1,3,'GTA VI launched on 19 November 2026 with record first-day sales. How Nepali players can buy it, what it costs and which console to get.',0,0,0,0,0,0,'2026-11-21 18:15:00','2026-11-24 00:14:02'),(37,20,'PS5 Prices in Nepal After Sony\'s 2026 Increases','ps5-price-in-nepal-november-2026','<p>Demand for PlayStation 5 consoles has jumped in Kathmandu with GTA VI\'s release, and prices are higher than they were a year ago. Sony raised PS5 prices in several regions in spring 2026, citing economic pressures and production costs. GadgetByte Nepal\'s listings, updated on 20 November 2026, now show:</p>\n<table>\n<thead><tr><th>Model</th><th>Storage</th><th>Price in Nepal</th></tr></thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr><td>PS5 Digital Edition</td><td>825GB</td><td>Rs 95,000</td></tr>\n<tr><td>PS5 Slim Disc Edition</td><td>1TB</td><td>Rs 1,39,999</td></tr>\n<tr><td>PS5 Pro</td><td>2TB</td><td>Rs 1,45,000</td></tr>\n<tr><td>DualSense controller</td><td>–</td><td>Rs 9,500</td></tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<p>The odd one out is the Slim Disc, which is listed only about Rs 5,000 below the far more powerful Pro. Shop prices move with stock, so it\'s worth checking a couple of sellers. If the gap is that small where you buy, the Pro is the better deal, unless you need a disc drive. Our <a href=\"/reviews/ps5-digital-slim-pro-review-nepal\">PS5 buying verdict</a> goes through the choice in detail.</p>\n<p>You can switch between models and see each price on the <a href=\"/products/sony-playstation-5\">PS5 product page</a>.</p>\n<h3>Sources</h3>\n<ul><li><a href=\"https://gadgetbytenepal.com/sony-playstation-5-price-nepal/\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" target=\"_blank\">GadgetByte Nepal – PS5 price</a></li><li><a href=\"https://www.gadgetbytenepal.com/sony-playstation-5-slim-price-nepal/\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" target=\"_blank\">GadgetByte Nepal – PS5 Slim price</a></li><li><a href=\"https://www.gadgetbytenepal.com/sony-playstation-5-pro-price-in-nepal/\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" target=\"_blank\">GadgetByte Nepal – PS5 Pro price</a></li><li><a href=\"https://blog.playstation.com/2026/03/27/20260327-ps/\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" target=\"_blank\">PlayStation Blog – 2026 price changes (Southeast Asia)</a></li></ul>','price-trends','news/news-ps5.jpg',1,0,'Current PS5 prices in Nepal: Digital Rs 95,000, Slim Disc Rs 1,39,999 and PS5 Pro Rs 1,45,000, after Sony raised prices in several regions in 2026.',0,0,0,0,0,0,'2026-11-21 18:15:00','2026-11-24 00:14:02'),(38,20,'iPhone 18 Pro, Pro Max and iPhone Duo: Official Prices in Nepal','iphone-18-pro-pro-max-iphone-duo-nepal-price','<p>Apple\'s autumn 2026 iPhones are all on sale in Nepal now. The iPhone 18 Pro and Pro Max arrived on 29 September, and Apple\'s first foldable, the iPhone Duo, followed on 30 October. Here\'s what each costs, according to Nepali Telecom\'s price list.</p>\n\n<h2>iPhone 18 Pro</h2>\n<p>256GB Rs 2,59,900 · 512GB Rs 3,01,900 · 1TB Rs 3,86,900 · 2TB Rs 5,13,900. It has a 6.3-inch display, the A20 Pro chip and a 4x telephoto. <a href=\"/products/iphone-18-pro\">Full specs</a>.</p>\n\n<h2>iPhone 18 Pro Max</h2>\n<p>256GB Rs 2,79,900 · 512GB Rs 3,22,900 · 1TB Rs 4,07,900 · 2TB Rs 5,34,900. It moves up to a 6.9-inch screen and a 5x periscope. Read our <a href=\"/reviews/iphone-18-pro-max-review-nepal\">iPhone 18 Pro Max review</a>.</p>\n\n<h2>iPhone Duo</h2>\n<p>256GB Rs 4,30,900 · 512GB Rs 4,72,900 · 1TB Rs 5,57,900 · 2TB Rs 6,84,900. The foldable has a 7.6-inch inner screen, a 5.4-inch cover screen and a titanium hinge. It uses Touch ID on the side instead of Face ID. <a href=\"/products/iphone-duo\">Full specs</a>.</p>\n\n<h2>Where\'s the regular iPhone 18?</h2>\n<p>Apple split its line-up this year. The standard <a href=\"/products/iphone-18\">iPhone 18</a> and the <a href=\"/products/iphone-18e\">iPhone 18e</a> are expected in spring 2027. Until then, the <a href=\"/products/iphone-17\">iPhone 17</a> (Rs 1,64,999) is the newest non-Pro iPhone.</p>\n<h3>Sources</h3>\n<ul><li><a href=\"https://www.nepalitelecom.com/iphone-price-in-nepal\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" target=\"_blank\">Nepali Telecom – iPhone price list</a></li></ul>','mobile','news/news-iphone-18-pro.jpg',1,0,'Official Nepal prices for the iPhone 18 Pro (from Rs 2,59,900), iPhone 18 Pro Max (from Rs 2,79,900) and the foldable iPhone Duo (from Rs 4,30,900).',0,0,0,0,0,0,'2026-11-21 18:15:00','2026-11-24 00:14:02'),(39,20,'M6 MacBook Pro and OLED MacBook Pro: Expected Prices in Nepal','macbook-pro-m6-oled-macbook-pro-expected-price-nepal','<p>Apple announced two new MacBook Pro models at the end of October 2026, a day apart. Neither is officially on sale in Nepal yet, so the prices below are GadgetByte\'s estimates converted from US prices, not official figures.</p>\n\n<h2>MacBook Pro 14 with M6</h2>\n<p>This model keeps the familiar design and mini-LED XDR screen, with a new M6 chip (12-core CPU and GPU), Wi-Fi 7 and battery life of up to 24 hours. It starts at $1,999 in the US with 16GB of memory and 1TB of storage. <strong>Expected Nepal price: about Rs 3,85,999</strong>, rising to Rs 4,81,999 with 2TB. <a href=\"/products/macbook-pro-14-m6\">See every configuration</a>.</p>\n\n<h2>MacBook Pro with ProLED XDR display</h2>\n<p>This is the bigger news: a tandem-OLED touchscreen, the first touchscreen on a Mac, plus a Dynamic Island, offered with M5 Pro and M5 Max chips in 14 and 16-inch sizes. US prices start at $2,899. <strong>Expected Nepal price: about Rs 5,35,999</strong> for the 14-inch M5 Pro, up to Rs 8,79,999 for the 16-inch M5 Max. <a href=\"/products/macbook-pro-proled-xdr\">Specs and expected prices</a>.</p>\n\n<h2>Should you wait?</h2>\n<p>If you need a Mac for work now, the <a href=\"/products/macbook-pro-14-m5\">M5 MacBook Pro 14</a> is on sale here at Rs 3,76,500, and the M6 is an incremental step up. Most people don\'t need a Pro at all. The <a href=\"/reviews/macbook-air-m5-13-review-nepal\">MacBook Air M5</a> is still our top pick.</p>\n<h3>Sources</h3>\n<ul><li><a href=\"https://www.gadgetbytenepal.com/apple-macbook-pro-m6-14-inch-price-in-nepal/\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" target=\"_blank\">GadgetByte Nepal – MacBook Pro M6 14-inch price in Nepal</a></li><li><a href=\"https://www.gadgetbytenepal.com/macbook-pro-with-proled-xdr-display-price-in-nepal/\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" target=\"_blank\">GadgetByte Nepal – MacBook Pro with ProLED XDR display</a></li></ul>','laptop','news/news-macbook-pro-m6.jpg',1,0,'Apple announced the M6 MacBook Pro 14 and a tandem-OLED MacBook Pro with touch. Expected Nepal prices start at Rs 3,85,999 and Rs 5,35,999.',0,0,0,0,0,0,'2026-11-21 18:15:00','2026-11-24 00:14:02'),(40,20,'Galaxy S27 Ultra: What the Leaks Say About Launch, Specs and Price','galaxy-s27-ultra-leaks-launch-date-nepal-price','<p>Samsung hasn\'t said anything officially about the Galaxy S27 series, but the leaks have settled into a fairly consistent picture. Here\'s what\'s being reported, and how much weight to give it.</p>\n\n<h2>Launch timing</h2>\n<p>Most reports expect a Galaxy Unpacked event in <strong>January or February 2027</strong>. One tipster says early January, while others expect late February. The <a href=\"/products/samsung-galaxy-s26-ultra\">S26 Ultra</a> was unveiled on 25 February 2026. Four models are expected: the S27, S27+, a new S27 Pro and the S27 Ultra.</p>\n\n<h2>Reported upgrades</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Battery:</strong> about 5,700mAh, up from 5,000mAh. This is the most widely repeated leak, and the most welcome one.</li>\n<li><strong>Chip:</strong> a 2nm Snapdragon 8 Elite Gen 6 for Galaxy.</li>\n<li><strong>Design:</strong> CAD renders show the three cameras in a single horizontal strip with a smaller bump.</li>\n<li><strong>S Pen:</strong> stays, despite earlier rumours that it would go.</li>\n</ul>\n\n<h2>Expected price in Nepal</h2>\n<p>US reports suggest $1,399–1,499, up from $1,299, and Indian outlets estimate about ₹1,49,990. The S26 Ultra launched here at Rs 2,24,999, so our estimate for the S27 Ultra is <strong>around Rs 2,40,000</strong>. We\'ll replace it with the official price as soon as Samsung Nepal announces one. <a href=\"/products/samsung-galaxy-s27-ultra\">Follow the S27 Ultra page</a> for updates.</p>\n<h3>Sources</h3>\n<ul><li><a href=\"https://www.digit.in/news/mobile-phones/samsung-galaxy-s27-ultra-leaks-price-in-india-launch-timeline-design-camera-and-other-details-we-know.html\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" target=\"_blank\">Digit – Galaxy S27 Ultra leaks and India pricing</a></li><li><a href=\"https://tomsguide.com/phones/samsung-phones/samsung-galaxy-s27-ultra-rumors-release-display-upgrades-and-everything-we-know-so-far\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" target=\"_blank\">Tom\'s Guide – Galaxy S27 Ultra rumours</a></li><li><a href=\"https://www.androidheadlines.com/exclusive-samsung-galaxy-s27-ultra-official-cad-renders-leak\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" target=\"_blank\">Android Headlines – S27 Ultra CAD renders</a></li><li><a href=\"https://www.phonearena.com/galaxy-s27-ultra-release-date-price-features-news\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" target=\"_blank\">PhoneArena – Galaxy S27 Ultra release date and price expectations</a></li></ul>','rumors',NULL,1,3,'Galaxy S27 Ultra leaks point to a January–February 2027 launch, a 5,700mAh battery and a 2nm Snapdragon. Our Nepal price estimate and what to believe.',0,0,0,0,0,0,'2026-11-22 18:15:00','2026-11-22 18:15:00'),(41,20,'iPhone 18 and iPhone 18e Expected in Spring 2027: What We Know','iphone-18-iphone-18e-spring-2027-what-we-know','<p>For the first time, Apple didn\'t launch its whole iPhone line-up together. The <a href=\"/products/iphone-18-pro\">iPhone 18 Pro</a>, Pro Max and the foldable iPhone Duo came in autumn 2026. The cheaper models are expected in spring 2027.</p>\n\n<h2>iPhone 18</h2>\n<p>Bloomberg\'s Mark Gurman has repeatedly reported a spring 2027 launch, and later supply-chain reports point to around March. The rumoured specs are a 2nm A20 chip (a small step below the Pro\'s A20 Pro), a 6.3-inch display, two 48MP rear cameras, a 24MP front camera and more RAM than the iPhone 17\'s 8GB.</p>\n<p><strong>Our Nepal estimate: about Rs 1,75,000.</strong> The <a href=\"/products/iphone-17\">iPhone 17</a> sells for Rs 1,64,999 at a US price of $799, and reports expect the iPhone 18 at $849–899. <a href=\"/products/iphone-18\">iPhone 18 page</a>.</p>\n\n<h2>iPhone 18e</h2>\n<p>The 18e is expected to stay close to the <a href=\"/products/iphone-17e\">iPhone 17e</a>, with the A20 chip, a single 48MP camera and Apple\'s C2 modem. One leak suggests another 60Hz screen. <strong>Our Nepal estimate: about Rs 1,35,000</strong> if Apple holds the $599 US price, or closer to Rs 1,50,000 if it moves to $649–699. <a href=\"/products/iphone-18e\">iPhone 18e page</a>.</p>\n\n<p>None of this is confirmed by Apple. Reports also note that Apple could still change its plans.</p>\n<h3>Sources</h3>\n<ul><li><a href=\"https://www.macrumors.com/roundup/iphone-18/\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" target=\"_blank\">MacRumors – iPhone 18 roundup</a></li><li><a href=\"https://www.macworld.com/article/3188152/iphone-18e-18-2027-release-date-specs-price-cameras.html\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" target=\"_blank\">Macworld – iPhone 18 and 18e: release date, specs, price</a></li><li><a href=\"https://9to5mac.com/2026/10/27/apples-low-cost-iphone-18-details-revealed-by-leaker/\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" target=\"_blank\">9to5Mac – low-cost iPhone 18 details from leaker</a></li></ul>','rumors',NULL,1,0,'The standard iPhone 18 and iPhone 18e are expected in spring 2027 with the A20 chip. Rumoured specs and our expected Nepal prices.',0,0,0,0,0,0,'2026-11-22 18:15:00','2026-11-22 18:15:00'),(42,20,'Why Phones, Laptops and Consoles Got More Expensive in Nepal in 2026','why-gadget-prices-rose-nepal-2026','<p>If a device you priced in January now costs more, you\'re not imagining it. 2026 was a year of price rises rather than falls, in Nepal and worldwide. Here are the changes we could date and source.</p>\n\n<h2>The increases we tracked</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><strong><a href=\"/products/samsung-galaxy-s26-ultra\">Galaxy S26 Ultra</a>:</strong> GadgetByte\'s listing shows the 256GB model up from Rs 2,12,999 to Rs 2,24,999, and the 512GB model up from Rs 2,42,999 to Rs 2,59,999.</li>\n<li><strong><a href=\"/products/samsung-galaxy-s26\">Galaxy S26</a>:</strong> recorded at Rs 1,33,999 in June, now Rs 1,39,999.</li>\n<li><strong><a href=\"/products/macbook-pro-14-m5\">MacBook Pro 14 (M5)</a>:</strong> up on 1 July 2026 to Rs 3,76,500. GadgetByte linked the rise to the global memory shortage.</li>\n<li><strong><a href=\"/products/vivo-x300-pro\">vivo X300 Pro</a>:</strong> from Rs 1,79,999 to Rs 1,99,999 on 1 September 2026.</li>\n<li><strong><a href=\"/products/sony-playstation-5\">PlayStation 5</a>:</strong> Sony raised prices in several regions in spring 2026. The Slim Disc is now listed at Rs 1,39,999.</li>\n<li><strong><a href=\"/products/nintendo-switch-2\">Nintendo Switch 2</a>:</strong> the US price went from $449.99 to $499 on 1 September 2026, after Japan\'s rise in May. Imports to Nepal follow those prices.</li>\n</ul>\n\n<h2>Why it\'s happening</h2>\n<p>The biggest single cause is memory. Demand for AI data-centre hardware has tightened the supply of RAM and flash storage, and manufacturers have passed those costs on. Apple raised Mac and iPad prices in June 2026, and the same pressure shows up in phones, where more RAM and storage now cost more. Exchange rates and import costs add to the effect in Nepal.</p>\n\n<h2>What this means for buyers</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Don\'t count on quick drops.</strong> With memory still expensive, several devices went up in price this year rather than down.</li>\n<li><strong>Buy the storage you need up front.</strong> Upgrades cost more than ever. See the storage prices on any product page.</li>\n<li><strong>Watch the price history.</strong> Every product page on this site now shows the dated prices we\'ve recorded, and the chart fills in as prices change.</li>\n</ul>\n<h3>Sources</h3>\n<ul><li><a href=\"https://www.gadgetbytenepal.com/samsung-mobiles-price-nepal/\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" target=\"_blank\">GadgetByte Nepal – Samsung price list</a></li><li><a href=\"https://www.gadgetbytenepal.com/macbook-pro-14-inch-m5-price-nepal\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" target=\"_blank\">GadgetByte Nepal – MacBook Pro 14 M5 price hike</a></li><li><a href=\"https://gadgetbytenepal.com/vivo-x300-pro-price-nepal\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" target=\"_blank\">GadgetByte Nepal – vivo X300 Pro price hike</a></li><li><a href=\"https://www.digitaltrends.com/gaming/nintendo-just-announced-a-price-hike-for-the-switch-2-in-the-us/\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" target=\"_blank\">Digital Trends – Switch 2 US price increase</a></li><li><a href=\"https://blog.playstation.com/2026/03/27/20260327-ps/\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" target=\"_blank\">PlayStation Blog – 2026 price changes (Southeast Asia)</a></li></ul>','price-trends','news/news-memory-prices.jpg',1,1,'From the Galaxy S26 Ultra to the MacBook Pro and PS5, 2026 brought price increases in Nepal. The dated hikes, the reasons, and what to do.',0,0,0,0,0,0,'2026-11-22 18:15:00','2026-11-24 00:14:02'),(43,20,'Samsung and Ncell Team Up: EMI From Rs 1,221, Free Data and a New Trade-in System','samsung-ncell-partnership-galaxy-offers-nepal','<p>Samsung Nepal and Ncell have signed a partnership aimed at moving more people onto 4G smartphones and making Galaxy phones easier to afford. Here\'s what it means in practice if you\'re buying a Samsung phone in Nepal.</p>\n\n<h2>What\'s on offer</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>2G-to-4G upgrade campaign:</strong> trade in an old feature phone for an exchange bonus of Rs 5,000. EMIs start from about Rs 1,221 a month, and old handsets go to e-waste recycling.</li>\n<li><strong>Longer EMI plans:</strong> 24 to 36 months through Hulas Fin Serve with a 20% down payment, starting at around Rs 5,106 a month. Selected Galaxy Z and S models also get exchange bonuses of up to Rs 10,000 and an extra year of warranty.</li>\n<li><strong>Free Ncell packs:</strong> up to 12 months of the Rs 799 pack on Z and S series phones, and 9 months of the Rs 449 pack on A and M series phones. That is worth up to Rs 9,588.</li>\n<li><strong>\"PhoneShield\" trade-in checks:</strong> an app-based valuation system at Samsung service centres and selected stores, so you can see what your old phone is worth before exchanging it.</li>\n<li><strong>Pre-order bonus:</strong> from 20 to 23 November 2026, a QR-code offer took 62% off the Galaxy Buds Core (normally Rs 4,999).</li>\n</ul>\n\n<h2>Our take</h2>\n<p>The free data and longer EMI terms are the useful parts. The bigger message is that Galaxy AI features are being pushed down to budget phones like the <a href=\"/products/samsung-galaxy-a17-5g\">Galaxy A17 5G</a> (Rs 44,999). If you\'re about to buy a <a href=\"/products/samsung-galaxy-s26-ultra\">Galaxy S26 Ultra</a> or a foldable, ask the shop which of these offers apply before you pay. Offers change, and they usually depend on the store.</p>\n<h3>Sources</h3>\n<ul><li><a href=\"https://www.gadgetbytenepal.com/samsung-ncell-galaxy-collaboration-nepal/\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" target=\"_blank\">GadgetByte Nepal – Samsung-Ncell partnership: what it means for Galaxy users</a></li></ul>','telecom',NULL,1,0,'Samsung Nepal and Ncell have partnered on 2G-to-4G upgrades, longer EMI plans, free Ncell data packs and an app-based trade-in check. What Galaxy buyers get.',0,0,0,0,0,0,'2026-11-22 18:15:00','2026-11-22 18:15:00'),(44,20,'Huawei OSTA 1 Pro: A New Brand Starts With a Wide-Screen Phone and 7,000mAh Battery','huawei-osta-1-pro-new-brand-wide-screen-phone','<p>Huawei has launched a new sub-brand called <strong>OSTA</strong>, short for \"Original Smart Technology Accessible\", and its first phone is unusual. The <strong>OSTA 1 Pro</strong> is now official in China, and its most striking feature is its shape.</p>\n\n<h2>A wider phone</h2>\n<p>The 6.39-inch OLED screen has a 16:9.5 aspect ratio, so the phone is much wider than a typical slab: 144.1 × 87 × 6.68mm, at about 200g. The panel runs at 2232 × 1320 with a 120Hz refresh rate. It closely resembles Huawei\'s Pura X View, with a few hardware differences.</p>\n\n<h2>Cameras and battery</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>200MP main camera with a 50MP periscope telephoto</li>\n<li>7,000mAh battery with 66W wired and 50W wireless charging</li>\n<li>IP68 and IP69 dust and water resistance</li>\n</ul>\n\n<h2>Will it come to Nepal?</h2>\n<p>Huawei hasn\'t announced a Nepal launch or price for the OSTA 1 Pro. Huawei\'s current phone presence here is limited, so treat any local price as speculation until a distributor confirms it. If you want a big-battery phone you can buy today, see our <a href=\"/guides/best-phones-in-nepal-by-budget\">phones by budget</a> guide.</p>\n<h3>Sources</h3>\n<ul><li><a href=\"https://www.gadgetbytenepal.com/huawei-osta-1-pro-price-in-nepal/\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" target=\"_blank\">GadgetByte Nepal – Huawei OSTA 1 Pro price, specifications and availability</a></li></ul>','mobile',NULL,1,0,'Huawei has launched OSTA, a new sub-brand, with the OSTA 1 Pro: a 6.39-inch wide OLED, 200MP camera, 50MP periscope and 7,000mAh battery. Nepal launch not con',0,0,0,0,0,0,'2026-11-21 18:15:00','2026-11-21 18:15:00'),(45,20,'Xiaomi 18 Pro Brings the First Snapdragon 8 Elite Gen 6 and Dual 200MP Cameras','xiaomi-18-pro-snapdragon-8-elite-gen-6-launch','<p>Xiaomi has launched the <strong>Xiaomi 18 Pro</strong> and <strong>18 Pro Max</strong> globally, starting in Europe. The 18 Pro is the first phone to use Qualcomm\'s <strong>Snapdragon 8 Elite Gen 6</strong>, Qualcomm\'s first 2nm flagship chip.</p>\n\n<h2>Key specs</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Display:</strong> a compact 6.4-inch LTPO AMOLED at 120Hz, up to 4,000 nits, with Xiaomi\'s hardware-level \"Smart Privacy Display\" that can narrow viewing angles for people around you.</li>\n<li><strong>Cameras:</strong> Leica-tuned, with two 200MP sensors. The periscope offers 3.2x optical zoom and can focus as close as 10cm for macro shots.</li>\n<li><strong>Battery:</strong> 6,000mAh silicon-carbon, with 90W wired and 50W wireless charging.</li>\n<li><strong>Build:</strong> 8.46mm thick and 198g (the Cosmic Blue version is 8.56mm and 203g).</li>\n</ul>\n\n<h2>Nepal</h2>\n<p>There\'s no official Nepal price yet. Xiaomi\'s current flagship here, the <a href=\"/products/xiaomi-17-ultra\">Xiaomi 17 Ultra</a>, sells for Rs 1,99,999. Expect the 18 Pro to sit close to that once it arrives. We\'ll add it to the catalogue with an official price when it launches.</p>\n<h3>Sources</h3>\n<ul><li><a href=\"https://www.gadgetbytenepal.com/xiaomi-18-pro-price-in-nepal/\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" target=\"_blank\">GadgetByte Nepal – Xiaomi 18 Pro price in Nepal, specs & availability</a></li></ul>','mobile',NULL,1,0,'Xiaomi 18 Pro is the first phone with Snapdragon 8 Elite Gen 6 (2nm): 6.4-inch privacy display, dual 200MP cameras and a 6,000mAh battery. What we know for Ne',0,0,0,0,0,0,'2026-11-20 18:15:00','2026-11-20 18:15:00'),(46,20,'OPPO Reno 17 Launches With an 8,000mAh Battery and Three 50MP Cameras','oppo-reno-17-launched-8000mah-battery','<p>OPPO has launched the <strong>Reno 17</strong> in China, the successor to the <a href=\"/products/oppo-reno-16-5g\">Reno 16</a>, which sells in Nepal for Rs 1,09,999. The headline upgrade is the battery: <strong>8,000mAh</strong>, in a phone with a compact 6.56-inch screen.</p>\n\n<h2>Key specs</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>6.56-inch 1.5K flat display at 120Hz</li>\n<li>Snapdragon 7 Gen 4, with up to 12GB RAM and 1TB storage</li>\n<li>Three 50MP rear cameras, including a 3.5x periscope telephoto, and 4K 60fps video</li>\n<li>8,000mAh battery with 80W wired charging</li>\n<li>ColorOS 17, a metal frame and a glass back. The \"Encounter Cat\" version has a 3D floating cat design.</li>\n</ul>\n<p>The Reno 17 also works with the OPPO Bubble, a magnetic screen that clips to the back so you can frame selfies with the main cameras. It\'s sold separately.</p>\n\n<h2>Nepal</h2>\n<p>No Nepal price or date yet. OPPO usually brings the Reno series here a few months after China. For now, the <a href=\"/products/oppo-reno-16f-5g\">Reno 16F</a> (Rs 89,999) is the newest Reno with a 7,000mAh battery on sale in Nepal.</p>\n<h3>Sources</h3>\n<ul><li><a href=\"https://www.gadgetbytenepal.com/oppo-reno-17-price-in-nepal/\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" target=\"_blank\">GadgetByte Nepal – OPPO Reno 17 price, specifications and availability</a></li></ul>','mobile',NULL,1,0,'OPPO Reno 17 launched in China with Snapdragon 7 Gen 4, triple 50MP cameras with a 3.5x periscope and an 8,000mAh battery. Nepal launch expected later.',0,0,0,0,0,0,'2026-11-19 18:15:00','2026-11-19 18:15:00'),(47,20,'REDMAGIC 12 Pro Gaming Phone Is Coming to Nepal in December','redmagic-12-pro-coming-to-nepal-december','<p>The <strong>REDMAGIC 12 Pro</strong>, Nubia\'s latest gaming phone, has launched globally, and it\'s set to <strong>arrive in Nepal this December</strong>. If you play BGMI, PUBG or Genshin for hours at a time, it\'s built for exactly that.</p>\n\n<h2>What makes it a gaming phone</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Chip:</strong> Snapdragon 8 Elite Extreme Gen 6 (2nm), clocked up to 5.0GHz, plus a dedicated RedCore R5 gaming chip.</li>\n<li><strong>Cooling:</strong> AquaCore Cooling System 3.0, with dual-loop liquid cooling and a built-in 25,500 RPM fan behind RGB lighting.</li>\n<li><strong>Screen:</strong> a 6.85-inch 1.5K BOE AMOLED at 185Hz, with an under-display selfie camera, so there\'s no punch-hole in the way.</li>\n<li><strong>Battery:</strong> 8,400mAh with 80W wired and wireless charging.</li>\n<li>Up to 16GB RAM and 1TB storage, plus a 50MP dual rear camera.</li>\n</ul>\n\n<h2>What to keep in mind</h2>\n<p>Gaming phones trade camera quality and weight for speed and cooling. If you game casually, the <a href=\"/products/oneplus-15r\">OnePlus 15R</a> or <a href=\"/products/realme-gt-8-pro\">realme GT 8 Pro</a> may be better all-rounders. We\'ll add the official Nepal price as soon as it\'s announced.</p>\n<h3>Sources</h3>\n<ul><li><a href=\"https://www.gadgetbytenepal.com/redmagic-12-pro-price-in-nepal/\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" target=\"_blank\">GadgetByte Nepal – REDMAGIC 12 Pro price, specifications and availability</a></li></ul>','mobile',NULL,1,0,'REDMAGIC 12 Pro launches in Nepal in December: Snapdragon 8 Elite Extreme Gen 6, 185Hz AMOLED, liquid cooling with a fan and an 8,400mAh battery.',0,0,0,0,0,0,'2026-11-19 18:15:00','2026-11-19 18:15:00'),(48,20,'iPhone Air 2 Could Add a Second Camera and Stay Just 5.2mm Thin','iphone-air-2-rumours-dual-camera','<p>The first <a href=\"/products/iphone-air\">iPhone Air</a> (Rs 1,90,699 in Nepal) was impressively thin, but it shipped with only one rear camera. Leaks suggest the <strong>iPhone Air 2</strong> will fix that without getting thicker.</p>\n\n<h2>What the rumours say</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Two 48MP rear cameras</strong>, adding an ultrawide to the main camera. Leaked dummy units show two cutouts side by side on the camera plateau.</li>\n<li><strong>A20 Pro chip with 12GB of RAM</strong>, the same chip family as the <a href=\"/products/iphone-18-pro\">iPhone 18 Pro</a>.</li>\n<li>A <strong>6.55-inch 120Hz OLED</strong> with a smaller Dynamic Island.</li>\n<li>A <strong>5.2mm</strong> body, and a titanium build is expected to continue.</li>\n</ul>\n\n<h2>When?</h2>\n<p>Apple hasn\'t announced anything. Reports point to the Air 2 arriving alongside the cheaper models in Apple\'s split launch schedule, around spring 2027. Treat all of this as rumour until Apple confirms it. See also: <a href=\"/news/iphone-18-iphone-18e-spring-2027-what-we-know\">what we know about the iPhone 18 and 18e</a>.</p>\n<h3>Sources</h3>\n<ul><li><a href=\"https://www.gadgetbytenepal.com/iphone-air-2-rumors/\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" target=\"_blank\">GadgetByte Nepal – iPhone Air 2 rumors, launch, specifications and availability</a></li></ul>','rumors',NULL,1,0,'iPhone Air 2 rumours: dual 48MP cameras, A20 Pro with 12GB RAM, 6.55-inch 120Hz OLED and a 5.2mm body. What leaked dummies show and when it may launch.',0,0,0,0,0,0,'2026-11-22 18:15:00','2026-11-22 18:15:00'),(49,20,'Galaxy S27 Pro and S27 Ultra Leak: New Camera Layout, and the Pro Skips the S Pen','galaxy-s27-pro-s27-ultra-design-leak','<p>A \"Pro\" model looks likely to join Samsung\'s Galaxy S line next year. Tipster Ice Universe has shared design sketches of the <strong>Galaxy S27 Pro</strong> alongside the <strong>S27 Ultra</strong>, and they show a fresh camera design.</p>\n\n<h2>What the leak shows</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Both phones use a <strong>compact cluster of three rear lenses</strong> instead of Samsung\'s familiar separate rings.</li>\n<li>The <strong>S27 Ultra</strong> is tipped to get a <strong>50MP periscope with 5x optical zoom</strong>.</li>\n<li>The <strong>S27 Pro</strong> is said to use a <strong>10MP 3x telephoto</strong> and to have <strong>no S Pen</strong>.</li>\n<li>Samsung is reportedly planning a four-model line-up: S27, S27+, S27 Pro and S27 Ultra.</li>\n</ul>\n\n<h2>What it means for buyers in Nepal</h2>\n<p>The Pro looks set to sit between the Plus and the Ultra, a flagship camera phone for people who never use the S Pen. Launch is expected in early 2027. Our current estimate for the S27 Ultra is on its <a href=\"/products/samsung-galaxy-s27-ultra\">product page</a>, and our earlier report covers <a href=\"/news/galaxy-s27-ultra-leaks-launch-date-nepal-price\">the S27 Ultra leaks</a>.</p>\n<h3>Sources</h3>\n<ul><li><a href=\"https://www.gadgetbytenepal.com/samsung-galaxy-s27-pro-and-s27-ultra-rumors/\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" target=\"_blank\">GadgetByte Nepal – Samsung Galaxy S27 Pro and S27 Ultra rumors & specifications</a></li></ul>','rumors',NULL,1,0,'Leaked sketches show the Galaxy S27 Pro and S27 Ultra with a new compact camera cluster. The Ultra gets a 50MP 5x periscope; the Pro a 10MP 3x and no S Pen.',0,0,0,0,0,0,'2026-11-17 18:15:00','2026-11-17 18:15:00'),(50,20,'Redmi Note 18 5G Tipped as a Note 17 5G With a Bigger Battery','redmi-note-18-5g-bigger-battery-rumour','<p>Don\'t expect a big leap from the next Redmi Note. According to tipster PaperKing13, the <strong>Redmi Note 18 5G</strong> will be a lightly updated <a href=\"/products/redmi-note-17-5g\">Redmi Note 17 5G</a> (Rs 47,999 in Nepal), and the battery is the main change.</p>\n\n<h2>What\'s rumoured</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Battery:</strong> 8,100mAh for the global model, up from 7,700mAh. The Chinese version could reach 8,888mAh.</li>\n<li><strong>Charging stays at 45W</strong>, so a full charge will take a little longer.</li>\n<li>The Snapdragon 4 Gen 4 chip, 6.99-inch FHD+ AMOLED and 50MP main camera are expected to carry over.</li>\n<li>It may also appear under the POCO name in some markets.</li>\n</ul>\n\n<h2>Should you wait?</h2>\n<p>If the leak is right, no. The Note 17 5G already has a very large battery, and its price may drop once the new model arrives. If battery life is your top priority today, the <a href=\"/products/redmi-note-17-pro-max-5g\">Note 17 Pro Max</a> has 10,000mAh.</p>\n<h3>Sources</h3>\n<ul><li><a href=\"https://www.gadgetbytenepal.com/redmi-note-18-5g-rumors/\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" target=\"_blank\">GadgetByte Nepal – Redmi Note 18 5G rumors, specifications and availability</a></li></ul>','rumors',NULL,1,0,'Redmi Note 18 5G is tipped to be a rebranded Note 17 5G with an 8,100mAh global battery (8,888mAh in China), Snapdragon 4 Gen 4 and 45W charging.',0,0,0,0,0,0,'2026-11-17 18:15:00','2026-11-17 18:15:00'),(51,20,'Honor\'s 13,500mAh Phone Battery Passes Certification','honor-13500mah-battery-phone-certified','<p>Phone batteries keep growing. A Honor battery rated at <strong>13,300mAh (13,500mAh typical)</strong> has passed China\'s 3C certification under model number HB6674118ELW-C. That suggests a phone using it isn\'t far off.</p>\n\n<h2>What we know</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>It is expected to power a <strong>7-inch mid-range Honor phone</strong>, possibly the <strong>Honor Power 3</strong>.</li>\n<li>It would beat Honor\'s earlier big-battery phones: the Power2 (10,080mAh), X80 Pro Max (11,000mAh) and Win RT2 (12,070mAh).</li>\n<li>Honor is reportedly testing 14,000–15,000mAh batteries for future phones.</li>\n<li>There\'s no name, date or price for China or Nepal yet.</li>\n</ul>\n\n<h2>Why it matters here</h2>\n<p>Load-shedding is a thing of the past, but long bus journeys and treks aren\'t. Silicon-carbon batteries are why phones like the <a href=\"/products/realme-p4-power\">realme P4 Power</a> (10,001mAh) and <a href=\"/products/honor-x9d\">Honor X9d</a> (8,300mAh) already last two days. A 13,500mAh phone would stretch that to three or four for light users.</p>\n<h3>Sources</h3>\n<ul><li><a href=\"https://www.gadgetbytenepal.com/honor-13500mah-battery-phone-rumor/\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" target=\"_blank\">GadgetByte Nepal – Honor 13,500mAh battery phone: rumor, specs & availability</a></li></ul>','rumors',NULL,1,0,'A 13,300mAh rated (13,500mAh typical) Honor battery has passed China\'s 3C certification, likely for a 7-inch mid-range phone, possibly the Honor Power 3.',0,0,0,0,0,0,'2026-11-17 18:15:00','2026-11-17 18:15:00'),(52,20,'Phone Price Updates in Nepal: November 2026','phone-price-updates-nepal-november-2026','<p>Phone prices in Nepal changed several times through 2026, mostly upward. These are the current prices from GadgetByte Nepal\'s listings, checked on 22–23 November 2026, for phones whose prices have moved recently or that people ask us about most.</p>\n\n<table>\n<thead><tr><th>Phone</th><th>Variant</th><th>Current price</th></tr></thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr><td><a href=\"/products/nothing-phone-4a-pro\">Nothing Phone (4a) Pro</a></td><td>12GB/256GB</td><td>Rs 1,09,999 (after repeated hikes this year)</td></tr>\n<tr><td><a href=\"/products/motorola-edge-70-fusion\">Motorola Edge 70 Fusion</a></td><td>12GB/256GB · 12GB/512GB</td><td>Rs 79,999 · Rs 89,999</td></tr>\n<tr><td><a href=\"/products/oneplus-nord-ce-6\">OnePlus Nord CE 6</a></td><td>8GB/256GB</td><td>Rs 74,999</td></tr>\n<tr><td><a href=\"/products/honor-600-pro\">Honor 600 Pro</a></td><td>12GB/256GB · 12GB/512GB</td><td>Rs 1,29,999 · Rs 1,49,999</td></tr>\n<tr><td><a href=\"/products/redmi-note-17-pro-max-5g\">Redmi Note 17 Pro Max</a></td><td>8GB/256GB · 12GB/256GB</td><td>Rs 69,999 · Rs 79,999</td></tr>\n<tr><td><a href=\"/products/samsung-galaxy-s26-ultra\">Galaxy S26 Ultra</a></td><td>12GB/256GB</td><td>Rs 2,24,999</td></tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n\n<h2>Why prices keep rising</h2>\n<p>Memory chips have become more expensive worldwide, and phone makers have passed that on. Our explainer covers it in detail: <a href=\"/news/why-gadget-prices-rose-nepal-2026\">why phones, laptops and consoles got more expensive in Nepal in 2026</a>.</p>\n<p>Every product page on this site shows the dated prices we\'ve recorded, so you can check whether a price has moved before you buy. Browse <a href=\"/products?category=mobile\">all phones</a>.</p>\n<h3>Sources</h3>\n<ul><li><a href=\"https://www.gadgetbytenepal.com/nothing-phone-4a-pro-price-nepal/\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" target=\"_blank\">GadgetByte Nepal – Nothing Phone (4a) Pro price in Nepal</a></li><li><a href=\"https://www.gadgetbytenepal.com/motorola-edge-70-fusion-price-nepal/\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" target=\"_blank\">GadgetByte Nepal – Motorola Edge 70 Fusion price in Nepal</a></li><li><a href=\"https://www.gadgetbytenepal.com/oneplus-nord-ce-6-price-in-nepal/\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" target=\"_blank\">GadgetByte Nepal – OnePlus Nord CE 6 price in Nepal</a></li><li><a href=\"https://www.gadgetbytenepal.com/honor-mobiles-price-nepal/\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" target=\"_blank\">GadgetByte Nepal – Honor mobile price list</a></li></ul>','price-trends',NULL,1,0,'Latest phone prices in Nepal for November 2026, including Nothing Phone (4a) Pro, Motorola Edge 70 Fusion, OnePlus Nord CE 6 and Honor 600 Pro, from GadgetByt',0,0,0,0,0,0,'2026-11-22 18:15:00','2026-11-22 18:15:00');
